#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:31
msgid "First synchronization"
msgstr "首次同步"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:33
msgid ""
"To synchronize the database with a bank, go to the Accounting Dashboard, "
"click :guilabel:`New`, and select the :guilabel:`Bank` card. In the "
":guilabel:`Add a Bank Account` window, select the relevant bank and click "
":guilabel:`Connect`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:38
msgid ""
"Alternatively, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical "
"ellipsis)` icon of the :guilabel:`Bank` journal, and :guilabel:`Connect "
"bank`, or click :guilabel:`Search over 26000 banks` in the Accounting "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
"或者，點擊 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(垂直省略號)` 圖示（位於 "
":guilabel:`銀行` 日記賬），並點擊 :guilabel:`連接銀行`，或在會計儀表板中點擊 "
":guilabel:`搜尋超過 26000 間銀行`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:41
msgid ""
"Depending on your bank and country, you can select the :guilabel:`Type of "
"account` and/or choose another :ref:`third-party provider <accounting/bank-"
"synchronization/third-party-providers>` to connect with the bank if needed "
"before clicking :guilabel:`Connect`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:45
msgid ""
"If your bank is not listed in the :guilabel:`Search for an institution` "
"window, scroll down the list and click :icon:`fa-plus` :guilabel:`Add new "
"bank` to create a bank account manually. Fill in the :guilabel:`Account "
"Number`, :guilabel:`Bank`, and :guilabel:`SWIFT Code`, and click "
":guilabel:`Connect`. A bank journal is then created and named using the "
"account number. Note that in this case, the bank is not synchronized."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:50
msgid ""
"If issues occur during the first synchronization, check that no firewall or "
"proxy is blocking the address https://production.odoofin.com/. Make sure "
"your web browser allows pop-ups and that any ad-blocker is disabled."
msgstr ""
"如果首次同步期間發生問題，請檢查防火牆或代理伺服器是否封鎖了網址 https://"
"production.odoofin.com/ 。請確保網頁瀏覽器允許彈出式視窗，並已停用任何廣告攔"
"截器。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:55
msgid ""
"When setting up bank synchronization, accounting transactions are "
"automatically recorded from the date of the last transaction +1 day (e.g., "
"if the last transaction date is 31/12/2025, the recording starts on "
"01/01/2026). If the journal contains no transactions, all available past "
"transactions are retrieved. To limit the retrieval period, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Accounting --> Lock Dates`, and set a date in"
" the :guilabel:`Lock Everything` field."
msgstr ""
"設定銀行同步時，會計交易會從最後一筆交易日期的下一天起自動記錄（例如，如果最"
"後一筆交易日期為 31/12/2025，則會從 01/01/2026 開始記錄）。如果日記賬中沒有交"
"易，則會擷取所有可用的過往交易。要限制擷取期間，請前往 :menuselection:`會"
"計 --> 會計 --> 鎖定日期`，並在 :guilabel:`全部鎖定` 欄位中設定日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:62
msgid ""
"Some banks are in a :guilabel:`Beta` status, meaning they're not yet fully "
"supported by third-party providers. This may lead to bugs or other issues. "
"Although they can be used, Odoo does not provide technical support in this "
"case."
msgstr ""
"部分銀行處於 :guilabel:`Beta` 狀態，表示它們尚未獲第三方供應商全面支援，這可"
"能會導致錯誤或其他問題。雖然這些銀行仍可使用，但在此情況下，Odoo 不會提供技術"
"支援。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:65
msgid ""
"The :ref:`third-party provider <accounting/bank-synchronization/third-party-"
"providers>` may request more information to connect with a bank. This "
"information is not stored on Odoo's servers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:68
msgid ""
"To view all past synchronizations, activate the :ref:`developer mode "
"<developer-mode>` and go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration -->"
" Online Synchronization`."
msgstr ""
"要查看所有過往的同步記錄，請啟用 :ref:`開發人員模式 <developer-mode>`，並前"
"往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 網上同步`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:74
msgid "Manual synchronization"
msgstr "手動同步"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:76
msgid ""
"After the :ref:`first synchronization <accounting/bank-"
"synchronization/first-synchronization>`, bank journals are synchronized by "
"default every twelve hours. To manually trigger synchronization, go to the "
"Accounting dashboard and click :guilabel:`Fetch Transactions` on the "
"relevant bank journal."
msgstr ""
"在:ref:`首次同步 <accounting/bank-synchronization/first-synchronization>`後，"
"銀行日記賬預設會每十二小時同步一次。如需手動觸發同步，請前往會計儀表板，在相"
"關銀行日記賬上點擊 :guilabel:`擷取交易`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:81
msgid ""
"Alternatively, activate the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Online Synchronization`, "
"select the relevant bank, and click :guilabel:`Fetch transactions`."
msgstr ""
"或者，啟用:ref:`開發者模式 <developer-mode>`，前往:menuselection:`會計 --> 設"
"定 --> 線上同步`，選擇相關銀行，然後按一下:guilabel:`擷取交易`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:86
msgid ""
"Some banks do not support automatic transaction fetching. For these "
"institutions, an error message appears during the automatic account "
"synchronization, prompting the user to disable the automatic "
"synchronization. This message is also logged in the chatter of the online "
"synchronization. In such cases, disable the :guilabel:`Automatic "
"synchronization` option in the corresponding bank's :guilabel:`Online "
"Synchronization` and make sure to perform manual synchronizations by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Fetch Transactions` on the relevant bank journal."
msgstr ""
"部分銀行不支援自動擷取交易。對於這些銀行，在自動同步賬戶時會顯示錯誤訊息，提"
"示用戶停用自動同步功能。此訊息亦會記錄在線上同步的通訊欄中。遇此情況，請停"
"用:guilabel:`自動同步`選項（位於相應銀行的:guilabel:`線上同步`），並確保在相"
"關銀行日記賬上點擊:guilabel:`擷取交易`以進行手動同步。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:92
msgid ""
"For some bank institutions, transactions can only be fetched up to three "
"months in the past. If older transactions are needed, they can be "
":ref:`imported <accounting/transactions/import>`."
msgstr ""
"部分銀行機構只能擷取過去三個月內的交易。如需更早期的交易紀錄，可進行 :ref:`匯"
"入 <accounting/transactions/import>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:98
msgid "Update synchronization credentials"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:100
msgid ""
"To update bank credentials, activate the :ref:`developer mode <developer-"
"mode>`, and go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Online "
"Synchronization`. Open the connection that needs to be updated, click "
":guilabel:`Update Credentials`, and follow the steps."
msgstr ""
"如要更新銀行憑證，請啟用 :ref:`開發人員模式 <developer-mode>`，然後前往 "
":menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 網上同步`。開啟需要更新的連線，點擊 "
":guilabel:`更新憑證`，然後按照步驟操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:105
msgid ""
"The steps may vary depending on the third-party provider, as each provider "
"follows its own process."
msgstr "由於各家第三方供應商的流程各有不同，實際步驟可能會有所差異。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/bank_synchronization.rst:107
msgid ""
"When updating bank credentials, make sure all accounts are selected for "
"synchronization, including those from other banking institutions if "
"applicable."
msgstr ""
"更新銀行憑證時，請確保已選取所有帳戶進行同步處理（如適用，亦包括其他銀行機構"
"的帳戶）。"

