"Loans`. When creating a new loan, there are three options for how to create "
"amortization schedules:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:16
msgid "importing it from a supported file;"
msgstr "從支援的檔案匯入；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:17
msgid ""
"calculating it from multiple input values (e.g., the :guilabel:`Amount "
"Borrowed`, the :guilabel:`Duration`, etc.) using the :guilabel:`Compute` "
"button;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:19
msgid "manually filling in the lines of the schedule."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:21
msgid ""
"In each case, three different fields are required for each line of the "
"amortization schedule: the :guilabel:`Date`, the :guilabel:`Principal`, and "
"the :guilabel:`Interest`."
msgstr ""
"在每種情況下，攤銷表中的每一行均需填寫三個不同欄位：:guilabel:`日"
"期`、:guilabel:`本金`及:guilabel:`利息`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:24
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Amount Borrowed`, :guilabel:`Interest`, and "
":guilabel:`Duration` fields will be red if the sum of the lines does not "
"match the total of the amortization schedule lines."
msgstr ""
"若資料行的總和與攤銷時間表資料行的總計不相符，:guilabel:`借款金"
"額`、:guilabel:`利息` 及 :guilabel:`期限` 欄位會顯示為紅色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:28
msgid "Loan entries mechanism"
msgstr "貸款分錄機制"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:30
msgid ""
"When the amount borrowed is credited to a bank account, it should be "
"transferred to a long-term account (defined in the :guilabel:`Loan Settings`"
" tab). Then, upon the validation of the loan, Odoo creates the necessary "
"journal entries so that there is always a holistic and forecasted view of "
"upcoming due dates. The entire process is completely automated with a long-"
"term and short-term principal reclassification mechanism."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:36
msgid ""
"For each line of the amortization schedule, Odoo creates the following "
"entries:"
msgstr "針對攤銷時間表的每一行，Odoo 會建立以下分錄："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:38
msgid "A payment entry on the same date that"
msgstr "同一日期的付款分錄，"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:39
msgid "debits the principal amount to the long-term account;"
msgstr "將本金借記至長期賬戶；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:40
msgid "debits the interest amount to the expense account;"
msgstr "將利息金額記入費用賬戶的借方；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:41
msgid ""
"credits the payment amount to the short-term account: this is the amount "
"that will be withdrawn by the bank."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:44
msgid "A reclassification entry on the same date that"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:45
msgid ""
"debits the sum of the principal amounts of the next 12 months to the long-"
"term account;"
msgstr "將未來 12 個月的本金總額借記至長期帳戶；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:46
msgid ""
"credits the sum of the principal amounts of the next 12 months to the short-"
"term account."
msgstr "將未來 12 個月的本金總額貸記入短期賬戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:48
msgid ""
"A reversed entry of the reclassification entry on *the next day* that simply"
" reverses the previous one."
msgstr "在 *翌日* 建立重新分類分錄的沖銷分錄，單純沖銷前一筆分錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:51
msgid ""
"With this mechanism, month after month, the short-term account is always up "
"to date with the current short-term due amounts."
msgstr "透過此機制，短期會計科目每個月都會維持最新狀態，始終反映當前的短期到期金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:55
msgid "Closing a loan"
msgstr "結清貸款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:57
msgid ""
"By default, a loan will be closed whenever its last payment entry is posted."
" However, it can also be manually closed (e.g., because it is being paid off"
" early) by clicking on the :guilabel:`Close` button. A wizard will appear "
"asking from which date the loan should be closed. All draft entries after "
"this date will be deleted too."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，每當最後一筆付款記賬憑證過賬時，貸款便會關閉。不過，您亦可按一下 "
":guilabel:`關閉` 按鈕手動關閉貸款（例如提前還清貸款）。系統會顯示精靈視窗，詢"
"問應從哪個日期起關閉貸款。該日期之後的所有草稿分錄亦會一併刪除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:62
msgid ""
"A loan can also be cancelled. In that case, all entries will be deleted even"
" if they were already posted."
msgstr "貸款亦可取消。在此情況下，即使分錄已經過賬，所有分錄亦會被刪除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:66
msgid "Loans Analysis Report"
msgstr "貸款分析報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/loans.rst:68
msgid ""
"By going to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Review --> Loans Analysis`, you "
"can access a report with a pivot view of your ongoing loans. By default, the"
" report shows the principal, interest, and total payment for each year for "
"the duration of the loan."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:3
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/batch.rst:102
msgid "Bank reconciliation"
msgstr "銀行對賬"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:5
msgid ""
"**Bank reconciliation** is the process of validating :doc:`bank transactions"
" <transactions>`. Many of these transactions are matched with counterpart "
"items related to business records such as :doc:`customer invoices "
"<../customer_invoices>`, :doc:`vendor bills <../vendor_bills>`, and "
":doc:`payments <../payments>`, while others that may not have a matching "
"counterpart item (such as bank fees) can be written off :ref:`manually "
"<accounting/reconciliation/set-account>` or with :ref:`reconciliation models"
" <accounting/reconciliation/model>`. Not only is bank reconciliation "
"compulsory for most businesses, but it also offers several benefits, such as"
" reduced risk of errors in financial reports, detection of fraudulent "
"activities, and improved cash flow management."
msgstr ""
"**銀行對賬** 是驗證 :doc:`銀行交易 <transactions>` 的過程。許多這類交易會與業"
"務記錄相關的對應項目配對，例如 :doc:`客戶發票 <../customer_invoices>"
"`、:doc:`供應商賬單 <../vendor_bills>` 及 :doc:`付款 <../payments>`；至於沒有"
"對應項目的交易（例如銀行手續費），則可 :ref:`手動 <accounting/reconciliation/"
"set-account>` 或使用 :ref:`對賬模型 <accounting/reconciliation/model>` 進行撇"
"賬。對大多數企業而言，銀行對賬不僅是強制要求，還能帶來多項好處，例如減低財務"
"報告出錯的風險、偵測欺詐活動，以及改善現金流管理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:14
msgid ""
"Thanks to the :ref:`default matching rules "
"<accounting/reconciliation/reconcile>` and customizable bank "
":doc:`reconciliation models <reconciliation_models>`, Odoo selects the "
"matching items automatically when possible."
msgstr ""

