":guilabel:`Reconcile` action button, select the matching journal item(s) in "
"the list, and click :guilabel:`Select`."
msgstr ""
"要將交易與客戶發票、供應商賬單及付款等記錄的現有項目對賬，請點擊 "
":guilabel:`對賬` 操作按鈕，在列表中選擇相符的日記賬項目，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`選擇`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:160
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Partner` is set, this list is automatically filtered to "
"only include items related to that partner."
msgstr ""
"如果已設定 :guilabel:`合作夥伴`，此清單會自動篩選，只包含與該合作夥伴相關的項"
"目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:164
msgid ""
"Use the search bar within the :guilabel:`Search: Journal Items to Match` "
"window to search for specific journal items."
msgstr ""
"使用 :guilabel:`搜尋：要配對的日記賬項目` 視窗內的搜尋列，搜尋特定的日記賬項"
"目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:167
msgid ""
"If a transaction amount is lower than the invoice or bill it is reconciled "
"with, the transaction is fully reconciled, but the difference remains open "
"on the counterpart item. The remaining amount can be left open to be "
"reconciled later or the invoice or bill can be marked as fully paid. To mark"
" the invoice or bill as fully paid, :ref:`edit "
"<accounting/reconciliation/edit>` the line, click :guilabel:`fully paid`, "
"and :guilabel:`Save`. To reverse this, :ref:`edit "
"<accounting/reconciliation/edit>` the line again, click :guilabel:`partial "
"payment`, and :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"如果交易金額低於所對賬的發票或賬單金額，該筆交易會完全對賬，但差額會保留在對"
"應項目上作為未結清金額。您可以將餘額保留為未結清以便稍後對賬，或將發票或賬單"
"標記為全額付款。要將發票或賬單標記為全額付款，請 :ref:`編輯 <accounting/"
"reconciliation/edit>` 該資料行，點擊 :guilabel:`全額付款`，然後 :guilabel:`儲"
"存`。若要撤銷此操作，請再次 :ref:`編輯 <accounting/reconciliation/edit>` 該資"
"料行，點擊 :guilabel:`部分付款`，然後 :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:175
msgid ""
"If a transaction amount is greater than the invoice or bill it is reconciled"
" with, the transaction is only partially reconciled. The remaining balance "
"can be reconciled as any other transaction amount."
msgstr ""
"如果交易金額大於所核銷的發票或賬單金額，該交易只會作部分核銷。剩餘餘額可如其"
"他交易金額一樣進行核銷。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:180
msgid ""
"Existing items of draft entries can be matched. Eventual automatic moves "
"(like currency exchange or cash basis moves) are created in draft "
"simultaneously with the reconciliation. Posting the original entry also "
"posts the automatic move."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:187
msgid "Set account"
msgstr "設定帳戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:189
msgid ""
"If no existing item matches the selected transaction, you can still write "
"off the transaction manually: Click :guilabel:`Set Account`, then choose the"
" appropriate account. To write off only part of the transaction, :ref:`edit "
"the line <accounting/reconciliation/edit>` to reflect the correct value and "
"reconcile the remaining amount as desired."
msgstr ""
"如果沒有現有項目與所選交易相符，您仍可手動撇銷該交易：點擊 :guilabel:`設定賬"
"戶`，然後選擇合適的賬戶。如只需撇銷部分交易，請 :ref:`編輯明細行 <accounting/"
"reconciliation/edit>` 以反映正確數值，並按需要為餘額進行對賬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:195
msgid ""
"If the partner is set, write the amount off to their receivable or payable "
"account directly by clicking the :guilabel:`Receivable` or "
":guilabel:`Payable` :ref:`action button <accounting/reconciliation/action-"
"buttons>`."
msgstr ""
"如果已設定合作夥伴，您可點擊 :guilabel:`應收賬款` 或 :guilabel:`應付賬款` "
":ref:`操作按鈕 <accounting/reconciliation/action-buttons>`，直接將金額撇銷至"
"其應收或應付賬戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:202
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:3
msgid "Reconciliation models"
msgstr "對賬模型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:204
msgid ""
"Use :doc:`reconciliation models <reconciliation_models>` to create custom "
"rules that can be applied automatically or manually via custom buttons for "
"operations that are frequently repeated. These custom buttons allow you to "
"quickly reconcile bank transactions manually and can also be combined with "
"other reconciliation models and with counterpart items when reconciling "
"transactions."
msgstr ""
"使用 :doc:`對賬模型 <reconciliation_models>` 建立自訂規則，以便針對經常重複的"
"操作，自動或透過自訂按鈕手動套用規則。這些自訂按鈕可讓您快速手動對賬銀行交易"
"，亦可在對賬交易時與其他對賬模型及對應項目結合使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:210
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:141
msgid ""
"An outgoing bank transaction for $103 is partially matched with a vendor "
"bill for $100, leaving $3 of the transaction still unreconciled. Use the "
":guilabel:`Bank Fees` reconciliation model to create a new counterpart item "
