"未對賬。請使用 :guilabel:`銀行費用` 對賬模型，為這 $3 建立新的對應項目，並與"
"銀行交易餘下的 $3 進行對賬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:218
msgid "Edit lines and unreconcile transactions"
msgstr "編輯資料行及取消對賬交易"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:220
msgid ""
"To edit a counterpart item, expand the line, click the :icon:`fa-pencil` "
":guilabel:`(pencil)` icon, and edit the necessary fields in :guilabel:`Edit "
