msgstr ""
"要編輯對應項目，請展開該資料行，點擊 :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`（鉛筆）` "
"圖示，然後在 :guilabel:`編輯資料行` 視窗中編輯所需欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:224
msgid ""
"When the counterpart item is an existing journal item, some fields are read-"
