"If a transaction is partially matched with a counterpart item, use the link "
"to mark the invoice as :guilabel:`fully paid` or to switch back to a "
":guilabel:`partial payment`."
msgstr ""
"如果交易與對應項目只是部分配對，請使用連結將發票標記為 :guilabel:`已全額付"
"款` 或切換回 :guilabel:`部分付款`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:229
msgid ""
"To unreconcile a transaction, delete all counterpart items associated with "
"the transaction by clicking on the :icon:`fa-trash` :guilabel:`(trash)` "
