#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:235
msgid "Netting"
msgstr "淨額結算"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:237
msgid ""
"Netting (also known as AP/AR offsetting) is the process of balancing "
"incoming debts from and outgoing debts to the same partner. Reconciling the "
"incoming and outgoing debts creates a new journal entry that balances the "
"debts. Two main scenarios exist:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:241
msgid ""
":ref:`A bank transaction balances <accounting/reconciliation/net-"
"transaction>` (either fully or partially) the incoming and outgoing debts."
msgstr ""
":ref:`銀行交易可抵銷 <accounting/reconciliation/net-transaction>`（全部或部分"
"）應收及應付債項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:243
msgid ""
":ref:`No bank transaction balances <accounting/reconciliation/net-no-"
"transaction>` the incoming and outgoing debts. This situation can occur "
"either when the debts balance each other completely or when the debts remain"
" unbalanced."
msgstr ""
":ref:`沒有任何銀行交易平衡 <accounting/reconciliation/net-no-transaction>` 應"
"收及應付債項。當債項互相完全抵銷，或債項仍未平衡時，便可能出現此情況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:250
msgid "Netting with bank transactions"
msgstr "銀行交易淨額結算"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:252
msgid ""
"When a bank transaction balances (either fully or partially) the incoming "
"and outgoing debts, reconcile the bank transaction from the :guilabel:`Bank "
"Matching` view like any other :ref:`existing items "
"<accounting/reconciliation/existing-items>`:"
msgstr ""
"當銀行交易（全額或部分）抵銷應收及應付債項時，請從 :guilabel:`銀行配對` 檢視"
"中調節該銀行交易，做法與其他 :ref:`現有項目 <accounting/reconciliation/"
"existing-items>` 相同："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:256
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Reconcile` on the transaction."
msgstr "點擊交易上的 :guilabel:`對賬`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:257
msgid ""
"Select all the relevant counterpart items on both the payable and receivable"
" side."
msgstr "選取應付及應收兩方的所有相關對應項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:258
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Select`."
msgstr "按一下:guilabel:`選取`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:259
msgid ""
"If a balance remains, depending on the details, the following situations are"
" possible:"
msgstr "如果仍有餘額，視乎詳細情況，可能會出現以下情況："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:261
msgid ""
"An invoice, bill, or other item is not fully reconciled, and the remaining "
"balance can be :ref:`reconciled <accounting/reconciliation/reconcile>` with "
"other bank transactions."
msgstr ""
"發票、賬單或其他項目尚未完全對賬，剩餘餘額可與其他銀行交易進行:ref:`對賬 "
"<accounting/reconciliation/reconcile>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:263
msgid ""
"The bank transaction itself is not fully reconciled, and the remaining "
"balance can be :ref:`reconciled <accounting/reconciliation/reconcile>` as in"
" any other situation."
msgstr ""
"銀行交易本身尚未完全對賬，而餘額可與其他情況一樣進行 :ref:`對賬 <accounting/"
"reconciliation/reconcile>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:269
msgid "Netting without bank transactions"
msgstr "不透過銀行交易進行淨額結算"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:271
msgid ""
"When no bank transaction balances the incoming and outgoing debts, there is "
"nothing to reconcile from the :guilabel:`Bank Matching` view. However, the "
"debt amount is visible in both the account receivable and the account "
"payable. To balance these debts so that they no longer appear on the partner"
" ledger, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"若沒有銀行交易可抵銷收支債項，在 :guilabel:`銀行配對` 檢視中便沒有可對帳的項"
"目。然而，該債項金額仍會同時顯示於應收帳款及應付帳款中。要平衡這些債項，使其"
"不再顯示於合作夥伴總帳上，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:276
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Accounting --> Reconcile`."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 會計 --> 對賬`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:277
msgid ""
"Select the journal items that debit or credit the account receivable and "
"account payable and represent the debts to be netted."
msgstr "選擇借記或貸記應收賬款及應付賬款，並代表需要抵銷債務的日記賬項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:280
msgid ""
"If the debts don't balance each other perfectly, a :guilabel:`Write-Off "
"Entry` popup window appears, allowing you to decide how to resolve the "
"remaining balance:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:283
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Allow partials` to only partially reconcile the account "
"receivable and account payable and leave the remaining balance open."
msgstr ""
"選擇 :guilabel:`允許部分核銷`，即可僅對應收帳款和應付帳款進行部分核銷，並保留"
"餘額未結清。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:285
msgid ""
"Use a :doc:`reconciliation model button <reconciliation_models>` to write "
"off the balance."
msgstr "使用:doc:`對帳模型按鈕 <reconciliation_models>`來撇銷餘額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:286
msgid ""
"Manually choose an :guilabel:`Account`, and optionally adjust the "
":guilabel:`Tax`, :guilabel:`Journal`, :guilabel:`Label`, :guilabel:`Date`, "
"and :guilabel:`To Check` fields."
msgstr ""
"手動選擇:guilabel:`科目`，並可按需要調整:guilabel:`稅項`、:guilabel:`日記"
"賬`、:guilabel:`標籤`、:guilabel:`日期`及:guilabel:`待檢查`欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:289
msgid ""
"The items are then matched, and their balance is removed from the partner "
"ledger, representing that no payment is due for these debts."
msgstr ""
"系統隨即會配對這些項目，並將其餘額從業務夥伴分類帳中移除，表示這些債務已無須"
"付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation.rst:293
msgid ""
"The workflow is the same whether there are only two equal debts in the "
"receivable and payable accounts or multiple debts in each account."
msgstr ""
"無論應收賬款及應付賬款中只有兩筆相等的債務，還是每個賬戶中各有數筆債務，工作"
"流程均相同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:5
msgid ""
"Reconciliation models are custom rules that complement the :ref:`default set"
" of matching rules <accounting/reconciliation/reconcile>` and enable more "
"advanced automation of the :doc:`bank reconciliation <reconciliation>` "
"process. These models are especially useful when dealing with recurring "
"flows like writing off bank fees or :doc:`cash discounts "
"<../customer_invoices/cash_discounts>`."
msgstr ""
"對賬模型是自訂規則，用以補充:ref:`預設配對規則 <accounting/reconciliation/"
"reconcile>`，並讓:doc:`銀行對賬 <reconciliation>`流程實現更進階的自動化。處理"
"如撇銷銀行手續費或:doc:`現金折扣 <../customer_invoices/cash_discounts>`等重複"
"性業務流程時，這些模型尤其實用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:12
