msgstr ":guilabel:`合作夥伴`：選擇要設定於日記賬項目的合作夥伴（如有）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:87
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Account`: Select the account, if any, to set on the journal item."
msgstr ":guilabel:`賬戶`：選擇要在日記賬項目上設定的賬戶（如有）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:88
msgid ""
