msgstr ":guilabel:`金額類型`：選擇如何計算日記賬項目的金額："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:90
msgid ":guilabel:`Fixed`: Use a fixed amount."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:91
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Percentage of balance`: Use a percentage of the remaining balance"
" of the transaction, regardless of the transaction total."
msgstr ":guilabel:`餘額百分比`：不論交易總額多少，均使用交易剩餘餘額的百分比。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Percentage of statement line`: Use a percentage of the "
"transaction total, regardless of the remaining balance of the transaction."
msgstr ":guilabel:`對賬單明細百分比`：使用交易總額的百分比，而不論交易的剩餘餘額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:95
msgid ""
":guilabel:`From label`: Use a percentage from the transaction's label using "
