msgstr ":guilabel:`根據標籤`：使用正則表達式從交易標籤中擷取百分比。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:97
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Amount`: Enter the amount to be used on the journal item. This "
"field will be either a fixed amount, percentage amount, or regex depending "
"on the :guilabel:`Account Type`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`金額`：輸入要在日記帳項目中使用的金額。此欄位可以是固定金額、百分"
"比金額或正規表示式，視乎 :guilabel:`帳戶類型` 而定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:99
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Taxes`: Select a tax, if any, to set on the journal item. This "
