msgstr ":guilabel:`分析`：如有，請選擇要在日記賬項目上設定的分析分佈。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:102
msgid ":guilabel:`Label`: Enter a label, if any, to set on the journal item."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:105
msgid ""
"While neither the :guilabel:`Partner` nor :guilabel:`Account` fields are "
"mandatory, at least one of the two must be set for the reconciliation model "
"to work correctly."
msgstr ""
"雖然 :guilabel:`合作夥伴` 及 :guilabel:`會計科目` 欄位皆非必填，但必須設定其"
"中至少一項，對賬模型才可正常運作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:107
msgid ""
"The reconciliation model can be used for :ref:`partner mapping "
