"include a :guilabel:`Partner` but no :guilabel:`Account`."
msgstr ""
"對賬模型可用於 :ref:`合作夥伴配對 <accounting/rec-models/partner>` ，前提是 "
":guilabel:`對應項目` 包含 :guilabel:`合作夥伴` 但沒有 :guilabel:`會計科目` 。"

