msgstr "預設對賬模型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:115
msgid ""
"In Odoo, different models are available by default depending on the "
"company's :doc:`fiscal localization <../../fiscal_localizations>`. These can"
" be updated if needed. The following reconciliation models exist across most"
" fiscal localizations."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 中，系統會根據公司的 :doc:`財政本地化 <../../fiscal_localizations>`，"
"預設提供不同的模型。如有需要，你可更新這些模型。以下對賬模型適用於大多數財政"
"本地化設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:120
msgid "Internal Transfers"
msgstr "內部調撥"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:122
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Internal Transfers` reconciliation model is used for making "
":doc:`internal transfers <internal_transfers>` from one bank or cash account"
" to another by moving the entire transaction's balance to a liquidity or "
"internal transfer account. To fully transfer the amount from one account to "
"another, this reconciliation model must be used on both the incoming "
"journal's transaction and the outgoing journal's transaction."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:129
msgid ":doc:`internal_transfers`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/reconciliation_models.rst:132
