#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:114
msgid "Register bank transactions manually"
msgstr "手動登記銀行交易"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:116
msgid ""
"You can also record your bank transactions manually. To do so, go to the "
":guilabel:`Accounting Dashboard`, click the :guilabel:`Bank` journal's name,"
" and then on :guilabel:`New`. The :guilabel:`Partner` field is optional to "
"ease the reconciliation process, but the :guilabel:`Label` and "
":guilabel:`Date` fields are mandatory."
msgstr ""
"您亦可手動記錄銀行交易。要執行此操作，請前往 :guilabel:`會計儀表板`，點擊 "
":guilabel:`銀行` 日記帳的名稱，然後點擊 :guilabel:`新增`。:guilabel:`合作夥"
"伴` 欄位為可選填，以簡化對帳流程；但 :guilabel:`標籤` 及 :guilabel:`日期` 欄"
"位則為必填。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:124
msgid "Statements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:126
msgid ""
"A **bank statement** is a document provided by a bank or financial "
"institution that lists the transactions that have occurred in a particular "
"bank account over a specified period of time."
msgstr ""
"**銀行結單** 是由銀行或金融機構提供的文件，列出特定銀行賬戶在指定時間內發生的"
"交易記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:129
msgid ""
"In Odoo Accounting, it is optional to group transactions by their related "
"statement, but depending on your business flow, you may want to record them "
"for record-keeping and organizational purposes."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 會計中，按相關結單將交易分組屬可選操作；但視乎你的業務流程，你亦可選"
"擇記錄相關資料，以便保存紀錄及整理賬目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:132
msgid ""
"To access a list of existing statements, go to the :guilabel:`Accounting "
"Dashboard`, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(dropdown menu)` icon"
" next to the bank or cash journal you want to check, then click "
":guilabel:`Statements`."
msgstr ""
"如要存取現有對帳單的列表，請前往 :guilabel:`會計儀表板`，點擊您想查看的銀行或"
"現金日記帳旁邊的 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`（下拉式選單）` 圖示，然後"
"點擊 :guilabel:`對帳單`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:137
msgid ""
"To ensure the ending balances of your bank statements in Odoo align with the"
" ending balances of the statements that are provided by your bank, create an"
" opening transaction to record the bank account balance as of the date you "
"begin synchronizing or importing transactions. This is necessary to ensure "
"the accuracy of your accounting."
msgstr ""
"為確保 Odoo 中銀行對賬單的期末結餘與銀行所提供對賬單的期末結餘一致，請建立開"
"賬交易，以記錄截至你開始同步或匯入交易當日的銀行賬戶結餘。此步驟對確保會計賬"
"目準確至關重要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:143
msgid ""
"To access a statement's transactions, click :guilabel:`Transactions` "
"directly from the :guilabel:`Bank Statements` list view or open a statement "
"and click the :guilabel:`Statement lines` smart button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:150
msgid "Statement creation"
msgstr "建立對帳單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:152
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Bank Matching` view displays transactions from most recent to"
" oldest and groups them by statement, with any recent transactions that do "
"not belong to a statement at the top. To add transactions to a statement, "
"hover on the most recent transaction that should be included in the "
"statement, and click the :guilabel:`Statement` button that appears on the "
"upper separator line. Doing so creates a statement from that transaction "
"down to the oldest transaction that is not yet part of a statement."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:159
msgid "A \"Statement\" button is visible when hovering on a transaction."
msgstr "將滑鼠懸停在交易上時，會顯示「結單」按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:162
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Create Statement` window, fill out the statement's "
":guilabel:`Reference`, verify its :guilabel:`Starting Balance` and "
":guilabel:`Ending Balance`, add an attachment such as a PDF of the statement"
" if desired, and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`建立對帳單` 視窗中，填寫對帳單的 :guilabel:`參考`，核實其 "
":guilabel:`期初結餘` 及 :guilabel:`期末結餘`，如有需要可加入附件（例如對帳單"
"的 PDF 檔案），然後按一下 :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:167
msgid ""
"Transactions can also be added to statements from the list view. Select all "
"the transactions corresponding to the bank statement, and, in the "
":guilabel:`Statement` column, select an existing statement or create a new "
"one by typing its reference, clicking on :guilabel:`Create and edit...`, "
"filling out the statement's details, and saving."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:175
msgid "Statement viewing, editing, and printing"
msgstr "檢視、編輯及列印結單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:177
msgid ""
"To view an existing statement, click the statement amount in the "
":guilabel:`Bank Matching` view or click the statement name and then the "
":icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(Internal link)` icon in the "
":guilabel:`Bank Matching` list view. From here, you can edit the "
":guilabel:`Reference`, :guilabel:`Starting Balance`, :guilabel:`Ending "
"Balance`, and :guilabel:`Attachments`."
msgstr ""
"如要檢視現有對帳單，請在 :guilabel:`銀行配對` 檢視中點擊對帳單金額，或點擊對"
"帳單名稱再點擊 :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(內部連結)` 圖示（於 "
":guilabel:`銀行配對` 列表檢視中）。在此畫面中，您可以編輯 :guilabel:`參考編"
"號`、:guilabel:`期初餘額`、:guilabel:`期末餘額` 及 :guilabel:`附件`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:183
msgid ""
"Manually updating the :guilabel:`Starting Balance` automatically updates the"
" :guilabel:`Ending Balance` based on the new value of the "
":guilabel:`Starting Balance` and the value of the statement's transactions."
msgstr ""
"手動更新 :guilabel:`期初餘額` 後，:guilabel:`期末餘額` 會根據 :guilabel:`期初"
"餘額` 的新數值及對賬單交易的金額自動更新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:186
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Starting Balance` doesn't equal the previous statement's "
":guilabel:`Ending Balance`, or if the :guilabel:`Ending Balance` doesn't "
"equal the running balance (:guilabel:`Starting Balance` plus the statement's"
" transactions), a warning appears explaining the issue. To maintain "
"flexibility, it is still possible to save without first resolving the issue."
msgstr ""
"如果 :guilabel:`期初結餘` 不等於上一份對賬單的 :guilabel:`期末結餘`，或者 "
":guilabel:`期末結餘` 不等於累計結餘（即 :guilabel:`期初結餘` 加上該對賬單的交"
"易），系統便會顯示警告說明問題。為保持操作彈性，您仍可先儲存而無需即時解決該"
"問題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:192
msgid ""
"To generate and print a PDF of the bank statement, click the :icon:`fa-cog` "
":guilabel:`(gear)` icon and click :icon:`fa-print` :guilabel:`Statement`."
msgstr ""
"要產生並列印銀行對賬單 PDF，請按一下 :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`（齒輪）` 圖示"
"，然後按一下 :icon:`fa-print` :guilabel:`對賬單`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/bank/transactions.rst:196
msgid ""
"When a bank statement is generated to be printed, it is automatically added "
"to the :guilabel:`Attachments` if no file was attached when creating the "
"statement."
msgstr ""
"若建立銀行結單時未附上任何檔案，系統在產生結單作列印用途時，會自動將該結單新"
"增至 :guilabel:`附件`。"

