msgid ""
"Under the terms of a contract with a customer, invoices can be generated "
"periodically or at the end of the contract based on the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:82
msgid ""
":doc:`Time and materials <../../sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials>`: "
"Based on recorded hours and materials used, as documented in timesheets or "
"purchase records."
msgstr ""
":doc:`工時與材料 <../../sales/sales/invoicing/time_materials>`：根據工時表或"
"採購記錄中所載的已記錄工時及已使用材料計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:84
msgid ""
"Fixed products/services: Based on predefined products or services as "
"outlined in a sales order linked to the contract."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:88
msgid ""
"This invoicing method is commonly used by service companies that bill "
"primarily on a time-and-materials basis. In contrast, service companies that"
" invoice at a fixed price typically follow a :ref:`standard sales order "
"process <accounting/invoice/invoice-from-sales>`."
msgstr ""
"這種開立發票方式常見於主要按工時及材料收費的服務型公司。相反，按固定價格開立"
"發票的服務型公司通常會採用 :ref:`標準銷售訂單流程 <accounting/invoice/"
"invoice-from-sales>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:93
msgid ":doc:`../../sales/sales/invoicing/milestone`"
msgstr ":doc:`../../sales/sales/invoicing/milestone`"

