#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:123
msgid "Manual invoice creation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:125
msgid ""
"Draft invoices can be created manually from the :guilabel:`Sales` journal in"
" the :guilabel:`Accounting Dashboard`."
msgstr ""
"從 :guilabel:`銷售` 日記賬即可手動建立草稿發票，該日記賬位於 :guilabel:`會計"
"儀表板`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:128
msgid ""
"An invoice must include the required information to enable the customer to "
"pay promptly for their goods and services. Make sure the following fields "
"are appropriately completed:"
msgstr ""
"發票必須包含必要資料，以便客戶及時為購買的貨品及服務付款。請確保正確填妥以下"
"欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:131
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer`: When a customer is selected, Odoo automatically pulls "
"information from the customer record, such as the invoice address, "
":doc:`preferred payment terms <customer_invoices/payment_terms>`, "
":doc:`fiscal positions <taxes/fiscal_positions>`, receivable account, and "
"more onto the invoice. To change these values for this specific invoice, "
"edit them directly on the invoice. To apply them for future invoices, update"
" the values on the contact record."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`客戶`：選擇客戶後，Odoo 會自動從該客戶記錄提取資料至發票，例如發票"
"地址、:doc:`首選付款條款 <customer_invoices/payment_terms>`、:doc:`財務狀況 "
"<taxes/fiscal_positions>`、應收賬款科目等。若要僅為此發票更改這些數值，請直接"
"在發票上編輯。若要套用至日後的發票，請在聯絡人記錄中更新相關數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:137
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invoice Date`: If not set manually, this field is automatically "
"set as the current date upon confirmation."
msgstr ":guilabel:`發票日期`：如未手動設定，此欄位會在確認時自動設為目前日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:139
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Due Date` or :doc:`payment terms "
"<customer_invoices/payment_terms>`: To specify when the customer has to pay "
"the invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`到期日`或:doc:`付款條款 <customer_invoices/payment_terms>`：用以指"
"定客戶須於何時支付發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:141
msgid ":guilabel:`Journal`: Automatically set and can be changed if needed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`日記賬`：系統會自動設定，如有需要可作更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:142
msgid ""
":doc:`Currency <get_started/multi_currency>`: If the invoice's currency "
"differs from the company's currency, the currency exchange rate is "
"automatically displayed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:145
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:92
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Invoice Lines` tab:"
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`發票資料行` 分頁中："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:147
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product`: Click :guilabel:`Add a line`, then search for and "
