msgstr ":doc:`稅項 <taxes>`（如適用）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:152
msgid ""
"To access the product catalog and view all items in an organized display, "
"click :doc:`Catalog </applications/essentials/product_catalog>`. When the "
"products and quantities are selected, click :guilabel:`Back to Invoice` to "
"return to the invoice; the selected catalog items will appear in the invoice"
" lines."
msgstr ""
"要存取產品目錄並以整齊方式查看所有項目，請點擊:doc:`目錄 </applications/"
"essentials/product_catalog>`。選擇產品及數量後，點擊:guilabel:`返回發票`即可"
"返回發票；所選的目錄項目將顯示於發票明細行中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:158
msgid ""
"To display the total amount of the invoice in words, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and activate the "
":guilabel:`Total amount of invoice in letters` option."
msgstr ""
"要以文字顯示發票總金額，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 設定`，並啟"
"用 :guilabel:`以文字顯示發票總金額` 選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:162
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Journal Items` tab displays the accounting entries created. "
"Additional invoice information, such as the :guilabel:`Customer Reference`, "
":guilabel:`Payment Reference`, :doc:`Fiscal Positions "
"<taxes/fiscal_positions>`, :doc:`Incoterms <customer_invoices/incoterms>`, "
"and more, can be added or modified in the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:168
msgid ""
"Odoo initially creates invoices in :guilabel:`Draft` status. Draft invoices "
"have no accounting impact until they are :ref:`confirmed "
"<accounting/invoice/confirmation>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 最初會以 :guilabel:`草稿` 狀態建立發票。草稿發票在 :ref:`確認 "
"<accounting/invoice/confirmation>` 前不會產生任何會計影響。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:172
msgid ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma`"
msgstr ":doc:`/applications/sales/sales/invoicing/proforma`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:177
msgid "Invoice confirmation"
msgstr "發票確認"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:179
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Confirm` when the invoice is completed. The invoice's "
"status changes to :guilabel:`Posted`, and a journal entry is created based "
"on the invoice configuration. On confirmation, Odoo assigns each invoice a "
"unique number from a defined :doc:`sequence <customer_invoices/sequence>`."
msgstr ""
"完成發票後，點擊 :guilabel:`確認`。發票狀態會變更為 :guilabel:`已過賬`，系統"
"亦會根據發票設定建立日記賬分錄。確認後，Odoo 會根據已定義的 :doc:`序號 "
"<customer_invoices/sequence>` 為每張發票分配一個獨一無二的編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:185
msgid ""
"Once confirmed, an invoice can no longer be updated. Click :guilabel:`Reset "
"to draft` if changes are needed."
msgstr "發票一經確認便無法再更新。如需更改，請點擊 :guilabel:`重設為草稿`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:187
msgid ""
"If required, invoices and other journal entries can be locked once posted "
"using the :ref:`Secure posted entries with hash <data-"
"inalterability/restricted>` feature."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，您可以使用 :ref:`使用雜湊保護已過賬分錄 <data-inalterability/"
"restricted>` 功能，在過賬後鎖定發票及其他日記賬分錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:193
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/dominican_republic.rst:292
msgid "Invoice sending"
msgstr "發送發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:195
msgid ""
"To set a preferred :guilabel:`Invoice sending` method for a customer, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Customers` and select the "
"customer. In the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab of the contact form, select the "
"preferred :guilabel:`Invoice sending` method in the :guilabel:`Customer "
"Invoices` section."
msgstr ""
"如要為客戶設定偏好的 :guilabel:`發送發票` 方式，請前往 :menuselection:`會"
"計 --> 客戶 --> 客戶` 並選擇該客戶。在聯絡人表單的 :guilabel:`會計` 分頁中，"
"選擇偏好的 :guilabel:`發送發票` 方式（位於 :guilabel:`客戶發票` 部分）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:201
msgid ""
"Sending letters in Odoo requires :doc:`In-App Purchase (IAP) "
"<../../essentials/in_app_purchase>` credit or tokens."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 中寄送實體信件需要 :doc:`應用程式內購買（IAP） <../../essentials/"
"in_app_purchase>` 點數或代幣。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:204
msgid ""
