#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:220
msgid ""
"If a preferred :guilabel:`Invoice sending` method was set in the contact "
"form, it is selected by default. Select another one if needed."
msgstr ""
"如已在聯絡人表單中設定偏好的 :guilabel:`發票傳送` 方式，系統會預設選取該方式"
"。如有需要，你可改選其他方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:222
msgid ""
"If no preferred :guilabel:`Invoice sending` method was set in the contact "
"form, select the method to use for sending the invoice to the customer."
msgstr ""
"如果聯絡人表單中未設定偏好的:guilabel:`發票傳送`方式，請選擇用於向客戶傳送發"
"票的方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:225
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Send` if the :guilabel:`by Email` option is selected, or "
"click :guilabel:`Download`."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`發送`（如已選取 :guilabel:`透過電郵` 選項），或點擊 "
":guilabel:`下載`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:231
msgid "Sending multiple invoices"
msgstr "傳送多張發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:233
msgid ""
"To send multiple invoices, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers "
"--> Invoices`, select them in the :guilabel:`Invoices` list view, and click "
":guilabel:`Send`. The :guilabel:`Send` window displays the number of "
"selected invoices to send by email."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:237
msgid ""
"After clicking :guilabel:`Send`, a banner is added to the selected invoices "
"to indicate they are part of an ongoing send batch. This helps prevent the "
"process from being triggered manually again, as exceptionally large batches "
"may take some time to complete."
msgstr ""
"按一下:guilabel:`傳送`後，系統會在已選取的發票上顯示橫額，指出這些發票屬於正"
"在進行的批量傳送作業。由於特別龐大的批次可能需要較長時間完成，此舉有助防止人"
"手再次觸發該流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices.rst:241
msgid ""
"To check all invoices that have not yet been sent, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices`. In the "
":guilabel:`Invoices` list view, click into the search bar and filter on "
":guilabel:`Not Sent`."
msgstr ""

