#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:149
msgid "Apply a cash discount to a customer invoice"
msgstr "為客戶發票套用現金折扣"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:151
msgid ""
"On a customer invoice, apply a cash discount by selecting the :ref:`payment "
"terms you created <cash-discounts/payment-terms>`. Odoo automatically "
"computes the correct amounts, tax amounts, due dates, and accounting "
"records."
msgstr ""
"在客戶發票上，選擇 :ref:`您所建立的付款條款 <cash-discounts/payment-terms>` "
"即可套用現金折扣。Odoo 會自動計算正確的金額、稅額、到期日及會計記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:155
msgid ""
"Under the :guilabel:`Journal Items` tab, you can display the discount "
"details by clicking on the \"toggle\" button and adding the "
":guilabel:`Discount Date` and :guilabel:`Discount Amount` columns."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:158
msgid ""
"An invoice of €100.00 with \"2/7 Net 30\" selected as payment terms. The \"Journal Items\" tab\n"
"is open, and the \"Discount Date\" and \"Discount Amount\" columns are displayed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:162
msgid ""
"The discount amount and due date are also displayed on the generated invoice"
" report sent to the customer if the :guilabel:`Show installment dates` "
"option is checked on the payment terms."
msgstr ""
"如果在付款條款中勾選了:guilabel:`顯示分期付款日期`選項，傳送給客戶的已產生發"
"票報表上亦會顯示折扣金額及到期日。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:165
msgid ""
"An invoice of €100.00 with the following text added to the terms and conditions: \"30\n"
"Days, 2% Early Payment Discount under 7 days. 118.58 € due if paid before 01/08/2023.\""
msgstr ""
"一張 €100.00 的發票，並在條款及細則中加入以下文字：「30\n"
"天，7 天內付款可享 2% 提早付款折扣。如於 01/08/2023 前付款，應付金額為 "
"118.58 €。」"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:170
msgid "Payment reconciliation"
msgstr "付款對賬"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:172
msgid ""
"When you record a :doc:`payment <../payments>` or :doc:`reconcile your bank "
"transactions <../bank/reconciliation>`, Odoo takes the customer payment's "
"date into account to determine if the customer can benefit from the cash "
"discount or not."
msgstr ""
"當你記錄 :doc:`付款 <../payments>` 或 :doc:`為你的銀行交易對賬 <../bank/"
"reconciliation>` 時，Odoo 會考慮客戶的付款日期，以決定客戶能否享有現金折扣。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts.rst:177
msgid ""
"If your customer pays the discount amount *after* the discount date, you can"
" always decide to mark the invoice as fully paid with a write-off or as "
"partially paid."
msgstr ""
"若客戶在折扣到期日 *之後* 才支付折扣金額，您仍可選擇以撇賬方式將發票標記為已"
"全數付款，或標記為部分付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_rounding.rst:3
msgid "Cash rounding"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_rounding.rst:5
msgid ""
"**Cash rounding** is required when the lowest physical denomination of "
"currency, or the smallest coin, is higher than the minimum unit of account."
msgstr ""
"當貨幣的最低實物面額（即最小硬幣面額）高於最小記賬單位時，便需要使用**現金捨"
"入**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_rounding.rst:9
msgid ""
"For example, some countries require their companies to round up or down the "
"total amount of an invoice to the nearest five cents, when the payment is "
"made in cash."
msgstr ""
"例如，部分國家／地區規定企業在使用現金付款時，須將發票總金額四捨五入至最接近"
"的五仙。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_rounding.rst:16
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and enable "
"*Cash Rounding*, then click on *Save*."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 設定`，並啟用 *現金湊整*，然後點擊 *儲"
"存*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_rounding.rst:22
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Cash Roundings`, and "
"click on *Create*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_rounding.rst:25
msgid ""
"Define here your *Rounding Precision*, *Rounding Strategy*, and *Rounding "
"Method*."
msgstr "在此定義您的 *捨入精度*、*捨入策略* 及 *捨入方式*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_rounding.rst:28
msgid "Odoo supports two **rounding strategies**:"
msgstr "Odoo 支援兩種 **捨入策略**："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_rounding.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Add a rounding line**: a *rounding* line is added on the invoice. You have"
" to define which account records the cash roundings."
msgstr ""
"**新增捨入行**：在發票上新增一行 *捨入* 明細行。您必須定義哪個科目用於記錄現"
"金捨入金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_rounding.rst:33
msgid "**Modify tax amount**: the rounding is applied in the taxes section."
msgstr "**修改稅額**：捨入將套用於稅項部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_rounding.rst:36
msgid "Apply roundings"
msgstr "套用捨入"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/cash_rounding.rst:38
msgid ""
"When editing a draft invoice, open the *Other Info* tab, go to the "
"*Accounting Information* section, and select the appropriate *Cash Rounding "
"Method*."
msgstr ""
"編輯草稿發票時，請開啟 *其他資料* 分頁，前往 *會計資料* 區段，並選擇合適的 "
"*現金捨入方式*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes.rst:3
msgid "Credit notes and refunds"
msgstr "貸項通知單及退款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes.rst:5
msgid ""
"A credit/debit note, or credit/debit memo, is a document sent to a customer "
"to inform them that they have been *credited/debited* a certain amount."
msgstr ""
"貸記單／借記單（或貸項／借項備忘錄）是發送給客戶的文件，用於通知客戶已獲 *貸"
"記／借記* 特定金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes.rst:8
msgid "Several use cases can lead to a credit note, such as:"
msgstr "多種情況都可能需要開立貸項通知單，例如："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes.rst:10
msgid "a mistake in the invoice or vendor bill"
msgstr "發票或供應商賬單中的錯誤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes.rst:11
msgid "a return of the goods, or a rejection of the services"
msgstr "退回貨品，或拒絕接受服務"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes.rst:12
msgid "the goods delivered are damaged"
msgstr "所交付的貨品已損毀"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes.rst:14
msgid ""
"Debit notes are less common but are most frequently used to track debts owed"
" by customers or to vendors because of modifications to confirmed customer "
"invoices or vendor bills."
msgstr ""
"借項通知單較為少見，但最常用於追蹤因修改已確認客戶發票或供應商賬單而導致的客"
"戶欠款或應付供應商款項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes.rst:18
msgid ""
"Issuing a credit/debit note is the only legal method for canceling, "
"refunding, or modifying a validated invoice. Make sure to **register the "
"payment** afterward if money is being refunded to the customer and/or "
"validate the :doc:`return "
"</applications/sales/sales/products_prices/returns>` if a storable product "
"is being returned."
msgstr ""
