#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:37
msgid ""
"Revenues are deferred on this Current Liability account until they are "
"recognized."
msgstr "收益會先遞延至此流動負債科目，直至確認為止。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:38
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:38
msgid "Generate Entries"
msgstr "產生分錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:39
msgid ""
"By default, Odoo :ref:`automatically generates "
"<customer_invoices/deferred/generate_on_validation>` the deferral entries "
"when you post a customer invoice. However, you can also choose to "
":ref:`generate them manually <customer_invoices/deferred/generate_manually>`"
" by selecting the :guilabel:`Manually & Grouped` option instead."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，當你過帳客戶發票時，Odoo 會:ref:`自動產生 <customer_invoices/"
"deferred/generate_on_validation>`遞延分錄。不過，你亦可選擇:ref:`手動產生 "
"<customer_invoices/deferred/generate_manually>`遞延分錄，只需改"
"選:guilabel:`手動並分組`選項即可。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:43
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:43
msgid "Based on"
msgstr "根據"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:44
msgid "There are three ways to calculate the deferred revenue recognition:"
msgstr "計算遞延收入確認的方法有三種："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:46
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Days`: The total amount is divided equally by the total number of"
" days in the period, inclusive of the start and end dates."
msgstr ":guilabel:`日數`：總金額會按期間內的總日數（包括開始及結束日期）平均分配。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:48
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:48
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Months`: Each full month represents an equal proportion of the "
"total amount, regardless of the actual number of days in that month "
"(standardized basis)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`月份`：每個完整月份代表總金額的相等比例，不論該月的實際日數（標準"
"化基準）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:50
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:50
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Full Months`: Any month started is treated as a complete month. "
"However, the final month is only considered full if the period extends to "
"the very last day of that month."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`完整月份`：任何已開始的月份均視為一個完整月份。然而，最後一個月只"
"有在期間延伸至該月最後一日時，才會視為完整月份。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:53
msgid "Suppose an invoice of $1200 must be deferred over 12 months."
msgstr "假設一張 $1200 的發票須分 12 個月遞延確認。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:55
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:55
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Days` option accounts for different amounts depending on the "
"number of days in each month (e.g., ~$102 for January and ~$92 for "
"February)."
msgstr ""
"使用 :guilabel:`天數` 選項會根據每月的天數計算不同的金額（例如，1 月約 "
"$102，2 月約 $92）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:57
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:57
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Months` option accounts for $100 each month prorated to the "
"number of days in that month (e.g., $50 for the first month if the "
":guilabel:`Start Date` is set to the 15th of the month)."
msgstr ""
"選擇 :guilabel:`月` 選項時，系統每月會按該月天數比例入帳 $100（例如，若將 "
":guilabel:`開始日期` 設為該月 15 日，首月便會入帳 $50）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:60
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:60
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Full Months` option considers each month started to be full "
"(e.g., $100 for the first month even if the :guilabel:`Start Date` is set to"
" the 15th of the month); this means that with the :guilabel:`Full Months` "
"option, a full $100 is recognized in the first partial month, eliminating "
"the need for a 13th month to recognize any remainder as would be the case "
"when using the :guilabel:`Months` option."
msgstr ""
"使用 :guilabel:`整月` 選項時，每個已開始的月份都會視為完整一個月計算（例如："
"即使 :guilabel:`開始日期` 設為該月 15 日，首月仍按 $100 計算）。這表示使用 "
":guilabel:`整月` 選項時，第一個不足月的期間會確認全額 $100，無須像使用 "
":guilabel:`月` 選項那樣，需於第 13 個月才確認餘額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:69
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/deferred_expenses.rst:69
msgid "Generate deferral entries on validation"
msgstr "在驗證時產生遞延記項"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:72
msgid ""
"Make sure the :guilabel:`Deferred Date` field is visible in the "
":guilabel:`Invoice Lines` tab. In most cases, the start of the deferred "
"period should be in the same month as the :guilabel:`Invoice Date`. Deferred"
" revenue entries are posted from the invoice date and are displayed in the "
"report accordingly."
msgstr ""
"請確保 :guilabel:`遞延日期` 欄位顯示於 :guilabel:`發票資料行` 分頁中。在大多"
"數情況下，遞延期間的開始日期應與 :guilabel:`發票日期` 處於同一月份。遞延收入"
"分錄會從發票日期起入賬，並相應顯示在報表中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:77
msgid ""
"For each line of the invoice that should be deferred, specify the start and "
"end dates of the deferral period."
msgstr "就發票上每個應遞延的項目行，指定遞延期間的開始及結束日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:80
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Generate Entries` field in the **Settings** is set to "
":guilabel:`On invoice/bill validation`, Odoo automatically generates the "
"deferral entries when the invoice is validated. Click the "
":guilabel:`Deferred Entries` smart button to see them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:84
msgid ""
"One entry, dated on the same day as the invoice's accounting date, moves the"
" invoice amounts from the income account to the deferred account. The other "
"entries are deferral entries which, month after month, move the invoice "
"amounts from the deferred account to the income account to recognize the "
"revenue."
msgstr ""
"其中一筆分錄的日期與發票的會計日期相同，負責將發票金額從收入科目轉移至遞延科"
"目。其餘分錄則為遞延分錄，按月將發票金額從遞延科目轉回收入科目，以確認收入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:90
msgid ""
"You can defer a January invoice of $1200 over 12 months by specifying a "
"start date of 01/01/2023 and an end date of 12/31/2023. At the end of "
"August, $800 is recognized as an income, whereas $400 remains on the "
"deferred account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/deferred_revenues.rst:97
msgid ""
"The deferred revenue report computes an overview of the necessary deferral "
"entries for each account. To access it, go to :menuselection:`Accounting -->"
" Review --> Deferred Revenues`."
msgstr ""
"遞延收入報表會為每個賬戶計算所需遞延分錄的概覽。如要開啟該報表，請前往 "
":menuselection:`會計 --> 覆核 --> 遞延收入`。"

