"合規電子發票解決方案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/croatia.rst:11
msgid "Legal framework for e-invoicing in Croatia"
msgstr "克羅地亞電子發票的法律框架"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/croatia.rst:13
msgid ""
"In Croatia, businesses must comply with e-invoicing regulations to ensure "
"secure, authentic, and storable transactions. The main legal framework "
"governing e-invoicing in Croatia is the Fiscalization Act and its related "
"requirements for public procurement, which are aligned with `EU Directive "
"2014/55/EU <https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-"
"content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32014L0055>`_ on e-invoicing in public "
"procurement. Under these regulations, all businesses involved in :abbr:`B2G "
"(business-to-government)` transactions are required to use electronic "
"invoicing via the :abbr:`CIS (Central Invoice System)`, Croatia’s official "
"platform for public sector e-invoicing. Croatia is also part of the Peppol "
"network, facilitating standardized cross-border e-invoicing within the "
"European Union. Furthermore, e-invoicing through the e-Račun platform is "
"mandatory for B2B transactions as of 1 January 2026."
msgstr ""
"在克羅地亞，企業必須遵守電子發票法規，以確保交易安全、真實且可儲存。克羅地亞"
"規範電子發票的主要法律框架為《財政化法案》（Fiscalization Act）及其公共採購相"
"關規定，該等規定與規範公共採購電子發票的 `歐盟第 2014/55/EU 號指令 <https://"
"eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32014L0055>`_ 保持一致。"
"根據這些法規，所有參與 :abbr:`B2G (企業對政府)` 交易的企業，均須透過克羅地亞"
"公共部門電子發票官方平台 :abbr:`CIS (中央發票系統)` 使用電子發票。克羅地亞亦"
"是 Peppol 網絡的一員，有助於歐盟境內標準化跨境電子發票的推行。此外，自 2026 "
"年 1 月 1 日起，B2B 交易必須透過 e-Račun 平台使用電子發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/croatia.rst:25
msgid "Compliance with Croatian e-invoicing regulations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/croatia.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Integrations**: Odoo can send invoices and report payments to the e-Račun "
"platform via an integration with third-party provider `moj-eRačun "
"<https://moj-eracun.hr>`_. As an accredited provider, mojeRačun is designed "
"to handle the differing technical requirements of the two parallel systems:"
msgstr ""
"**整合**：Odoo 可透過與第三方服務供應商 `moj-eRačun <https://moj-eracun.hr>"
"`_ 整合，向 e-Račun 平台傳送發票及申報付款。作為獲認可的服務供應商，"
"mojeRačun 專為處理兩個並行系統的不同技術要求而設："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/croatia.rst:35
msgid ""
"**For Fiscalization 1.0 (B2C):** MojeRačun supports the real-time reporting "
"of receipts to the Croatian Tax Administration for all payment types (cash, "
"cards, and bank transfers)."
msgstr ""
"**財政化 1.0（B2C）：** MojeRačun 支援向克羅地亞稅務局即時申報所有付款方式（"
"現金、銀行卡及銀行轉賬）的收據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/croatia.rst:37
msgid ""
"**For Fiscalization 2.0 (B2B/B2G):** MojeRačun facilitates the exchange of "
"mandatory structured e-invoices (XML) through certified access points, "
"ensuring automatic fiscalization and real-time reporting to the Croatian Tax"
" Administration."
msgstr ""
"**就 Fiscalization 2.0（B2B/B2G）而言：** MojeRačun 透過經認證的存取點促進強"
"制性結構化電子發票（XML）的交換，確保自動完成稅務申報（Fiscalization）並即時"
"向克羅地亞稅務局匯報。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/croatia.rst:40
msgid ""
"**Supported formats**: Odoo supports standard e-invoice formats, such as PDF"
" with digital signatures and XML in :abbr:`UBL (Universal Business "
"Language)` format, which are fully compatible with Croatia's :abbr:`CIS "
"(Central Invoice System)` for public procurement transactions and e-Račun "
"platform for B2B transactions. Additionally, Odoo enables transmission of "
"e-invoices through any platform connected to the Peppol network, as the "
"*Servis eRačun za državu* reached via Peppol, ensuring compliance with both "
"Croatian and EU standards."
msgstr ""
"**支援格式**：Odoo 支援標準電子發票格式，例如附帶數碼簽署的 PDF，以及採用 "
":abbr:`UBL（通用商業語言）` 格式的 XML。這些格式完全兼容克羅地亞用於公共採購"
"交易的 :abbr:`CIS（中央發票系統）`，以及用於 B2B 交易的 e-Račun 平台。此外，"
"Odoo 亦支援透過任何已連接至 Peppol 網絡的平台（例如經由 Peppol 存取的 "
"*Servis eRačun za državu*）傳送電子發票，確保同時符合克羅地亞及歐盟標準。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/croatia.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Secure storage and retrieval**: In accordance with Croatian regulations to"
" store invoices for a minimum of eleven years, Odoo securely archives all "
"invoices in a tamper-proof system, ensuring they can be easily retrieved "
"during audits."
msgstr ""
"**安全儲存與擷取**：根據克羅地亞法規，發票須保存至少十一年；Odoo 會在防竄改系"
"統中安全封存所有發票，確保審計期間可輕鬆檢索。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/croatia.rst:50
msgid ""
"**Automatic VAT calculation and reporting**: Odoo Invoicing helps businesses"
" stay in line with Croatian VAT requirements by automatically calculating "
"and including VAT in invoices and ensuring that each invoice follows the "
"legal format for both B2B and :abbr:`B2G (business-to-government)` "
"transactions."
msgstr ""

