"框架。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/denmark.rst:12
msgid "Legal framework for e-invoicing in Denmark"
msgstr "丹麥電子發票的法律框架"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/denmark.rst:14
msgid ""
"In Denmark, businesses must adhere to e-invoicing laws that ensure secure, "
"authentic, and storable transactions. The primary regulations governing "
"e-invoicing requirements in Denmark are the `Danish Executive Order on "
"Electronic Invoicing <https://retsinformation.dk>`_ and the `Danish "
"Bookkeeping Act (Bogføringsloven) <https://erhvervsstyrelsen.dk>`_, which "
"align with `EU Directive 2014/55/EU <https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-"
"content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32014L0055>`_. These laws mandate that all "
"businesses engaged in :abbr:`B2G (business-to-government)` transactions must"
" use e-invoicing via NemHandel, Denmark's official electronic invoicing "
"platform for public procurement transactions. Additionally, Denmark's "
"NemHandel network is integrated with the Peppol framework, transitioning to "
"the unified NemHandel BIS 4 standard to provide an interoperable framework "
"for domestic and cross-border e-invoicing. Under the Danish Bookkeeping Act,"
" e-invoicing and digital record-keeping are also systematically mandated for"
" B2B transactions based on a phased rollout timeline to enhance financial "
"transparency."
msgstr ""
"在丹麥，企業必須遵守電子發票法例，以確保交易安全、真實及可保存。規管丹麥電子"
"發票要求的主要法例為 `丹麥電子發票行政命令 <https://retsinformation.dk>`_ 及 "
"`丹麥會計法（Bogføringsloven） <https://erhvervsstyrelsen.dk>`_ ，兩者均符合 "
"`歐盟指令 2014/55/EU <https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/"
"?uri=CELEX%3A32014L0055>`_ 。這些法例規定，所有從事 :abbr:`B2G（企業對政府"
"）` 交易的企業，必須透過丹麥官方公共採購電子發票平台 NemHandel 使用電子發票。"
"此外，丹麥的 NemHandel 網絡已與 Peppol 框架整合，並正過渡至統一的 NemHandel "
"BIS 4 標準，為本地及跨境電子發票提供可互操作的框架。根據《丹麥會計法》，為提"
"升財務透明度，B2B 交易亦會按照分階段推行時間表，系統性地強制實施電子發票及數"
"碼記錄保存。"

