msgstr "交易一旦在 Odoo 中記錄，便無法透過使用者介面刪除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/denmark.rst:69
msgid ""
"All modifications are logged in Odoo, providing a complete audit trail."
msgstr "所有修改均會記錄在 Odoo 中，提供完整的審計追蹤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/denmark.rst:70
msgid ""
"While historically dated entries can be made, Odoo records the creation date"
" and time of the entry."
msgstr "雖然系統允許建立過往日期的記項，但 Odoo 仍會記錄該記項的建立日期及時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/denmark.rst:74
