#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/denmark.rst:76
msgid ""
"Receipts and digital vouchers are stored in Odoo as attachments and "
"integrated into the database, ensuring they are included in backups."
msgstr "收據及數碼憑證會作為附件儲存在 Odoo 並整合至資料庫，確保其包含在備份中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/denmark.rst:78
