"Odoo fully supports the storage of mandatory digital vouchers as defined by "
"Danish regulations."
msgstr "Odoo 全面支援儲存丹麥法規所規定的強制性數碼憑證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/denmark.rst:82
