#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/denmark.rst:84
msgid ""
"Customers with active subscriptions can access all transactions and digital "
"vouchers through Odoo."
msgstr "擁有有效訂閱的客戶可透過 Odoo 存取所有交易及數碼憑證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/denmark.rst:85
msgid ""
"Regardless of customer relations, bankruptcy, or dissolution, Odoo can "
"provide access to transaction and digital voucher details to former clients "
"for six years (see :ref:`electronic_invoicing/denmark/data-lifecycle`)."
msgstr ""
"無論客戶關係、破產或解散與否，Odoo 均可為前客戶提供長達六年的交易及數碼憑證詳"
"情查閱權限（參閱 :ref:`electronic_invoicing/denmark/data-lifecycle`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/denmark.rst:90
