"as a standard ZIP archive accompanying the SQL dump."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/denmark.rst:105
msgid "Data lifecycle management"
msgstr "數據生命週期管理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/denmark.rst:107
msgid ""
"Odoo database backups are available in standard SQL dump formats at all "
"times and include all recorded transactions."
msgstr "Odoo 資料庫備份隨時以標準 SQL 傾印格式提供，並包含所有已記錄的交易。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/denmark.rst:109
msgid ""
"The `Odoo Cloud Hosting SLA <https://www.odoo.com/cloud-sla>`_ guarantees "
"three months of backup history to all active customers. As a special "
"guarantee for Danish customers subject to the DBA and meeting the conditions"
" highlighted above, the last Odoo Cloud backup retention gets increased to "
"six years as soon as they decide to terminate their Odoo Cloud subscription,"
" in order to comply with the requirements of Annex 1, 4 of Executive Order "
"97."
msgstr ""
"`Odoo Cloud 託管服務級別協議（SLA） <https://www.odoo.com/cloud-sla>`_ 為所有"
"有效客戶保證提供三個月的備份歷史記錄。針對受 DBA 約束且符合上述條件的丹麥客戶"
"，我們提供特別保證：一旦客戶決定終止其 Odoo Cloud 訂閱，最後一次 Odoo Cloud "
"備份的保留期限將延長至六年，以符合第 97 號行政命令附件 1 第 4 條的要求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/denmark.rst:116
msgid "Decryption"
msgstr "解密"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/denmark.rst:118
msgid ""
"Odoo customer data on the Odoo Cloud is always stored in encrypted form "
"(encryption at rest at storage level). When backups are retrieved, they are "
"automatically decrypted and provided in decrypted form in standard formats "
"for the user: SQL dumps + ZIP archive of all attached documents (file "
"store)."
msgstr ""
"儲存在 Odoo Cloud 上的 Odoo 客戶資料一律以加密形式保存（儲存層靜態加密）。提"
"取備份時，系統會自動解密，並以標準格式向用戶提供已解密的檔案：SQL 傾印檔及包"
"含所有附件文件的 ZIP 壓縮檔（檔案儲存庫）。"

