#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/jordan.rst:12
msgid "Legal framework for e-invoicing in Jordan"
msgstr "約旦電子發票的法律框架"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/jordan.rst:14
msgid ""
"In Jordan, businesses must comply with `electronic invoicing regulations "
"<https://istd.gov.jo/EN/List/Electronic_billing_User_Manual>`_ established "
"by the `Income and Sales Tax Department (ISTD) "
"<https://istd.gov.jo/En/List/Laws>`_ through the Jordanian National "
"Electronic Invoicing System, commonly referred to as JoFotara. The system "
"requires businesses within the mandated scope to issue and submit electronic"
" invoices and related debit and credit notes through the JoFotara platform "
"in accordance with the government’s technical and legal requirements. "
"Businesses must generate invoices in the required UBL 2.1 format and submit "
"them for real-time validation through the JoFotara platform. Upon successful"
" validation, invoices receive a QR code used for verification and compliance"
" purposes. Depending on the taxpayer type and applicable tax regime, "
"invoices may require percentage-based taxes, fixed taxes, or both. The "
"framework aims to improve tax compliance, transparency, and digitalization "
"across Jordan’s tax system."
msgstr ""
"在約旦，企業必須遵守 `電子發票法規 <https://istd.gov.jo/EN/List/"
"Electronic_billing_User_Manual>`_ ，該法規由 `約旦所得稅及銷售稅局（ISTD） "
"<https://istd.gov.jo/En/List/Laws>`_ 透過約旦國家電子發票系統（通稱 JoFotara"
"）制定。該系統規定受規管範圍內的企業，須按照政府的技術及法律要求，透過 "
"JoFotara 平台開立及提交電子發票以及相關的借項通知單和貸項通知單。企業必須以指"
"定的 UBL 2.1 格式生成發票，並提交至 JoFotara 平台進行實時驗證。驗證成功後，發"
"票會獲發一個二維碼，作核實及合規用途。視乎納稅人類別及適用的稅制，發票可能需"
"要套用百分比稅項、固定稅項，或兩者兼備。此框架旨在提升約旦稅制的合規性、透明"
"度及數碼化水平。"

