"ZATCA 整合平台的通訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/saudi_arabia.rst:42
msgid ""
"**Secure storage and retrieval**: Odoo securely stores electronic invoices, "
"XML files, QR codes, and ZATCA responses within the system, allowing "
"businesses to retrieve compliant records for audits, legal retention "
"requirements, and operational purposes."
msgstr ""
"**安全儲存與檢索**：Odoo 會在系統內安全儲存電子發票、XML 檔案、二維碼及 "
"ZATCA 回應，讓企業能因應審計、法定保留要求及營運需要隨時檢索合規記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/saudi_arabia.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Automatic VAT calculation and reporting**: Odoo Invoicing helps businesses"
" comply with Saudi VAT requirements by automatically calculating taxes, "
