#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/spain.rst:11
msgid "Legal framework for e-invoicing in Spain"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/spain.rst:13
msgid ""
"In Spain, e-invoicing is governed by the `Ley de Facturación Electrónica "
"<https://www.facturae.gob.es/face/Paginas/FACE.aspx>`_ and aligned with `EU "
"Directive 2014/55/EU <https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-"
"content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32014L0055>`_, mandating e-invoicing for "
":abbr:`B2G (business-to-government)` transactions. All invoices to public "
"sector entities must be submitted through the FACe platform, Spain’s "
"official electronic invoicing hub, using the required Facturae format. "
"Additionally, the :abbr:`SII (Immediate Supply of Information)` system "
"mandates near real-time reporting of VAT-related invoice data for certain "
"companies, reinforcing transparency and compliance. While e-invoicing is not"
" yet mandatory for B2B transactions, its adoption is expected to expand in "
"the near future."
msgstr ""
"在西班牙，電子發票受 `《電子發票法》（Ley de Facturación Electrónica） "
"<https://www.facturae.gob.es/face/Paginas/FACE.aspx>`_ 規管，並與 `歐盟第 "
"2014/55/EU 號指令 <https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/"
"?uri=CELEX%3A32014L0055>`_ 保持一致，強制要求 :abbr:`B2G (企業對政府)` 交易必"
"須使用電子發票。所有開予公營部門實體的發票，均須透過西班牙官方電子發票樞紐 "
"FACe 平台，以指定的 Facturae 格式提交。此外，:abbr:`SII (即時資訊供應)` 系統"
"亦規定特定公司須近乎實時申報與增值稅（VAT）相關的發票數據，以加強透明度及合規"
"性。雖然目前 B2B 交易尚未強制推行電子發票，但預計將於不久將來逐步擴大適用範圍"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/spain.rst:23
msgid "Compliance with Spanish e-invoicing regulations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/spain.rst:25
msgid ""
"Odoo Invoicing is fully equipped to help businesses meet Spain's e-invoicing"
" and VAT reporting requirements. Here is how Odoo ensures compliance:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/spain.rst:28
msgid ""
"**Supported formats**: Odoo supports the Facturae (XML) format required by "
"the FACe platform for public sector e-invoicing in Spain. It is also "
"compatible with XML in :abbr:`UBL (Universal Business Language)` formats "
"used within the Peppol network for cross-border transactions. Odoo "
"integrates with FACe, allowing businesses to submit e-invoices directly to "
"Spanish public authorities. Odoo also facilitates compliance with the SII "
"system, enabling automated and near real-time reporting of VAT-related data "
"to the Spanish Tax Agency."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/spain.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Secure storage and retrieval**: In compliance with Spanish regulations "
"requiring invoices to be stored for a minimum of four years, Odoo securely "
"archives all invoices in a tamper-proof system, ensuring easy access during "
"audits or inspections."
msgstr ""
"**安全儲存及檢索**：為符合西班牙法規對發票須保存至少四年的要求，Odoo 會在防竄"
"改系統中安全存檔所有發票，確保於審計或檢查期間能輕鬆存取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/spain.rst:37
msgid ""
"**Automatic VAT calculation and reporting**: Odoo Invoicing automates VAT "
"calculations and ensures invoices are formatted to meet Spanish requirements"
" for both :abbr:`B2G (business-to-government)` and B2B transactions, helping"
" businesses comply with national and EU standards."
msgstr ""
"**自動增值稅計算及申報**：Odoo 發票管理會自動計算增值稅，並確保發票格式符合西"
"班牙對 :abbr:`B2G (企業對政府)` 及 B2B 交易的要求，協助企業遵守國家及歐盟標準"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/spain.rst:42
msgid ""
":doc:`Spain fiscal localization documentation "
"<../../../fiscal_localizations/spain>`"
msgstr ":doc:`西班牙財政本地化文件 <../../../fiscal_localizations/spain>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/spain.rst:46
msgid ""
"This page provides an overview of Spanish e-invoicing laws and how Odoo "
"Invoicing supports compliance with the Ley de Facturación Electrónica, FACe "
"platform, SII system, Peppol standards, and other relevant regulations. It "
"does not constitute legal advice. We recommend consulting with a tax advisor"
" or legal professional familiar with Spanish e-invoicing regulations to "
"ensure compliance tailored to your specific business needs."
msgstr ""
"本頁概述西班牙電子發票法例，以及 Odoo 發票管理如何協助遵守《電子發票法》（"
"Ley de Facturación Electrónica）、FACe 平台、SII 系統、Peppol 標準及其他相關"
"法規。本內容並不構成法律意見。我們建議您諮詢熟悉西班牙電子發票法規的稅務顧問"
"或法律專業人士，以確保符合您特定業務需求的合規要求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/turkiye.rst:5
msgid "Odoo electronic invoicing in Türkiye"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/turkiye.rst:7
msgid ""
"Odoo Invoicing is your trusted partner for safe, efficient, and legally "
"compliant e-invoicing solutions tailored to meet Türkiye’s regulatory "
"standards and compatible with the requirements set forth by the Turkish "
"Revenue Administration."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 發票是您值得信賴的合作夥伴，提供安全、高效且符合法規的電子發票解決方案，"
"專為滿足土耳其的監管標準而設，並符合土耳其稅務局的要求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/turkiye.rst:12
msgid "Legal framework for e-invoicing in Türkiye"
msgstr "土耳其電子發票的法律框架"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/turkiye.rst:14
msgid ""
"In Türkiye, businesses must comply with electronic invoicing regulations "
"established by the Turkish Revenue Administration (Gelir İdaresi Başkanlığı "
"– GİB) under the `Tax Procedure Law No. 213 (VUK) "
"<https://www.gib.gov.tr/mevzuat/kanun/434>`_ and the `General Communiqué No."
" 509 <https://www.resmigazete.gov.tr/eskiler/2019/10/20191019-5.pdf>`_. "
"These regulations govern the issuance, transmission, and storage of "
"electronic invoices through the centralized GİB platform using the UBL-TR "
"XML standard. Businesses subject to mandatory e-invoicing must use the "
"e-Fatura system for B2B and B2G transactions, while e-Arşiv Fatura is used "
"for transactions involving non-registered recipients, including many B2C "
"sales. Mandatory adoption is based on turnover thresholds and sector-"
"specific requirements, and the scope continues to expand to improve tax "
"compliance, transparency, and digitalization across Türkiye’s tax system."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/turkiye.rst:25
msgid "Compliance with Türkiye’s e-invoicing regulations"
msgstr "符合土耳其電子發票法規"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/turkiye.rst:27
msgid ""
"Odoo invoicing simplifies the process of adhering to Türkiye’s e-invoicing "
"regulations, offering features designed to ensure compliance:"
msgstr "Odoo 發票管理簡化了遵守土耳其電子發票法規的流程，並提供旨在確保合規的功能："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/turkiye.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Supported formats**: Odoo supports the standardized UBL-TR 1.2.1 XML "
"format required by the Turkish Revenue Administration (GİB) for e-Fatura and"
" e-Arşiv invoices. This ensures invoices comply with Turkish e-invoicing "
"regulations for both B2B and B2C transactions. Odoo also supports "
"integration with certified GİB private integrator for compliant invoice "
"transmission."
msgstr ""
"**支援格式**：Odoo 支援土耳其稅務局（GİB）就 e-Fatura 及 e-Arşiv 電子發票所規"
"定的標準化 UBL-TR 1.2.1 XML 格式，確保發票符合土耳其 B2B 及 B2C 交易的電子發"
"票法規。Odoo 亦支援與獲認證的 GİB 私人整合商整合，以合規地傳送發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/turkiye.rst:34
msgid ""
"**Secure storage and retrieval**: Odoo sends electronic invoice XML files to"
" Nilvera, a certified private integrator, which securely stores the data on "
"servers located in Türkiye in accordance with Turkish e-invoicing and data "
"retention requirements. This ensures invoices remain accessible for "
"retrieval, audits, and legal compliance purposes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/turkiye.rst:38
msgid ""
"**Automatic VAT calculation and reporting**: Odoo Invoicing helps businesses"
" comply with Turkish VAT requirements by automatically calculating and "
"including VAT in invoices and ensuring that each invoice follows the legal "
"format defined by GİB for electronic invoicing transactions."
msgstr ""
"**自動計算及申報增值稅**：Odoo 開票系統協助企業遵守土耳其增值稅規定，自動計算"
"增值稅並將其計入發票中，同時確保每張發票均符合 GİB 為電子發票交易訂明的法定格"
"式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/turkiye.rst:43
msgid ""
":doc:`Türkiye fiscal localization documentation "
"<../../../fiscal_localizations/turkiye>`"
msgstr ":doc:`土耳其財政本地化文件 <../../../fiscal_localizations/turkiye>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing/turkiye.rst:48
msgid ""
"This page provides an overview of Türkiye’s e-invoicing laws and how Odoo "
"Invoicing supports compliance with the Turkish Revenue Administration "
"regulations. It is not intended as legal advice. We recommend consulting "
"with a tax advisor or legal professional familiar with Türkiye’s e-invoicing"
" regulations to ensure compliance tailored to your specific business needs."
msgstr ""

