#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/epc_qr_code.rst:3
msgid "EPC QR codes"
msgstr "EPC 二維碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/epc_qr_code.rst:5
msgid ""
"European Payments Council quick response codes, or **EPC QR codes**, are "
"two-dimensional barcodes that customers can scan with their **mobile banking"
" applications** to initiate a **SEPA credit transfer (SCT)** and pay their "
"invoices instantly."
msgstr ""
"歐洲支付委員會快速響應碼，即 **EPC QR 碼**，是一種二維條碼，客戶可使用其 **手"
"機銀行應用程式** 掃描該條碼，以發起 **SEPA 信用轉賬 (SCT)** 並即時支付發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/epc_qr_code.rst:9
msgid ""
"In addition to bringing ease of use and speed, it greatly reduces typing "
"errors that would potentially make for payment issues."
msgstr "除了操作簡便及快捷外，亦能大幅減少可能引致付款問題的輸入錯誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/epc_qr_code.rst:13
msgid ""
"This feature is only available for companies in several European countries "
"such as Austria, Belgium, Finland, Germany, and the Netherlands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/epc_qr_code.rst:17
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/journals.rst:93
msgid ":doc:`../bank`"
msgstr ":doc:`../bank`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/epc_qr_code.rst:22
