"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and "
"activate the :guilabel:`QR Codes` feature in the :guilabel:`Customer "
"Payments` section."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 設定`，並啟用 :guilabel:`二維碼` 功能"
"（位於 :guilabel:`客戶付款` 部分）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/epc_qr_code.rst:26
msgid "Configure your bank account's journal"
msgstr "設定銀行賬戶的日記賬"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/epc_qr_code.rst:28
msgid ""
"Make sure that your :guilabel:`Bank Account` is correctly configured in Odoo"
" with your IBAN and BIC."
msgstr "請確保已在 Odoo 中為您的 :guilabel:`銀行賬戶` 正確配置 IBAN 及 BIC。"

