"行帳戶號碼` 欄位下）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/epc_qr_code.rst:34
msgid "Bank account number column in the bank journal"
msgstr "銀行日記賬中的銀行賬戶號碼欄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/epc_qr_code.rst:40
msgid "Issue invoices with EPC QR codes"
msgstr "開立附有 EPC 二維碼的發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/epc_qr_code.rst:42
msgid ""
"EPC QR codes are added automatically to your invoices. Customers whose bank "
"supports making payments via EPC QR codes will be able to scan the code and "
"pay the invoice."
msgstr ""
"系統會自動將 EPC 二維碼加入您的發票中。只要客戶的銀行支援透過 EPC 二維碼付款"
"，客戶即可掃描該二維碼並支付發票款項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/epc_qr_code.rst:45
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices`, and create a "
"new invoice."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 客戶 --> 發票`，然後建立新發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/epc_qr_code.rst:47
msgid ""
"Before posting it, open the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab. Odoo automatically "
"fills out the :guilabel:`Recipient Bank` field with your IBAN."
msgstr ""
"過賬前，請開啟:guilabel:`其他資訊`分頁。Odoo 會自動以你的 IBAN 填"
"寫:guilabel:`收款銀行`欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/epc_qr_code.rst:51
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab, the account indicated in the "
":guilabel:`Recipient Bank` field is used to receive your customer's payment."
" Odoo automatically populates this field with your IBAN by default and uses "
"it to generate the EPC QR code."
msgstr ""
