"置 --> 設定` 中，向下捲動至 :guilabel:`客戶發票` 部分，並在 :guilabel:`預設國"
"際貿易條款` 欄位中選擇一項國際貿易條款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:3
msgid "Payment terms and installment plans"
msgstr "付款條款及分期付款計劃"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:5
msgid ""
"**Payment terms** specify all the conditions of a sale's payment to help "
"ensure customers pay their invoices correctly and on time."
msgstr "**付款條款**指定銷售付款的所有條件，以確保客戶準確並準時繳付發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:8
msgid ""
"Payment terms are generally defined on documents such as sales orders, "
"customer invoices, and vendor bills. Payment terms cover:"
msgstr ""
"付款條款通常在銷售訂單、客戶發票及供應商賬單等文件上定義。付款條款涵蓋以下內"
"容："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:11
msgid "The due date(s)"
msgstr "到期日"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:12
msgid "Early payment discounts"
msgstr "提前付款折扣"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:13
msgid "Any other conditions on the payment"
msgstr "付款的任何其他條件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:15
msgid ""
"An **installment plan** allows the customers to pay an invoice in parts, "
"with the amounts and payment dates defined beforehand by the seller."
msgstr "**分期付款計劃**允許客戶分期支付發票，金額及付款日期由賣方預先設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:19
msgid "Immediate Payment"
msgstr "即時付款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:20
msgid "The full payment is due on the day of the invoice's issuance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:21
msgid "15 Days (or Net 15)"
msgstr "15 日（或 Net 15）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:22
msgid "The full payment is due 15 days after the invoice date."
msgstr "全額款項於發票日期後 15 天到期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:23
msgid "21 MFI"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:24
msgid ""
"The full payment is due by the 21st of the month following the invoice date."
msgstr "全額款項須於發票日期翌月 21 日或之前支付。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:25
msgid "30% Advance End of Following Month"
msgstr "預付 30%，下月底到期"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:26
msgid ""
"30% is due on the day of the invoice's issuance. The remaining balance is "
"due at the end of the following month."
msgstr "發票開立當日應付 30%，餘額於下個月月底到期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:28
msgid "2% 10, Net 30 EOM"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:29
msgid ""
"A 2% :doc:`cash discount <cash_discounts>` if the payment is received within"
" ten days. Otherwise, the full payment is due at the end of the month "
"following the invoice date."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:33
msgid ""
"Payment terms are not to be confused with :doc:`down payment invoices "
"</applications/sales/sales/invoicing/down_payment>`. If, for a specific "
"order, you issue multiple invoices to your customer, that is neither a "
"payment term nor an installment plan but an invoicing policy."
msgstr ""
"切勿將付款條款與 :doc:`預付款發票 </applications/sales/sales/invoicing/"
"down_payment>` 混淆。如果您就特定訂單向客戶開立多張發票，這既不屬於付款條款，"
"亦不屬於分期付款計劃，而是開立發票政策。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:37
msgid ""
"This page is about the *payment terms* feature, not :doc:`terms & conditions"
" <terms_conditions>`, which can be used to declare contractual obligations "
"regarding content use, return policies, and other policies surrounding the "
"sale of goods and services."
msgstr ""
"本頁介紹的是 *付款條款* 功能，而非 :doc:`條款及細則 <terms_conditions>`，後者"
"可用於聲明有關內容使用、退貨政策，以及其他與銷售貨品及服務相關政策的合約責任"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:42
msgid ""
"`Odoo Tutorials: payment terms <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/payment-"
"terms-1679>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Odoo 教學課程：付款條款 <https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/payment-terms-"
"1679>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:43
msgid ":doc:`cash_discounts`"
msgstr ":doc:`cash_discounts`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:50
msgid "To create new payment terms, follow these steps:"
msgstr "要建立新的付款條款，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:52
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Payment Terms` and "
"click on :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 付款條款`，然後點擊 :guilabel:`新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:54
msgid ""
"Enter a name in the :guilabel:`Payment Terms` field. This field is the name "
"displayed both internally and on sales orders."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`付款條款` 欄位輸入名稱。此名稱會同時在內部系統及銷售訂單上顯示"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:56
msgid ""
"Tick the :guilabel:`Early Discount` checkbox and fill out the discount "
"percentage, discount days, and :ref:`tax reduction <cash-discounts/tax-"
"reductions>` fields to add a :doc:`cash discount <cash_discounts>`, if "
"desired."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，可剔選 :guilabel:`提前折扣` 複選框，並填寫折扣百分比、折扣天數及 "
":ref:`稅項減免 <cash-discounts/tax-reductions>` 欄位，以加入 :doc:`現金折扣 "
"<cash_discounts>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:59
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Due Terms` section, add a set of rules (terms) to define "
"what needs to be paid and by which due date(s). Defining terms automatically"
" calculates the payments' due date(s). This is particularly helpful for "
"managing **installment plans** (:dfn:`payment terms with multiple terms`)."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`到期條款` 部分，加入一組規則（條款）以定義需支付的金額及到期日"
"。定義條款後，系統會自動計算付款到期日。這對於管理**分期付款計劃**（:dfn:`包"
"含多項條款的付款條款`）尤其有用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:64
msgid ""
"To add a term, click on :guilabel:`Add a line`, define the discount's value "
"and type in the :guilabel:`Due` fields, then fill out the :guilabel:`After` "
"fields to determine the due date."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:68
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Days end of the month on the` option allows you to add a "
":ref:`buffer period <accounting/payment-terms/buffer>` so that an invoice "
"registered at the end of the month isn't due at the beginning of the month "
"that immediately follows."
msgstr ""
"使用 :guilabel:`月底天數於` 選項，你可加入 :ref:`緩衝期 <accounting/payment-"
"terms/buffer>`，以免月底登記的發票在緊接下個月月初立即到期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:72
msgid ""
"Enter the text to be displayed on the document (sales order, invoice, etc.) "
"in the gray textbox in the :guilabel:`Preview` column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:74
msgid ""
"Tick the :guilabel:`Show installment dates` checkbox to display a breakdown "
"of each payment and its due date on the invoice report, if desired."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，請勾選:guilabel:`顯示分期付款日期`核取方塊，以在發票報表上顯示每筆"
"付款及其到期日的明細。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:78
msgid ""
"To instead specify a number of days *before the end of the month*, use a "
"negative value in the :guilabel:`After` field."
msgstr "如要改為指定 *月底前* 的天數，請在 :guilabel:`之後` 欄位輸入負數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:81
msgid ""
"To test that your payment terms are configured correctly, enter an invoice "
"date on the :guilabel:`Example` line to generate the payments that would be "
"due and their due dates using these payment terms."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:86
msgid "Terms are computed in the order of their due dates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:89
msgid ""
"In the following example, 30% is due on the day of issuance, and the "
"remaining 70% is due at the end of the following month."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:92
msgid ""
"Example of Payment Terms. The first line is the 30% due immediately. The second line is\n"
"the remaining 70% due at the end of the following month."
msgstr ""
"付款條款範例。第一行是即時到期的 30%。第二行是\n"
"於下月底到期的餘下 70%。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:99
msgid "End of the month buffer"
msgstr "月底緩衝期"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:101
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Days end of the month on the` option allows users to add a "
"buffer period so that an invoice registered at the end of the month isn't "
"due at the beginning of the month that immediately follows."
msgstr ""
"使用 :guilabel:`月底天數於` 選項，用戶可加入緩衝期，使月底登記的發票不會在緊"
"接的翌月初立即到期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:105
msgid ""
"When using this option, Odoo calculates the due date by taking the invoice "
"date, adding the integer in the :guilabel:`After` field, going to the end of"
" the resulting month, and then adding the integer from the :guilabel:`Days "
"on the next month` field."
msgstr ""
"使用此選項時，Odoo 會以發票日期為基準計算到期日：先加上 :guilabel:`之後` 欄位"
"的整數，移至該月月底，然後再加上 :guilabel:`下月天數` 欄位的整數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:110
msgid ""
"For example, take two invoices, one dated 5 March and the other dated 28 "
"March. Both use the same payment terms with a single :guilabel:`Due Terms` "
"line for 100% of the due amount, due `5` :guilabel:`Days end of the month on"
" the` `1`."
msgstr ""
"例如，有兩張發票，一張日期為 3 月 5 日，另一張為 3 月 28 日。兩者使用相同的付"
"款條款，當中只有一行 :guilabel:`到期條款`，金額為應付總額的 100%，到期設定為 "
"`5` :guilabel:`月底後天數，於每月` `1` 日。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:114
msgid ""
"For the invoice dated 5 March, the due date is computed as **1 April** with "
"the following calculations:"
msgstr "對於日期為 3 月 5 日的發票，系統會透過以下計算得出到期日為 **4 月 1 日**："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:117
msgid "5 March + 5 days = 10 March"
msgstr "3 月 5 日 + 5 天 = 3 月 10 日"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:118
msgid "10 March + end of the month = 31 March"
msgstr "3 月 10 日 + 月底 = 3 月 31 日"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:119
msgid "31 March + on the 1 = 1 April"
msgstr "3 月 31 日 + 於第 1 日 = 4 月 1 日"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:122
msgid ""
"For the invoice dated 28 March, the due date is computed as **1 May** with "
"the following calculations:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:125
msgid "28 March + 5 days = 2 April"
msgstr "3 月 28 日 + 5 天 = 4 月 2 日"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:126
msgid "2 April + end of the month = 30 April"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/customer_invoices/payment_terms.rst:127
