"of the entries from the past period or only the balance of each account at "
"the end of the period."
msgstr ""
"於課稅期結束時：透過此選項，你可以選擇過賬過去期間的所有分錄，或僅過賬期末每"
"個會計科目的餘額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:347
msgid ""
"In the middle of a tax period: this option is not recommended because it "
"causes additional work and complications. Splitting a tax period between a "
"legacy software and Odoo complicates the tax filing process since the data "
"from the two systems must be combined."
msgstr ""
"在稅期中途：不建議採用此選項，因為這會增加額外工作及複雜性。將單一稅期拆分至"
"舊有軟件與 Odoo 之間，會令報稅流程變得複雜，因為必須合併兩個系統的資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:351
msgid "Prepare the following documents from your previous system(s):"
msgstr "從過往系統準備以下文件："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:353
msgid "Opening account balances"
msgstr "期初帳戶餘額"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:354
msgid "Open (unpaid) invoices and credit notes"
msgstr "未結清（未付款）發票及貸項通知單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:355
msgid "Open (unpaid) vendor bills and refunds"
msgstr "未結清（未付款）的供應商帳單及退款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:356
msgid "Opening inventory count"
msgstr "期初庫存盤點"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:359
msgid ""
"If journal entries have been created through the use of the Invoicing app or"
" stock moves in a system with an automated inventory valuation, use the "
":guilabel:`Invoicing Switch Threshold` feature in the Accounting settings to"
" cancel all journal entries before the specified date to start with a clean "
"general ledger. Additionally, enter the appropriate starting balance on each"
" bank journal's first statement so that it matches the current bank account "
"balance."
msgstr ""
"若系統已透過「發票」應用程式建立日記賬分錄，或在啟用自動庫存計價的情況下透過"
"庫存移動建立日記賬分錄，請在「會計」設定中使用 :guilabel:`發票切換閾值` 功能"
"，取消指定日期前的所有日記賬分錄，以全新整潔的總分類賬開始使用。此外，請在每"
"個銀行日記賬的第一張對賬單上輸入適當的期初結餘，使其與目前的銀行賬戶結餘相符"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:366
msgid ""
"Before starting the process of creating opening entries in Odoo, verify that"
" the data meets the following requirements:"
msgstr "在 Odoo 開始建立期初記項的流程前，請確認資料符合以下要求："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:369
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:765
msgid ""
"The sum of the opening trial balances of all receivable accounts must equal "
"the sum of the open customer invoices minus credit notes."
msgstr "所有應收賬款科目的期初試算表總和，必須等於未結客戶發票總和減去貸項通知單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:371
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:767
msgid ""
"The sum of the opening trial balances of all payable accounts must equal the"
" sum of the open vendor bills minus refunds."
msgstr "所有應付賬款科目的期初試算表總和，必須等於未結清供應商賬單總和減去退款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:373
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:769
msgid ""
"The sum of the opening trial balance values of all inventory accounts must "
"equal the sum of the value of the inventory (calculated by multiplying the "
"product cost by the product quantity for each product and summing them "
"together)."
msgstr ""
"所有存貨賬戶的期初試算表總額，必須等於存貨總價值（計算方式為將每項產品的成本"
"乘以產品數量，然後全部相加）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:376
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:772
msgid "The opening trial balance itself must be balanced."
msgstr "期初試算表本身必須保持平衡。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:381
msgid "Open invoices and bills"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:383
msgid ""
"Companies transitioning to Odoo need to import or manually create their open"
" (i.e., existing but not yet fully paid) invoices and vendor bills (as well "
"as any credit notes or refunds) in Odoo so that no invoice or bill is lost "
"in the transition. Importing these records is largely the same process for "
"both invoices and bills and is done in three steps:"
msgstr ""
"轉用 Odoo 的公司需要在 Odoo 中匯入或手動建立未結清（即現有但尚未全額付款）的"
"客戶發票與供應商賬單（以及任何貸項通知單或退款），以確保在過渡期間不會遺漏任"
"何發票或賬單。匯入客戶發票及供應商賬單的流程大致相同，並分為三個步驟："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:388
msgid ":ref:`Preparing invoices/bills <accounting/get_started/prep-bills>`"
msgstr ":ref:`準備發票/帳單 <accounting/get_started/prep-bills>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:389
msgid ""
":ref:`Validating invoices/bills <accounting/get_started/validate-bills>`"
msgstr ":ref:`驗證發票／帳單 <accounting/get_started/validate-bills>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:390
msgid ":ref:`Importing invoices/bills <accounting/get_started/import-bills>`"
msgstr ":ref:`匯入發票／帳單 <accounting/get_started/import-bills>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:393
msgid ""
"For simplicity's sake, it is recommended to import each invoice/bill with "
"only the total amount due, rather than individual invoice/bill lines. This "
"avoids common errors, such as tax accounts being affected twice for the same"
" record."
msgstr ""
"為簡化操作，建議匯入每張應收發票／應付賬單時只匯入應付總額，而非逐項匯入發票"
"／賬單明細行。這樣可避免常見錯誤，例如同一筆記錄的稅項科目被重複影響。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:400
msgid "Prepare invoices and bills"
msgstr "準備發票及帳單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:402
msgid ""
"Prepare the open invoices and bills using the import template available in "
"Odoo. To access the import templates:"
msgstr ""
"使用 Odoo 提供的匯入範本準備未結清的發票及賬單。要存取匯入範本，請執行以下操"
"作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:405
msgid ""
"For invoices and credit notes, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Customers --> Invoices`, click the :icon:`fa-cog` (:guilabel:`Actions`) "
"icon, and click :icon:`oi-download` :guilabel:`Import`. Click :icon:`oi-"
"download` :guilabel:`Template for Invoices` to download the template."
msgstr ""
"如需處理發票及貸項通知單，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 客戶 --> 發票`，點"
"擊 :icon:`fa-cog`（:guilabel:`動作`）圖示，然後點擊 :icon:`oi-download` "
":guilabel:`匯入`。點擊 :icon:`oi-download` :guilabel:`發票範本` 以下載範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:408
msgid ""
"For vendor bills and refunds, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors "
"--> Bills`, click the :icon:`fa-cog` (:guilabel:`Actions`) icon, and click "
":icon:`oi-download` :guilabel:`Import`. Click :icon:`oi-download` "
":guilabel:`Template for Bills` to download the template."
msgstr ""
"有關供應商賬單及退款，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 供應商 --> 賬單`，點擊 "
":icon:`fa-cog`（:guilabel:`動作`）圖示，然後點擊 :icon:`oi-download` "
":guilabel:`匯入`。點擊 :icon:`oi-download` :guilabel:`賬單範本` 以下載範本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:412
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started.rst:536
msgid "Prepare the following fields:"
msgstr "準備以下欄位："

