#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:3
msgid "Average price on returned goods"
msgstr "退回貨品的平均價格"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:8
msgid ""
"*Average cost valuation* (AVCO) is an inventory valuation method that "
"evaluates cost based on the total cost of goods bought or produced during a "
"period, divided by the total number of items on-hand. Inventory valuation is"
" used to:"
msgstr ""
"*平均成本估值法*（AVCO）是一種存貨估值方法，以某段期間內購買或生產的貨品總成"
"本，除以現有貨品總數來計算成本。存貨估值用於："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:12
msgid "reflect the value of a company's assets;"
msgstr "反映公司資產的價值；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:13
msgid "keep track of the amount of unsold goods;"
msgstr "記錄未售出貨品的金額；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:14
msgid "account for monetary value in goods that have yet to generate profit;"
msgstr "記錄尚未產生利潤的貨物之貨幣價值；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:15
msgid "report on flow of goods throughout the quarter."
msgstr "報告整個季度的貨物流動情況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:17
msgid ""
"Because |AVCO| uses the weighted average to evaluate the cost, it is a good "
"fit for companies that sell only a few different products in large "
"quantities. In Odoo, this costing analysis is *automatically updated* each "
"time products are received."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:21
msgid ""
"Thus, when shipments are returned to their supplier, Odoo automatically "
"generates accounting entries to reflect the change in inventory valuation. "
"However, Odoo does **not** automatically update the |AVCO| calculation, "
"because :ref:`this can potentially create inconsistencies with inventory "
"valuation <inventory/avg_price/leaving_inventory>`."
msgstr ""
"因此，當貨品退回給供應商時，Odoo 會自動產生會計分錄，以反映庫存估值的變動。然"
"而，Odoo **不會** 自動更新 |AVCO| 的計算，因為:ref:`這可能會導致與庫存估值不"
"一致 <inventory/avg_price/leaving_inventory>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:27
msgid ""
"This document addresses a specific use case for theoretical purposes. For "
"instructions on how to set up and use |AVCO|, refer to the :doc:`inventory "
"valuation cheat sheet "
"<../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet>`."
msgstr ""
"本文件針對特定使用情況作理論說明。有關如何設定及使用 |AVCO| 的指示，請參閱 "
":doc:`存貨估值速查表 <../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:34
msgid ""
"To use average cost inventory valuation on a product, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Product Categories` and "
"select the category that will be using |AVCO|. On the product category page,"
" set :guilabel:`Costing Method` to `Average Cost (AVCO)` and "
":guilabel:`Inventory Valuation` to `Automated`."
msgstr ""
"如要對產品使用平均成本庫存計價，請前往 :menuselection:`庫存 --> 設定 --> 產品"
"類別`，然後選擇將使用 |AVCO| 的類別。在產品類別頁面上，將 :guilabel:`成本計價"
"方式` 設為 `平均成本 (AVCO)`，並將 :guilabel:`庫存計價` 設為 `自動`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:40
msgid ""
":doc:`Inventory valuation cheat sheet "
"<../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`存貨估值速查表 <../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:44
msgid "Using average cost valuation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:46
msgid ""
"The average cost method adjusts the inventory valuation when products are "
"received in the warehouse. This section explains how it works, but if the "
"explanation is unnecessary, skip to the :ref:`return to supplier use case "
"<inventory/avg_cost/return>` section."
msgstr ""
"平均成本法會在倉庫收到產品時調整存貨估值。本節將說明其運作方式；如無需了解說"
"明，可直接跳至 :ref:`退貨給供應商使用案例 <inventory/avg_cost/return>` 部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:53
msgid "Formula"
msgstr "公式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:55
msgid ""
"When new products arrive, the new average cost for each product is "
"recomputed using the formula:"
msgstr "當新產品到貨時，系統會使用以下公式重新計算每項產品的新平均成本："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:57
msgid ""
"Avg~Cost = \\frac{(Old~Qty \\times Old~Avg~Cost) + (Incoming~Qty \\times Purchase~Price)}{Final~Qty}\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Avg~Cost = \\frac{(Old~Qty \\times Old~Avg~Cost) + (Incoming~Qty \\times "
"Purchase~Price)}{Final~Qty}\n"
"\n"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:60
msgid "**Old Qty**: product count in stock before receiving the new shipment;"
msgstr "**舊數量**：收到新貨運前的庫存產品數量；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:61
msgid ""
"**Old Avg Cost**: calculated average cost for a single product from the "
"previous inventory valuation;"
msgstr "**舊平均成本**：從上一次庫存估值計算得出的單一產品平均成本；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:63
msgid "**Incoming Qty**: count of products arriving in the new shipment;"
msgstr "**入庫數量**：新貨運中到達的產品數量；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:64
msgid ""
"**Purchase Price**: estimated price of products at the reception of products"
" (since vendor bills may arrive later). The amount includes not only the "
"price for the products, but also added costs, such as shipping, taxes, and "
":doc:`landed costs "
"<../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/landed_costs>`. At"
" reception of the vendor bill, this price is adjusted;"
msgstr ""
"**採購價格**：接收產品時的產品預估價格（因供應商賬單可能稍後到達）。該金額不"
"僅包括產品價格，亦包括額外費用，例如運費、稅項及:doc:`到岸成本 <../../../"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/landed_costs>`。收到供應商賬"
"單時，此價格會作出調整；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:69
msgid "**Final Qty**: quantity of on-hand stock after the stock move."
msgstr "**最終數量**：庫存移動後的現有庫存數量。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:74
msgid ""
"When products leave the warehouse, the average cost **does not** change. "
"Read about why the average cost valuation is **not** adjusted :ref:`here "
"<inventory/avg_price/leaving_inventory>`."
msgstr ""
"當產品離開倉庫時，平均成本**不會**改變。請按 :ref:`此處 <inventory/avg_price/"
"leaving_inventory>` 了解平均成本估值**不作**調整的原因。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:80
msgid "Compute average cost"
msgstr "計算平均成本"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:82
msgid ""
"To understand how the average cost of a product changes with each shipment, "
"consider the following table of warehouse operations and stock moves. Each "
"is a different example of how the average cost valuation is affected."
msgstr ""
"要了解產品的平均成本如何隨每次出貨而變化，請參考以下倉庫作業與庫存移動的表格"
"。當中每一項均展示平均成本估值如何受到影響的不同例子。"

