#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:253
msgid "Anglo-Saxon accounting"
msgstr "英美式會計"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:255
msgid ""
"In addition to using |AVCO|, companies that use **Anglo-Saxon accounting** "
"also keep a holding account that tracks the amount to be paid to vendors. "
"Once a vendor delivers an order, **inventory value** increases based on the "
"vendor price of the products that have entered the stock. The holding "
"account (called **stock input**) is credited and only reconciled once the "
"vendor bill is received."
msgstr ""
"除了使用 |AVCO| 外，採用**盎格魯-撒克遜會計**的公司亦會保留一個暫記賬戶，以追"
"蹤應付予供應商的金額。供應商交付訂單後，**庫存價值**會按已入庫產品的供應商價"
"格增加。該暫記賬戶（稱為**庫存輸入**）會被貸記，並僅在收到供應商賬單後才進行"
"對賬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:260
