"的 :guilabel:`參考編號`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:337
msgid "Show accounting entry of 8 tables from the list."
msgstr "顯示清單中 8 個表格的會計分錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:341
msgid ""
"Click on the line for 8 tables. This accounting journal entry shows that "
"when the 8 tables were received, the `Stock Valuation` account increased by "
"`$80`. Conversely, the **Stock Input** account (set as `Stock Interim "
"(Received)` account by default) is credited `$80`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:345
msgid "Debit stock valuation and credit stock input 80 dollars."
msgstr "借記存貨估值及貸記存貨輸入 80 元。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:350
msgid "Accounts balanced at received vendor bill"
msgstr "收到供應商賬單時結平的科目"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:352
msgid ""
"In this example, a company starts with zero units of a product, table, in "
"stock. Then, 8 tables are received from the vendor. When the bill is "
"received from vendor for 8 tables:"
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，公司最初的產品（桌子）庫存為零件。之後，公司從供應商收到 8 張桌子"
"。當收到供應商開立的 8 張桌子賬單時："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:355
msgid ""
"Use `$80` in the **Stock Input** account to pay the bill. This cancels out "
"and the account now holds `$0`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:357
msgid "Debit **Stock Input** `$80` (to reconcile this account)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:358
msgid ""
"Credit **Accounts payable** `$80`. This account stores the amount the "
"company owes others, so accountants use the amount to write checks to "
"vendors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:364
msgid ""
"Once the vendor requests payment, navigate to the :menuselection:`Purchase "
"app --> Orders --> Purchase` and select the :abbr:`PO (Purchase Order)` for "
"8 tables. Inside the :abbr:`PO (Purchase Order)`, select :guilabel:`Create "
"Bill`."
msgstr ""
"當供應商要求付款時，請前往 :menuselection:`採購應用程式 --> 訂單 --> 採購`，"
"然後選擇訂購 8 張桌子的 :abbr:`PO (採購單)`。在該 :abbr:`PO (採購單)` 中，選"
"擇 :guilabel:`建立賬單`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:368
msgid ""
"Switch to the :guilabel:`Journal Items` tab to view how `$80` is transferred"
" from the holding account, `Stock Interim (Received)` to `Accounts Payable`."
" :guilabel:`Confirm` the bill to record the payment to the vendor."
msgstr ""
"切換至 :guilabel:`日記賬項目` 分頁，即可查看 `$80` 如何從暫記賬戶 `庫存暫記（"
"已收）` 轉撥至 `應付賬款`。:guilabel:`確認` 賬單，以記錄付予供應商的款項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:372
msgid "Show bill linked to the purchase order for 8 tables."
msgstr "顯示與 8 張桌子的採購訂單相關聯的賬單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:377
msgid "On product delivery"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:379
msgid ""
"In the :ref:`above example table <inventory/avg_price/price-table>`, when 10"
" products are delivered to a customer, the **Stock Input** account is "
"untouched because there are no new products coming in. To put it simply:"
msgstr ""
"在:ref:`上述範例表格 <inventory/avg_price/price-table>`中，當向客戶交付 10 件"
"產品時，由於沒有新產品入庫，**庫存輸入**科目不會受影響。簡單來說："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:383
msgid ""
"**Inventory valuation** is credited `$120`. Subtracting from inventory "
"valuation represents `$120` worth of products exiting the company."
msgstr "**存貨估值** 貸記 `$120`。從存貨估值中扣減，代表價值 `$120` 的產品離開公司。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:385
msgid "Debit **Accounts Receivable** to record revenue from the sale."
msgstr "借記 **應收賬款** 以記錄銷售收入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:387
msgid "Show journal items linked to sale order."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:393
msgid ""
"In the accounting journal entry invoicing a customer for 10 tables, the "
"accounts **Product Sales**, **Tax Received**, and **Accounts Receivable** "
"all pertain to the sale of the product. **Accounts Receivable** is the "
"account where the customer payment will be received."
msgstr ""
"在向客戶開立 10 張桌子發票的會計日記賬分錄中，**產品銷售**、**已收稅"
"款**及**應收賬款**這幾個科目均與產品銷售相關。**應收賬款**為收取客戶付款的科"
"目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:397
msgid ""
"Anglo-Saxon accounting recognizes the cost of goods sold (COGS) once the "
"sale is made. So, up until the product is sold, scrapped, or returned, costs"
" of keeping the product in stock are not accounted for. The **Expense** "
"account is debited `$120` to log the costs of storing 10 tables during this "
"period of time."
msgstr ""
"盎格魯-撒克遜會計制度（Anglo-Saxon accounting）會在完成銷售後才確認銷貨成本（"
"COGS）。因此，在產品售出、報廢或退回之前，保存產品庫存的成本不會入賬。系統會"
"將 **開支** 科目借記 `$120`，以記錄在此期間存放 10 張桌子的成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:403
msgid "On product return"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:405
msgid ""
"In the :ref:`above example table <inventory/avg_price/price-table>`, when "
"returning 1 product to a vendor purchased at `$10`, a company expects `$10` "
"in the **Accounts Payable** account from the vendor. However, **Stock "
"Input** account must be debited `$12` because the average cost is `$12` at "
"the time of the return. The missing `$2` is accounted for in the "
":guilabel:`Price Difference Account`, which is set up in the product's "
":guilabel:`Product Category`."
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`上方範例表格 <inventory/avg_price/price-table>` 中，當向供應商退回 "
"1 件以 `$10` 購買的產品時，公司預期在 **應付賬款** 帳戶中向供應商收回 `$10`。"
"然而，由於退貨時的平均成本為 `$12`，**存貨輸入** 帳戶必須借記 `$12`。差額 "
"`$2` 會計入 :guilabel:`價格差異帳戶`，該帳戶在產品的 :guilabel:`產品類別` 中"
"設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:412
msgid ""
"Behavior of *price difference accounts* varies from localization. In this "
"case, the account is intended to store differences between vendor price and "
"*automated* inventory valuation methods."
msgstr ""
"*價格差異科目* 的運作方式因本地化設定而異。在此情況下，該科目用於記錄供應商價"
"格與 *自動* 存貨估值方法之間的差額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:415
msgid "Summary:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:417
msgid ""
"Debit **Stock Input** account `$10` to move the table from stock to stock "
"input. This move is to indicate that the table is to be processed for an "
"outgoing shipment."
msgstr ""
"借記 **庫存進項** 賬戶 `$10`，將該張桌子由庫存移至庫存進項。此項移動表示該張"
"桌子即將處理出庫發貨。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:419
msgid ""
"Debit **Stock Input** an additional `$2` to account for the **Price "
"Difference**."
msgstr "將 **庫存輸入** 額外借記 `$2`，以計入 **價格差異**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:420
msgid ""
"Credit **Stock Valuation** `$12` because the item is leaving the stock."
msgstr "貸記 **庫存估值** `$12`，因為該項目正離開庫存。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:422
msgid "2 dollar difference expensed in Price Difference account."
msgstr "2 元的差額於價格差異賬戶中列為開支。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:426
msgid "Once the vendor's refund is received,"
msgstr "收到供應商的退款後，"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:428
msgid ""
"Credit **Stock Input** account `$10` to reconcile the price of the table."
msgstr "貸記 **存貨入庫** 賬戶 `$10`，以對賬該桌子的價格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:429
msgid ""
"Debit **Accounts Payable** `$10` to have the accountants collect and "
"register the payment in their journal."
msgstr "借記**應付賬款** `$10`，讓會計人員在其日記賬中收款並登記付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/avg_price_valuation.rst:432
msgid "Return to get 10 dollars back."
msgstr "退貨即可取回 10 元。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:5
msgid ""
"The **chart of accounts (COA)** is the list of all the accounts used to "
"record financial transactions in the general ledger of an organization. The "
"chart of accounts can be found under :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Chart of Accounts`."
msgstr ""
"**會計科目表（COA）** 是機構用來在總分類帳中記錄財務交易的所有科目清單。會計"
"科目表位於 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 會計科目表`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:9
msgid ""
"When browsing your chart of accounts, you can sort the accounts by "
":guilabel:`Code`, :guilabel:`Account Name`, or :guilabel:`Type`, but other "
"options are available in the drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
