#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:120
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`View` menu of an account, select the :guilabel:`Default "
"Taxes` to be applied when this account is chosen for a product sale or "
"purchase."
msgstr ""
"在會計科目的 :guilabel:`檢視` 選單中，選擇在銷售或採購產品並選用此會計科目時"
"要套用的 :guilabel:`預設稅項`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:126
msgid "Tags"
msgstr "標籤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:128
msgid ""
"Some accounting reports require **tags** to be set on the relevant accounts."
" To add a tag, under :guilabel:`View`, click the :guilabel:`Tags` field and "
"select an existing tag or :guilabel:`Create` a new one."
msgstr ""
"部分會計報表需要在相關賬戶設定 **標籤**。如要新增標籤，請在 :guilabel:`檢視` "
"下，點擊 :guilabel:`標籤` 欄位，然後選擇現有標籤或 :guilabel:`建立` 新標籤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:133
msgid "Account groups"
msgstr "會計科目群組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:135
msgid ""
"**Account groups** are useful to list multiple accounts as *sub-accounts* of"
" a bigger account and thus consolidate reports such as the **Trial "
"Balance**. By default, groups are handled automatically based on the code of"
" the group. For example, a new account `131200` is going to be part of the "
"group `131000`. You can attribute a specific group to an account in the "
":guilabel:`Group` field under :guilabel:`View`."
msgstr ""
"**科目群組** 可用於將多個會計科目列為較大科目的 *子科目*，從而合併報表（例如 "
"**試算表**）。預設情況下，系統會根據群組代碼自動處理群組。例如，新科目 "
"`131200` 會歸入群組 `131000`。你可以在 :guilabel:`群組` 欄位（位於 "
":guilabel:`檢視` 下方）中，為科目指定特定群組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:142
msgid "Create account groups manually"
msgstr "手動建立會計科目組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:145
msgid ""
"Regular users should not need to create account groups manually. The "
"following section is only intended for rare and advanced use cases."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:148
msgid ""
"To create a new account group, activate :ref:`developer mode <developer-"
"mode>` and head to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Account "
"Groups`. Here, create a new group and enter the :guilabel:`name, code "
"prefix, and company` to which that group account should be available. Note "
"that you must enter the same code prefix in both :guilabel:`From` and "
":guilabel:`to` fields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:153
msgid "Account groups creation."
msgstr "建立科目組別。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:156
msgid ""
"To display your **Trial Balance** report with your account groups, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Trial Balance`, then open the "
":guilabel:`Options` menu and select :guilabel:`Hierarchy and Subtotals`."
msgstr ""
"要按賬戶群組顯示 **試算表** 報表，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 報告 --> 試"
"算表`，然後開啟 :guilabel:`選項` 選單並選擇 :guilabel:`層級與小計`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:160
msgid "Account Groups in the Trial Balance in Odoo Accounting"
msgstr "Odoo 會計試算表中的會計科目組別"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:166
msgid ""
"Selecting a :guilabel:`Currency` restricts the journal items targeting the "
"account to the selected currency, and identifies the account for potential "
"unrealized gain/loss adjustments. If no currency is selected, journal items "
"in any currency can target the account."
msgstr ""
"選擇:guilabel:`貨幣`會限制指向該科目的日記賬項目僅可使用所選貨幣，並標記該科"
"目以進行潛在的未實現損益調整。若未選擇任何貨幣，則任何貨幣的日記賬項目均可指"
"向該科目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:171
msgid "Allow reconciliation"
msgstr "允許對賬"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:173
msgid ""
"To keep the reconciliation process simple, when reconciling a bank, cash, or"
" credit card transaction with an existing journal item, only journal items "
"that debit or credit accounts with the :guilabel:`Allow reconciliation` "
"option enabled are displayed as possible matches."
msgstr ""
"為簡化對賬流程，將銀行、現金或信用卡交易與現有日記賬項目進行對賬時，系統只會"
"顯示借記或貸記已啟用 :guilabel:`允許對賬` 選項的會計科目的日記賬項目，作為可"
"配對的項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:177
msgid ""
"To enable this option on an account, tick the :guilabel:`Allow "
"Reconciliation` checkbox in the account's settings, and :guilabel:`Save`; or"
" enable the button from the chart of accounts view."
msgstr ""
"要在賬戶上啟用此選項，請在賬戶設定中勾選 :guilabel:`允許核銷` 核取方塊，然後"
"點擊 :guilabel:`儲存`；或者在會計科目表檢視中啟用該按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:183
msgid "Shared accounts"
msgstr "共用賬戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:185
msgid ""
"The **Shared Accounts** feature allows the creation of a single account for "
"a specific purpose and sharing it between multiple companies. It is "
"especially useful for multi-company environments where a similar account "
"might be used across different companies."
msgstr ""
"**共用帳戶**功能可讓您為特定目的建立單一帳戶，並在多間公司之間共用。這在多公"
"司環境中尤其有用，因為不同公司之間可能會使用類似的帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:190
msgid "Deprecated"
msgstr "已棄用"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts.rst:192
msgid ""
"It is not possible to delete an account once a transaction has been recorded"
" on it. You can make them unusable by using the **Deprecated** feature: "
"check the :guilabel:`Deprecated` box in the account's settings, and "
":guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"一旦某個會計科目已記錄交易，便無法將其刪除。您可使用 **已停用** 功能使其無法"
"再使用：在該科目的設定中剔選:guilabel:`已停用`方格，然後按:guilabel:`儲存`。"

