#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:7
msgid "Accounting cheat sheet"
msgstr "會計速查表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:13
msgid ""
"The **Balance Sheet** is a snapshot of the company's finances at a specific "
"date (as opposed to the Profit and Loss, which is an analysis over a "
"period)."
msgstr ""
"**資產負債表** 是公司於特定日期的財務狀況快照（相對於損益表，後者為一段期間內"
"的財務分析）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Assets** represent the company's wealth and the goods it owns. Fixed "
"assets include buildings and offices, while current assets include bank "
"accounts and cash. The money owed by a client is an asset. An employee is "
"not an asset."
msgstr ""
"**資產**代表公司的財富及其擁有的財產。固定資產包括建築物及辦公室，而流動資產"
"則包括銀行帳戶及現金。客戶所欠的款項屬於資產，而員工則不屬於資產。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Liabilities** are obligations from past events that the company will have "
"to pay in the future (utility bills, debts, unpaid suppliers). Liabilities "
"could also be defined as a source of financing which is provided to the "
"company, also called *leverage*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:30
msgid ""
"**Equity** is the amount of the funds contributed by the owners of the "
"company (founders or shareholders) plus previously retained earnings (or "
"losses). Each year, net profits (or losses) may be reported as retained "
"earnings or distributed to the shareholders (as a dividend)."
msgstr ""
"**權益**是指公司擁有人（創辦人或股東）投入的資金金額，加上過往的保留盈餘（或"
"虧損）。每年，淨利潤（或虧損）可列為保留盈餘，或（作為股息）分派給股東。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:34
msgid ""
"What is owned (an asset) has been financed through debts to reimburse "
"(liabilities) or equity (profits, capital)."
msgstr "所擁有的（資產）是透過需要償還的債務（負債）或權益（利潤、資本）來融資的。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:37
msgid "A difference is made between **assets** and **expenses**:"
msgstr "**資產** 與 **開支** 有所區分："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:38
msgid ""
"An **asset** is a resource with economic value that an individual, "
"corporation, or country owns or controls with the expectation that it will "
"provide a future benefit. Assets are reported on a company's balance sheet. "
"They are bought or created to increase a firm's value or benefit its "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"**資產** 是指由個人、企業或國家擁有或控制、具有經濟價值且預期可帶來未來效益的"
"資源。資產會在公司的資產負債表上列報，購買或建立資產的目的是提升企業價值或有"
"助於業務營運。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:42
msgid ""
"An **expense** is the costs of operations a company bears to generate "
"revenues."
msgstr "**開支** 是指企業為產生收入而承擔的營運成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:48
msgid ""
"The **profit and loss** (P&L) report shows the company's performance over a "
"specific period of time, usually a quarter or a fiscal year."
msgstr ""
"**損益**（P&L）報表顯示公司在特定期間（通常為一個季度或一個會計年度）的業績表"
"現。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:53
msgid ""
"The **revenue** refers to the money earned by the company by selling goods "
"and/or services."
msgstr "**收入** 是指公司透過銷售貨品及／或服務所賺取的款項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:57
msgid ""
"The **cost of goods sold** (COGS, or also known as \"Cost of Sale\") refers "
"to the sale of goods' costs (e.g., the cost of the materials and labor used "
"to create the goods)."
msgstr ""
"**銷貨成本**（COGS，又稱「銷售成本」）是指銷售貨品的成本（例如製造貨品所使用"
"的材料及人工成本）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/cheat_sheet.rst:62
msgid ""
