"Stock "
"<../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/reporting/stock>` "
"report."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`期末庫存`：完成 :ref:`結帳分錄 <accounting/inventory-valuation/"
"closing-entry>` 後的未來會計存貨價值。點擊 :guilabel:`期末庫存` 以查閱 "
":doc:`存貨庫存 <../../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"reporting/stock>` 報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:220
msgid ""
