":guilabel:`Billed Not Received`, and :guilabel:`Invoiced Not Delivered`."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 覆核`，然後選擇相關報表：:guilabel:`待收帳"
"單`、:guilabel:`待開發票`、:guilabel:`已開帳單但未收貨` 及 :guilabel:`已開發"
"票但未交貨`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:257
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`As of` to change the date, if needed."
msgstr "如有需要，點擊 :icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`截至` 以更改日期。"

