msgid ""
"Select the relevant lines and click :guilabel:`Create Accrual Entries`."
msgstr "選擇相關資料行，然後點擊 :guilabel:`建立應計分錄`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:259
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Accrued Revenue/Expense Entry` popup, set the "
":guilabel:`Accrual Account` and review the :guilabel:`Reversal Date`, if "
"needed. Then, click :guilabel:`Create Entry`."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`應計收益/開支記項`彈出視窗中，設定:guilabel:`應計賬戶`，如有需要"
"，請檢視:guilabel:`迴轉日期`。然後，點擊:guilabel:`建立記項`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:263
msgid ""
"Both valuation methods (periodic and perpetual) use accrual entries to "
"update revenues and expenses. However, when using the Anglo-Saxon accounting"
" standard in combination with the :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)` "
"inventory valuation, these entries also take value from the buffer "
":guilabel:`Variation account` and allocate it to the appropriate accounts, "
"such as Bill to Receive or |GRNI|."
msgstr ""
"兩種估值方法（定期及永續）均使用應計分錄來更新收入及開支。然而，當配合 "
":guilabel:`永續（開具發票時）` 存貨估值方法使用盎格魯-撒克遜會計準則時，這些"
"分錄亦會從緩衝的 :guilabel:`變動賬戶` 提取價值，並分配至適當的賬戶，例如「待"
"收賬單」或 |GRNI|。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:272
msgid "Upgrade process for Anglo-Saxon Perpetual"
msgstr "英美式永續盤存的升級流程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:275
msgid ""
"This process is only mandatory if upgrading from Odoo 19 to Odoo 20. It is "
"handled automatically when upgrading from Odoo 18 to Odoo 20."
msgstr ""
"此程序僅在從 Odoo 19 升級至 Odoo 20 時為必需步驟。從 Odoo 18 升級至 Odoo 20 "
"時，系統會自動處理此程序。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:278
msgid ""
"In Odoo 20, the stock input/output accounts are no longer used. Any non-zero"
" balances in stock interim accounts must be transferred to the :ref:`stock "
"valuation account <accounting/inventory-valuation/valuation-account>` via "
"journal entry to maintain accurate inventory values after migration. This "
"rebalancing can be performed :ref:`before <accounting/inventory-"
"valuation/upgrade-process-server-action>` or :ref:`after "
"<accounting/inventory-valuation/upgrade-process-manual>` upgrading to Odoo "
"20."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 20 中，不再使用存貨輸入／輸出科目。存貨暫記科目中的任何非零餘額，必須"
"透過日記賬分錄轉撥至 :ref:`存貨估值科目 <accounting/inventory-valuation/"
"valuation-account>`，以在遷移後維持準確的庫存價值。此重新平衡操作可在升級至 "
"Odoo 20 :ref:`之前 <accounting/inventory-valuation/upgrade-process-server-"
"action>` 或 :ref:`之後 <accounting/inventory-valuation/upgrade-process-"
"manual>` 執行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:285
msgid ""
"Before upgrading, review received purchase or sales orders that are not yet "
"linked to vendor bills or invoices, and post any existing draft "
"bills/invoices to reduce the open balance."
msgstr ""
"升級前，請檢查尚未連結至供應商賬單或發票的已收到採購訂單或銷售訂單，並過賬任"
"何現有的草稿賬單/發票，以減少未清餘額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/inventory_valuation.rst:289
msgid ""
"It is recommended to implement the change **after** upgrading to Odoo 20, "
"because a server action identifies the open balance in the :guilabel:`Stock "
"Interim` accounts and automatically applies the change."
msgstr ""
"建議在升級至 Odoo 20 **之後**才實施此變更，因為伺服器動作會識別 :guilabel:`庫"
"存暫記` 賬戶中的未結餘額並自動套用變更。"

