"the :guilabel:`Interval` from :guilabel:`Manually` to :guilabel:`Daily`, "
":guilabel:`Weekly`, or :guilabel:`Monthly`. You can also select the web "
"service from which you want to retrieve the latest currency rates by "
"clicking the :guilabel:`Service` field."
msgstr ""
"匯率可以定期自動更新。為此，請將 :guilabel:`間隔` 從 :guilabel:`手動` 變更為 "
":guilabel:`每日`、:guilabel:`每週` 或 :guilabel:`每月`。您亦可以點擊 "
":guilabel:`服務` 欄位，選擇用於擷取最新貨幣匯率的網絡服務。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/get_started/multi_currency.rst:71
msgid "Exchange difference entries"
msgstr "匯兌差額分錄"

