#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/payments/sepa_payments.rst:281
msgid ""
"By default, the :ref:`SEPA-compliant XML files "
"<accounting/sepa_payments/XML>` generated by Odoo use the "
"**PAIN.001.001.09** format. If your workflows require a different format, "
"refer to the :ref:`PAIN <accounting/sepa_payments/pain>` section above."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，Odoo 產生的 :ref:`符合 SEPA 標準的 XML 檔案 <accounting/"
"sepa_payments/XML>` 使用 **PAIN.001.001.09** 格式。如果您的工作流程需要使用其"
