#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:154
msgid "To create a new financial budget, follow these steps:"
msgstr "如要建立新的財務預算，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:156
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Profit and Loss` to open "
"the :ref:`Profit and Loss <accounting/reporting/profit-and-loss>` report."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 報告 --> 損益表`，以開啟 :ref:`損益表 "
"<accounting/reporting/profit-and-loss>` 報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:158
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`(calendar)` button to use the date "
"selector and choose a period."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :icon:`fa-calendar` :guilabel:`(日曆)` 按鈕，即可使用日期選擇器並選擇期"
"間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:160
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-bar-chart` :guilabel:`Budget` button and name the "
"budget. A new column labeled with the budget name will appear next to the "
":guilabel:`Balance` column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:162
msgid "Assign amounts to each account requiring analysis."
msgstr "將金額分配至每個需要進行分析的賬戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:163
msgid ""
"A new :guilabel:`%` column will appear to the right of the new budget "
"column, indicating the current status."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:166
msgid ""
"Different financial budgets can be created using these steps for comparison "
"purposes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/budget.rst:169
msgid ""
"The date selector enables the division of periods and navigation between "
"periods, automatically updating the amounts accordingly."
msgstr "日期選擇器可劃分期間並在不同期間之間切換，同時會相應自動更新金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:3
msgid "Custom reports"
msgstr "自訂報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo comes with a powerful and easy-to-use reporting framework. The engine "
"allows you to create new reports, such as **tax reports**, or **balance "
"sheets** and **income statements** with **specific groupings** and "
"**layouts**."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 內置強大且易於使用的報表架構。該引擎讓你能夠建立新報表，例如 **稅務報"
"表**，或包含 **特定分組** 及 **版面配置** 的 **資產負債表** 及 **損益表**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:10
msgid ""
"Activate the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>` to access the accounting"
" report creation interface."
msgstr "啟用 :ref:`開發人員模式 <developer-mode>` 以存取會計報表建立介面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:13
msgid ""
"To create a new report, open the :guilabel:`Accounting` app and navigate to "
":menuselection:`Configuration --> Accounting Reports`. From here, you can "
"either create a :ref:`root report <customize-reports/root>` or a "
":ref:`variant <customize-reports/variants>`."
msgstr ""
"要建立新報表，請開啟 :guilabel:`會計` 應用程式，然後前往 :menuselection:`配"
"置 --> 會計報表`。在這裡，你可以建立 :ref:`根報表 <customize-reports/root>` "
"或 :ref:`變體 <customize-reports/variants>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:20
msgid "Root reports"
msgstr "根報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:22
msgid ""
"Root reports can be regarded as generic, neutral accounting reports. They "
"serve as models on which local accounting versions are built. If a report "
"has no root report, it is considered to be a root report itself."
msgstr ""
"根報表可視為通用、中立的會計報表，作為建構各地本地化會計版本的範本。如某報表"
"沒有根報表，其本身即被視為根報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:27
msgid ""
"A tax report for Belgium and the US would both use the same generic version "
"as a base and adapt it for their domestic regulations."
msgstr ""
"比利時與美國的稅務報表均會以相同的通用版本為基礎，並根據各自的本地法規進行調"
"整。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:30
msgid ""
"When creating a new root report, you need to create a **menu item** for it. "
"To do so, open the report and, on that same report, click the :icon:`fa-cog`"
" :guilabel:`(Actions)` icon, then select :guilabel:`Create Menu Item`. "
"Refresh the page; the report is now available under "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting`."
msgstr ""
"建立新的根報表時，你需要為它建立一個 **選單項目**。要執行此操作，請開啟該報表"
"，在該報表頁面上點擊 :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`（動作）` 圖示，然後選擇 "
":guilabel:`建立選單項目`。重新整理頁面後，該報表便會顯示在 :menuselection:`會"
"計 --> 報告` 下。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:36
msgid ""
"Cases that require creating a new root report are rare, such as when a "
"country's tax authorities require a new and specific type of report."
msgstr ""
"需要建立新根報表的情況相當罕見，例如當某國家的稅務機構要求提交一種新的特定類"
"型報表時。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:42
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:138
msgid "Variants"
msgstr "變體"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:44
msgid ""
"Variants are country-specific versions of root reports and, therefore, "
"always refer to a root report. To create a variant, select a generic (root) "
"report in the :guilabel:`Root Report` field when creating a new report."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:48
msgid ""
"When a root report is opened from one of the accounting app's main menus, "
"all its variants are displayed in the variant selector in the top right "
"corner of the view."
msgstr ""
"從「會計」應用程式的主選單開啟根報表時，其所有變體都會顯示於檢視畫面右上角的"
"變體選擇器中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:52
msgid ""
"In the following image, :guilabel:`VAT Report (BE)` is the variant of the "
"root :guilabel:`Generic Tax report`."
msgstr ""
"在下圖中，:guilabel:`增值稅報表 (BE)` 是根報表 :guilabel:`通用稅務報表` 的變"
"體。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:58
msgid "Report lines"
msgstr "報表行"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:60
msgid ""
"After having created a report (either root or variant), you need to fill it "
"with report lines. You can either create a new one by clicking on "
":guilabel:`Add a line`, or modify an existing report line by clicking on it."
" All report lines *require* a :guilabel:`Name`, and can have an optional "
"additional :guilabel:`Code` (of your choice) if you wish to use their value "
"in formulas."
msgstr ""
"建立報表（根報表或變體報表）後，您需要為其填寫報表明細行。您可點擊 "
":guilabel:`新增明細行` 建立新的明細行，或點擊現有的報表明細行以進行修改。所有"
"報表明細行都 *必須* 填寫 :guilabel:`名稱`，如果希望在公式中使用其數值，亦可視"
"乎需要額外填寫自訂的 :guilabel:`代碼`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:65
msgid "Engine lines options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:71
msgid "Expressions"
msgstr "運算式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:73
msgid ""
"Each report line can contain one or multiple **expressions**. Expressions "
"can be seen as **sub-variables** needed by a report line. To create an "
"expression, click on :guilabel:`Add a line` *within* a report line."
msgstr ""
"每個報表行可包含一個或多個 **表達式**。表達式可視為報表行所需的 **子變數**。"
"要建立表達式，請在報表行 *內* 點擊 :guilabel:`新增資料行`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:77
msgid ""
"When creating an expression, you must attribute a :guilabel:`Label` used to "
"refer to that expression. Therefore, it has to be **unique** among the "
"expressions of each line. Both a :guilabel:`Computation Engine` and a "
":guilabel:`Formula` must also be indicated. The **engine** defines how your "
"**formula(s)** and **subformula(s)** are interpreted. It is possible to mix "
"expressions using different computation engines under the same line if you "
"need to."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:84
msgid "Depending on the engine, :guilabel:`subformulas` may also be required."
msgstr "視乎所使用的計算引擎而定，亦可能需要填寫 :guilabel:`子公式`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:89
msgid "'Odoo Domain' engine"
msgstr "「Odoo Domain」引擎"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:91
msgid ""
"With this engine, a formula is interpreted as an :ref:`Odoo domain "
"<reference/orm/domains>` targeting `account.move.line` objects."
msgstr ""
"使用此引擎時，公式會被解讀為針對 `account.move.line` 物件的 :ref:`Odoo 篩選條"
"件 <reference/orm/domains>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:94
msgid ""
"The subformula allows you to define how the move lines matching the domain "
"are used to compute the value of the expression:"
msgstr "子公式讓你可定義如何使用符合條件的會計分錄明細來計算表達式的值："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:97
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:267
msgid "`sum`"
msgstr "`sum`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:98
msgid "The result is the sum of all the balances of the matched move lines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:100
msgid "`sum_if_pos`"
msgstr "`sum_if_pos`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:101
msgid ""
"The result is the sum of all the balances of the matched move lines if this "
"amount is positive. Otherwise, it is `0`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:104
msgid "`sum_if_neg`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:105
msgid ""
"The result is the sum of all the balances of the matched move lines if this "
"amount is negative. Otherwise, it is `0`."
msgstr "如果所有已配對分錄明細行的餘額總和為負數，則結果為該總和；否則為 `0`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:108
msgid ""
"You can also put a `-` sign at the beginning of the subformula to "
"**reverse** the sign of the result."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:111
msgid "Expression line within a line report"
msgstr "資料行報表內的運算式資料行"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:117
msgid "'Tax Tags' engine"
msgstr "「稅項標籤」引擎"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:119
msgid ""
"A formula made for this engine consists of a name used to match tax tags. If"
" such tags do not exist when creating the expression, they will be created."
msgstr ""
"為此引擎建立的公式由用於配對稅務標籤的名稱組成。建立算式時，如果該等標籤不存"
"在，系統會自動建立。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:122
msgid ""
"When evaluating the expression, the expression computation can roughly be "
"expressed as: **(amount of the move lines with** `+` **tag)** `-` **(amount "
"of the move lines with** `-` **tag)**."
msgstr ""
"計算運算式時，其運算式計算可大致表示為：**（帶有** `+` **標籤的分錄明細行金額"
"）** `-` **（帶有** `-` **標籤的分錄明細行金額）**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:126
msgid ""
"If the formula is `tag_name`, the engine matches tax tags `+tag_name` and "
"`-tag_name`, creating them if necessary. To exemplify further: two tags are "
"matched by the formula. If the formula is `A`, it will require (and create, "
"if needed) tags `+A` and `-A`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:133
msgid "'Aggregate Other Formulas' engine"
msgstr "「匯總其他公式」引擎"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:135
msgid ""
"Use this engine when you need to perform arithmetic operations on the "
"amounts obtained for other expressions. Formulas here are composed of "
"references to expressions separated by one of the four basic arithmetic "
"operators (addition `+`, subtraction `-`, division `/`, and multiplication "
"`*`). To refer to an expression, type in its report line's **code** followed"
" by a period `.` and the expression's **label** (ex. **code.label**)."
msgstr ""
"當您需要對其他表達式所得的金額執行算術運算時，請使用此引擎。此處的公式由表達"
"式參照組成，並以四種基本算術運算符之一（加 `+`、減 `-`、除 `/` 及乘 `*`）分隔"
"。如要參照表達式，請輸入其報表行的**代碼**，後面加上句號 `.` 及該表達式的**標"
"籤**（例如：**code.label**）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:141
msgid "**Subformulas** can be one of the following:"
msgstr "**子公式**可為以下其中一項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:143
msgid "`if_above(CUR(amount))`"
msgstr "`if_above(CUR(amount))`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:144
msgid ""
"The value of the arithmetic expression will be returned only if it is "
"greater than the provided bound. Otherwise, the result will be `0`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:147
msgid "`if_below(CUR(amount))`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:148
msgid ""
"The value of the arithmetic expression will be returned only if it is lower "
"than the provided bound. Otherwise, the result will be `0`."
msgstr "只有在算術表達式的值低於所提供的上限時，才會傳回該值。否則，結果將為 `0`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:151
msgid "`if_between(CUR1(amount1), CUR2(amount2))`"
msgstr "`if_between(CUR1(amount1), CUR2(amount2))`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:152
msgid ""
"The value of the arithmetic expression will be returned only if it is "
"strictly between the provided bounds. Otherwise, it will be brought back to "
"the closest bound."
msgstr ""
"只有當算術運算式的值嚴格介於所提供的上下限之間時，才會傳回該值；否則，系統會"
"將其調整回最接近的邊界值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:155
msgid "`if_other_expr_above(LINE_CODE.EXPRESSION_LABEL, CUR(amount))`"
msgstr "`if_other_expr_above(LINE_CODE.EXPRESSION_LABEL, CUR(amount))`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:156
msgid ""
"The value of the arithmetic expression will be returned only if the value of"
" the expression denoted by the provided line code and expression label is "
"greater than the provided bound. Otherwise, the result will be `0`."
msgstr ""
"只有當所提供的行代碼及表達式標籤所表示的表達式數值大於所提供的界限值時，系統"
"才會傳回該算術表達式的數值；否則，結果將為 `0`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:160
msgid "`if_other_expr_below(LINE_CODE.EXPRESSION_LABEL, CUR(amount))`"
msgstr "`if_other_expr_below(LINE_CODE.EXPRESSION_LABEL, CUR(amount))`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:161
msgid ""
"The value of the arithmetic expression will be returned only if the value of"
" the expression denoted by the provided line code and expression label is "
"lower than the provided bound. Otherwise, the result will be `0`."
msgstr ""
"只有當由所提供的行代碼及運算式標籤表示的運算式數值低於所提供的界限時，系統才"
"會傳回該算術運算式的數值。否則，結果將為 `0`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:165
msgid ""
"`CUR` is the currency code in capital letters, and `amount` is the amount of"
" the bound expressed in that currency."
msgstr "`CUR` 為大寫貨幣代碼，而 `amount` 為以該貨幣表示的界限金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:168
msgid "`cross_report(xml_id | report_id[, force_date_scope])`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:169
msgid ""
"Match an expression from another report targeted by the xml_id or the report"
" ID itself. If `force_date_scope` is added, the :guilabel:`Date Scope` "
"defined on the expression will be used to compute all the expressions used "
"by the formula."
msgstr ""
"比對由 xml_id 或報告 ID 本身指定的另一份報告中的表達式。如果加入了 "
"`force_date_scope`，則會使用該表達式上定義的 :guilabel:`日期範圍` 來計算公式"
"使用的所有表達式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:176
msgid "'Prefix of Account Codes' engine"
msgstr "「科目代碼前綴」引擎"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:178
msgid ""
"This engine is used to match amounts made on accounts using the prefixes of "
"these accounts' codes as variables in an arithmetic expression."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`21`"
msgstr "`21`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "Arithmetic expressions can also be a single prefix, such as here."
msgstr "算術運算式也可以是單一前綴，例如此處所示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`21 + 10 - 5`"
msgstr "`21 + 10 - 5`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"This formula adds the balances of the move lines made on accounts whose "
"codes start with `21` and `10`, and subtracts the balance of the ones on "
"accounts with the prefix `5`."
msgstr ""
"此公式會將代碼以 `21` 和 `10` 開頭的科目上的分錄行餘額相加，並減去前綴為 `5` "
"的科目上的分錄行餘額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:190
msgid "It is also possible to ignore a selection of sub-prefixes."
msgstr "亦可忽略所選的子前綴。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`21 + 10\\\\(101, 102) - 5\\\\(57)`"
msgstr "`21 + 10\\\\(101, 102) - 5\\\\(57)`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"This formula works the same way as the previous example but ignores the "
"prefixes `101`, `102`, and `57`."
msgstr "此公式的運作方式與上一個範例相同，但會忽略前綴 `101`、`102` 及 `57`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:197
msgid ""
"You can apply 'sub-filtering' on **credits and debits** using the `C` and "
"`D` suffixes. In this case, an account will only be considered if its prefix"
" matches, *and* if the total balance of the move lines made on this account "
"is **credit/debit**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:202
msgid ""
"Account `210001` has a balance of -42 and account `210002` has a balance of "
"25. The formula `21D` only matches the account `210002`, and hence returns "
"25. `210001` is not matched, as its balance is *credit*."
msgstr ""
"會計科目 `210001` 的餘額為 -42，而會計科目 `210002` 的餘額為 25。公式 `21D` "
"僅配對會計科目 `210002`，因此傳回 25。由於 `210001` 的餘額為 *貸方*，因此不會"
"配對。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:206
msgid "Prefix exclusions can be mixed with the `C` and `D` suffixes."
msgstr "前綴排除規則可與 `C` 及 `D` 後綴混合使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`21D + 10\\\\(101, 102)C - 5\\\\(57)`"
msgstr "`21D + 10\\\\(101, 102)C - 5\\\\(57)`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"This formula adds the balances of the move lines made on accounts whose code"
" starts with `21` *if* it is debit (`D`) and `10` *if* it is credit (`C`), "
"but ignores prefixes `101`, `102`, and subtracts the balance of the ones on "
"accounts with the prefix `5`, ignoring the prefix `57`."
msgstr ""
"此公式會將代碼以 `21` 開首的科目（*若*為借方 `D`）及以 `10` 開首的科目"
"（*若*為貸方 `C`）的憑證行餘額相加，但會忽略前綴 `101` 和 `102`，然後減去前綴"
"為 `5` 的科目憑證行餘額（忽略前綴 `57`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:214
msgid ""
"To match the letter `C` or `D` in a prefix and not use it as a suffix, use "
"an empty exclusion `()`."
msgstr "如要配對前綴中的字母 `C` 或 `D`，而不將其用作後綴，請使用空白排除項 `()`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`21D\\\\()`"
msgstr "`21D\\\\()`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"This formula matches accounts whose code starts with `21D`, regardless of "
"their balance sign."
msgstr "此公式會配對編碼以 `21D` 開頭的會計科目，不論其結餘正負號為何。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:220
msgid ""
"In addition to using code prefixes to include accounts, you can also match "
"them with **account tags**. This is especially useful, for example, if your "
"country lacks a standardized chart of accounts, where the same prefix might "
"be used for different purposes across companies."
msgstr ""
"除了使用編碼前綴來納入帳戶之外，你亦可使用 **帳戶標籤** 進行配對。例如，若你"
"所在的國家/地區缺乏標準化的會計科目表，導致不同公司可能會將相同前綴用於不同用"
"途，此方法就特別實用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`tag(25)`"
msgstr "`tag(25)`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"This formula matches accounts whose associated tags contain the one with id "
"*25*."
msgstr "此公式會配對關聯標籤中包含 ID 為 *25* 的標籤的賬戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:228
msgid ""
"If the tag you reference is defined in a data file, an xmlid can be used "
"instead of the id."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`tag(my_module.my_tag)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"This formula matches accounts whose associated tags include the tag denoted "
"by *my_module.my_tag*."
msgstr "此公式會配對其關聯標籤包含 *my_module.my_tag* 所指標籤的科目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:235
msgid ""
"You can also use arithmetic expressions with tags, possibly combining them "
"with prefix selections."
msgstr "您亦可以將標籤用於算術運算式，並可視需要配合前綴選擇使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`tag(my_module.my_tag) + tag(42) + 10`"
msgstr "`tag(my_module.my_tag) + tag(42) + 10`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"The balances of accounts tagged as *my_module.my_tag* will be summed with "
"those of accounts linked to the tag with ID *42* and accounts with the code "
"prefix `10`"
msgstr ""
"標記為 *my_module.my_tag* 的會計科目餘額，將會與連結至 ID 為 *42* 標籤的會計"
"科目，以及代碼前綴為 `10` 的會計科目餘額加總"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:242
msgid "`C` and `D` suffixes can be used in the same way with tags."
msgstr "`C` 及 `D` 後綴亦可以相同方式用於標籤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`tag(my_module.my_tag)C`"
msgstr "`tag(my_module.my_tag)C`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"This formula matches accounts with the tag *my_module.my_tag* and a credit "
"balance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:248
msgid "Prefix exclusion also works with tags."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`tag(my_module.my_tag)\\\\(10)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid ""
"This formula matches accounts with the tag *my_module.my_tag* and a code not"
" starting with `10`."
msgstr "此公式會配對帶有標籤 *my_module.my_tag* 且編號並非以 `10` 開頭的賬戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:258
msgid "'External Value' engine"
msgstr "「外部數值」引擎"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:260
msgid ""
"The 'external value' engine is used to refer to **manual** and **carryover "
"values**. Those values are not stored using `account.move.line`, but with "
"`account.report.external.value`. Each of these objects directly points to "
"the expression it impacts, so very little needs to be done about their "
"selection here."
msgstr ""
"「外部數值」引擎用於指代**手動數值**及**結轉數值**。這些數值並非透過 "
"`account.move.line` 儲存，而是透過 `account.report.external.value` 儲存。每個"
"物件都會直接指向其影響的表達式，因此在此處幾乎無需對其選擇進行任何處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:265
msgid "**Formulas** can be one of the following:"
msgstr "**公式** 可以是以下其中一項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:268
msgid ""
"If the result must be the sum of all the external values in the period."
msgstr "如果結果必須為該期間所有外部數值的總和。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:270
msgid "`most_recent`"
msgstr "`most_recent`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:271
msgid ""
"If the result must be the value of the latest external value in the period."
msgstr "如果結果必須為該期間內最新外部數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:273
msgid "In addition, **subformulas** can be used in two ways:"
msgstr "此外，**子公式**可透過兩種方式使用："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:275
msgid "`rounding=X`"
msgstr "`rounding=X`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:276
msgid ""
"Replacing `X` with a number instructs to round the amount to X decimals."
msgstr "將 `X` 替換為數字，即代表指示系統將金額四捨五入至小數點後 X 位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:278
msgid "`editable`"
msgstr "`editable`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:279
msgid ""
"Indicates this expression can be edited manually, triggering the display of "
"an icon in the report, allowing the user to perform this action."
msgstr "表示此表達式可以手動編輯，並會在報表中顯示圖示，讓用戶執行此操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:283
msgid ""
"Manual values are created at the `date_to` currently selected in the report."
msgstr "手動數值會在報表目前選取的 `date_to` 建立。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:285
msgid "Both subformulas can be mixed by separating them with a `;`."
msgstr "兩個子公式可以 `;` 分隔並混合使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "`editable;rounding=2`"
msgstr "`editable;rounding=2`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:0
msgid "is a correct subformula mixing both behaviors."
msgstr "是結合兩種行為的正確子公式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:294
msgid "'Custom Python Function' engine"
msgstr "「自訂 Python 函數」引擎"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:296
msgid ""
"This engine is a means for developers to introduce custom computation of "
"expressions on a case-by-case basis. The formula is the name of a **python "
"function** to call, and the subformula is a **key** to fetch in the "
"**dictionary** returned by this function. Use it only if you are making a "
"custom module of your own."
msgstr ""
"此引擎讓開發人員可按個別情況引入自訂的表達式運算。公式為要呼叫的 **Python 函"
"式** 名稱，而子公式則為從該函式傳回的 **字典** 中擷取的 **鍵**。僅當你製作自"
"己的自訂模組時才應使用此功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:304
msgid "Date filtering"
msgstr "日期篩選"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:306
msgid ""
"By default, the values computed for each expression will restrict the move "
"lines they consider to the ones strictly within the interval selected on the"
" report. To change that behavior, modify the :guilabel:`Date Scope` field of"
" the expression."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:311
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:454
msgid "Columns"
msgstr "直欄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:313
msgid ""
"Reports can have an **indefinite number** of columns to display. Each column"
" gets its values from the **expressions** declared on the **lines**. The "
"field :guilabel:`expression_label` of the column gives the label of the "
"expressions whose value is displayed. If a line has no **expression** in "
"that field, then nothing is displayed for it in this column. If multiple "
"columns are required, you must use different **expression** labels."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:319
msgid "Columns of report."
msgstr "報表欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:322
msgid ""
"When using the **period comparison** feature found under the "
":guilabel:`Options` tab of an accounting report, all columns are repeated in"
" and for each period."
msgstr ""
"使用會計報表:guilabel:`選項`分頁中的**期間比較**功能時，每個期間都會重複顯示"
"所有欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:328
msgid "Line grouping"
msgstr "行項目分組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:330
msgid ""
"Non-standard grouping is possible by adding or using existing fields on the "
"*Journal Item* model, provided that the fields are related and non-stored."
msgstr ""
"只要欄位屬關聯且非儲存欄位，即可透過在 *日記賬項目* 模型上新增或使用現有欄位"
"，實現非標準分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:334
msgid ""
"Grouping lines requires the report to have explicit report lines that can be"
" edited. The deferred reports, for example, do not support grouping lines as"
" they use dynamic lines that are generated."
msgstr ""
"要將報表行分組，報表必須包含可編輯的明確報表行。例如，遞延報表使用動態產生的"
"報表行，因此不支援將報表行分組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:338
msgid "Create a new field on journal item"
msgstr "在日記賬項目上建立新欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:340
msgid ""
"To create a non-stored, related field in the *Journal Item* model, first go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Journal Items`, and click the :icon:`fa-"
"bug` :guilabel:`(bug)` icon, then click :guilabel:`Fields`. Click "
":guilabel:`New` to create a new field, and complete the following fields:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:345
msgid ":guilabel:`Field Name`: a technical name for the field"
msgstr ":guilabel:`欄位名稱`：欄位的技術名稱"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:346
msgid ":guilabel:`Field Label`: the label to be displayed for the field"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:347
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Field Type`: the type of field that this related field should "
"point to"
msgstr ":guilabel:`欄位類型`：此關聯欄位應指向的欄位類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:348
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Stored`: Leave this field unchecked as only non-stored fields can"
" be used to group lines."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`已儲存`：請勿勾選此欄位，因為只有未儲存的欄位才可用於為明細行分組"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:350
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Related Model`: If the field type is :guilabel:`one2many`, "
":guilabel:`many2many`, or :guilabel:`many2one`, select the model of the "
"original field to group by."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`相關模型`：如欄位類型為 "
":guilabel:`one2many`、:guilabel:`many2many` 或 :guilabel:`many2one`，請選擇要"
"作為分組依據的原始欄位模型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:352
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Related Field Definition`: the technical path to the field you "
"want to group by"
msgstr ":guilabel:`關聯欄位定義`：用作分組依據的欄位技術路徑"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:355
msgid ""
"To group by the sales team of the commercial partner, set the related field "
"definition to `move_id.team_id`."
msgstr "要按商業夥伴的銷售團隊分組，請將關聯欄位定義設為 `move_id.team_id`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:359
msgid "Group lines"
msgstr "分組明細行"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:361
msgid ""
"To group lines, go to the :ref:`Lines <customize-reports/lines>` tab of the "
"desired report, click on the line you want to group, and edit the "
":guilabel:`Group by` field. Enter the technical name (:guilabel:`Field "
"Name`) of the field to use as the grouping key."
msgstr ""
"要將資料行分組，請前往目標報表的 :ref:`資料行 <customize-reports/lines>` 分頁"
"，按一下要分組的資料行，然後編輯 :guilabel:`分組依據` 欄位。輸入用作分組鍵值"
"的欄位技術名稱（:guilabel:`欄位名稱`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:366
msgid ""
"To find a list of all the model's fields and their technical names, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Journal Items`, and click the :icon:`fa-bug` "
":guilabel:`(bug)` icon, then click :guilabel:`Fields`. The technical name of"
