msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`子公式` 欄位中，輸入 `base` 以申報未稅金額，或輸入 `tax` 以申報"
"實際收取／支付的稅額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:416
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:426
