#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:423
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/customize.rst:447
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Formula` field, use basic algebra referencing your line "
"codes (e.g., `LINE_10 - LINE_20`)."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`公式` 欄位中，使用基本代數運算並參照你的行代碼（例如"
