"定`，在 :guilabel:`公司 Intrastat 地區` 選擇公司所在地區，然後按一下 "
":guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:56
msgid ""
"If your warehouses are located in more than one region, you can define the "
"region code at the level of each warehouse instead. To do so, go to "
":menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Warehouses`, select a "
"warehouse, set its :guilabel:`Intrastat region`, and then :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"若您的倉庫位於多個地區，您可改為在每個倉庫層級定義地區代碼。要執行此操作，請"
"前往 :menuselection:`庫存 --> 配置 --> 倉庫`，選擇一個倉庫，設定其 "
":guilabel:`Intrastat 地區`，然後按 :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:60
msgid "Adding the Intrastat region to a warehouse"
msgstr "將 Intrastat 地區新增至倉庫"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:67
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/brazil.rst:603
msgid "Product configuration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:69
msgid ""
"All products must be properly configured to be included in the Intrastat "
"report."
msgstr "所有產品必須妥善配置，方可納入 Intrastat 報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:74
msgid "Commodity code"
msgstr "商品代碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:76
msgid ""
"Commodity codes are internationally recognized reference numbers used to "
"classify goods depending on their **nature**. Intrastat uses the `Combined "
"Nomenclature <https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/customs-4/calculation-"
"customs-duties/customs-tariff/combined-nomenclature_en>`_."
msgstr ""
"商品代碼是國際認可的參考編號，用於根據貨物的**性質**進行分類。Intrastat 使用 "
"`綜合命名法 <https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/customs-4/calculation-"
"customs-duties/customs-tariff/combined-nomenclature_en>`_。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:79
msgid ""
"To add a commodity code, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> "
"Products` and select a product. Under the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab, set "
"the product's :guilabel:`Commodity Code`."
msgstr ""
"如要新增商品編碼，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 客戶 --> 產品`，並選擇產品"
"。在 :guilabel:`會計` 分頁下，設定產品的 :guilabel:`商品編碼`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:83
msgid ""
"`National Bank of Belgium - Intrastat commodity codes "
"<https://www.nbb.be/en/statistics/foreign-trade/nomenclature-and-codes>`_"
msgstr ""
"`比利時國家銀行 - Intrastat 商品代碼 <https://www.nbb.be/en/statistics/"
"foreign-trade/nomenclature-and-codes>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:89
msgid "Quantity: weight and supplementary unit"
msgstr "數量：重量及補充單位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:91
msgid ""
"Depending on the nature of the goods, it is necessary to specify either the "
"product's weight in kilos (without packaging) or the product's supplementary"
" unit, such as square meter (`m2`), number of items (`p/st`), liter (`l`), "
"or gram (`g`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:95
msgid ""
"To add a product's weight or supplementary unit, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Products` and select a product."
