"either fill in the product :guilabel:`Weight` or its "
":guilabel:`Supplementary Units`."
msgstr ""
"如要新增產品重量或輔助單位，請前往:menuselection:`會計 --> 客戶 --> 產品`並選"
"擇一個產品。在:guilabel:`會計`分頁下，視乎所設定的商品代碼，填寫產品"
"的:guilabel:`重量`或:guilabel:`輔助單位`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:102
msgid "Country of origin"
msgstr "原產國"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:104
msgid ""
"To add the product's country of origin, go to :menuselection:`Accounting -->"
" Customers --> Products` and select a product. Under the "
":guilabel:`Accounting` tab, set the :guilabel:`Country of Origin`."
msgstr ""
"若要新增產品的原產地，請前往:menuselection:`會計 --> 客戶 --> 產品`並選擇產品"
"。在:guilabel:`會計`分頁下，設定:guilabel:`原產地`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:110
msgid "Invoices and bills configuration"
msgstr "發票及賬單設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:112
msgid ""
"Once products are properly configured, several settings must be configured "
"on the invoices and bills you create."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:118
msgid "Transaction code"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:120
msgid ""
"Transaction codes are used to identify a transaction's nature. :ref:`Default"
