msgstr ""
"如要手動編輯合作夥伴國家／地區，請建立發票或賬單，點擊:guilabel:`其他資料`分"
"頁，然後選擇:guilabel:`Intrastat 國家／地區`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:150
msgid "Transport code"
msgstr "運輸代碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:152
msgid ""
"The transport code identifies the presumed **mode of transport** used to "
"send the goods (arrival or dispatch)."
msgstr "運輸代碼用於識別發送貨物（到達或發出）時所採用的推定 **運輸方式**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:155
msgid ""
"To add the transport code, create an invoice or a bill, go to the "
":guilabel:`Other info` tab, and select the :guilabel:`Intrastat Transport "
