msgstr ""
"要新增運輸代碼，請建立發票或賬單，前往 :guilabel:`其他資訊` 分頁，然後選擇 "
":guilabel:`Intrastat 運輸模式`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/intrastat.rst:161
msgid "Value of the goods"
msgstr ""

