"<https://ec.europa.eu/taxation_customs/business/vat/what-is-vat_en>`_."
msgstr ""
"`歐盟委員會增值稅說明文件 <https://ec.europa.eu/taxation_customs/business/"
"vat/what-is-vat_en>`_。"

