"查為可選項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:193
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bill attachments`: Bills must have attached documents as proof in"
" case of an audit."
msgstr ":guilabel:`賬單附件`：賬單必須附有證明文件，以備審計之用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:194
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company data`: Missing information (e.g., VAT number or country) "
"can lead to errors in tax reports or exemptions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`公司資料`：缺少資料（例如增值稅號或國家/地區）可能會導致稅務報表或"
"豁免項目出現錯誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:196
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Draft entries`: Any draft invoices and bills within the "
"corresponding period must be reviewed and posted, or assigned a different "
"accounting date."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`草稿分錄`：必須審核並過賬相應期間內的任何草稿發票及賬單，或為其指"
"定不同的會計日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:198
msgid ""
":guilabel:`No negative amount in VAT report`: Some countries only allow "
"positive values in tax returns, as a negative amount could indicate "
"misconfigurations."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`增值稅報表中不允許負數金額`：部分國家/地區的報稅表只允許填寫正數，"
"因為負數金額可能表示設定有誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:200
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Taxes and countries matching`: Taxes applied on invoices and "
"bills must match the customer’s country."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/tax_returns.rst:203
msgid ""
