"不可逆轉，旨在確保資料不可更改，並符合部分國家的會計要求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:144
msgid "Current year earnings"
msgstr "本年度盈餘"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:147
msgid ""
"In versions before Odoo 19, current year earnings were handled differently. "
"For consistency in your reporting history, upgrading users should revisit "
"past fiscal years and explicitly book the results that were previously "
"handled implicitly by the system. These :ref:`manual journal entries "
"<accounting/year-end/manual-je>` should be made in chronological order. For "
"more information on why this change was made and how versions before Odoo 19"
" compare to versions after it, see this `blog post "
"<https://www.odoo.com/blog/business-hacks-1/how-to-manage-current-years-"
"earnings-in-odoo-19-compared-to-previous-versions-2107>`_."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 19 之前的版本中，本年收益的處理方式有所不同。為確保報表歷史紀錄的一致"
"性，升級系統的用戶應重新檢視過往會計年度，並明確入賬先前由系統隱含處理的損益"
"結果。這些 :ref:`手動日記賬分錄 <accounting/year-end/manual-je>` 應按時間順序"
"建立。如欲進一步了解作出此變更的原因，以及 Odoo 19 之前與之後版本的比較，請參"
"閱這篇 `網誌文章 <https://www.odoo.com/blog/business-hacks-1/how-to-manage-"
"current-years-earnings-in-odoo-19-compared-to-previous-versions-2107>`_。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:154
msgid ""
"At the end of a fiscal year, a company will almost always have a net profit "
"or a net loss that is calculated by summing the income and expenses accounts"
" of the profit and loss statement. Odoo displays the result for year **N** "
"as a **dynamic line** called *Result Brought Forward* in the trial balance "
"and general ledger of the year **N+1**. To clear this dynamic line, create a"
" :ref:`manual journal entry <accounting/year-end/manual-je>` in year **N** "
"for the end-of-year result using a :ref:`Current Year Earnings type account "
"<accounting/year-end/appropriation>`."
msgstr ""
"在財政年度結束時，公司幾乎總會有淨利潤或淨虧損，該金額是透過加總損益表的收入"
"及支出科目計算得出。在 **N+1** 年度的試算表及總賬中，Odoo 會將 **N** 年度的業"
"績顯示為名為 *結轉損益* 的 **動態行**。如要清除此動態行，請在 **N** 年度為年"
"終業績建立一項:ref:`手動日記賬分錄 <accounting/year-end/manual-je>`，並使"
"用:ref:`本年盈利類型科目 <accounting/year-end/appropriation>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:164
msgid "Balancing the trial balance"
msgstr "平衡試算表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:166
msgid ""
"A trial balance is, by default, always balanced (meaning the sum of debits "
"equals the sum of credits) because it records the sum of all journal entries"
" which are themselves balanced. However, **balance sheet accounts** (assets,"
" liabilities, and equity) carry over their balances from previous fiscal "
"years, whereas **profit and loss accounts** (income, expense, and "
":ref:`appropriation accounts <accounting/year-end/appropriation>`) reset to "
"zero at the start of a new fiscal year. This difference in account behavior "
"would leave the trial balance unbalanced if it were not for the dynamic line"
" - *Result Brought Forward* - that balances this difference temporarily "
"until an explicit, :ref:`manual journal entry <accounting/year-end/manual-"
"je>` is made to appropriate the profit or the loss. Posting an explicit "
"entry to a :ref:`current year earnings account <accounting/year-"
"end/appropriation>` at year-end \"neutralizes\" the dynamic line and ensures"
" the trial balance is balanced by actual journal items. This manual journal "
"entry does not need to be made immediately following the end of the fiscal "
"year because the trial balance is always balanced, but whenever the "
"company's profit/loss is ready to be appropriated, this manual journal entry"
" replaces the dynamic line."
msgstr ""
"試算表在預設情況下永遠保持平衡（即借方總和等於貸方總和），因為它記錄了所有本"
"身已平衡的日記賬分錄總和。然而，**資產負債表賬戶**（資產、負債及權益）會從過"
"往財政年度結轉餘額，而 **損益表賬戶**（收入、開支及 :ref:`分配賬戶 "
"<accounting/year-end/appropriation>`）則會在新財政年度開始時重設為零。這種賬"
"戶運作上的差異原本會令試算表失去平衡，幸好系統設有動態項目「*結轉損益*」暫時"
"平衡此差額，直至您作出明確的 :ref:`手動日記賬分錄 <accounting/year-end/"
"manual-je>` 來分配利潤或虧損為止。在年結時將明確的分錄過賬至 :ref:`本年度盈餘"
"賬戶 <accounting/year-end/appropriation>`，即可「抵銷」該動態項目，確保試算表"
"由實際的日記賬項目達致平衡。由於試算表始終保持平衡，此手動日記賬分錄無須在財"
"政年度結束後立即作出；當公司準備好分配損益時，該手動日記賬分錄便會取代該動態"
"項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:184
msgid "Appropriation (current year earnings) accounts"
msgstr "盈餘分配（本年度盈利）帳戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:186
msgid ""
"Appropriation accounts (also called by their account type, current year "
"earnings) are used to allocate a company's profit or loss, whether that "
"allocation is to reserves, dividends, or any other destination. There are "
"several key pieces of information to know about these accounts and how they "
"function:"
msgstr ""
"盈餘分配賬戶（亦依其賬戶類型稱為「本年盈餘」）用於分配公司的利潤或虧損，無論"
"是分配至儲備、股息或任何其他用途。以下是關於這些賬戶及其運作方式的幾項重要須"
"知："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:191
msgid ""
"**Annual reset**: Like the income and expenses accounts that are also found "
"on the profit and loss statement, allocation accounts have their opening "
"balances reset at the beginning of a fiscal year."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:194
msgid ""
"**P&L presentation**: These accounts appear at the bottom of the **profit "
"and loss** statement."
msgstr "**損益表呈列**：這些科目會顯示在 **損益表** 的底部。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:195
msgid ""
"**No profit effect**: Unlike income and expenses accounts, these accounts "
"**do not affect** the calculation of the net profit."
msgstr "**不影響利潤**：與收入及開支賬戶不同，這些賬戶**不會影響**淨利潤的計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:197
msgid ""
"**Balance sheet counterparts**: Only the *counterparts* of the journal items"
" that debit or credit appropriations accounts (e.g., the dividends payable "
"or the reserve accounts) appear on the balance sheet. This maintains a "
"strict separation between the process of distributing profit and the "
"resulting liabilities or equity."
msgstr ""
"**資產負債表對應項目**：只有借記或貸記盈餘分配帳戶的日記賬項目之*對應項目*（"
"例如應付股息或儲備帳戶）會顯示於資產負債表上。這可嚴格區分利潤分配過程與由此"
"產生的負債或權益。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:205
msgid "Manual journal entry"
msgstr "手動日記賬記項"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:207
msgid ""
"To roll up income and expenses and replace the dynamic *Result Brought "
"Forward* line with an explicit journal item that balances the trial balance,"
" create a manual journal entry by following these steps:"
msgstr ""
"如要彙總收入及支出，並以明確的日記賬項目取代動態的 *結轉結果* 行以平衡試算表"
"，請按照以下步驟建立手動日記賬分錄："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:211
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Accounting --> Journal Entries`."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 會計 --> 日記賬記項`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:212
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:231
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:173
msgid "Click the :guilabel:`New` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:213
msgid ""
"Add a :guilabel:`Reference` such as `Annual Closing [YEAR]`, replacing "
"`[YEAR]` with the current year."
msgstr "新增 :guilabel:`參考`，例如 `年度結算 [年份]`，並以目前年份取代 `[年份]`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:215
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Accounting Date` to the end of the fiscal year in which "
"the profit or loss was incurred."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:217
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Journal Items` tab, add the necessary appropriation lines."
" In the case of recording a profit, debit one or more appropriation (current"
" year earnings) accounts. In the case of recording a loss, credit one or "
"more appropriation (current year earnings) accounts. Either way, to fully "
"distribute the year's profit or loss, the amount should sum to the amount "
"that is on the dynamic :guilabel:`Result Brought Forward` line of the trial "
"balance **for the year after the profit or loss was incurred**."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`日記賬項目` 分頁中，新增所需的利潤分配資料行。若記錄利潤，請借"
"記一個或多個分配（本年度盈利）賬戶；若記錄虧損，請貸記一個或多個分配（本年度"
"盈利）賬戶。無論哪種情況，要完全分配該年度的盈虧，總金額應等於試算表**在產生"
"盈虧之後的年度**中，動態 :guilabel:`結轉損益` 行上的金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:223
msgid ""
"Add one or more additional lines that credit (in the case of a profit) or "
"debit (in the case of a loss) one or more destination accounts to balance "
"the journal entry. Depending on the localization and the situation, the "
"destination account(s) will vary, but they could be other appropriation "
"(current year earnings) accounts, equity accounts, current liabilities "
"accounts, or a combination thereof. The sum of these lines must balance the "
"line(s) from the previous step."
msgstr ""
"加入一個或多個額外資料行，以貸記（如有盈利）或借記（如有虧損）一個或多個目標"
"賬戶，從而平衡日記賬分錄。目標賬戶會視乎本地化及情況而異，可能是其他分配（本"
"年盈利）賬戶、權益賬戶、流動負債賬戶，或這些賬戶的組合。這些資料行的總額必須"
"與上一步驟的資料行平衡。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:228
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Post`."
msgstr "按一下 :guilabel:`過賬`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:231
msgid ""
"Depending on the localization and the situation, the accounts involved will "
"vary. The following example illustrates one potential journal entry using "
"accounts from the Belgian :abbr:`GAAP (generally accepted accounting "
"principles)` / :abbr:`CSA-WVV (code des sociétés et des associations - "
"wetboek van vennootschappen en verenigingen)`. This example debits three "
"different allocation (current year earnings) accounts and credits three "
"different destination accounts (two equity accounts and one current "
"liabilities account)."
msgstr ""
"視乎當地語系化設定及實際情況，所涉及的會計科目會有所不同。以下範例展示了一筆"
"使用比利時 :abbr:`GAAP (公認會計原則)` / :abbr:`CSA-WVV (比利時《公司及協會法"
"典》)` 會計科目的潛在日記賬分錄。此範例借記三個不同的分配（本年盈餘）科目，並"
"貸記三個不同的目標科目（兩個權益科目及一個流動負債科目）。"

