#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:293
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Aged payables per partner`: Review payables without a partner."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:294
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Aged receivables per partner`: Review receivables without a "
"partner."
msgstr ":guilabel:`按合作夥伴分類的應收賬款賬齡`：檢視沒有合作夥伴的應收賬款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:295
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bank Reconciliation`: Reconcile all bank account transactions up "
"to year-end."
msgstr ":guilabel:`銀行對賬`：對賬截至年底的所有銀行賬戶交易。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:296
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Deferred Entries`: Ensure start and end dates are correctly set "
"on bills and invoices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:298
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Earnings Allocation`: After adjustments, transfer the result "
"brought forward to an equity account."
msgstr ":guilabel:`盈餘分配`：調整後，將結轉損益轉撥至權益帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:300
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fixed Assets`: Ensure assets are properly registered for "
"automatic depreciation calculation."
msgstr ":guilabel:`固定資產`：確保資產已妥善登記，以便自動計算折舊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:302
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Loans`: Ensure loans are properly registered for automatic "
"amortization calculations."
msgstr ":guilabel:`貸款`：確保已妥善登記貸款，以便自動計算攤銷。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:303
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Manual Adjustments`: Complete any necessary manual adjustments "
"and internal checks."
msgstr ":guilabel:`手動調整`：完成任何必要的手動調整及內部檢查。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:304
msgid ""
":guilabel:`No draft entries`: Review and post draft invoices, bills, and "
"entries in the period, or change their accounting date."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`沒有草稿分錄`：檢查並過賬該期間的草稿發票、賬單及分錄，或更改其會"
"計日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:306
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Overdue payables`: Review overdue payables aged over 60 days and "
"assess the need for an allowance for uncertain liabilities."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:308
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Overdue receivables`: Review overdue receivables aged over 60 "
"days and assess the need for an allowance for doubtful accounts or expected "
"credit loss provision, as per IFRS 9 guidelines."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`逾期應收賬款`：根據《國際財務報告準則》第 9 號（IFRS 9）指引，檢視"
"賬齡超過 60 日的逾期應收賬款，並評估是否需要提撥呆賬準備或預期信貸虧損撥備。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:311
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total Receivables`: Verify that the total aged receivables equals"
" the customer account balance."
msgstr ":guilabel:`應收帳款總額`：確認帳齡應收帳款總額等於客戶帳戶餘額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/reporting/year_end.rst:313
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total payables`: Verify that the total aged payables equals the "
"vendor account balance."
msgstr ":guilabel:`應付賬款總計`：確認應付賬款賬齡總計等於供應商賬戶餘額。"

