#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:7
msgid ""
"Tax regulations generally require companies to compute tax amounts on sales,"
" keep a record of accumulated tax debit and credit, and periodically file "
"this information in tax returns."
msgstr ""
"稅務法規一般要求公司計算銷售稅額、記錄累計稅項借方及貸方，並定期在報稅表中申"
"報相關資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:11
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概覽"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:13
msgid "In general, managing taxes in Odoo involves the following steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:15
msgid ""
"Taxes are added on individual lines of documents created via the Sales, "
"Purchase, Accounting, and Point of Sale apps."
msgstr "透過銷售、採購、會計及 POS 銷售點應用程式建立的文件，稅項會加入至個別資料行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:17
msgid "Odoo automatically computes tax amounts on the documents."
msgstr "Odoo 會自動計算文件上的稅額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:18
msgid ""
"On accounting documents, Odoo generates journal items to keep track of tax "
"debit and tax credit."
msgstr "在會計文件上，Odoo 會產生日記賬項目，以追蹤稅項借方及稅項貸方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:19
msgid ""
"The total base, tax debit, and tax credit for a period can be viewed in the "
"tax return report and used to file a tax return."
msgstr "特定期間的總稅基、稅項借方及稅項貸方金額，可在報稅表報告中查看並用於報稅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:23
msgid "Taxes on sales and purchases"
msgstr "銷售及採購稅項"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:25
msgid ""
"Most sales and purchase documents have a :guilabel:`Taxes` field where taxes"
" can be applied to individual lines. This includes :doc:`invoices "
"<customer_invoices>` and :doc:`vendor bills <vendor_bills>` in the "
"Accounting app, :doc:`sales quotations <../../sales/sales/sales_quotations>`"
" in the Sales app, and :doc:`purchase orders "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/purchase/manage_deals/rfq>` in the Purchase app."
msgstr ""
"大多數銷售及採購單據都設有 :guilabel:`稅項` 欄位，可為個別資料行套用稅項。這"
"包括會計應用程式中的 :doc:`發票 <customer_invoices>` 和 :doc:`供應商賬單 "
"<vendor_bills>`、銷售應用程式中的 :doc:`銷售報價單 <../../sales/sales/"
"sales_quotations>`，以及採購應用程式中的 :doc:`採購訂單 <../../"
"inventory_and_mrp/purchase/manage_deals/rfq>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:31
msgid "Adding a 21% tax on an invoice line."
msgstr "在發票明細行加入 21% 稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:35
msgid ""
"When adding a product to a sale or purchase line, the taxes :ref:`assigned "
"to the product <taxes/product>` are automatically applied to the line."
msgstr ""
"在銷售或採購資料行加入產品時，:ref:`指派給該產品 <taxes/product>` 的稅項會自"
"動套用至該資料行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:38
msgid ""
"In the :doc:`Point of Sale <../../sales/point_of_sale>` app, the taxes "
":ref:`assigned to the products <taxes/product>` are applied directly to the "
"order and cannot be changed except by a :doc:`fiscal position "
"<taxes/fiscal_positions>`."
msgstr ""
"在 :doc:`銷售點 <../../sales/point_of_sale>` 應用程式中，:ref:`指派給產品 "
"<taxes/product>` 的稅項會直接套用至訂單，除非透過 :doc:`財務狀況 <taxes/"
"fiscal_positions>`，否則無法更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:43
msgid "Automatic computation of tax amounts"
msgstr "自動計算稅額"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:45
msgid ""
"Applying a tax to a sale or purchase line allows Odoo to automatically "
"compute the tax amount based on the sale or purchase line's subtotal and the"
" tax's configuration. The details of the computation are explained in the "
":doc:`Tax computation documentation <taxes/tax_computation>`."
msgstr ""
"在銷售或採購資料行套用稅項後，Odoo 便會根據資料行的小計及稅項設定自動計算稅額"
"。計算詳情請參閱 :doc:`稅項計算文件 <taxes/tax_computation>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:49
msgid "Odoo automatically computes a tax amount for the 21% tax."
msgstr "Odoo 會自動計算 21% 稅項的稅額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:53
msgid "Automatic generation of tax journal items"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:55
msgid ""
"Upon applying a tax on an :doc:`invoice <customer_invoices>` or :doc:`vendor"
" bill <vendor_bills>`, a tax payable journal item is automatically generated"
" with the tax amount. This keeps track of the tax debit or credit associated"
" with the transaction."
msgstr ""
"當對 :doc:`發票 <customer_invoices>` 或 :doc:`供應商賬單 <vendor_bills>` 套用"
"稅項時，系統會自動產生一個包含該稅額的應付稅項日記賬項目，以追蹤與該交易相關"
"的稅項借方或貸方金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:59
msgid ""
"Furthermore, the tax amount is added to the amount due on the receivable or "
"payable journal item."
msgstr "此外，稅額會加到應收或應付日記賬項目的應付金額中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:61
msgid ""
"Finally, :ref:`Tax Grids <accounting/tax-returns/tax-grids>` are added both "
"to the automatically created tax payable journal item and to the invoice "
"line on which the tax is applied. These tags are used to retrieve the "
"journal items corresponding to the tax's base and tax amount in the "
":doc:`Tax Return <reporting/tax_returns>` report."
msgstr ""
"最後， :ref:`稅務網格 <accounting/tax-returns/tax-grids>` 會同時加入至自動建"
"立的應付稅項日記賬項目，以及套用該稅項的發票明細行。這些標籤用於在 :doc:`報稅"
"表 <reporting/tax_returns>` 報表中擷取對應稅基及稅額的日記賬項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:66
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically generates a tax payable journal item for the 21% tax."
msgstr "Odoo 會自動為 21% 稅項產生一項應付稅項日記賬項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:70
msgid ""
"If :doc:`Cash Basis <taxes/cash_basis>` is enabled, upon reconciling the "
"invoice or vendor bill with the payment, an additional journal entry is "
"created to represent the creation of the tax debit or credit at that point "
"in time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:75
msgid "Filing tax returns"
msgstr "提交報稅表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:77
msgid ""
"The :doc:`Tax Return <reporting/tax_returns>` report aggregates the base and"
" tax amounts from invoices and vendor bills over a given period and presents"
" it in a format tailored to the :doc:`fiscal localization "
"<../fiscal_localizations>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:81
msgid ""
"The amounts presented in the tax return report can be used to complete tax "
"declarations that need to be periodically submitted to the government. In "
"most cases, there is a one-to-one correspondence between the lines of the "
"tax return and the official tax declaration, allowing amounts to simply be "
"copied from one to the other."
msgstr ""
"報稅表報告中所列示的金額，可用於填寫須定期向政府提交的稅務申報表。在大多數情"
"況下，報稅表的項目與官方稅務申報表之間存在一對一的對應關係，因此只需直接將金"
"額抄錄過去即可。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:86
msgid "The base section of the tax return report for Belgium."
msgstr "比利時報稅表的稅基部份。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:89
msgid "The tax section of the tax return report for Belgium."
msgstr "比利時報稅表報告的稅項部分。"

