msgstr "在客戶門戶查看時，發票明細行會顯示發票上的標籤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:244
msgid "Tax group"
msgstr "稅組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:246
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Tax Group` is shown in the totals section of the invoice, in "
"invoice PDFs and on the customer portal. Multiple taxes that belong to the "
"same tax group are aggregated together into a single tax amount."
msgstr ""
"發票的總計部分、發票 PDF 及客戶門戶網站均會顯示 :guilabel:`稅組`。屬於同一稅"
"組的多項稅項會匯總為單一稅額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:250
msgid ""
"The Tax Group shows in the totals section when viewed in the customer "
"portal."
msgstr "在客戶門戶查看時，稅項群組會顯示於總計部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:256
msgid "Configure how tax journal items are created"
msgstr "設定如何建立稅務日記賬項目"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:258
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Distribution for Invoices` and :guilabel:`Distribution for "
"Refunds` sections control the generation of tax payable journal items in "
"invoices and credit notes, respectively. They also determine which :ref:`tax"
" grids <accounting/tax-returns/tax-grids>` are set on invoice lines when "
"this tax is applied."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:263
msgid ""
"Each of these sections should contain one :guilabel:`Base` line, one or more"
" :guilabel:`% of tax` lines amounting to 100% (e.g. one 100% line, or two "
"50% lines), and optionally, one or more :guilabel:`% of tax` lines amounting"
" to -100.00%."
msgstr ""
"每個部分應包含一行 :guilabel:`基數` 資料行、一行或多行總計為 100% 的 "
":guilabel:`稅項 %` 資料行（例如一行 100%，或兩行 50%），以及可選的一行或多行"
"總計為 -100.00% 的 :guilabel:`稅項 %` 資料行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:267
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Base` line can have one or more :guilabel:`Tax Grids` set, "
"which are added to the invoice line on which the tax is applied."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:270
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`% of tax` lines control the creation of tax payable journal "
"items. The tax amount is distributed according to the percentages on these "
"lines, and each line is then used as a template to create a tax payable "
"journal item with the same :guilabel:`Account` and :guilabel:`Tax Grids`. If"
" the :guilabel:`Account` is not specified, it defaults to the account of the"
" original invoice line on which the tax is applied."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:276
msgid "Typical cases include:"
msgstr "常見情況包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:278
msgid ""
"one :guilabel:`100% of tax` line: this is the most common case where the tax"
" amount should appear on a single tax payable journal item."
msgstr ""
"單一:guilabel:`100% 稅額`資料行：這是最常見的情況，稅額應顯示於單一應付稅項日"
"記帳項目中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:280
msgid ""
"one :guilabel:`100% of tax` and one :guilabel:`-100% of tax` line: this is "
"appropriate if the tax simultaneously generates both a tax debit and a tax "
"credit which cancel each other out (e.g. EU intra-community reverse-charge "
"VAT)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:283
msgid ""
"one :guilabel:`50% of tax` line that specifies a tax payable account and "
"another :guilabel:`50% of tax` line that does not specify an account: this "
"is appropriate for partially deductible purchase VAT, where part of the tax "
"must be considered an expense rather than a tax credit asset that can offset"
" tax liability."
msgstr ""
"一條指定應付稅款帳戶的 :guilabel:`50% 稅款` 明細行，以及另一條未指定帳戶的 "
":guilabel:`50% 稅款` 明細行：這適用於部分可扣抵的採購增值稅（VAT），其中部分"
"稅項必須視為開支，而非可用於抵銷稅務負債的稅項抵免資產。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:288
msgid "The Distribution for Invoices of a 21% VAT tax."
msgstr "21% 增值稅發票的分配。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:291
msgid "The Distribution for Refunds of a 21% VAT tax."
msgstr "21% 增值稅的退款分配。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:297
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions.rst:35
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:57
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/new_zealand.rst:65
msgid "Tax mapping"
msgstr "稅項對應"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:299
msgid ""
"Taxes can be combined with :doc:`fiscal positions <taxes/fiscal_positions>` "
"to map taxes to each other so that the correct tax is applied based on the "
"customer's or vendor's location and business type."
msgstr ""
"稅項可與 :doc:`財政位置 <taxes/fiscal_positions>` 結合使用，將不同稅項互相對"
"應，從而根據客戶或供應商的所在地及業務類型套用正確的稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:303
msgid ""
"When configuring a tax, leave the :guilabel:`Fiscal Position` field blank to"
" make the tax immediately available across all fiscal positions, or select "
"specific fiscal positions where this tax should be used to replace other "
"taxes with it. If one or more fiscal positions are selected, use the "
":guilabel:`Replaces` field to select all of the taxes that this tax should "
"replace for the selected fiscal position(s)."
msgstr ""
"設定稅項時，將 :guilabel:`財政狀況` 欄位留空，即可令該稅項即時適用於所有財政"
"狀況；你亦可選擇特定財政狀況，以便在這些狀況下使用此稅項取代其他稅項。如已選"
"擇一個或多個財政狀況，請使用 :guilabel:`取代` 欄位，選取此稅項在所選財政狀況"
"下應取代的所有稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:309
msgid ""
"To replace one tax with multiple other taxes, configure each of the "
"replacement taxes to replace the default product tax."
msgstr "要將一項稅項替換為多項其他稅項，請配置每項替代稅項以取代預設產品稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:313
msgid ""
"As a sales tax, the :guilabel:`0% Exports` tax applies to quotations, sales "
"orders, and invoices that use the :guilabel:`Foreign Trade` fiscal position."
" On those records, any time that the :guilabel:`15%` tax would be used, the "
":guilabel:`0% Exports` tax is used instead."
msgstr ""
"作為銷售稅項，:guilabel:`0% 出口` 稅項適用於使用 :guilabel:`對外貿易` 稅務規"
"則的報價單、銷售訂單及發票。在該等記錄中，凡原本會使用 :guilabel:`15%` 稅項的"
"情況，均會改為使用 :guilabel:`0% 出口` 稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:317
msgid "The **0% Exports** tax record"
msgstr "**0% 出口**稅項記錄"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:321
msgid ""
"Since the first fiscal position in the sequence is considered the company's "
"default, the taxes set on products are expected to be used with that fiscal "
"position, so the :guilabel:`Replaces` field is not displayed on it."
msgstr ""
"系統會將排序中首個財務狀況視為公司的預設設定，並預期產品上設定的稅項會配合該"
"設定使用。因此，該財務狀況不會顯示 :guilabel:`取代` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:326
msgid ""
"To more easily view which taxes are replaced, use the :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`adjust settings` in the taxes list view and display the "
":guilabel:`Replaces` field."
msgstr ""
"為方便查看哪些稅項已被取代，請在稅項列表檢視中使用 :icon:`oi-settings-"
"adjust` :guilabel:`調整設定`，並顯示 :guilabel:`取代` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:329
msgid "The **Replaces** field shown in the list view"
msgstr "清單檢視中顯示的 **取代** 欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:333
msgid ""
"Tax mapping only works with :ref:`active <taxes/list_activation>` taxes."
msgstr "稅項對應僅適用於 :ref:`已啟用 <taxes/list_activation>` 的稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:336
msgid "Extra taxes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:338
msgid ""
"\"Extra taxes\" is a broad term referring to additional taxes beyond the "
"standard or basic taxes imposed by governments. These extra taxes can be "
"**luxury** taxes, **environmental** taxes, **import** or **export duties** "
"taxes, etc."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:343
msgid ""
"The method to compute these taxes varies across different countries. We "
"recommend consulting your country's regulations to understand how to "
"calculate them for your business."
msgstr ""
"這些稅項的計算方法因國家／地區而異。建議查閱您所在國家／地區的法規，以了解如"
"何為您的業務計算相關稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:346
msgid ""
"To compute an extra tax in Odoo, :ref:`create a tax <taxes/configuration>`, "
"enter a tax name, select a :ref:`Tax Computation <taxes/configuration>`, set"
" an :guilabel:`Amount`, and in the :guilabel:`Advanced Options` tab, enable "
":guilabel:`Affect Base of Subsequent Taxes`. Then, drag and drop the taxes "
"in the :ref:`order they should be computed <taxes/base-subsequent>`."
msgstr ""
"要在 Odoo 中計算額外稅項，請:ref:`建立稅項 <taxes/configuration>`、輸入稅項名"
"稱、選擇:ref:`稅項計算方式 <taxes/configuration>`、設定 :guilabel:`金額`，並"
"在 :guilabel:`進階選項` 分頁中，啟用 :guilabel:`影響後續稅項基數`。然後，"
"按:ref:`應有的計算順序 <taxes/base-subsequent>`拖放排列各項稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:352
msgid ""
"In Belgium, the formula to compute an environmental tax is: `(product price "
"+ environmental tax) x sales tax`. Therefore, our environmental tax has to "
"come *before* the sales tax in the computation sequence."
msgstr ""
"在比利時，環保稅的計算公式為：`(產品價格 + 環保稅) x 銷售稅`。因此，環保稅在"
"計算順序中必須位於銷售稅*之前*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:355
msgid ""
"In our case, we created a 5% environmental tax (Ecotax) and put it *before* "
"the Belgian base tax of 21%."
msgstr ""
"在本例中，我們建立了一項 5% 的環保稅（Ecotax），並將其置於 21% 比利時基本稅"
"項 *之前*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes.rst:358
msgid "Environmental tax sequence in Belgium."
msgstr "比利時的環保稅序列。"

