msgid ""
"After finishing these configurations that are specific to *Avalara "
"Included*, be sure to complete the :ref:`configurations "
"<accounting/avalara/odoo-configuration>` that are common to both *Avalara "
"Included* and *Avalara Direct*."
msgstr ""
"完成這些專屬於 *Avalara Included* 的設定後，請務必同時完成 *Avalara "
"Included* 與 *Avalara Direct* 共用的:ref:`設定 <accounting/avalara/odoo-"
"configuration>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:239
msgid "Migrate to Avalara Included"
msgstr "遷移至 Avalara Included"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:241
msgid ""
"Companies currently using *Avalara Direct* in production that have fewer "
"than 5,000 annual transactions, including invoices and credit notes, are "
"eligible to migrate their account plan to *Avalara Included*."
msgstr ""
"目前在正式環境中使用 *Avalara Direct* 的公司，若每年交易量（包括發票及貸項通"
"知單）少於 5,000 宗，便合資格將帳戶方案遷移至 *Avalara Included*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:246
msgid ""
"Migrating from *Avalara Direct* to *Avalara Included* changes the Avalara "
"account from a monthly contract model to an in-app purchase model, where "
"transaction credits can be purchased based on volume. First-level support is"
" also transferred to Odoo."
msgstr ""
"由 *Avalara Direct* 遷移至 *Avalara Included* 會將 Avalara 賬戶從月費合約模式"
"變更為應用程式內購買模式，你可按交易量購買交易點數。第一線支援服務亦會轉移至 "
"Odoo。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:250
msgid "To migrate to *Avalara Included*, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:253
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Taxes` section, under :guilabel:`AvaTax`, verify that the "
":guilabel:`Integration Method` is set to :guilabel:`Avalara Direct`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`稅項` 部分中的 :guilabel:`AvaTax` 下，確認 :guilabel:`整合方"
"式` 已設為 :guilabel:`Avalara Direct`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:255
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Environment` field, select :guilabel:`Production`. Confirm"
" that the :guilabel:`API ID` and :guilabel:`API KEY` are correctly "
"configured."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`環境` 欄位中，選擇 :guilabel:`正式環境`。確認 :guilabel:`API "
"ID` 及 :guilabel:`API KEY` 已正確設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:257
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-plug` :guilabel:`Migrate to Avalara Included`. A "
"confirmation message appears outlining the changes to Avalara services and "
"pricing before proceeding with the migration."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :icon:`fa-plug` :guilabel:`遷移至 Avalara Included`。系統會顯示確認訊"
"息，在繼續遷移前概述 Avalara 服務及定價的變更。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:259
msgid ""
"Review the differences between each integration carefully before confirming "
"the migration."
msgstr "在確認遷移前，請仔細檢視各項整合之間的差異。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:261
msgid ""
"Once the migration is complete, a confirmation message appears indicating "
"that the account was successfully migrated to *Avalara Included*."
msgstr "完成遷移後，畫面會顯示確認訊息，表示賬戶已成功遷移至 *Avalara Included*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:265
msgid ""
"Because the migration process uses the same email address associated with "
"the *Avalara Direct* account, access to the *Avalara* portal remains "
"available with the existing email address. No additional email configuration"
" is required in Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:270
msgid ""
"Once the migration is complete, :ref:`IAP credits "
"<accounting/avalara/included-iap>` must be purchased to continue using the "
"AvaTax engine."
msgstr ""
"遷移完成後，必須購買 :ref:`IAP 點數 <accounting/avalara/included-iap>`，方可"
"繼續使用 AvaTax 引擎。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:278
msgid ""
"*Avalara Direct* is an in-app tax calculation service designed for mid-"
"market and enterprise businesses with a high volume of transactions (5000+ "
"per year) and more complex needs. Built on *Avalara's AvaTax* engine, "
"*Avalara Direct* integrates with Odoo to provide real-time, region-specific "
"tax calculations for sales, purchases, and invoices."
msgstr ""
"*Avalara Direct* 是一項應用程式內稅務計算服務，專為交易量龐大（每年 5000 宗以"
"上）且需求較複雜的中型市場及企業客戶而設。*Avalara Direct* 建基於 *Avalara "
"的 AvaTax* 引擎，並與 Odoo 整合，為銷售、採購及發票提供即時且符合地區規範的稅"
"務計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:283
msgid ""
