#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:489
msgid ""
"To enable address validation, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, scroll to the :guilabel:`Taxes` section, and "
"under :guilabel:`AvaTax`, tick the checkbox next to :guilabel:`Address "
"Validation`."
msgstr ""
"要啟用地址驗證，請前往:menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 設定`，捲動"
"至:guilabel:`稅項`部分，然後在:guilabel:`AvaTax`下方，勾選:guilabel:`地址驗"
"證`旁邊的核取方塊。"

