"select a contact. With the :guilabel:`Address Validation` feature enabled, "
"the :guilabel:`Validate` link appears beside the :guilabel:`Address`."
msgstr ""
"若要 :guilabel:`驗證` 地址，請開啟 :guilabel:`聯絡人` 應用程式並選擇一位聯絡"
