#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:500
msgid "Validate address link on a North American contact in Odoo."
msgstr "在 Odoo 中驗證北美洲聯絡人的地址連結。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:503
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Validate` to open a pop-up window with a "
":guilabel:`Validated Address` and :guilabel:`Original Address` listed. If "
"the :guilabel:`Validated Address` is the correct mailing address for tax "
"purposes, click :guilabel:`Save Validated`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:508
msgid ""
"All previously-entered addresses for contacts in the Odoo database need to "
"be validated using the validation process outlined above."
msgstr "Odoo 資料庫中所有先前為聯絡人輸入的地址，均須使用上述驗證流程進行驗證。"

