"address for the contacts saved in the database. However, AvaTax can still "
"function by implementing a best effort attempt using only the "
":guilabel:`Country`, :guilabel:`State`, and :guilabel:`ZIP`. These are the "
"three minimum required fields."
msgstr ""
"為確保稅項計算準確，最佳做法是為儲存在資料庫中的聯絡人輸入完整地址。不過，即"
"使只使用 :guilabel:`國家/地區`、:guilabel:`州/省` 及 :guilabel:`郵遞區號`，"
"AvaTax 仍可盡力嘗試進行計算。這是三個最基本的必填欄位。"

