msgid ""
"Click the default :guilabel:`Automatic Tax Mapping (AvaTax)` in the list or "
":ref:`create a new fiscal position <fiscal_positions/configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"在列表中點擊預設的:guilabel:`自動稅項對應 (AvaTax)`，或:ref:`建立新的財政位"
"置 <fiscal_positions/configuration>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:530
msgid ""
"Ensure that :guilabel:`Use AvaTax API` is enabled on the fiscal position "
"form view."
msgstr "確保在財務狀況表單檢視中已啟用 :guilabel:`使用 AvaTax API`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:531
msgid ""
"Optionally, enable :guilabel:`Detect Automatically` to :ref:`automatically "
"<fiscal_positions/automatic>` apply the fiscal position to transaction "
"records in Odoo that match the fiscal position's set conditions."
msgstr ""
"你亦可選擇啟用:guilabel:`自動偵測`，以:ref:`自動 <fiscal_positions/automatic>"
"`將該財政位置套用至 Odoo 中符合所設條件的交易記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:536
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Detect Automatically` feature is disabled, a fiscal "
"position must be :ref:`set for each customer "
"<accounting/fiscal_positions/partner>`."
msgstr ""
"若停用 :guilabel:`自動偵測` 功能，則必須 :ref:`為每位客戶設定 <accounting/"
"fiscal_positions/partner>` 財務狀況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:540
msgid "AvaTax accounts"
msgstr "AvaTax 帳戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:542
msgid ""
"Once :guilabel:`Use AvaTax API` has been enabled for a fiscal position, set "
"the relevant accounts in the :guilabel:`AvaTax Invoice Account` and "
":guilabel:`AvaTax Refund Account` fields in the :guilabel:`AvaTax` tab to "
"ensure smooth end-of-year record keeping. Consult a certified public "
"accountant (CPA) for specific guidance on setting both accounts."
msgstr ""
"為財政狀況啟用:guilabel:`使用 AvaTax API`後，請設定:guilabel:`AvaTax 發票賬"
"戶`及:guilabel:`AvaTax 退款賬戶`欄位（位於:guilabel:`AvaTax`分頁內）中的相關"
"賬戶，以確保年終記賬順利。如需設定這兩個賬戶的具體指引，請諮詢註冊會計師（CPA"
"）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:548
msgid "AvaTax product category codes"
msgstr "AvaTax 產品類別代碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:550
msgid ""
"AvaTax categorizes products using product category codes to ensure that the "
"correct taxes are applied to each product. Before using the integration, "
"specify an AvaTax product category code on each product category or "
"individual product."
msgstr ""
"AvaTax 會使用產品類別代碼對產品進行分類，以確保對每項產品套用正確的稅項。使用"
"此整合功能前，請在每個產品類別或個別產品上指定 AvaTax 產品類別代碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:554
msgid ""
"To set an AvaTax product category code for a product category, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Product Categories` and "
"select the relevant product category. Then, select the AvaTax product "
"category from the :guilabel:`AvaTax Category` drop-down menu, or click "
":guilabel:`Search More` to open the complete list of options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:559
msgid ""
"To set an AvaTax product category code for an individual product, navigate "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Products` and remove the "
"default :guilabel:`Sales` filter. Select the relevant product, then select "
"the AvaTax product category from the :guilabel:`AvaTax Category` drop-down "
"menu, or click :guilabel:`Search More` to open the complete list of options."
msgstr ""
"若要為個別產品設定 AvaTax 產品類別代碼，請前往:menuselection:`會計 --> 客"
"戶 --> 產品`，並移除預設的:guilabel:`銷售`篩選條件。選擇相關產品，然後"
"從:guilabel:`AvaTax 類別`下拉選單中選擇 AvaTax 產品類別，或點擊:guilabel:`搜"
"尋更多`以開啟完整選項清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:566
msgid ""
"Every product must have an AvaTax category, whether defined directly on the "
"product form or on the product category the product belongs to."
msgstr ""
"每項產品都必須設有 AvaTax 類別，無論是直接在產品表單中定義，還是在該產品所屬"
"的產品類別中設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/avalara.rst:570
msgid ""
"If both the product and its category have an :guilabel:`AvaTax Category` "
"set, the product's :guilabel:`AvaTax Category` takes precedence."
msgstr ""

