#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:137
msgid "Withholding taxes"
msgstr "預扣稅"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/retention.rst:5
msgid ""
"A **withholding tax**, also known as retention tax, mandates the payer of a "
"customer invoice to deduct a tax from the payment and remit it to the "
"government. Typically, a tax is included in the subtotal to calculate the "
"total amount paid, while withholding taxes are directly subtracted from the "
"payment."
msgstr ""
"**預扣稅**（又稱留置稅）規定客戶發票的付款人須從付款中扣除一筆稅款並上繳政府"
"。一般而言，稅項會計入小計中以計算總付款額，而預扣稅則會直接從付款中扣除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/retention.rst:13
msgid ""
"In Odoo, a withholding tax is defined by creating a negative tax. To create "
"one, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes` and, in "
"the :guilabel:`Amount` field, enter a negative amount."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 中，預扣稅是透過建立負數稅項來定義。要建立預扣稅，請前往 "
":menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 稅項`，並在 :guilabel:`金額` 欄位中輸入負數"
"金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/retention.rst:17
msgid "negative tax amount in field"
msgstr "欄位中的負數稅額"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/retention.rst:20
msgid ""
"Then, go to the :menuselection:`Advanced Options` tab and create a retention"
" :guilabel:`Tax Group`."
msgstr "然後，前往 :menuselection:`進階選項` 分頁並建立預扣 :guilabel:`稅務群組`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/retention.rst:22
msgid "tax group for retention tax."
msgstr "預扣稅稅項群組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/retention.rst:26
msgid ""
"If the retention is a percentage of a regular tax, create a :guilabel:`Tax` "
"with a :guilabel:`Tax Computation` as a :guilabel:`Group of Taxes`. Then, "
"set both the regular tax and the retention one in the :guilabel:`Definition`"
" tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/retention.rst:31
msgid "Retention taxes on invoices"
msgstr "發票上的預扣稅"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/retention.rst:33
msgid ""
"Once the retention tax has been created, it can be used on customer forms, "
"sales orders, and customer invoices. Several taxes can be applied on a "
"single customer invoice line."
msgstr ""
"建立預扣稅後，即可在客戶表單、銷售訂單及客戶發票中使用。單一客戶發票資料行可"
"套用多項稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/retention.rst:37
msgid "invoice lines with taxes"
msgstr "含稅發票明細行"

