msgid "Tax computation"
msgstr "稅項計算"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:5
msgid ""
"How taxes are computed depends on multiple different fields on the taxes "
"form view. The :ref:`Tax Computation <taxes/computation>` field is located "
"at the top of the taxes form view, but the :ref:`Included in Price "
"<taxes/included-in-price>`, :ref:`Affect Base of Subsequent Taxes "
"<taxes/base-subsequent>`, and :ref:`Base Affected by Preceding Taxes "
"<taxes/base-affected>` fields are all located in the :guilabel:`Advanced "
"Options` tab."
msgstr ""
"稅項的計算方式取決於稅項表單檢視中的多個不同欄位。:ref:`稅項計算 <taxes/"
"computation>` 欄位位於稅項表單檢視的頂部，而 :ref:`已包含在價格中 <taxes/"
"included-in-price>`、:ref:`影響後續稅項的基數 <taxes/base-subsequent>` 及 "
":ref:`基數受前項稅款影響 <taxes/base-affected>` 欄位則全數位於 :guilabel:`進"
"階選項` 分頁中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:16
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Tax Computation` field determines the relation between the "
"tax amount and the base the tax is based on. The following options are "
"available:"
msgstr " :guilabel:`稅項計算` 欄位決定了稅額與計稅基準之間的關係。可用的選項如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:19
msgid ""
":ref:`Group of Taxes <taxes/computation/group-of-taxes>`: a combination of "
"several other taxes"
msgstr ":ref:`稅項組合 <taxes/computation/group-of-taxes>`：多個其他稅項的組合"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:20
msgid ":ref:`Fixed <taxes/computation/fixed>`: a fixed amount"
msgstr ":ref:`固定 <taxes/computation/fixed>`：固定金額"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:21
msgid ""
":ref:`Percentage of Price <taxes/computation/percentage-of-price>`: a "
"percentage of the tax-excluded sales price"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:23
msgid ""
":ref:`Percentage of Price Tax Included <taxes/computation/percentage-of-"
"price-tax-included>`: a percentage of the tax-included total"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:25
msgid ""
":ref:`Custom Formula <taxes/computation/python-code>`: a custom, user-"
"defined formula"
msgstr ":ref:`自訂公式 <taxes/computation/python-code>`：由用戶自訂的公式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:30
msgid "Group of taxes"
msgstr "稅項群組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:32
msgid ""
"The tax is a combination of multiple sub-taxes. You can add as many taxes as"
" you want, in the order you want them to be applied."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:36
msgid ""
"Make sure the tax sequence is correct, as the display order determines the "
"application order and may affect tax computation, particularly if a tax "
":ref:`affects the base of subsequent taxes <taxes/base-subsequent>`."
msgstr ""
"請確保稅項順序正確。顯示順序會決定套用順序，並可能影響稅款計算，尤其是當某個"
"稅項:ref:`影響後續稅項的稅基 <taxes/base-subsequent>`時。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:43
msgid "Fixed"
msgstr "固定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:45
msgid ""
"The tax has a fixed amount in the default currency. The amount remains the "
"same per unit, regardless of the sales price."
msgstr "此稅項以預設貨幣計算固定金額。不論銷售價格為何，每單位的稅額均保持不變。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:48
msgid ""
"The computation is :math:`\\text{tax amount} = \\text{fixed tax amount} "
"\\times \\text{quantity}`."
msgstr ""
"計算公式為 :math:`\\text{tax amount} = \\text{fixed tax amount} \\times \\t"
"ext{quantity}`。"

