msgid ""
"A product has a sales price of $1000, and we apply a 10% "
":guilabel:`Percentage of Price Tax Included` tax that is :guilabel:`Tax "
"Excluded`. We then have:"
msgstr ""
"產品的銷售價格為 $1000，我們套用 10% 的:guilabel:`價格百分比（含稅）`稅項，且"
"該稅項為:guilabel:`未含稅`。計算如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:135
msgid "111.11"
msgstr "111.11"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:135
msgid "1,111.11"
msgstr "1,111.11"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:138
msgid ""
"Note that the real tax rate in terms of the tax-excluded price is "
":math:`\\frac{111.11}{1000} = 11.111\\%`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:143
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Included in Price` is set to :guilabel:`Tax Included`, the "
"computation is :math:`\\text{tax amount} = \\text{sales price} \\times "
"\\text{tax rate}`."
msgstr ""
"如果 :guilabel:`包含在價格內` 設為 :guilabel:`含稅`，計算方式為 :math:`\\text"
"{tax amount} = \\text{sales price} \\times \\text{tax rate}`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:147
msgid ""
"A product has a sales price of $1000, and we apply a 10% "
":guilabel:`Percentage of Price Tax Included` tax that is :guilabel:`Tax "
"Included`. We then have:"
msgstr ""
"某產品的銷售價格為 $1000，我們為其套用 10% 的 :guilabel:`含稅價格百分比` 稅項"
"，並設為 :guilabel:`已含稅`。計算結果如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:155
msgid "900"
msgstr "900"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:158
msgid ""
"Note that the real tax rate in terms of the tax-excluded price is "
":math:`\\frac{100}{900} = 11.111\\%`."
msgstr "請注意，按不含稅價格計算的實際稅率為 :math:`\\frac{100}{900} = 11.111\\%`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:164
msgid "Custom formula"
msgstr "自訂公式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:167
msgid ""
"If a tax can be expressed as a multiple of the quantity of the product to "
"which it applies, it can be defined as a :ref:`Fixed "
"<taxes/computation/fixed>` tax. Doing so is strongly recommended over "
"defining a :guilabel:`Custom Formula` tax."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:172
msgid ""
"To use :guilabel:`Custom Formula` taxes, :ref:`install <general/install>` "
"the :guilabel:`Define Taxes as Python Code` (`account_python_tax`) module."
msgstr ""
"若要使用 :guilabel:`自訂公式` 稅項，請 :ref:`安裝 <general/install>` "
":guilabel:`以 Python 程式碼定義稅項`（`account_python_tax`）模組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:175
msgid ""
"For a :guilabel:`Custom Formula` tax, the tax amount is computed according "
"to a Python expression defined in the :guilabel:`Formula` field. The Python "
"expression may contain the following tokens:"
msgstr ""
"對於 :guilabel:`自訂公式` 稅項，稅額會根據 :guilabel:`公式` 欄位中定義的 "
"Python 表達式計算。該 Python 表達式可包含以下標記："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:178
msgid "any of the following variables:"
msgstr "以下任何變數："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:180
msgid "`price_unit`: the unit price of the product"
msgstr "`price_unit`：產品的單價"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:181
msgid ""
"`base`: the taxable basis on which the tax is applied - may differ from the "
"`price_unit` if other taxes are applied first"
msgstr "`base`：計算稅項的應稅基數，若先套用其他稅項，則可能與 `price_unit` 不同"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:183
msgid "`quantity`: the quantity of the product"
msgstr "`quantity`：產品數量"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:184
msgid "`product`: the product record - product fields can also be accessed"
msgstr "`product`：產品記錄 - 亦可存取產品欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:186
msgid "integers and floating-point numbers"
msgstr "整數及浮點數"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:188
msgid ""
"the following permitted tokens: `(`, `)`, `+`, `-`, `*`, `/`, `,`, `<`, `>`,"
" `<=`, `>=`, `and`, `or`, `None`, `min`, and `max`"
msgstr ""
"以下允許的符號：`(`、`)`、`+`、`-`、`*`、`/`、`,`、`<`、`>`、`<=`、`>"
"=`、`and`、`or`、`None`、`min` 及 `max`"

