msgid ""
"A product has a sales price of $1000, and we apply a :guilabel:`Custom "
"Formula` tax with a :guilabel:`Formula` of `min(base, 500) * 0.10 + max(base"
" - 500, 0) * 0.20`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:195
msgid "We then have:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:201
msgid "150"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:201
msgid "1,150.00"
msgstr "1,150.00"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:207
msgid "Included in price"
msgstr "包含在價格內"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:209
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Included in Price` field determines if the price on products "
"and invoices already includes this tax or if this tax should be applied on "
"top of that value."
msgstr ""
"透過 :guilabel:`包含在價格中` 欄位，可決定產品及發票上的價格是否已包含此稅項"
"，或是否應在該金額上額外加徵此稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:213
msgid ""
"To set a company-wide default for this setting, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, find the "
":guilabel:`Taxes` section, and set the :guilabel:`Prices` setting to "
":guilabel:`Tax Excluded` or :guilabel:`Tax Included`."
msgstr ""
"要為此設定配置公司層級的預設值，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 設"
"定`，找到 :guilabel:`稅項` 區塊，並將 :guilabel:`價格` 設定為 :guilabel:`不含"
"稅` 或 :guilabel:`含稅`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:217
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Default` indicates that the tax follows the company-wide default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:219
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Excluded` indicates that the tax amount is not included in "
"the sales price. The tax computation will therefore compute a tax amount on "
"top of the sales price."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`不含稅` 表示銷售價格未包含稅額。因此，稅項計算會在銷售價格之上另行"
"計算稅額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:222
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Included` indicates that the tax amount is included in the "
"sales price. The tax computation will therefore split the sales price into a"
" tax-excluded base and the tax amount. This makes it suitable for B2C sales "
"in most countries, where prices are quoted tax-inclusive."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`已含稅` 表示稅額已包含在銷售價格內。因此，稅項計算會將銷售價格拆分"
"為未含稅基數及稅額。這適用於大多數國家的 B2C 銷售，因這些國家的報價均為含稅價"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:229
msgid "Tax excluded/included toggle"
msgstr "未含稅／含稅切換開關"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:231
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Tax Excl. / Tax Incl.` toggle on quotations, sales orders, "
"purchase orders, and invoices allows users to change a tax's behavior "
"regarding if it is included or excluded in the price of products. This "
"toggle allows one tax to meet the needs of multiple situations instead of "
"requiring duplicate taxes with otherwise identical configurations."
msgstr ""
"報價單、銷售訂單、採購訂單及發票上的 :guilabel:`不含稅 / 含稅` 切換按鈕，可讓"
"用戶更改稅項的計算方式，決定稅項是否包含在產品價格內。此切換按鈕可讓單一稅項"
"滿足多種情況的需求，而無需建立設定完全相同的重複稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:236
msgid ""
"To use the :guilabel:`Tax Excl. / Tax Incl.` toggle, add the desired "
"products first, then set the toggle to the desired option."
msgstr ""
"要使用:guilabel:`未含稅 / 已含稅`切換開關，請先加入所需產品，再將開關設為所需"
"選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:239
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`Default` option is selected, using the :guilabel:`Tax "
"Excl. / Tax Incl.` toggle on a specific quotation, sales order, purchase "
"order, or invoice changes this tax's behavior for that record only."
msgstr ""
"若已選擇 :guilabel:`預設` 選項，在特定報價單、銷售訂單、採購單或發票上使用 "
":guilabel:`未含稅 / 已含稅` 切換開關，只會更改此稅項在該記錄上的行為。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:243
msgid ""
"However, if a tax's :guilabel:`Included in Price` field is set to either "
":guilabel:`Tax Excluded` or :guilabel:`Tax Included`, the tax's behavior "
"will not be changed by the :guilabel:`Tax Excl. / Tax Incl.` toggle on "
"quotations, sales orders, purchase orders, and invoices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:248
msgid ""
"A product has a sales price of $1000, and we apply a 10% "
":guilabel:`Percentage of Price` tax with :guilabel:`Included in Price` set "
"to :guilabel:`Tax Included`. That results in the following:"
msgstr ""
"假設產品的銷售價格為 $1000，並套用 10% 的:guilabel:`價格百分比`稅項，且"
"將:guilabel:`包含在價格中`設為:guilabel:`含稅`，結果如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:264
msgid ""
"If the same product instead had its :guilabel:`Included in Price` field set "
"to :guilabel:`Tax Excluded`, the results would be the following:"
msgstr ""
"若同一產品改為將 :guilabel:`包含在價格中` 欄位設為 :guilabel:`不含稅`，結果將"
"會如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:276
msgid "100.00"
msgstr "100.00"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:280
msgid ""
"For a guide on configuring tax-excluded and tax-included prices for B2B and "
"B2C customers, see :doc:`B2B_B2C`."
msgstr "有關為 B2B 及 B2C 客戶配置未含稅及含稅價格的指南，請參閱 :doc:`B2B_B2C`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:286
msgid "Affect base of subsequent taxes"
msgstr "影響後續稅項的基數"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:288
msgid ""
"This setting controls how multiple taxes on a product line affect each "
"other."
msgstr "此設定控制產品資料行上的多項稅金如何互相影響。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:290
msgid ""
"If this setting is enabled, this tax's tax amount is included in the base of"
" any subsequent tax applied on the same product line that has its "
":ref:`taxes/base-affected` setting enabled. As such, the subsequent tax's "
"base is the sum of the tax-excluded base and this tax's tax amount."
msgstr ""
"如啟用此設定，此稅項的稅額將計入在同一產品行上套用、且已啟用 :ref:`taxes/"
"base-affected` 設定的任何後續稅項的計稅基礎中。因此，後續稅項的計稅基礎為未稅"
"基礎金額與此稅項稅額的總和。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:296
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Affect base of subsequent taxes` is enabled and "
":guilabel:`Included in Price` is set to :guilabel:`Tax Excluded`, subsequent"
" taxes with the :guilabel:`Base affected by preceding taxes` setting enabled"
" will be based on a modified sales price equal to the original sales price "
"plus the tax amount."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:302
msgid ""
"A product has a sales price of $1000, and we apply a 10% "
":guilabel:`Percentage of Price` tax where the :guilabel:`Included in Price` "
"setting is set to :guilabel:`Tax Excluded` and the :guilabel:`Affect base of"
" subsequent taxes` setting is enabled. Any subsequent tax with its "
":guilabel:`Base affected by preceding taxes` will be based on a modified "
"sales price of $1100."
msgstr ""
"假設產品的銷售價格為 $1000，並套用 10% 的 :guilabel:`價格百分比` 稅項，其中 "
":guilabel:`包含在價格中` 設定為 :guilabel:`不含稅`，且已啟用 :guilabel:`影響"
"後續稅項的稅基` 設定。任何啟用了 :guilabel:`稅基受先前稅項影響` 的後續稅項，"
"都會以調整後的銷售價格 $1100 作為計算基礎。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:309
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Affect base of subsequent taxes` is enabled and "
":guilabel:`Included in Price` is set to :guilabel:`Tax Included`, subsequent"
" taxes with the :guilabel:`Base affected by preceding taxes` setting enabled"
" will be based on the original sales price."
msgstr ""
"如果已啟用 :guilabel:`影響後續稅項基數`，且將 :guilabel:`已計入價格` 設為 "
":guilabel:`含稅`，則已啟用 :guilabel:`基數受前置稅項影響` 設定的後續稅項將以"
"原始銷售價格為計算基礎。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:314
msgid ""
"A product has a sales price of $1000, and we apply a 10% "
":guilabel:`Percentage of Price` tax where the :guilabel:`Included in Price` "
"setting is set to :guilabel:`Tax Included` and the :guilabel:`Affect base of"
" subsequent taxes` setting is enabled. Any subsequent tax with its "
":guilabel:`Base affected by preceding taxes` will be based on the original "
"sales price of $1000."
msgstr ""
"某產品的售價為 $1000，我們套用一項 10% 的 :guilabel:`價格百分比` 稅項。該稅項"
"的 :guilabel:`包含於價格中` 設定為 :guilabel:`含稅`，並已啟用 :guilabel:`影響"
"後續稅項的稅基` 設定。任何啟用了 :guilabel:`稅基受先前稅項影響` 的後續稅項，"
"都會以原本的 $1000 售價作為計算基礎。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:320
msgid ""
"If this setting is disabled, the tax amount will not be included in the base"
" of any subsequent tax applied on the same product line."
msgstr "若停用此設定，稅額將不會計入套用於同一產品資料行的任何後續稅項的計稅基礎中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:325
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Affect base of subsequent taxes` is disabled and "
":guilabel:`Included in Price` is set to :guilabel:`Tax Excluded`, subsequent"
" taxes with the :guilabel:`Base affected by preceding taxes` setting enabled"
" will be based on the original sales price."
msgstr ""
"如果已停用 :guilabel:`影響後續稅項的稅基`，且將 :guilabel:`包含在價格內` 設"
"為 :guilabel:`不含稅`，則已啟用 :guilabel:`稅基受先前稅項影響` 設定的後續稅項"
"將會根據原始售價計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:330
msgid ""
"A product has a sales price of $1000, and we apply a 10% "
":guilabel:`Percentage of Price` tax where the :guilabel:`Included in Price` "
"setting is set to :guilabel:`Tax Excluded` and the :guilabel:`Affect base of"
" subsequent taxes` setting is enabled. Any subsequent tax with its "
":guilabel:`Base affected by preceding taxes` will be based on the original "
"sales price of $1000."
msgstr ""
"假設某產品的售價為 $1000，我們套用一項 10% 的:guilabel:`價格百分比`稅項，並"
"將:guilabel:`包含在價格內`設定為:guilabel:`不含稅`，同時啟用:guilabel:`影響後"
"續稅項基數`設定。任何啟用了:guilabel:`基數受先前稅項影響`的後續稅項，均會以原"
"售價 $1000 作為計算基數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:337
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Affect base of subsequent taxes` is disabled and "
":guilabel:`Included in Price` is set to :guilabel:`Tax Included`, subsequent"
" taxes with the :guilabel:`Base affected by preceding taxes` setting enabled"
" will be based on a modified sales price equal to the original sales price "
"minus the tax amount."
msgstr ""
"如果停用 :guilabel:`影響後續稅項基數`，並將 :guilabel:`包含在價格內` 設為 "
":guilabel:`含稅`，則啟用了 :guilabel:`基數受先前稅項影響` 設定的後續稅項，將"
"以原銷售價格減去稅額後的調整銷售價格作為計算基數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:343
msgid ""
"A product has a sales price of $1000, and we apply a 10% "
":guilabel:`Percentage of Price` tax where the :guilabel:`Included in Price` "
"setting is set to :guilabel:`Tax Included` and the :guilabel:`Affect base of"
" subsequent taxes` setting is enabled. Any subsequent tax with its "
":guilabel:`Base affected by preceding taxes` will be based on a modified "
"sales price of $909.09."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:349
msgid ""
"This setting is considered any time multiple taxes are applied to the same "
"product line, whether via a :ref:`group of taxes <taxes/computation>` or "
"multiple taxes added directly to a product line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:353
msgid ""
"The order in which taxes are applied depends only on the order in which they"
" appear in the :guilabel:`Taxes` list, not on the order in which they are "
"added to a product line."
msgstr ""
"稅項的套用順序僅取決於它們在 :guilabel:`稅項` 清單中出現的順序，而非新增至產"
"品明細行的順序。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:356
msgid ""
"To modify the order, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> "
"Taxes`, and drag and drop taxes using the handles to the left of the tax "
"names."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:359
msgid ""
"The order of appearance of taxes in the Taxes list determines which tax is "
"applied first"
msgstr "稅項在「稅項」清單中的顯示順序，決定最先套用哪個稅項"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:362
msgid ""
"Regardless of the order in the :guilabel:`Taxes` list, :guilabel:`Tax "
"Excluded` taxes do not affect the base of subsequent :guilabel:`Tax "
"Included` taxes (see the note in :ref:`taxes/base-affected`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:367
msgid "In the following example:"
msgstr "在以下例子中："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:369
msgid ""
"the Ecotax is a :guilabel:`Fixed` tax of €0.90 per unit, with the "
":guilabel:`Affect base of subsequent taxes` setting enabled."
msgstr ""
"環保稅為每單位 €0.90 的 :guilabel:`固定` 稅項，並已啟用 :guilabel:`影響後續稅"
"項的基數` 設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:371
msgid ""
"The 21% VAT tax is a 21% :guilabel:`Percentage of Price` tax with the "
":guilabel:`Base affected by preceding taxes` setting enabled."
msgstr ""
"21% 增值稅是稅率為 21% 的:guilabel:`價格百分比`稅項，並已啟用:guilabel:`稅基"
"受先前稅項影響`設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:373
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Taxes` list, the 21% VAT tax comes after the Ecotax, as "
"shown in the configuration above."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`稅項` 清單中，21% 增值稅位於環保稅之後，如上述設定所示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:376
msgid ""
"When applying both taxes to a product line, the Ecotax amount is added to "
"the basis of the 21% VAT tax."
msgstr "將兩種稅項同時套用至產品資料行時，生態稅金額會計入 21% 增值稅的計稅基礎中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:379
msgid "The Ecotax is added to the basis of the 21% VAT tax"
msgstr "環保稅會計入 21% 增值稅的計稅基礎"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:385
msgid "Base affected by preceding taxes"
msgstr "受前置稅項影響的稅基"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:387
msgid ""
"This setting, which is only visible in :doc:`developer mode "
"<../../../general/developer_mode>`, determines whether any previous tax that"
" :ref:`affects the base of subsequent taxes <taxes/base-subsequent>` will "
"modify the sales price that this tax is based on."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/tax_computation.rst:392
msgid ""
"Taxes with :ref:`Included in Price <taxes/included-in-price>` set to "
":guilabel:`Tax Included` do not have this setting. Such taxes are never "
"affected by previous :guilabel:`Tax Excluded` taxes, except if they have the"
" :guilabel:`Fixed` :ref:`tax computation <taxes/computation>` type."
msgstr ""
"若稅項的 :ref:`包含於價格內 <taxes/included-in-price>` 設為 :guilabel:`含稅` "
"，則不會有此設定。這類稅項絕不受先前 :guilabel:`不含稅` 稅項的影響，除非它們"
"採用 :guilabel:`固定` 的 :ref:`稅項計算 <taxes/computation>` 類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/vat_verification.rst:3
msgid "VAT numbers verification (VIES)"
msgstr "增值稅編號驗證 (VIES)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/vat_verification.rst:5
msgid ""
"`VAT Information Exchange System "
"<https://ec.europa.eu/taxation_customs/vies/#/vat-validation>`_, or "
"**VIES**, is a tool provided by the European Commission that allows you to "
"check the validity of VAT numbers for companies registered in the European "
"Union."
msgstr ""
"`增值稅資訊交換系統 <https://ec.europa.eu/taxation_customs/vies/#/vat-"
"validation>`_（簡稱 **VIES**）是由歐盟委員會提供的工具，讓您查核於歐盟註冊的"
"公司的增值稅（VAT）號碼是否有效。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/vat_verification.rst:9
msgid ""
"Odoo's VAT Validation feature uses the VIES to verify your contacts' VAT "
"numbers directly from Odoo's interface."
msgstr "Odoo 的增值稅驗證功能會使用 VIES，直接從 Odoo 介面驗證聯絡人的增值稅號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/vat_verification.rst:13
msgid ""
"Regardless of whether or not the Verify VAT Numbers feature is enabled, Odoo"
" checks the format of a contact's VAT against the `expected format of VAT "
"numbers <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/VAT_identification_number>`_ from "
"that country."
msgstr ""
"不論是否啟用「驗證增值稅編號」功能，Odoo 都會根據該國家/地區的 `預期增值稅編"
"號格式 <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/VAT_identification_number>`_ 檢查聯絡人"
"的增值稅編號格式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/vat_verification.rst:18
msgid "VIES VAT number verification"
msgstr "VIES 增值稅號碼驗證"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/vat_verification.rst:20
msgid ""
"To activate this feature, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration"
" --> Settings`. In the :guilabel:`Taxes` section, enable the "
":guilabel:`Verify VAT Numbers` feature, and click on :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/vat_verification.rst:24
msgid ""
"Once the :guilabel:`Verify VAT Numbers` feature is enabled, if the contact's"
" :guilabel:`Tax ID` field is populated *and* its country is different from "
"your company's country, Odoo displays an :guilabel:`Intra-Community Valid` "
"checkbox. Odoo tests the VAT number through the VIES and automatically "
"checks or unchecks the :guilabel:`Intra-Community Valid` checkbox depending "
"on the validity of the VAT number."
msgstr ""
"啟用 :guilabel:`驗證增值稅編號` 功能後，若聯絡人的 :guilabel:`稅務編號` 欄位"
"已填寫，*且* 其國家或地區與貴公司不同，Odoo 便會顯示 :guilabel:`歐盟境內有"
"效` 核取方塊。Odoo 會透過 VIES 測試該增值稅編號，並視乎編號是否有效而自動勾選"
"或取消勾選 :guilabel:`歐盟境內有效` 核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/vat_verification.rst:30
msgid "Intra-community valid checkbox on the contact record"
msgstr "聯絡人記錄上的「歐盟內部有效」複選框"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/vat_verification.rst:34
msgid ""
"It is possible to manually override the :guilabel:`Intra-Community Valid` "
"field on a contact in case the automatic VIES check is incorrect (for "
"example, if the company was recently created and its VAT is not yet in the "
"VIES). This change is logged in the chatter for transparency."
msgstr ""
"如果自動 VIES 檢查結果有誤（例如公司剛成立，其增值稅編號尚未載入 VIES 系統）"
"，您可以手動覆寫聯絡人的 :guilabel:`歐盟區內有效` 欄位。為確保透明度，此變更"
"會記錄於通訊欄中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/taxes/vat_verification.rst:39
msgid ""
"Odoo can :ref:`automatically apply fiscal positions "
"<fiscal_positions/automatic>`. If the Verify VAT Numbers feature is enabled,"
" any fiscal positions with VAT required enabled will require Intra-Community"
" valid VAT numbers to apply automatically."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 可以 :ref:`自動套用財務位置 <fiscal_positions/automatic>`。如果已啟用「"
"驗證增值稅號碼」功能，任何已啟用「必須提供增值稅號碼」的財務位置，均須提供有"
"效的歐盟區內增值稅號碼才可自動套用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:7
msgid ""
"Vendor bills can be registered either **manually** or **automatically** in "
"Odoo. The :ref:`Aged Payable report <accounting/vendor_bills/age-payable-"
"report>` provides an overview of all outstanding bills to help ensure timely"
" payment of the correct amounts."
msgstr ""
"供應商賬單可在 Odoo 中 **手動** 或 **自動** 登記。:ref:`應付賬款賬齡分析報告 "
"<accounting/vendor_bills/age-payable-report>` 提供所有未付賬單的概覽，有助確"
"保按時支付正確金額。"

