#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:211
msgid "Self-billing"
msgstr "自我開票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:213
msgid ""
"Self-billing is a workflow where a customer generates a vendor bill on the "
"supplier's behalf and sends a copy to the supplier for their records. It "
"removes the need for the supplier to send the customer a vendor bill and is "
"common in industries where the customer has more reliable transaction data. "
"It also reduces payment time as the customer does not have to wait for the "
"supplier to issue a vendor bill."
msgstr ""
"自我開單是一種工作流程，由客戶代表供應商產生供應商賬單，並將副本發送予供應商"
"存檔。這免除了供應商向客戶發送供應商賬單的步驟，常見於客戶擁有更可靠交易數據"
"的行業。此做法亦能縮短付款時間，因為客戶無需等待供應商發出供應商賬單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:219
msgid ""
"Odoo supports the generation of self-billing vendor bills and self-billing "
"credit notes, both of which can be sent by email and via Peppol."
msgstr "Odoo 支援產生自開供應商賬單及自開貸記單，兩者均可透過電郵及 Peppol 發送。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:227
msgid ""
"To configure self-billing in Odoo, first create a separate purchase journal "
"specifically for self-billing:"
msgstr "要在 Odoo 中設定自開賬單，請先專門為自開賬單建立一個獨立的採購日記賬："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:232
msgid "In the popup window, click :guilabel:`Purchases Journal`."
msgstr "在彈出視窗中，按一下 :guilabel:`採購日記賬`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:233
msgid "Enter a :guilabel:`Journal Name`."
msgstr "輸入 :guilabel:`日記賬名稱`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:234
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Advanced Settings` tab, enable :guilabel:`Self Billing`."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`進階設定` 分頁中，啟用 :guilabel:`自開賬單`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:237
msgid ":doc:`get_started/journals`"
msgstr ":doc:`get_started/journals`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:242
msgid "Create a self-bill"
msgstr "建立自開賬單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:244
msgid ""
"Self-bills can be created both :ref:`manually "
"<accounting/vendor_bills/creation-manual>` and :ref:`automatically "
"<accounting/vendor_bills/automatic>`. When creating self-bills, be sure to "
"either create them directly from the :ref:`self-billing purchase journal "
"<accounting/vendor_bills/self-billing-config>` on the :guilabel:`Accounting "
"Dashboard` or manually set the :guilabel:`Journal` of the self-bill to the "
"self-billing purchase journal."
msgstr ""
"自開賬單可:ref:`手動 <accounting/vendor_bills/creation-manual>`或:ref:`自動 "
"<accounting/vendor_bills/automatic>`建立。建立自開賬單時，請務必直接"
"從:ref:`自開賬單採購日記賬 <accounting/vendor_bills/self-billing-config>`（位"
"於:guilabel:`會計儀表板`上）建立，或手動將自開賬單的:guilabel:`日記賬`設為自"
"開賬單採購日記賬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:251
msgid ""
"The sequence of self-bills contains the :ref:`database ID "
"<export_import_data/different-ids>` (also known as the internal ID) of the "
"partner, making the sequence unique per partner."
msgstr ""
"自開賬單的編號序列包含合作夥伴的 :ref:`數據庫 ID <export_import_data/"
"different-ids>`（亦稱為內部 ID），使每個合作夥伴的編號序列均為唯一。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:257
msgid "Send a self-bill"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills.rst:259
msgid ""
"To send a self-bill after :ref:`creating <accounting/vendor_bills/self-"
"billing-create>` and confirming it, click :guilabel:`Send`. In the "
":guilabel:`Send` popup window, select the sending methods (i.e., "
":guilabel:`by Email`, :guilabel:`by Post`, and/or :guilabel:`by Peppol`), "
"and click :guilabel:`Send`."
