":guilabel:`折舊模型`：選擇 :ref:`折舊模型 <accounting/assets/depreciation-"
"models>` 以自動填入預設設定（可選）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:216
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Computation`:  The computation method to calculate the "
"depreciation rate."
msgstr ":guilabel:`計算`：用於計算折舊率的計算方法。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:218
msgid ""
":guilabel:`No Prorata`: The start date is implicitly set to the first day of"
" the fiscal year, recognizing a full year of depreciation regardless of the "
"actual acquisition date."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:220
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Constant Periods`: Time is divided into equal, standardized "
"intervals (such as 12 months of 30 days each), ensuring identical "
"depreciation amounts per period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`固定期間`：時間被劃分為相等的標準化區間（例如 12 個月，每月 30 日"
"），確保每期的折舊金額相同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:222
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Based on days per period`: Depreciation is computed using the "
"exact calendar days elapsed in each period, accounting for month-length "
"variations (e.g., 28, 30, or 31 days) and leap years."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:226
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Prorata Date`: Starting date of the period used in the prorata "
"calculation of the first depreciation."
msgstr ":guilabel:`按比例計算日期`：首次折舊進行按比例計算時所使用期間的開始日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/assets.rst:230
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Constant Periods` and :guilabel:`Based on days per period` "
"computations allow specifying a :guilabel:`Prorata Date` when necessary. A "
"specific computation is conveyed by default in specific localizations (e.g.,"
" Germany, where the asset deprecates from the first day of the month of its "
"acquisition)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`固定期間` 及 :guilabel:`按每期日數` 計算方式允許在有需要時指定 "
":guilabel:`按比例計算日期`。特定本地化套件預設採用特定計算方式（例如德國，資"
"產自購入當月首日起折舊）。"

