msgid ""
":guilabel:`Vendor`, :guilabel:`Bill Reference`, :guilabel:`Bill Date`, "
":guilabel:`Payment Reference` (only in the Belgian +++xxx/xxxx/xxxxx+++ "
"format), :guilabel:`Recipient Bank`, :guilabel:`Due Date`, and the currency "
"(in a :doc:`multi-currency <../get_started/multi_currency>` environment and "
