"multi_currency>` 環境下，且該貨幣已啟用）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/invoice_digitization.rst:146
msgid ""
"From the :guilabel:`Invoices Lines` tab: :guilabel:`Product` "
"description/label, :guilabel:`Quantity`, unit :guilabel:`Price`, "
":guilabel:`Taxes` (if the :ref:`tax is activated <taxes/list_activation>`; "
"this field is not recognized by OCR for the :doc:`Indian localization "
"<../../fiscal_localizations/india>`), :guilabel:`Untaxed Amount`, and "
