"india>`的此欄位）、:guilabel:`未稅金額`及:guilabel:`總計`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/invoice_digitization.rst:157
msgid ""
"When a digitized vendor bill is recognized by :abbr:`OCR (optical character "
"recognition)`, Odoo searches the database for a matching purchase order. If "
"found, the vendor bill can be manually :ref:`matched with the existing open "
"purchase order lines <accounting/vendor_bills/vendor-bills-matching-po>`."
msgstr ""
"當數碼化供應商賬單經 :abbr:`OCR (光學字元識別)` 識別後，Odoo 會在資料庫中搜尋"
"相符的採購訂單。若找到相符訂單，你可手動將供應商賬單:ref:`與現有未結清的採購"
"訂單明細配對 <accounting/vendor_bills/vendor-bills-matching-po>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/invoice_digitization.rst:163
msgid ""
"Electronic vendor bills with embedded XML ensure more accurate and efficient"
" processing."
msgstr "內嵌 XML 的電子供應商賬單，可確保處理過程更準確、更有效率。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/accounting/vendor_bills/invoice_digitization.rst:164
msgid ""
"Alternatively, the :ref:`Auto-complete <accounting/vendor_bills/bill-"
"completion>` feature can transfer information from the purchase order to the"
