msgstr ""
"儲存後，該記項會顯示於 :menuselection:`ESG --> 收集 --> 排放量` 下，並會納入"
"碳足跡報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:105
msgid "Emission factors"
msgstr "排放係數"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:107
msgid ""
"An emission factor is a coefficient that indicates the rate at which a "
"specific activity emits greenhouse gases into the atmosphere."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:111
msgid "Source database"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:113
msgid ""
"Import the data from a certified emission factors database by going to "
":menuselection:`ESG --> Configuration --> Source Databases`. Click "
":guilabel:`Download` on the `ADEME <https://www.ademe.fr/en/our-"
"missions/data>`_ database to import its emission factors and sources."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`ESG --> 配置 --> 來源資料庫`，從經認證的排放系數資料庫匯"
"入資料。點擊 :guilabel:`下載` 以匯入 `ADEME <https://www.ademe.fr/en/our-"
"missions/data>`_ 資料庫的排放系數及來源。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:118
msgid "Main components of an emission factor"
msgstr "排放因子的主要組成部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:121
msgid "Source"
msgstr "來源"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:123
msgid ""
"Each emission factor is assigned to a scope, following the GHG Protocol:"
msgstr "每個排放系數都會根據《溫室氣體盤查議定書》（GHG Protocol）分配至相應範疇："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:125
msgid ""
"Scope 1 – Direct emissions (e.g., fuel burned on-site or in company "
"vehicles)"
msgstr "範圍 1 – 直接排放（例如：在現場或公司車輛中燃燒的燃料）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:126
msgid ""
"Scope 2 – Indirect emissions from purchased energy (e.g., electricity or "
"heat)"
msgstr "範疇 2 – 來自外購能源（例如電力或熱能）的間接排放"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:127
msgid ""
"Scope 3 – All other indirect emissions across the value chain (e.g., "
"purchased goods, travel, waste)"
msgstr "範疇 3 – 價值鏈中的所有其他間接排放（例如：採購貨品、商務旅遊、廢棄物）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:130
msgid ""
"Scopes can be structured hierarchically (parent-child) for more detailed "
"categorization, such as \"Scope 3: Others Indirect > Purchased Goods > "
"Electronics\"."
msgstr ""
"範疇可採用層級結構（父子關係）進行更細緻的分類，例如「範疇 3：其他間接排放 > "
"外購商品 > 電子產品」。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:134
msgid "Uncertainty"
msgstr "不確定性"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:136
msgid ""
"Uncertainty represents the potential margin of error in an emission factor. "
"It reflects how precise or reliable the factor is when estimating emissions "
"for a given activity, based on the quality of data, assumptions used, and "
"calculation methodology."
msgstr ""
"不確定性代表排放系數的潛在誤差範圍。它根據數據質素、所採用的假設及計算方法，"
"反映該系數在估算特定活動排放量時的精確度或可靠程度。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:140
msgid ""
"It helps you assess the confidence level of the emissions data used in the "
"reporting."
msgstr "這有助您評估報告中所用排放數據的可信度。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:143
msgid "Compute method"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:145
msgid ""
"The compute method determines whether emissions are calculated using "
"physical quantities (e.g., kg, liters, units) or monetary values (e.g., € "
"spent). In physical mode, the system uses the quantity from the transaction "
"(e.g., 10 units × :abbr:`EF (emission factor)` per unit). In monetary mode, "
"it uses the transaction amount (e.g., €500 × :abbr:`EF (emission factor)` "
"per €)."
msgstr ""
"計算方法決定排放量是以物理數量（例如公斤、公升、單位）還是貨幣價值（例如消費"
"歐元金額）來計算。在物理模式下，系統會使用交易中的數量（例如：10 個單位 × 每"
"單位 :abbr:`EF (排放係數)`）。在貨幣模式下，系統會使用交易金額（例如：€500 × "
"每歐元 :abbr:`EF (排放係數)`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:151
msgid "Gas emissions lines"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:153
msgid ""
"Each emission factor can include multiple gas emission lines, representing "
"the different greenhouse gases involved in the activity. The ESG app "
"includes the six main gases from the Kyoto Protocol — CO₂, CH₄, N₂O, HFCs, "
"PFCs, SF₆ — each with a predefined Global Warming Potential (GWP) used to "
"convert them into a common unit: CO₂-equivalent (kgCO₂e)."
msgstr ""
"每個排放系數可包含多行氣體排放資料，代表該活動涉及的不同溫室氣體。ESG 應用程"
"式包含《京都議定書》中的六種主要氣體——CO₂、CH₄、N₂O、HFCs、PFCs、SF₆——每種均"
"設有預定義的全球暖化潛勢（GWP），用於將其換算為通用單位：二氧化碳當量（kgCO₂e"
"）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:159
msgid ""
"Add more specific gases by going to :menuselection:`ESG --> Configuration "
"--> Gases`."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`ESG --> 配置 --> 氣體`，即可新增更多特定氣體。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:161
msgid ""
"Each gas line can be linked to an activity type such as production, "
"transport, or use, allowing for detailed breakdowns in your emissions "
"reporting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:164
msgid ""
"The final emission factor value is the sum of all these gases’ emissions "
"converted into CO₂-equivalents."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:168
msgid "Assignation rules"
msgstr "指派規則"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:170
msgid ""
"Assignation rules allow emission factors to be automatically applied to "
"relevant activity data based on specific criteria: the product, partner, "
"and/or account involved in the transaction."
msgstr ""
"指派規則可讓你根據特定條件（例如交易涉及的產品、合作夥伴及／或會計科目），自"
"動將排放系數套用至相關活動數據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:174
msgid ""
"You have assigned an emission factor to the *Zenith Pro Computer* product "
"and later receive a vendor bill for 150 units; the system automatically "
"applies the assigned emission factor, multiplying the emission factor's "
"emissions (kgCO₂e) by 150."
msgstr ""
"您已為 *Zenith Pro Computer* 產品指派排放係數，隨後收到一張 150 件的供應商帳"
"單；系統會自動套用所指派的排放係數，將該排放係數的排放量（kgCO₂e）乘以 150。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:178
msgid ""
"To define assignation rules on emissions factors, go to :menuselection:`ESG "
"--> Configuration --> Emission Factors` and select an emission factor. Under"
" the :guilabel:`Assignations` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line`, and select "
"a record for one or more of the following attributes: :guilabel:`Product`, "
":guilabel:`Partner`, and :guilabel:`Account`."
msgstr ""
"要為排放係數定義分配規則，請前往 :menuselection:`ESG --> 配置 --> 排放係數`，"
"並選擇一個排放係數。在 :guilabel:`分配` 分頁下，點擊 :guilabel:`新增資料行`，"
"然後為以下一個或多個屬性選擇記錄：:guilabel:`產品`、:guilabel:`合作夥伴` 及 "
":guilabel:`科目`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:183
msgid "All attributes have to match for the rule to be applied."
msgstr "必須符合所有屬性，才能套用該規則。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:186
msgid ""
"Ensure the unit of measure set next to the product's :guilabel:`Cost` "
"matches the emission factor's :guilabel:`Unit of Measure`."
msgstr ""
"請確保產品 :guilabel:`成本` 旁邊設定的計量單位與排放係數的 :guilabel:`計量單"
"位` 相符。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:189
msgid "A product's unit of measure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:192
msgid ""
"If the field is not displayed, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Settings` and enable the :guilabel:`Units of Measure & "
"Packagings` option."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:196
msgid ""
"Accounting journal entries with a missing emission factor can be found by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Emissions to define` under the :guilabel:`Collect "
"Emissions` card on the dashboard."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`待定義排放量`（位於儀表板 :guilabel:`收集排放量` 卡片下），即"
"可尋找缺少排放係數的會計日記賬分錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:200
msgid "Rules priority"
msgstr "規則優先次序"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:202
msgid ""
"When multiple assignation rules match, Odoo prioritizes the most specific "
"rule based on the following criteria:"
msgstr "當有多個指派規則相符時，Odoo 會根據以下準則優先採用最具體的規則："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:205
msgid ""
"Attribute specificity: Odoo first evaluates rules by the most precise "
"attribute, following this priority hierarchy (from most to least specific):"
msgstr ""
"屬性精確度：Odoo 會先根據最精確的屬性評估規則，並遵循以下優先順序層級（由最具"
"體到最不具體）："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:212
msgid ""
"Attribute count: if multiple rules share the same level of attribute "
"specificity, Odoo then considers the number of attributes in the rule. The "
"rule with more attributes defined will take priority."
msgstr ""

