#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:281
msgid ""
"Once your emission factors are configured with assignation rules, you can "
"also apply them retroactively to past activity data."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:284
msgid ""
"To do so, go to :menuselection:`ESG -->  Configuration --> Emission "
"Factors`, select an emission factor, and click :guilabel:`Assign`. Select an"
" :guilabel:`Application Period`, and, if desired, enable the "
":guilabel:`Replace existing assignations` option."
msgstr ""
"為此，請前往 :menuselection:`ESG --> 配置 --> 排放因子`，選擇一個排放因子，然"
"後按一下 :guilabel:`指派`。選擇一個 :guilabel:`適用期間`，如有需要，亦可啟用 "
":guilabel:`替換現有指派` 選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:289
msgid ""
"Apply emission factors in bulk by selecting multiple emission factors in "
":icon:`oi-view-list` list view and clicking :icon:`fa-cog` "
"(:guilabel:`Actions`) :menuselection:`--> Assign Emission Factors`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:294
msgid "Sex parity and pay gap"
msgstr "性別平權與薪酬差距"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:296
msgid ""
"Sex parity tracks the distribution of sexes across the workforce, such as "
"comparing women and men in technical vs. administrative roles, permanent vs."
" temporary contracts, different office locations, or management vs. non-"
"management positions."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:300
msgid ""
"These insights, based on employee data, are essential for CSRD reporting "
"under ESRS S1 and will also support future VSME standards."
msgstr ""
"這些基於員工數據的洞察分析對於符合 ESRS S1 的 CSRD 報告至關重要，同時亦將支援"
"未來的 VSME 標準。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:303
msgid ""
"To view a company's sex parity and pay gap measures, set the sex of each "
"employee by opening the :guilabel:`Employees` app and selecting an employee."
" Under the :guilabel:`Private Information` tab, select the employee's "
":guilabel:`Gender`."
msgstr ""
"若要檢視公司的性別平等及薪酬差距指標，請開啟 :guilabel:`員工` 應用程式並選擇"
"一名員工，以設定每位員工的性別。在 :guilabel:`私人資料` 分頁下，選擇員工的 "
":guilabel:`性別`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:307
msgid ""
"The pay gap is calculated using the wages set on the employees' Payroll "
"contracts for the same jobs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:309
msgid "Pay gap formula"
msgstr "薪酬差距公式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:311
msgid ""
"((`Average male salary` – `Average female salary`) / `Average male salary`) "
"× `100`"
msgstr "((`男性平均薪酬` – `女性平均薪酬`) / `男性平均薪酬`) × `100`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:313
msgid ""
"Access the measures by clicking :menuselection:`ESG --> Measure --> Sex "
"Parity / Pay Gap`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:316
msgid ""
"Use the different :ref:`Group By <search/group>` options to break down the "
"data by :guilabel:`Leadership Level`, :guilabel:`Department`, :guilabel:`Job"
" Position`, :guilabel:`Contract Type`, or :guilabel:`Country`."
msgstr ""
"使用不同的 :ref:`分組 <search/group>` 選項，按 :guilabel:`領導層"
"級`、:guilabel:`部門`、:guilabel:`職位`、:guilabel:`合約類型` 或 "
":guilabel:`國家/地區` 細分數據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:320
msgid "The sex parity graph filtering options"
msgstr "性別均等圖表篩選選項"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:324
msgid "Initiatives"
msgstr "倡議"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:326
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`ESG --> Act --> Initiatives` to access all the "
":doc:`Project <../services/project>` features, and start taking action on "
"your impact. You can estimate CO₂ savings for each task, track progress, and"
" assign team members with deadlines."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`ESG --> 行動 --> 倡議` 即可存取所有 :doc:`項目 <../"
"services/project>` 功能，並開始就你的影響採取行動。你可以估算每項任務的 CO₂ "
"減排量、追蹤進度，並為團隊成員指派截止日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/esg.rst:331
msgid ""
"Estimated CO₂ reductions do not immediately lower your carbon footprint. The"
" real impact shows only when these reductions are reflected in your "
"operations."
msgstr ""
"預計 CO₂ 減排量不會立即降低您的碳足跡。只有當這些減排措施反映在您的營運中時，"
"才會顯現實際影響。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:3
msgid "Process expenses"
msgstr "處理開支"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:5
msgid ""
"Once expenses have been created and submitted, they must be processed by an "
"authorized database user. In Odoo, most users cannot process expenses; only "
"users with the necessary :doc:`access rights "
"<../../general/users/access_rights>` or permissions can. This means that a "
"user **must** have at least *Team Approver* rights for the **Expenses** app."
" Employees with the necessary rights can review expenses, approve or refuse "
"them, and provide feedback with an integrated :ref:`refuse expense "
"<expenses/refuse-report>` communication tool."
msgstr ""
"建立並提交開支後，必須由獲授權的資料庫用戶處理。在 Odoo 中，大多數用戶都無法"
"處理開支，只有具備所需 :doc:`存取權限 <../../general/users/access_rights>` 或"
"許可的用戶方可處理。這表示用戶 **必須** 至少擁有 **開支** 應用程式的 *團隊審"
"批人* 權限。具備所需權限的員工可審核開支、批核或拒絕開支，並透過整合的 "
":ref:`拒絕開支 <expenses/refuse-report>` 溝通工具提供意見。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:13
msgid "View expenses"
msgstr "檢視開支"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:15
msgid ""
"Users who are able to process expenses (typically managers) can view all "
"expenses they have access rights for in the *Expenses to Process* dashboard."
" To view the dashboard, navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app --> My "
"Expenses --> Expenses to Process`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:19
msgid ""
"A list of all expenses with a status of :guilabel:`Submit` appears, while "
"expenses with a status of :guilabel:`Draft`, :guilabel:`Approved`, "
":guilabel:`Posted`, :guilabel:`In Payment`, :guilabel:`Paid`, or "
":guilabel:`Refused` are hidden by default. To view expenses with a different"
" status, click the corresponding :guilabel:`Status` button in the side "
"panel."
msgstr ""
"畫面上會顯示所有狀態為 :guilabel:`提交` 的開支清單，而狀態為 :guilabel:`草"
"稿`、:guilabel:`已核准`、:guilabel:`已過賬`、:guilabel:`付款"
"中`、:guilabel:`已付款` 或 :guilabel:`已拒絕` 的開支預設會隱藏。如要查看其他"
"狀態的開支，請點擊側邊欄中相應的 :guilabel:`狀態` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:24
msgid "Expenses to validate are found on the Expenses to Process dashboard."
msgstr "需要驗證的開支可在「待處理開支」儀表板中找到。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:28
msgid "Approve expenses"
msgstr "批核開支"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:30
msgid ""
"Expenses can be approved in two ways: :ref:`individually "
"<expenses/individual>` or :ref:`in bulk <expenses/multiple>`."
msgstr ""
"開支可透過兩種方式審批：:ref:`逐一 <expenses/individual>`或:ref:`批量 "
"<expenses/multiple>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:34
msgid "Only reports with a status of :guilabel:`Submitted` can be approved."
msgstr "只有狀態為:guilabel:`已提交`的報表才可獲批核。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:39
msgid "Approve individual expenses"
msgstr "批核個別開支"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:41
msgid ""
"To approve an individual expense, navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app "
"--> My Expenses --> Expenses to Process`, and click on an individual expense"
" to view the details."
msgstr ""
"要批核個別費用，請前往:menuselection:`費用應用程式 --> 我的費用 --> 待處理費"
"用`，然後點擊個別費用以查看詳情。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:44
msgid ""
"From here, several options are presented: :guilabel:`Post Journal Entries`, "
":guilabel:`Report in Next Payslip` :guilabel:`Approve`, :guilabel:`Refuse`, "
":guilabel:`Reset`, :guilabel:`Split Expense`, and :guilabel:`Attach "
"Receipt`. Click :guilabel:`Approve` to approve the expense."
msgstr ""
"此處提供多個選項：:guilabel:`過賬日記賬記項`、:guilabel:`於下次糧單申"
"報`、:guilabel:`批准`、:guilabel:`拒絕`、:guilabel:`重設`、:guilabel:`拆分開"
"支` 及 :guilabel:`附加收據`。點擊 :guilabel:`批准` 以批准該開支。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:48
msgid "An individual expense report that can be approved or refused."
msgstr "可予批准或拒絕的個別開支報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:54
msgid "Approve multiple expenses"
msgstr "批准多項開支"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:56
msgid ""
"To approve multiple expenses at once, first navigate to "
":menuselection:`Expenses app --> My Expenses --> Expenses to Process` to "
"view a list of all expenses waiting to be processed. Next, select the "
"expenses to approve by ticking the checkbox next to each expense being "
"approved, or tick the checkbox next to the :guilabel:`Employee` column title"
" to select all the expenses in the list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:61
msgid "Next, click the :guilabel:`Approve` button."
msgstr "接著，點擊 :guilabel:`批准` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:63
msgid "Select multiple expense reports at once."
msgstr "同時選擇多份開支報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:67
msgid ""
"Team managers can view all the expenses for their team members only. While "
"on the :guilabel:`Expenses to Process` page, click the :icon:`fa-caret-down`"
" :guilabel:`(down arrow)` on the right-side of the search bar, then click "
":guilabel:`My Team` in the :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`Filters` section. "
"This presents all the expenses for only the manager's team."
msgstr ""
"團隊經理只可檢視其團隊成員的所有開支。在 :guilabel:`待處理開支` 頁面，按一下"
"搜尋列右側的 :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`（向下箭頭）`，然後按一下 "
":guilabel:`我的團隊`（位於 :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`篩選條件` 部分）。這"
"樣便只會顯示該經理團隊的所有開支。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:75
msgid "Refuse expenses"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:77
msgid ""
"Expenses can **only** be refused individually, and **not** from the "
":guilabel:`Expenses to Process` dashboard. To refuse an individual expense, "
"navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app --> My expenses --> Expenses to "
"Process`, then click on an individual expense to open the detailed expense "
"record."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:81
msgid ""
"If more information is needed, such as a missing receipt, communicate any "
"necessary information requests in the *chatter* of the expense record. On "
"the individual expense, click either :guilabel:`Send message` or "
":guilabel:`Log note` to open a message text box."
msgstr ""
"如果需要更多資料（例如遺漏收據），請在開支記錄的 *聊天室* 中提出任何必要的資"
"料要求。在個別開支上，點擊 :guilabel:`發送訊息` 或 :guilabel:`記錄備註` 以開"
"啟訊息文字方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:85
msgid ""
"Type in a message, tagging the proper people, and post it to the *chatter* "
"by clicking :guilabel:`Send` or :guilabel:`Log`, depending on the method of "
"communication. The message is posted in the chatter, and the tagged people "
"are notified via email."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:90
msgid ""
"The only people that can be tagged in a message are *followers* of the "
"specific expense. To see who is a follower, click the :icon:`fa-user-o` "
":guilabel:`(Show Followers)` icon to display the followers of the expense "
"report. Additional followers can be added by clicking the :icon:`fa-user-o` "
":guilabel:`(Show Followers)` icon, then clicking :guilabel:`Add Followers`."
msgstr ""
"只有該特定開支的 *關注者* 才可在訊息中被標記。要查看關注者名單，請按一下 "
":icon:`fa-user-o` :guilabel:`(顯示關注者)` 圖示，以顯示該開支報告的關注者。如"
"要新增其他關注者，請按一下 :icon:`fa-user-o` :guilabel:`(顯示關注者)` 圖示，"
"然後按一下 :guilabel:`新增關注者`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:95
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:104
msgid "Send messages in the chatter."
msgstr "在溝通欄中發送訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:98
msgid ""
"To refuse an expense, click :guilabel:`Refuse`, and a *Refuse Expense* pop-"
"up window loads. Enter a brief explanation for the refusal in the "
":guilabel:`Reason` field, then click :guilabel:`Refuse`."
msgstr ""
"如要拒絕開支，請按一下:guilabel:`拒絕`，系統隨即會載入*拒絕開支*彈出視窗。請"
"在:guilabel:`原因`欄位中簡要輸入拒絕說明，然後按一下:guilabel:`拒絕`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:102
msgid ""
"A reason **must** be entered in the :guilabel:`Reason` field, or the expense"
" cannot be refused."
msgstr "**必須** 在 :guilabel:`原因` 欄位輸入原因，否則無法拒絕該開支。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/approve_expenses.rst:107
msgid ""
"Once the expense is refused, the status changes to :guilabel:`Refused`, and "
"the only buttons that appear are :guilabel:`Add Receipt` and "
":guilabel:`Reset`."
msgstr ""
"開支被拒絕後，狀態會變更為 :guilabel:`已拒絕`，並只會顯示 :guilabel:`新增收"
"據` 及 :guilabel:`重設` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:3
msgid "Expense cards"
msgstr "開支卡"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo offers physical and virtual expense cards, allowing for better expense "
"tracking and management. Using expense cards allows for real time expense "
"management, creating expense records as soon as an expense transaction "
"occurs, allowing management greater visibility of expense costs as they are "
"incurred."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 提供實體及虛擬開支卡，有助更有效地追蹤及管理開支。使用開支卡可實現即時開"
"支管理，在開支交易發生時隨即建立開支記錄，讓管理層在費用產生時更清楚掌握開支"
"成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:10
msgid ""
"The elimination of the need to :doc:`actively create expense records "
"<log_expenses>` allows for a more streamlined expense workflow, with records"
" automatically created as purchases are made."
msgstr ""
"省卻:doc:`主動建立開支記錄 <log_expenses>`的需要，可在進行採購時自動建立記錄"
"，讓開支工作流程更為精簡流暢。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:13
msgid ""
"To use expense cards, first a :ref:`card is configured <expenses/card-"
"configure>`, then it is :ref:`activated <expenses/card-activate>`. Before "
"employees can make purchases with their expense card, a :ref:`Stripe account"
" must be created <expenses/create-stripe>` and configured, then :ref:`funds "
"must be added <expenses/add-funds>` to the company's Stripe account. Once "
"there is money available in the account (this typically takes 2-3 business "
"days for the transfer to Stripe), employees can use their expense cards, and"
" the money is pulled from the company's Stripe account."
msgstr ""
"要使用開支卡，須先 :ref:`設定開支卡 <expenses/card-configure>`，然後將其 "
":ref:`啟用 <expenses/card-activate>`。在員工使用開支卡消費前，必須先 :ref:`建"
"立 Stripe 帳戶 <expenses/create-stripe>` 並進行設定，然後為公司的 Stripe 帳"
"戶 :ref:`存入資金 <expenses/add-funds>`。當帳戶內有可用資金後（轉帳至 Stripe "
"通常需時 2 至 3 個工作天），員工即可使用其開支卡，款項將從公司的 Stripe 帳戶"
"中扣除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:21
msgid ""
"To create and use expense cards, both the **Accounting** and **Invoicing** "
"apps **must** be :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"要建立及使用開支卡，**必須** :ref:`安裝 <general/install>` **會計** 及 **發票"
"管理** 兩個應用程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:24
msgid ""
"To access confidential card data (card number and CVV for virtual cards; PIN"
" for physical cards), the employee **must** have a :doc:`user "
"<../../general/users>` profile. These details can **only** be accessed "
"through that profile."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:29
msgid ""
"Expense cards act like pre-paid debit cards, as they can **only** be used "
"with a connected Stripe account, and **only** if funds are added to that "
"account, to be drawn from."
msgstr ""
"開支卡類似預付扣賬卡，因為它們**僅可**配合已連結的 Stripe 賬戶使用，且**僅"
"當**該賬戶已存入資金以供動用時方可使用。"

