msgstr "只有位於這些國家/地區之一的公司，方可建立及使用開支卡。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:54
msgid "Fees"
msgstr "費用"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:56
msgid ""
"Odoo covers **all fees** associated with creating virtual and physical "
"cards."
msgstr "Odoo 承擔與建立虛擬卡及實體卡相關的 **所有費用**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:63
msgid ""
"Two settings must be configured to use expense cards. Navigate to "
":menuselection:`Expenses app --> Configuration --> Settings`. Tick the box "
"next to :guilabel:`Expense Card`, then click :guilabel:`Save`. The "
":guilabel:`Settings` page reloads, and two fields now appear beneath the "
":guilabel:`Expense Card` option."
msgstr ""
"必須設定兩項功能才可使用開支卡。請前往:menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 配"
"置 --> 設定`。剔選:guilabel:`開支卡`旁邊的方格，然後點擊:guilabel:`儲"
"存`。:guilabel:`設定`頁面會重新載入，而:guilabel:`開支卡`選項下方會隨即顯示兩"
"個欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:68
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Journal` field with :guilabel:`Stripe Issuing` appears, "
"populating the field. This is the default journal, and it is **not** "
"recommended to alter this unless instructed by the accounting department."
msgstr ""
"畫面會顯示 :guilabel:`日記賬` 欄位，並自動填入 :guilabel:`Stripe Issuing`。這"
"是預設日記賬，除非會計部門另有指示，否則**不**建議更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:72
msgid ""
"Next, click the text link :guilabel:`terms and conditions` and an "
":guilabel:`Expense Cards Terms and Conditions` pop-up window loads, with all"
" the details of the agreement. After this has been read, click "
":guilabel:`Close`, then tick the checkbox next to :guilabel:`I confirm "
"agreeing to the terms and conditions` to accept the terms, then click "
":guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"接下來，按一下文字連結 :guilabel:`條款及細則`，系統會載入 :guilabel:`開支卡條"
"款及細則` 彈出式視窗，當中包含協議的所有詳細資料。閱讀完畢後，按一下 "
":guilabel:`關閉`，再剔選 :guilabel:`本人確認同意條款及細則` 旁的剔選方格以接"
"受條款，然後按一下 :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:78
msgid "The terms and conditions **must** be agreed to use expense cards."
msgstr "使用開支卡**必須**同意條款及細則。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:80
msgid ""
"After agreeing to the terms and conditions, :ref:`create a Stripe connected "
"account <expenses/create-stripe>`."
msgstr "同意條款及細則後，:ref:`建立 Stripe 關聯帳戶 <expenses/create-stripe>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:86
msgid "Create Stripe connected account"
msgstr "建立 Stripe 關聯賬戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:88
msgid ""
"To create a Stripe connected account, open the **Expenses** app, and ensure "
"the :guilabel:`Expense Card` option is enabled. Next, click :icon:`oi-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`Connect` to create a new Stripe Issuing connect account."
msgstr ""
"要建立 Stripe 關聯帳戶，請開啟 **開支** 應用程式，並確保已啟用 :guilabel:`開"
"支卡` 選項。接著，點擊 :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`連接` 以建立新的 "
"Stripe Issuing 關聯帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:92
msgid ""
"Fill in the KYC questionnaire provided by Stripe. Stripe takes +/-24 hours "
"to approve or refuse account creation requests."
msgstr "填寫 Stripe 提供的 KYC 問卷。Stripe 需要約 24 小時審批或拒絕賬戶建立申請。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:95
msgid ""
"A green :guilabel:`Verified` tag now appears next to :icon:`oi-arrow-left` "
":guilabel:`Refresh`, indicating the account is properly configured."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:98
msgid ""
"Once the account is verified, the company must :ref:`add funds "
"<expenses/add-funds>` to their Stripe balance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:104
msgid "Add funds to Stripe account"
msgstr "為 Stripe 帳戶加入資金"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:106
msgid ""
"For employees to use their expense cards, funds must be available in the "
"company's Stripe account, to make purchases against. To add funds to the "
"company's Stripe account, open the **Accounting** app. On the "
":guilabel:`Stripe Issuing` Kanban card, click :guilabel:`Top-up`, and a "
":guilabel:`Top-up` pop-up window loads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:111
msgid ""
"Enter the amount being transferred into the account in the "
":guilabel:`Amount` field. The :guilabel:`IBAN` and :guilabel:`BIC` fields "
"are populated according to the Stripe configuration and cannot be changed. "
"When configured, click :guilabel:`Topup`, and the transfer is initiated."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`金額` 欄位輸入要轉入帳戶的金額。:guilabel:`IBAN` 及 "
":guilabel:`BIC` 欄位會根據 Stripe 設定自動填入，無法更改。設定完成後，點擊 "
":guilabel:`增值`，系統便會啟動轉賬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:116
msgid ""
"The user wires money to the IBAN shown using a SEPA Credit Transfer (for the"
" EURO Zone). The Stripe issuing partner bank is `Circle Bank`."
msgstr ""
"用戶使用 SEPA 信用轉賬（適用於歐元區）將資金電匯至顯示的 IBAN。Stripe 發卡合"
"作銀行為 `Circle Bank`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:120
msgid ""
"It typically takes 2-3 business days for transfers to be processed. Funds "
"are **not** available until the transfer is complete."
msgstr "轉賬通常需要 2 至 3 個工作天處理。在轉賬完成前，資金 **無法** 動用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:126
msgid "Configure expense cards"
msgstr "配置開支卡"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:128
msgid ""
"To create and configure a new expense card, click :menuselection:`Cards` in "
"the main **Expenses** app menu to view the :guilabel:`Cards` dashboard. "
"Click :guilabel:`New` and a blank :guilabel:`Cards` form loads. Enter the "
"following information on the form:"
msgstr ""
"如要建立及設定新開支卡，請在 **開支** 應用程式主選單中按一下 "
":menuselection:`卡片`，以檢視 :guilabel:`卡片` 儀表板。按一下 :guilabel:`新"
"增`，系統會載入空白的 :guilabel:`卡片` 表單。請在表單中輸入以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:132
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Card Name`: The first line on the card form is blank, and "
"displays `Draft`. Enter a name for the card in this field. This does **not**"
" need to be a person's name, it can be something descriptive to explain the "
"use of the card."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`卡名稱`：卡表單的第一行是空白的，並顯示 `草稿`。請在此欄位輸入卡的"
"名稱。這 **不需要** 是人名，可以是說明該卡用途的描述性名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:137
msgid ""
"An employee is going on a week-long business trip to Berlin to visit many "
"clients. The employee needs to pay for meals, transportation, and other "
"business-related expenses. Since this is a short trip, a virtual card is "
"created to capture all the expenses, with the name `Business Trip - Berlin`."
msgstr ""
"一名員工將前往柏林出差一週，拜訪多名客戶。員工需要支付餐飲、交通及其他商務相"
"關開支。由於這是短期出差，系統建立了一張名為 `商務出差 - 柏林` 的虛擬卡，以記"
"錄所有開支。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:142
msgid ""
"The marketing department pays for many expenses throughout the year, from "
"email marketing services, venue rentals for events, promotional merchandise,"
" etc. Since the expenses do not have an end date, and it is used for an "
"entire department, a physical card is ordered with the name `Marketing`."
msgstr ""
"市場推廣部全年會支付多項開支，包括電郵市場推廣服務、活動場地租賃、宣傳商品等"
"。由於這些開支沒有結束日期，而且供整個部門使用，因此訂購了一張名為 "
"`Marketing` 的實體卡。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:147
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cardholder`: Select the person using the card from the drop-down "
"menu. Once selected, the person's name populates the :guilabel:`Draft` "
"field, above :guilabel:`Cardholder`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`持卡人`：從下拉式選單中選擇使用該卡的人員。選擇後，該人員的姓名會"
"填入 :guilabel:`草稿` 欄位，位於 :guilabel:`持卡人` 上方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:149
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Update info`: Next to the cardholder's name, click "
":guilabel:`Update info` and a :guilabel:`Cardholder Configuration` pop-up "
"window loads. Update the cardholder's name, birthday, phone number, email, "
"and physical address. All the requested information **must** be populated, "
"as it is used to create the expense card with Stripe, and to verify the "
"cardholder's identity, when needed. If any information is missing from this "
"form, the card **cannot** be created, and an error appears when creating or "
"ordering the card."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`更新資料`：在持卡人姓名旁邊，點擊 :guilabel:`更新資料`，隨即會載"
"入 :guilabel:`持卡人設定` 彈出式視窗。更新持卡人的姓名、出生日期、電話號碼、"
"電郵地址及實際地址。您 **必須** 填寫所有要求的資料，因為這些資料將用於透過 "
"Stripe 建立開支卡，並在有需要時核實持卡人身份。若此表單中缺少任何資料，便 "
"**無法** 建立開支卡，並在建立或訂購開支卡時出現錯誤訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:157
msgid ""
"The phone number listed is used for two-factor authentication. The phone "
"number can be changed in the future. When changing the phone number, an "
"alert is sent to the original phone number, notifying them of the change."
msgstr ""
"所列的電話號碼用於雙重認證。電話號碼日後可以更改。更改電話號碼時，系統會向原"
"電話號碼發送通知訊息，告知該項變更。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:161
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Type`: Click the radio button next to the desired *type* of "
"expense card. Options are:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`類型`：點按所需開支卡 *類型* 旁邊的選項按鈕。選項包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:163
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Physical`: A physical card is printed and mailed out to the "
"employee. If selected, a :guilabel:`Delivery Address` field appears. Using "
"the drop-down menu, select the employee or company address the card is "
"mailed to."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`實體卡`：印製實體卡並郵寄給員工。如果選擇此項，畫面會顯示 "
":guilabel:`送貨地址` 欄位。請使用下拉式選單，選擇郵寄卡片的員工或公司地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:166
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Virtual`: Virtual cards are available instantaneously once the "
"card configuration is completed and the card is activated."
msgstr ":guilabel:`虛擬`：完成卡設定並啟用卡片後，虛擬卡即可即時使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:169
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: Select the company the expenses are associated with "
"using the drop-down menu. Each card must be associated with a single "
"company, and are **not** available for use between all companies or branches"
" in the database. Ensure the selected company has its own Stripe Connect "
"account configured, or the expense cards will not work."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`公司`：使用下拉式選單選擇與開支關聯的公司。每張卡必須關聯至單一公"
"司，且 **無法** 在資料庫中的所有公司或分公司之間共用。請確保所選公司已設定專"
"屬的 Stripe Connect 帳戶，否則開支卡將無法運作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:173
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Stripe Journal`: :guilabel:`Stripe Issuing` populates this field "
"by default, and cannot be modified."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`Stripe 日記賬`：:guilabel:`Stripe Issuing` 會預設填入此欄位，且不"
"可修改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:176
msgid ""
"Next, configure the following fields in the :guilabel:`Spending Policy` tab "
"of the card form:"
msgstr "接下來，在卡表格的 :guilabel:`消費政策` 分頁中設定以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:178
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Countries`: Using the drop-down menu, select the countries the "
"card is able to be used in. The company's country location populates this "
"field, by default. All other countries the employee may travel to or "
"purchase expensable items from, should be included in this list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:181
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Categories`: If the expense card is limited to purchase items "
"within a specific *category*, select them using the drop-down menu. If this "
"field is left blank, the card may be used for *any* expense category."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`類別`：如果開支卡只限購買特定 *類別* 的項目，請使用下拉式選單選擇"
"該等類別。如果此欄位留空，該卡可用於 *任何* 開支類別。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:185
msgid ""
"Odoo is able to categorize transactions based on the :abbr:`MCC (Merchant "
"Category Code)` provided by the card network provider (such as Mastercard). "
"Every merchant has a corresponding :abbr:`MCC (Merchant Category Code)` that"
" identifies their business and product types. When a Stripe-issued card is "
"used, the :abbr:`MCC (Merchant Category Code)` is sent with the transaction,"
" allowing Stripe to approve or block it based on the card's configuration."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 能夠根據發卡網絡供應商（例如 Mastercard）提供的 :abbr:`MCC (商戶類別代"
"碼)` 來為交易分類。每個商戶都有一個對應的 :abbr:`MCC (商戶類別代碼)`，用以識"
"別其業務及產品類型。當使用 Stripe 發行的卡時，:abbr:`MCC (商戶類別代碼)` 會隨"
"交易一同傳送，讓 Stripe 根據該卡的配置批准或封鎖交易。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:192
msgid ""
"A company issues an expense card that is only authorized for airline, train,"
" and taxi travel expenses."
msgstr "公司發出了一張僅授權用於機票、火車及的士差旅費用的開支卡。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:195
msgid ""
"To configure this, click into the :guilabel:`Category` field, and click "
":guilabel:`Search more...` at the bottom. In the :guilabel:`Search: "
"Categories` pop-up window, click into the search bar and click "
":guilabel:`Transportation services` in the :icon:`fa-filter` "
":guilabel:`Filters` column."
msgstr ""
"要進行此設定，請點擊:guilabel:`類別`欄位，然後點擊底部的:guilabel:`搜尋更"
"多...`。在:guilabel:`搜尋：類別`彈出視窗中，點擊搜尋欄並點擊:guilabel:`運輸服"
"務`（位於:icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`篩選`欄內）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:200
msgid ""
"Next, tick the checkboxes next to the desired transportation categories. In "
"this example, only :guilabel:`Railroads`, :guilabel:`Passenger Railways`, "
":guilabel:`Taxicabs Limousines`, and :guilabel:`Airlines Air Carriers` are "
"selected."
msgstr ""
"接下來，勾選所需運輸類別旁邊的核取方塊。在此範例中，僅選取了:guilabel:`鐵"
"路`、:guilabel:`客運鐵路`、:guilabel:`的士及豪華轎車`及:guilabel:`航空公司及"
"航空承運商`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:204
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Select` and the selected transportation categories now "
"populate the :guilabel:`Categories` field."
msgstr "按一下:guilabel:`選取`，所選的運輸類別隨即會填入:guilabel:`類別`欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:207
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Limit`: Configure the two spending limits for the card. The first"
" configuration sets the total expense amount allowed during a specific time "
"period. Using the drop-down menu after the word :guilabel:`per`, select the "
"time period the limit applies to. The available options are: "
":guilabel:`Day`, :guilabel:`Week`, :guilabel:`Month`, :guilabel:`Year`, or "
":guilabel:`All Time`. Next, enter the maximum amount allowed for the "
"selected time period."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`限額`：設定此卡的兩項消費限額。第一項設定為特定時段內允許的總開支"
"金額。使用:guilabel:`每`一詞後的下拉式選單，選擇限額適用的時段。可用選項包括"
"：:guilabel:`日`、:guilabel:`週`、:guilabel:`月`、:guilabel:`年`或:guilabel:`全"
"部時間`。接著，輸入所選時段內允許的最高金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:213
msgid ""
"Next, set the *per transaction* limit. Enter the maximum amount that can be "
"charged on the expense card in a single transaction in the field."
msgstr ""
"接下來，設定 *單筆交易* 限額。在該欄位輸入開支卡於單次交易中可扣賬的最高金額"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:217
msgid ""
"A company allows employees to purchase airline tickets that are less than "
"$1,000.00 total. Additionally, there is a monthly cap of $3,000.00 for all "
"expenses."
msgstr ""
"某公司允許員工購買總金額少於 $1,000.00 的機票。此外，所有開支設有每月 "
"$3,000.00 的上限。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:220
msgid ""
"The company would configure the limit as follows: `3,000.00` per "
":guilabel:`Month` and `1,000.00` per transaction."
msgstr "公司會將限額設定如下：每 :guilabel:`月` `3,000.00`，以及每宗交易 `1,000.00`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:224
msgid ""
"Card limits can be modified at any point. Once modified, they immediately go"
" into effect."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:227
msgid ""
"All expense cards pull payments from a single Stripe account. It is "
"recommended to set card limits to avoid large charges or transactions that "
"may prematurely deplete the expense Stripe account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:231
msgid "An expense card form filled out for transportation and food only."
msgstr "僅用於填報交通及膳食費用的開支卡表格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:237
msgid "Activate expense cards"
msgstr "啟用開支卡"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:239
msgid ""
"Once an expense card is configured, the next step is to activate the cards. "
"First, navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app --> Cards`, and the "
":guilabel:`Cards` dashboard loads, displaying all expense cards in a Kanban "
"view."
msgstr ""
"設定開支卡後，下一步是啟用該卡。首先，前往 :menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> "
"卡`，隨即載入 :guilabel:`卡` 儀表板，以看板檢視顯示所有開支卡。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:243
msgid ""
"All cards display their status on a banner in the upper-right corner of each"
" card. Statuses are either:"
msgstr "所有卡的右上角橫幅均會顯示其狀態。狀態可為以下其中一項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:246
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Draft`: The card form is filled out, but the card has not been "
"requested or activated."
msgstr ":guilabel:`草稿`：卡片表單已填妥，但尚未申請或啟用該卡。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:247
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Pending`: A physical card has been ordered, but not activated."
msgstr ":guilabel:`待處理`：已訂購實體卡，但尚未啟用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:248
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Active`: The card is able to be used. This status does **not** "
"display a status banner on the card."
msgstr ":guilabel:`有效`：此卡可使用。此狀態 **不會** 在卡上顯示狀態橫幅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:250
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Paused`: A card has been put *on hold* and no transactions can be"
" processed with this status."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已暫停`：卡片已 *暫停使用*，在此狀態下無法處理任何交易。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:252
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Blocked`: The physical or virtual card is *cancelled* and cannot "
"be used."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已封鎖`：實體卡或虛擬卡已 *取消*，無法再使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:254
msgid ""
"Click on a card to activate, and the card form loads. Ensure all the fields "
"are :ref:`configured <expenses/card-configure>`, then click either "
":guilabel:`Order` if requesting a physical card, or :guilabel:`Activate` if "
"creating a virtual card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:259
msgid ""
"Physical cards take 5 to 10 business days to be delivered. Once ordered, "
"delivery information is added to the chatter, and the user who placed the "
"card order receives the information by email."
msgstr ""
"實體卡需要 5 至 10 個工作天送達。訂購後，送貨資訊會新增至溝通欄，下單訂購卡片"
"的使用者亦會透過電郵收到相關資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:262
msgid ""
"If a physical card is requested, the card status changes to "
":guilabel:`Inactive`, while it is being printed and mailed to the selected "
"address. Once the card arrives, follow the included instructions to activate"
" the card."
msgstr ""
"如果申請實體卡，在印製並郵寄至所選地址期間，卡片狀態會變為 :guilabel:`未啟"
"用`。收到卡片後，請按照隨附指示啟用卡片。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:266
msgid ""
"If the card is a virtual card, once :guilabel:`Activate` is clicked, the "
"status changes to :guilabel:`Active` and it is available for use."
msgstr ""
"若為虛擬卡，點擊 :guilabel:`啟用` 後，狀態會變更為 :guilabel:`已啟用`，即可開"
"始使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:269
msgid ""
"Once the status of an expense card is :guilabel:`Active`, the user can use "
"the card to purchase expensable items, as long as the purchases are within "
"the limits set on the card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:273
msgid "Demo expense card"
msgstr "示範開支卡"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:275
msgid ""
"To test the expense card feature without using a live Stripe account, "
":ref:`install <general/install>` the `Expense Cards: Demo` module. This "
"replaces production functionalities and allows for the creation of a demo "
"Stripe account, using virtual cards and fake funds to simulate transactions."
msgstr ""
"如要在不使用真實 Stripe 賬戶的情況下測試開支卡功能，請 :ref:`安裝 <general/"
"install>` `Expense Cards: Demo` 模組。這會取代正式環境功能，讓您建立示範 "
"Stripe 賬戶，並使用虛擬卡及模擬資金來模擬交易。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:281
msgid ""
"If a production account is already configured, **do not use** the demo "
"module, as it overwrites the existing setup."
msgstr "如已配置正式環境賬戶，**請勿使用**示範模組，因為該模組會覆寫現有設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:285
msgid "Using expense cards"
msgstr "使用費用卡"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:287
msgid ""
"Using an expense card is almost identical to using any other credit or debit"
" card. The only difference is if a :ref:`physical card <expenses/physical>` "
"or a :ref:`virtual card <expenses/virtual>` is used."
msgstr ""
"使用開支卡與使用其他信用卡或扣賬卡幾乎完全相同。唯一的分別在於所使用的是 "
":ref:`實體卡 <expenses/physical>` 還是 :ref:`虛擬卡 <expenses/virtual>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:291
msgid ""
"When a charge is made using an expense card, an expense record is "
"automatically created in the **Expenses** app, linked to the specific card. "
"The next step is to attach the corresponding receipt."
msgstr ""
"使用開支卡付款時，系統會自動在 **開支** 應用程式中建立開支記錄，並連結至該特"
"定卡片。下一步是附加相應的收據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:295
msgid ""
"It is best proactive to take a photo of a receipt as soon as it is received,"
" to eliminate the risk of losing the receipt and having an expense "
"reimbursement request denied."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:298
msgid ""
"Open the expense record by navigating to :menuselection:`Expenses app --> "
"Cards`, and click on the specific card. Next, click the :icon:`fa-usd` "
":guilabel:`Expenses` smart button, and the :guilabel:`Expenses` dashboard "
"loads for that card. Any expense that does *not* have a receipt attached to "
"the record displays a :icon:`fa-credit-card` :guilabel:`Please upload the "
"receipt.`"
msgstr ""
"前往:menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 卡`開啟開支記錄，然後點擊特定卡片。接著"
"，點擊 :icon:`fa-usd` :guilabel:`開支` 智能按鈕，系統便會載入該卡的 "
":guilabel:`開支` 儀表板。任何*沒有*在記錄中附上收據的開支，均會顯示 "
":icon:`fa-credit-card` :guilabel:`請上傳收據。`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:303
msgid ""
"Click on the desired expense record to open the detailed expense form. Click"
" the :guilabel:`Attach Receipt` button, and a file explorer loads. Navigate "
"to the receipt, and click :guilabel:`Open` to select it and attach it to the"
" expense."
msgstr ""
"按一下所需的開支記錄以開啟詳細開支表單。點擊 :guilabel:`附加收據` 按鈕後，系"
"統會開啟檔案總管。瀏覽至收據檔案，然後點擊 :guilabel:`開啟` 以選取並將其附加"
"至該開支項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:307
msgid ""
"Make any other adjustments to :ref:`the expense record "
"<expenses/manual_expense>`, if necessary. Once the record is correct, click "
":guilabel:`Submit` to submit the receipt, or :guilabel:`Split`, if the "
"receipt needs to be split between multiple expenses."
msgstr ""
"如有需要，請對 :ref:`開支記錄 <expenses/manual_expense>` 作出任何其他調整。確"
"認記錄無誤後，點擊 :guilabel:`提交` 提交收據；如需將收據分拆至多項開支，則點"
"擊 :guilabel:`分拆`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:312
msgid ""
"If a purchase is attempted that either is outside the listed countries, "
"listed categories, or exceeds the transaction limit or total expense limit "
"for the specified time period, the expense is denied and captured in the "
":guilabel:`Expenses` dashboard for the card, with a status of *Refused*."
msgstr ""
"如果嘗試進行的購買超出所列國家/地區或類別，或者超過指定時段內的交易上限或總開"
"支上限，該開支會被拒絕，並記錄在該卡的 :guilabel:`開支` 儀表板中，狀態顯示為 "
"*已拒絕*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:317
msgid ""
"To view the details of why the transaction was refused, click on the "
":icon:`fa-usd` :guilabel:`Expenses` smart button for the card, and click on "
"the refused transaction. The details explaining why the transaction was "
"refused appears in the chatter, authored by *OdooBot*."
msgstr ""
"要查看交易被拒的詳細原因，請點擊該卡的 :icon:`fa-usd` :guilabel:`開支` 智能按"
"鈕，然後點擊被拒的交易。說明交易被拒原因的詳細資訊會顯示在通訊欄中，由 "
"*OdooBot* 發佈。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:324
msgid "Physical card"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:326
msgid ""
"When using a physical card, make charges in the same manner as a regular "
"physical pre-paid debit card."
msgstr "使用實體卡時，請以與一般實體預付扣賬卡相同的方式進行扣款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:329
msgid ""
"Once the user receives the card, the cardholder must activate the card using"
" the instructions provided with the card. Next, open the **Expenses** app, "
"and click on the physical card, which has a status of :guilabel:`Pending`. "
"Click :guilabel:`Activate`, then when prompted, enter the last four digits "
"of the card, confirm the phone number, accept the terms and conditions, and "
"complete the activation."
msgstr ""
"用戶收到卡片後，持卡人必須按照隨卡附上的指示啟用卡片。接著，開啟 **開支** 應"
"用程式，並點擊狀態為 :guilabel:`待處理` 的實體卡。點擊 :guilabel:`啟用`，然後"
"在系統提示時輸入卡號最後四位數字、確認電話號碼、接受條款及細則，並完成啟用程"
"序。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:336
msgid "Card PIN"
msgstr "卡 PIN 碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:338
msgid ""
"To view the card's PIN, the cardholder **must** have a :doc:`user "
"<../../general/users>` profile. Navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app -->"
" Cards`, and click on the card to open the card form. Enter the six-digit "
"code sent via SMS to the associated phone number. The card and its PIN "
"appear in a pop-up window. The PIN is displayed below the card and "
"**cannot** be changed."
msgstr ""
"要查看卡的 PIN 碼，持卡人 **必須** 擁有 :doc:`用戶 <../../general/users>` 個"
"人檔案。前往 :menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 卡`，然後點擊該卡以開啟卡表單。"
"輸入透過短訊傳送至關聯電話號碼的六位數驗證碼。彈出視窗隨即會顯示該卡及其 PIN "
"碼。PIN 碼顯示於卡下方，且 **不可** 更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:346
msgid "Virtual card"
msgstr "虛擬卡"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:348
msgid ""
"If using a virtual card, the cardholder **must** have a :doc:`user "
"<../../general/users>` profile to access the card information required for "
"purchases."
msgstr ""
"如使用虛擬卡，持卡人 **必須** 擁有 :doc:`用戶 <../../general/users>` 個人資料"
"，才可存取購買所需的卡資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:351
msgid ""
"To obtain the card information, navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app -->"
" Cards` and click on the virtual card being used. Next, click into the "
":guilabel:`Card Details` tab, and two items appear: the expense card number,"
" with only the last four digits displayed, and the expiration date."
msgstr ""
"要取得開支卡資料，請前往 :menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 卡片`，然後點擊正在"
"使用的虛擬卡。接著點擊 :guilabel:`卡片詳情` 分頁，畫面會顯示兩項資料：開支卡"
"號碼（僅顯示最後四位數字）及到期日。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:355
msgid ""
"To view the full details, click :icon:`fa-eye` :guilabel:`View Details`, and"
" a :guilabel:`Two-Factor Authentication` pop-up window loads. Enter the six-"
"digit authentication code that is texted to the cardholder's phone number. "
"The card appears in the pop-up window, with all the information displayed: "
"the card number, expiration date, and security code. When done, close the "
"window by clicking :guilabel:`X`."
msgstr ""
"如要查看完整詳情，請按一下 :icon:`fa-eye` :guilabel:`查看詳情`，隨即會載入 "
":guilabel:`雙重驗證` 彈出視窗。輸入透過短訊傳送至持卡人電話號碼的六位數驗證碼"
"。卡片資料隨即會顯示於彈出視窗中，並列出所有資訊：卡號、到期日及安全碼。完成"
"後，按一下 :guilabel:`X` 關閉視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:362
msgid ""
"Android users can add their virtual expense cards `to a Google Wallet "
"<https://support.google.com/wallet/answer/12058983?hl=en>`_. Currently, IOS "
"users **cannot** add their expense cards to an Apple Wallet."
msgstr ""
"Android 用戶可將其虛擬開支卡 `加入 Google Wallet <https://support.google.com/"
"wallet/answer/12058983?hl=en>`_。目前，iOS 用戶**無法**將其開支卡加入 Apple "
"Wallet。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:367
msgid "Lost cards"
msgstr "遺失卡片"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:369
msgid ""
"When a physical card is lost, or if credentials for a virtual card have been"
" compromised, the cards must be updated in the **Expenses** app so they "
"cannot be used. This is referred to in Odoo as *blocking*."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:373
msgid ""
"To stop any charges on a card, navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app --> "
"Cards`, and click on the specific card being deactivated. On the card form, "
"click the :guilabel:`Block` button, and a :guilabel:`Block a Card` pop-up "
"window loads."
msgstr ""
"如要停止卡上的任何收費，請前往 :menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 卡`，並點擊要"
"停用的特定卡。在卡表單中，點擊 :guilabel:`封鎖` 按鈕，系統隨即會載入 "
":guilabel:`封鎖卡` 彈出式視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:377
msgid ""
"Click into the field next to :guilabel:`Reason`, and select the reason the "
"card is being blocked. The options are :guilabel:`Lost`, :guilabel:`Stolen`,"
" or :guilabel:`Other`. After making a selection, click :guilabel:`Block`, "
"and the card is unable to be used, and a red :guilabel:`Blocked` banner "
"appears on the card in the :guilabel:`Cards` dashboard view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:383
msgid ""
"An employee is given a virtual expense card to use for an upcoming business "
"trip. The employee uses this card to purchase an airline ticket and a hotel "
"room, one month before the scheduled trip."
msgstr ""
"員工獲發一張虛擬開支卡，用於即將到來的商務旅行。該員工在預定行程前一個月，使"
"用此卡購買機票及預訂酒店房間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:387
msgid ""
"A week before the trip, they receive an email from the airline, explaining "
"there has been a data breach, and customer names, contact information, and "
"purchase details including credit card numbers have been leaked."
msgstr ""
"在旅程開始前一星期，他們收到航空公司的電郵，說明發生了資料外洩事件，客戶姓名"
"、聯絡資料及包括信用卡號碼在內的購買詳情已經外洩。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:391
msgid ""
"The employee reaches out to their manager, explaining the situation. The "
"manager opens the virtual expense card, and blocks the card using the reason"
" :guilabel:`Other`. Then the manager issues another virtual card for the "
"employee to use for their business trip."
msgstr ""
"員工聯絡其經理並說明情況。經理開啟虛擬開支卡，並以 :guilabel:`其他` 為原因封"
"鎖該卡。然後，經理為員工另發一張虛擬卡，供其出差使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:396
msgid "Temporary card pauses"
msgstr "暫時停用卡片"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:398
msgid ""
"When an employee is out of office for an extended period of time, such as a "
"vacation, or an illness, it is recommended to temporarily deactivate their "
"card to prevent any fraudulent charges. This is referred to in Odoo as "
"*pausing* a card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:402
msgid ""
"To pause a card, navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app --> Cards`, and "
"click on the specific card being paused. On the card form, click "
":guilabel:`Pause`, and the card is unable to be used until it is activated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:407
msgid ""
"An employee in the sales department has a physical expense card to use for "
"client meetings. They recently welcomed a new child, and will be out of "
"office on parental leave for three months."
msgstr ""
"銷售部門的一名員工持有一張實體開支卡，用於與客戶會面時的支出。該名員工最近迎"
"來新生兒，並將休育嬰假三個月。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_cards.rst:410
msgid ""
"On the employee's last day, their manager opens the expense card record, and"
" clicks :guilabel:`Pause`. When the employee returns to work, the manager "
"opens the expense card form and clicks :guilabel:`Active` to reactivate the "
"card."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:3
msgid "Expense categories"
msgstr "開支類別"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:5
msgid ""
"Odoo **Expenses** streamlines the management of expenses. After an employee "
":doc:`logs <../expenses/log_expenses>` and :doc:`submits "
"<../expenses/submit_expenses>` their expenses in Odoo, expenses are reviewed"
" by management and accounting teams. Once :doc:`approved "
"<../expenses/approve_expenses>`, payments can be processed and "
":doc:`disbursed back to the employee <../expenses/reimburse>` for "
"reimbursement."
msgstr ""
"Odoo **開支** 簡化了開支管理。員工在 Odoo 中 :doc:`記錄 <../expenses/"
"log_expenses>` 並 :doc:`提交 <../expenses/submit_expenses>` 開支後，管理層和"
"會計團隊會進行審核。一旦獲得 :doc:`批准 <../expenses/approve_expenses>`，系統"
"便可處理付款並 :doc:`發還款項予員工 <../expenses/reimburse>` 以作報銷。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:12
msgid "`Odoo Expenses: product page <https://www.odoo.com/app/expenses>`_"
msgstr "`Odoo 費用：產品頁面 <https://www.odoo.com/app/expenses>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:15
msgid "View expense categories"
msgstr "檢視開支類別"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:17
msgid ""
"The first step to track expenses is configuring the different types of "
"expenses for the company (managed as *expense categories* in Odoo). Each "
"category can be as specific or generalized as needed. Additionally, expense "
"categories can be configured to repay expenses at either a set price or "
"allow for specific prices to be reported."
msgstr ""
"追蹤開支的第一步是為公司設定不同類型的開支（在 Odoo 中以 *開支類別* 管理）。"
"每個類別可按需要設得具體或概括。此外，開支類別可設定為按固定價格報銷開支，或"
"允許申報指定價格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:22
msgid ""
"To view the default expense categories, navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses"
" app --> Configuration --> Expense Categories`."
msgstr ""
"如要查看預設開支類別，請前往:menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 配置 --> 開支類"
"別`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:25
msgid ""
"The default expense categories allow creating expenses for common expenses, "
"including communication costs, meals, gifts, miles driven, and other travel "
"expenses. For expenses outside these default categories, the general "
"expenses category, :guilabel:`EXP_GEN`, is used. If a company has specific "
"expenses it commonly reimburses, and wants to track them separately, "
":ref:`new expense categories can be made <expenses/new-category>` or "
"existing expense categories can be modified."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:31
msgid "Set expense costs on products."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:37
msgid "Create new expense categories"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:39
msgid ""
"Some companies require more expense categories than the **Expenses** app "
"includes. For these situations, new expense categories can be created."
msgstr ""
"部分公司所需的開支類別多於**開支**應用程式所包含的類別。在這種情況下，可以建"
"立新的開支類別。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:43
msgid ""
"A company that trains car mechanics allows its technicians to purchase $500 "
"worth of tools in a year. In this situation, the company creates a new "
"category called `TOOLS` to track all tool expenses."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:47
msgid ""
"To create a new expense category, navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app "
"--> Configuration --> Expense Categories`. Click :guilabel:`New`, and a new "
"expense category form loads."
msgstr ""
"要建立新的開支類別，請前往 :menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 配置 --> 開支類"
"別`。點擊 :guilabel:`新增`，系統便會載入新的開支類別表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:51
msgid ""
"Expense *categories* are managed like *products* in Odoo. The expense "
"category form follows the standard product form in Odoo, and the information"
" entered is similar. Expense *products* are referred to as expense "
"*categories* throughout this document since the main menu refers to these as"
" :guilabel:`Expense Categories`."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 中，開支 *類別* 的管理方式與 *產品* 相同。開支類別表單沿用 Odoo 的標"
"準產品表單，所需填寫的資料亦相若。由於主選單將這些項目稱為:guilabel:`開支類"
"別`，因此本文件會將開支 *產品* 統稱為開支 *類別* 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:56
msgid "Enter the following fields on the form:"
msgstr "在表單上填寫以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product Name`: Enter a name for the category that is short and "
"informative."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:59
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cost`: If employees can report the actual cost of an expense, and"
" are reimbursed the reported amount, leave the field set to `0.00`. If the "
"expense should **always** be reimbursed for a specific price, enter the "
"amount in this field. If a price is entered, a :guilabel:`per` field appears"
" with :guilabel:`Unit` populated by default. :guilabel:`Unit` covers most "
"expense situations, but if the reimbursement is based on weight, length, "
"volume, etc., choose the corresponding type of unit using the drop-down "
"menu."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`成本`：如果員工可申報開支的實際成本，並按申報金額獲得報銷，請將此"
"欄位保留為 `0.00`。如果該開支應**始終**按指定價格報銷，請在此欄位輸入金額。輸"
"入價格後，系統會顯示 :guilabel:`每` 欄位，並預設填入 :guilabel:`單"
"位`。:guilabel:`單位` 適用於大多數開支情況；如果報銷金額是按重量、長度、體積"
"等計算，請從下拉式選單中選擇相應的單位類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:67
msgid ""
"Here are some examples for when to set a specific :guilabel:`Cost` on a "
"product vs. leaving the :guilabel:`Cost` at `0.00`:"
msgstr ""
"以下範例說明何時應為產品設定特定 :guilabel:`成本`，以及何時應將 :guilabel:`成"
"本` 維持為 `0.00`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:70
msgid ""
"**Meals**: If employees are reimbursed for their full meal cost, set the "
":guilabel:`Cost` to `0.00`. When an employee logs an expense for a meal, "
"they enter the actual amount of the bill and are reimbursed for that amount."
" An expense for a meal costing $95.23 would equal a reimbursement of $95.23."
msgstr ""
"**膳食**：如果員工可獲全額膳食費報銷，請將 :guilabel:`成本` 設為 `0.00`。當員"
"工記錄膳食開支時，只需輸入賬單的實際金額，即可按該金額獲得報銷。例如，一筆金"
"額為 $95.23 的膳食開支，可獲報銷 $95.23。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:74
msgid ""
"**Mileage**: If employees receive a flat rate for each mile they drive, set "
"the :guilabel:`Cost` to `1.00`. When an employee logs an expense for the "
"miles driven, they enter the number of miles driven in the "
":guilabel:`Quantity` field, and are reimbursed $1.00 per mile they reported."
" An expense for 100 miles would equal a reimbursement of $100.00."
msgstr ""
"**里數**：如果員工按駕駛每英里的固定費率領取津貼，請將:guilabel:`成本`設為 "
"`1.00`。當員工為行駛里數記錄開支時，須在:guilabel:`數量`欄位輸入駕駛英里數，"
"系統將按其申報的每英里報銷 $1.00。舉例來說，100 英里的開支相當於報銷 $100.00"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:78
msgid ""
"**Per Diem**: If employees receive a daily flat rate of $125.00 when "
"traveling, set the :guilabel:`Cost` to `125.00`. An expense for three days "
"of per diem costs (meals, incidentals, taxi fare, etc.) would equal a "
"reimbursement of $375.00."
msgstr ""
"**每日津貼**：如果員工公幹時每日領取 $125.00 的定額津貼，請將 :guilabel:`成"
"本` 設為 `125.00`。三天的每日津貼開支（餐費、雜費、的士車費等）將相當於 "
"$375.00 的報銷金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:83
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Cost` field is always visible on the expense category form, "
"but the :guilabel:`Sales Price` field is *only* visible if the "
":guilabel:`Sales Price` is selected under the :guilabel:`Re-Invoice "
"Expenses` section. Otherwise, the :guilabel:`Sales Price` field is hidden."
msgstr ""
"在開支類別表單上，:guilabel:`成本`欄位一直可見，但:guilabel:`銷售價格`欄位 "
"*僅* 在選取:guilabel:`銷售價格`（位於:guilabel:`重新開立開支發票`部分下）時才"
"會顯示。否則，:guilabel:`銷售價格`欄位將會隱藏。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:88
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reference`: Enter a short reference for the expense, such as "
"`FOOD` or `TRAVEL`. This reference is used when :ref:`emailing expenses "
"<expenses/email_expense>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`參考`：輸入開支的簡短參考編號，例如 `FOOD` 或 `TRAVEL`。在:ref:`透"
"過電郵提交開支 <expenses/email_expense>`時會使用此參考編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:90
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Category`: Using the drop-down menu, select the category the "
"expense falls under. It is recommended to use the default category `All / "
"Expenses`, but another category can be selected if the accounting department"
" requires it."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`類別`：使用下拉式選單選擇該項開支所屬的類別。建議使用預設類別 `全"
"部 / 開支`，但如會計部門有需要，亦可選擇其他類別。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:93
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: If in a multi-company database, select the company the "
"expense category applies to. If the expense category applies to *all* "
"companies, leave this field blank."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`公司`：如使用多公司資料庫，請選擇該開支類別適用的公司。如果該開支"
"類別適用於 *所有* 公司，請將此欄位留空。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:95
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Guideline`: Enter some rules or important information for the "
"expense category. This is visible in the :guilabel:`Note` column on the "
":guilabel:`Expense Category` dashboard."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`指引`：輸入此開支類別的規則或重要資訊。此內容會顯示於 "
":guilabel:`備註` 欄，位於 :guilabel:`開支類別` 儀表板上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:99
msgid ""
"An expense category for expenses related to working from home may have a "
":guilabel:`Name` of `WFH`, and the :guilabel:`Guideline` may say `Monitors, "
"Chairs, & Other Home Working Costs`."
msgstr ""
"與在家工作相關的開支類別，其 :guilabel:`名稱` 可設為 `WFH`，而 :guilabel:`指"
"引` 則可填寫 `顯示器、座椅及其他在家工作開支`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:102
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expense Account`: If using the Odoo **Accounting** app, select "
"the :abbr:`CoA (Chart of Accounts)` the expense should be logged on."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`開支科目`：如使用 Odoo **會計** 應用程式，請選擇應記錄該開支的 "
":abbr:`CoA (會計科目表)`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:106
msgid ""
"Check with the accounting department to determine the correct account to "
"reference in this field as it affects various reports."
msgstr "請向會計部門確認此欄位應參照的正確賬戶，因為這會影響多份報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:109
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Purchase Taxes` and :guilabel:`Sales Taxes`: Enter the default "
"taxes that are applied when purchasing or selling this product, if "
"applicable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`採購稅` 及 :guilabel:`銷售稅`：如有適用，請輸入採購或銷售此產品時"
"套用的預設稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:113
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Sales Taxes` field is **only** visible if the **Sales** app "
"is installed, and either the :guilabel:`At cost` or :guilabel:`Sales Price` "
"options are selected in the :ref:`invoicing section <expenses/invoicing>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:118
msgid ""
"It is considered good practice to use a tax that is configured with "
":ref:`Tax Included in Price <taxes/included-in-price>`. Taxes are "
"automatically configured if these are set."
msgstr ""
"建議使用已配置:ref:`價格已含稅 <taxes/included-in-price>`的稅項。如已進行這些"
"設定，系統會自動配置稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:121
msgid "A new expense category for tools."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:127
msgid "Invoicing section"
msgstr "開立發票部分"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:129
msgid ""
"If the **Sales** app is installed, an invoicing section is visible. This "
"section allows the expense to be reinvoiced to customers on sales orders."
msgstr ""
"如果已安裝 **銷售** 應用程式，畫面會顯示開立發票部分。此部分允許在銷售訂單上"
"將開支重新向客戶開立發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:132
msgid ""
"If the expense **cannot** be reinvoiced, enable the :guilabel:`No` option. "
"If the expense category **can** be reinvoiced, enable either of these "
"options:"
msgstr ""
"如果開支 **不可** 重新開立發票，請啟用 :guilabel:`否` 選項。如果開支類別 **可"
"以** 重新開立發票，請啟用以下其中一個選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:135
msgid ""
":guilabel:`At cost`: Select this option to have the expense item reinvoiced "
"at the price set in the :guilabel:`Cost` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`按成本`：選擇此選項，即可按照 :guilabel:`成本` 欄位中所設的價格，"
"重新開立開支項目的發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:137
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Sales Price`: Select this option to have the expense item "
"reinvoiced at the sales price. When enabled, a :guilabel:`Sales Price` field"
" appears beneath the :guilabel:`Product Name` field. Enter the sales price "
"in the new field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`銷售價格`：選擇此選項即可按銷售價格重新開立費用項目的發票。啟用後"
"，系統會顯示:guilabel:`銷售價格`欄位（位於:guilabel:`產品名稱`欄位下方）。請"
"在新欄位中輸入銷售價格。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:142
msgid ""
"A heating and cooling company offers at-home repairs on the furnaces and "
"central air units it sells. Their technicians are sub-contracted, and use "
"their own vans, tools, and parts."
msgstr ""
"一間冷暖氣設備公司為其銷售的暖氣爐及中央空調裝置提供上門維修服務。其技術人員"
"為外判人員，並自備客貨車、工具及零件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:145
msgid ""
"As part of their contracts, technicians are reimbursed for their travel. "
"They receive $1.00 for every mile they drive. Additionally, the customer "
"must pay for the travel as part of their service contract. The customer pays"
" $1.50 for every mile the technician drives to their location."
msgstr ""
"根據合約條款，技術員可獲報銷差旅費，每駕駛一英里可獲發 $1.00。此外，客戶亦須"
"根據服務合約支付該筆差旅費。技術員每駕駛一英里前往客戶地點，客戶須支付 $1.50"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:149
msgid ""
"To configure this expense, the :guilabel:`Sales Price` is set to `1.50` and "
"the :guilabel:`Cost` is set to `1.00`."
msgstr ""
"要配置此費用，請將 :guilabel:`銷售價格` 設為 `1.50`，並將 :guilabel:`成本` 設"
"為 `1.00`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expense_categories.rst:152
msgid "An expense category to reinvoice customers and pay technicians."
msgstr "用於向客戶重新開立發票及支付技術人員費用的開支類別。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:3
msgid "Expenses analysis"
msgstr "開支分析"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:5
msgid ""
"It is important for companies to track expenses so they have an "
"understanding of their expenses and can identify trends. Expense reporting "
"allows for detailed information, such as which expense categories are "
"reimbursed the most, which employees incur the most expenses, and if there "
"are any periods of time that tend to incur more expenses than others."
msgstr ""
"公司追蹤開支十分重要，有助了解支出狀況並識別趨勢。開支報告可提供詳細資訊，例"
"如哪些開支類別的報銷金額最高、哪些員工產生的開支最多，以及是否有某些時段較其"
"他時段容易產生更多開支。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:11
msgid "View expense analysis report"
msgstr "檢視開支分析報告"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:13
msgid ""
"To view the default *Expenses Analysis* report, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Expenses app --> Reporting --> Expenses Analysis`. The "
":guilabel:`Expenses Analysis` report displays all expenses for the current "
"year, in a stacked bar chart, grouped by month."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:17
msgid "The default stacked bar chart for annual expenses, grouped by month."
msgstr "按月份分組的年度開支預設堆疊柱形圖。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:21
msgid "View expenses by employee"
msgstr "按員工檢視開支"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:23
msgid ""
"It is possible to view the data so that the total cost of expenses *by "
"employee* is visible. To view the report in this way, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Expenses app --> Reporting --> Expenses Analysis`. Next, "
"click the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` icon to view the data in"
" a pivot table."
msgstr ""
"你可以查看數據，以顯示*按員工*計算的開支總成本。要以此方式查看報表，請前往 "
":menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 報表 --> 開支分析`。接著，點擊 :icon:`oi-"
"view-pivot` :guilabel:`（樞紐分析表）` 圖示，以在樞紐分析表中查看數據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:28
msgid ""
"This presents the data with the *employees* populating the rows, and the "
"*total monthly expenses* populate the columns. Next, click :icon:`fa-minus-"
"square-o` :guilabel:`Total` at the top of the monthly columns to hide the "
"individual monthly totals, and present only the *total* amount for the year."
msgstr ""
"這會將資料顯示為以*員工*作為橫列，並以*每月開支總額*作為直欄。接著，點擊月份"
"直欄頂部的 :icon:`fa-minus-square-o` :guilabel:`總計`，以隱藏個別月份的總計，"
"並只顯示全年的*總計*金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:33
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:63
msgid ""
"To present the data in either ascending or descending total, click the "
":guilabel:`Total In Currency` box, and the information is organized first in"
" ascending order, starting with the smallest amount. Click :guilabel:`Total "
"In Currency` again to reverse the order, and present the highest amount "
"first."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:39
msgid ""
"In this example it can be determined that :guilabel:`Mike Smith` has the "
"highest amount of expenses, totaling :guilabel:`4,216.44`. This is almost "
"seven times higher than :guilabel:`Ronnie Hart`, who has the second highest "
"expenses, with a total of :guilabel:`644.74`."
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，可以看到 :guilabel:`Mike Smith` 的開支金額最高，總計 "
":guilabel:`4,216.44`。這幾乎是開支金額第二高的 :guilabel:`Ronnie Hart` 的七倍"
"，其總計為 :guilabel:`644.74`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:43
msgid ""
"A pivot table with the information shown by employee, in descending order."
msgstr "按員工顯示資料的樞紐分析表，以降序排列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:47
msgid "View expenses by category"
msgstr "按類別檢視開支"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:49
msgid ""
"It is possible to view the data so that the total cost of expenses *by "
"category* is visible. To view the report in this way, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Expenses app --> Reporting --> Expenses Analysis`. Next, "
"click the :icon:`oi-view-pivot` :guilabel:`(Pivot)` icon to view the data in"
" a pivot table."
msgstr ""
"你可以檢視數據，以 *按類別* 顯示開支總成本。若要以此方式檢視報表，請前往 "
":menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 報告 --> 開支分析`。接著，點擊 :icon:`oi-"
"view-pivot` :guilabel:`（樞紐分析）` 圖示，即可在樞紐分析表中檢視數據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:54
msgid ""
"This presents the data with the *employees* populating the rows, and the "
"*total monthly expenses* populate the columns. Next, click :icon:`fa-minus-"
"square-o` :guilabel:`Total` at the top of the employees column. Click "
":icon:`fa-plus-square` :guilabel:`Total` that appears in place of :icon:`fa-"
"minus-square-o` :guilabel:`Total`, revealing a drop-down menu of options. "
"Click :guilabel:`Category`, and the expense categories now populate the "
"rows."
msgstr ""
"這會以 *員工* 作為資料列，並以 *每月總開支* 作為資料欄來顯示資料。接下來，點"
"擊員工欄頂部的 :icon:`fa-minus-square-o` :guilabel:`總計`。點擊 :icon:`fa-"
"plus-square` :guilabel:`總計`（即取代原本 :icon:`fa-minus-square-o` "
":guilabel:`總計` 顯示的項目），以展開選項下拉選單。點擊 :guilabel:`類別`，開"
"支類別隨即會顯示於各資料列。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:60
msgid ""
"Next, click :icon:`fa-minus-square-o` :guilabel:`Total` at the top of the "
"months column to hide the individual months, and only show the annual total "
"for each category."
msgstr ""
"接著，點擊月份欄頂部的 :icon:`fa-minus-square-o` :guilabel:`總計`，以隱藏個別"
"月份，僅顯示每個類別的年度總計。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:69
msgid ""
"In this example, it can be determined that the company spent the most on "
"travel expenses, with the expense category :guilabel:`[TRANS & ACC] Travel &"
" Accommodation` incurring :guilabel:`2,940.00` of expenses for the year. The"
" company reimbursed mileage the least, with only :guilabel:`229.69` in "
":guilabel:`[MIL] Mileage` expenses."
msgstr ""
"在此範例中，可以看出公司在差旅費用上的開支最多，其中開支類別 "
":guilabel:`[TRANS & ACC] 差旅及住宿` 全年產生了 :guilabel:`2,940.00` 的費用。"
"公司在里程報銷方面的開支最少，僅有 :guilabel:`229.69` 的 :guilabel:`[MIL] 里"
"程` 費用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/expenses_analysis.rst:74
msgid ""
"A pivot table with the information shown by catrgory in descending order."
msgstr "一個按類別降冪排列顯示資訊的樞紐分析表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:3
msgid "Log expenses"
msgstr "記錄開支"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:5
msgid ""
"Before expenses can be reimbursed, each individual expense needs to be "
"logged in the database. Expense records can be created in four different "
"ways: :ref:`manually enter an expense record <expenses/manual_expense>`, "
":ref:`upload a receipt <expenses/upload_receipt>`, :ref:`drag and drop "
"<expenses/drag_and_drop>` a receipt onto the **Expenses** app dashboard, or "
":ref:`email a receipt <expenses/email_expense>` to a preconfigured email "
"address."
msgstr ""
"在報銷開支之前，每項開支都必須記錄在資料庫中。開支記錄可透過四種方式建立"
"：:ref:`手動輸入開支記錄 <expenses/manual_expense>`、:ref:`上載收據 "
"<expenses/upload_receipt>`、將收據 :ref:`拖放 <expenses/drag_and_drop>` 至 "
"**開支** 應用程式儀表板，或 :ref:`透過電郵傳送收據 <expenses/email_expense>` "
"至預先設定的電郵地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:14
msgid "Manually enter expenses"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:16
msgid ""
"To record a new expense, open the **Expenses** app, which displays the "
":guilabel:`My Expenses` page, by default."
msgstr ""
"要記錄新開支，請開啟 **開支** 應用程式；系統預設會顯示 :guilabel:`我的開支` "
"頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:20
msgid ""
"This view can also be accessed at any time by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Expenses app --> My Expenses --> My Expenses`."
msgstr ""
"你亦可隨時前往 :menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 我的開支 --> 我的開支` 開啟此"
"檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:23
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`New` button and fill out the following fields on the "
"blank expense form that loads:"
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕，並在載入的空白開支表單上填寫以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:26
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Description`: Enter a short description for the expense. This "
"should be concise and informative, such as `Lunch with client` or `Hotel for"
" trade show`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`描述`：輸入開支的簡短描述。內容應簡潔且具資訊性，例如 `與客戶午"
"餐` 或 `貿易展酒店住宿`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:28
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Category`: Using the drop-down menu, select the :doc:`expense "
"category <expense_categories>` that most closely corresponds to the expense."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:30
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total`: Enter the total amount paid for the expense in one of two"
" ways:"
msgstr ":guilabel:`總計`：以兩種方式之一輸入該筆開支的已付總金額："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:32
msgid ""
"If the expense is for a single item/expense, and the category selected was "
"for a single item, enter the cost in the :guilabel:`Total` field (the "
":guilabel:`Quantity` field is hidden)."
msgstr ""
"如開支只涉及單一項目/費用，且所選類別亦適用於單一項目，請在 :guilabel:`總計` "
"欄位輸入金額（:guilabel:`數量` 欄位會隱藏）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:34
msgid ""
"If the expense is for multiples of the same item/expense with a fixed price,"
" the :guilabel:`Unit Price` is displayed. Enter the number of units in the "
":guilabel:`Quantity` field, and the total cost is automatically updated with"
" the correct total. The total cost appears below the :guilabel:`Quantity`."
msgstr ""
"如果該項開支涉及多個固定價格的相同項目／開支，系統會顯示 :guilabel:`單價`。請"
"在 :guilabel:`數量` 欄位輸入單位數目，總成本便會自動更新為正確總額。總成本會"
"顯示在 :guilabel:`數量` 下方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:40
msgid ""
"An employee received one dollar for each mile driven for work. The "
":guilabel:`Category` is :guilabel:`[MIL] Mileage`. The :guilabel:`Unit "
"Price` is automatically populated with `$1.00`, which is the cost *per mile*"
" configured for the expense :guilabel:`Category` :guilabel:`[MIL] Mileage`. "
"The :guilabel:`Quantity` is set to `48`, which is the *number of miles "
"driven*, and the total is calculated to `$48.00`."
msgstr ""
"一名員工因工作駕駛，每英里獲得一美元補貼。:guilabel:`類別` 為 "
":guilabel:`[MIL] 里程`。:guilabel:`單價` 會自動填入 `$1.00`，即為開"
"支:guilabel:`類別` :guilabel:`[MIL] 里程` 設定的 *每英里* 成本。:guilabel:`數"
"量` 設為 `48`，即 *行駛英里數*，總額計算為 `$48.00`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:46
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Included Taxes`: If taxes were configured on the selected expense"
" category, the tax percentage and amount appear automatically after entering"
" either the :guilabel:`Total` or the :guilabel:`Quantity`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`已包含稅項`：如所選開支類別已設定稅項，在輸入 :guilabel:`總計` 或 "
":guilabel:`數量` 後，系統會自動顯示稅率及稅額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:51
msgid ""
"When a tax is configured on an expense category, the :guilabel:`Included "
"Taxes` value updates in real time, as the :guilabel:`Total` or "
":guilabel:`Quantity` is updated."
msgstr ""
"當開支類別設定了稅項時，:guilabel:`已包含稅項` 的數值會隨著 :guilabel:`總計` "
"或 :guilabel:`數量` 的更新而即時更新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:54
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Employee`: Using the drop-down menu, select the employee "
"associated with the expense."
msgstr ":guilabel:`員工`：使用下拉式選單，選擇與該開支相關的員工。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:55
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Paid By`: Click the radio button to indicate who paid for the "
"expense and should be reimbursed. Select either :guilabel:`Employee (to "
"reimburse)` or :guilabel:`Company`. Depending on the expense category "
"selected, this field may not appear."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`付款人`：按一下選項按鈕，註明由誰支付開支並應獲報銷。請選"
"擇:guilabel:`員工（須報銷）`或:guilabel:`公司`。視乎所選的開支類別，此欄位未"
"必會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:58
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Expense Date`: Using the calendar popover window that appears "
"when this field is clicked, enter the date the expense was incurred."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`開支日期`：點擊此欄位時會彈出日曆視窗，請在該視窗輸入產生開支的日"
"期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:60
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Account`: If the selected expense :guilabel:`Category` has a "
"specific account linked to it, that account appears in the "
":guilabel:`Account` field. If no account is specified, the default `600000 "
"Expenses` account populates this field. If a different account is desired, "
"select the account the expense should be logged in."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`帳戶`：如果所選開支 :guilabel:`類別` 已連結特定帳戶，該帳戶便會顯"
"示於 :guilabel:`帳戶` 欄位中。如未指定任何帳戶，系統會在此欄位填入預設的 "
"`600000 Expenses` 帳戶。如需使用其他帳戶，請選擇要記錄該筆開支的帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:64
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Customer to Reinvoice`: If the expense should be paid for by a "
"customer and the selected :guilabel:`Category` allows for reinvoicing of "
"expenses, select the :abbr:`SO (Sales Order)` and customer to be invoiced "
"for the expense using the drop-down menu. All sales orders in the drop-down "
"menu list both the :abbr:`SO (Sales Order)`, as well as the company the "
"sales order is written for. After the expense is saved, the customer name "
"disappears, and only the :abbr:`SO (Sales Order)` is visible on the expense."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`要重新開立發票的客戶`：如果該開支應由客戶支付，且所選的 "
":guilabel:`類別` 允許重新開立開支發票，請使用下拉式選單選擇要為該開支開立發票"
"的 :abbr:`SO (銷售訂單)` 及客戶。下拉式選單中的所有銷售訂單都會同時列出 "
":abbr:`SO (銷售訂單)`，以及該銷售訂單所屬的公司。儲存開支後，客戶名稱會消失，"
"開支上只會顯示 :abbr:`SO (銷售訂單)`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:72
msgid ""
"A customer wishes to have an on-site meeting for the design and installation"
" of a custom building, and agrees to pay for all expenses associated with "
"the meeting, including travel, hotel, and meals for the traveling employees."
" All expenses tied to that meeting would indicate the sales order for the "
"custom building (which also references the customer) as the "
":guilabel:`Customer to Reinvoice`."
msgstr ""
"某客戶希望就定制建築的設計及安裝舉行實地會議，並同意支付與會議相關的所有開支"
"，包括出差員工的差旅、酒店及膳食費用。與該會議相關的所有開支，均會將該定制建"
"築的銷售訂單（當中亦包含該客戶的資料）標示為:guilabel:`需重新開立發票的客"
"戶`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:78
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Analytic Distribution`: Select the account the expense should be "
"written against from the drop-down menu for either :guilabel:`Projects`, "
":guilabel:`Departments`, or both. Multiple accounts can be listed for each "
"category, if needed. Adjust the percentage for each analytic account by "
"typing in the percentage value next to each account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:82
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Company`: If in a multi-company database, select the company the "
"expense should be filed for using the drop-down menu. The current company "
"automatically populates this field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:84
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Notes...`: If any notes are needed to clarify the expense, enter "
"them in the notes field."
msgstr ":guilabel:`備註...`：如需任何備註說明該筆開支，請在備註欄位中輸入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:87
msgid "A filled in expense form for a client lunch."
msgstr "已填妥的客戶午餐開支表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:91
msgid "Attach receipts"
msgstr "附加收據"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:93
msgid ""
"After the expense record is created, the next step is to attach a receipt. "
"Click the :guilabel:`Attach Receipt` button, and a file explorer appears. "
"Navigate to the receipt to be attached, and click :guilabel:`Open`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:97
msgid ""
"The new receipt is recorded in the *chatter*, and the number of receipts "
"appears next to the :icon:`fa-paperclip` :guilabel:`(paperclip)` icon. "
"Multiple receipts can be attached to an individual expense record, as "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"新收據會記錄在 *通訊欄* 中，而收據數量會顯示在 :icon:`fa-paperclip` "
":guilabel:`（萬字夾）` 圖示旁邊。如有需要，可為單一開支記錄附加多張收據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:104
msgid "Upload expenses"
msgstr "上載開支"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:106
msgid ""
"It is possible to have expense records created automatically by "
":ref:`uploading a PDF receipt <expenses/upload>`. To utilize this feature, a"
" setting must be enabled, and :abbr:`IAP (in-app purchases)` credits must be"
" purchased."
msgstr ""
"您可以透過 :ref:`上載 PDF 收據 <expenses/upload>` 自動建立開支記錄。要使用此"
"功能，必須先啟用相關設定，並購買 :abbr:`IAP（應用程式內購買）` 點數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:113
msgid "Digitalization settings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:115
msgid ""
"To enable receipt scanning, navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, and tick the checkbox beside the "
":guilabel:`Expense Digitization (OCR)` option. Then, click :guilabel:`Save`."
" When enabled, additional options appear. Click on the corresponding radio "
"button to select one of the following options:"
msgstr ""
"要啟用收據掃描功能，請前往 :menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設定`，"
"並勾選 :guilabel:`開支數碼化（OCR）` 選項旁的核取方塊，然後點擊 :guilabel:`儲"
"存`。啟用後會顯示更多選項。點擊相應的單選按鈕以選擇以下其中一個選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:120
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Do not digitize`: Disables receipt digitization but does *not* "
"uninstall the related digitization module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:122
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Digitize on demand only`: Only digitizes receipts when requested."
" A :guilabel:`Digitize document` button appears on expense records. When "
"clicked, the receipt is scanned and the expense record is updated."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`僅按需要數碼化`：僅在要求時數碼化收據。費用記錄上會顯示 "
":guilabel:`數碼化文件` 按鈕。點擊後，系統會掃描收據並更新費用記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:125
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Digitize automatically`: Automatically digitizes all receipts "
"when they are uploaded."
msgstr ":guilabel:`自動數碼化`：上載所有收據時自動進行數碼化處理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:127
msgid ""
"Beneath these options are two additional links. Click the :icon:`fa-arrow-"
"right` :guilabel:`Manage Service & Buy Credits` link to view account details"
" and settings, and purchase credits for receipt digitization. Click the "
":icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`View My Services` link to view a list of "
"all current services, and their remaining credit balances."
msgstr ""
"這些選項下方還有兩個額外連結。點擊 :icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`管理服務"
"及購買點數` 連結，即可查看帳戶詳情及設定，並購買收據數碼化點數。點擊 "
":icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`查看我的服務` 連結，即可查看所有現有服務清"
"單及其剩餘點數餘額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:132
msgid ""
"For more information on document digitization and :abbr:`IAPs (in-app "
"purchases)`, refer to the :doc:`In-app purchase (IAP) "
"<../../essentials/in_app_purchase>` documentation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:136
msgid ""
"When the :guilabel:`Expense Digitization (OCR)` option is enabled, a "
"necessary module is installed, so receipts can be scanned. Disabling this "
"option uninstalls the module."
msgstr ""
"啟用:guilabel:`開支數碼化 (OCR)`選項後，系統會安裝必要模組，以便掃描收據。停"
"用此選項將會解除安裝該模組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:139
msgid ""
"If, at some point, there is a desire to temporarily stop digitizing "
"receipts, select the :guilabel:`Do not digitize` option. The reason this "
"option is available is so the module is not uninstalled, allowing for "
"digitization to be enabled in the future by selecting one of the other two "
"options."
msgstr ""
"如果日後想暫時停止將收據數碼化，請選擇 :guilabel:`不數碼化` 選項。提供此選項"
"的原因是讓用戶無需卸載模組，日後只需選擇另外兩個選項之一，即可重新啟用數碼化"
"功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:147
msgid "Upload receipts"
msgstr "上載收據"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:149
msgid ""
"Open the :guilabel:`Expenses app`, and from the :guilabel:`My Expenses` "
"dashboard, click :guilabel:`Upload`, and a file explorer appears. Navigate "
"to the desired receipt, select it, then click :guilabel:`Open`."
msgstr ""
"開啟 :guilabel:`開支應用程式`，在 :guilabel:`我的開支` 儀表板中點擊 "
":guilabel:`上載`，隨即會出現檔案瀏覽器。前往所需收據的位置並選取，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`開啟`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:153
msgid ""
"The receipt is scanned, and a new expense record is created. The "
":guilabel:`Expense Date` field is populated with today's date, along with "
"any other fields based on the scanned data, such as the :guilabel:`Total`."
msgstr ""
"系統會掃描收據並建立新的開支記錄。:guilabel:`開支日期`欄位會自動填入今天的日"
"期，而其他欄位亦會根據掃描所得的資料填入，例如:guilabel:`總計`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:157
msgid ""
"Click on the new entry to open the individual expense form, and make any "
"changes, if needed. The scanned receipt appears in the *chatter*."
msgstr ""
"點擊新記錄以開啟個別開支表格，並在需要時作出修改。掃描的收據會顯示在 *通訊"
"欄* 中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:163
msgid "Drag and drop an expense"
msgstr "拖放開支"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:165
msgid ""
"If :ref:`digitalization is enabled <expenses/digitalization>`, drag and drop"
" a receipt onto the **Expenses** app dashboard. The receipt is scanned and "
"appears by itself on the :guilabel:`Generate Expenses` dashboard."
msgstr ""
"如果:ref:`已啟用數碼化功能 <expenses/digitalization>`，請將收據拖放到 **費"
"用** 應用程式儀表板上。系統會掃描收據，並將其單獨顯示在:guilabel:`產生費用`儀"
"表板上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:169
msgid ""
"Click on the expense record, and modify the details as needed. After changes"
" are made, return to the :guilabel:`My Expenses` dashboard, and the expense "
"now appears in the list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:175
msgid "Email expenses"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:177
msgid ""
"Instead of individually creating each expense in the **Expenses** app, "
"expenses can be automatically created by sending an email to an email alias."
msgstr ""
"您無需在 **開支** 應用程式中逐一建立每筆開支，只需將電郵傳送至電郵別名，即可"
"自動建立開支。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:181
msgid ""
"For security purposes, only authenticated employee emails are accepted by "
"Odoo when creating an expense from an email. To confirm an authenticated "
"employee email address, go to the employee card in the "
":menuselection:`Employees app`, and refer to the :guilabel:`Work Email` "
"field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:185
msgid "Create the domain alias by clicking the link."
msgstr "按一下連結以建立網域別名。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:188
msgid ""
"To do so, an email alias must first be configured. Navigate to "
":menuselection:`Expenses app --> Configuration --> Settings`. Ensure the "
"checkbox beside :guilabel:`Incoming Emails` is ticked. The default email "
"alias is *expense@(domain).com*. Change the email alias by entering the "
"desired email in the field to the right of :guilabel:`Alias`. Then, click "
":guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"為此，必須先配置電郵別名。前往 :menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設"
"定`。確保已剔選 :guilabel:`接收電郵` 旁邊的複選框。預設電郵別名為 *expense@"
"(domain).com*。在 :guilabel:`別名` 右側欄位輸入所需電郵地址，即可更改電郵別名"
"。然後按一下 :guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:194
msgid ""
"If the domain alias needs to be set up, :icon:`fa-arrow-right` "
":guilabel:`Setup your domain alias` appears beneath the :guilabel:`Incoming "
"Emails` checkbox, instead of the email address field."
msgstr ""
"如果需要設定網域別名，:icon:`fa-arrow-right` :guilabel:`設定您的網域別名` 會"
"顯示在 :guilabel:`收件電郵` 核取方塊下方，取代電郵地址欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:198
msgid ""
"Refer to the "
":doc:`/applications/websites/website/configuration/domain_names` "
"documentation for setup instructions and more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:201
msgid ""
"Once the domain alias is configured, the email address field is visible "
"beneath the :guilabel:`Incoming Emails` feature on the :guilabel:`Settings` "
"page in the **Expenses** app."
msgstr ""
"設定網域別名後，電郵地址欄位便會顯示在 :guilabel:`接收電郵` 功能下方，位於 "
"**費用** 應用程式的 :guilabel:`設定` 頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:204
msgid ""
"Once the email address has been entered, emails can be sent to that alias to"
" create new expenses, without having to be in the Odoo database."
msgstr "輸入電郵地址後，即可發送電郵至該別名以建立新開支，而無需在 Odoo 資料庫中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:207
msgid ""
"To submit an expense via email, create a new email, and enter the product's "
"*reference* code (if available) and the amount of the expense as the subject"
" of the email. Next, attach the receipt to the email. Odoo creates the "
"expense by taking the information in the email subject, and combining it "
"with the receipt."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:213
msgid ""
"To check an expense category's reference code, go to "
":menuselection:`Expenses app --> Configuration --> Expense Categories`. "
"Reference codes are listed in the :guilabel:`Reference` column."
msgstr ""
"如要查看開支類別的參考編號，請前往 :menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 配置 --> "
"開支類別`。參考編號會列於 :guilabel:`參考` 欄中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:217
msgid ""
"To add a reference code to an expense category, click on the category to "
"open the expense category form. Enter the reference code in the "
":guilabel:`Reference` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:220
msgid "Reference categories displayed in the main Expense Categories view."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:224
msgid ""
"If submitting an expense, via email, for a $25.00 meal during a work trip, "
"the email subject would be `FOOD $25.00`."
msgstr ""
"如透過電郵提交公幹期間一頓 $25.00 膳食的開支申請，電郵主旨應為 `FOOD "
"$25.00`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:227
msgid "Explanation:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:229
msgid "The :guilabel:`Reference` for the expense category `Meals` is `FOOD`"
msgstr "開支類別 `Meals` 的:guilabel:`參考`為 `FOOD`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/log_expenses.rst:230
msgid "The :guilabel:`Cost` for the expense is `$25.00`"
msgstr "該筆開支的 :guilabel:`成本` 為 `$25.00`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:3
msgid "Post expenses"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:5
msgid ""
"Once an expense is :doc:`approved <../expenses/approve_expenses>`, the next "
"step is to post the expense to the proper accounting journal."
msgstr ""
"當開支獲:doc:`批核 <../expenses/approve_expenses>`後，下一步是將該開支過帳至"
"適當的會計日記帳。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:9
msgid ""
"To post an expense to an accounting journal, the user **must** have the "
"following :doc:`access rights <../../general/users/access_rights>`:"
msgstr ""
"要將開支過賬至會計日記賬，用戶 **必須** 擁有以下 :doc:`存取權限 <../../"
"general/users/access_rights>`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:12
msgid "Accounting: *Accountant* or *Adviser*"
msgstr "會計：*會計師* 或 *顧問*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:13
msgid "Expenses: *Manager*"
msgstr "開支：*管理員*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:15
msgid ""
"Only expenses with an *Approved* status can be posted to a journal. To view "
"all expenses ready to be posted, navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app "
"--> My Expenses --> Expenses to Process`. Next, to view **only** approved "
"expenses that need to be posted, adjust the filters on the left side so only"
" the :guilabel:`Approved` checkbox is ticked."
msgstr ""
"只有狀態為 *已批准* 的開支才可過賬至日記賬。如要檢視所有準備過賬的開支，請前"
"往 :menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 我的開支 --> 待處理開支` 。接著，如要 "
"**僅** 檢視需要過賬的已批准開支，請調整左側的篩選條件，只剔選 :guilabel:`已批"
"准` 核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:20
msgid ""
"Expenses can be posted to accounting journals in two ways: "
":ref:`individually <expenses/post-individual>` or :ref:`in bulk "
"<expenses/post-multiple>`."
msgstr ""
"開支可透過兩種方式過賬至會計日記賬：:ref:`逐項 <expenses/post-individual>"
"`或:ref:`批量 <expenses/post-multiple>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:23
msgid ""
"View reports to post by clicking on expense reports, then reports to post."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:27
msgid ""
"The default :guilabel:`Expenses to Process` dashboard displays all expenses "
"with a status of :guilabel:`Submitted`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:33
msgid "Post individual expenses"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:35
msgid ""
"To post an individual expense, navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app --> "
"My Expenses --> Expenses to Process`, and click on an individual expense, to"
" view the detailed expense form. In this view, several options are "
"presented: :guilabel:`Post Journal Entries`, :guilabel:`Report In Next "
"Payslip`, :guilabel:`Refuse`, :guilabel:`Reset`, :guilabel:`Split Expense`, "
"and :guilabel:`Attach Receipt`."
msgstr ""
"如要過賬單項開支，請前往:menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 我的開支 --> 待處理"
"開支`，點擊單項開支以檢視詳細的開支表單。此檢視畫面提供多個選項"
"：:guilabel:`過賬日記賬記項`、:guilabel:`於下期糧單申報`、:guilabel:`拒"
"絕`、:guilabel:`重設`、:guilabel:`分拆開支`及:guilabel:`附加收據`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:40
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Post Journal Entries` and a *Post expenses* pop-up window "
"loads. The default accounting journal for the expense category populates the"
" :guilabel:`Journal` field, but can be modified if needed. The default "
"journal for all expense categories is *Purchases*. Additionally, the date of"
" the expense populates the :guilabel:`Accounting Date` field, indicating "
"when the expense was incurred."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :guilabel:`過賬日記賬分錄`，隨即會載入 *過賬開支* 彈出式視窗。開支類別"
"的預設會計日記賬會自動填入 :guilabel:`日記賬` 欄位，但如有需要可作出修改。所"
"有開支類別的預設日記賬均為 *採購*。此外，開支日期會填入 :guilabel:`會計日期` "
"欄位，以顯示開支發生的日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:46
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Post Expenses` button, and the journal entry loads, "
"displaying all the details, and has a status of :guilabel:`Posted`."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`過賬開支` 按鈕後，系統會載入日記賬分錄並顯示所有詳細資料，其"
"狀態會變為 :guilabel:`已過賬`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:49
msgid "A single expense report to be approved."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:55
msgid "Post multiple expenses"
msgstr "過帳多項開支"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:57
msgid ""
"To post multiple expenses at once, navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app "
"--> My Expenses --> Expenses to Process`, then adjust the filters on the "
"left side so only the :guilabel:`Approved` checkbox is ticked. Next, select "
"the expenses to approve by ticking the checkbox next to each expense being "
"approved."
msgstr ""
"要一次過過賬多項開支，請前往:menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 我的開支 --> 待"
"處理開支`，然後調整左側的篩選條件，只剔選:guilabel:`已核准`核取方塊。接著，剔"
"選每項要核准的開支旁的核取方塊，以選取要核准的開支。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:62
msgid ""
"Next, click the :guilabel:`Post Entries` button. A *Post Expenses* pop-up "
"window loads, with the default accounting journal :guilabel:`Purchases` "
"populating the :guilabel:`Journal` field, and the expense date populating "
"the :guilabel:`Accounting date` field. Make any necessary modifications, "
"then click :guilabel:`Post Expenses`."
msgstr ""
"接著，點擊 :guilabel:`過帳分錄` 按鈕。系統會載入 *過帳開支* 彈出視窗，其中預"
"設會計日記帳 :guilabel:`採購` 會填入 :guilabel:`日記帳` 欄位，而開支日期會填"
"入 :guilabel:`會計日期` 欄位。如有需要，請進行修改，然後點擊 :guilabel:`過帳"
"開支`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:67
msgid ""
"Once posted, the list changes ot show all the various accounting journal "
"entries created. Click on any entry to view the accounting journal details."
msgstr ""
"過賬後，列表會更新並顯示所有已建立的會計日記賬分錄。點按任何分錄即可查看會計"
"日記賬詳情。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:71
msgid ""
"Only expenses with a status of :guilabel:`Approved` can be posted to an "
"accounting journal. If an expense is selected that **cannot** be posted, "
"such as an unapproved expense, or the expense has already been posted to a "
"journal, the :guilabel:`Post Entries` button is **not** visible."
msgstr ""
"只有狀態為:guilabel:`已批准`的費用才可過賬至會計日記賬。如果所選費用**無"
"法**過賬（例如未經批准的費用，或該費用已過賬至日記賬），則**不會**顯"
"示:guilabel:`過賬分錄`按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/post_expenses.rst:75
msgid ""
"Post multiple reports at a time from the Expense Reports view, with the "
"Approved filter."
msgstr "使用「已批准」篩選條件，在開支報告檢視畫面中一次過帳多份報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:3
msgid "Reimburse employees"
msgstr "向員工報銷"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:5
msgid ""
"After an expense is :doc:`posted to an accounting journal "
"<../expenses/post_expenses>`, the next step is to reimburse the employee. "
"Employees can be reimbursed :ref:`directly in their paychecks "
"<expenses/reimburse-payslip>`, or an individual expense can be "
":ref:`reimbursed via cash, check, or direct deposit <expenses/reimburse-"
"single>`."
msgstr ""
"開支 :doc:`過賬至會計日記賬 <../expenses/post_expenses>` 後，下一步便是向員工"
"報銷。員工可以 :ref:`直接在薪資單中獲發報銷款項 <expenses/reimburse-payslip>"
"`，或者個別開支可以 :ref:`透過現金、支票或直接存款報銷 <expenses/reimburse-"
"single>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:13
msgid "Reimbursement settings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:15
msgid ""
"Reimbursements can be paid via a paycheck, check, cash, or bank transfer "
"(usually referred to as direct deposit). To set up payment options, first "
"configure the various settings by navigating to the :menuselection:`Expenses"
" app --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr ""
"報銷款項可透過薪資支票、支票、現金或銀行轉賬（通常稱為直接存款）支付。若要設"
"定付款選項，請先前往 :menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 配置 --> 設定` 配置各項"
"設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:19
msgid ""
"To reimburse employees for expenses :ref:`in their paychecks "
"<expenses/reimburse-payslip>`, tick the checkbox beside the "
":guilabel:`Reimburse in Payslip` option in the :guilabel:`Expenses` section."
msgstr ""
"如要 :ref:`在薪資單中 <expenses/reimburse-payslip>` 向員工報銷開支，請勾選 "
":guilabel:`在薪資單中報銷` 選項旁的核取方塊（位於 :guilabel:`開支` 部分）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:22
msgid ""
"Next, set how payments are made in the :guilabel:`Accounting` section. Click"
" the drop-down menu under :guilabel:`Payment Methods`, and select the "
"desired payment option. The default options include paying by "
":guilabel:`Manual Payment (Bank)`, :guilabel:`Batch Deposit (Bank)`, and "
":guilabel:`Checks (Bank)`. Depending on the installed :doc:`payroll "
"localization <../../hr/payroll/payroll_localizations>`, additional options "
"may appear."
msgstr ""
"接著，在 :guilabel:`會計` 部分設定付款方式。點擊 :guilabel:`付款方式` 下方的"
"下拉式選單，並選擇所需的付款選項。預設選項包括透過 :guilabel:`手動付款（銀行"
"）`、:guilabel:`批量存款（銀行）` 及 :guilabel:`支票（銀行）` 付款。視乎已安"
"裝的 :doc:`薪酬本地化 <../../hr/payroll/payroll_localizations>`，系統可能會顯"
"示其他選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:28
msgid ""
"Leaving this field blank allows for **all** available payment options to be "
"used."
msgstr "將此欄位留空，即可使用 **所有** 可用的付款選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:30
msgid ""
"When all desired configurations are complete, click :guilabel:`Save` to "
"activate the settings."
msgstr "完成所有所需配置後，點擊 :guilabel:`儲存` 以啟用設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:35
msgid "Reimburse in payslips"
msgstr "於糧單中報銷"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:37
msgid ""
"If the  *Reimburse in Payslip* option is activated on the :ref:`settings "
"<expenses/reimburse-settings>` page, payments can be added to the employee's"
" next payslip, instead of issuing separate payments."
msgstr ""
"如果在 :ref:`設定 <expenses/reimburse-settings>` 頁面啟用了 *在糧單中報銷* 選"
"項，款項可加入員工的下一張糧單中，而無需另外開立付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:42
msgid ""
"Only expenses with a status of :guilabel:`Approved` and :guilabel:`Posted` "
"are able to be reimbursed in a payslip. If an expense with a different "
"status is selected, a warning appears when attempting to repay the expense "
"in a payslip."
msgstr ""
"只有狀態為 :guilabel:`已批核` 及 :guilabel:`已過帳` 的開支才可在薪資單中報銷"
"。若選擇其他狀態的開支，在嘗試透過薪資單償還該開支時，系統便會顯示警告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:47
msgid ":doc:`Payslips <../../hr/payroll/payslips>`"
msgstr ":doc:`糧單 <../../hr/payroll/payslips>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:52
msgid "Reimburse individually"
msgstr "個別報銷"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:54
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app --> My Expenses --> Expenses to "
"Process`, and click on an expense with a :guilabel:`Status` of "
":guilabel:`Approved` or :guilabel:`Posted`."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 我的開支 --> 待處理開支`，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`狀態` 為 :guilabel:`已批准` 或 :guilabel:`已過賬` 的開支項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:57
msgid ""
"On the individual expense, click the :guilabel:`Report in Next Payslip` "
"button. A message is logged in the chatter stating the `Expense (\"Expense "
"Name\") will be added to the next payslip.` The status for the expense "
"remains unchanged, but changes to :guilabel:`Posted` when the journal entry "
"is posted, then :guilabel:`Paid` when the related payslip is processed."
msgstr ""
"在個別開支項目上，點擊 :guilabel:`於下期糧單申報` 按鈕。通訊欄會記錄一則訊息"
"，顯示 `開支（「開支名稱」）將加入至下期糧單。` 開支狀態保持不變，但會在日記"
"賬分錄過賬後變更為 :guilabel:`已過賬`，並在處理相關糧單後變更為 :guilabel:`已"
"付款`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:62
msgid ""
"If the expense is repaid in another manner before the payslip is processed, "
"the expense can be removed from the payslip by clicking the "
":guilabel:`Remove from Payslip` button."
msgstr ""
"如在處理薪資單前已透過其他方式償還開支，可點擊 :guilabel:`從薪資單移除` 按鈕"
"，從薪資單中移除該開支。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:65
msgid "The Report in Next Payslip button, visible on an expense."
msgstr "顯示在開支上的「在下次薪資單中報告」按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:71
msgid "Reimburse in bulk"
msgstr "批量報銷"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:73
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses app --> My Expenses --> Expenses to "
"Process`, and click the checkbox next to all the expenses being reimbursed."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 我的開支 --> 待處理開支`，然後點擊所有"
"正在報銷的開支旁邊的複選框。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:77
msgid ""
"To select *all* reimbursable expenses, adjust the side menu so that only "
":guilabel:`Approved` or :guilabel:`Posted` are checked. Next, click the "
"checkbox next to :guilabel:`Employee` to select all expenses."
msgstr ""
"如要選擇 *所有* 可報銷開支，請調整側邊選單，只勾選 :guilabel:`已批准` 或 "
":guilabel:`已過賬`。接著，點擊 :guilabel:`員工` 旁邊的核取方塊，以選擇所有開"
"支。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:81
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`Actions` button, then select "
":guilabel:`Report in Next Payslip` from the resulting drop-down menu. "
":guilabel:`Report in Next Payslip` button, and the expenses are all added to"
" the next payslip issued for the corresponding employee."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :icon:`fa-gear` :guilabel:`動作` 按鈕，然後從下拉式選單中選"
"擇:guilabel:`於下期糧單申報`。:guilabel:`於下期糧單申報` 按鈕，所有開支便會加"
"入至相應員工的下一張糧單中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:85
msgid ""
"Nothing changes on the :guilabel:`Expenses to Process` dashboard, but a "
"message is logged in the chatter of each individual expense stating the "
"`Expense (\"Expense Name\") will be added to the next payslip.` The status "
"for the individual expenses remains unchanged, but changes to "
":guilabel:`Posted` when the journal entry is posted, then :guilabel:`Paid` "
"when the related payslip is processed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:94
msgid "Reimburse expenses via cash, check, or direct deposit"
msgstr "透過現金、支票或直接存款報銷開支"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:96
msgid ""
"To reimburse an individual expense, navigate to the :menuselection:`Expenses"
" app --> My Expenses --> Expenses to Process`, and the :guilabel:`Expenses "
"to Process` dashboard appears, displaying all :guilabel:`Submitted` "
"expenses. Adjust the side menu to display only :guilabel:`Posted` expenses."
msgstr ""
"要報銷單筆開支，請前往 :menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 我的開支 --> 待處理開"
"支`，隨即會顯示 :guilabel:`待處理開支` 儀表板，當中列出所有 :guilabel:`已提"
"交` 開支。調整側邊選單，以僅顯示 :guilabel:`已過賬` 開支。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:101
msgid ""
"Only expenses that have been :doc:`posted to an accounting journal "
"<post_expenses>` (expenses with a status of :guilabel:`Posted`) can be "
"reimbursed."
msgstr ""
"只有已 :doc:`過賬至會計日記賬 <post_expenses>` 的開支（狀態為 :guilabel:`已過"
"賬` 的開支）才可報銷。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:104
msgid ""
"Click the expense to pay, then click the :icon:`fa-bars` :guilabel:`Journal "
"Entry` smart button. On the journal entry, click the :guilabel:`Pay` button."
" In the *Pay* pop-up window, enter the following information in the pop-up "
"window:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:108
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Journal`: Select the accounting journal to post the payment using"
" the drop-down menu. The default journal is :guilabel:`Bank`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`日記賬`：使用下拉式選單選擇用以過賬付款的會計日記賬。預設日記賬為 "
":guilabel:`銀行`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:110
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payment Method`: Select how the payment is made using the drop-"
"down menu. If :guilabel:`Cash` is selected for the :guilabel:`Journal`, the "
"only option available is :guilabel:`Manual Payment`. If :guilabel:`Bank` is "
"selected for the :guilabel:`Journal`, the default options are "
":guilabel:`Manual Payment` or :guilabel:`Checks`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`付款方式`：使用下拉式選單選擇付款方式。如果選取:guilabel:`現金`作"
"為:guilabel:`日記賬`，則唯一可用的選項為:guilabel:`手動付款`。如果選"
"取:guilabel:`銀行`作為:guilabel:`日記賬`，則預設選項為:guilabel:`手動付"
"款`或:guilabel:`支票`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:114
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Recipient Bank Account`: This field only appears if the "
":guilabel:`Journal` is set to :guilabel:`Bank`, and the :guilabel:`Payment "
"Method` is set to :guilabel:`Manual Payment`. The employee's :ref:`bank "
"account <employees/private-info>` populates this field, by default. If the "
"employee has more than one trusted bank account on their employee profile, "
"use the drop-down menu to select the desired bank account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`收款銀行賬戶`：只有當 :guilabel:`日記賬` 設為 :guilabel:`銀行`，"
"且 :guilabel:`付款方式` 設為 :guilabel:`手動付款` 時，此欄位才會顯示。預設情"
"況下，此欄位會填入員工的 :ref:`銀行賬戶 <employees/private-info>`。如果員工個"
"人資料中有多個受信任的銀行賬戶，請使用下拉式選單選擇所需的銀行賬戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:119
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Amount`: The total amount being reimbursed populates this field "
"by default."
msgstr ":guilabel:`金額`：此欄位預設會填入報銷的總金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:120
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Payment Date`: Enter the date the payment is issued in this "
"field. The current date populates this field by default."
msgstr ":guilabel:`付款日期`：在此欄位輸入發出付款的日期。此欄位預設會填入目前日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:122
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Memo`: The text entered in the :guilabel:`Description` field of "
"the expense form populates this field by default."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`備忘`：此欄位預設會填入開支表單中 :guilabel:`描述` 欄位所輸入的文"
"字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:125
msgid ""
"When the fields of the pop-up window are completed, click the "
":guilabel:`Create Payment` button to register the payment, and reimburse the"
" employee. A green :guilabel:`Paid` banner now appears on the journal entry."
msgstr ""
"填妥彈出視窗的欄位後，點擊 :guilabel:`建立付款` 按鈕以登記付款並向員工報銷。"
"日記賬分錄上隨即會顯示綠色的 :guilabel:`已付款` 橫幅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reimburse.rst:129
msgid ""
"The Register Payment pop-up window filled out for an individual expense report\n"
"reimbursement."
msgstr ""
"為個別開支報告報銷而填妥的\n"
"「登記付款」彈出視窗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reinvoice_expenses.rst:3
msgid "Reinvoice expenses"
msgstr "重新開立開支發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reinvoice_expenses.rst:5
msgid ""
"If expenses are tracked on customer projects, they can be automatically "
"charged back to the customer. This is done by :ref:`logging an expense "
"<expenses/reinvoice-create>`, referencing the corresponding sales order, and"
" then :ref:`creating an expense report <expenses/reinvoice-expense-report>`."
msgstr ""
"如果在客戶項目中追蹤開支，系統便可自動向客戶收取有關費用。方法是先 :ref:`記錄"
"開支 <expenses/reinvoice-create>`，關聯相應的銷售訂單，然後 :ref:`建立開支報"
"告 <expenses/reinvoice-expense-report>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reinvoice_expenses.rst:10
msgid ""
"Next, managers :ref:`approve the expense report <expenses/reinvoice-"
"approve>`, then the accounting department :ref:`post the journal entries "
"<expenses/reinvoice-approve>`."
msgstr ""
"接下來，管理人員會:ref:`批核開支報告 <expenses/reinvoice-approve>`，然後會計"
"部門會:ref:`過賬日記賬記項 <expenses/reinvoice-approve>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reinvoice_expenses.rst:13
msgid ""
"Finally, once the expense report is posted to a journal, the expenses appear"
" on the specified :abbr:`SO (Sales Order)`. When the :abbr:`SO (Sales "
"Order)` is :ref:`invoiced <expenses/reinvoice>`, the customer is charged for"
" the expenses."
msgstr ""
"最後，將開支報告過賬至日記賬後，開支便會顯示在指定的 :abbr:`SO（銷售訂單）` "
"上。當為該 :abbr:`SO（銷售訂單）` :ref:`開立發票 <expenses/reinvoice>` 時，系"
"統會向客戶收取相關開支。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reinvoice_expenses.rst:18
msgid ""
"Approving expenses, posting expenses to accounting, and reinvoicing expenses"
" on :abbr:`SOs (Sales Orders)` is **only** possible for users with the "
"appropriate :doc:`access rights <../../general/users/access_rights>`."
msgstr ""
"在:abbr:`銷售訂單 (SO)`上審批開支、將開支過賬至會計，以及重新開立開支發票"
"，**僅限**具備適當:doc:`存取權限 <../../general/users/access_rights>`的用戶操"
"作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reinvoice_expenses.rst:23
msgid ""
"This document provides lower-level instructions for the creation, "
"submission, approval, and posting of expenses. For fully-detailed "
"instructions for any of these steps, refer to the following documentation:"
msgstr ""
"本文件提供建立、提交、核准及過帳開支的基本指引。如欲了解各步驟的完整詳細說明"
"，請參閱以下文件："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reinvoice_expenses.rst:27
msgid ":doc:`Log expenses <../expenses/log_expenses>`"
msgstr ":doc:`記錄開支 <../expenses/log_expenses>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reinvoice_expenses.rst:28
msgid ":doc:`Submit expenses <../expenses/submit_expenses>`"
msgstr ":doc:`提交開支 <../expenses/submit_expenses>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/reinvoice_expenses.rst:29
