msgstr "我的開支儀表板"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/submit_expenses.rst:13
msgid ""
"Open the **Expenses** app, which displays the :guilabel:`My Expenses` "
"dashboard, by default. Alternatively, navigate to :menuselection:`Expenses "
"app --> My Expenses --> My Expenses`."
msgstr ""
"開啟 **開支** 應用程式，系統預設會顯示 :guilabel:`我的開支` 儀表板。你亦可前"
"往 :menuselection:`開支應用程式 --> 我的開支 --> 我的開支`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/submit_expenses.rst:16
msgid ""
"All expenses are color-coded by status. Any expense with a status of "
":guilabel:`Draft` (expenses that have been created but not submitted) "
"appears in blue text. For all other statuses (:guilabel:`Submitted`, "
":guilabel:`Approved`, and :guilabel:`Refused`), the text appears in black."
msgstr ""
"所有開支都會按狀態以顏色標示。任何狀態為 :guilabel:`草稿` 的開支（已建立但尚"
"未提交的開支），其文字會顯示為藍色。至於所有其他狀態（:guilabel:`已提"
"交`、:guilabel:`已批核` 及 :guilabel:`已拒絕`），其文字則會顯示為黑色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/submit_expenses.rst:20
msgid ""
"Above the list of expenses is the total monetary value of all expenses "
"waiting to be submitted, waiting for approval, or waiting for reimbursement."
" Expenses with a status of :guilabel:`Draft` are used to calculate the "
"amount in the :guilabel:`To Submit` field, expenses with a status of "
":guilabel:`Submitted` are used to calculate the :guilabel:`Waiting Approval`"
" amount, and expenses with a status of :guilabel:`Approved` are used to "
"calculate the :guilabel:`Waiting Reimbursement` total."
msgstr ""
"開支列表上方顯示所有待提交、待批核或待報銷開支的總金額。狀態為 :guilabel:`草"
"稿` 的開支會計入 :guilabel:`待提交` 欄位的金額；狀態為 :guilabel:`已提交` 的"
"開支會計入 :guilabel:`待批核` 金額；而狀態為 :guilabel:`已批核` 的開支則會計"
"入 :guilabel:`待報銷` 總額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/submit_expenses.rst:27
msgid ""
"The top banner above the My Expenses dashboard with all the various totals "
"by status.\\"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/submit_expenses.rst:31
msgid ""
"While any expense can be selected from the :guilabel:`My Expenses` list, the"
" :guilabel:`Submit` button is *only* visible when expenses with a status of "
":guilabel:`Draft` are selected. If any other status of expense is selected, "
"the :guilabel:`Submit` button does **not** appear."
msgstr ""
"雖然可從 :guilabel:`我的開支` 列表中選擇任何開支項目，但 :guilabel:`提交` 按"
"鈕 *僅* 在所選開支的狀態為 :guilabel:`草稿` 時顯示。如選擇任何其他狀態的開支"
"，:guilabel:`提交` 按鈕 **不會** 出現。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/submit_expenses.rst:36
msgid ""
"Another way to select all expenses with a :guilabel:`Draft` status is to "
"click into the search bar and select :guilabel:`To Submit` in the :icon:`fa-"
"filter` :guilabel:`Filters` column, then click the checkbox next to "
":guilabel:`Employee`."
msgstr ""
"另一種選取所有處於 :guilabel:`草稿` 狀態開支的方法，是點擊搜尋欄並選取 "
":guilabel:`待提交`（在 :icon:`fa-filter` :guilabel:`篩選條件` 欄中），然後點"
"擊 :guilabel:`員工` 旁邊的核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/expenses/submit_expenses.rst:41
msgid "Submit expense records"
msgstr "提交開支記錄"

