#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:358
msgid ""
"**Generate renewal request**: In the :guilabel:`ARCA Web Services` section, "
"click :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Generate Renewal Request` to "
"generate a `.csr` (certificate signing request) file to use in the |ARCA| "
