msgstr ""
"**產生續期申請**：在 :guilabel:`ARCA 網頁服務` 區域中，按一下 :icon:`oi-"
"arrow-right` :guilabel:`產生續期申請`，以產生 `.csr`（憑證簽署要求）檔案，供"
"在 |ARCA| 門戶網站申請憑證之用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:361
msgid ""
"**Obtain certificate (ARCA)**: Access the |ARCA| portal and follow the "
"instructions described in `this document "
"<https://drive.google.com/file/d/17OKX2lNWd1bjUt3NxfqcCKBkBh-Xlpo-/view>`_ "
"to get a certificate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:364
msgid ""
