" into Odoo, click the :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`(Internal link)` "
"icon next to the :guilabel:`Certificate` field and select the corresponding "
"file. Then add the existing private key that was created after clicking "
":guilabel:`Generate Renewal Request`."
msgstr ""
"**上載憑證並新增私鑰（Odoo）**：要將憑證上載至 Odoo，請按一下 :icon:`oi-"
"arrow-right` :guilabel:`（內部連結）` 圖示（位於 :guilabel:`憑證` 欄位旁），"
"然後選擇相應的檔案。然後，加入在點擊 :guilabel:`生成續期請求` 後建立的現有私"
"鑰。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:370
msgid ""
"When a created certificate expires, click :guilabel:`Generate Renewal "
"Request` to generate a new certificate."
msgstr "當已建立的憑證到期時，點擊 :guilabel:`產生續期請求`，即可產生新憑證。"

