#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:664
msgid "Validate vendor bills in Odoo"
msgstr "在 Odoo 中驗證供應商賬單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:666
msgid ""
"Once the :ref:`vendor bill validation settings are enabled "
"<localizations/argentina/validate-vendor-bill>`, click :guilabel:`Verify on "
"ARCA` in the :guilabel:`Authorization code` field."
msgstr ""
"完成 :ref:`啟用供應商賬單驗證設定 <localizations/argentina/validate-vendor-"
"bill>` 後，請按一下 :guilabel:`在 ARCA 上驗證`（位於 :guilabel:`授權碼` 欄位"
"中）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:670
msgid ""
"If the vendor bill cannot be validated in ARCA, the status is updated to "
":guilabel:`Rejected` in the :guilabel:`Authorization code` field, and the "
"details are recorded in the chatter."
msgstr ""
"如供應商賬單無法在 ARCA 完成驗證，系統會將狀態更新為 :guilabel:`已拒絕`（於 "
":guilabel:`授權碼` 欄位顯示），並於通訊記錄中記下詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:681
msgid "Untaxed concepts"
msgstr "未稅項目"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:683
msgid ""
"Some transactions include items that are not part of the VAT base amount, "
"such as fuel and gasoline invoices."
msgstr "部分交易包含不屬於增值稅計稅基礎金額的項目，例如燃油及汽油發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:686
msgid ""
"The vendor bill will be recorded using one item for each product that is "
"part of the VAT base amount, and an additional item to register the amount "
"of the exempt concept."
msgstr ""
"記錄供應商帳單時，系統會為構成增值稅稅基的每項產品各建立一個項目，並額外建立"
"一個項目以登記免稅項目的金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:689
msgid "VAT exempt."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:695
msgid "Perception taxes"
msgstr "預徵稅"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:697
msgid ""
"The vendor bill will be recorded using one item for each product that is "
"part of the VAT base amount, and the perception tax can be added to any of "
"the product lines. As a result, there will be one tax group for the VAT and "
"another for the perception. The perception default value is always "
":guilabel:`0.10`."
msgstr ""
"系統會為計入增值稅基數金額的每項產品使用一個項目來記錄供應商賬單，而預徵稅可"
"新增至任何產品明細行。因此，增值稅和預徵稅會各有一個稅項群組。預徵稅的預設值"
"一律為 :guilabel:`0.10`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:702
msgid ""
"To edit the VAT perception and set the correct amount, you should use the "
":guilabel:`Pencil` icon next to the :guilabel:`Perception` amount. After the"
" VAT perception amount has been set, the invoice can be validated."
msgstr ""
"如要編輯增值稅預徵稅並設定正確金額，你應使用 :guilabel:`鉛筆` 圖示（位於 "
":guilabel:`預徵稅` 金額旁邊）。設定增值稅預徵稅金額後，即可驗證發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:706
msgid "Enter the perception amount."
msgstr "輸入預徵稅金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:712
msgid "Withholding management"
msgstr "預扣稅管理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:715
msgid ""
"Make sure the :guilabel:`Argentina Payment Withholdings` "
"(`l10n_ar_withholding`) module is :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""
"請確保 :guilabel:`阿根廷付款預扣稅`（`l10n_ar_withholding`）模組已 :ref:`安"
"裝 <general/install>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:718
msgid ""
"The Argentinian fiscal localization module contains the necessary "
"withholding records, which can be seen by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes` and removing the "
"default :guilabel:`Sale or Purchase` filter."
msgstr ""
"阿根廷財政本地化模組包含所需的預扣稅記錄。你可前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> "
"配置 --> 稅項`，並移除預設的 :guilabel:`銷售或採購` 篩選條件來查看這些記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:722
msgid ""
"Journal entries are *not* created when payments are posted unless "
":ref:`outstanding accounts <accounting/journals/outstanding-accounts>` are "
"set up. Thus, for this feature to work properly, it is important to verify "
"that *all* payment methods within the bank journals have an outstanding "
"payment and receipt account set."
msgstr ""
"除非已設定:ref:`未結帳戶 <accounting/journals/outstanding-accounts>`，否則過"
"賬付款時 *不會* 建立日記賬記項。因此，為確保此功能正常運作，務必核實銀行日記"
"賬內的 *所有* 付款方式均已設定未結付款及收款帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:727
msgid "An outstanding payment account must be set."
msgstr "必須設定未結付款帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:730
msgid ""
"This configuration is crucial for the proper accounting of withholding "
"transactions with clients and vendors."
msgstr "此設定對於正確處理與客戶及供應商之間的預扣交易會計入帳至關重要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:734
msgid ""
"In Argentina, withholdings represent the cancellation of a specific portion "
"of the total debt owed to a supplier or a reduction in the total payment to "
"be collected from a customer. Therefore, one or multiple withholdings can be"
" recorded for each payment applied to an invoice."
msgstr ""
"在阿根廷，預扣稅代表抵銷應付予供應商的總欠款中的特定部分，或減少向客戶收取的"
"總付款金額。因此，套用至發票的每筆付款均可記錄一項或多項預扣稅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:743
msgid ""
"While Odoo already creates most of the required withholdings inside the "
":guilabel:`Taxes` menu, in several cases it is necessary to apply or modify "
"configurations to correctly calculate the withholding amount on vendor "
"payments. The following withholding types are available:"
msgstr ""
"雖然 Odoo 已在 :guilabel:`稅項` 選單中建立大部分所需的預扣稅項目，但在部分情"
"況下，仍須套用或修改設定，才能正確計算供應商付款的預扣金額。系統提供以下預扣"
"稅類型："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:747
msgid ":ref:`Earnings <localizations/argentina/earnings-withholdings>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:748
msgid ""
":ref:`Earnings Scale <localizations/argentina/earnings-scale-withholdings>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:749
msgid ""
":ref:`IIBB Total Amount <localizations/argentina/iib-total-amount-"
"withholdings>`"
msgstr ":ref:`IIBB 總金額 <localizations/argentina/iib-total-amount-withholdings>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:750
msgid ""
":ref:`IIBB Non-Taxable <localizations/argentina/iib-nontax-withholdings>`"
msgstr ":ref:`IIBB 非應稅 <localizations/argentina/iib-nontax-withholdings>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:755
msgid "Earnings"
msgstr "收益"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:757
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Earnings` withholdings, Odoo already has a record for each "
"regime group, which is listed under the tax name and the |ARCA| code."
msgstr ""
"對於 :guilabel:`收益` 預扣稅，Odoo 已為每個稅制群組設有記錄，並會列於稅項名稱"
"及 |ARCA| 代碼下方。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:760
msgid ""
"Each of these records is ready to be used. As a best practice, the "
"configuration should be double-checked to make sure it is updated and well-"
"applied. The fields to validate are:"
msgstr ""
"這些記錄均已準備就緒可供使用。建議再次檢查設定，確保資料已更新並正確套用。需"
"要驗證的欄位包括："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:763
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Amount`: This is the percentage of the total payment amount which"
" is withheld."
msgstr ":guilabel:`金額`：這是從總付款金額中預扣的百分比。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:764
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Non-Taxable Amount`: Up to this amount, the withholding does not "
"apply."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:765
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Minimum Withholding`: If the calculated withholding amount is "
"smaller than this value, the total withholding amount is set to `0.0`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`最低預扣金額`：如果計算得出的預扣金額小於此數值，總預扣金額將設為 "
"`0.0`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:767
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Withholding Sequence`: This field automates the capture of a "
"withholding number under the payment line. If this field is not set, a "
"number is manually captured while adding a withholding to a payment."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`預扣序列`：此欄位可自動在付款資料行下擷取預扣編號。如未設定此欄位"
"，則需在為付款新增預扣項目時手動輸入編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:771
msgid "Earnings withholding type."
msgstr "收入預扣稅類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:777
msgid "Earnings Scale"
msgstr "薪資級距"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:779
msgid ""
"In this particular case, a percentage does not need to be set. Instead, this"
" withholding is calculated based on the value of the :guilabel:`Scale` "
"field."
msgstr ""
"在此特定情況下，無須設定百分比，系統會根據 :guilabel:`級距` 欄位的數值計算此"
"預扣稅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:782
msgid ""
"To view, modify, or create new scales, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Earnings Scale`. By "
"default, the Argentinian localization is preconfigured with two main scales."
" However, scales should be created and updated as necessary to suit a "
"business's needs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:787
msgid ""
"Earnings scales are cumulative, which means that Odoo keeps track of the "
"different records created for a bill and automatically calculates the "
"correct withholding amount."
msgstr ""
"收入級距為累計制，代表 Odoo 會追蹤為賬單建立的不同記錄，並自動計算正確的預扣"
"金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:793
msgid "IIBB Total Amount"
msgstr "IIBB 總金額"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:795
msgid ""
"In this case, the necessary records related to the applicable province must "
"be created. The withholding amount is calculated based on the percentage "
":guilabel:`Amount` set on the tax configuration. Since Odoo does not "
"automatically synchronize the percentages applicable to each province, this "
"information must be manually updated."
msgstr ""
"在此情況下，必須建立與適用省份相關的必要記錄。預扣金額是根據稅項設定中的百分"
"比 :guilabel:`金額` 計算。由於 Odoo 不會自動同步各省適用的百分比，因此必須手"
"動更新此資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:800
msgid ""
"The recommendation, in this case, is to always duplicate and apply the "
"different configurations to each record to safeguard technical "
"configurations that allow the proper calculation and accounting of the "
"withholding."
msgstr ""
"在這種情況下，建議始終複製並將不同的設定套用至每筆記錄，以保障能正確計算及入"
"賬預扣稅的技術設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:807
msgid "IIBB Untaxed"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:809
msgid ""
"The configuration of non-taxable gross income withholdings is very similar "
"to that of a :ref:`total amount withholding <localizations/argentina/iib-"
"total-amount-withholdings>`, so the percentage :guilabel:`Amount` in each "
"record must be maintained. However, Odoo comes preconfigured with several "
"records that apply to different provinces. The difference, in this case, is "
"that it is not necessary to establish a non-taxable amount or minimum "
"withholding for this record type."
msgstr ""
"非應稅總收入預扣稅的設定與 :ref:`總金額預扣稅 <localizations/argentina/iib-"
"total-amount-withholdings>` 非常相似，因此必須保留每項記錄中的百分比 "
":guilabel:`金額`。不過，Odoo 已預先設定多項適用於不同省份的記錄。兩者的區別在"
"於，此記錄類型無須設定免稅額或最低預扣稅額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:818
msgid "Partner withholding assignation"
msgstr "合作夥伴預扣稅指派"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:820
msgid ""
"Once the proper configuration is set on each possible withholding for "
"partners, the applicable withholdings must be assigned to each contact. To "
"do this, open the Contacts app and select the desired partner. In the "
":guilabel:`Accounting` tab, find the :guilabel:`Purchase Withholdings` "
"table."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:825
msgid ""
"By using the additional fields :guilabel:`From Date` and :guilabel:`To "
"Date`, the applicability of multiple withholdings can be automated across "
"different date ranges. The :guilabel:`ref` field allows you to apply an "
"internal control number to each withholding line, which is just for internal"
" reference, so it does not affect any transactions and is not visible on "
"them. These fields are accessible from the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` "
":guilabel:`(adjust settings)` menu."
msgstr ""
"透過使用額外欄位 :guilabel:`開始日期` 及 :guilabel:`結束日期`，可自動設定多項"
"預扣稅在不同日期範圍的適用性。:guilabel:`參考` 欄位可讓您為每行預扣稅套用內部"
"控制編號；該編號僅供內部參考，不會影響任何交易，亦不會在交易上顯示。您可從 "
":icon:`oi-settings-adjust` :guilabel:`（調整設定）` 選單存取這些欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:831
msgid ":guilabel:`From Date`: The start of the withholding date range."
msgstr ":guilabel:`開始日期`：預扣稅日期範圍的開始日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:832
msgid ":guilabel:`To Date`: The end of the withholding date range."
msgstr ":guilabel:`結束日期`：預扣稅日期範圍的結束日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:833
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ref`: Apply an internal control number to each withholding line "
"that is only visible for internal reference and does not affect any "
"transactions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`參考`：為每筆預扣稅資料行套用內部控制編號；此編號僅供內部參考，不"
"會影響任何交易。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:839
msgid "Automatic withholding calculation and application per payment"
msgstr "每次付款自動計算並套用預扣稅"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:841
msgid ""
"By applying new payments to vendor bills, Odoo automatically applies and "
"calculates the proper withholding into the payment. Based on the record's "
"configuration, it may be necessary to use a reference number for each "
"withholding line."
msgstr ""
"將新付款套用至供應商賬單時，Odoo 會自動在付款中套用並計算正確的預扣稅款。根據"
"記錄的設定，您可能需要為每個預扣稅項明細行使用參考編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:845
msgid ""
"More withholdings can be added, or computed withholdings can be edited if "
"necessary."
msgstr "如有需要，可新增更多預扣稅，或編輯已計算的預扣稅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:847
msgid "Payment with applied withholdings."
msgstr "已套用預扣稅的付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:851
msgid ""
"The amount of the debt to be cancelled equals the total payment amount. "
"However, Odoo still captures the net amount (i.e., the amount to be "
"reconciled with the bank), which will be represented as the payment amount "
"after the withholding application."
msgstr ""
"要清償的債務金額等於總付款金額。不過，Odoo 仍會擷取淨額（即與銀行對賬的金額）"
"，並將其顯示為套用預扣稅後的付款金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:855
msgid "Payment registered form."
msgstr "付款登記表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:861
msgid "Check management"
msgstr "支票管理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:864
msgid ""
"Make sure to :ref:`install <general/install>` the :guilabel:`Third Party and"
" Deferred/Electronic Checks Management` (`l10n_latam_check`) module."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:867
msgid ""
"This module enables the required configuration for journals and payments to:"
msgstr "此模組可啟用日記賬及付款所需的配置，以："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:869
msgid "Create, manage, and control your different types of checks."
msgstr "建立、管理及控制不同類型的支票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:870
msgid "Optimize the management of *own checks* and *third-party checks*."
msgstr "優化 *自有支票* 及 *第三方支票* 的管理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:871
msgid ""
"Have an easy and effective way to manage expiration dates for your own and "
"third-party checks."
msgstr "輕鬆有效地管理自有支票及第三方支票的到期日。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:873
msgid ""
"Once all the configurations are set for the Argentinian electronic invoice "
"flow, it is also needed to complete certain configurations for the own "
"checks and third-party checks flows."
msgstr ""
"為阿根廷電子發票流程完成所有設定後，亦須為自家支票及第三方支票流程完成部分設"
"定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:879
msgid "Own checks"
msgstr "自有支票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:881
msgid ""
"Configure the bank journal used to create your own checks by going to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals`, selecting the "
"bank journal, and opening the :guilabel:`Outgoing Payments` tab."
msgstr ""
"若要配置用於開立自有支票的銀行日記賬，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配"
"置 --> 日記賬`，選擇該銀行日記賬，然後開啟 :guilabel:`匯出付款` 分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:885
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Checks` should be available as a :guilabel:`Payment Method`. If "
"not, click :guilabel:`Add a line` and type `Checks` under :guilabel:`Payment"
" Method` to add them."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`支票` 應可作為 :guilabel:`付款方式` 使用。如果沒有，請按一下 "
":guilabel:`新增資料行`，並在 :guilabel:`付款方式` 下輸入 `支票` 以將其加入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:887
msgid "Enable the :guilabel:`Use electronic and deferred checks` setting."
msgstr "啟用 :guilabel:`使用電子及遠期支票` 設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:890
msgid "This last configuration disables the printing ability but:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:892
msgid "allows check numbers to be entered manually"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:893
msgid "adds a field to indicate the payment date of the check"
msgstr "新增欄位以註明支票的付款日期"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:898
msgid "Management of own checks"
msgstr "自有支票管理"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:900
msgid ""
"Own checks can be created directly from the vendor bill. For this process, "
"click :guilabel:`Register Payment`."
msgstr "自有支票可直接從供應商賬單建立。要執行此操作，請按一下:guilabel:`登記付款`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:903
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Pay` window, select the bank journal from which the "
"payment is to be made and set the :guilabel:`Check Cash-In Date` and "
":guilabel:`Amount`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:907
msgid ""
"To manage current checks, the :guilabel:`Check Cash-In Date` field must be "
"left blank or filled in with the current date. To manage deferred checks, "
"the :guilabel:`Check Cash-In Date` must be set in the future."
msgstr ""
"若要管理即期支票，:guilabel:`支票兌現日期`欄位必須留空或填寫當天日期。若要管"
"理遠期支票，:guilabel:`支票兌現日期`必須設為未來的日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:911
msgid ""
"To manage your existing own checks, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting "
"--> Vendors --> Own Checks`. This window displays critical information, "
"including the dates checks must be paid, the total number of checks, and the"
" total amount paid in checks."
msgstr ""
"要管理現有的自開支票，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 供應商 --> 自開支票`。"
"此視窗會顯示重要資訊，包括支票的應付日期、支票總數及支票付款總額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:915
msgid ""
"It is important to note that the list is pre-filtered by checks that are "
"still *not reconciled* with a bank statement - that were not yet debited "
"from the bank - which can be verified with the :guilabel:`Is Matched with a "
"Bank Statement` field. If you want to see all of your own checks, delete the"
" :guilabel:`No Bank Matching` filter by clicking on the :guilabel:`X` "
"symbol."
msgstr ""
"請注意，此清單已預先篩選出仍 *尚未與銀行結單對賬* 的支票（即尚未從銀行扣賬的"
"支票），您可透過 :guilabel:`已與銀行結單配對` 欄位確認。如要檢視所有自己的支"
"票，請在 :guilabel:`沒有銀行配對` 篩選條件上按一下 :guilabel:`X` 符號將其刪除"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:923
msgid "Cancel an own check"
msgstr "取消自開支票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:925
msgid ""
"To cancel an own check created in Odoo, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Own Checks` and select the check "
"to be cancelled, then click :guilabel:`Void Check`. This breaks the "
"reconciliation between vendor bills and bank statements, leaving the check "
"marked as :guilabel:`Cancelled`."
msgstr ""
"要取消在 Odoo 建立的自開支票，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 供應商 --> 自開"
"支票`，選擇要取消的支票，然後按一下 :guilabel:`作廢支票`。這會中斷供應商賬單"
"與銀行對賬單之間的核對，並將該支票標記為 :guilabel:`已取消`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:933
msgid "Third-party checks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:935
msgid ""
"To register payments with third-party checks, two specific journals must be "
"configured. To do so, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Journals` and create two new journals:"
msgstr ""
"如要登記第三方支票付款，必須設定兩個專用日記賬。請前往 :menuselection:`會"
"計 --> 配置 --> 日記賬` 並建立兩個新日記賬："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:938
msgid "`Third-Party Checks`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:939
msgid "`Rejected Third-Party Checks`"
msgstr "`已退回的第三方支票`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:942
msgid ""
"You can manually create additional journals if you have multiple points of "
"sale and need journals for those."
msgstr "如果你有多個銷售點並需要為其設立日記賬，可以手動建立額外的日記賬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:945
msgid ""
"To create the *Third-Party Checks* journal, click :guilabel:`New` and "
"configure the following:"
msgstr "要建立 *第三方支票* 日記帳，請點擊:guilabel:`新增`，然後設定以下項目："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:947
msgid "Type `Third-Party Checks` as the :guilabel:`Journal Name`."
msgstr "輸入 `第三方支票` 作為 :guilabel:`日記賬名稱`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:948
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Cash` as :guilabel:`Type`."
msgstr "選擇:guilabel:`現金`作為:guilabel:`類型`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:949
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Journal Entries` tab, set :guilabel:`Cash Account`: to "
"`1.1.1.02.010 Cheques de Terceros`, input a :guilabel:`Short Code` of your "
"choice, and select a :guilabel:`Currency`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`日記帳分錄` 分頁中，將 :guilabel:`現金帳戶` 設為 `1.1.1.02.010 "
"Cheques de Terceros`，輸入自訂的 :guilabel:`簡碼`，並選擇 :guilabel:`貨幣`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:952
msgid ""
"The available payment methods are listed in the :guilabel:`Payments` tab:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:954
msgid ""
"For new incoming third-party checks, click :guilabel:`Add a line` in the "
":guilabel:`Incoming Payments` tab and select :guilabel:`New Third Party "
"Checks`. This method is used to create *new* third-party checks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:957
msgid ""
"For incoming and outgoing existing third-party checks, click :guilabel:`Add "
"a line` in the :guilabel:`Incoming Payments` tab and  select "
":guilabel:`Existing Third Party Checks`. Repeat the same step for the "
":guilabel:`Outgoing Payments` tab. This method is used to receive and/or pay"
" vendor bills using already *existing* checks, as well as for internal "
"transfers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:963
msgid ""
"You can delete pre-existing payment methods that appear by default when "
"configuring third-party check journals."
msgstr "配置第三方支票日記賬時，你可以刪除預設出現的現有付款方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:966
msgid ""
"The *Rejected Third-Party Checks* journal must also be created and/or "
"configured. This journal is used to manage rejected third-party checks and "
"can be used to send checks rejected at the time of collection or upon "
"receipt from vendors."
msgstr ""
"系統亦必須建立及/或設定 *已拒收的第三方支票* 日記賬。此日記賬用於管理被拒收的"
"第三方支票，並可用於傳送在託收時或從供應商收到時被拒收的支票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:970
msgid ""
"To create the *Rejected Third-Party Checks* journal, click :guilabel:`New` "
"and configure the following:"
msgstr "要建立 *已退回第三方支票* 日記賬，請點擊 :guilabel:`新增` 並配置以下項目："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:973
msgid "Type `Rejected Third Party Checks` as the :guilabel:`Journal Name`"
msgstr "輸入 `Rejected Third Party Checks` 作為:guilabel:`日記帳名稱`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:974
msgid "Select :guilabel:`Cash` as :guilabel:`Type`"
msgstr "選擇:guilabel:`現金`作為:guilabel:`類型`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:975
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Journal Entries` tab, set :guilabel:`Cash Account`: to "
"`1.1.1.01.002 Rejected Third Party Checks`, input a :guilabel:`Short Code` "
"of your choice, and select a :guilabel:`Currency`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`日記賬分錄` 分頁中，將 :guilabel:`現金賬戶` 設為 `1.1.1.01.002 "
"Rejected Third Party Checks`，輸入您選擇的 :guilabel:`簡碼`，並選擇 "
":guilabel:`貨幣`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:979
msgid "Use the same payment methods as the *Third-Party Checks* journal."
msgstr "使用與 *第三方支票* 日記賬相同的付款方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:984
msgid "New third-party checks"
msgstr "新增第三方支票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:986
msgid ""
"To register a *new* third-party check for a customer invoice, click "
":guilabel:`Register Payment`. In the pop-up window, select :guilabel:`Third-"
"Party Checks` as the journal for the payment registration."
msgstr ""
"若要為客戶發票登記 *新* 第三方支票，請點擊 :guilabel:`登記付款`。在彈出視窗中"
"，選擇 :guilabel:`第三方支票` 作為付款登記的日記賬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:990
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`New Third Party Checks` as :guilabel:`Payment Method`, and"
" fill in the :guilabel:`Check Number`, :guilabel:`Payment Date`, and "
":guilabel:`Check Bank`. Optionally, you can manually add the "
":guilabel:`Check Issuer Vat`, but this field is automatically filled with "
"the customer's VAT number as it appears on the invoice."
msgstr ""
"選擇:guilabel:`新第三方支票`作為:guilabel:`付款方式`，並填寫:guilabel:`支票號"
"碼`、:guilabel:`付款日期`及:guilabel:`支票銀行`。您亦可手動填寫:guilabel:`開"
"票人增值稅編號`，但此欄位會自動填入發票上顯示的客戶增值稅編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:998
msgid "Existing third-party checks"
msgstr "現有第三方支票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1000
msgid ""
"To pay a vendor bill with an *existing* check, click :guilabel:`Register "
"Payment`. In the pop-up window, select :guilabel:`Third Party Checks` as the"
" journal for the payment registration."
msgstr ""
"要使用*現有*支票支付供應商賬單，請點擊:guilabel:`登記付款`。在彈出視窗中，選"
"擇:guilabel:`第三方支票`作為付款登記的日記賬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1003
msgid ""
"Select :guilabel:`Existing Third Party Checks` as :guilabel:`Payment "
"Method`, and select a check from the :guilabel:`Check` field. The field "
"shows all **available existing checks** to be used as payment for vendor "
"bills."
msgstr ""
"選擇 :guilabel:`現有第三方支票` 作為 :guilabel:`付款方式`，並在 :guilabel:`支"
"票` 欄位中選取一張支票。該欄位會顯示所有 **可用的現有支票**，用作支付供應商賬"
"單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1007
msgid ""
"When an **existing third-party check** is used, you can review the "
"operations related to it. For example, you can see if a third-party check "
"made to pay a customer invoice was later used as an existing third-party "
"check to pay a vendor bill."
msgstr ""
"使用**現有第三方支票**時，你可以查閱與其相關的操作。例如，你可以查看一張原本"
"用於支付客戶發票的第三方支票，其後是否曾作為現有第三方支票來支付供應商賬單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1011
msgid ""
"To do so, either go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Third "
"Party Checks` or :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Own Checks`, "
"depending on the case, and click on a check. In the :guilabel:`Check Current"
" Journal` field, click on :guilabel:`=> Check Operations` to bring up the "
"check's history and movements."
msgstr ""
"要執行此操作，請視乎情況前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 客戶 --> 第三方支票` "
"或 :menuselection:`會計 --> 供應商 --> 自有支票` ，並點擊一張支票。在 "
":guilabel:`支票目前日記賬` 欄位中，點擊 :guilabel:`=> 支票操作` 以顯示該支票"
"的歷史記錄及異動情況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1016
msgid ""
"The menu also displays critical information related to these operations, "
"such as:"
msgstr "此選單亦會顯示與這些操作相關的重要資訊，例如："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1018
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Payment Type`, allowing to classify whether it is a payment "
"*sent* to a vendor or a payment *received* from a customer"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1020
msgid "The :guilabel:`Journal` in which the check is currently registered"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1021
msgid ""
"The **partner** associated with the operation (either customer or vendor)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1026
msgid "Liquidity product direct sales"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1028
msgid ""
"Liquidity product direct sales are used for sales involving third parties. "
"For such sales, the seller and the proprietary company of the goods can each"
" register their corresponding sales and purchases."
msgstr ""
"流動性產品直銷用於涉及第三方的銷售。在這類銷售中，賣方與貨物的所有權公司可各"
"自登記其相應的銷售及採購。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1033
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the :guilabel:`Argentinean Electronic "
"Invoicing` module (`l10n_ar_edi`) to use this feature."
msgstr ""
":ref:`安裝 <general/install>` :guilabel:`阿根廷電子發票` 模組"
"（`l10n_ar_edi`）以使用此功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1044
msgid "Purchase journal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1046
msgid ""
"A purchase journal is needed to generate an electronic vendor bill with a "
"document type *Liquidity Product*. This journal must be synchronized with "
"|ARCA|, as it will be used to generate the electronic document for the "
"liquidity product."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1050
msgid ""
"To modify the existing purchase journal or create a new one, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals`. Then, select the"
" existing purchase journal or click :guilabel:`New`, and fill in the "
"following required information:"
msgstr ""
"如要修改現有採購日記賬或建立新日記賬，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配"
"置 --> 日記賬`。然後，選擇現有的採購日記賬或點擊 :guilabel:`新增`，並填寫以下"
"必填資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1054
msgid ":guilabel:`Type`: Select :guilabel:`Purchase`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`類型`：選取:guilabel:`採購`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1055
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Use Documents`: Check this field to select the electronic "
"document type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1056
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Is ARCA POS?`: Check this field to generate electronic documents."
" Three additional fields appear:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1059
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ARCA POS System`: Select :guilabel:`Electronic Invoice - Web "
"Service` from the drop-down menu to send the electronic document to |ARCA| "
"via web service."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ARCA POS 系統`：從下拉式選單中選擇 :guilabel:`電子發票 - 網絡服"
"務`，以透過網絡服務將電子文件傳送至 |ARCA|。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1061
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ARCA POS Number`: The number configured in |ARCA| to identify the"
" operations related to this |ARCA| POS."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ARCA POS 編號`：在 |ARCA| 中設定的編號，用以識別與此 |ARCA| POS 相"
"關的操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1063
msgid ""
":guilabel:`ARCA POS Address`: The field related to the commercial address "
"registered for the POS, which is usually the same address as the company. "
"For example, if a company has multiple stores (fiscal locations) then |ARCA|"
" will require the company to have one ARCA POS per location. This location "
"will be printed in the invoice report."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`ARCA POS 地址`：此欄位與 POS 註冊的商業地址相關，通常與公司地址相"
"同。例如，如果公司擁有多間門市（稅務地點），|ARCA| 會要求公司為每個地點設定一"
"個 ARCA POS。此地點將會列印在發票報表上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1071
msgid "Sales journal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1073
msgid ""
"A sales journal is needed to record the invoice when a product is sold to a "
"third party that will then sell the same product. This journal will not be "
"synced with |ARCA| as the invoice will not be electronic."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1077
msgid ""
"To modify the existing sales journal or create a new one, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals`. Then, access the"
" sales journal or click :guilabel:`New`, and fill in the following required "
"information:"
msgstr ""
"要修改現有銷售日記賬或建立新日記賬，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> "
"日記賬`。然後開啟銷售日記賬或點擊 :guilabel:`新增`，並填寫以下所需資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1081
msgid ":guilabel:`Type`: select :guilabel:`Sales`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`類型`：選擇 :guilabel:`銷售`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1082
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Use Documents`: check this field on the journal to select the "
"electronic document type (in this case, the electronic invoice)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`使用文件`：在日記賬上勾選此欄位，以選擇電子文件類型（在此情況下為"
"電子發票）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1088
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1567
msgid "Invoicing flow"
msgstr "開立發票流程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1090
msgid ""
"Once all configurations are set, the *Liquidity Product Vendor Bill* will be"
" generated by the company selling the product on behalf of another party. "
"For example, a distributor of a specific product."
msgstr ""
"所有配置完成後，代表另一方銷售產品的公司將會生成 *流動性產品供應商賬單*。例如"
"特定產品的分銷商。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1097
msgid "Ecommerce electronic invoicing"
msgstr "電子商務電子發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/argentina.rst:1099
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the :guilabel:`Argentinean eCommerce` "
"(`l10n_ar_website_sale`) module to enable the following features and "
"configurations:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`安裝 <general/install>` :guilabel:`阿根廷電子商務` "
