"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Journals` and select "
"the :guilabel:`Bank` journal. Enter the :guilabel:`Account Number`, click "
":guilabel:`Create and edit...`, and fill in the following fields:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:419
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:449
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/new_zealand.rst:249
msgid ":guilabel:`Bank`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`銀行`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:420
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:450
msgid ":guilabel:`BSB`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`BSB`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:421
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:451
msgid ":guilabel:`Account Holder`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`帳戶持有人`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:423
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:453
msgid ""
"Then, toggle on the :guilabel:`Send Money` switch and click :guilabel:`Save "
"& Close`."
msgstr "然後，開啟 :guilabel:`匯款` 開關，並點擊 :guilabel:`儲存並關閉`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:426
msgid "Using the :guilabel:`Currency` field is optional."
msgstr "你可自行決定是否使用:guilabel:`貨幣`欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/australia.rst:428
