#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:222
msgid "Digitally signatured receipts"
msgstr "數碼簽署收據"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:224
msgid ""
"To ensure the integrity and authenticity of the receipts, the system "
"automatically signs them using the :abbr:`SCU (Signature Creation Unit)` in "
"a background process. The receipt then displays an encrypted signature as a "
"QR code containing the receipt number and information about the SCU used to "
"sign it."
msgstr ""
"為確保收據的完整性及真確性，系統會在後台處理中自動使用 :abbr:`SCU (簽署建立單"
"元)` 為收據進行簽署。簽署後，收據會以二維碼顯示加密簽署，當中包含收據編號及用"
"作簽署該收據的 SCU 資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:230
msgid ""
"If the :abbr:`SCU (Signature Creation Unit)` is unavailable, receipts may "
"not include a QR code; in such cases:"
msgstr ""
"如果 :abbr:`SCU（簽名建立單元）` 無法使用，收據可能不會包含 QR 碼；在此情況下"
"："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:233
msgid ""
"Make sure the receipt includes a :guilabel:`Sicherheitseinrichtung "
"ausgefallen` message, indicating that the system is linked to Fiskaly "
"services, but the SCU is temporarily unavailable."
msgstr ""
"確保收據包含 :guilabel:`Sicherheitseinrichtung ausgefallen` 訊息，表示系統已"
"連接至 Fiskaly 服務，但 SCU 暫時無法使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:236
msgid ""
"If this message is missing from the receipt, it indicates no connection to "
"Fiskaly services."
msgstr "若收據上未顯示此訊息，表示系統尚未連線至 Fiskaly 服務。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:238
msgid ""
"Orders that remain unsigned due to SCU unavailability can be signed "
"manually. To do so, follow these steps:"
msgstr "由於 SCU 無法使用而未簽署的訂單，可手動進行簽署。請按以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:241
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Orders --> Orders`."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`銷售點 --> 訂單 --> 訂單`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:242
msgid ""
"To identify unsigned orders, click the :icon:`oi-settings-adjust` "
":guilabel:`(adjust settings)` icon in the :guilabel:`Orders` list view to "
"reveal the :guilabel:`Receipt Signed?` column."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:245
msgid ""
"Select the unsigned orders, click :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions`, and "
"select :guilabel:`Sign Order`."
msgstr ""
"選取未簽署的訂單，點擊 :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`操作`，然後選擇 "
":guilabel:`簽署訂單`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:251
msgid "DEP7 export"
msgstr "DEP7 匯出"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:253
msgid ""
"The exported :abbr:`DEP7 (Digitale Schnittstelle der Finanzverwaltung für "
"Kassensysteme)` file allows authorities to verify transactions and ensure "
"compliance with anti-fraud measures. Businesses must periodically generate "
"it for audit purposes and submit it to the Austrian tax authorities upon "
"request."
msgstr ""
"匯出的 :abbr:`DEP7 (Digitale Schnittstelle der Finanzverwaltung für "
"Kassensysteme，收銀系統財政管理數碼介面)` 檔案可讓當局核實交易並確保符合防欺"
"詐措施。企業必須定期產生該檔案以供審計，並在奧地利稅務當局要求時提交。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:258
msgid ""
"To generate it, go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Reporting --> DEP7 "
"Reports`, and, in the :guilabel:`DEP7 Reports`, fill in the following "
"mandatory fields:"
msgstr ""
"要生成此報表，請前往 :menuselection:`銷售點 --> 報表 --> DEP7 報表`，並在 "
":guilabel:`DEP7 報表` 中填寫以下必填欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:261
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Start Datetime`: Exports data with dates on or after the start "
"date."
msgstr ":guilabel:`開始日期時間`：匯出日期為開始日期或之後的資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:262
msgid ""
":guilabel:`End Datetime`: Exports data with dates on or before the end date."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:263
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Point of Sale`: Specify from which point of sale(s) data must be "
"exported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:265
msgid ""
"Then, click :guilabel:`Print` to download the :abbr:`JSON (JavaScript Object"
" Notation)` file with DEP7 data."
msgstr ""
"然後，按一下 :guilabel:`列印` 以下載包含 DEP7 資料的 :abbr:`JSON（JavaScript "
"物件表示法）` 檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:268
msgid "DEP7 Reports"
msgstr "DEP7 報告"

