msgid "Monthly / Yearly closing receipts"
msgstr "每月／每年結算收據"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:276
msgid ""
"To print monthly/yearly closing receipts, :ref:`open the related POS "
"register <pos/use/open-register>` from the **POS dashboard**. Click the "
":icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`(list view)` icon in the top-right corner "
