msgstr ""
"要列印每月／每年結算收據，請從 **POS 儀表板** :ref:`開啟相關的 POS 收銀機 "
"<pos/use/open-register>`。點擊右上角的 :icon:`oi-view-list` :guilabel:`（列表"
"檢視）` 圖示，並選擇 :guilabel:`每月／每年收據`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/austria.rst:280
msgid ""
"The last month is selected by default in the :guilabel:`Print closing "
