#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:481
msgid ""
"CODA files are automatically imported from CodaBox every 12 hours. You do "
"not have to do anything. However, if you wish, it can also be done manually,"
" by clicking on :guilabel:`Fetch from CodaBox` in the Accounting Dashboard."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:487
msgid ""
"SODA files are automatically imported from CodaBox once a day as a draft. "
"You do not have to do anything. However, if you wish, it can also be done "
"manually by clicking on :guilabel:`Fetch from CodaBox` in the Accounting "
"Dashboard."
msgstr ""
"SODA 檔案會每日自動從 CodaBox 匯入一次，並儲存為草稿。您無需執行任何操作。不"
"過，如有需要，您亦可在會計儀表板中點擊 :guilabel:`從 CodaBox 擷取` 手動匯入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:491
msgid ""
"By default, if an account in the SODA file is not mapped to an account in "
"Odoo, the Suspense Account (499000) is used, and a note is added to the "
"created journal entry."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，如果 SODA 檔案中的科目未對應至 Odoo 中的會計科目，系統將使用暫記"
"賬戶（499000），並在建立的日記賬分錄中加入備註。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:495
msgid ""
"You can access the mapping between the SODA and Odoo accounts by going to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and clicking on "
"the :guilabel:`Open SODA Mapping` button in the :guilabel:`CodaBox` section."
msgstr ""
"如要存取 SODA 與 Odoo 帳戶之間的對應設定，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配"
"置 --> 設定`，並點擊 :guilabel:`開啟 SODA 對應` 按鈕（位於 "
":guilabel:`CodaBox` 區段）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:502
msgid "Potential issues"
msgstr "潛在問題"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:504
msgid "**CodaBox is not configured. Please check your configuration.**"
msgstr "**CodaBox 尚未設定。請檢查您的設定。**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:506
msgid ""
"Either the :guilabel:`Company VAT` or the :guilabel:`Accounting Firm VAT` is"
" not set."
msgstr "尚未設定 :guilabel:`公司增值稅號` 或 :guilabel:`會計師事務所增值稅號`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:508
msgid ""
"**No connection exists with these accounting firms and company VAT "
"numbers.** **Please check your configuration.**"
msgstr "**這些會計師事務所與公司增值稅編號之間沒有連線。** **請檢查您的設定。**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:511
msgid ""
"This can happen when checking the connection status, and the "
":guilabel:`Accounting Firm VAT` and :guilabel:`Company VAT` combination "
"still needs to be registered. This may happen if you have changed the "
":guilabel:`Company VAT` after the connection was established. For security "
"reasons, you have to :ref:`recreate a connection <belgium/codabox-"
"configuration-connection>` for this :guilabel:`Company VAT`."
msgstr ""
"檢查連線狀態時，若 :guilabel:`會計師事務所增值稅編號` 與 :guilabel:`公司增值"
"稅編號` 的組合仍未註冊，便可能會出現此情況。如果你在建立連線後更改了 "
":guilabel:`公司增值稅編號`，亦可能會出現此問題。基於安全理由，你必須 :ref:`重"
"新建立連線 <belgium/codabox-configuration-connection>`，以用於此 "
":guilabel:`公司增值稅編號`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:517
msgid ""
"**It seems that your CodaBox connection is not valid anymore. Please connect"
" again.**"
msgstr "**你的 CodaBox 連線似乎已失效，請重新連線。**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:519
msgid ""
"This can happen if you revoke Odoo's access to your CodaBox account or still"
" need to complete the configuration process. In this case, you must revoke "
"the connection and create a new one."
msgstr ""
"如果您撤銷了 Odoo 對您的 CodaBox 帳戶的存取權限，或仍需完成設定流程，就可能會"
"出現此情況。在這種情況下，您必須撤銷連線並建立一個新連線。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:522
msgid ""
"**The provided password is not valid for this accounting firm.** **You must "
"reuse the password you received from Odoo during your first connection.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:525
msgid ""
"The password you provided is different from the one you received from Odoo "
"during your first connection. You must use the password you received from "
"Odoo during your first connection to create a new connection for this "
"accounting firm. If you have lost your password, you must first revoke the "
"Odoo connection on CodaBox's side (i.e., on your myCodaBox portal). Then, "
"you can revoke the connection on Odoo's side and :ref:`create a new one "
"<belgium/codabox-configuration-connection>`."
msgstr ""
"您提供的密碼與首次連線時從 Odoo 收到的密碼不同。您必須使用首次連線時從 Odoo "
"收到的密碼，為此會計師事務所建立新連線。如您已遺失密碼，必須先在 CodaBox 一方"
"（即您的 myCodaBox 門戶網站）撤銷 Odoo 連線。然後，您便可在 Odoo 一方撤銷連線"
"並 :ref:`建立新連線 <belgium/codabox-configuration-connection>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:532
msgid ""
"**It seems that the company or accounting firm VAT number you provided is "
"not valid.** **Please check your configuration.**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:535
msgid ""
"Either the :guilabel:`Company VAT` or the :guilabel:`Accounting Firm VAT` is"
" not in a valid Belgian format."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:538
msgid ""
"**It seems that the accounting firm VAT number you provided does not exist "
"in CodaBox.** **Please check your configuration.**"
msgstr ""
"**您提供的會計師事務所增值稅編號似乎不存在於 CodaBox 中。** **請檢查您的設定"
"。**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:541
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Accounting Firm VAT` number you provided is not registered in"
" CodaBox. You may not have a valid CodaBox license linked to this VAT "
"number."
msgstr ""
"您提供的 :guilabel:`會計師事務所增值稅` 號碼未在 CodaBox 註冊。您可能沒有與此"
"增值稅號碼關聯的有效 CodaBox 授權。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:544
msgid ""
"**It seems you have already created a connection to CodaBox with this "
"accounting firm.** **To create a new connection, you must first revoke the "
"old one on myCodaBox portal.**"
msgstr ""
"**看來你已使用此會計師事務所建立與 CodaBox 的連線。** **如要建立新連線，必須"
"先在 myCodaBox 門戶網站撤銷舊連線。**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:547
msgid ""
"You must go to your myCodaBox portal and revoke Odoo's access to your "
"CodaBox account. Then, you can :ref:`create a new connection "
"<belgium/codabox-configuration-connection>` on Odoo's side."
msgstr ""
"您必須前往您的 myCodaBox 入口網站，撤銷 Odoo 對您 CodaBox 帳戶的存取權。然後"
"，您便可在 Odoo 端 :ref:`建立新連線 <belgium/codabox-configuration-"
"connection>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:552
msgid ""
"To revoke the connection between Odoo and CodaBox, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll down to "
"the :guilabel:`CodaBox` section, click on :guilabel:`Manage Connection`, "
"then click on :guilabel:`Revoke`."
msgstr ""
"要撤銷 Odoo 與 CodaBox 之間的連接，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> "
"設定`，向下捲動至 :guilabel:`CodaBox` 部分，點擊 :guilabel:`管理連接`，然後點"
"擊 :guilabel:`撤銷`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:560
msgid "Codaclean"
msgstr "Codaclean"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:562
msgid ""
"**Codaclean** is a service that allows Belgian companies and accounting "
"firms to access bank information and statements. Odoo provides a way to "
"import such statements and their transactions automatically."
msgstr ""
"**Codaclean** 是一項讓比利時企業及會計師事務所存取銀行資料及結單的服務。Odoo "
"提供自動匯入該等結單及其交易的功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:572
msgid ""
"Make sure to :ref:`install <general/install>` the :guilabel:`Codaclean` "
"(`l10n_be_codaclean`) module."
msgstr ""
"請確保已 :ref:`安裝 <general/install>` "
":guilabel:`Codaclean`（`l10n_be_codaclean`）模組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:581
msgid "To connect Odoo with Codaclean, follow these steps:"
msgstr "如要將 Odoo 連接至 Codaclean，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:583
msgid ""
"Open the Settings app, navigate to the :ref:`Companies "
"<general/companies/company>` section, and click :icon:`oi-arrow-right` "
":guilabel:`Manage Companies` to make sure the company's :guilabel:`Country` "
"is set to :guilabel:`Belgium`."
msgstr ""
"開啟「設定」應用程式，前往:ref:`公司 <general/companies/company>`部分，然後按"
"一下 :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`管理公司`，確保公司的:guilabel:`國家/"
"地區`已設為:guilabel:`比利時`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:586
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and scroll "
"to the :guilabel:`Codaclean` section."
msgstr ""
"前往:menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 設定`，並向下捲動"
"至:guilabel:`Codaclean`部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:588
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Manage Connection` to open the connection wizard, enter the"
" Codaclean :guilabel:`Username` and :guilabel:`Password` and click "
":guilabel:`Connect`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:591
msgid "The :guilabel:`Status` is updated to :guilabel:`Connected`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:594
msgid ""
"Once the connection is established, the :guilabel:`Manage Connection` wizard"
" provides two options:"
msgstr "建立連線後，:guilabel:`管理連線`精靈會提供兩個選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:596
msgid ""
"Update Codaclean credentials: Enter the new :guilabel:`Username` and "
":guilabel:`Password`, then click :guilabel:`Change Credentials`."
msgstr ""
"更新 Codaclean 憑證：輸入新的:guilabel:`用戶名稱`及:guilabel:`密碼`，然後點"
"擊:guilabel:`更改憑證`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:598
msgid ""
"Remove Codaclean connection: Click :guilabel:`Disconnect`; no "
":guilabel:`Username` or :guilabel:`Password` is required."
msgstr ""
"移除 Codaclean 連線：按一下:guilabel:`中斷連線`；無需輸入:guilabel:`用戶名"
"稱`或:guilabel:`密碼`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:604
msgid "Journal creation"
msgstr "建立日記賬"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:606
msgid ""
"A specific bank journal must be created for Codaclean synchronization. To do"
" so, :doc:`create a new bank journal <../accounting/bank>`, make sure to "
"enter the correct IBAN in the :guilabel:`Bank Account Number` field, and "
"select :guilabel:`Codaclean Syncronization` in the :guilabel:`Bank Feeds` "
"field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:612
msgid ""
"For bank transactions in different currencies, it is recommended to create a"
" separate journal for each currency, using the same bank account."
msgstr ""
"對於不同貨幣的銀行交易，建議為每種貨幣建立獨立的日記賬，並使用相同的銀行賬戶"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:620
msgid ""
"Once the connection is established, Odoo is synchronized with Codaclean, and"
" new CODA files received via Codaclean are checked every twelve hours."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:624
msgid ""
"To manually check for new CODA files, go to the Accounting Dashboard and "
"click :guilabel:`Fetch from Codaclean` on the relevant :ref:`journal "
"<belgium/codaclean-configuration-journal>` ."
msgstr ""
"如要手動檢查是否有新的 CODA 檔案，請前往會計儀表板，按一下:guilabel:`從 "
"Codaclean 擷取`（位於相關的:ref:`日記賬 <belgium/codaclean-configuration-"
"journal>`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:630
msgid "Electronic invoicing with Peppol"
msgstr "透過 Peppol 開立電子發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:632
msgid ""
"As of 1 January 2026, all Belgian companies must be registered on the Peppol"
" network to send and receive electronic invoices."
msgstr ""
"自 2026 年 1 月 1 日起，所有比利時公司必須在 Peppol 網絡註冊，方可發送及接收"
"電子發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:635
msgid ""
"To activate Peppol, refer to the :ref:`Peppol documentation "
"<accounting/e-invoicing/peppol>`, ensuring during :ref:`registration "
"<accounting/e-invoicing/peppol-registration>` that:"
msgstr ""
"要啟用 Peppol，請參閱 :ref:`Peppol 說明文件 <accounting/e-invoicing/peppol>"
"`，並在:ref:`註冊 <accounting/e-invoicing/peppol-registration>`期間確保："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:638
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Peppol EAS` field is set to :guilabel:`0208 - Numero "
"d'entreprise / ondernemingsnummer / Unternehmensnummer`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:640
msgid ""
"the :guilabel:`Peppol Endpoint` field is set to the company registry number."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:642
msgid ""
"In addition, when veryfing that a customer is :ref:`registered as a Peppol "
"participant <accounting/e-invoicing/contact-verification>`, ensure the "
":guilabel:`Format` field is set to :guilabel:`BIS Billing 3.0`."
msgstr ""
"此外，在驗證客戶是否 :ref:`已登記為 Peppol 參與者 <accounting/e-invoicing/"
"contact-verification>` 時，請確保 :guilabel:`格式` 欄位已設為 :guilabel:`BIS "
"Billing 3.0`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:647
msgid ":ref:`Peppol documentation <accounting/e-invoicing/peppol>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:652
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:280
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:496
msgid "Cash discount"
msgstr "現金折扣"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:654
msgid ""
"In Belgium, if an early payment discount is offered on an invoice, the tax "
"is calculated based on the discounted total amount, whether the customer "
"benefits from the discount or not."
msgstr ""
"在比利時，如發票提供提前付款折扣，無論客戶有否享用該折扣，稅項均會按折後總金"
"額計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:657
msgid ""
"To apply the right tax amount and report it correctly in your VAT return, "
"set the tax reduction as :guilabel:`Always (upon invoice)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:661
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:286
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:502
msgid ":doc:`../accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts`"
msgstr ":doc:`../accounting/customer_invoices/cash_discounts`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:671
msgid "Fiscal certification: POS restaurant"
msgstr "財政認證：POS 餐廳"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:673
msgid ""
"In Belgium, the owner of a cooking business such as a restaurant or food "
"truck is required by law to use a government-certified **Cash Register "
"System** for their receipts. This applies if their yearly earnings "
"(excluding VAT, drinks, and take-away food) exceed 25,000 euros."
msgstr ""
"在比利時，餐廳或美食車等餐飲業務的東主，如其年度收入（不包括增值稅、飲品及外"
"賣食物）超過 25,000 歐元，必須依法使用經政府認證的 **收銀機系統** 開立收據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:677
msgid ""
"This government-certified system entails the use of a :ref:`certified POS "
"system <belgium/certified-pos>`, along with a device called a :ref:`Fiscal "
"Data Module <belgium/fdm>` (or **black box**) and a :ref:`VAT Signing Card "
"<belgium/vat>`."
msgstr ""
"這個獲政府認證的系統需要使用 :ref:`獲認證的 POS 系統 <belgium/certified-pos>"
"`，並配合名為 :ref:`財政數據模組 <belgium/fdm>`（或**黑盒**）的裝置及 "
":ref:`增值稅簽署卡 <belgium/vat>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:682
msgid ""
"Do not forget to register as *foodservice industry manager* on the `Federal "
"Public Service Finance registration form "
"<https://www.systemedecaisseenregistreuse.be/fr/enregistrement>`_."
msgstr ""
"請緊記在 `聯邦財政公共服務部登記表格 <https://"
"www.systemedecaisseenregistreuse.be/fr/enregistrement>`_ 登記成為 *餐飲業經"
"理*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:688
msgid "Certified POS system"
msgstr "認證 POS 系統"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:690
msgid ""
"The Odoo POS system is certified for databases hosted on **Odoo Online**, "
"**Odoo.sh**, and **On-Premise**."
msgstr ""
"Odoo POS 系統已獲認證，適用於託管在 **Odoo Online**、**Odoo.sh** 及 **本地部"
"署** 的資料庫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:694
msgid ":doc:`/administration/standard_extended_support`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:696
msgid ""
"A `certified POS system "
"<https://www.systemedecaisseenregistreuse.be/systemes-certifies>`_ must "
"adhere to rigorous government regulations, which means it operates "
"differently from a non-certified POS."
msgstr ""
"`經認證的 POS 系統 <https://www.systemedecaisseenregistreuse.be/systemes-"
"certifies>`_ 必須遵守嚴格的政府法規，因此其運作方式與非認證 POS 不同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:700
msgid "On a certified POS, you cannot:"
msgstr "在經認證的 POS 上，你不能："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:702
msgid ""
"Set up and use the **global discounts** feature (the `pos_discount` module "
"is blacklisted and cannot be activated)."
msgstr "設定並使用**全域折扣**功能（`pos_discount` 模組已被列入黑名單，無法啟用）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:704
msgid ""
"Set up and use the **loyalty programs** feature (the `pos_loyalty` module is"
" blacklisted and cannot be activated)."
msgstr ""
"設定及使用 **忠誠度計劃** 功能（`pos_loyalty` 模組已被列入黑名單，無法啟用）"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:706
msgid ""
"Reprint receipts (the `pos_reprint` module is blacklisted and cannot be "
"activated)."
msgstr "重新列印收據（`pos_reprint` 模組已被列入黑名單，無法啟用）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:707
msgid "Modify prices in order lines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:708
msgid "Modify or delete order lines in POS orders."
msgstr "修改或刪除 POS 訂單中的訂單行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:709
msgid "Sell products without a valid VAT number."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:710
msgid "Use a POS that is not connected to an IoT box."
msgstr "使用未連接至 IoT 盒子的 POS。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:712
msgid ""
"The :ref:`cash rounding <pos/pricing/rounding>` feature must be activated "
"and set to a :guilabel:`Rounding Precision` of `0,05` and a "
":guilabel:`Rounding Method` set as :guilabel:`Nearest`."
msgstr ""
"必須啟用:ref:`現金捨入 <pos/pricing/rounding>`功能，並將:guilabel:`捨入精確"
"度`設為 `0,05`，同時將:guilabel:`捨入方式`設為:guilabel:`最接近`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:715
msgid ""
"Taxes must be set as included in the price. To set it up, go to "
":menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> Settings`, and from the "
":guilabel:`Accounting` section, open the :guilabel:`Default Sales Tax` form "
"by clicking the arrow next to the default sales tax field. There, click "
":guilabel:`Advanced Options` and enable :guilabel:`Included in Price`."
msgstr ""
"稅項必須設為已包含在價格內。要進行設定，請前往:menuselection:`POS 銷售點 --> "
"配置 --> 設定`，然後在:guilabel:`會計`部分，按一下預設銷售稅欄位旁邊的箭嘴，"
"開啟:guilabel:`預設銷售稅`表單。在該處按一下:guilabel:`進階選項`並啟"
"用:guilabel:`已包含在價格內`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:719
msgid ""
"At the opening of the POS register, users must click :guilabel:`Work in` to "
"clock in. Doing so allows the registration of POS orders. If users are not "
"clocked in, they cannot make POS orders. Likewise, they must click "
":guilabel:`Work Out` to clock out at the end of the session."
msgstr ""
"開啟 POS 收銀機時，用戶必須點擊:guilabel:`上班`打卡上班，才可登記 POS 訂單。"
"如用戶未打卡上班，將無法建立 POS 訂單。同樣地，時段結束時，用戶必須點"
"擊:guilabel:`下班`打卡下班。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:724
msgid ""
"If you configure a POS to work with a :abbr:`FDM (Fiscal Data Module)`, you "
"cannot use it again without it."
msgstr ""
"如果你設定了 POS 配合:abbr:`FDM（財政數據模組）`使用，之後便無法在沒有它的情"
"況下再次使用該 POS。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:730
msgid "Fiscal Data Module (FDM)"
msgstr "財政數據模組（FDM）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:732
msgid ""
"An FDM, or **black box**, is a government-certified device that works "
"together with the Point of Sale application and saves your POS orders "
"information. Concretely, a **hash** (:dfn:`unique code`) is generated for "
"each POS order and added to its receipt. This allows the government to "
"verify that all revenue is declared."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:738
msgid ""
"Only the FDM from **Boîtenoire.be** with the `FDM certificate number BMC04 "
"<https://www.systemedecaisseenregistreuse.be/fr/systemes-"
"certifies#FDM%20certifiés>`_ is supported by Odoo. `Contact the manufacturer"
" (GCV BMC) <https://www.boîtenoire.be/contact>`_ to order one."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 僅支援來自 **Boîtenoire.be** 且具備 `FDM 證書編號 BMC04 <https://"
"www.systemedecaisseenregistreuse.be/fr/systemes-certifies#FDM%20certifiés>`_ "
"的 FDM。如要訂購，請 `聯絡製造商 (GCV BMC) <https://www.boîtenoire.be/"
"contact>`_。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:746
msgid ""
"Before setting up your database to work with an FDM, ensure you have the "
"following hardware:"
msgstr "在設定資料庫以配合 FDM 使用前，請確保你具備以下硬件："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:748
msgid "a **Boîtenoire.be** (certificate number BMC04) FDM;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:749
msgid "an RS-232 serial null modem cable per FDM;"
msgstr "每部 FDM 一條 RS-232 串列零數據機連接線；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:750
msgid "an RS-232 serial-to-USB adapter per FDM;"
msgstr "每部 FDM 一個 RS-232 序列埠轉 USB 轉接器；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:751
msgid "an :ref:`IoT Box <belgium/iotbox>` (one IoT box per FDM); and"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:752
msgid "a receipt printer."
msgstr "收據打印機。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:757
msgid "Black box module"
msgstr "黑盒模組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:759
msgid ""
"As a pre-requisite, :ref:`activate <general/install>` the `Belgian "
"Registered Cash Register` module (technical name: `pos_blackbox_be`)."
msgstr ""
"作為先決條件，請先 :ref:`啟用 <general/install>` `Belgian Registered Cash "
"Register` 模組（技術名稱：`pos_blackbox_be`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:762
msgid "black box modules for belgian fiscal certification"
msgstr "比利時財政認證黑盒模組"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:765
msgid ""
"Once the module is activated, add your VAT number to your company "
"information. To set it up, go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Companies --> "
"Update Info`, and fill in the :guilabel:`VAT` field. Then, enter a national "
"registration number for every staff member who operates the POS system. To "
"do so, go to the :guilabel:`Employees` app and open an employee form. There,"
" go to :menuselection:`HR settings tab --> Attendance/Point of Sale`, and "
"fill in the :guilabel:`INSZ or BIS number` field."
msgstr ""
"啟用模組後，請將您的增值稅 (VAT) 編號加入公司資料。設定方法：前往 "
":menuselection:`設定 --> 公司 --> 更新資料`，並填寫 :guilabel:`增值稅` 欄位。"
"接著，為每位操作 POS 系統的員工輸入國民登記號碼。請前往 :guilabel:`員工` 應用"
"程式並開啟員工表單。在表單中前往 :menuselection:`人力資源設定分頁 --> 考勤/"
"POS 銷售點`，然後填寫 :guilabel:`INSZ 或 BIS 號碼` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:771
msgid "ISNZ or BIS number field on employee form"
msgstr "員工表單上的 ISNZ 或 BIS 編號欄位"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:775
msgid ""
"To input your information, click on your avatar, go to :menuselection:`My "
"Profile --> Preference tab`, and enter your INSZ or BIS number in the "
"designated field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:779
msgid ""
"You must configure the :abbr:`FDM (Fiscal Data Module)` directly in the "
"production database. Utilizing it in a testing environment may result in "
"incorrect data being stored within the FDM."
msgstr ""
"你必須直接在正式數據庫中配置 :abbr:`FDM (財政數據模組)`。在測試環境中使用它，"
"可能會導致 FDM 內儲存錯誤的數據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:785
msgid "IoT Box"
msgstr "IoT 盒"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:787
msgid ""
"In order to use an :abbr:`FDM (Fiscal Data Module)`, you need a registered "
"IoT Box. To register your IoT box, you must contact us through our `support "
"contact form <https://www.odoo.com/help>`_ and provide the following "
"information:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:791
msgid "your VAT number;"
msgstr "您的增值稅編號；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:792
msgid "your company's name, address, and legal structure;"
msgstr "貴公司的名稱、地址及法律架構；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:793
msgid "the identifier of your IoT Box."
msgstr "您的 IoT Box 識別碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:795
msgid ""
"Once your IoT box is certified, :doc:`connect <../../general/iot/connect>` "
"it to your database. To verify that the IoT Box recognizes the FDM, go to "
"the IoT homepage and scroll down the :guilabel:`IOT Device` section, which "
"should display the FDM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:799
msgid "Hardware status page on a registered IoT Box"
msgstr "已註冊 IoT Box 上的硬件狀態頁面"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:802
msgid ""
"Then, add the IoT to your POS. To do so, go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale"
" --> Configuration --> Point of Sale`, select your POS, scroll down to the "
":guilabel:`Connected Device` section, and enable :guilabel:`IoT Box`. "
"Lastly, add the FMD in the :guilabel:`Fiscal Data Module` field."
msgstr ""
"然後，將 IoT 新增至您的 POS。請前往 :menuselection:`銷售點 --> 設定 --> 銷售"
