#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:875
msgid ""
"To request a payment by generating a QR code, select the :ref:`configured "
"payment method <belgium/pos/bancontact-method>` on the payment screen. The "
"customer can then scan the QR code and confirm the payment using the "
"Bancontact Pay app or a mobile banking app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:880
msgid ""
"If the QR code is not automatically displayed after selecting the payment "
"method or if using the sticker as the payment method, click :guilabel:`Send`"
" under the :guilabel:`Payment request pending` notification."
msgstr ""
"如果選擇付款方式後未有自動顯示二維碼，或使用貼紙作為付款方式，請點擊 "
":guilabel:`傳送`（位於 :guilabel:`付款請求待處理` 通知下方）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:883
msgid ""
"If the payment fails, the transaction is canceled. Click :guilabel:`Retry` "
"to reset the payment."
msgstr "如果付款失敗，交易便會取消。點擊 :guilabel:`重試` 以重設付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:887
msgid ""
"When customers cancel the payment request from their app, Odoo is notified "
"and automatically cancels the payment."
msgstr "當客戶在應用程式中取消付款請求時，Odoo 會收到通知並自動取消該筆付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/belgium.rst:889
msgid ""
"Use the :guilabel:`Force Cancel` or :guilabel:`Force Done` buttons in "
"specific cases only, such as canceling the customer's ongoing transaction in"
" their app. The actual payment status with Bancontact Pay is not verified "
"when using these buttons; clicking :guilabel:`Force Done`, for example, can "
"validate the order in Odoo even if the payment is not completed."
msgstr ""
"僅限在特定情況下才使用 :guilabel:`強制取消` 或 :guilabel:`強制完成` 按鈕，例"
"如取消客戶在應用程式中正在進行的交易。使用這些按鈕時，系統不會驗證 "
"Bancontact Pay 的實際付款狀態；例如，即使付款尚未完成，點擊 :guilabel:`強制完"
"成` 仍可在 Odoo 中驗證訂單。"

