#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:443
msgid "PAD mandates"
msgstr "PAD 授權書"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:445
msgid ""
"A :abbr:`PAD (Pre-Authorized Debit)` mandate, or PAD agreement, is the "
"authorization given by a customer to debit their bank account for the "
"amounts due on their invoices. An active PAD mandate is required to collect "
"a customer's payments with a CPA005 file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:449
msgid "To create a PAD mandate, follow these steps:"
msgstr "如要建立 PAD 授權書，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:453
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`Customer`. Make sure a :guilabel:`Country` is set on "
"the customer's contact form."
msgstr "選擇:guilabel:`客戶`。請確保客戶的聯絡人表單已設定:guilabel:`國家／地區`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:455
msgid ""
"Select the customer's :guilabel:`Bank Account` from which the payments are "
"collected."
msgstr "選擇用於向客戶收取款項的 :guilabel:`銀行賬戶`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:456
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`PAD Category`, which is printed on the PAD agreement: "
":guilabel:`Personal (Utilities, Mortgage, ...)` or :guilabel:`Business "
"(Commercial Activities)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:458
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Pre-notification` period, i.e., the minimum number of "
"days between notifying the customer of an upcoming debit (e.g., by sending "
"them the invoice) and collecting it. The Payments Canada rules require at "
"least `10` days."
msgstr ""
"設定 :guilabel:`預先通知` 期限，即在通知客戶即將扣款（例如透過向客戶發送發票"
"）與實際收款之間的最少相隔天數。Payments Canada 規則要求至少為 `10` 天。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:461
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Validity` period. If no end date is set, the mandate "
"remains active until it is :ref:`closed or revoked "
"<localizations/canada/cpa005-pad-close-revoke>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:464
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Send & Print` to generate the PAD agreement. Enable "
":guilabel:`Email` to send it to the customer for signature and/or "
":guilabel:`Download` to get the PDF file, then click :guilabel:`Send & "
"Print`. The PAD agreement is attached to the mandate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:468
msgid "PAD agreement generated from a PAD mandate."
msgstr "從 PAD 授權書產生的 PAD 協議。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:472
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Recurrent` frequency on the PAD agreement means that the "
"mandate can be used for multiple payments as long as it remains active, as "
"opposed to a one-time mandate that can no longer be used after a single "
"payment. It does not mean that payments are collected automatically: each "
"payment must still be :ref:`registered and included in a batch payment "
"<localizations/canada/cpa005-pad-collections>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:478
msgid ""
"Once the customer has signed the PAD agreement, click :guilabel:`Validate` "
"to activate the mandate."
msgstr "客戶簽署 PAD 協議後，點擊 :guilabel:`驗證` 以啟用授權書。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:482
msgid ""
"Validating a mandate requires the :guilabel:`Validate bank account` "
":doc:`access rights <../../general/users/access_rights>`."
msgstr ""
"驗證授權書需要具備 :guilabel:`驗證銀行賬戶` :doc:`存取權限 <../../general/"
"users/access_rights>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:484
msgid ""
"The customer's bank account must be :ref:`trusted <accounting/batch/create-"
"bank-account>`, and its :guilabel:`Account Number` and :guilabel:`Routing "
"Number (EFT)` must be valid for the CPA005 format."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:489
msgid ""
"To access a customer's mandates or create a new one from their contact form,"
" click the :guilabel:`Direct Debit Mandates` smart button."
msgstr ""
"如要從客戶的聯絡人表單存取其授權或建立新授權，請按一下 :guilabel:`直接扣賬授"
"權` 智能按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:491
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Collections` and :guilabel:`Invoices Paid` smart "
"buttons on the mandate form to view the payments and invoices linked to it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:496
msgid "To stop using an active mandate, open it and click:"
msgstr "如要停止使用有效的授權書，請開啟該授權書並點擊："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:498
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Close`: The mandate's end date is set to the current day. It can "
"no longer be used for payments dated after that day."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:500
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Revoke`: The mandate is immediately disabled (e.g., in case of "
"fraud). It can no longer be used for any payment."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`撤銷`：立即停用授權書（例如發生欺詐時）。該授權書不可再用於任何付"
"款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:503
msgid ""
"Mandates are also closed automatically once their end date has passed. "
"Closed and revoked mandates cannot be reactivated, and payments linked to "
"them are flagged when validating a batch payment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:509
msgid "PAD collections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:511
msgid ""
"To collect customer invoices by :abbr:`PAD (Pre-Authorized Debit)` via the "
