msgstr ""
"要透過 CPA005 檔案格式使用 :abbr:`PAD（預先授權扣款）` 收取客戶發票款項，請按"
"照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:514
msgid ""
":ref:`Register the payment <accounting/payments/from-invoice-bill>` of the "
"customer invoices with the bank journal configured for CPA005. Select the "
":guilabel:`CPA 005 Pre-Authorized Debit (PAD)` payment method and the "
":guilabel:`EFT/CPA transaction code` that best describes the payment."
msgstr ""
":ref:`登記付款 <accounting/payments/from-invoice-bill>`，並使用已配置 CPA005 "
"的銀行日記賬處理客戶發票。選擇 :guilabel:`CPA 005 預先授權扣款 (PAD)` 付款方"
"式，以及最適合描述該筆付款的 :guilabel:`EFT/CPA 交易代碼`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:519
msgid ""
"A message confirms that a valid mandate is available for the customer. The "
"payment is linked to that mandate, and the amount is collected from the bank"
" account set on it. Invoices of customers without a valid mandate are not "
"paid."
msgstr ""
"系統會顯示訊息，確認該客戶設有有效的授權書。付款會連結至該授權書，並從其設定"
"的銀行賬戶扣取款項。沒有有效授權書的客戶，其發票將不會獲付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:523
msgid "Registering a CPA005 PAD payment for an invoice with a valid mandate."
msgstr "為附有有效授權書的發票登記 CPA005 PAD 付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:527
msgid ""
"To list the invoices that can be paid with a mandate, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices` and use the "
":guilabel:`Has Mandate` filter."
msgstr ""
"如要列出可使用授權書付款的發票，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 客戶 --> 發"
"票`，然後使用 :guilabel:`已有授權書` 篩選條件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:530
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Payments`, select the "
"relevant payments, click :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions`, and select "
":guilabel:`Create batch payment`."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 客戶 --> 付款`，選擇相關付款，點擊 :icon:`fa-"
"cog` :guilabel:`操作`，然後選擇 :guilabel:`建立批量付款`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:532
msgid ""
"Verify the information, such as the :guilabel:`Date` and the :guilabel:`File"
" Creation Number used in Canadian EFT`, before validating the batch payment."
" Leave the :guilabel:`File Creation Number used in Canadian EFT` field empty"
" to use the journal's next PAD :abbr:`FCN (File Creation Number)`."
msgstr ""
"驗證批次付款前，請先核對各項資料，例如 :guilabel:`日期` 及 :guilabel:`加拿大 "
"EFT 使用的檔案建立編號`。如將 :guilabel:`加拿大 EFT 使用的檔案建立編號` 欄位"
"留空，系統將使用該日記賬的下一個 PAD :abbr:`FCN（檔案建立編號）`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:538
msgid ""
"The generated CPA005 TXT file is available in the chatter for download and "
"bank import. Once the bank has collected the funds, :ref:`reconcile "
"<accounting/batch/bank_reconciliation>` the bank transaction with the batch "
"payment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:542
msgid ""
"Validated CPA005 PAD batch payment with the generated file in the chatter."
msgstr "已驗證的 CPA005 PAD 批量付款，訊息記錄中包含已產生的檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:546
msgid ""
"The payment date is the date on which the funds are collected. Make sure the"
" customer is notified of the amount and date at least as many days in "
"advance as set in the mandate's :guilabel:`Pre-notification` field."
msgstr ""
"付款日期即收取款項的日期。請確保至少提前授權書的 :guilabel:`預先通知` 欄位中"
"所設定的天數，通知客戶付款金額及日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:549
msgid ""
"The CPA005 format only accepts payment dates up to 2 business days after the"
" batch payment's :guilabel:`Date`, and up to 173 days before it."
msgstr ""
"CPA005 格式只接受在批量付款:guilabel:`日期`之後最多 2 個工作天，以及之前最多 "
"173 天內的付款日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/canada.rst:551
msgid ""
"A CPA005 file contains payments in a single currency: either Canadian "
"dollars (CAD) or United States dollars (USD)."
msgstr "CPA005 檔案包含單一貨幣的付款：加元（CAD）或美元（USD）。"

