msgid ""
":guilabel:`Subject Serial Number`: depending on the certificate format, the "
"field might not be automatically populated. In that case, enter the "
"certificate's legal representative :abbr:`RUT (Rol Único Tributario)`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`主體序號`：視乎憑證格式而定，此欄位未必會自動填寫。在該情況下，請"
"輸入憑證法定代表人的 :abbr:`RUT (Rol Único Tributario，統一稅務識別號)`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:213
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Certificate Owner`: select one if you need to restrict the "
"certificate for a specific user. Leave the field empty to share it with all "
"billing users."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`憑證擁有者`：如須限制只有特定用戶可使用該憑證，請選擇一名用戶。將"
"此欄位留空，即可與所有賬單用戶共用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:216
msgid "Digital certificate configuration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:220
