#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:403
msgid ""
"In the Chilean localization, the electronic invoice workflow includes "
"customer invoice issuance and vendor bill reception. The following diagram "
"explains how information is shared to the :abbr:`SII (Servicio de Impuestos "
"Internos)`, customers, and vendors."
msgstr ""
"在智利本地化版本中，電子發票工作流程包括開立客戶發票及接收供應商賬單。以下圖"
"表說明如何向 :abbr:`SII (智利國內稅務局)`、客戶及供應商分享資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:407
msgid "Diagram with Electronic invoice transactions."
msgstr "顯示電子發票交易的圖表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:411
