#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:607
msgid "Cancel referenced document"
msgstr "取消參照文件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:609
msgid ""
"In case you need to cancel or invalidate an invoice, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices` and select the "
"desired invoice. Then, use the button :guilabel:`Add Credit Note` and select"
" :guilabel:`Full Refund`, in this case the :abbr:`SII (Servicio de Impuestos"
" Internos)` reference code is automatically set to :guilabel:`Anula "
"Documento de referencia`."
msgstr ""
"如需要取消或作廢發票，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 客戶 --> 發票`，並選擇"
"所需發票。然後使用 :guilabel:`新增貸項通知單` 按鈕並選擇 :guilabel:`全額退"
"款`，在此情況下，:abbr:`SII (智利國稅局，Servicio de Impuestos Internos)` 參"
"考代碼將自動設為 :guilabel:`Anula Documento de referencia`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:614
msgid "Credit note cancelling the referenced document."
msgstr "用以取消所引用單據的貸記單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:618
msgid "Correct referenced document"
msgstr "更正參照文件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:620
msgid ""
"If a correction in the invoice information is required, for example the "
"street name on the original invoice is wrong, then use the button "
":guilabel:`Add Credit Note`, select :guilabel:`Partial Refund` and select "
"the option :guilabel:`Only Text Correction`. In this case the :guilabel:`SII"
" Reference Code` field is automatically set to :guilabel:`Corrects "
"Referenced Document Text`."
msgstr ""
"如需更正發票資料（例如原發票上的街道名稱有誤），請點擊 :guilabel:`新增貸記"
"單` 按鈕，選擇 :guilabel:`部分退款`，並選擇 :guilabel:`僅更正文字` 選項。在此"
"情況下，:guilabel:`SII 參考代碼` 欄位會自動設為 :guilabel:`更正參考文件文"
"字`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:625
msgid "Credit note correcting referenced document text."
msgstr "用於更正所參考文件文字的貸記單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:628
msgid ""
"Odoo creates a credit note with the corrected text in an invoice and "
":guilabel:`Price` `0.00`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 會建立一張貸記單，當中包含發票上已更正的文字，而:guilabel:`價格`則為 "
"`0.00`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:630
msgid "Credit note with the corrected value on the invoice lines."
msgstr "在發票資料行上載有更正金額的貸記單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:634
msgid ""
"Make sure to define the :guilabel:`Default Credit Account` in the sales "
"journal specifically for this use case."
msgstr "請務必在銷售日記賬中專門為此使用情境定義:guilabel:`預設貸方賬戶`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:638
msgid "Corrects referenced document amount"
msgstr "更正參考文件金額"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:640
msgid ""
"When a correction on the amounts is required, use the button :guilabel:`Add "
"Credit note` and select :guilabel:`Partial Refund`. In this case the "
":guilabel:`SII Reference Code` is automatically set to :guilabel:`Corrige el"
" monto del Documento de Referencia`."
msgstr ""
"需要更正金額時，請使用 :guilabel:`新增貸記單` 按鈕並選擇 :guilabel:`部分退"
"款`。在此情況下，:guilabel:`SII 參考代碼` 會自動設為 :guilabel:`Corrige el "
"monto del Documento de Referencia`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:644
msgid ""
"Credit note for partial refund to correct amounts, using the SII reference "
"code 3."
msgstr "用於部分退款以更正金額的貸項通知單，使用 SII 參考代碼 3。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:650
msgid ""
"In Chilean localization, debit notes, in addition to credit notes, can be "
"created using the :guilabel:`Add Debit Note` button, with two main use "
"cases."
msgstr ""
"在智利本地化設定中，除了貸記單外，亦可使用 :guilabel:`新增借記單` 按鈕建立借"
"記單，主要有兩種使用情境。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:659
msgid "Add debt on invoices"
msgstr "在發票上加入欠款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:661
msgid ""
"The primary use case for debit notes is to increase the value of an existing"
" invoice. To do so, select option :guilabel:`3. Corrige el monto del "
"Documento de Referencia` for the :guilabel:`Reference Code SII` field."
msgstr ""
"借記單的主要用途是增加現有發票的金額。如要這樣做，請選取 :guilabel:`3. "
"Corrige el monto del Documento de Referencia` 選項作為 :guilabel:`SII 參考編"
"號` 欄位的設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:665
msgid "Debit note correcting referenced document amount."
msgstr "更正參考文件金額的借項通知單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:668
msgid ""
"In this case Odoo automatically includes the :guilabel:`Source Invoice` in "
"the :guilabel:`Cross Reference` tab."
msgstr ""
"在此情況下，Odoo 會自動將 :guilabel:`來源發票` 包含在 :guilabel:`交叉參照` 分"
"頁中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:671
msgid "Automatic reference to invoice in a debit note."
msgstr "在借項通知單中自動參考發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:675
msgid ""
"You can only add debit notes to an invoice already accepted by the SII."
msgstr "您只可為已獲 SII 接納的發票新增借項通知單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:678
msgid "Cancel credit notes"
msgstr "取消貸項通知單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:680
msgid ""
"In Chile, debits notes are used to cancel a valid credit note. To do this, "
"click the :guilabel:`Add Debit Note` button and select the :guilabel:`1: "
"Anula Documentos de referencia` option for the :guilabel:`Reference Code "
"SII` field."
msgstr ""
"在智利，借項通知單用於取消有效的貸項通知單。要執行此操作，請點擊 "
":guilabel:`新增借項通知單` 按鈕，並選擇 :guilabel:`1: Anula Documentos de "
"referencia` 選項作為 :guilabel:`SII 參考代碼` 欄位的值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:684
msgid "Debit note to cancel the referenced document (credit note)."
msgstr "用於取消所參照文件（貸項通知單）的借項通知單。"

