msgstr ""
":guilabel:`智利 - 電子發票送貨單` 與 :guilabel:`Chile - Facturación "
"Electrónica` 存在相依關係。安裝 :guilabel:`送貨單` 模組時，Odoo 會自動安裝該"
"相依模組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:795
msgid ""
"The *Delivery Guide* module includes the ability to send the :abbr:`DTE "
"(Documentos Tributarios Electrónicos)` to :abbr:`SII (Servicio de Impuestos "
"Internos)` and the stamp in PDF reports for deliveries."
msgstr ""
"*送貨單* 模組支援將 :abbr:`DTE (電子稅務文件 Documentos Tributarios "
"Electrónicos)` 發送至 :abbr:`SII (智利國稅局 Servicio de Impuestos Internos)"
"`，並支援在送貨 PDF 報表中加入電子印章。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:799
msgid ""
"Once all configurations have been made for :ref:`electronic invoices "
"<chile/electronic-invoice>` (e.g., uploading a valid company certificate, "
"setting up master data, etc.), delivery guides need their own :abbr:`CAFs "
"(Folio Authorization Code)`. Please refer to the :ref:`CAF documentation "
"<chile/caf-documentation>` to check the details on how to acquire the "
":abbr:`CAF (Folio Authorization Code)` for electronic Delivery Guides."
msgstr ""
"完成 :ref:`電子發票 <chile/electronic-invoice>` 的所有設定後（例如上載有效的"
"公司憑證、設定主資料等），送貨單需要專屬的 :abbr:`CAF (頁碼授權碼)`。請參閱 "
":ref:`CAF 說明文件 <chile/caf-documentation>`，以了解如何取得電子送貨單專用"
"的 :abbr:`CAF (頁碼授權碼)`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:805
msgid ""
"Verify the following important information in the :guilabel:`Price for the "
"Delivery Guide` configuration:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:808
msgid ""
":guilabel:`From Sales Order`: delivery guide takes the product price from "
"the sales order and shows it on the document."
msgstr ":guilabel:`來自銷售訂單`：送貨單會從銷售訂單擷取產品價格，並顯示在文件上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:810
msgid ""
":guilabel:`From Product Template`: Odoo takes the price configured in the "
"product template and shows it on the document."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:812
msgid ":guilabel:`No show price`: no price is shown in the delivery guide."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:814
msgid ""
"Electronic delivery guides are used to move stock from one place to another "
"and they can represent sales, sampling, consignment, internal transfers, and"
" basically any product move."
msgstr ""
"電子送貨單用於將庫存從一個地點轉移至另一個地點，可代表銷售、樣品、寄售、內部"
"調撥，以及幾乎任何產品移動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:818
msgid "Delivery guide from a sales process"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:821
msgid ""
"A delivery guide should **not** be longer than one page or contain more than"
" 60 product lines."
msgstr "送貨單 **不應** 超過一頁或包含超過 60 個產品明細行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:823
msgid ""
"When a sales order is created and confirmed, a delivery order is generated. "
"After validating the delivery order, the option to create a delivery guide "
"is activated."
msgstr ""
"建立並確認銷售訂單後，系統會產生一張送貨單。驗證送貨單後，建立送貨指南的選項"
"便會啟用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:826
msgid "Create Delivery Guide button on a sales process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:830
msgid ""
"When clicking on :guilabel:`Create Delivery Guide` for the first time, a "
"warning message pops up, stating the following:"
msgstr "首次點擊:guilabel:`建立送貨單`時，系統會彈出警告訊息，內容如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:833
msgid ""
"`No se encontró una secuencia para la guía de despacho. Por favor, "
"establezca el primer número dentro del campo número para la guía de "
"despacho`"
msgstr "`找不到送貨單的序號。請在送貨單的編號欄位中設定第一個編號`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:836
msgid "First Delivery Guide number warning message."
msgstr "首個送貨指南編號警告訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:839
msgid ""
"This warning message means the user needs to indicate the next sequence "
"number Odoo has to take to generate the delivery guide (e.g. next available "
":abbr:`CAF (Folio Authorization Code)` number), and only happens the first "
"time a delivery guide is created in Odoo. After the first document has been "
"correctly generated, Odoo takes the next available number in the :abbr:`CAF "
"(Folio Authorization Code)` file to generate the following delivery guide."
msgstr ""
"此警告訊息表示用戶需要指定 Odoo 用於產生送貨指引的下一個序號（例如下一個可用"
"的 :abbr:`CAF（編號授權碼）` 編號），且僅會在首次於 Odoo 建立送貨指引時出現。"
"成功產生首份文件後，Odoo 會從 :abbr:`CAF（編號授權碼）` 檔案中取得下一個可用"
"編號，以產生後續的送貨指引。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:845
msgid "After the delivery guide is created:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:847
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`DTE (Documentos Tributarios Electrónicos)` file (Electronic Tax "
"Document) is automatically created and added to the :guilabel:`chatter`."
msgstr ""
"系統會自動建立 :abbr:`DTE (Documentos Tributarios Electrónicos)` 檔案（電子稅"
"務文件），並將其加入至 :guilabel:`對話欄`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:851
msgid "Chatter notes of Delivery Guide creation."
msgstr "建立送貨單的聊天室備註。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:854
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`DTE Status` is automatically updated by Odoo with a scheduled"
" action that runs every night. To get a response from the :abbr:`SII "
"(Servicio de Impuestos Internos)` immediately, press the :guilabel:`Send now"
" to SII` button."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 會透過每晚執行的排程動作自動更新 :guilabel:`DTE 狀態`。如要立即從 "
":abbr:`SII (Servicio de Impuestos Internos)` 取得回應，請按 :guilabel:`立即傳"
"送至 SII` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:858
msgid ""
"Once the delivery guide is sent, it may then be printed by clicking on the "
":guilabel:`Print Delivery Guide` button."
msgstr "發送送貨指南後，即可點擊 :guilabel:`列印送貨指南` 按鈕將其列印。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:861
msgid "Printing Delivery Guide PDF."
msgstr "列印送貨指南 PDF。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:864
msgid ""
"Delivery guide will have fiscal elements that indicate that the document is "
"fiscally valid when printed (if hosted in *Odoo SH* or on *On-premise* "
"remember to manually add the :guilabel:`pdf417gen` library mentioned in the "
":ref:`Invoice PDF report section <chile/electronic-invoice-pdf-report>`)."
msgstr ""
"送貨單會包含稅務元素，表示文件在列印時具有稅務效力（如託管於 *Odoo SH* 或 *本"
"地部署*，請謹記手動加入 :guilabel:`pdf417gen` 函式庫，該函式庫於 :ref:`發票 "
"PDF 報表章節 <chile/electronic-invoice-pdf-report>` 中提及）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:870
msgid "Electronic receipt"
msgstr "電子收據"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:872
msgid ""
"To install the :guilabel:`Electronic Receipt` module, go to "
":menuselection:`Apps` and search for `Chile (l10n_cl)`. Then click "
":guilabel:`Install` on the module :guilabel:`Chile - Electronic Receipt`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:877
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Chile - Electronic Receipt` has a dependency with "
":guilabel:`Chile - Facturación Electrónica`. Odoo will install the "
"dependency automatically when the :guilabel:`E-invoicing Delivery Guide` "
"module is installed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`智利 - 電子收據` 與 :guilabel:`智利 - 電子發票` 有相依關係。安裝 "
":guilabel:`電子發票送貨單` 模組時，Odoo 會自動安裝該相依模組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:881
msgid ""
"Once all configurations have been made for :ref:`electronic invoices "
"<chile/electronic-invoice>` (e.g., uploading a valid company certificate, "
"setting up master data, etc.), electronic receipts need their own "
":abbr:`CAFs (Folio Authorization Code)`. Please refer to the :ref:`CAF "
"documentation <chile/caf-documentation>` to check the details on how to "
"acquire the :abbr:`CAFs (Folio Authorization Code)` for electronic receipts."
msgstr ""
"完成 :ref:`電子發票 <chile/electronic-invoice>` 的所有配置後（例如上載有效的"
"公司憑證、設定主數據等），電子收據需要專屬的 :abbr:`CAF (編號授權碼)`。請參"
"閱 :ref:`CAF 說明文件 <chile/caf-documentation>`，了解如何取得電子收據的 "
":abbr:`CAF (編號授權碼)`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:887
msgid ""
"Electronic receipts are useful when clients do not need an electronic "
"invoice. By default, there is a partner in the database called "
":guilabel:`Anonymous Final Consumer` with a generic :abbr:`RUT (Rol Único "
"Tributario)` `66666666-6` and taxpayer type of :guilabel:`Final Consumer`. "
"This partner can be used for electronic receipts or a new record may be "
"created for the same purpose."
msgstr ""
"當客戶不需要電子發票時，電子收據便非常有用。資料庫中預設有一個名為 "
":guilabel:`匿名最終消費者` 的合作夥伴，其通用的 :abbr:`RUT (統一稅務登記號)` "
"為 `66666666-6`，納稅人類別為 :guilabel:`最終消費者`。您可將此合作夥伴用於電"
"子收據，或為相同目的建立新記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:892
msgid "Electronic Receipt module."
msgstr "電子收據模組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:895
msgid ""
"Although electronic receipts should be used for final consumers with a "
"generic :abbr:`RUT (Rol Único Tributario)`, it can also be used for specific"
" partners. After the partners and journals are created and configured, the "
"electronic receipts are created in the standard way as electronic invoice, "
"but the type of document :guilabel:`(39) Electronic Receipt` should be "
"selected in the invoice form:"
msgstr ""
"雖然電子收據應使用通用 :abbr:`RUT（Rol Único Tributario）` 開立予最終消費者，"
"但亦可用於特定合作夥伴。建立並配置合作夥伴及日記賬後，電子收據會按電子發票的"
"標準方式建立，但須在發票表單中選擇文件類型 :guilabel:`(39) 電子收據`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:900
msgid "Document type 39 for Electronic Receipts."
msgstr "電子收據的文件類型 39。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:906
msgid ""
"When all of the electronic receipt information is filled, manually (or "
"automatically) proceed to validate the receipt from the sales order. By "
"default, :guilabel:`Electronic Invoice` is selected as the "
":guilabel:`Document Type`, however in order to validate the receipt "
"correctly, make sure to edit the :guilabel:`Document Type` and change to "
":guilabel:`Electronic Receipt`."
msgstr ""
"填妥所有電子收據資料後，請手動（或自動）從銷售訂單驗證該收據。系統預設選擇 "
":guilabel:`電子發票` 作為 :guilabel:`文件類型`；但為確保正確驗證收據，請務必"
"編輯 :guilabel:`文件類型`，並更改為 :guilabel:`電子收據`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:911
msgid "After the receipt is posted:"
msgstr "收據過賬後："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:913
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`DTE (Documentos Tributarios Electrónicos)` file (Electronic Tax "
"Document) is created automatically and added to the :guilabel:`chatter`."
msgstr ""
"系統會自動建立 :abbr:`DTE（Documentos Tributarios Electrónicos）` 檔案（電子"
"稅務文件），並將其新增至 :guilabel:`通訊欄`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:917
msgid "Electronic Receipts STE creation status."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:920
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`DTE Status` is automatically updated by Odoo with a scheduled"
" action that runs every day at night. To get a response from the :abbr:`SII "
"(Servicio de Impuestos Internos)` immediately, press the :guilabel:`Send now"
" to SII` button."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 會透過每天夜間執行的排程動作自動更新 :guilabel:`DTE 狀態`。如要立即從 "
":abbr:`SII (智利國稅局，Servicio de Impuestos Internos)` 取得回應，請按下 "
":guilabel:`立即傳送至 SII` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:924
msgid ""
"Please refer to the :ref:`DTE Workflow <chile/electronic-invoice-"
"validation>` for electronic invoices as the workflow for electronic receipt "
"follows the same process."
msgstr ""
"請參閱電子發票的 :ref:`DTE 工作流程 <chile/electronic-invoice-validation>`，"
"因為電子收據的工作流程亦採用相同程序。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:928
msgid "Electronic export of goods"
msgstr "貨物電子出口"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:930
msgid ""
"To install the :guilabel:`Electronic Exports of Goods` module, go to "
":menuselection:`Apps` and search for `Chile (l10n_cl)`. Then click "
":guilabel:`Install` on the module :guilabel:`Electronic Exports of Goods for"
" Chile`."
msgstr ""
"要安裝:guilabel:`貨物電子出口`模組，請前往:menuselection:`應用程式`並搜尋 "
"`Chile (l10n_cl)`。然後點擊:guilabel:`安裝`，以安裝:guilabel:`智利貨物電子出"
"口`模組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:935
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Chile - Electronic Exports of Goods for Chile` has a dependency "
"with :guilabel:`Chile - Facturación Electrónica`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`智利 - 智利貨物電子出口` 依賴 :guilabel:`智利 - Facturación "
"Electrónica`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:938
msgid ""
"Once all configurations have been made for :ref:`electronic invoices "
"<chile/electronic-invoice>` (e.g., uploading a valid company certificate, "
"setting up master data, etc.), electronic exports of goods need their own "
":abbr:`CAFs (Folio Authorization Code)`. Please refer to the :ref:`CAF "
"documentation <chile/caf-documentation>` to check the details on how to "
"acquire the :abbr:`CAFs (Folio Authorization Code)` for electronic receipts."
msgstr ""
"完成 :ref:`電子發票 <chile/electronic-invoice>` 的所有配置後（例如：上傳有效"
"的公司憑證、設定主數據等），電子出口貨物需要專用的 :abbr:`CAF (編號授權碼)`。"
"請參閱 :ref:`CAF 文件 <chile/caf-documentation>`，以了解如何為電子收據取得 "
":abbr:`CAF (編號授權碼)` 的詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:944
msgid ""
"Electronic invoices for the export of goods are tax documents that are used "
"not only for the :abbr:`SII (Servicio de Impuestos Internos)` but are also "
"used with customs and contain the information required by it."
msgstr ""
"貨物出口電子發票是一種稅務文件，不僅用於:abbr:`SII (Servicio de Impuestos "
"Internos)`，亦同時用於海關，並包含海關所需的資料。"

