#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:960
msgid "Chilean customs fields."
msgstr "智利海關欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:964
msgid "PDF report"
msgstr "PDF 報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:966
msgid ""
"Once the invoice is accepted and validated by the :abbr:`SII (Servicio de "
"Impuestos Internos)` and the PDF is printed, it includes the fiscal elements"
" that indicate that the document is fiscally valid and a new section needed "
"for customs."
msgstr ""
"發票經 :abbr:`SII (Servicio de Impuestos Internos)` 接受並驗證後，列印出的 "
"PDF 會包含證明該文件在稅務上有效的稅務元素，以及海關所需的新增部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:970
msgid "PDF report section for the Electronic Exports of Goods PDF Report."
msgstr "電子出口貨品 PDF 報表的 PDF 報表部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:974
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:941
