#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:984
msgid "Generate electronic documents from the *eCommerce* application"
msgstr "從 *電子商務* 應用程式產生電子文件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:985
