"系統會在網上付款確認時自動生成電子文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:998
msgid "Invoice Policy and Automatic Invoice configurations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/chile.rst:1001
msgid ""
"Since an online payment needs to be confirmed for the *automatic invoice* "
"feature to generate the document, a payment provider must be configured for "
"the related website."
msgstr ""
"由於必須先確認網上付款，*自動建立發票* 功能才會產生文件，因此必須為相關網站設"
"定付款服務商。"

