#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:334
msgid ""
"Some VAT scenarios are not configured as taxes. Instead, each scenario is an"
" independent tax grid defined directly in the formulas of the :ref:`tax "
"report <localizations/china/accounting/tax_report>`."
msgstr ""
"部分增值稅情況並非配置為稅項。相反，每種情況都是一個獨立的稅務網格，直接定義"
"於 :ref:`稅務報表 <localizations/china/accounting/tax_report>` 的公式中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:338
msgid ""
"To report an amount under a specific grid, open a draft invoice, bill, or "
"journal entry. In the :guilabel:`Journal Items` tab, select the grid in the "
":guilabel:`Tax Grids` field of the relevant journal item. A tax grid can be "
"used alone, without applying a tax rate, or combined with a tax when the "
"amount also needs to follow a tax rate."
msgstr ""
"如要在特定網格下申報金額，請開啟草稿發票、賬單或日記賬分錄。在:guilabel:`日記"
"賬項目`分頁中，於相關日記賬項目的:guilabel:`稅務網格`欄位選取該網格。稅務網格"
"可單獨使用（無需套用稅率），亦可在金額同時需要跟隨稅率時與稅項結合使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:344
msgid ""
"These grids are not taxes and therefore do not appear in the list of taxes "
"under :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes`."
msgstr ""
"這些網格並非稅項，因此不會顯示於 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 稅項` 的稅"
"項清單中。"

