#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:480
msgid "VAT differential taxation"
msgstr "增值稅差額徵稅"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:482
msgid ""
"**VAT differential taxation** allows taxpayers to calculate VAT on the "
"balance of the sales amount after deducting specific amounts paid to third "
"parties, instead of on the full sales amount. This method applies to "
"businesses where part of the amount received from customers is passed on to "
"other parties, such as travel agencies, labor dispatch, and agency services."
msgstr ""
"**增值稅差額徵稅**允許納稅人從銷售總額中扣除支付予第三方的特定款項後，僅就餘"
"額計算增值稅，而非按全額計算。此方法適用於將部分向客戶收取的款項轉付予其他方"
"的企業，例如旅行社、勞務派遣及代理服務。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:487
msgid ""
"Deductible amounts are recorded as balance deductions on the customer "
"invoice. An :ref:`output VAT offset entry "
"<localizations/china/vat_differential_taxation/workflow/output_vat_offset_entry>`"
" is then automatically posted to reduce the output VAT accordingly. The "
"fapiao can be issued either for the full amount or for the net amount after "
"deduction."
msgstr ""
"可抵扣金額會記錄為客戶發票上的餘額扣減。系統隨後會自動過賬:ref:`銷項增值稅抵"
"減記項 <localizations/china/vat_differential_taxation/workflow/"
"output_vat_offset_entry>`，以相應減少銷項增值稅。發票可按全額或扣減後的淨額開"
"具。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:497
msgid ""
"To configure :guilabel:`VAT Differential Taxation`, follow these steps:"
msgstr "要設定 :guilabel:`增值稅差額徵稅`，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/china.rst:500
