#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:144
msgid "Colombian electronic invoicing credentials configured."
msgstr "已配置哥倫比亞電子發票憑證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:147
msgid ""
"Configure the |DIAN| environment; the |DIAN| electronic invoicing module "
"offers four different |DIAN| environments to connect with:"
msgstr "配置 |DIAN| 環境；|DIAN| 電子發票模組提供四種不同的 |DIAN| 環境可供連接："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:150
msgid ""
"**DIAN demo mode**: This environment allows to test electronic invoicing "
"workflows using a demo digital certificate. Files are created and accepted "
"automatically and are not sent to any |DIAN| environment. Every internal "
"validation can be tested. To activate it, tick the :guilabel:`DIAN Demo "
"Mode` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"**DIAN 示範模式**：此環境可讓您使用示範數碼證書測試電子發票工作流程。系統會自"
"動建立及接受檔案，且不會傳送至任何|DIAN|環境。每項內部驗證均可進行測試。若要"
"啟用此模式，請剔選:guilabel:`DIAN 示範模式`核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:156
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`DIAN Demo Mode` checkbox is hidden from view when the "
":guilabel:`Test environment` checkbox is enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:159
msgid ""
"**Certification environment**: This environment is useful to pass the |DIAN|"
" certification process and obtain the *Enabled* status to invoice from Odoo."
" To activate it, enable both the :guilabel:`Test environment` and the "
":guilabel:`Activate the certification process` checkboxes."
msgstr ""
"**認證環境**：此環境有助通過 |DIAN| 認證流程，並取得*已啟用*狀態以透過 Odoo "
"開立發票。要啟用此環境，請同時剔選:guilabel:`測試環境`和:guilabel:`啟用認證流"
"程`核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:162
msgid ""
"**Testing environment**: This environment allows reproducing electronic "
"invoicing flows and validations in the |DIAN| testing portal. To activate "
"it, enable only the :guilabel:`Test Environment` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"**測試環境**：此環境可讓您在 |DIAN| 測試入門網站中重現電子發票流程及驗證。如"
"要啟用，只需勾選 :guilabel:`測試環境` 複選框即可。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:165
msgid ""
"**Production environment**: This environment allows generating valid "
"electronic documents. To activate it, disable both the :guilabel:`Test "
"environment` and the :guilabel:`Activate the certification process` "
"checkboxes."
msgstr ""
"**生產環境**：此環境可產生有效的電子文件。若要啟用，請取消勾選:guilabel:`測試"
"環境`及:guilabel:`啟用認證流程`兩個核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:170
msgid ""
"Do not activate :guilabel:`DIAN Demo Mode` on a production database. This "
"mode is intended for use in test environments only."
msgstr "請勿在正式環境資料庫啟用 :guilabel:`DIAN 示範模式`。此模式只供測試環境使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:174
msgid ""
"In a multi-company database, each company can have its own certificate."
msgstr "在多公司資料庫中，每間公司都可以擁有自己的證書。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:177
msgid ""
"For electronic invoicing configurations using the Carvajal solution, review "
"the following video: `Configuración de Facturación Electrónica - "
"Localización de Colombia "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bzweMwTEbfY&list=PL1-aSABtP6ABxZshems3snMjx7bj_7ZsZ&index=3>`_."
msgstr ""
"如要了解使用 Carvajal 解決方案的電子發票設定，請觀看以下影片：`Configuración "
"de Facturación Electrónica - Localización de Colombia <https://"
"www.youtube.com/watch?v=bzweMwTEbfY&list=PL1-"
"aSABtP6ABxZshems3snMjx7bj_7ZsZ&index=3>`_。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:184
msgid "Automatic DIAN Enablement"
msgstr "自動啟用 DIAN"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:186
msgid ""
"Odoo automates the |DIAN| enablement process to become an electronic "
"invoicer using the `DIAN Own Software "
"<https://micrositios.dian.gov.co/sistema-de-facturacion-electronica/como-"
"puedes-facturar-electronicamente/>`_ solution, sending the required number "
"of valid customer invoices, credit notes, and debit notes to the DIAN "
"certification environment."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 會將 |DIAN| 的啟用流程自動化，協助你透過 `DIAN 自有軟件 <https://"
"micrositios.dian.gov.co/sistema-de-facturacion-electronica/como-puedes-"
"facturar-electronicamente/>`_ 方案成為電子發票開立機構，並向 DIAN 認證環境發"
"送所需數量的有效客戶發票、貸記單及借記單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:191
msgid ""
"To start this process, complete the :ref:`main configuration steps for "
"electronic invoicing <localization/colombia/einvoice-configuration>`."
msgstr ""
"要開始此程序，請先完成 :ref:`電子發票的主要配置步驟 <localization/colombia/"
"einvoice-configuration>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:195
msgid ""
"Always run the enablement process in a **test database** to serve as the "
"environment for continued electronic invoicing testing before going to "
"production."
msgstr ""
"在正式投入使用前，請務必先在 **測試數據庫** 中執行啟用程序，作為持續進行電子"
"發票測試的環境。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/colombia.rst:198
msgid ""
"To begin the process, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration -->"
" Settings`, scroll to the :guilabel:`Colombian Electronic Invoicing` "
"section, and complete the following steps:"
