"在 :guilabel:`財政化 (HR)` 區域中，填寫 :guilabel:`營業場所標"
"籤`、:guilabel:`開票設備標籤`、:guilabel:`營業場所標籤（退款審批）` 及 "
":guilabel:`開票設備標籤（退款審批）` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:109
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Business premises label` and :guilabel:`Issuing device label`"
" are used to generate invoice names. The :guilabel:`Business premises label "
"(refund approval)` and :guilabel:`Issuing device label (refund approval)` "
"fields are used to generate credit note names."
msgstr ""
"系統會使用 :guilabel:`營業場所標籤` 及 :guilabel:`開票裝置標籤` 來產生發票名"
"稱。至於貸記單名稱，則會使用 :guilabel:`營業場所標籤（退款批准）` 及 "
":guilabel:`開票裝置標籤（退款批准）` 欄位來產生。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:116
msgid "Sending an e-invoice"
msgstr "傳送電子發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:118
msgid ""
"To send an e-invoice, follow the :ref:`standard e-invoicing "
"<accounting/e-invoicing/generation>` workflow. Be sure to select "
":guilabel:`by MojEracun` when sending the e-invoice."
msgstr ""
"如要傳送電子發票，請按照:ref:`標準電子發票 <accounting/e-invoicing/"
"generation>`工作流程。傳送電子發票時，請務必選擇:guilabel:`經 MojEracun`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:121
msgid "The following invoice fields must be set before sending to mojeRačun:"
msgstr "發送至 mojeRačun 前，必須先設定以下發票欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:123
msgid ""
"**Invoice sequence:** Ensure the invoice sequence is in the format `{Journal"
" code}-{Year}-{Sequence}/{Business premises label}/{Issuing device label}`. "
"If the journal is configured :ref:`as instructed above "
"<localizations/croatia/configuration/journal>`, Odoo automatically formats "
"invoice names to fit this format."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:127
msgid ""
":guilabel:`KPD category`: Set the :guilabel:`KPD category` on every invoice "
"line."
msgstr ":guilabel:`KPD 類別`：在每行發票明細上設定 :guilabel:`KPD 類別`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:130
msgid ""
"The |KPD category| can also be set on the product record, which will then "
"automatically apply it on invoice lines when the product is used. To do so, "
"go to :menuselection:`Accounting -> Customers -> Products`, click the "
"product, and set the :guilabel:`KPD category`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:134
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Croatia: Fiscalization 2.0` tab of invoices:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:136
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Business process type`: Set the :guilabel:`Business Process Type`"
" as appropriate. If :guilabel:`P99: Customer-defined process` is selected, "
"complete the :guilabel:`Custom Process Name` field."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`業務流程類型`：請視乎情況設定 :guilabel:`業務流程類型`。若選擇 "
":guilabel:`P99：客戶定義流程`，請填寫 :guilabel:`自訂流程名稱` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:139
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fiscal user` and :guilabel:`Operator OIB`: The Croatian "
"government expects the user who sends the invoice to be identified via their"
" personal |OIB| number. The fiscal user defaults to the user who confirms "
"the invoice and is identified under :guilabel:`Fiscal User`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`財政用戶` 及 :guilabel:`操作員 OIB`：克羅地亞政府要求透過個人 "
"|OIB| 號碼識別發送發票的用戶。財政用戶預設為確認發票的用戶，並會在 "
":guilabel:`財政用戶` 下識別。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:143
msgid ""
"The user's |OIB| can be set on the user's contact record. To do so, follow "
"these steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:145
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Users & Companies --> Users` and click "
"the user in the list view."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`設定 --> 用戶與公司 --> 用戶`，然後在列表檢視中按一下該"
"用戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:147
msgid ""
"In the user's form, click the :guilabel:`Contact` smart button to access the"
" user's :guilabel:`Contact` form."
msgstr ""
"在使用者表單中，點擊:guilabel:`聯絡人`智能按鈕，以開啟該使用者的:guilabel:`聯"
"絡人`表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:149
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab, set the :guilabel:`Personal OIB` in"
" the :guilabel:`Misc` section."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`銷售及採購` 分頁中，設定 :guilabel:`個人 OIB`（位於 "
":guilabel:`雜項` 區域）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:152
msgid "Once an invoice has been sent:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:154
msgid ""
"**Invoice fiscalization information:** The :guilabel:`Fiscalization status`,"
" :guilabel:`Fiscalization request ID`, :guilabel:`Payment amount already "
"reported to Tax Authority`, and :guilabel:`MojeRačun document ElectronicId` "
"can be viewed in the :guilabel:`Croatia: Fiscalization 2.0` tab."
msgstr ""
"**發票財政化資料：** :guilabel:`財政化狀態`、:guilabel:`財政化請求 "
"ID`、:guilabel:`已向稅務機關申報的付款金額` 及 :guilabel:`MojeRačun 文件 "
"ElectronicId` 可在 :guilabel:`克羅地亞：財政化 2.0` 分頁中查看。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:158
msgid ""
"**Fetching status updates:** Odoo periodically checks for any updates to the"
" invoice's status (e.g., rejection by |MER|, the eRačun system, or the "
"recipient). To manually check for updates, go to the "
":menuselection:`Accounting` dashboard, and in the :guilabel:`Customer "
"Invoices` (sales) journal, click the :guilabel:`MER: Fetch status` button."
msgstr ""
"**擷取狀態更新：** Odoo 會定期檢查發票狀態的任何更新（例如遭 |MER|、eRačun 系"
"統或收件人拒絕）。如要手動檢查更新，請前往 :menuselection:`會計` 儀表板，並"
"在 :guilabel:`客戶發票`（銷售）日記賬中，按一下 :guilabel:`MER: 擷取狀態` 按"
"鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:162
msgid ""
"**Reporting a payment:** The Croatian government expects to be notified once"
" payment has been received for an invoice. To send this notification, click "
"the :guilabel:`MER: Report payments` button on the invoice form view, which "
"appears if the invoice has unreported payments."
msgstr ""
"**申報付款：** 克羅地亞政府規定在收到發票付款後必須發出通知。若要傳送此通知，"
"請按一下發票表單檢視上的 :guilabel:`MER: 申報付款` 按鈕（若發票有未申報的付款"
"，該按鈕便會顯示）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:167
msgid ""
"To report multiple payment notifications at once, select multiple invoices "
"from the invoice list view and click the :guilabel:`MER: Report payments` "
"button."
msgstr ""
"若要一次過申報多項付款通知，請在發票清單檢視中選取多張發票，然後點"
"擊:guilabel:`MER：申報付款`按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:173
msgid "Receiving e-invoices"
msgstr "接收電子發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:175
msgid ""
"Odoo periodically checks for new invoices received via mojeRačun. New "
"invoices received via mojeRačun appear in the :guilabel:`Incoming E-Invoices"
" Journal` specified in the :ref:`settings "
"<localizations/croatia/configuration/company>`."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 會定期檢查透過 mojeRačun 接收的新發票。透過 mojeRačun 接收的新發票會顯示"
"在 :guilabel:`接收電子發票日記賬`（於 :ref:`設定 <localizations/croatia/"
"configuration/company>` 中指定）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:180
msgid "Rejecting an invoice"
msgstr "拒絕發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/croatia.rst:182
msgid ""
"To reject an incoming invoice, click the :guilabel:`MER: Reject eRacun` "
"button on the invoice form view. This notifies the eRačun system and the "
"sender that the invoice is rejected."
msgstr ""
"要拒絕收到的發票，請點擊發票表單檢視上的:guilabel:`MER: 拒絕 eRacun`按鈕。此"
"操作會通知 eRačun 系統及寄件人該發票已被拒絕。"

