msgid ""
"To upload information for electronic documents, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, and scroll to "
"the :guilabel:`Ecuadorian Localization` section."
msgstr ""
"如要上載電子文件資料，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 設定`，然後捲"
"動至 :guilabel:`厄瓜多爾本地化` 部分。"

