msgid ""
"The *Ecuadorian Module for Point of Sale* adds two new fields to the contact"
" creation form: :guilabel:`Identification Type` and :guilabel:`Tax ID`."
msgstr ""
"*厄瓜多爾 Point of Sale 模組* 會在聯絡人建立表單中新增兩個欄位：:guilabel:`身"
"份證明類型` 及 :guilabel:`稅務編號`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:874
msgid ""
"As the identification number length differs depending on the identification "
"type, Odoo automatically checks the :guilabel:`Tax ID` field when saving the"
" contact form. To manually ensure the length is correct, know that the "
":guilabel:`RUC` and :guilabel:`Citizenship` types require 13 and 10 digits, "
"respectively."
msgstr ""
"由於識別號碼的長度視乎識別類型而異，Odoo 會在儲存聯絡人表單時自動檢查 "
":guilabel:`稅務編號` 欄位。如要手動確認長度是否正確，請注意 :guilabel:`RUC` "
"和 :guilabel:`公民身份` 類型分別需要 13 位和 10 位數字。"

