msgstr "電子發票：匿名最終消費者"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:884
msgid ""
"When clients do not request an electronic invoice for their purchase, Odoo "
"automatically sets the customer as :guilabel:`Consumidor Final` and "
"generates an electronic invoice anyway."
msgstr ""
"當客戶在購物時沒有要求開立電子發票，Odoo 會自動將客戶設"
"為:guilabel:`Consumidor Final`，並如常產生電子發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:888
msgid ""
"If the client requests a credit note due to a return of this type of "
"purchase, the credit note should be made using the client's real contact "
"information. Credit notes cannot be created for *Consumidor Final* and can "
"be managed :ref:`directly from the POS register <pos/use/refund>`."
msgstr ""
"如果客戶因退回此類購買項目而要求開立貸記單，則必須使用客戶的真實聯絡資料開立"
"貸記單。系統無法為 *Consumidor Final* 建立貸記單，且貸記單可:ref:`直接透過 "
"POS 收銀機 <pos/use/refund>`管理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:895
msgid "Electronic invoice: specific customer"
msgstr "電子發票：特定客戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:897
msgid ""
"If a customer requests an invoice for their purchase, it is possible to "
"select or create a contact with their fiscal information. This ensures the "
"invoice is generated with accurate customer details."
msgstr ""
"如果客戶要求為其購買項目開立發票，你可以選擇或建立包含其稅務資料的聯絡人。這"
"可確保系統使用準確的客戶詳細資料生成發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/ecuador.rst:901
msgid ""
"If the client requests a credit note due to a return of this type of "
"purchase, the credit note and return process can be managed :ref:`directly "
"from the POS register <pos/use/refund>`."
msgstr ""
"如果客戶因退回此類購買項目而要求開立貸項通知單，您可以 :ref:`直接從 POS 收銀"
"機 <pos/use/refund>` 管理貸項通知單及退貨流程。"

