#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:263
msgid "B2B and B2C invoicing"
msgstr "B2B 及 B2C 發票開立"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:265
msgid ""
"France's `electronic invoicing reform "
"<https://www.impots.gouv.fr/professionnel/je-passe-la-facturation-"
"electronique>`_ *(reforme de la facturation électronique)* impacts all VAT-"
"registered French companies, and is being rolled out in two phases:"
msgstr ""
"法國的 `電子發票改革 <https://www.impots.gouv.fr/professionnel/je-passe-la-"
"facturation-electronique>`_ *(reforme de la facturation électronique)* 影響所"
"有已註冊增值稅的法國公司，並正分兩個階段推行："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:270
msgid "From **September 1, 2026**:"
msgstr "自 **2026 年 9 月 1 日**起："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:272
msgid ""
"every company must be able to receive domestic B2B e-invoices via "
"*plateformes agréées* (approved platforms) :ref:`(e-invoicing) "
"<localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-einvoicing>`"
msgstr ""
"每間公司都必須能夠透過 *plateformes agréées*（認可平台）接收本地 B2B 電子發"
"票 :ref:`（電子發票） <localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-einvoicing>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:274
msgid ""
"large enterprises (GE) and mid-sized enterprises (ETI) must send domestic "
"B2B e-invoices :ref:`(e-invoicing) <localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-"
"elec-einvoicing>` and must submit data to the tax authorities about certain "
"operations, such as B2C and cross-border B2B operations :ref:`(e-reporting) "
"<localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-reporting>`"
msgstr ""
"大型企業（GE）及中型企業（ETI）必須傳送本地 B2B 電子發票 :ref:`（電子發票） "
"<localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-einvoicing>`，並必須就特定業務（例"
"如 B2C 及跨境 B2B 業務）向稅務機關提交數據 :ref:`（電子申報） <localizations/"
"france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-reporting>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:279
msgid ""
"From **September 1, 2027**, every company, including small and medium-sized "
"enterprises (PME) and micro-enterprises are subject to the same "
":ref:`e-invoicing <localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-einvoicing>` "
"and :ref:`e-reporting <localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-reporting>`"
" requirements."
msgstr ""
"由 **2027 年 9 月 1 日** 起，所有公司（包括中小企業（PME）及微型企業）均須遵"
"守相同的 :ref:`電子發票 <localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-"
"einvoicing>` 及 :ref:`電子申報 <localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-"
"reporting>` 規定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:284
msgid ""
"Odoo is officially certified as a *plateforme agréée* (approved platform) on"
" the e-invoicing network. It supports the receipt of documents in various "
"formats (Facture-X, UBL, and CII) and the sending of documents exclusively "
"in UBL format."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 已獲官方認證為電子發票網絡上的 *plateforme agréée*（認可平台）。系統支援"
"接收多種格式的文件（Facture-X、UBL 及 CII），並僅支援以 UBL 格式發送文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:289
msgid "VAT-exempt transactions under Articles 261-261E are excluded."
msgstr "不包括根據第 261 至 261E 條獲豁免增值稅的交易。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:296
