":ref:`多張發票 <accounting/invoice/sending-multiple-invoices>` 亦可透過電子發"
"票網絡分批發送。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:430
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`French Invoicing Info` section of the :guilabel:`Other "
