#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:435
msgid ""
"The invoice delivery status is also displayed in the :guilabel:`E-Invoicing "
"Status` column of the :guilabel:`Invoices` list view."
msgstr ""
"發票傳送狀態亦會顯示於:guilabel:`電子發票狀態`欄位（位於:guilabel:`發票`列表"
"檢視）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:437
msgid ""
"If an error occurs during the tax authority's delivery of the invoice, the "
