msgstr "如果在向稅務局傳送發票期間發生錯誤，錯誤詳情會顯示在發票的通訊欄中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:441
msgid ""
"To manually trigger the scheduled action used to check the delivery status "
