msgstr ""
"如要手動觸發用於檢查發票傳送狀態的已排程動作，請前往「會計」儀表板，並在相應"
"的銷售日記賬上按一下 :guilabel:`擷取電子發票狀態`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:446
msgid ""
"For domestic B2B invoices, the :guilabel:`Reset to Draft` option is not "
"available for invoices that have already been sent via :ref:`e-reporting "
"<localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-reporting>`."
msgstr ""
"對於本地 B2B 發票，:guilabel:`重設為草稿`選項不適用於已透過:ref:`電子申報 "
"<localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-reporting>`傳送的發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:455
msgid ""
"Odoo checks for new documents received via the e-invoicing network multiple "
"times a day, and automatically imports vendor bills into the purchase "
"journal set in the :guilabel:`Incoming Invoices Journal` field during "
":ref:`configuration <localizations/france/e-invoicing-fac-elec-config>`. "
"Corresponding vendor bills are created as drafts and appear in the vendor "
"bills list view."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 每日會多次檢查透過電子發票網絡接收的新文件，並自動將供應商賬單匯入"
"在:guilabel:`進項發票日記賬`欄位中（於:ref:`設定 <localizations/france/e-"
"invoicing-fac-elec-config>`期間）所設的採購日記賬。相應的供應商賬單會建立為草"
"稿，並顯示在供應商賬單列表檢視中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:460
msgid "Open a vendor bill and click one of the following options:"
msgstr "開啟供應商賬單，並點擊以下其中一個選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:462
msgid ":guilabel:`Confirm`: To confirm the vendor bill."
msgstr ":guilabel:`確認`：確認供應商賬單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:463
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Cancel`: To refuse the vendor bill. In the :guilabel:`Send "
"Response` window, fill in the following fields, then click :guilabel:`Send`:"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`取消`：拒絕供應商賬單。在 :guilabel:`傳送回覆` 視窗中填寫以下欄位"
"，然後點擊 :guilabel:`傳送`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:466
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reason Code`: Select the reason why you are refusing the vendor "
"bill."
msgstr ":guilabel:`原因代碼`：選擇拒收供應商賬單的原因。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:467
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Enter an optional note here`: Add a message to explain your "
"refusal to the vendor, if desired."
msgstr ":guilabel:`在此輸入可選備註`：如有需要，可新增訊息向供應商說明拒絕原因。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:471
msgid ""
"To manually trigger the scheduled action to retrieve incoming vendor bills, "
"go to the Accounting dashboard and click :guilabel:`Fetch E-invoicing "
"Documents` on the purchase journal set in the :guilabel:`Incoming Invoices "
"Journal` field during configuration."
msgstr ""
"要手動觸發預定動作以擷取收到的供應商賬單，請前往會計儀表板，點擊採購日記賬上"
"的 :guilabel:`擷取電子發票文件`（該日記賬已在設定期間於 :guilabel:`進項發票日"
"記賬` 欄位中指定）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:478
msgid "E-reporting"
msgstr "電子申報"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:480
msgid ""
"E-reporting consists of submitting transaction and payment data to tax "
"authorities for :ref:`confirmed <accounting/invoice/confirmation>` invoices "
"within the e-reporting scope, including B2C transactions and cross-border "
"B2B operations. Every ten days, Odoo automatically submits an XML report "
"with this data to the tax authorities."
msgstr ""
"電子申報是指將電子申報範圍內的:ref:`已確認 <accounting/invoice/confirmation>"
"`發票（包括 B2C 交易及跨境 B2B 業務）的交易及付款資料提交予稅務機關。Odoo 每"
"十天會自動向稅務機關提交一份包含這些資料的 XML 報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:485
msgid ""
"To view e-reports and their submission status, in the **Accounting** app, go"
" to :menuselection:`Reporting --> E-reporting`. E-reports have one of the "
"following statuses:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:488
msgid ":guilabel:`Ready`: Ready for submission."
msgstr ":guilabel:`就緒`：已準備好提交。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:489
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Error`: Submission failed, the e-report will be re-submitted in "
"5-7 days."
msgstr ":guilabel:`錯誤`：提交失敗，電子報表將於 5 至 7 天內重新提交。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:490
msgid ":guilabel:`Sent`: Submitted, awaiting confirmation."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已發送`：已提交，正等待確認。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:491
msgid ":guilabel:`Completed`: Successfully processed."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:494
msgid ""
