#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:586
msgid "FEC - Fichier des Écritures Comptables"
msgstr "FEC - Fichier des Écritures Comptables"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:588
msgid ""
"An FEC :dfn:`Fichier des Écritures Comptables` audit file contains all the "
"accounting data and entries recorded in all the accounting journals for a "
"financial year. The entries in the file must be arranged in chronological "
"order. Since January 2014, every French company is required to produce and "
"transmit this file upon request by the tax authorities for audit purposes."
msgstr ""
"FEC :dfn:`Fichier des Écritures Comptables` 審計檔案包含一個財政年度內，所有"
"會計日記賬所記錄的全部會計數據及分錄。檔案中的分錄必須按時間順序排列。自 "
"2014 年 1 月起，每間法國公司均須在稅務機關要求進行審計時，製作並提交此檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:596
msgid "FEC Import"
msgstr "FEC 匯入"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:598
msgid ""
":doc:`Install </applications/general/apps_modules>` the :guilabel:`France - "
"FEC Import` (`l10n_fr_fec_import`) module to import FEC files from other "
"software."
msgstr ""
":doc:`安裝 </applications/general/apps_modules>` :guilabel:`法國 - FEC 匯"
"入`（`l10n_fr_fec_import`）模組，以從其他軟件匯入 FEC 檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:601
msgid ""
"To enable this feature, in the **Accounting** app, go to "
":menuselection:`Configuration --> Settings`. In the :guilabel:`Accounting "
"Import` section, click :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`Import` and "
":guilabel:`Import FEC`. Then, in the :guilabel:`FEC Import` window, upload "
"the FEC file and click :guilabel:`Import`."
msgstr ""
"要啟用此功能，請在 **會計** 應用程式中，前往 :menuselection:`配置 --> 設定`。"
"在 :guilabel:`會計匯入` 部分，點擊 :icon:`oi-arrow-right` :guilabel:`匯入` "
"及 :guilabel:`匯入 FEC`。然後，在 :guilabel:`FEC 匯入` 視窗中上載 FEC 檔案，"
"並點擊 :guilabel:`匯入`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:607
msgid ""
"Importing FEC files from different years requires no particular actions or "
"computations. However, if multiple files contain RAN :dfn:`Reports à "
"Nouveaux` with the starting balance for the year, these entries are "
"automatically marked as unnecessary in Odoo and may need to be deleted."
msgstr ""
"匯入不同年份的 FEC 檔案無須進行任何特別操作或計算。不過，如果多個檔案包含帶有"
"該年度期初餘額的 RAN :dfn:`結轉餘額（Reports à Nouveaux）`，這些記項在 Odoo "
"中會自動標記為不必要，並可能需要刪除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:614
msgid "File formats"
msgstr "檔案格式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:617
msgid "FEC files must be in TXT format, as XML format is not supported."
msgstr "FEC 檔案必須為 TXT 格式，系統不支援 XML 格式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:618
msgid ""
"The FEC TXT file is a plain text file structured as a data table. The first "
"line serves as the header, defining the list of fields for each entry, and "
"each following line represents a single accounting entry without any "
"specific order."
msgstr ""
"FEC TXT 檔案是一個以數據表結構組成的純文字檔案。第一行作為標題，定義每項分錄"
"的欄位列表，隨後每一行代表一項獨立的會計分錄，且無特定排列順序。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:622
msgid "FEC files must comply with the following technical specifications:"
msgstr "FEC 檔案必須符合以下技術規格："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:624
msgid "**Encoding**: UTF-8, UTF-8-SIG and iso8859_15."
msgstr "**編碼**：UTF-8、UTF-8-SIG 及 iso8859_15。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:625
msgid "**Separator**: any of these: `;` or `|` or `,` or `TAB`."
msgstr "**分隔符**：以下任何一項：`;`、`|`、`,` 或 `TAB`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:626
msgid ""
"**Line terminators**: both CR+LF (`\\\\r\\\\n`) and LF (`\\\\n`) character "
"groups are supported."
msgstr "**換行符號**：同時支援 CR+LF（`\\\\r\\\\n`）及 LF（`\\\\n`）字元組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:627
msgid "**Date format**: `%Y%m%d`"
msgstr "**日期格式**：`%Y%m%d`"

