msgid "**Result**"
msgstr "**結果**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:763
msgid "Match **found**"
msgstr "**找到**相符項目"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:766
msgid ""
"The account type is then flagged as :guilabel:`payable` and "
":guilabel:`reconcilable` based on the account template."
msgstr ""
"系統隨後會根據會計科目範本，將該科目類型標記為 :guilabel:`應付` 及 "
":guilabel:`可核銷`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:774
msgid ""
"Journals are checked against the existing ones in Odoo to avoid duplicates, "
"even when importing multiple FEC files."
msgstr ""
"系統會將日記賬與 Odoo 中的現有日記賬進行核對，即使匯入多個 FEC 檔案，亦能避免"
"重複。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:777
msgid ""
"If a journal with the same code already exists, the existing journal is used"
" instead of creating a new one."
msgstr "如已有相同代碼的日記賬，系統將直接使用現有日記賬，而不會建立新的日記賬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:780
msgid ""
"New journals have the prefix :guilabel:`FEC-` added to their name. For "
"example, :guilabel:`ACHATS` becomes :guilabel:`FEC-ACHATS`."
msgstr ""
"新日記賬的名稱會加上前綴 :guilabel:`FEC-`。例如，:guilabel:`ACHATS` 會變為 "
":guilabel:`FEC-ACHATS`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:784
msgid ""
"Journals are *not* archived, allowing the user to manage them as desired."
msgstr "日記賬 *不會* 封存，讓用戶可按需要自行管理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:789
msgid "Journal type determination"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:791
msgid ""
"The journal type is not specified in the format (similar to the accounts) "
"and is initially created with the default type :guilabel:`general`."
msgstr ""
"該格式未有指定日記賬類型（與科目類似），最初會以預設類型 :guilabel:`一般` 建"
"立。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:794
msgid ""
"At the end of the import process, the journal type is determined based on "
"the following rules regarding related moves and accounts:"
msgstr ""
"在匯入程序結束時，系統會根據以下有關相關會計分錄及會計科目的規則來決定日記賬"
"類型："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:0
msgid ""
":guilabel:`bank`: Moves in these journals always include a line (debit or "
"credit) impacting a liquidity account."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`銀行`：這些日記賬中的分錄必定包含一項影響流動資金賬戶的明細行（借"
"方或貸方）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:0
msgid ""
":guilabel:`cash` / :guilabel:`bank` can be interchanged, so :guilabel:`bank`"
" is assigned when this condition is met."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:0
msgid ""
":guilabel:`sale`: Moves in these journals mostly have debit lines on "
"receivable accounts and credit lines on tax income accounts."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`銷售`：這些日記賬中的分錄大多包含應收賬款科目的借方項目，以及稅務"
"收入科目的貸方項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:0
msgid "Sale refund journal items are debit/credit inverted."
msgstr "銷售退款日記賬項目的借方/貸方會對調。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:0
msgid ""
":guilabel:`purchase`: Moves in these journals mostly have credit lines on "
"payable accounts and debit lines on expense accounts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:0
msgid "Purchase refund journal items are debit/credit inverted."
msgstr "採購退款日記賬項目的借方與貸方會對調。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`general`: Used for everything else."
msgstr ":guilabel:`一般`：用於所有其他項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:810
msgid "A minimum of three moves is required to identify the journal type."
msgstr "最少需要三個記項，方可識別日記賬類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:811
msgid ""
"A threshold of 70% of the moves must meet the criteria for a journal type to"
" be determined."
msgstr "必須達到 70% 分錄符合條件的門檻，才可確定日記賬類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:814
msgid ""
"Suppose we are analyzing the moves that share a certain "
":guilabel:`journal_id`."
msgstr "假設我們正在分析共用同一個 :guilabel:`journal_id` 的分錄。"

