#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:836
msgid ""
"Each contact keeps its :guilabel:`Reference` from the :guilabel:`CompAuxNum`"
" field."
msgstr "每位聯絡人會保留其 :guilabel:`參考` （來自 :guilabel:`CompAuxNum` 欄位）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:839
msgid ""
"These fields are searchable based on previous FEC imports for fiscal/audit "
