#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1147
msgid ""
"All methods to cancel or modify key data in POS orders, invoices, and "
"journal entries are deactivated for companies located in France or any DOM-"
"TOM."
msgstr ""
"對於位於法國或任何法國海外省及領地（DOM-TOM）的公司，所有用於取消或修改 POS "
"訂單、發票及日記賬分錄關鍵資料的方法均會停用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1151
msgid ""
"In a multi-company environment, only the documents of such companies are "
"impacted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1156
msgid "Security"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1158
msgid ""
"To ensure inalterability, every order or journal entry is encrypted upon "
"validation. This number (or hash) is calculated from the document's key data"
" and the hash of the precedent documents. The module introduces an interface"
" to test the data's inalterability. The test will fail if any information is"
" modified on a document after its validation. The algorithm recomputes all "
"the hashes and compares them against the initial ones. In case of failure, "
"the system points out the first corrupted document recorded in the system."
msgstr ""
"為確保資料不可更改，每張訂單或日記賬分錄在驗證時都會進行加密。此編號（或雜湊"
"值）是根據文件的關鍵資料及前序文件的雜湊值計算得出。該模組提供了一個介面，用"
"於測試資料的不可更改性。如果文件在驗證後有任何資料被修改，測試將會失敗。演算"
"法會重新計算所有雜湊值，並與初始雜湊值進行比較。若測試失敗，系統會指出系統中"
"記錄的第一份受損文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1165
msgid ""
"Only users with :doc:`administrator "
"</applications/general/users/access_rights>` access rights can initiate the "
"inalterability check:"
msgstr ""
"只有具備 :doc:`管理員 </applications/general/users/access_rights>` 存取權限的"
"用戶才可啟動不可篡改檢查："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1168
msgid ""
"For POS orders, go to :menuselection:`Point of Sales --> Reporting --> POS "
"Inalterability Check`;"
msgstr ""
"如要查看 POS 訂單，請前往 :menuselection:`POS 銷售點 --> 報告 --> POS 不可篡"
"改檢查`；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1169
msgid ""
"For journal entries, in the **Accounting** or **Invoicing** app, go to "
":menuselection:`Configuration --> Settings`. In the :guilabel:`Reporting` "
"section, click :guilabel:`Download the Data Inalterability Check Report`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1176
msgid "Storage"
msgstr "儲存"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1178
msgid ""
"The system also processes automatic sales closings daily, monthly, and "
"annually. Such closings compute the sales total for the period and the "
"cumulative grand totals from the very first sales entry recorded in the "
"system."
msgstr ""
"系統亦會每日、每月及每年自動處理銷售結算。此結算會計算該期間的銷售總額，以及"
"自系統記錄首筆銷售項目以來的累計總額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1182
msgid ""
"To access closings, either go to :menuselection:`Point of Sales --> "
"Reporting --> Sales Closings` or in the **Accounting** or **Invoicing** app,"
" go to :menuselection:`Reporting --> Sales Closings`."
msgstr ""
"要存取結算記錄，請前往 :menuselection:`POS 銷售點 --> 報告 --> 銷售結算`，或"
"在 **會計** 或 **開立發票** 應用程式中前往 :menuselection:`報告 --> 銷售結"
"算`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1186
msgid ""
"Closings compute the totals for journal entries of sales journals (Journal "
"Type = Sales)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1187
msgid ""
"For multi-companies environments, such closings are performed by company."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1188
msgid ""
"POS orders are posted as journal entries at the closing of the POS register."
" Closing the POS register can be done at any time. To prompt users to do it "
"daily, the module prevents them from resuming a session that was opened more"
" than 24 hours ago. Such a session must be closed before selling again."
msgstr ""
"POS 訂單會在關閉 POS 收銀機時過賬為日記賬分錄。POS 收銀機可隨時關閉。為提示用"
"戶每日關閉收銀機，此模組會阻止用戶恢復開啟超過 24 小時的營業時段。必須先關閉"
"該營業時段，才能再次進行銷售。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1192
msgid ""
"A period’s total is computed from all the journal entries posted after the "
"previous closing of the same type, regardless of their posting date. "
"Recording a new sales transaction for a period already closed will be "
"counted in the very next closing."
msgstr ""
"每個期間的總額會根據上次同類型結算後所有已過賬的日記賬分錄計算，而不論其過賬"
"日期為何。如為已結算的期間記錄新的銷售交易，該交易將計入下一次結算中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1197
msgid ""
"For test & audit purposes, closings can be manually generated in "
":ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`. To do so, go to "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> Scheduled Actions`. In the "
"scheduled actions list view, open the desired :guilabel:`Sale Closing` "
"action and click :guilabel:`Run manually`."
msgstr ""
"基於測試及審計用途，您可在:ref:`開發人員模式 <developer-mode>`下手動產生結算"
"。如要執行此操作，請前往:menuselection:`設定 --> 技術 --> 已安排的動作`。在已"
"安排的動作清單檢視中，開啟所需的:guilabel:`銷售結算`動作，然後點"
"擊:guilabel:`手動執行`。"

