"Users are responsible for their Odoo system and must operate it carefully. "
"Modifying source code responsible for ensuring data integrity is not "
"allowed."
msgstr ""
"用戶須對其 Odoo 系統負責，並必須小心操作。不得修改負責確保數據完整性的原始碼"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/france.rst:1213
