#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:202
msgid ""
"The DATEV ATCH ZIP file includes the files (reports) linked to an Odoo "
"invoice or bill. For customer invoices, the file must have been generated by"
" using the :guilabel:`Send` button. For vendor bills, the file must have "
"been received via an email alias or uploaded by using the :guilabel:`Upload`"
" button."
msgstr ""
"DATEV ATCH ZIP 檔案包含連結至 Odoo 客戶發票或供應商賬單的檔案（報告）。對於客"
"戶發票，該檔案必須是透過 :guilabel:`傳送` 按鈕產生的。對於供應商賬單，該檔案"
"必須是透過電郵別名接收，或使用 :guilabel:`上載` 按鈕上載的。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:209
msgid "The ZIP file contains two types of files:"
msgstr "ZIP 檔案包含兩種類型的檔案："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:211
msgid ""
"the individual invoice/bill files (PDF, JPEG, etc.) for the selected period "
"on the general ledger, and"
msgstr "總賬中選定期間的個別發票／賬單檔案（PDF、JPEG 等），以及"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:213
msgid ""
"a :file:`document.xml` file used to generate a unique ID (GUID) for each "
"file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:215
msgid ""
"These unique IDs are essential as they allow DATEV to automatically link the"
" files to the individual journal items, which will be imported with the "
"DATEV DATA file in the next step."
msgstr ""
"這些唯一識別碼至關重要，因為它們讓 DATEV 能自動將檔案連結至個別日記賬項目；這"
"些項目將在下一步隨 DATEV DATA 檔案一同匯入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:221
msgid "GoBD compliance"
msgstr "GoBD 合規性"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:223
msgid ""
"**GoBD** stands for *Grundsätze zur ordnungsmäßigen Führung und Aufbewahrung"
" von Büchern, Aufzeichnungen und Unterlagen in elektronischer Form sowie zum"
" Datenzugriff*. In short, it is a guideline for the proper management and "
"storage of books, records, and documents in electronic form, as well as for "
"data access, that is relevant for the German tax authority, tax declaration,"
" and balance sheet."
msgstr ""
"**GoBD** 是 *Grundsätze zur ordnungsmäßigen Führung und Aufbewahrung von "
"Büchern, Aufzeichnungen und Unterlagen in elektronischer Form sowie zum "
"Datenzugriff* 的縮寫。簡而言之，這是一套關於妥善管理及儲存電子形式賬簿、記錄"
"和文件以及資料存取的指引，與德國稅務機關、報稅及資產負債表息息相關。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:229
msgid ""
"These principles have been written and published by the Federal Ministry of "
"Finance (BMF) in November 2014. Since January 2015, **they have become the "
"norm** and have replaced previously accepted practices linked to computer-"
"based accounting. Several changes have been made by the BMF in 2019 and "
"January 2020 to specify some of the content due to the development of "
"digital solutions (cloud hosting, paperless companies, etc.)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:236
msgid "Odoo is certified **GoBD-compliant**."
msgstr "Odoo 已獲認證 **符合 GoBD 規範**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:241
msgid "Understanding GoBD in relation to accounting software"
msgstr "了解 GoBD 與會計軟件的關係"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:243
msgid ""
"The **GoBD is binding for companies that have to present accounts**, which "
"includes SMEs, freelancers, and entrepreneurs, to the financial authorities."
" As such, **the taxpayer himself is the sole responsible** for the complete "
"and exhaustive keeping of fiscal-relevant data (above-mentioned financial "
"and related data)."
msgstr ""
"**GoBD 對須向稅務機關提交賬目的公司具有約束力**，其中包括中小企業、自由職業者"
"及企業家。因此，**納稅人本人須對完整及詳盡保存稅務相關資料（上述財務及相關資"
"料）負上全責**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:248
msgid ""
"Apart from software requirements, the user is required to ensure internal "
"control systems (*in accordance with sec. 146 of the Fiscal Code*):"
msgstr "除軟件要求外，用戶還必須確保具備內部控制系統（*根據《稅法典》第 146 條*）："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:251
msgid "access rights control;"
msgstr "存取權限控制；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:252
msgid "segregation of duties, functional separating;"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:253
msgid "entry controls (error notifications, plausibility checks);"
msgstr "輸入控制（錯誤通知、合理性檢查）；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:254
msgid "reconciliation checks at data entry;"
msgstr "在資料輸入時進行對賬檢查；"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:255
msgid "processing controls; and"
msgstr "處理控制；以及"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:256
msgid ""
"measures to prevent intentional or unintentional manipulation of software, "
"data, or documents."
msgstr "防止蓄意或無意篡改軟件、數據或文件的措施。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:258
msgid ""
"The user must distribute tasks within their organization to the relevant "
"positions (*control*) and verify that the tasks are properly and completely "
"performed (*supervision*). The result of these controls must be recorded "
"(*documentation*), and should errors be found during these controls, "
"appropriate measures to correct the situation should be put into place "
"(*prevention*)."
msgstr ""
"使用者必須將組織內的任務分配予相關職位（*控制*），並核實任務是否妥善及完整執"
"行（*監督*）。這些控制的結果必須予以記錄（*存檔記錄*）；如在控制過程中發現錯"
"誤，應採取適當措施予以糾正（*預防*）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:266
msgid "Data security"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:268
msgid ""
"The taxpayer must **secure the system against any data loss** due to "
"deletion, removal, or theft of any data. If the entries are not sufficiently"
" secured, the bookkeeping will be regarded as not in accordance with the "
"GoBD guidelines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:272
msgid ""
"Once bookings have been finally posted, they can no longer be changed or "
"deleted via the application."
msgstr "記帳分錄一旦最終過帳，便無法再透過應用程式更改或刪除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:275
msgid ""
"If Odoo is used in the cloud, regular backups are part of the Odoo Online "
"service. In addition, regular backups can be downloaded and backed up on "
"external systems."
msgstr ""
"如果使用雲端版 Odoo，定期備份已包含在 Odoo Online 服務中。此外，您亦可下載定"
"期備份，並備份至外部系統。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:279
msgid ""
"`Odoo Cloud Hosting - Service Level Agreement <https://www.odoo.com/cloud-"
"sla>`_"
msgstr "`Odoo 雲端託管 - 服務水平協議 <https://www.odoo.com/cloud-sla>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:281
msgid ""
"If the server is operated locally, the user is responsible for creating the "
"necessary backup infrastructure."
msgstr "如果伺服器在本地運行，用戶須負責建立所需的備份基礎架構。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:285
msgid ""
"In some cases, data has to be kept for ten years or more, so always have "
"backups saved. It is even more important if you decide to change software "
"provider."
msgstr ""
"在某些情況下，資料必須保存十年或以上，因此請務必儲存備份。如果您決定更換軟件"
"供應商，備份就更為重要。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:291
msgid "Responsibility of the software editor"
msgstr "軟件開發商的責任"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:293
msgid ""
"Considering GoBD applies only to the taxpayer, **the software editor can by "
"no means be held responsible for the accurate and compliant documentation of"
" their users' financial transactional data**. It can merely provide the "
"necessary tools for the user to respect the software-related guidelines "
"described in the GoBD."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:301
msgid "Ensuring compliance through Odoo"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:303
msgid ""
"The keywords, when it comes to GoBD are: **traceable, verifiable, true, "
"clear, and continuous**. In short, you need to have audit-proof archiving in"
" place, and Odoo provides you with the means to achieve all of these "
"objectives:"
msgstr ""
"談到 GoBD，核心關鍵字為：**可追溯、可驗證、真實、清晰及連續**。簡而言之，您需"
"要備有符合審計要求的存檔機制，而 Odoo 正可為您提供實現所有這些目標的方法："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:0
msgid "**Traceability and verifiability**"
msgstr "**可追溯性及可驗證性**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:0
msgid ""
"Each record in Odoo is stamped with the creator of the document, the "
"creation date, the modification date, and who modified it. In addition, "
"relevant fields are tracked. Thus, it can be seen which value was changed by"
" whom in the chatter of the relevant object."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 中的每項記錄都會標記文件建立者、建立日期、修改日期及修改者。此外，系統亦"
"會追蹤相關欄位。因此，你可以在相關物件的溝通欄中，查看某個數值由誰更改。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:0
msgid "**Completeness**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:0
msgid ""
"All financial data must be recorded in the system, and there can be no gaps."
" Odoo ensures that there is no gap in the numbering of the financial "
"transactions. It is the responsibility of the user to encode all financial "
"data in the system. As most financial data in Odoo is generated "
"automatically, it remains the responsibility of the user to encode all "
"vendor bills and miscellaneous operations completely."
msgstr ""
"所有財務數據均必須記錄在系統中，不能有任何缺漏。Odoo 會確保財務交易的編號不會"
"出現間斷。用戶有責任將所有財務數據輸入系統。由於 Odoo 中的大部分財務數據均會"
"自動生成，用戶仍有責任完整輸入所有供應商賬單及雜項操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:0
msgid "**Accuracy**"
msgstr "**準確性**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:0
msgid ""
"Odoo ensures that, with the correct configuration, the correct accounts are "
"used. In addition, the control mechanisms between purchase orders and sales "
"orders and their respective invoices reflect the reality of the business. It"
" is the responsibility of the user to scan and attach the paper-based vendor"
" bill to the respective record in Odoo. *Odoo Documents helps you automate "
"this task*."
msgstr ""
"只要設定正確，Odoo 便可確保使用正確的會計科目。此外，採購單、銷售訂單及其相應"
"發票之間的控制機制亦能反映業務實況。使用者有責任將紙本供應商賬單掃描並附加至 "
"Odoo 內的相關記錄。*Odoo 文件應用程式可協助你自動完成此工作*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:0
msgid "**Timely booking and record-keeping**"
msgstr "**及時入賬及保存記錄**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:0
msgid ""
"As most financial data in Odoo is generated by the transactional objects "
"(for example, the invoice is booked at confirmation), Odoo ensures out-of-"
"the-box timely record-keeping. It is the responsibility of the user to "
"encode all incoming vendor bills in a timely manner, as well as the "
"miscellaneous operations."
msgstr ""
"由於 Odoo 中的大部分財務數據均由交易物件生成（例如，發票會在確認時記賬），因"
"此 Odoo 本身即可確保及時的記錄保存。用戶有責任及時輸入所有收到的供應商賬單以"
"及雜項操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:0
msgid "**Order**"
msgstr "**訂單**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:0
msgid ""
"Financial data stored in Odoo is, per definition, ordered and can be "
"reordered according to most fields present in the model. A specific ordering"
" is not enforced by the GoBD, but the system must ensure that a given "
"financial transaction can be quickly found by a third-party expert. Odoo "
"ensures this out-of-the-box."
msgstr ""
"儲存在 Odoo 的財務數據按定義均經過排序，並可根據模型中的大部分欄位重新排序。"
"GoBD 並無強制規定特定的排序方式，但系統必須確保第三方專家能快速找出指定的財務"
"交易。Odoo 原生已確保符合此要求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:0
msgid "**Inalterability**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:0
msgid ""
"With the German Odoo localization, Odoo is in standard configured in such a "
"way that the inalterability clause can be adhered to without any further "
"customization."
msgstr ""
"透過德國 Odoo 本地化功能，Odoo 在標準配置下已能符合不可篡改條款的要求，無需進"
"行任何額外自訂。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:340
msgid "GoBD export"
msgstr "GoBD 匯出"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:342
msgid ""
"In the case of fiscal control, the fiscal authority can request three levels"
" of access to the accounting system (Z1, Z2, Z3). These levels vary from "
"direct access to the interface to the handover of the financial data on a "
"storage device."
msgstr ""
"在進行稅務審查時，稅務機關可要求三個級別的會計系統存取權限（Z1、Z2、Z3）。這"
"些級別涵蓋從直接存取介面到透過儲存裝置交付財務數據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:346
msgid ""
"In the case of a handover of financial data to a storage device, the GoBD "
"does **not** enforce the format. It can be, for example, in XLS, CSV, XML, "
"Lotus 123, SAP-format, AS/400-format, or else. Odoo supports the CSV and XLS"
" export of financial data out of the box. The GoBD **recommends** the export"
" in a specific XML-based GoBD format (see \"Ergänzende Informationen zur "
"Datenträgerüberlassung\" §3), but it is not binding."
msgstr ""
"如將財務數據移交至儲存裝置，GoBD **並無** 強制規定格式。例如，檔案可採用 XLS"
"、CSV、XML、Lotus 123、SAP 格式、AS/400 格式或其他格式。Odoo 預設支援匯出 "
"CSV 及 XLS 格式的財務數據。GoBD **建議** 以特定的 XML 基礎 GoBD 格式匯出（參"
"閱「Ergänzende Informationen zur Datenträgerüberlassung」§3），但這並不具約束"
"力。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:355
msgid "Non-compliance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:357
msgid ""
"In the event of an infringement, you can expect a fine and a court order "
"demanding the implementation of specific measures."
msgstr "如發生違規情況，可能會被處以罰款，並收到要求實施特定措施的法院命令。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:368
msgid "Technical security system"
msgstr "技術安全系統"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:370
msgid ""
"The **Kassensicherungsverordnung** (The Act on Protection against "
"Manipulation of Digital Records) requires that electronic record-keeping "
"systems - including the :doc:`point of sale "
"</applications/sales/point_of_sale>` systems - must be equipped with a "
"**technical security system** (also called **TSS** or **TSE**)."
msgstr ""
"**Kassensicherungsverordnung**（《防止篡改數碼紀錄保護法》）規定，電子紀錄保"
"存系統（包括 :doc:`銷售點 </applications/sales/point_of_sale>` 系統）必須配"
"備 **技術安全系統**（亦稱為 **TSS** 或 **TSE**）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:375
msgid ""
"Odoo offers a service that is compliant with the help of `fiskaly "
"<https://fiskaly.com>`_, a cloud-based solution."
msgstr "Odoo 透過雲端解決方案 `fiskaly <https://fiskaly.com>`_ 提供合規服務。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:379
msgid ""
"The Odoo Point of Sale offline functionality allows POS orders placed "
"offline to remain compliant. However, a working internet connection is "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 銷售點（POS）的離線功能可讓離線建立的 POS 訂單保持合規。不過，仍建議保持"
"正常的互聯網連線。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:383
msgid ""
"The only VAT rates allowed are given by fiskaly. You can check these rates "
"by consulting `fiskaly DSFinV-K API: VAT Definition "
"<https://developer.fiskaly.com/api/dsfinvk/v0/#tag/VAT-Definition>`_."
msgstr ""
"系統只允許使用 fiskaly 提供的增值稅稅率。您可參閱 `fiskaly DSFinV-K API：增值"
"稅定義 <https://developer.fiskaly.com/api/dsfinvk/v0/#tag/VAT-Definition>`_ "
"查看這些稅率。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:392
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the **Germany - Certification for Point of "
"Sale** (`l10n_de_pos_cert`) and **Germany - Certification for Point of Sale "
"of type restaurant** (`l10n_de_pos_res_cert`) modules."
msgstr ""
":ref:`安裝 <general/install>` **德國 - 銷售點認證**（`l10n_de_pos_cert`）及 "
"**德國 - 餐廳類型銷售點認證**（`l10n_de_pos_res_cert`）模組。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:397
msgid ""
"If these modules are not listed, :ref:`update the app list "
"<general/install>`."
msgstr ""

