"如果看不到 :guilabel:`Fiskaly 註冊` 按鈕，請確保你已 *儲存* 公司資料，且不再"
"處於 *編輯模式*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:422
msgid "Once the registration has been finalized, new fields appear:"
msgstr "完成登記後，畫面上會出現新欄位："

