msgstr "如果現有憑證出現任何問題，可按一下 :guilabel:`新密鑰` 按鈕以申請新憑證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:438
msgid "Create a technical security system and link it to a POS"
msgstr "建立技術安全系統並將其連結至 POS"

