"要在德國使用銷售點系統，請先建立 :abbr:`TSS（技術安全系統）`。請前往 "
":menuselection:`銷售點 --> 設定 --> 銷售點`，選擇要編輯的 :guilabel:`銷售"
"點`，然後勾選 :guilabel:`建立 TSS` 方塊（位於 :guilabel:`Fiskaly API` 部分下"
"）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:445
msgid "Once the creation of the TSS is successful, you can find the:"
msgstr "成功建立 TSS 後，你可以找到："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:447
msgid ""
":guilabel:`TSS ID`, which refers to the ID of your TSS on fiskaly's side, "
"and"
msgstr ":guilabel:`TSS ID`，即你在 fiskaly 一方的 TSS 識別碼，以及"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:448
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fiskaly Client ID`, which refers to your POS on fiskaly's side."
msgstr ":guilabel:`Fiskaly 客戶端 ID`，指你在 fiskaly 系統中的 POS。"

