#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:461
msgid ""
"In case of an audit, you can export the data sent to DSFinV-K by going to "
":menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Orders --> DSFinV-K Exports --> New`."
msgstr ""
"如遇審計，您可前往 :menuselection:`銷售點 --> 訂單 --> DSFinV-K 匯出 --> 新"
"增`，匯出傳送至 DSFinV-K 的數據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:464
msgid "Menu to export DSFinV-K"
msgstr "匯出 DSFinV-K 的選單"

