msgid ""
":guilabel:`Start Datetime`: export data with dates larger than or equal to "
"the given start date"
msgstr ":guilabel:`開始日期時間`：匯出日期大於或等於指定開始日期的數據"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:470
msgid ""
":guilabel:`End Datetime`: export data with dates smaller than or equal to "
"the given end date"
msgstr ":guilabel:`結束日期時間`：匯出日期早於或等於指定結束日期的資料"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/germany.rst:472
msgid ""
"Leave the :guilabel:`Point of Sale` field blank to export the data of all "
"your points of sale; specify one if you want to export data for this "
"specific POS only."
msgstr ""
"將 :guilabel:`銷售點` 欄位留空，即可匯出所有銷售點的資料；如只想匯出特定 POS "
