msgstr ""
"要申報 GST 報稅表，請確保已啟用 :ref:`GST 電子報稅及配對功能 <india/indian-"
"configuration>`。然後，前往會計儀表板，點擊 :guilabel:`報稅表`（位於 "
":guilabel:`報稅表` 日記賬上）。在 :guilabel:`會計期間` 視窗中，填寫以下欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:508
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Opening Date`: Starting date from which tax return periods are "
"created."
msgstr ":guilabel:`開始日期`：建立報稅期間的起始日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:509
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fiscal Year End`: End date of the fiscal year (e.g., "
":guilabel:`31 March`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`財政年度結束日期`：財政年度的結束日期（例如：:guilabel:`3 月 31 "
"日`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:510
msgid ""
":guilabel:`GSTIN Periodicity`: Frequency of return filing (e.g., "
":guilabel:`Monthly`)."
msgstr ":guilabel:`GSTIN 週期`：提交報稅表的頻率（例如：:guilabel:`每月`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:513
msgid ""
"Alternatively, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Tax "
"Report`, click :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Report:` and select "
":guilabel:`GSTR-1 (IN)`. Then, click :guilabel:`Returns` to file the return."
msgstr ""
"或者，前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 報告 --> 稅務報告`，點擊 :icon:`fa-book` "
":guilabel:`報告：` 並選擇 :guilabel:`GSTR-1 (IN)`。然後，點擊 :guilabel:`報稅"
"表` 以提交報稅表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:518
msgid ""
"To reconcile vendor bills with GST portal data, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Tax Report`, click :icon:`fa-"
"book` :guilabel:`Report:` and select :guilabel:`GSTR-2B`, and click "
":guilabel:`Reconcile`."
msgstr ""
"如要將供應商賬單與 GST 門戶網站數據對賬，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 報"
"告 --> 稅務報告`，點擊 :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`報告：` 並選擇 "
":guilabel:`GSTR-2B`，然後點擊 :guilabel:`對賬`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:525
msgid "Filing GSTR-1 tax return"
msgstr "申報 GSTR-1 報稅表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:527
msgid "To file a GSTR-1 tax return, follow these steps:"
msgstr "若要申報 GSTR-1 報稅表，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:529
msgid ""
"Click the suitable :guilabel:`GSTR-1` report for the desired period to open "
"the filing view."
msgstr "點擊所需期間對應的 :guilabel:`GSTR-1` 報表，以開啟申報檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:531
msgid "GSTR-1 filing view"
msgstr "GSTR-1 申報檢視"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:535
msgid ""
"It is recommended to file the return **five days before the filing date** to"
" avoid any penalties."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:538
msgid ""
"Odoo automatically performs validation checks before submission to ensure "
"compliance with GST portal requirements that must be addressed before "
"filing."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 會在提交前自動執行驗證檢查，以確保符合 GST 入口網站的要求，並須在申報前"
"處理相關問題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:542
msgid "The following types of validation issues can be raised:"
msgstr "可能會出現以下類型的驗證問題："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:544
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Apply Appropriate Tax`: :guilabel:`IGST` is not applicable for "
"intra-state transactions."
msgstr ":guilabel:`套用適當稅項`：:guilabel:`IGST` 不適用於邦內交易。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:546
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Wrong CGST/SGST on Inter-State Transactions`: "
":guilabel:`CGST/SGST` cannot be applied on inter-state transactions."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`跨州交易的 CGST/SGST 錯誤`：:guilabel:`CGST/SGST` 不可用於跨州交易"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:548
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Fiscal Year Reversed Move`: Credit Notes for invoices issued in a"
" given financial year should not be included in GSTR-1 after **November "
"30th**; remove tax from these lines."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`財政年度沖銷分錄`：在特定財政年度開具的發票，其貸項通知單不應在 "
"**11 月 30 日** 之後計入 GSTR-1；請從這些明細行中移除稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:550
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invalid HSN Codes`: - For products (non-services), HSN codes must"
" not begin with `99`. - For services, HSN codes must begin with `99`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`無效的 HSN 代碼`：- 對於產品（非服務），HSN 代碼不得以 `99` 開頭"
"。- 對於服務，HSN 代碼必須以 `99` 開頭。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:553
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Missing HSN Codes`: Some product lines do not have HSN codes for "
"journal items."
msgstr ":guilabel:`缺少 HSN 代碼`：部分產品明細行沒有日記賬項目的 HSN 代碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:555
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invalid UQC Codes`: The Unit Quantity Code (UQC) must comply with"
" Indian GST standards."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`無效的 UQC 代碼`：單位數量代碼（UQC）必須符合印度商品及服務稅（GST"
"）標準。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:557
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Missing Document Summary`: Document summary lines are mandatory "
"for GSTR-1. This check is always marked as :guilabel:`Anomaly` initially. "
"After reviewing the summary by clicking the relevant check, it changes to "
":guilabel:`Reviewed`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`缺少文件摘要`：GSTR-1 必須包含文件摘要明細行。此檢查在最初一律會標"
"記為 :guilabel:`異常`。點按相關檢查項目以審核摘要後，狀態會變更為 "
":guilabel:`已審核`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:560
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Missing E-Invoice`: Some invoices are not linked to an e-invoice."
msgstr ":guilabel:`缺少電子發票`：部分發票未連結至電子發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:561
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Unlinked Unregistered Credit Notes`: Credit Notes have been "
"issued without referencing an invoice."
msgstr ":guilabel:`未關聯的未登記貸項通知單`：已開立但未關聯至任何發票的貸項通知單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:564
msgid "Validation checks have four stages:"
msgstr "驗證檢查分為四個階段："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:566
msgid ":guilabel:`To Review`: Check requires review."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:567
msgid ":guilabel:`Reviewed`: Check has been reviewed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已審核`：檢查已完成審核。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:568
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Supervised`: Check is supervised, and a supervisor is assigned."
msgstr ":guilabel:`已監督`：檢查受監督，且已指派監督人員。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:569
msgid ":guilabel:`Anomaly`: Check has failed."
msgstr ":guilabel:`異常`：檢查失敗。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:571
msgid ""
"Click on any individual check to view and resolve the corresponding issue."
msgstr "按一下任何個別檢查項目，以檢視及解決相應的問題。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:574
msgid ""
"A tax return can only be validated when all checks are in the "
":guilabel:`Reviewed` or :guilabel:`Supervised` stage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:577
msgid ""
"After reviewing the checks, click :guilabel:`Validate`. The "
":guilabel:`Review` stage appears in green then."
msgstr ""
"檢視檢查項目後，按一下 :guilabel:`驗證`。隨即 :guilabel:`覆核` 階段會以綠色顯"
"示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:580
msgid "Click :guilabel:`GSTR-1 (IN)` to review the report."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`GSTR-1 (IN)` 以檢視報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:582
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Submit`, and click :guilabel:`Push Data` in the "
":guilabel:`Submission Instructions` window to send the report to the GST "
"portal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:585
msgid ""
"During this step, GST portal credentials must be verified. As the data is "
"being sent, the :guilabel:`Send` stage in the progress bar appears orange. "
"Once the GST portal confirms receipt, the stage turns green. If an error "
"occurs, the :guilabel:`Send` stage changes to red."
msgstr ""
"在此步驟中，系統必須驗證 GST 入口網站的登入憑證。傳送資料期間，進度列中"
"的:guilabel:`傳送`階段會顯示為橙色。當 GST 入口網站確認收到資料後，該階段會變"
"成綠色。如果發生錯誤，:guilabel:`傳送`階段則會變成紅色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:590
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(ellipsis)` icon on the relevant "
":guilabel:`GSTR-1` line to display additional options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:593
msgid ":guilabel:`Generate XLSX`: Download the GSTR-1 report as an XLSX file."
msgstr ":guilabel:`產生 XLSX`：將 GSTR-1 報表下載為 XLSX 檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:594
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reset`: Clear the current state and revert the return to the "
"initial stage."
msgstr ":guilabel:`重設`：清除目前狀態，並將申報表還原至初始階段。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:596
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Check Status` to retrieve the current status from the GST "
"portal. Once the confirmation is received, the :guilabel:`Review` stage in "
"the progress bar turns green. Then, click :guilabel:`Mark as Filed` to "
"finalize and submit the return as filed."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`檢查狀態`，從商品及服務稅（GST）門戶網站擷取目前狀態。收到確"
"認後，進度列中的 :guilabel:`審核` 階段會變為綠色。然後，點擊 :guilabel:`標記"
"為已申報` 以完成並將報稅表提交為已申報。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:601
msgid ""
"Once a return is marked as **Filed**, it cannot be reset or filed again."
msgstr "報稅表一旦標記為 **已申報**，便無法重設或再次申報。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:606
msgid "Receive GSTR-2B tax reconciliation"
msgstr "接收 GSTR-2B 稅務對賬"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:608
msgid ""
"Select the relevant :guilabel:`GSTR-2B` report for the desired period that "
"needs to be reconciled."
msgstr "為需要對賬的指定期間，選取相關的 :guilabel:`GSTR-2B` 報告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:611
msgid ""
"In the validation checks view, click :guilabel:`Fetch E-Invoice` to retrieve"
" vendor e-invoice data for the reconciliation period. The check is initially"
" marked as :guilabel:`Anomaly` and changes to :guilabel:`Reviewed` after "
"fetching. Then, click :guilabel:`Validate` to confirm and mark the "
":guilabel:`Review` stage as green."
msgstr ""
"在驗證檢查檢視中，按一下 :guilabel:`擷取電子發票`，以擷取對賬期間的供應商電子"
"發票資料。該項檢查最初標記為 :guilabel:`異常`，擷取後會變更為 :guilabel:`已審"
"核`。然後，按一下 :guilabel:`驗證` 以確認並將 :guilabel:`審核` 階段標記為綠色"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:617
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Fetch E-Invoice` check only turns green if the e-invoice data"
" is fetched **two days after the end of the last month's reconciliation "
"period**."
msgstr ""
"只有在**上月對帳期結束後兩天**擷取電子發票資料，:guilabel:`擷取電子發票` 檢查"
"才會變成綠色。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:620
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Fetch GSTR-2B` to retrieve all invoices from the GST "
"portal. Once the data is fetched, the :guilabel:`Fetch` stage in the "
"progress bar turns green. To view the raw report data, click "
":guilabel:`GSTR-2B (IN)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:624
msgid ""
"The fetched invoices are automatically matched with the E-invoices. Click "
":guilabel:`View Bills` to see detailed matching results."
msgstr ""
"擷取到的發票會自動與電子發票進行配對。按一下 :guilabel:`檢視賬單` 以查看詳細"
"的配對結果。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:628
msgid "The :guilabel:`Match` stage indicates the reconciliation status:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:630
msgid "Orange: Partially matched (some bills require correction)."
msgstr "橙色：部分相符（部分賬單需要更正）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:631
msgid "Green: Fully matched (all bills reconciled)."
msgstr "綠色：完全配對（所有賬單已對賬）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:633
msgid ""
"In case of mismatches, correct the affected bills, then click the :icon:`fa-"
"ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(ellipsis)` icon to access additional options:"
msgstr ""
"如有不符之處，請更正受影響的帳單，然後點擊 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
":guilabel:`（省略號）` 圖示以存取更多選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:636
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Re-Match`: Re-run the matching process after making corrections."
msgstr ":guilabel:`重新配對`：作出修正後重新執行配對程序。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:637
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reset`: Reset the reconciliation to the :guilabel:`Match` stage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:639
msgid ""
"After all bills are fully matched, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
":guilabel:`(ellipsis)` icon and select :guilabel:`Mark as Complete`. The "
":guilabel:`Complete` stage in the progress bar turns green, finalizing the "
"bill reconciliation."
msgstr ""
"所有帳單完全配對後，點擊 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`（省略號）` 圖示並"
"選擇:guilabel:`標記為完成`。進度列中的:guilabel:`完成`階段會變成綠色，代表完"
"成帳單對帳。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:647
msgid "TDS and TCS"
msgstr "TDS 及 TCS"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:649
msgid ""
":abbr:`TDS (tax deducted at source)` and :abbr:`TCS (tax collected at "
"source)` are tax provisions under Indian income tax law. TCS is collected by"
" the seller on top of the invoice amount, while TDS is deducted by the payer"
" from the amount due. In Odoo, TDS is recorded using the :guilabel:`Pay` "
"button, either as soon as the invoice or bill is confirmed or together with "
"the payment. TDS can also be deducted on advance payments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:659
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Indian Integration` section, enable the :guilabel:`TDS` or"
" :guilabel:`TCS` features as required. Enabling a feature activates the "
"corresponding TDS or TCS taxes."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`印度整合`部分，按需要啟用:guilabel:`TDS`或:guilabel:`TCS`功能。"
"啟用相關功能後，系統會同時啟動對應的 TDS 或 TCS 稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:661
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`TDS` is enabled, enter the company's :abbr:`TAN (Tax Deduction"
" and Collection Account Number)` in the :guilabel:`TAN` field. This field is"
" required to enable TDS."
msgstr ""
"如已啟用 :guilabel:`TDS`，請將公司的 :abbr:`TAN (扣稅及收稅賬戶編號)` 輸入到 "
":guilabel:`TAN` 欄位中。此為啟用 TDS 的必填欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:665
msgid ""
"The TAN is issued by the Income Tax Department and must be quoted on all "
"TDS/TCS returns, challans, and certificates."
msgstr "TAN 由所得稅局簽發，並必須在所有 TDS/TCS 報稅表、繳款單及證明書上註明。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:668
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`TDS` is enabled, scroll down to the :guilabel:`Default "
"Accounts` section and, under :guilabel:`India TDS Control`, set the "
"following fields:"
msgstr ""
"如果已啟用 :guilabel:`TDS`，請向下捲動至 :guilabel:`Default Accounts` 區域，"
"並在 :guilabel:`India TDS Control` 下設定以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:671
msgid ""
":guilabel:`TDS Journal`: Select the miscellaneous journal used to record TDS"
" entries."
msgstr ":guilabel:`TDS 日記賬`：選擇用於記錄 TDS 記項的雜項日記賬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:672
msgid ""
":guilabel:`TDS Control Account`: Select the account used on TDS base lines. "
"By default, the :guilabel:`TDS (Withholding Control)` account is used."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`TDS 控制賬戶`：選擇用於 TDS 基準項目的賬戶。預設會使"
"用:guilabel:`TDS（預扣稅控制）`賬戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:682
msgid ""
"TDS and TCS taxes are pre-configured for the sections of the Income Tax Act."
" To view them, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes`"
" and search for `TDS` or `TCS`. Open a tax to review the following options:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:686
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Withhold` (enabled on TDS taxes): A withholding tax does not "
"affect the amount due of the invoice or bill. Instead, it is deducted using "
"the :guilabel:`Pay` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:688
msgid ""
":guilabel:`TDS Sequence` (in the :guilabel:`Advanced options` tab, only "
"available on TDS purchase taxes): Select a sequence to automatically number "
"the TDS lines when TDS is deducted."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`TDS 序列`（位於 :guilabel:`進階選項` 分頁，僅適用於 TDS 採購稅項）"
"：選擇一個序列，以便在扣除 TDS 時自動為 TDS 資料行編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:691
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Advanced Options` tab, the following options define the "
"base on which TDS and TCS are computed:"
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`進階選項` 分頁中，以下選項定義計算 TDS 及 TCS 的基礎："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:694
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Affect Base of Subsequent Taxes`: Enabled on GST taxes, so that "
"the GST amount is included in the base of the taxes computed after them."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`影響後續稅項基數`：在 GST 稅項上啟用，使 GST 金額計入其後計算的稅"
"項基數中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:696
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Base Affected by Previous Taxes`: Enabled on TCS taxes, so that "
"TCS is computed on the amount including GST. Disabled on TDS taxes, so that "
"TDS is computed on the amount excluding GST."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`稅基受先前稅項影響`：對 TCS 稅項啟用此選項，以便按包含 GST 的金額"
"計算 TCS。對 TDS 稅項停用此選項，以便按不含 GST 的金額計算 TDS。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:700
msgid ""
"A vendor bill line of ₹100 with 18% GST and 10% TDS: the GST amount is ₹18 "
"and the TDS amount is ₹10 (10% of ₹100)."
msgstr ""
"一張 ₹100 的供應商賬單明細，附帶 18% GST 及 10% TDS：GST 金額為 ₹18，TDS 金額"
"為 ₹10（₹100 的 10%）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:702
msgid ""
"A customer invoice line of ₹100 with 18% GST and 1% TCS: the GST amount is "
"₹18 and the TCS amount is ₹1.18 (1% of ₹118)."
msgstr ""
"一張 ₹100、含 18% GST 及 1% TCS 的客戶發票資料行：GST 金額為 ₹18，TCS 金額為 "
"₹1.18（₹118 的 1%）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:708
msgid "Apply TCS on customer invoices"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:710
msgid ""
"TCS is directly applicable as a tax on the invoice lines. On the customer "
"invoice, add the appropriate TCS tax in the :guilabel:`Taxes` column of the "
"invoice line. The TCS amount is added to the invoice total."
msgstr ""
"TCS 可直接作為稅項套用於發票明細行。在客戶發票上，於發票明細行的 "
":guilabel:`稅項` 欄加入適當的 TCS 稅項。TCS 金額會計入發票總額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:715
msgid ""
"If the customer's :abbr:`PAN (Permanent Account Number)` is missing or "
"invalid, a warning is displayed, suggesting to applying TCS at a higher "
"rate."
msgstr ""
"如果客戶的 :abbr:`PAN (永久帳號)` 遺失或無效，系統會顯示警告，建議以較高稅率"
"套用 TCS。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:721
msgid "Apply TDS on vendor bills and customer invoices"
msgstr "在供應商賬單及客戶發票上套用 TDS"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:723
msgid ""
"On the vendor bill, add the appropriate TDS tax in the :guilabel:`Taxes` "
"column of the bill line."
msgstr "在供應商賬單上，於賬單明細行的:guilabel:`稅項`欄加入適用的 TDS 稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:724
msgid ":guilabel:`Confirm` the bill."
msgstr ":guilabel:`確認` 賬單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:727
msgid ""
"The TDS tax does not reduce the bill's amount due. Instead, the "
":guilabel:`TDS Due` and :guilabel:`Net Due` amounts are displayed below the "
"bill totals once the bill is confirmed."
msgstr ""
"TDS 稅項不會扣減賬單的應付金額。確認賬單後，賬單總計下方會改為顯"
"示:guilabel:`應付 TDS`及:guilabel:`應付淨額`金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:730
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Pay`."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`付款` 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:731
msgid "In the :guilabel:`Pay` window, select one of the following options:"
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`付款` 視窗中，選擇以下其中一個選項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:733
msgid ""
":guilabel:`TDS Only` (default): Record only the TDS entry in the "
":guilabel:`TDS Journal`, without paying the vendor. Use this option to "
"deduct TDS when the bill is booked, before the payment is made. The vendor "
"payment can be registered later using the :guilabel:`Payment Only` option."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`僅 TDS`（預設）：僅在 :guilabel:`TDS 日記賬` 中記錄 TDS 分錄，而不"
"向供應商付款。請使用此選項在入賬賬單時、付款前扣除 TDS。供應商付款可稍後使用 "
":guilabel:`僅付款` 選項登記。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:737
msgid ""
":guilabel:`TDS and Pay`: Record the TDS entry and the vendor payment for the"
" net amount at the same time."
msgstr ":guilabel:`TDS 及付款`：同時記錄 TDS 分錄及淨額的供應商付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:739
msgid ":guilabel:`Payment Only`: Record only the vendor payment."
msgstr ":guilabel:`僅付款`：僅記錄供應商付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:741
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Withholdings` tab, review the TDS lines, which are pre-"
"filled based on the TDS taxes applied on the bill. If needed, modify the "
":guilabel:`TDS base` or the :guilabel:`Tax`, or add a line."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`預扣稅` 分頁中，檢視系統根據賬單上套用的源頭扣稅（TDS）自動填入"
"的預扣稅資料行。如有需要，可修改 :guilabel:`TDS 基數` 或 :guilabel:`稅項`，或"
"新增資料行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:747
msgid ""
"The same process applies to customer invoices when the customer deducts TDS "
"from the payment: add the appropriate TDS sale tax on the invoice line and "
"record the TDS using the :guilabel:`Pay` button."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:752
msgid ""
"TDS options are not available when registering a single payment for multiple"
" bills. Register the TDS for each bill individually."
msgstr "為多張賬單登記單一付款時，無法使用 TDS 選項。請為每張賬單個別登記 TDS。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:758
msgid "Apply TDS on advance payments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:760
msgid ""
"TDS can be deducted on an advance payment made to a vendor or received from "
"a customer, before the bill or invoice is created."
msgstr "在建立賬單或發票之前，可對支付給供應商或向客戶收取的預付款扣減 TDS。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:763
msgid ""
"Navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Payments` for a "
"vendor advance payment, or :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> "
"Payments` for a customer advance payment, and click :guilabel:`New`."
msgstr ""
"如要建立供應商預付款，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 供應商 --> 付款`；如要"
"建立客戶預付款，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 客戶 --> 付款`，然後點擊 "
":guilabel:`新增`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:766
msgid ""
"Select the partner and enter the full :guilabel:`Amount` of the advance, "
"before TDS."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:767
msgid "Select :guilabel:`TDS and Pay`."
msgstr "選擇:guilabel:`TDS 及付款`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:768
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`TDS` tab, click :guilabel:`Add a line`, then set the "
":guilabel:`TDS base` and the TDS :guilabel:`Tax`. The :guilabel:`TDS Amount`"
" is computed automatically, and the :guilabel:`Net Amount` shows the amount "
"actually paid or received."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`TDS` 分頁中，點擊 :guilabel:`新增資料行`，然後設定 "
":guilabel:`TDS 基數` 及 TDS :guilabel:`稅項`。:guilabel:`TDS 金額` 會自動計算"
"，而 :guilabel:`淨額` 會顯示實際支付或收取的金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:771
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:884
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr "按一下 :guilabel:`確認`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:774
msgid ""
"When the advance payment is later reconciled with a bill or invoice that has"
" the same TDS tax, the TDS already deducted on the advance payment reduces "
"the bill's or invoice's :guilabel:`TDS Due` amount."
msgstr ""
"之後將預付款項與具有相同 TDS 稅項的賬單或發票對賬時，預付款項上已扣除的 TDS "
"會扣減該賬單或發票的 :guilabel:`應付 TDS` 金額。"

