#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:854
msgid "Bill of Entry (BOE)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:856
msgid ""
"A Bill of Entry (:abbr:`BOE (Bill of Entry)`) is a legal document filed by "
"importers with the customs department to declare imported goods, assessable "
"values, customs duties, and import taxes. In Odoo, creating a Bill of Entry "
"generates a customs vendor bill and allocates customs duties to the related "
"stock receipts using landed costs."
msgstr ""
"進口報關單（:abbr:`BOE (進口報關單)`）是進口商向海關部門提交的法律文件，用於"
"申報進口貨物、應評稅價值、關稅及進口稅。在 Odoo 中，建立進口報關單會產生海關"
"供應商賬單，並使用到岸成本將關稅分配至相關的庫存收貨。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:862
msgid ""
"Make sure the :guilabel:`Indian - Bill Of Entry` (`l10n_in_boe`) module is "
":ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:864
msgid ""
"The imported products must use the :guilabel:`First In First Out (FIFO)` or "
":guilabel:`Average Cost (AVCO)` costing method."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:867
msgid "To create a Bill of Entry, follow these steps:"
msgstr "如要建立進口報關單，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:869
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Bills` and open a posted "
"vendor bill with its :guilabel:`GST Treatment` set to :guilabel:`Overseas` "
"(or select multiple posted overseas vendor bills for the same vendor and "
"currency from the list view, and click :menuselection:`Action --> Bill of "
"Entry`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:873
msgid ""
":ref:`Match the relevant purchase order to the vendor bill "
"<accounting/vendor_bills/vendor-bills-matching-po>`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`將相關採購訂單與供應商賬單配對 <accounting/vendor_bills/vendor-bills-"
"matching-po>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:874
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Bill Of Entry` to open the wizard and fill in the required "
"details:"
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`報關單` 以開啟精靈並填寫所需詳情："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:876
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Transfers`: Select the validated (:guilabel:`Done`) incoming "
"stock receipts linked to the purchase."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`調撥`：選擇與該採購相關聯且已驗證（:guilabel:`已完成`）的入庫單據"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:878
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Currency`: Verify the document currency and conversion rate if it"
" differs from the company currency."
msgstr ":guilabel:`貨幣`：如文件貨幣與公司貨幣不同，請核對文件貨幣及兌換率。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:880
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bill of Entry Number`, :guilabel:`Bill of Entry Date`, and "
":guilabel:`Port Code`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`進口報關單編號`、:guilabel:`進口報關單日期` 及 :guilabel:`港口代"
"碼`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:882
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Lines` tab, review the :guilabel:`Assessable Value` for "
"each product line, enter the :guilabel:`Custom Duty`, and select the "
"applicable purchase :guilabel:`Taxes`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`明細行` 分頁中，檢視每個產品明細的 :guilabel:`完稅價格`，輸入 "
":guilabel:`關稅`，並選擇適用的採購 :guilabel:`稅項`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/india.rst:886
msgid ""
"A draft Bill of Entry vendor bill is created for the customs duty and import"
" tax, and a linked landed cost record is generated to allocate the customs "
"duty across the selected transfers."
msgstr ""
"系統會為關稅及進口稅建立一張進口報關單（Bill of Entry）供應商賬單草稿，並生成"
"關聯的到岸成本記錄，以將關稅分攤至所選調撥。"

