"restriction, the QR code is not included in reports sent to customers and is"
" only available on the customer portal."
msgstr ""
"根據 `QRIS API 文件 <https://qris.online/api-doc/create-invoice.php>`_，QRIS "
"會在 30 分鐘後過期。受此限制影響，二維碼不會包含在發送給客戶的報告中，僅可在"
"客戶門戶上查看。"

