msgstr "TD16 - 內部反向徵稅"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:462
msgid ""
"Internal **reverse charge** transactions (see :ref:`localizations/italy/tax-"
"exemption` and :ref:`localizations/italy/reverse-charge`) are exported as "
"`TD16` if the following conditions are met:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:466
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:485
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:501
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:522
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:588
msgid "It is a vendor bill."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:467
msgid ""
"It has at least **one tax** on the invoice lines that targets one of these "
":ref:`tax grids <localizations/italy/grids>`: `VJ6`, `VJ7`, `VJ8`, `VJ12`, "
"`VJ13`, `VJ14`, `VJ15`, `VJ16`, `VJ17`"
msgstr ""
"發票資料行上至少有 **一項稅款** 對應以下其中一個 :ref:`稅務網格 "
"<localizations/italy/grids>"
"`：`VJ6`、`VJ7`、`VJ8`、`VJ12`、`VJ13`、`VJ14`、`VJ15`、`VJ16`、`VJ17`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:473
msgid "TD17 - buying services from abroad"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:475
msgid ""
"When buying **services** from **EU** and **non-EU** countries, the foreign "
"*seller* invoices a service with a **VAT-excluded** price, as it is not "
"taxable in Italy. The VAT is paid by the *buyer* in Italy."
msgstr ""
"向 **歐盟** 及 **非歐盟** 國家購買 **服務** 時，由於該服務毋須在意大利課稅，"
"外國 *賣方* 會以 **不含增值稅** 的價格開立發票。增值稅由位於意大利的 *買方* "
"繳納。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:479
msgid ""
"Within the EU: the *buyer* integrates the invoice received with the **VAT "
"information** due in Italy (i.e., **vendor bill tax integration**)."
msgstr ""
"在歐盟境內：*買方*須將收到的發票整合意大利應繳的**增值稅資料**（即**供應商賬"
"單稅項整合**）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:481
msgid ""
"Non-EU: the *buyer* sends themselves an invoice (i.e., **self-billing**)."
msgstr "非歐盟地區： *買方* 向自己發出發票（即 **自開發票** ）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:483
msgid ""
"Odoo exports a transaction as `TD17` if the following conditions are met:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:486
msgid ""
"It has at least **one tax** on the invoice lines that targets the tax grid "
":ref:`VJ3 <localizations/italy/grids>`."
msgstr ""
"其發票明細行至少有 **一項稅項** 對應稅務網格 :ref:`VJ3 <localizations/italy/"
"grids>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:488
msgid ""
"All invoice lines either have :guilabel:`Services` as **products**, or a tax"
" with the :guilabel:`Services` as **tax scope**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:494
msgid "TD18 - buying goods from EU"
msgstr "TD18 - 從歐盟購買貨品"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:496
msgid ""
"Invoices issued within the EU follow a **standard format**, therefore only "
"an integration of the existing invoice is required."
msgstr "於歐盟境內發出的發票均採用 **標準格式**，因此只需整合現有發票即可。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:499
msgid ""
"Odoo exports a transaction as `TD18` if the following conditions are met:"
msgstr "如果符合以下條件，Odoo 會將交易匯出為 `TD18`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:502
msgid "The **partner** is from an **EU** country."
msgstr "**合作夥伴** 來自 **歐盟** 國家。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:503
msgid ""
"It has at least one tax on the invoice lines that targets the tax grid "
":ref:`VJ9 <localizations/italy/grids>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:505
msgid ""
"All invoice lines either have :guilabel:`Consumable` as **products**, or a "
"tax with :guilabel:`Goods` as **tax scope**."
msgstr ""
"所有發票資料行均使用:guilabel:`消耗品`作為**產品**，或使用將:guilabel:`貨"
"品`設為**稅務範圍**的稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:511
msgid "TD19 - buying goods from VAT deposit"
msgstr "TD19 - 從增值稅倉庫購買貨物"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:513
msgid ""
"Buying **goods** from a **foreign** vendor, but the **goods** are already in"
" **Italy** in a **VAT deposit**."
msgstr ""
"向 **外國** 供應商購買 **貨品**，但該 **貨品** 已存放在 **意大利** 的 **增值"
"稅倉庫** 中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:516
msgid ""
"From the EU: the *buyer* integrates the invoice received with the **VAT "
"information** due in Italy (i.e., **vendor bill tax integration**)."
msgstr ""
"來自歐盟： *買方* 將在意大利應繳的 **增值稅資料** 整合至收到的發票中（即 **供"
"應商賬單稅項整合**）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:518
msgid ""
"Non-EU: the *buyer* sends an invoice to *themselves* (i.e., **self-"
"billing**)."
msgstr "非歐盟地區： *買方* 向 *自己* 發出發票（即 **自我開票**）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:520
msgid ""
"Odoo exports a transaction as a `TD19` if the following conditions are met:"
msgstr "如果符合以下條件，Odoo 會將交易匯出為 `TD19`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:523
msgid ""
"It has at least one tax on the invoice lines that targets the tax grid "
":ref:`VJ3 <localizations/italy/grids>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:525
msgid ""
"All invoice lines either have :guilabel:`Consumables` as products, or a tax "
"with :guilabel:`Goods` as **tax scope**."
msgstr ""
"所有發票明細行的產品均為 :guilabel:`消耗品`，或所套用稅項的**稅項範圍**為 "
":guilabel:`貨品`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:531
msgid "TD24 - deferred invoices"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:533
msgid ""
"The **deferred invoice** is an invoice that is **issued at a later time** "
"than the sale of goods or the provision of services. A **deferred invoice** "
"has to be issued at the latest within the **15th day** of the month "
"following the delivery covered by the document."
msgstr ""
"**遞延發票** 是指在銷售貨物或提供服務 **之後才開立** 的發票。**遞延發票** 最"
"遲必須在該單據所涵蓋的交付月份之後的次月 **15 日** 內開立。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:537
msgid ""
"It usually is a **summary invoice** containing a list of multiple sales of "
"goods or services carried out in the month. The business is allowed to "
"**group** the sales into **one invoice**, generally issued at the **end of "
"the month** for accounting purposes. Deferred invoices are default for "
"**wholesalers** having recurrent clients."
msgstr ""
"這通常是一張 **匯總發票**，當中列出該月內進行的多筆貨品或服務銷售。企業可將這"
"些銷售 **合併** 為 **一張發票**，通常於 **月底** 開立作會計用途。對於擁有固定"
"客戶的 **批發商**，遞延發票為預設選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:542
msgid ""
"If the goods are transported by a **carrier**, every delivery has an "
"associated **Documento di Transporto (DDT)**, or **Transport Document**. The"
" deferred invoice **must** indicate the details of all the **DDTs** "
"information for better tracing."
msgstr ""
"如果貨物由 **承運商** 運送，每次送貨都會附有關聯的 **Documento di Transporto "
"(DDT)**（即 **運輸文件**）。延期發票 **必須** 列明所有 **DDT** 的詳細資料，以"
"便更有效追蹤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:547
msgid ""
"E-invoicing of deferred invoices requires the `l10n_it_stock_ddt` "
":ref:`module <localizations/italy/modules>`. In this case, a dedicated "
":guilabel:`Document Type` `TD24` is used in the e-invoice."
msgstr ""
"延遲發票的電子發票功能需要 `l10n_it_stock_ddt` :ref:`模組 <localizations/"
"italy/modules>`。在此情況下，電子發票會使用專用的 :guilabel:`文件類型` "
"`TD24`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:551
msgid ""
"Odoo exports transactions as `TD24` if the following conditions are met:"
msgstr "若符合以下條件，Odoo 會將交易匯出為 `TD24`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:554
msgid ""
"It is associated with deliveries whose **DDTs** have a **different** date "
"than the issue date of the invoice."
msgstr "此項目與 **DDTs** 日期和發票開立日期 **不同** 的交貨相關聯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:560
msgid "TD28 - San Marino"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:567
msgid ""
"San Marino and Italy have special agreements on e-invoicing operations. As "
"such, **invoices** follow the regular **reverse charge** rules. You can use "
"the proper :guilabel:`Document Type` depending on the invoice type: `TD01`, "
"`TD04`, `TD05`, `TD24`, `TD25`. Additional requirements are not enforced by "
"Odoo. However, the user is requested by the **State** to:"
msgstr ""
"聖馬力諾與意大利就電子發票操作訂有特別協議。因此，**發票** 須遵循常規的 **反"
"向徵稅** 規則。你可根據發票類型使用適當的 :guilabel:`文件類"
"型`：`TD01`、`TD04`、`TD05`、`TD24`、`TD25`。Odoo 不會強制執行額外要求，但 "
"**國家** 當局要求用戶："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:572
msgid "Select a tax with the :guilabel:`Tax Exemption Kind` set to `N3.3`."
msgstr "選擇 :guilabel:`免稅類別` 設為 `N3.3` 的稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:573
msgid "Use the generic |SdI| :guilabel:`Destination Code` `2R4GTO8`."
msgstr "使用通用的 |SdI| :guilabel:`目的地代碼` `2R4GTO8`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:575
msgid ""
"The invoice is then routed by a dedicated office in San Marino to the "
"correct business."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:582
msgid ""
"When a **paper bill** is received from San Marino, any Italian company "
"**must** submit that invoice to the |AdE| by indicating the e-invoice's "
":guilabel:`Document Type` field with the special value `TD28`."
msgstr ""
"收到來自聖馬力諾的 **紙本賬單** 時，任何意大利公司 **必須** 將該發票提交至 "
"|AdE|，並在電子發票的 :guilabel:`文件類型` 欄位中指明特殊值 `TD28`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:586
msgid ""
"Odoo exports a transaction as `TD28` if the following conditions are met:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:589
msgid ""
"It has at least one tax on the invoice lines that targets the tax grids "
":ref:`VJ <localizations/italy/grids>`."
msgstr ""
"發票資料行上至少有一項稅項指向稅務網格 :ref:`VJ <localizations/italy/grids>"
"`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:591
msgid "The **country** of the partner is **San Marino**."
msgstr "合作夥伴的 **國家/地區** 為 **聖馬力諾**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:596
msgid "Public administration businesses (B2G)"
msgstr "公共行政機構（B2G）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:598
msgid ""
"|PA| businesses are subjected to more control than private businesses as "
"they handle public money coming from taxpayers. The :abbr:`EDI (Electronic "
"Data Interchange)` process adds some steps to the :ref:`regular one "
"<localizations/italy/e-invoicing-process>`, as |PA| businesses can "
"**accept** or **refuse** invoices."
msgstr ""
"|PA| 機構由於處理來自納稅人的公帑，因此受到比私人企業更嚴格的監管。:abbr:`EDI"
"（電子數據交換）` 流程在 :ref:`一般流程 <localizations/italy/e-invoicing-"
"process>` 的基礎上增加了一些步驟，因為 |PA| 機構可以 **接受** 或 **拒絕** 發"
"票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:604
msgid ""
"|PA| businesses have a 6-digit long :guilabel:`Destination Code`, also "
"called :abbr:`CUU (Codice Univoco Ufficio)`, that is **mandatory**, **PEC** "
"address cannot be used in this case."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:608
msgid ""
"`Complete list of businesses that belong to the Public Administration along "
"with their Destination Code "
"<https://www.agenziaentrate.gov.it/portale/web/guest/aree-"
"tematiche/fatturazione-elettronica>`_"
msgstr ""
"`屬於公共行政部門的企業完整清單及其目的地代碼 <https://"
"www.agenziaentrate.gov.it/portale/web/guest/aree-tematiche/fatturazione-"
"elettronica>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:614
msgid "CIG, CUP, DatiOrdineAcquisto"
msgstr "CIG, CUP, DatiOrdineAcquisto"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:616
msgid ""
"To ensure the effective traceability of payments by public administrations, "
"electronic invoices issued to public administrations must contain:"
msgstr ""
"為確保公共行政部門付款的有效可追溯性，向公共行政部門發出的電子發票必須包含以"
"下內容："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:619
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`CIG (Codice Identificativo Gara)`, except in cases of exclusion "
"from traceability obligations provided by law n. 136 of August 13, 2010."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:621
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`CUP (Codice Unico di Progetto)`, in case of invoices related to "
"public works."
msgstr "如屬公共工程相關發票，須提供 :abbr:`CUP（Codice Unico di Progetto）`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:623
msgid ""
"If the XML file requires it, the |AdE| can *only* proceed payments of "
"electronic invoices when the XML file contains a :abbr:`CIG (Codice "
"Identificativo Gara)` and :abbr:`CUP (Codice Unico di Progetto)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:628
msgid ""
"The :abbr:`CUP (Codice Unico di Progetto)` and the :abbr:`CIG (Codice "
"Identificativo Gara)` must be included in one of the `DatiOrdineAcquisto`, "
"`DatiContratto`, `DatiConvenzione`, `DateRicezione`, or "
"`DatiFattureCollegate` XML tags."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:632
msgid ""
"These correspond to the elements named :guilabel:`CodiceCUP` and "
":guilabel:`CodiceCIG` of the electronic invoice XML file, whose table can be"
" found on the government `website <http://www.fatturapa.gov.it/>`_."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:639
msgid "Split payment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:641
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Split Payment` mechanism behaves much like "
":ref:`localizations/italy/reverse-charge`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:644
msgid ""
"When an Italian company bills a |PA| business - for example, cleaning "
"services for a public building - the |PA| business self-reports the VAT to "
"the Tax Agency themselves, and the vendor just has to select the appropriate"
" tax with the right :guilabel:`Tax Exemption` for their invoice lines."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:649
msgid ""
"The specific :guilabel:`Scissione dei Pagamenti` fiscal position is "
"available to deal with partners belonging to the |PA|."
msgstr ""
"系統提供專用的 :guilabel:`Scissione dei Pagamenti` 財政狀況，以處理屬於 |PA| "
"的合作夥伴。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:660
msgid "Qualified electronic signature"
msgstr "合資格電子簽署"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:662
msgid ""
"Invoices and bills intended for the |PA| must include a **qualified "
"electronic signature** when submitted through the |SdI|. This signature is "
"automatically applied in the :abbr:`XAdES (XML Advanced Electronic "
"Signature)` format when the invoice's partner has a 6-digit long "
":guilabel:`Destination Code` (which indicates a |PA| business)."
msgstr ""
"發送給 |PA| 的發票及賬單在透過 |SdI| 提交時，必須包含 **合資格電子簽名**。此"
"簽名會自動以 :abbr:`XAdES (XML 進階電子簽名)` 格式套用，前提是發票的合作夥伴"
"擁有 6 位數的 :guilabel:`目的地代碼`（表示該合作夥伴為 |PA| 機構）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:668
msgid ""
"When such an invoice is transmitted to the Tax Agency, the generated `.xml` "
"file is signed on the Odoo servers, returned to the database, and attached "
"to the invoice automatically."
msgstr ""
"將此類發票傳輸至稅務局時，系統會在 Odoo 伺服器上簽署生成的 `.xml` 檔案，將其"
"傳回資料庫，並自動附加至發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:674
msgid "Acceptance or refusal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:676
msgid ""
"After receiving the invoice through the |SdI|, the |PA| business has 15 days"
" to accept the invoice. If it does, then the process ends here. If the |PA| "
"business refuses the invoice, it is still considered valid once it is "
"accepted by the |SdI|. You then have to issue a credit note to compensate "
"and send it to the |SdI|."
msgstr ""
"透過 |SdI| 收到發票後，|PA| 企業有 15 天時間接受發票。如果接受，流程便到此結"
"束。如果 |PA| 企業拒絕該發票，只要該發票已獲 |SdI| 接受，則仍被視為有效。隨後"
"，您必須開立貸記單以作抵銷，並將其傳送至 |SdI|。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:684
msgid "Expired terms"
msgstr "已過期條款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:686
msgid ""
"If the |PA| business doesn't reply within 15 days, you need to contact the "
"|PA| business directly, sending them both the invoice and the received "
"deadline notification by email. You can make an arrangement with them and "
"manually set the correct :guilabel:`SdI State` on your invoice."
msgstr ""
"如果 |PA| 機構未在 15 天內回覆，您需要直接聯絡該 |PA| 機構，並透過電郵向其傳"
"送發票及已收到的截止日期通知。您可以與對方協調，並在您的發票上手動設定正確"
"的:guilabel:`SdI 狀態`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:693
msgid "Point of sale fiscal printers"
msgstr "銷售點稅控打印機"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:696
msgid ""
"Fiscal printers are distinct from :doc:`ePOS printers "
"</applications/sales/point_of_sale/hardware_network/receipt_printers>`. The "
"IP address for a fiscal printer should not be entered in the ePOS IP address"
" settings."
msgstr ""
"稅控打印機與 :doc:`ePOS 打印機 </applications/sales/point_of_sale/"
"hardware_network/receipt_printers>` 不同。請勿在 ePOS IP 地址設定中輸入稅控打"
"印機的 IP 地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:700
msgid ""
"Fiscal regulations mandate using certified RT devices, such as RT printers "
"or RT servers, to ensure compliant sales receipts and secure communication "
"with the Tax Authority. These devices automatically transmit fiscal data "
"daily. RT printers, designed for individual POS terminals, handle "
"transactions, print receipts, and report to the authorities, ensuring data "
"integrity and compliance."
msgstr ""
"稅務法規要求使用經認證的 RT 裝置（例如 RT 打印機或 RT 伺服器），以確保銷售收"
"據符合規定，並與稅務局進行安全通訊。這些裝置會每日自動傳送稅務資料。專為個別 "
"POS 終端機設計的 RT 打印機可處理交易、列印收據並向當局申報，從而確保資料完整"
"及合規。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:708
msgid "Simulation mode"
msgstr "模擬模式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:711
msgid ""
"Since the simulation mode sends data to the authorities, it should only be "
"enabled at the very start of the printer's configuration process. Once the "
"printer is switched to the production mode, it cannot be reverted to the "
"simulation mode."
msgstr ""
"由於模擬模式會向當局發送資料，因此只應在打印機設定過程的最開始時啟用。一旦打"
"印機切換至生產模式，便無法切換回模擬模式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:715
msgid ""
"To test the fiscal printer setup with Odoo, configure the fiscal printer in "
"the simulation mode as follows:"
msgstr "要在 Odoo 中測試財政打印機設定，請按以下步驟將財政打印機設為模擬模式："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:718
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:749
msgid ""
"Make sure the fiscal printer is set to its default state: printer on, start-"
"up cycle complete, and no transaction in progress."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:720
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:751
msgid "Type `3333`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:721
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:752
msgid ""
"Press :guilabel:`Chiave`. The screen displays :guilabel:`Scelta Funzione`."
msgstr "按 :guilabel:`Chiave`。畫面會顯示 :guilabel:`Scelta Funzione`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:722
msgid "Type `14`. The screen displays :guilabel:`Apprendimento`."
msgstr "輸入 `14`。畫面會顯示 :guilabel:`Apprendimento`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:723
msgid "Type `62`. The screen displays :guilabel:`Simulazione`."
msgstr "輸入 `62`。畫面會顯示 :guilabel:`Simulazione`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:724
msgid "To turn the :guilabel:`no` into a :guilabel:`si`, press :guilabel:`X`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:725
msgid "To confirm, press :guilabel:`Contante`."
msgstr "若要確認，請按 :guilabel:`Contante`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:726
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:757
msgid "Press :guilabel:`Chiave`."
msgstr "按下 :guilabel:`Chiave`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:728
msgid "To configure the printer for production, repeat the steps above."
msgstr "要為正式環境配置打印機，請重複上述步驟。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:731
msgid ""
"To test the printer configuration, the physical device must first be "
"obtained and registered with the relevant authorities."
msgstr "要測試打印機設定，必須先取得實體裝置並向相關部門註冊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:737
msgid "Setting up the printer to work with Odoo"
msgstr "設定打印機以配合 Odoo 使用"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:739
msgid ""
"Fiscal printers are meant to work only in the local network. This means the "
"printer and the device running :doc:`Odoo Point of Sale "
"</applications/sales/point_of_sale>` must be connected to the same network."
msgstr ""
"稅控打印機僅可在區域網絡內運作。這表示打印機與執行 :doc:`Odoo 銷售點 </"
"applications/sales/point_of_sale>` 的裝置必須連接至同一網絡。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:743
msgid ""
"Fiscal printers are typically configured to use HTTP by default. To ensure "
"compatibility with Odoo, the settings must be updated to enable HTTPS "
"support on the printer. This can be done using either the EpsonFPWizard "
"configuration software or the keyboard connected to the printer."
msgstr ""
"稅控打印機預設通常設定為使用 HTTP。為確保與 Odoo 相容，必須更新設定以在打印機"
"上啟用 HTTPS 支援。您可使用 EpsonFPWizard 設定軟件或連接至打印機的鍵盤來完成"
"此操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:747
msgid "To set up the fiscal printer using the keyboard, follow these steps:"
msgstr "如要使用鍵盤設定財政打印機，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:753
msgid "Type `34`. The screen displays :guilabel:`Web Server`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:754
msgid ""
"Press :guilabel:`Contante` 3 times until the screen displays :guilabel:`Web "
"Server: SSL`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:755
msgid "To turn the value `0` into a `1`, press :guilabel:`X`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:756
msgid "To confirm, press :guilabel:`Contante` 3 times."
msgstr "如要確認，請按 :guilabel:`Contante` 3 次。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:759
msgid ""
"Then, log in to the printer with the device that runs :doc:`Odoo Point of "
"Sale </applications/sales/point_of_sale>` so it recognizes the printer's "
"certificate."
msgstr ""
"然後，使用執行 :doc:`Odoo 銷售點 </applications/sales/point_of_sale>` 的裝置"
"登入打印機，讓裝置識別打印機的憑證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:762
msgid "To approve and install the printer's certificate, follow these steps:"
msgstr "要批准並安裝打印機證書，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:764
msgid ""
"Access the printer by opening a web browser and entering `https://<ip-of-"
"your-printer>` in the address bar. A :guilabel:`Warning: Potential Security "
"Risk Ahead` security message appears."
msgstr ""
"開啟網頁瀏覽器並在網址列輸入 `https://<ip-of-your-printer>` 以存取打印機。畫"
"面會顯示 :guilabel:`警告：潛在的安全性風險` 安全性訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:766
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Advanced` to show the certificate approval options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:767
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Proceed` to validate the certificate."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:769
msgid ""
"Then, to ensure :doc:`Odoo Point of Sale "
"</applications/sales/point_of_sale>` is configured with the fiscal printer, "
"go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> Settings`. In the "
":guilabel:`Connected Devices` section, add the IP address in the "
":guilabel:`Italian Fiscal Printer IP address` and enable :guilabel:`Use "
"HTTPS`."
msgstr ""
"然後，為確保 :doc:`Odoo POS 銷售點 </applications/sales/point_of_sale>` 已配"
"置該稅務打印機，請前往 :menuselection:`POS 銷售點 --> 配置 --> 設定`。在 "
":guilabel:`已連接裝置` 部分中，於 :guilabel:`意大利稅務打印機 IP 位址` 欄位輸"
"入 IP 位址，並啟用 :guilabel:`使用 HTTPS`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:777
msgid "Ri.Ba. (Ricevuta Bancaria)"
msgstr "Ri.Ba.（銀行收款憑證，Ricevuta Bancaria）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:779
msgid ""
"|Ri.Ba.| is a payment method widely used in Italy where vendors request "
"payments through their bank, which forwards the request to the customer's "
"own bank and takes responsibility for the collection. This enables payment "
"automation and reduces risks for the vendor."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:783
msgid ""
"The vendor generally uploads a fixed-format text file with the list of "
"payments to the bank's web portal."
msgstr "供應商通常會將包含付款清單的固定格式文字檔案上載至銀行網站門戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:787
msgid ""
"|Ri.Ba.| are exclusively for **domestic payments** in Italy. For recurring "
"international payments, please use `SEPA Direct Debt (SDD) "
"<../accounting/payments/batch_sdd>`_"
msgstr ""
"|Ri.Ba.| 僅適用於意大利的**本地付款**。如需進行定期國際付款，請使用 `SEPA 直"
"接扣賬 (SDD) <../accounting/payments/batch_sdd>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:795
msgid ""
"Check that the `l10n_it_riba` module is :ref:`installed <general/install>`."
msgstr "檢查 `l10n_it_riba` 模組是否:ref:`已安裝 <general/install>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:796
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Users & Companies --> Companies` and "
"select the company that will use |Ri.Ba.|."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:798
msgid "Fill out the required :guilabel:`SIA Code`."
msgstr "填寫所需的 :guilabel:`SIA 代碼`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:800
msgid "The company's SIA code"
msgstr "公司的 SIA 代碼"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:804
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`SIA Code` identifies businesses within the Italian banking "
"network and is used to receive money through specific payment methods. It "
"consists of one letter and four digits (e.g., T1234) and can usually be "
"found on the bank's portal or obtained by contacting the bank."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/italy.rst:809
