#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:96
msgid "Qualified invoices"
msgstr "合資格發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:98
msgid ""
"A qualified invoice (適格請求書) is an invoice that contains the information "
"required by the Japanese qualified invoice system, including the issuer's "
"registration number. Buyers can only deduct the full consumption tax paid on"
" a purchase if the vendor's invoice is a qualified invoice. Only businesses "
"registered with the National Tax Agency as qualified invoice issuers can "
"issue them."
msgstr ""
"合資格發票（適格請求書）是指載有日本合資格發票制度規定資料（包括開立人註冊編"
"號）的發票。買方只有取得賣方開立的合資格發票，方可全額扣減採購時所支付的消費"
"稅。只有向國稅廳註冊為合資格發票開立機構的企業，方可開立此類發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:103
msgid ""
"If your company is a registered qualified invoice issuer, enter your "
":ref:`Tax ID <localizations/japan/company-and-contacts>`. The number is then"
" printed on invoices and other documents, as required for qualified "
"invoices."
msgstr ""
"如果貴公司是已登記的合資格發票開立人，請輸入貴公司的 :ref:`稅務編號 "
"<localizations/japan/company-and-contacts>`。該編號隨後會列印在發票及其他文件"
"上，以符合合資格發票的規定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:107
msgid ""
"When an invoice is received from a vendor that is not a qualified invoice "
"issuer, the deductible share of the tax depends on the transaction date. "
":ref:`Check which taxes to select <localizations/japan/accounting/qualified-"
"invoice-transition>`."
msgstr ""
"如從非合資格發票開立人的供應商收到發票，稅項的可扣減比例取決於交易日期"
"。:ref:`查看應選擇哪些稅項 <localizations/japan/accounting/qualified-invoice-"
"transition>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:114
msgid "Consumption tax filing"
msgstr "消費稅申報"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:116
msgid "The following tax returns are installed and active:"
msgstr "以下報稅表已安裝並啟用："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:122
msgid "Sales calculation"
msgstr "銷售計算"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:123
msgid ":guilabel:`JCT Return (Sales Accumulation) (JP)`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`JCT 申報表（銷售累計）(JP)`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:124
msgid "Accumulation method (sum of the tax amounts on each invoice)"
msgstr "累計法（每張發票稅額的總和）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:125
msgid ":guilabel:`JCT Return (Sales Deduction) (JP)`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`JCT 申報表（銷售扣減）(JP)`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:126
msgid "Deduction method (tax calculated from the tax-inclusive total)"
msgstr "扣減法（根據含稅總額計算稅項）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:128
msgid ""
"In most cases, no further configuration is needed. Select the appropriate "
"tax in the :guilabel:`Taxes` column of each transaction line, then select "
"the tax return that matches your calculation method to display a draft of "
"your return."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:132
msgid ""
"Additional taxes or tax returns must be activated for imported purchases, "
"the :ref:`itemized method <localizations/japan/accounting/itemized>`, and "
":ref:`simplified taxpayers <localizations/japan/accounting/simplified-tax-"
"payer>`. To activate a tax, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Taxes`."
msgstr ""
"必須為進口採購、 :ref:`逐項列明法 <localizations/japan/accounting/itemized>` "
"及 :ref:`簡易納稅人 <localizations/japan/accounting/simplified-tax-payer>` 啟"
"用額外稅項或報稅表。要啟用稅項，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 稅"
"項`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:140
msgid "General taxpayer"
msgstr "一般納稅人"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:142
msgid ""
"Both the accumulation method and the deduction method are supported for the "
"sales of general taxpayers."
msgstr "一般納稅人的銷售業務同時支援累計法及扣減法。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:145
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Tax Report` and select "
"the tax return that matches your calculation method. The tax return consists"
" of Schedule 1-3 (tax base amounts) and Schedule 2-3 (deductible purchase "
"tax amounts)."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 報告 --> 稅務報告`，並選擇符合您計算方法的報稅"
"表。報稅表由附表 1-3（稅基金額）及附表 2-3（可扣減進項稅額）組成。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:149
msgid ""
":guilabel:`JCT Return (Sales Accumulation) (JP)`: The accumulation method is"
" applied to purchases."
msgstr ":guilabel:`JCT 報稅表（銷售累計）（日本）`：累計方法適用於採購。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:151
msgid ""
":guilabel:`JCT Return (Sales Deduction) (JP)`: Both the accumulation method "
"and the deduction method are calculated for purchases, and the one with the "
"larger deduction is applied automatically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:158
msgid "Itemized method"
msgstr "分項法"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:160
msgid ""
"The itemized method calculates the deductible tax amount by managing "
"expenses under three purposes: taxable sales, non-taxable sales, and both."
msgstr ""
"分項計算法透過將開支分為三種用途來計算可扣減稅額：應課稅銷售、非應課稅銷售，"
"以及兩者兼有。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:163
msgid ""
"To use the itemized method, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Taxes`, activate the following taxes, and select the one "
"matching the purpose of each purchase line:"
msgstr ""
"如要使用分項法，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 稅項`，啟用以下稅項"
"，並選擇符合每個採購明細行用途的稅項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:166
msgid ""
"`10% Taxable` and `8% Taxable`: Purchases exclusively for taxable sales"
msgstr "`10% 應課稅` 及 `8% 應課稅`：專門用於應課稅銷售的採購"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:167
msgid ""
"`10% Taxable + Non Taxable` and `8% Taxable + Non Taxable`: Purchases common"
" to taxable and non-taxable sales"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:170
msgid ""
"Taxes are also available for purchases from vendors that are not qualified "
"invoice issuers, for each deductible share of the :ref:`transition period "
"<localizations/japan/accounting/qualified-invoice-transition>`, such as `10%"
" NQI 80% Taxable` and `10% NQI 80% Taxable and Non Taxable`. Activate them "
"as needed."
msgstr ""
"系統亦為向非合資格發票開立人採購的情況提供稅項，對應:ref:`過渡期 "
"<localizations/japan/accounting/qualified-invoice-transition>`的各個可扣稅比"
"例，例如 `10% NQI 80% Taxable` 及 `10% NQI 80% Taxable and Non Taxable`。請按"
"需要啟用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:175
msgid ""
"The standard 10% and 8% purchase taxes are counted neither as purchases "
"exclusively for taxable sales nor as common purchases. They are not "
"deductible under the itemized method, as they are treated as purchases "
"exclusively for non-taxable sales. It is recommended to deactivate them to "
"prevent accidental use."
msgstr ""
"標準的 10% 及 8% 採購稅既不計入專用於應稅銷售的採購，亦不計入共同採購。由於這"
"些稅項被視為專用於免稅銷售的採購，因此無法按逐項扣減法扣除。建議將其停用，以"
"免誤用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:183
msgid "Simplified taxpayer"
msgstr "簡易納稅人"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:185
msgid ""
"Simplified taxpayers use different sales taxes for each business category "
"(`Type 1` to `Type 6`)."
msgstr "簡易稅制納稅人會就每個業務類別（`Type 1` 至 `Type 6`）使用不同的銷售稅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:187
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes` and activate "
"the sales taxes that match your business category (e.g., `10% Type 5` and "
"`8% Type 5`), as well as `0% ST` and `0% EXEMPT ST`."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 設定 --> 稅項`，並啟用符合你業務類別的銷售稅（"
"例如 `10% Type 5` 及 `8% Type 5`），以及 `0% ST` 和 `0% EXEMPT ST`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:190
msgid ""
"Activate the :ref:`developer mode <developer-mode>`, and go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Tax Report`."
msgstr ""
"啟用 :ref:`開發者模式 <developer-mode>`，然後前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 報"
"表 --> 稅務報表`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:192
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`add` :guilabel:`(add)` icon, then the :icon:`fa-toggle-off`"
" :guilabel:`(toggle-off)` icon to enable :guilabel:`Schedule 4-3` (tax base "
"amounts) and :guilabel:`Schedule 5-3` (deductible purchase tax amounts) for "
"simplified taxpayers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:195
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Tax Return` to go back to the Tax Return and click the "
":icon:`settings_applications` :guilabel:`(settings_applications)` icon."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :guilabel:`報稅表` 返回報稅表，然後按一下 "
":icon:`settings_applications` :guilabel:`(settings_applications)` 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:197
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`JCT Return (Sales Accumulation)` view, click the "
":icon:`fa-toggle-on` :guilabel:`(toggle-on)` icon to deactivate "
":guilabel:`Schedule 1-3` and :guilabel:`Schedule 2-3` for general taxpayers."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`JCT 申報表（銷售累計）` 檢視中，點擊 :icon:`fa-toggle-on` "
":guilabel:`（切換開啟）` 圖示，為一般納稅人停用 :guilabel:`附表 1-3` 及 "
":guilabel:`附表 2-3`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:201
msgid ""
"For businesses operating in more than one category, Schedule 5-3 "
"automatically calculates the deductible purchase tax amount for each "
"applicable calculation method: the principle calculation, the special "
"calculation if one type of business accounts for 75% or more of sales, and "
"the special calculation if two types of business together account for 75% or"
" more of sales."
msgstr ""
"對於經營超過一個業務類別的企業，附表 5-3 會自動為每種適用的計算方法計算可扣減"
"進項稅額：原則計算方法、單一業務類別佔銷售額 75% 或以上時的特殊計算方法，以及"
"兩個業務類別合計佔銷售額 75% 或以上時的特殊計算方法。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:206
msgid ""
"However, the calculation method to apply is not selected automatically. "
"Click the :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`(pencil)` icon to manually enter the "
"result of the chosen method in the :guilabel:`37. Amount selected from "
"selectable calculation formula categories (20 to 36)` line of Schedule 5-3."
msgstr ""
"不過，系統不會自動選擇要套用的計算方法。請按一下 :icon:`fa-pencil` "
":guilabel:`（鉛筆）` 圖示，在附表 5-3 的 :guilabel:`37. 從可選計算公式類別（"
"20 至 36）選擇的金額` 行中手動輸入所選方法的結果。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/japan.rst:214
msgid "Qualified invoice issuers: transition measures"
msgstr "合資格發票開立機構：過渡措施"

