msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:115
msgid "Registering on eTIMS"
msgstr "在 eTIMS 註冊"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/kenya.rst:117
msgid ""
"Taxpayers *must* sign up and create an account on the `KRA portal "
"<https://etims.kra.go.ke/basic/login/indexLogin>`_. If you do not have an "
"account yet:"
msgstr ""
"納稅人 *必須* 在 `KRA 門戶網站 <https://etims.kra.go.ke/basic/login/"
"indexLogin>`_ 註冊並建立賬戶。如你尚未擁有賬戶："

