#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:209
msgid "Opening the declaration"
msgstr "開啟申報"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:213
msgid ""
"In the :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`Report` selector, select :guilabel:`Annual"
" VAT Declaration (LU)`."
msgstr ""
"在 :icon:`fa-book` :guilabel:`報表` 選擇器中，選擇 :guilabel:`年度增值稅申報"
"表 (LU)`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:215
msgid ""
"In the :icon:`fa-calendar` (:guilabel:`Period`) selector, choose the fiscal "
"year dates for which to generate the declaration."
msgstr ""
"在 :icon:`fa-calendar`（:guilabel:`期間`）選擇器中，選擇要為其產生申報表的財"
"政年度日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:219
msgid "Completing the declaration"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:221
msgid ""
"The annual declaration contains five sections labelled I to V, seven "
"appendices labelled A to G, and an additional Appendix to Operational "
"Expenditures."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:224
msgid ""
"Sections I, III, and Appendix A can be pre-populated automatically based on "
"the :ref:`account tag configuration <luxembourg/account-tag-configuration>`."
" After configuring the account tags, :ref:`set the tax lock date "
"<accounting/tax-returns/lock-date>` to the end of the fiscal year. This will"
" trigger the pre-computation of those values."
msgstr ""
"系統可根據:ref:`賬戶標籤設定 <luxembourg/account-tag-configuration>`自動預填"
"第 I、III 部分及附錄 A。設定賬戶標籤後，請:ref:`設定稅務鎖定日期 <accounting/"
"tax-returns/lock-date>`至財政年度結束日。這樣便會觸發預先計算相關數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:229
msgid ""
"Odoo Accounting populates a Luxembourgish annual VAT declaration based on "
"account tags."
msgstr "Odoo 會計會根據會計科目標籤填入盧森堡年度增值稅申報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:232
msgid ""
"Alternatively, the year's total VAT debit and credit can be manually "
"distributed among the various report lines in sections I and III. You can "
"use the :icon:`fa-pencil` (:guilabel:`Edit`) icon to manually enter the "
"value for each report line."
msgstr ""
"此外，全年的增值稅借方及貸方總額，亦可手動分配至第 I 及第 III 部分的各個報表"
"項目。你可使用 :icon:`fa-pencil`（:guilabel:`編輯`）圖示，手動輸入每個報表項"
"目的數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:236
msgid "Sections II and IV are automatically computed."
msgstr "第 II 及第 IV 部分會自動計算。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:238
msgid ""
"You then need to manually complete appendices B through G, as well as the "
"Appendix to Operational Expenditures, with any additional information to be "
"reported."
msgstr ""
"然後，你需要手動填寫附錄 B 至 G，以及營運開支附錄，補充任何需要申報的額外資料"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:242
msgid "Exporting the declaration"
msgstr "匯出申報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:244
msgid ""
"Once the declaration is complete and correct, click the :icon:`fa-cog` "
"(:guilabel:`action menu`) icon, then click :guilabel:`XML` to export and "
"download it in XML format. You can then submit the XML file on the eCDF "
"platform."
msgstr ""
"申報表填寫完成並核對無誤後，按一下 :icon:`fa-cog`（:guilabel:`操作選單`）圖示"
"，然後按一下 :guilabel:`XML` 以匯出並下載 XML 格式檔案。然後你可在 eCDF 平台"
"提交該 XML 檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:250
msgid ""
"`Tax office website - VAT declaration "
"<https://guichet.public.lu/en/entreprises/fiscalite/impots-"
"benefices/tva/declarations/declaration-tva.html>`_"
msgstr ""
"`稅務局網站 - 增值稅申報表 <https://guichet.public.lu/en/entreprises/"
"fiscalite/impots-benefices/tva/declarations/declaration-tva.html>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:251
msgid ""
"`Platform for electronic gathering of financial data (eCDF) "
"<http://www.ecdf.lu>`_"
msgstr "`電子財務數據收集平台 (eCDF) <http://www.ecdf.lu>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:256
msgid "FAIA audit file export"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:258
msgid ""
":abbr:`FAIA (Fichier d’Audit Informatisé AED)` is the Luxembourgish version "
"of the SAF-T format for accounting data interchange. It allows exporting "
"complete accounting data for a period from a taxpayer's accounting system to"
" the tax office."
msgstr ""
":abbr:`FAIA (Fichier d’Audit Informatisé AED)` 是盧森堡版本的 SAF-T 會計資料"
"交換格式，讓納稅人可從其會計系統匯出指定期間的完整會計資料予稅務局。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:262
msgid ""
"Odoo can generate an XML file in the FAIA format that contains the entire "
"accounting data for a period."
msgstr "Odoo 可產生 FAIA 格式的 XML 檔案，當中包含該期間的所有會計資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/luxembourg.rst:265
msgid ""
"To generate and download the FAIA file, open :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Reporting --> General Ledger`, choose the desired period, click the "
":icon:`fa-cog` (:guilabel:`action menu`) icon, and click :guilabel:`Export "
"FAIA`."
msgstr ""
"要產生並下載 FAIA 檔案，請前往:menuselection:`會計 --> 報告 --> 總賬`，選擇所"
"需期間，按一下:icon:`fa-cog`（:guilabel:`動作選單`）圖示，再按一"
"下:guilabel:`匯出 FAIA`。"

