"態`會更新為:guilabel:`已取消`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:376
msgid "Send credit notes to MyInvois"
msgstr "將貸記單傳送至 MyInvois"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:378
msgid ""
"Before sending a credit note, the original invoice must be successfully "
"submitted to MyInvois. Otherwise, the credit note's :guilabel:`MyInvois "
"State` is updated to :guilabel:`Invalid`."
msgstr ""
"傳送貸項通知單前，必須先成功將原始發票提交至 MyInvois；否則，貸項通知單的 "
":guilabel:`MyInvois 狀態` 會更新為 :guilabel:`無效`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:381
msgid ""
"While Odoo uses a single :guilabel:`credit note` document, MyInvois "
"categorizes these into two types: :guilabel:`credit note` and "
":guilabel:`refund note`, depending on how they are reconciled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:384
msgid ""
":guilabel:`MyInvois Credit Note`: This is created when an Odoo credit note "
"is reconciled with the original invoice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:386
msgid ""
":guilabel:`MyInvois Refund Note`: This is created when an Odoo credit note "
"is reconciled with a full payment instead of the original invoice."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`MyInvois 退款單`：當 Odoo 貸項通知單與全額付款（而非原始發票）對賬"
"時，系統便會建立此單據。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:390
msgid ""
"If a credit note is reconciled with only a partial payment before being "
"sent, it is still categorized as a :guilabel:`credit note` in MyInvois."
msgstr ""
"如果貸記單在發送前僅與部分付款對賬，在 MyInvois 中仍會歸類為 :guilabel:`貸記"
"單`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:394
msgid ""
"To issue both a credit note and a refund note for the same original invoice:"
msgstr "如要為同一張原始發票同時開立貸記單及退款單："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:395
msgid "Create two separate credit notes in Odoo from the original invoice."
msgstr "在 Odoo 中根據原發票建立兩張獨立的貸記單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:396
msgid ""
"For a MyInvois :guilabel:`Refund Note`: Register a payment before sending "
"it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/malaysia.rst:397
msgid ""
"For a MyInvois :guilabel:`Credit Note`: Do not register a payment before "
"sending it."
msgstr "對於 MyInvois :guilabel:`貸記單`：在傳送前請勿登記付款。"

