msgstr ""
"墨西哥本地化模組容許按照 |SAT| 就 `CFDI 4.0 版本 <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/"
"tramitesyservicios/Paginas/documentos/Anexo_20_Guia_de_llenado_CFDI.pdf>`_ 制"
"訂的規格簽署電子發票（此為自 2022 年 1 月 1 日起的法定要求）。這些模組亦會新"
"增包括 |DIOT| 在內的相關會計報表，並支援對外貿易及建立送貨單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:132
msgid "The Sign app must be installed to electronically sign any document."
msgstr "必須安裝「簽署」應用程式，才能以電子方式簽署任何文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:137
msgid ""
":doc:`Mexican payroll signing and configurations "
"<../../hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico>`"
msgstr ":doc:`墨西哥薪酬簽署及配置 <../../hr/payroll/payroll_localizations/mexico>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:145
msgid ""
"After :ref:`installing the correct modules <l10n/mx/modules>`, verify that "
"the company is configured with the correct data. To do so, go to "
":menuselection:`Settings --> Users & Companies --> Companies`, and access "
"the relevant company form."
msgstr ""
"在 :ref:`安裝正確的模組 <l10n/mx/modules>` 後，請確認公司已設定正確的資料。為"
"此，請前往 :menuselection:`設定 --> 使用者與公司 --> 公司`，並開啟相關的公司"
"表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:149
msgid ""
"Enter the full :guilabel:`Address`, including the :guilabel:`ZIP` code, "
":guilabel:`State`, and :guilabel:`Country`, as well as the |RFC| in the "
":guilabel:`Tax ID` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:153
msgid ""
"|CFDI| 4.0 requires the main company contact name to match the business name"
" registered with the |SAT|, excluding the legal entity abbreviation. The "
"same applies to the :guilabel:`ZIP` code."
msgstr ""
"|CFDI| 4.0 要求主公司聯絡人名稱必須與向 |SAT| 登記的商業名稱相符，不包括法律"
"實體簡稱。:guilabel:`郵遞區號`亦須相符。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:157
msgid ""
"From a legal point of view, Mexican companies **must** use the local "
"currency (MXN). To use another currency, keep MXN as the default currency "
"and use a :doc:`pricelist "
"<../../sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing>` instead."
msgstr ""
"從法律角度而言，墨西哥公司**必須**使用當地貨幣（MXN）。如要使用其他貨幣，請保"
"留 MXN 作為預設貨幣，並改用:doc:`價目表 <../../sales/sales/products_prices/"
"prices/pricing>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:165
msgid "To test the Mexican localization, fill in the following fields:"
msgstr "要測試墨西哥本地化設定，請填寫以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:167
msgid "On the company form:"
msgstr "在公司表單上："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:169
msgid ":guilabel:`Company Name`: enter `INNOVACION VALOR Y DESARROLLO SA SA`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`公司名稱`：輸入 `INNOVACION VALOR Y DESARROLLO SA SA`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:170
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Address`: enter a real address in Mexico, with `58000` as the "
":guilabel:`ZIP` code"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`地址`：輸入一個真實的墨西哥地址，並以 `58000` 作為 :guilabel:`郵政"
"編號`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:172
msgid ":guilabel:`Tax ID`: enter `IVD920810GU2`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:174
msgid ""
"In :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, under the "
":guilabel:`MX Electronic invoicing` section, select :guilabel:`General de "
"Ley Personas Morales` in the :guilabel:`Fiscal Regime` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:183
msgid ""
"Branches allow a parent company to manage several brands. When invoicing "
"from a branch, the invoicing information is taken from the parent company, "
"except for the ZIP code. If an |RFC| is set on the branch, the branch "
"information is used instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:187
msgid ""
"A separate branch is also required for each fiscal regime used for invoicing"
" purposes. By default, the regime is inherited from the parent company; if a"
" regime is explicitly set on the branch, the regime of that branch applies."
msgstr ""
"每個用於開立發票的稅制，亦須設有獨立的分支機構。預設情況下，分支機構會繼承母"
"公司的稅制；如在分支機構上明確設定了稅制，則套用該分支機構的稅制。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:197
msgid ""
":ref:`Install <general/install>` the **Contacts** app to access contact "
"records."
msgstr ":ref:`安裝 <general/install>` **聯絡人** 應用程式，以存取聯絡人記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:199
msgid ""
"To create a contact that can be invoiced, open the Contacts app and click "
":guilabel:`New`. Then, enter the contact name and the full "
":guilabel:`Address`, including the :guilabel:`ZIP` code, :guilabel:`State`, "
"and :guilabel:`Country`, as well as the |RFC| in the :guilabel:`Tax ID` "
"field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:204
msgid ""
"As with the company itself, all contacts must have the business name "
"registered with the |SAT|. The :guilabel:`Fiscal Regime` must also be set in"
" the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab."
msgstr ""
"與公司本身一樣，所有聯絡人都必須具備在 |SAT| 登記的商業名稱。此外，亦須"
"在:guilabel:`稅務制度`設定於:guilabel:`銷售及採購`分頁內。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:208
msgid ""
"Setting an |RFC| in the :guilabel:`Tax ID` field without configuring the "
":guilabel:`Country` may result in incorrect invoices."
msgstr ""
"若將 |RFC| 填入 :guilabel:`稅務編號` 欄位，但未設定 :guilabel:`國家/地區`，可"
"能會導致發票出錯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:216
msgid ""
"To sign invoices properly, set the :ref:`Factor Type <l10n/mx/factor-type>` "
"and :ref:`Tax Object <l10n/mx/tax-object>` fields on sales taxes."
msgstr ""
"如要正確簽署發票，請在銷售稅上設定 :ref:`係數類型 <l10n/mx/factor-type>` 及 "
":ref:`稅務對象 <l10n/mx/tax-object>` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:220
msgid ""
"RESICO ISR withholdings and some |IEPS| taxes are created automatically but "
"are inactive by default. To enable them, go to :menuselection:`Accounting "
"--> Configuration --> Taxes` and use the toggle."
msgstr ""
"系統會自動建立 RESICO ISR 預扣稅及部分 |IEPS| 稅項，但預設為停用。若要啟用，"
"請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 稅項` 並使用開關按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:227
msgid "Factor type"
msgstr "係數類型"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:229
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Factor Type` and :guilabel:`SAT Tax Type` fields are "
"preloaded on the default taxes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:231
msgid ""
"To set these fields on a new tax, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Taxes` and click :guilabel:`New`. Set the :guilabel:`Tax "
"Type` to :guilabel:`Sales`, then fill in the :guilabel:`SAT Tax Type` and "
":guilabel:`Factor Type` fields in the :guilabel:`Advanced Options` tab."
msgstr ""
"如要為新稅項設定這些欄位，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 稅項` 並點"
"擊 :guilabel:`新增`。將 :guilabel:`稅項類型` 設為 :guilabel:`銷售`，然後填寫 "
":guilabel:`SAT 稅項類型` 及 :guilabel:`係數類型` 欄位（位於 :guilabel:`進階選"
"項` 分頁）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:235
msgid ""
"Four groups of :guilabel:`SAT Tax Type` are supported: :guilabel:`IVA`, "
":guilabel:`ISR`, :guilabel:`IEPS`, and :guilabel:`Local Taxes`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:238
msgid ""
"If the factor type is :guilabel:`Cuota`, the standard calculation methods do"
" not apply. In this case, set the :guilabel:`Tax computation` to "
":guilabel:`Custom Formula`."
msgstr ""
"如果係數類型為 :guilabel:`Cuota`，則不適用標準計算方法。在此情況下，請將 "
":guilabel:`稅項計算` 設為 :guilabel:`自訂公式`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:246
msgid "`quantity`: the number of items in the transaction"
msgstr "`quantity`：交易中的項目數量"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:247
msgid "`6.455`: the quota value, a fixed amount per unit"
msgstr "`6.455`：配額價值，即每單位的固定金額"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:249
msgid ""
"Only per-unit quotas are supported, but quotas based on other factors are "
"not available."
msgstr "僅支援按單位計算的配額，不支援基於其他因素的配額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:252
msgid "Mexico applies two types of 0% VAT to address different scenarios:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:254
msgid "For *0% VAT*, set the :guilabel:`Factor Type` to :guilabel:`Tasa`."
msgstr "對於 *0% 增值稅*，請將 :guilabel:`因素類型` 設為 :guilabel:`Tasa`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:255
msgid ""
"For *VAT exempt*, set the :guilabel:`Factor Type` to :guilabel:`Exento`."
msgstr "對於 *免徵增值稅*，請將 :guilabel:`係數類型` 設為 :guilabel:`Exento`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:258
msgid ""
"Local taxes are generated in a separate node of the XML file and are not "
"validated by the |PAC|."
msgstr "地方稅會在 XML 檔案的獨立節點中產生，並不會由 |PAC| 驗證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:261
msgid ""
"Quotas and custom formulas require the :guilabel:`Define Taxes as Python "
"Code` module. See :ref:`Custom formula <taxes/computation/python-code>`."
msgstr ""
"配額及自訂公式需要使用 :guilabel:`將稅項定義為 Python 程式碼` 模組。請參閱 "
":ref:`自訂公式 <taxes/computation/python-code>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:267
msgid "Tax object"
msgstr "稅項物件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:269
msgid ""
"|CFDI| 4.0 requires the XML file to include a tax breakdown as specified by "
"regulation. The XML file can include eight possible values:"
msgstr ""
"|CFDI| 4.0 要求 XML 檔案必須包含法規訂明的稅項明細。XML 檔案可包含八個可能的"
"值："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:272
msgid ""
"`01`: No tax object. This value is automatically assigned if the invoice "
"line does not include taxes."
msgstr "`01`：無課稅對象。如果發票明細行不含稅項，系統會自動指派此值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:274
msgid ""
"`02`: Tax object. This is the default configuration for any invoice line "
"that includes taxes."
msgstr "`02`：稅務對象。此為任何包含稅項的發票資料行之預設配置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:275
msgid ""
"`03`: Tax object, no breakdown required. This value must be added manually."
msgstr "`03`：課稅項目，無需分項列明。此數值必須手動新增。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:276
msgid "`04`: Tax object, no tax applied. This value must be added manually."
msgstr "`04`：稅務對象，不適用稅項。此數值必須手動新增。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:277
msgid "`05`: Tax object, VAT for PODEBI. This value must be added manually."
msgstr "`05`：稅項對象，PODEBI 的增值稅。此數值必須手動新增。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:278
msgid ""
"`06`: VAT object, no VAT forwarded. Select this value when there is an ISR "
"withholding and no VAT tax."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:280
msgid ""
"`07`: No VAT forwarded, |IEPS| breakdown. Select this value when there is an"
" ISR withholding, an |IEPS| tax, and no VAT tax."
msgstr ""
"`07`：無轉移增值稅，|IEPS|明細。當存在所得稅（ISR）預扣稅、|IEPS|稅項及無增值"
"稅時，請選擇此值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:282
msgid ""
"`08`: No VAT forwarded, |IEPS| breakdown. This value must be added manually."
msgstr "`08`：無轉嫁增值稅，|IEPS| 明細。此數值必須手動新增。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:285
msgid ""
"Using `01`, `03`, `04`, or `05` removes the tax node from the XML file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:288
msgid ""
"The :ref:`IEPS Breakdown <l10n/mx/ieps-breakdown>` status determines how tax"
" objects behave, as the |IEPS| is missing if the breakdown does not occur."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:294
msgid "Local taxes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:296
msgid ""
"Local taxes, such as *ISH* and *Cedular*, require a separate XML node and "
"may not follow the standard tax logic."
msgstr ""
"地方稅（例如 *ISH* 及 *Cedular*）需要獨立的 XML 節點，且可能不遵循標準稅項邏"
"輯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:299
msgid ""
"When a local tax is configured, its name appears in the local tax "
"complement. Negative rates are treated as a withholding, while positive "
"rates are carried forward."
msgstr ""
"設定地方稅後，其名稱會顯示在地方稅補充資料中。負稅率會視為預扣稅處理，而正稅"
"率則會結轉。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:305
msgid "IEPS breakdown"
msgstr "IEPS 明細"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:307
msgid ""
"By default, |IEPS| is hidden on invoices, so that the VAT is calculated on a"
" subtotal that includes the |IEPS| amount. This ensures that fiscal regimes "
"that do not require the breakdown do not receive it."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，發票會隱藏 |IEPS|，以便根據包含 |IEPS| 金額的小計來計算增值稅。這"
"樣可確保不需要該明細分項的稅務制度不會收到相關資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:312
msgid ""
"To display the |IEPS| in the XML file, tick the :guilabel:`IEPS Breakdown` "
"checkbox in the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab of the relevant contact "
"form."
msgstr ""
"要在 XML 檔案中顯示|IEPS|，請勾選:guilabel:`IEPS 明細`核取方塊，該選項位於相"
"關聯絡人表格的:guilabel:`銷售及採購`分頁中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:316
msgid ""
"When using :ref:`eCommerce invoicing <l10n/mx/ecommerce>` or the :ref:`self-"
"invoicing portal <l10n/mx/pos/portal>`, the customer decides whether to "
"include the |IEPS| breakdown."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:322
msgid "Other tax configurations"
msgstr "其他稅項配置"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:324
msgid ""
"The Mexican localization uses :doc:`cash basis taxes "
"<../accounting/taxes/cash_basis>`. When a payment is registered, the taxes "
"are moved from the *cash basis transition account* to the account set in the"
" :guilabel:`Definition` tab of the relevant tax record. The tax base account"
" :guilabel:`899.01.99 Base Imponible de Impuestos en Base a Flujo de "
"Efectivo` is used in the journal entry for tax reclassifications. **Do not "
"delete this account.**"
msgstr ""
"墨西哥本地化功能使用 :doc:`現金收付制稅項 <../accounting/taxes/cash_basis>`。"
"登記付款後，稅項會從 *現金收付制過渡賬戶* 轉移至相關稅項記錄的 :guilabel:`定"
"義` 分頁中所設定的賬戶。稅基賬戶 :guilabel:`899.01.99 Base Imponible de "
"Impuestos en Base a Flujo de Efectivo` 會用於稅項重新分類的日記賬分錄。**請勿"
"刪除此賬戶。**"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:333
msgid "Withholdings"
msgstr "預扣稅項"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:335
msgid ""
"By default, withholdings are included using special distributions to "
"allocate VAT."
msgstr "預設情況下，系統會使用特殊分佈來分配增值稅，以計入預扣稅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:337
msgid ""
"When registering a vendor bill, include both the withholding and its "
"corresponding VAT to ensure accurate accounting. Using :doc:`fiscal "
"positions <../accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions>` is recommended so that the"
" cash basis entry splits the distribution properly."
msgstr ""
"登記供應商賬單時，請同時包含預扣稅及相應的增值稅，以確保會計入賬準確。建議使"
"用 :doc:`財政位置 <../accounting/taxes/fiscal_positions>`，以便現金制分錄正確"
"分拆分配。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:342
msgid ""
"For a lease vendor bill of `10000 MXN`, the `10.67%` lease withholding "
"corresponds to a `16% VAT 2/3 H`. Both taxes must be applied together to "
"reflect the accurate accounting."
msgstr ""
"對於金額為 `10000 MXN` 的租賃供應商賬單，`10.67%` 的租賃預扣稅對應 `16% VAT "
"2/3 H`。必須同時套用這兩項稅款，以準確反映會計賬目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:345
msgid "Cash basis entry with the VAT split between paid and due."
msgstr "按已付及應付金額分拆增值稅的現金制記項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:349
msgid ""
"The withholdings |CFDI| is not supported. Consult an accountant about the "
"proper distribution."
msgstr "系統不支援預扣稅 |CFDI|。請就適當分配方式諮詢會計師。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:356
msgid ""
"To configure products, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> "
"Products`. Open an existing product or click :guilabel:`New`, then set the "
":guilabel:`UNSPSC Product Category` in the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab. "
"Products and categories can be set manually or through :doc:`a bulk import "
"<../../essentials/export_import_data>`."
msgstr ""
"要配置產品，請前往:menuselection:`會計 --> 客戶 --> 產品`。開啟現有產品或按一"
"下:guilabel:`新增`，然後設定:guilabel:`UNSPSC 產品類別`（位於:guilabel:`會"
"計`分頁內）。產品及類別可手動設定，或透過:doc:`批次匯入 <../../essentials/"
"export_import_data>`設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:362
msgid "All products need a |SAT| code to prevent validation errors."
msgstr "所有產品均須設有 |SAT| 代碼，以防止驗證錯誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:367
msgid "Electronic invoicing setup"
msgstr "電子發票設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:369
msgid ""
"The company's :guilabel:`Fiscal Regime` has to be configured. To do so, go "
"to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, and scroll to"
" the :guilabel:`MX Electronic invoicing` section. Under :guilabel:`Service "
"Tax Administration (SAT)`, select the :guilabel:`Fiscal Regime` that applies"
" to the company from the dropdown list, then click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"您必須配置公司的:guilabel:`稅務制度`。為此，請前往:menuselection:`會計 --> 配"
"置 --> 設定`，並捲動至:guilabel:`MX 電子發票`部分。在:guilabel:`稅務管理局（"
"SAT）`下，從下拉式清單中選擇適用於該公司的:guilabel:`稅務制度`，然後點"
"擊:guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:378
msgid "PAC credentials"
msgstr "PAC 憑證"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:380
msgid ""
"After processing the `private key (CSD) "
"<https://sat.gob.mx/portal/public/tramites/certificado-de-sello-digital>`_ "
"with the |SAT|, register directly with a :ref:`PAC <l10n/mx/requirements>` "
"before creating any invoice."
msgstr ""
"在 `私密金鑰（CSD） <https://sat.gob.mx/portal/public/tramites/certificado-"
"de-sello-digital>`_ 經 |SAT| 處理後，請在建立任何發票前直接向 :ref:`PAC "
"<l10n/mx/requirements>` 註冊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:384
msgid ""
"Once an account has been created with one of these providers, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and scroll to the"
" :guilabel:`MX Electronic invoicing` section. Under :guilabel:`Authorized "
"Certification Provider (PAC)`, enter the name of the |PAC| with the "
"corresponding credentials in the :guilabel:`PAC username` and :guilabel:`PAC"
" password` fields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:389
msgid "Configuring the PAC credentials from the Accounting settings."
msgstr "在「會計」設定中配置 PAC 憑證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:393
msgid ""
"To test electronic invoicing without credentials, tick the :guilabel:`MX PAC"
" test environment` checkbox and select :guilabel:`Solucion Factible` as the "
":guilabel:`PAC`. A username and password are not required in a test "
"environment."
msgstr ""
"如要在沒有憑證的情況下測試電子發票，請勾選 :guilabel:`MX PAC 測試環境` 核取方"
"塊，並選擇 :guilabel:`Solucion Factible` 作為 :guilabel:`PAC`。在測試環境中無"
"需輸入用戶名稱及密碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:400
msgid "Certificates and keys"
msgstr "證書與密鑰"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:402
msgid ""
"The `digital certificates of the company "
"<https://www.gob.mx/tramites/ficha/certificado-de-sello-digital/SAT139>`_ "
"must be uploaded in the :guilabel:`Certificates` section. To do so, follow "
"these steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:406
msgid ""
"Open the Settings app and navigate to the :guilabel:`Certificates and Keys` "
"section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:407
msgid ""
"Under :guilabel:`Manage your certificates`, click the :icon:`east` "
":guilabel:`Keys` link to access the :guilabel:`Keys` list view."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`管理你的憑證` 下方，點擊 :icon:`east` :guilabel:`金鑰` 連結，即"
"可進入 :guilabel:`金鑰` 列表檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:409
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`New`, then upload the :file:`.key` file to the "
":guilabel:`Key file` field."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`新增`，然後將 :file:`.key` 檔案上載至 :guilabel:`金鑰檔案` 欄"
"位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:410
msgid ""
"Add a :guilabel:`Name` for the key, and enter the :guilabel:`Private key "
"password`."
msgstr "為密鑰新增 :guilabel:`名稱`，並輸入 :guilabel:`私鑰密碼`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:411
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Keys`, then :guilabel:`Settings` to go back to the "
":guilabel:`Certificates and Keys` section."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:413
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`east` :guilabel:`Certificates` to access the "
":guilabel:`Certificate` list view."
msgstr "點擊 :icon:`east` :guilabel:`證書`，以存取 :guilabel:`證書` 清單檢視。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:414
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`New`, then upload the :file:`.cer` file to the "
":guilabel:`Certificate` field."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`新增`，然後將 :file:`.cer` 檔案上載至 :guilabel:`憑證` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:415
msgid ""
"Add a :guilabel:`Name` for the certificate, and select the "
":guilabel:`Private Key` created in the previous steps from the dropdown "
"menu."
msgstr ""
"為證書加入:guilabel:`名稱`，並從下拉式選單中選取在先前步驟建立的:guilabel:`私"
"密金鑰`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:417
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Certificate scope` to :guilabel:`CFDI (CSD)` for a "
"digital seal certificate, or to :guilabel:`E Firma (FIEL)` for an e.firma."
msgstr ""
"將 :guilabel:`憑證範圍` 設為 :guilabel:`CFDI (CSD)`（數碼印章憑證），或設為 "
":guilabel:`E Firma (FIEL)`（e.firma 電子簽章）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:421
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Certificate scope` is never filled in automatically from the "
"uploaded file. If it is not set, the certificate is not used: invoices fail "
"to be signed because no |CFDI| (CSD) certificate is found."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:426
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Certificate Password` and :guilabel:`Public Key` fields on "
":guilabel:`Certificate` records are optional."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:430
msgid ""
"Uploading the company's e.firma in the same section, with the "
":guilabel:`Certificate scope` set to :guilabel:`E Firma (FIEL)`, enables the"
" automatic download of :ref:`CFDI documents <l10n/mx/cfdi-documents>` from "
"the |SAT|."
msgstr ""

