#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:452
msgid ""
"The invoicing process is based on version 4.0 of the |SAT|'s `Annex 20 "
"<http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/anexo_20.htm>`_."
msgstr ""
"開立發票流程基於 |SAT| 的 `附件 20 <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/"
"tramitesyservicios/Paginas/anexo_20.htm>`_ 4.0 版本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:460
msgid ""
"To start invoicing, :doc:`create a customer invoice "
"<../accounting/customer_invoices>`. The document can still be modified while"
" it is in draft. Some fields automatically use values from the sales order "
"or contact."
msgstr ""
"要開始開立發票，請 :doc:`建立客戶發票 <../accounting/customer_invoices>`。文"
"件處於草稿狀態時仍可修改。部分欄位會自動採用銷售訂單或聯絡人中的數值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:464
msgid "Review the following fields:"
msgstr ""

