":guilabel:`Payment Way`, if the :guilabel:`Payment Policy` is not set to "
"|PPD|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:472
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Usage`, :guilabel:`Payment Policy`, and :guilabel:`Payment "
"Way` fields can be set beforehand on a sales order, or on the contact to "
"apply them to every invoice."
msgstr ""
"您可以在銷售訂單或聯絡人資料中預先設定:guilabel:`用途`、:guilabel:`付款政"
"策`及:guilabel:`付款方式`欄位，以便套用至每張發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:475
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Payment Policy` field can be set manually on the invoice. If "
"no policy is selected, one is automatically computed: the value is set to "
"|PUE| if the payment is expected in the current month, and to |PPD| if it is"
" expected outside the current month."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:480
msgid ""
"If the payment policy is not selected and the |PPD| policy is expected, "
"either select an invoice :guilabel:`Due Date` in a month other than the "
"current one, or choose :guilabel:`Payment terms` that change the due month, "
"e.g., :guilabel:`30 Days` or :guilabel:`15 Days`, as long as they fall in "
"the next month."
msgstr ""
"若未選擇付款政策且預期採用 |PPD| 政策，請選擇非本月的發票 :guilabel:`到期"
"日`，或選擇會改變到期月份的 :guilabel:`付款條款`（例如 :guilabel:`30 天` 或 "
":guilabel:`15 天`），只要到期日落在下個月即可。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:485
msgid ""
"After confirming the customer invoice, click :guilabel:`Send`. In the "
":guilabel:`Send` window, enable the :guilabel:`CFDI` checkbox, and click "
":guilabel:`Send` to submit it to the |PAC|."
msgstr ""
"確認客戶發票後，點擊 :guilabel:`傳送`。在 :guilabel:`傳送` 視窗中，啟用 "
":guilabel:`CFDI` 核取方塊，然後點擊 :guilabel:`傳送` 以提交至 |PAC|。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:488
msgid ""
"Once the |PAC| returns the signed document, the :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio` "
"field appears on the document, and the XML file is displayed both in the "
":guilabel:`CFDI` tab and as an attachment in the chatter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:493
msgid ""
"If the customer contact record includes an email address, selecting both the"
" :guilabel:`by Email` and :guilabel:`CFDI` checkboxes send the XML and PDF "
"files together."
msgstr ""
"如果客戶聯絡人記錄包含電郵地址，同時勾選:guilabel:`透過電"
"郵`及:guilabel:`CFDI`核取方塊，系統便會一併發送 XML 和 PDF 檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:496
msgid ""
":ref:`To download the PDF file locally <l10n/mx/printed-representation>`, "
"click :guilabel:`Print`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`如要將 PDF 檔案下載至本機 <l10n/mx/printed-representation>`，請點擊 "
":guilabel:`列印`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:499
msgid "To download the PDF file locally, click :guilabel:`Print`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:502
msgid ""
"Clicking :guilabel:`Update SAT` refreshes the :guilabel:`SAT status` field, "
"which confirms whether the XML file is :guilabel:`Validated` with the |SAT|."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :guilabel:`更新 SAT` 會重新整理 :guilabel:`SAT 狀態` 欄位，確認 XML 檔"
"案是否 :guilabel:`已驗證`（經 |SAT| 驗證）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:505
msgid ""
"In a testing environment, the :guilabel:`Not Found` message commonly "
"appears."
msgstr "在測試環境中，通常會顯示 :guilabel:`找不到` 訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:508
msgid ""
"Invoices with a :guilabel:`Country` other than Mexico, or without a "
":guilabel:`ZIP` code on the customer form, are classified as :guilabel:`CFDI"
" to public` and addressed to a generic customer. The :guilabel:`CFDI to "
"public` checkbox stays active on the invoice form until valid partner "
"information is provided. Once the contact information of a national customer"
" is complete, the checkbox is deactivated automatically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:517
msgid "Total rounding"
msgstr "總計捨入"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:519
msgid ""
"In the Mexican localization, :doc:`total rounding "
"<../accounting/customer_invoices/cash_rounding>` is supported using the "
":guilabel:`Add a rounding line` method. This adds a rounding line that "
"changes the paid amount but not the amount in the |CFDI|."
msgstr ""
"在墨西哥本地化設定中，:doc:`總額捨入 <../accounting/customer_invoices/"
"cash_rounding>`支援使用:guilabel:`新增捨入行`方法。這會新增一個捨入行，更改已"
"付金額，但不會更改 |CFDI| 中的金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:526
msgid "Printed representation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:528
msgid ""
"The PDF file of a signed document is generated from the values in its XML "
"file, which makes it an exact printed representation of the |CFDI|: both "
"always show the same values."
msgstr ""
"已簽署文件的 PDF 檔案會根據其 XML 檔案中的數值產生，因此它是 |CFDI| 的精確列"
"印版本：兩者顯示的數值永遠相同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:531
msgid "Besides the standard invoice information, the PDF displays:"
msgstr "除了標準發票資料外，PDF 亦會顯示："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:533
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Usage`, :guilabel:`Payment Way`, and :guilabel:`Payment "
"Method` of the document"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:534
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Currency` and, for foreign currencies, the "
":guilabel:`Currency rate`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:535
msgid "The total amount in words"
msgstr "以文字表示的總金額"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:536
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Product Code`, :guilabel:`Unit Code`, and :ref:`Tax Object "
"<l10n/mx/tax-object>` of each line"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:538
msgid "The discount of each line and the total discount"
msgstr "每行的折扣及總折扣"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:539
msgid "The :ref:`customs number <l10n/mx/inventory/customs>` of each line"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:540
msgid ""
"The amounts including the |IEPS| when the :ref:`IEPS breakdown "
"<l10n/mx/ieps-breakdown>` is not requested"
msgstr ""
"包含 |IEPS| 的金額（當未要求提供 :ref:`IEPS 明細 <l10n/mx/ieps-breakdown>` 時"
"）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:542
msgid ""
"The digital stamps of the emitter and of the |SAT|, the original chain "
"complement of the digital certification, and the :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio`"
msgstr ""
"簽發機構及 |SAT| 的數碼印章、數碼認證的原始鏈補充資料，以及:guilabel:`財政編"
"號`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:545
msgid ""
"The printed representation uses the :ref:`default document layouts "
"<studio/pdf-reports/default-layout>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:553
msgid ""
"While an invoice is a document of type `I` (Ingreso), a credit note is a "
"document of type `E` (Egreso)."
msgstr ""
"發票屬於 `I`（Ingreso）類型的文件，而貸項通知單則屬於 `E`（Egreso）類型的文件"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:556
msgid ""
"In addition to the :doc:`standard credit notes flow "
"<../accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes>`, the |SAT| requires each "
"credit note to be linked to its corresponding invoice using the fiscal "
"folio."
msgstr ""
"除了:doc:`標準貸項通知單流程 <../accounting/customer_invoices/credit_notes>"
"`外，|SAT| 亦要求每張貸項通知單使用財政編號連結至其相應發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:560
msgid ""
"To comply with this requirement, the :guilabel:`CFDI Origin` field links the"
" original :abbr:`UUID (universally unique identifier)` using the prefix "
"`01|`, followed by its fiscal folio."
msgstr ""
"為符合此規定，:guilabel:`CFDI 來源` 欄位會連結原始的 :abbr:`UUID (通用唯一識"
"別碼)`，並使用前綴 `01|`，後接其財政編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:563
msgid ""
"When creating credit notes, make sure the line description clearly indicates"
" its purpose and specifies whether the entry applies to a bonus, a discount,"
" or a refund."
msgstr ""
"建立貸記單時，請確保項目說明清楚列明其用途，並指明該記項適用於獎金、折扣或退"
"款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:567
msgid ""
"To add the :guilabel:`CFDI Origin` field automatically, use the "
":guilabel:`Add Credit Note` button on the invoice instead of creating the "
"credit note manually."
msgstr ""
"如要自動加入 :guilabel:`CFDI 來源` 欄位，請使用發票上的 :guilabel:`新增貸記"
"單` 按鈕，而非手動建立貸記單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:569
msgid ""
"Credit notes generally reverse the main sales account defined on the "
"journal, but an account can also be assigned globally to all credit notes. "
"To do so, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` "
"and set the :guilabel:`Credit notes` account in the :guilabel:`Default "
"Accounts` section."
msgstr ""
"貸記單通常會沖銷日記賬上定義的主要銷售科目，但亦可為所有貸記單統一指派一個科"
"目。如要設定，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 設定`，並將 "
":guilabel:`貸記單` 科目設定於 :guilabel:`預設科目` 部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:573
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Payment Policy` can be set manually before signing the "
"document."
msgstr "簽署文件前，可手動設定 :guilabel:`付款政策`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:576
msgid ""
"In the default configuration, the credit notes account is set to "
":guilabel:`402.01.01 Returns, discounts or bonuses over sales and/or "
"services at the general rate`."
msgstr ""
"在預設設定中，貸項通知單科目設為 :guilabel:`402.01.01 按一般稅率計算的銷售及"
"／或服務退貨、折扣或獎金`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:584
msgid ""
"Vendor bills require a fiscal folio for accurate reporting and payment "
"processing. If a vendor bill is created via the Purchase app or manually, "
"attach its XML file as a chatter **log note** while the bill is in "
":guilabel:`Draft` status to update the fiscal folio accordingly."
msgstr ""
"供應商賬單需要財務憑證編號，以進行準確申報及付款處理。如果供應商賬單是透過「"
"採購」應用程式建立或手動建立，請在賬單處於 :guilabel:`草稿` 狀態時，將其 XML "
"檔案作為動態消息 **記錄備註** 附上，以相應更新財務憑證編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:589
msgid ""
"To refresh the :guilabel:`SAT status` field and confirm whether the XML file"
" is :guilabel:`Validated` with the |SAT|, click :guilabel:`Update SAT`. This"
" also applies to vendor bills."
msgstr ""
"如要重新整理 :guilabel:`SAT 狀態` 欄位並確認 XML 檔案是否處於 :guilabel:`已驗"
"證` 狀態（於 |SAT|），請按一下 :guilabel:`更新 SAT`。此操作亦適用於供應商賬單"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:594
msgid ":doc:`../accounting/vendor_bills`"
msgstr ":doc:`../accounting/vendor_bills`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:595
msgid ":ref:`l10n/mx/cfdi-documents`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:600
msgid "XML reader"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:602
msgid ""
"Invoices and vendor bills created in another software or directly with the "
"|SAT| can be uploaded, and the XML reader retrieves the data from the XML "
"file."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:605
msgid ""
"To create draft invoices or bills automatically, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices`. In the list view, "
"click :guilabel:`Upload` to select one or more XML files, or drag and drop "
"them directly into the list view."
msgstr ""
"要自動建立發票或賬單草稿，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 客戶 --> 發票`。在"
"列表檢視中，點擊 :guilabel:`上載` 以選擇一個或多個 XML 檔案，或直接將其拖放至"
"列表檢視中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:610
msgid ""
"XML files that are not issued to the company's |RFC| are not imported. The "
"file is still added to the chatter, with a message explaining that the "
"invoice does not belong to the company's |RFC|."
msgstr ""
"並非開立給公司 |RFC| 的 XML 檔案不會匯入。該檔案仍會新增至溝通欄，並附帶訊息"
"說明該發票不屬於公司的 |RFC|。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:613
msgid "The XML reader extracts the following information:"
msgstr "XML 讀取器會擷取以下資訊："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:615
msgid ""
"Contact details: Customer or vendor information, with new contacts created "
"if they do not exist."
msgstr "聯絡人資料：客戶或供應商資訊；若聯絡人尚未存在，系統將建立新的聯絡人。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:616
msgid "Product lines: Product descriptions and internal references included."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:617
msgid ""
"Taxes: :ref:`Local taxes <l10n/mx/local-taxes>` and :ref:`IEPS "
"<l10n/mx/ieps-breakdown>` amounts if not hidden."
msgstr ""
"稅項： :ref:`地方稅 <l10n/mx/local-taxes>` 及 :ref:`IEPS <l10n/mx/ieps-"
"breakdown>` 金額（如未隱藏）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:619
msgid ""
"Exchange rate: Foreign currency rates specified on the document, overriding "
"the configured rate."
msgstr "匯率：單據上指定的外幣匯率，會覆蓋已配置的匯率。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:620
msgid "Fields specific to the Mexican localization."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:622
msgid ""
"Products are matched on several criteria, including the vendor pricelists, "
"and the account of each line is determined by a predictive model."
msgstr ""
"系統會根據多項條件（包括供應商價目表）配對產品，並由預測模型決定每項明細行的"
"會計科目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:625
msgid ""
"Transaction and tax amounts are verified to the cent against the XML values,"
" and total amounts are logged in the chatter:"
msgstr "交易及稅項金額會與 XML 數值逐分核對，而總金額則會記錄在通訊欄中："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:628
msgid "If amounts match: No flags are generated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:629
msgid ""
"If amounts differ: An anomaly is flagged in the invoice list view, and a "
"banner on the document is displayed, recommending that the values be "
"checked. The import is not blocked."
msgstr ""
"如果金額不同：發票清單檢視會標記異常，文件上亦會顯示橫額，建議檢查相關數值。"
"匯入不會受阻。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:632
msgid ""
"Customer invoices created this way can generate *payment complements* and "
"can be canceled at any time. Clicking :guilabel:`Print` produces a PDF "
"document that includes all the corresponding information. The same applies "
"to vendor bills."
msgstr ""
"以此方式建立的客戶發票可產生*付款補充文件*，並可隨時取消。點擊 :guilabel:`列"
"印` 即可產生包含所有相關資料的 PDF 文件。供應商賬單亦同樣適用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:637
msgid ""
"To retrieve the :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio` of a draft invoice that already "
"exists, drag and drop the XML file into the chatter as a log note."
msgstr ""
"若要擷取現有草稿發票的 :guilabel:`財政編號`，請將 XML 檔案拖放至通訊欄作為記"
"錄備註。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:643
msgid "CFDI documents"
msgstr "CFDI 文件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:645
msgid ""
"The incoming |CFDI| XML files from the |SAT| are downloaded and generate "
"corresponding draft vendor bills and credit notes. To access them, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Review --> CFDI Documents (MX)`:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:649
msgid ""
"To enable the download, upload the company's e.firma (formerly known as "
"FIEL) to the :guilabel:`Certificates and Keys` section of the Settings app, "
"following the same steps as for the :ref:`digital seal certificate "
"<l10n/mx/certifications>`, and set the :guilabel:`Certificate scope` to "
":guilabel:`E Firma (FIEL)`. No other configuration is required."
msgstr ""
"要啟用下載功能，請前往設定應用程式的 :guilabel:`證書及密鑰` 部分，按照上載 "
":ref:`數碼印章證書 <l10n/mx/certifications>` 的相同步驟，上載公司的 e.firma（"
"前稱 FIEL），並將 :guilabel:`證書適用範圍` 設為 :guilabel:`E Firma (FIEL)`。"
"無需進行其他設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:653
msgid ""
"The downloaded files are processed by the :ref:`XML reader <l10n/mx/xml-"
"reader>`, which fills in the vendor information, product lines, taxes, and "
"fields specific to the Mexican localization. Each downloaded document is "
"compared with the documents already in the database, so only the missing "
"ones are created, and existing records are not duplicated."
msgstr ""
"下載的檔案會由 :ref:`XML 讀取器 <l10n/mx/xml-reader>` 處理，並填寫供應商資料"
"、產品資料行、稅項及墨西哥本地化專屬欄位。每份下載的文件都會與資料庫中現有的"
"文件比對，因此只會建立缺少的項目，而不會重複建立現有記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:657
msgid ""
"The list displays the :guilabel:`Datetime`, :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio`, "
":guilabel:`Receipt Type`, :guilabel:`RFC`, and :guilabel:`Sat State` of "
"every CFDI in the database. The :guilabel:`Sat State` column shows the "
"status of each document with the |SAT|. Click a line to open the related "
"document, and use the :guilabel:`Receipt Type` and :guilabel:`Datetime` "
"fields to filter the list."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:661
msgid ""
"Two requests are sent automatically every day: one for the invoices "
"received, and one for the credit notes received. The CFDIs issued by the "
"company can only be retrieved through a manual request."
msgstr ""
"系統每天會自動發送兩個請求：一個用於擷取收到的發票，另一個用於擷取收到的貸項"
"通知單。公司開立的 CFDI 只能透過手動請求擷取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:665
msgid ""
"To retrieve issued CFDIs, or documents from a specific period, such as those"
" issued by other software during the previous fiscal year, proceed as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""
"如要擷取已發出的 CFDI 或特定期間的文件（例如上一財政年度由其他軟件發出的文件"
"），請按以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:668
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`CFDI Documents` list view, click :guilabel:`Create CFDI "
"Request`."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`CFDI 文件` 列表檢視中，按一下 :guilabel:`建立 CFDI 請求`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:669
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`New CFDI Request` window, click :guilabel:`Last Week` or "
":guilabel:`Last Month`, or set the period manually in the :guilabel:`From - "
"To` fields."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`新增 CFDI 請求` 視窗中，按一下 :guilabel:`上週` 或 "
":guilabel:`上月`，或在 :guilabel:`由 - 至` 欄位中手動設定期間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:671
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Request Type` to :guilabel:`CFDI (Issued)` or "
":guilabel:`CFDI (Received)`."
msgstr ""
"將 :guilabel:`請求類型` 設為 :guilabel:`CFDI（已開立）` 或 :guilabel:`CFDI（"
"已收到）`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:672
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Receipt Type` to :guilabel:`I (Income)` or :guilabel:`E "
"(Credit Note)`."
msgstr ""
"將 :guilabel:`收據類型` 設為 :guilabel:`I（收入）` 或 :guilabel:`E（貸項通知"
"單）`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:673
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Send Request`."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`發送請求`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:675
msgid ""
"The request is processed in the background. To follow its status, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Review --> CFDI Requests`."
msgstr ""
"請求會在後台處理。如要追蹤其狀態，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 審閱 --> "
"CFDI 請求`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:679
msgid ""
"Download times depend on the |SAT| and range from a few minutes to several "
"days. In most cases, the request is completed within the same day."
msgstr ""
"下載時間取決於 |SAT|，需時由數分鐘至數天不等。在大多數情況下，請求會於當日內"
"完成。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:683
msgid ""
"Only invoices and credit notes are downloaded. Payments, payroll documents, "
"and Carta Porte documents are not."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:686
msgid ""
"There is no test environment for this feature: it requires the company's "
"real e.firma and the real data of the |SAT|."
msgstr "此功能沒有測試環境：需要公司的真實 e.firma 及 |SAT| 的真實資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:690
msgid ""
"The documents stored by the |SAT| do not contain addendas. If a development "
"depends on reading :ref:`addendas <l10n/mx/addendas-and-complements>`, do "
"not retrieve those documents this way."
msgstr ""
"由 |SAT| 儲存的文件不包含附錄。如開發項目需要讀取 :ref:`附錄 <l10n/mx/"
"addendas-and-complements>`，請勿透過此方式擷取這些文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:699
msgid ""
"To complete the :guilabel:`Address Issued` field on the sales journal, the "
":guilabel:`EDI for Mexico (Advanced Features)` (`l10n_mx_edi_extended`) "
"module must be :ref:`installed <general/install>`. This ensures that all "
"invoices from that sales journal, as well as :ref:`global invoices "
"<l10n/mx/global-invoice>`, use the correct ZIP code when generating the "
"|CFDI|."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:705
msgid ""
"To invoice within a company spanning multiple time zones with the same user,"
" create a system parameter that applies the correct time zone when "
"invoicing, as the user's time zone is used by default. To do so, follow "
"these steps:"
msgstr ""
"由於系統預設使用用戶的時區，如要以同一用戶在跨越多個時區的公司內開發票，請建"
"立一個系統參數，以便在開發票時套用正確時區。請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:709
msgid "Enable :doc:`developer mode <../../general/developer_mode>`."
msgstr "啟用 :doc:`開發人員模式 <../../general/developer_mode>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:710
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Settings --> Technical --> System Parameters`."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`設定 --> 技術 --> 系統參數`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:711
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`New` to create a parameter with the key "
"`l10n_mx_edi_tz_XX`, where `XX` is the ID of the journal."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`新增` 以建立鍵值為 `l10n_mx_edi_tz_XX` 的參數，其中 `XX` 為日"
"記賬的 ID。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:713
msgid "Set the desired time zone as the value, e.g., `America/Tijuana`."
msgstr "將所需的時區設為該值，例如 `America/Tijuana`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:723
msgid "Payment policy"
msgstr "付款政策"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:725
msgid ""
"Set the Mexican-specific :guilabel:`Payment Policy` field `according to the "
"two SAT payment classifications "
"<https://www.sat.gob.mx/consultas/92764/comprobante-de-recepcion-de-"
"pagos>`_:"
msgstr ""
"設定墨西哥專用的 :guilabel:`付款政策` 欄位（`根據兩項 SAT 付款分類 <https://"
"www.sat.gob.mx/consultas/92764/comprobante-de-recepcion-de-pagos>`_）："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:728
msgid ""
":guilabel:`PUE` (*Pago en una Sola Exhibición*): Payment in a Single "
"Exhibition"
msgstr ":guilabel:`PUE` (*Pago en una Sola Exhibición*)：單次付款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:729
msgid ""
":guilabel:`PPD` (*Pago en Parcialidades o Diferido*): Payment in "
"Installments or Deferred"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:732
msgid ""
"Payment complements are only generated if the policy of the invoice is set "
"to |PPD|."
msgstr "只有當發票的政策設為 |PPD| 時，系統才會產生付款補充文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:733
msgid ""
"If the invoice has a due date outside the current month, the policy defaults"
" to |PPD|."
msgstr "如果發票的到期日不在當月，政策將預設為 |PPD|。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:738
msgid "Payment flow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:740
msgid ""
":doc:`The payment process is the same <../accounting/payments>` for |PUE| or"
" |PPD|. Note that the payments for |PPD| invoices legally require a type `P`"
" (Pago) document to be sent to the government."
msgstr ""
":doc:`付款流程相同 <../accounting/payments>`，適用於 |PUE| 或 |PPD|。請注意，"
"為 |PPD| 發票付款時，法例規定必須向政府傳送 `P` (Pago) 類型文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:743
msgid "To register a payment for a PUE invoice, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:745
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:331
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Invoices`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:746
msgid "Select the relevant invoice and click :guilabel:`Pay`."
msgstr "選擇相關發票，然後點擊 :guilabel:`付款`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:747
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Pay` window, set the :guilabel:`Payment Way` and any other"
" necessary field."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`付款` 視窗中，設定 :guilabel:`付款方式` 及其他任何必要欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:751
msgid ":doc:`../accounting/payments`"
msgstr ":doc:`../accounting/payments`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:752
msgid ":doc:`../accounting/bank/reconciliation`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:754
msgid ""
"|PPD| invoice payments follow the same workflow. But, additional "
"requirements apply when creating :doc:`electronic documents "
"<../accounting/customer_invoices/electronic_invoicing>` to ensure proper "
"transmission to the |PAC|. |PPD| invoices do not require a "
":guilabel:`Payment Way` as it is set as *99 - To Define*. Consequently, the "
":guilabel:`Payment Way` of a payment **cannot** be set to :guilabel:`To "
"Define`, and the option does not exist."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:761
msgid ""
"If a bank account number is required, add it in the :guilabel:`Accounting` "
"tab of the customer's contact record."
msgstr "如需提供銀行賬戶號碼，請在客戶聯絡人記錄的 :guilabel:`會計` 分頁中新增。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:763
msgid ""
"Per |SAT| `Annex 20     "
"<http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/anexo_20.htm>`_ "
"guidelines, :guilabel:`Bank Account` numbers must contain 10 or 18 digits "
"for transfers, and 16 for credit or debit cards."
msgstr ""
"根據 |SAT| `附件 20     <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/"
"anexo_20.htm>`_ 指引，:guilabel:`銀行賬戶` 號碼在轉賬時必須包含 10 或 18 位數"
"字，信用卡或扣賬卡則必須為 16 位數字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:767
msgid ""
"If a fully reconciled payment is related to an invoice with a "
":guilabel:`Fiscal Folio`, the :guilabel:`Update Payments` button appears. "
"Click it to send the *payment complement* XML file to the government "
"automatically and display it in the :guilabel:`CFDI` tab of both the invoice"
" and the payment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:773
msgid ""
"Like invoices or credit notes, PDF and XML files can be sent to the final "
"customer. To do so, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` (:guilabel:`vertical "
"ellipsis`) icon on the payment and select :guilabel:`Send receipt by email`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:776
msgid ""
"To download the payment PDF from the invoice :guilabel:`CFDI` tab, "
"regardless of whether the payment was created with or without "
"reconciliation, click :guilabel:`Print`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:782
msgid "Payment cancellations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:784
msgid ""
"To cancel a :ref:`payment complement <l10n/mx/payment-flow>`, go to the "
":guilabel:`CFDI` tab of the related invoice and click :guilabel:`Cancel` on "
"the line of the payment complement."
msgstr ""
"要取消 :ref:`付款補充文件 <l10n/mx/payment-flow>`，請前往相關發票的 "
":guilabel:`CFDI` 分頁，然後在付款補充文件的資料行上按一下 :guilabel:`取消`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:787
msgid ""
"As with invoices, go to the payment and click :guilabel:`Update SAT` to "
"change the :guilabel:`SAT Status` and :guilabel:`Status` to "
":guilabel:`Cancelled`."
msgstr ""
"與發票一樣，前往付款並按一下 :guilabel:`更新 SAT`，將 :guilabel:`SAT 狀態` "
"及 :guilabel:`狀態` 變更為 :guilabel:`已取消`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:791
msgid ""
"When substituting a payment complement, unreconcile the current payment. "
"Then, to link the new payment to the original document, add `04|` followed "
"by the fiscal folio in the :guilabel:`CFDI Origin` field. If the new payment"
" is signed after the substituted document is linked, the older payment is "
"canceled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:801
msgid ""
"Factoring is a financial transaction in which a business sells its accounts "
"receivable, i.e., its outstanding invoices, to a specialized financial "
"institution known as a *factor*, to gain immediate liquidity."
msgstr ""
"保理（Factoring）是一種金融交易，企業將其應收賬款（即未結清的發票）出售給稱"
"為 *保理商* 的專業金融機構，以即時獲取流動資金。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:805
msgid "To record a payment for financial factoring, proceed as follows:"
msgstr "如要記錄應收帳款保理的付款，請按以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:807
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings`, scroll to "
"the :guilabel:`Default Accounts` section, and make sure an account is "
"selected in the :guilabel:`Factoring account` field."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 設定`，向下捲動至 :guilabel:`預設賬"
"戶` 部分，並確保已在 :guilabel:`保理賬戶` 欄位中選擇賬戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:810
msgid ""
"From the Accounting dashboard, click :guilabel:`Bank` on the corresponding "
"Kanban card to manually :ref:`add a transaction line "
"<accounting/transactions/register>` and record the factoring payment. "
"Complete the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"在會計儀表板上，按一下相應看板卡片上的 :guilabel:`銀行`，手動 :ref:`新增交易"
"明細行 <accounting/transactions/register>` 並記錄保理付款。請填寫以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:814
msgid ":guilabel:`Label`: Enter a brief description of the transaction."
msgstr ":guilabel:`標籤`：輸入交易的簡短說明。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:815
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Partner`: Select the financial institution, i.e., the factor, "
"that purchases the debt."
msgstr ":guilabel:`合作夥伴`：選擇購買債務的金融機構（即保理商）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:817
msgid ":guilabel:`Amount`: Enter the actual amount received from the factor."
msgstr ":guilabel:`金額`：輸入從保理商實際收到的金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:820
msgid ""
"The currency of the factoring payment **must** match the currency of the "
"bank journal."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:822
msgid ""
"On the newly created transaction line, click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` "
"(:guilabel:`vertical ellipsis`) icon and select :guilabel:`Reconcile`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:824
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Search: Journal Items to Match` window, remove the "
":guilabel:`Partner` filter, select the invoices to be paid by the factor, "
"and click :guilabel:`Select & Distribute`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`搜尋：要配對的日記賬項目` 視窗中，移除 :guilabel:`合作夥伴` 篩"
"選條件，選擇要由保理商支付的發票，然後點擊 :guilabel:`選擇及分配`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:828
msgid "Do not select the tax lines related to the invoices."
msgstr "請勿選擇與發票相關的稅項明細。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:830
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Distribute Payment` window, fill in the following fields "
"to distribute the payment over the selected invoices:"
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`分配付款` 視窗中，填寫以下欄位，將付款分配至所選發票："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:833
msgid ":guilabel:`Amount`: Enter the amount received from the factor."
msgstr ":guilabel:`金額`：輸入從保理商收到的金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:834
msgid ":guilabel:`Compensation`: Enter the compensation paid to the factor."
msgstr ":guilabel:`補償`：輸入支付予保理商的補償金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:837
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Amount` and :guilabel:`Compensation` amounts are provided by "
"the factor and are stated on the factoring receipt."
msgstr "保理收據上列明由保理商提供的 :guilabel:`金額` 及 :guilabel:`補償` 數額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:839
msgid ""
"Make sure the :guilabel:`Amount` and :guilabel:`Compensation` amounts equal "
"the :guilabel:`Due` amount. If they exceed it, the line is highlighted in "
"red."
msgstr ""
"請確保 :guilabel:`金額` 與 :guilabel:`補償` 的金額等於 :guilabel:`應付` 金額"
"。如超出該金額，該資料行會以紅色標示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:841
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`To distribute` field balances the :guilabel:`Amount` against "
"the transaction amount entered; it must equal zero."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:846
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Bank Matching` view, the factoring payment is then "
"reconciled with the relevant invoices, and the factoring commission is "
"allocated to the configured :guilabel:`Factoring` account."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`銀行配對`檢視中，保理付款隨後會與相關發票進行對帳，而保理佣金則"
"會分配至已設定的:guilabel:`保理`科目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:849
msgid ""
"To generate the XML file, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers -->"
" Invoices`, open one of the paid invoices, and click :guilabel:`Update "
"Payments`."
msgstr ""
"如要產生 XML 檔案，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 客戶 --> 發票`，開啟其中一"
"張已付款的發票，然後點擊 :guilabel:`更新付款`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:853
msgid ""
"The factoring company can retain a portion of the invoice amount, known as "
"*aforo*, until the end customer completes the payment. The retained balance "
"is then released to the vendor."
msgstr ""
"保理公司可保留部分發票金額，稱為 *aforo*，直至最終客戶完成付款為止。該保留餘"
"額隨後會發放予供應商。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:855
msgid ""
"For multi-currency factoring, use the :icon:`fa-sliders` (:guilabel:`adjust "
"settings`) button in the :guilabel:`Distribute Payment` window and add the "
":guilabel:`Due (Company)` column to display the due amount in the company's "
"currency."
msgstr ""
"如要進行多幣別保理，請按一下 :icon:`fa-sliders`（:guilabel:`調整設定`）按鈕，"
"該按鈕位於 :guilabel:`分配付款` 視窗內，然後新增 :guilabel:`到期金額（公司"
"）` 欄，以公司貨幣顯示到期金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:862
msgid "Invoice cancellations"
msgstr "取消發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:864
msgid ""
"The EDI documents sent to the |SAT| can be canceled. According to the "
"`Reforma Fiscal 2022 <https://www.sat.gob.mx/consultas/91447/nuevo-esquema-"
"de-cancelacion>`_, two requirements apply since January 1, 2022:"
msgstr ""
"傳送至 |SAT| 的 EDI 文件可以取消。根據 `Reforma Fiscal 2022 <https://"
"www.sat.gob.mx/consultas/91447/nuevo-esquema-de-cancelacion>`_，自 2022 年 1 "
"月 1 日起適用兩項規定："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:868
msgid "All cancellation requests require a *cancellation reason*."
msgstr "所有取消請求都必須提供 *取消原因*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:869
msgid ""
"After 24 hours from the invoice creation, the client must be asked to "
"approve the cancellation. If there is no response within 72 hours, the "
"cancellation is processed automatically."
msgstr ""
"建立發票後滿 24 小時，必須先要求客戶批准取消。如在 72 小時內未獲回覆，系統會"
"自動處理取消操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:872
msgid ""
"Invoice cancellations are updated automatically, but the update can take "
"some time. To check the cancellation status, click :guilabel:`Update SAT`."
msgstr ""
"發票取消狀態會自動更新，但更新可能需要一些時間。若要查看取消狀態，請點擊 "
":guilabel:`更新 SAT`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:875
msgid "Invoice cancellations can be made for one of the following reasons:"
msgstr "發票可因以下其中一個原因取消："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:877
msgid ":guilabel:`01 - Document issued with errors (with related document)`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`01 - 開立有誤的文件（附關聯文件）`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:878
msgid ":guilabel:`02 - Document issued with errors (no replacement)`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`02 - 發出有誤的文件（無替換）`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:879
msgid ":guilabel:`03 - The operation was not carried out`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`03 - 未執行操作`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:880
msgid ":guilabel:`04 - Nominative operation related to the global invoice`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`04 - 與匯總發票相關的記名操作`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:882
msgid ""
"To initiate a cancellation, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers "
"--> Invoices`, select the posted invoice to cancel, and click "
":guilabel:`Request Cancel`. Then, refer to the :ref:`l10n/mx/01-invoice-"
"cancellation` or :ref:`l10n/mx/02-03-04-invoice-cancellation` section, "
"depending on the cancellation reason."
msgstr ""
"若要發起取消，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 客戶 --> 發票`，選擇要取消的已"
"過帳發票，然後點擊 :guilabel:`請求取消`。然後，視乎取消原因，參閱 :ref:`l10n/"
"mx/01-invoice-cancellation` 或 :ref:`l10n/mx/02-03-04-invoice-cancellation` "
"部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:888
msgid ""
"Alternatively, request a cancellation from the :guilabel:`CFDI` tab by "
"clicking :guilabel:`Cancel` on the line item."
msgstr ""
"或者，你亦可在 :guilabel:`CFDI` 分頁中，點擊明細項目上的 :guilabel:`取消` 來"
"申請取消。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:892
msgid ""
"If a cancellation is requested in a locked period, the |CFDI| is canceled "
"but the accounting entry is not."
msgstr "如果在已鎖定期間內要求取消，|CFDI| 會被取消，但會計分錄不會被取消。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:894
msgid ""
"If the client rejects the cancellation, the invoice cancellation line item "
"is removed from the :guilabel:`CFDI` tab."
msgstr "若客戶拒絕取消，發票取消項目會從 :guilabel:`CFDI` 分頁中移除。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:900
msgid "Cancellation reason 01"
msgstr "取消原因 01"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:902
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Request CFDI Cancellation` pop-up window, select "
":guilabel:`01 - Document issued with errors (with related document)` in the "
":guilabel:`Reason` field and click :guilabel:`Create Replacement Invoice` to"
" create a new draft invoice. This new draft invoice replaces the previous "
"invoice, along with the related |CFDI|."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`申請取消 CFDI` 彈出式視窗中，選取 :guilabel:`01 - 簽發文件有誤"
"（附有關聯文件）` 作為 :guilabel:`原因` 欄位選項，然後點擊 :guilabel:`建立替"
"代發票` 以建立新的草稿發票。此新草稿發票將取代先前的發票及相關的 |CFDI|。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:907
msgid ""
"The invoice cancellation is then generated with a reason line item in the "
":guilabel:`CFDI` tab."
msgstr "發票取消記錄隨後會在 :guilabel:`CFDI` 分頁中產生，並附帶原因資料行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:909
msgid "Canceled invoice line item in the CFDI tab."
msgstr "CFDI 分頁中已取消的發票明細項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:913
msgid ""
"When using the :guilabel:`01 - Invoice issued with errors (with related "
"document)` cancellation reason, the `04|` prefix appears in the "
":guilabel:`Fiscal Folio` field. This is an internal prefix used to complete "
"the cancellation; it **does not** mean that the cancellation reason was "
":guilabel:`04 - Nominative operation related to the global invoice`."
msgstr ""
"使用:guilabel:`01 - 發票開立有誤（含關聯單據）`取消原因時，:guilabel:`財政憑"
"證號`欄位會顯示 `04|` 前綴。這是用於完成取消操作的內部前綴，**並不**代表取消"
"原因為:guilabel:`04 - 與總發票相關的記名交易`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:921
msgid "Cancellation reasons 02, 03, and 04"
msgstr "取消原因 02、03 及 04"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:923
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Request CFDI Cancellation` pop-up window, select the "
"desired cancellation :guilabel:`Reason` and click :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`申請取消 CFDI` 彈出視窗中，選擇所需的取消 :guilabel:`原因`，然"
"後點擊 :guilabel:`確認`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:926
msgid ""
"For the cancellation reasons `02`, `03`, and `04`, the :guilabel:`Create "
"Replacement Invoice` button is replaced by a :guilabel:`Confirm` button that"
" requests the cancellation immediately."
msgstr ""
"對於取消原因 `02`、`03` 及 `04`，:guilabel:`建立替代發票` 按鈕會被 "
":guilabel:`確認` 按鈕取代，點擊後會立即請求取消。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:929
msgid ""
"The invoice cancellation is then generated with a reason line item in the "
":guilabel:`CFDI` tab, where both the current :guilabel:`State` and "
":guilabel:`Cancellation Reason` are available."
msgstr ""
"系統隨即會建立發票取消記錄，並在 :guilabel:`CFDI` 分頁中顯示原因明細項目，當"
"中提供目前的 :guilabel:`狀態` 及 :guilabel:`取消原因`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:932
msgid "Cancellation reason and state in the CFDI tab."
msgstr "CFDI 分頁中的取消原因及狀態。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:936
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`SAT Status` goes back to :guilabel:`Validated`, it can be "
"due to one of the following reasons:"
msgstr "如果 :guilabel:`SAT 狀態` 變回 :guilabel:`已驗證`，可能是基於以下原因之一："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:939
msgid ""
"The invoice is labeled as *No Cancelable* on the `SAT website "
"<https://www.sat.gob.mx/home>`_ because it has a valid related document, "
"either another invoice linked through the :guilabel:`CFDI Origin` field or a"
" payment complement. In that case, cancel the related document first."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:943
msgid ""
"The cancellation request is still being processed by the |SAT|. In that "
"case, wait a few minutes and try again."
msgstr "取消請求仍由 |SAT| 處理中。在此情況下，請等候數分鐘後再試。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:945
msgid ""
"The final customer still has to reject or accept the cancellation request in"
" their `Buzón Tributario "
"<http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/BuzonTributario/Paginas/servicios_disponibles.html>`_."
" This can take up to 72 hours. If the cancellation request is rejected, "
"repeat the process."
msgstr ""
"最終客戶仍須在其 `Buzón Tributario <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/BuzonTributario/"
"Paginas/servicios_disponibles.html>`_ 內拒絕或接受取消請求，此過程最長可能需"
"要 72 小時。如果取消請求遭拒絕，請重複此流程。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:950
msgid ""
"`Tool to validate the status of Mexican electronic documents (CFDI) "
"<https://verificacfdi.facturaelectronica.sat.gob.mx/>`_"
msgstr ""
"`驗證墨西哥電子文件（CFDI）狀態的工具 <https://"
"verificacfdi.facturaelectronica.sat.gob.mx/>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:956
msgid "Cancellation acknowledgment"
msgstr "取消確認"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:958
msgid ""
"To print a |PAC| cancellation response after canceling a |CFDI|, click "
":guilabel:`Print` on the corresponding cancellation line in the "
":guilabel:`CFDI` tab of the invoice form."
msgstr ""
"要列印 |PAC| 取消回覆（在取消 |CFDI| 後），請點擊發票表單中相應取消明細行上"
"的 :guilabel:`列印`（位於 :guilabel:`CFDI` 分頁）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:961
msgid ""
"To include the current :guilabel:`SAT status` in the PDF, click "
":guilabel:`Update SAT` on the invoice form. When a payment is reviewed, the "
"invoice status is updated accordingly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:964
msgid "Cancellation acknowledgment example."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:968
msgid ""
"A cancellation acknowledgment confirms that the cancellation was requested "
"successfully, but it is *not* definitive proof that the |CFDI| has been "
"fully canceled."
msgstr "取消確認回執確認已成功提出取消請求，但這 *並非* |CFDI| 已完全取消的最終證明。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:974
msgid "Invoicing special use cases"
msgstr "發票特殊使用案例"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:979
msgid "CFDI relations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:981
msgid ""
"To relate the current document to previously signed CFDIs, fill in the "
":guilabel:`CFDI Origin` field on the invoice and specify the relation using "
"one of the seven available values:"
msgstr ""
"如要將目前文件關聯至先前已簽署的 CFDI，請在發票填寫 :guilabel:`CFDI 來源` 欄"
"位，並使用七個可用值之一指定關聯："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:984
msgid "`01`: Nota de crédito"
msgstr "`01`：貸項通知單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:985
msgid "`02`: Nota de débito de los documentos relacionados"
msgstr "`02`：相關文件的借項通知單"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:986
msgid "`03`: Devolución de mercancía sobre facturas o traslados previos"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:987
msgid "`04`: Sustitución de los CFDI previos"
msgstr "`04`: Sustitución de los CFDI previos"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:988
msgid "`05`: Traslados de mercancías facturados previamente"
msgstr "`05`: Traslados de mercancías facturados previamente"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:989
msgid "`06`: Factura generada por los traslados previos"
msgstr "`06`：Factura generada por los traslados previos（由先前轉移產生的發票）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:990
msgid "`07`: CFDI por aplicación de anticipo"
msgstr "`07`：CFDI por aplicación de anticipo"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:993
msgid ""
"The format is `Origin Type|UUID1, UUID2, ..., UUIDn`, and multiple origin "
"types can be added."
msgstr "格式為 `Origin Type|UUID1, UUID2, ..., UUIDn`，且可新增多個來源類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:996
msgid "The following value contains two relations:"
msgstr "以下數值包含兩個關聯："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1003
msgid "The first section has the relation type `04` with one UUID."
msgstr "第一部分包含關聯類型 `04` 及一個 UUID。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1004
msgid "The second section has the relation type `07` with two UUIDs."
msgstr "第二部分包含關係類型 `07` 及兩個 UUID。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1006
msgid "Every combination is also visible on the signed PDF."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1008
msgid "Signed PDF displaying three CFDI relations."
msgstr "已簽署的 PDF，顯示三項 CFDI 關聯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1016
msgid ""
"The main :guilabel:`Currency` in Mexico is MXN. While this is mandatory for "
"all Mexican companies, invoices and payments can be sent and received in "
"other currencies. After :ref:`enabling foreign currencies <multi-"
"currency/config-enable>`, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration"
" --> Settings`, and scroll down to the :guilabel:`Currencies` section to set"
" the automatic rate update. Under the :guilabel:`Automatic Currency Rates` "
"option, set :guilabel:`[MX] Bank of Mexico` as the :guilabel:`Service`, and "
"the :guilabel:`Interval` field to the desired frequency to update the "
"exchange rates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1024
msgid ""
"The XML file of the document then contains the correct exchange rate and the"
" total amount in both the foreign currency and MXN."
msgstr "該文件的 XML 檔案隨即會包含正確的匯率，以及以外幣和 MXN 顯示的總金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1027
msgid ""
"Using separate :doc:`bank accounts for each currency "
"<../accounting/bank/foreign_currency>` is highly recommended."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1031
msgid ""
"The only currencies whose exchange rate is updated daily are USD, EUR, GBP, "
"JPY, and CNY."
msgstr ""
"僅美元 (USD)、歐元 (EUR)、英鎊 (GBP)、日圓 (JPY) 及人民幣 (CNY) 的匯率會每日"
"更新。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1038
msgid ""
"Electronic documents sent to the |PAC| cannot contain negative lines, as "
"these can trigger errors. Therefore, when using :doc:`gift cards "
"<../../sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards>` or :doc:`loyalty "
"programs <../../sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount>`, the "
"resulting negative lines are translated in the XML file as regular "
":doc:`discounts <../../sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing>`."
msgstr ""
"傳送至 |PAC| 的電子文件不能包含負數資料行，否則可能會觸發錯誤。因此，當使用 "
":doc:`禮品卡 <../../sales/sales/products_prices/ewallets_giftcards>` 或 "
":doc:`忠誠度計劃 <../../sales/sales/products_prices/loyalty_discount>` 時，產"
"生的負數資料行會在 XML 檔案中轉換為一般 :doc:`折扣 <../../sales/sales/"
"products_prices/prices/pricing>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1045
msgid ""
"To set this up, go to :menuselection:`Sales --> Products --> Products` and "
"create a `Discounts` product with a valid :guilabel:`Tax`, usually "
":guilabel:`IVA` at `16%`."
msgstr ""
"要進行此設定，請前往 :menuselection:`銷售 --> 產品 --> 產品`，建立一個 `折"
"扣` 產品並設定有效的 :guilabel:`稅項`（通常為 :guilabel:`IVA` `16%`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1048
msgid ""
"Then, create and sign the invoice via |CFDI| and add the `Discounts` product"
" at the bottom. In the XML file, the discount is distributed evenly between "
"the lines and adds any rounding difference to a rounding product."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1053
msgid ""
"A `Discounts` product and a `UNSPSC Product Category` must be created for "
"each product variant related to gift cards or loyalty programs."
msgstr ""
"必須為每個與禮品卡或忠誠度計劃相關的產品變體建立一個 `Discounts` 產品及一個 "
"`UNSPSC Product Category`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1059
msgid "Down payments"
msgstr "預付款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1061
msgid ""
"Down payments are a common practice in Mexico. They are primarily used when "
"a payment is received for a good or a service whose product, price, or both "
"have not been fully determined."
msgstr ""
"預付款在墨西哥是一種常見做法。這種做法主要用於在貨品或服務的產品、價格或兩者"
"尚未完全確定時收取款項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1064
msgid ""
"The |SAT| allows two ways to handle this process; both involve linking all "
"invoices to one another with the :guilabel:`CFDI Origin` field."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1068
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1199
msgid ""
"The :doc:`Sales <../../sales/sales>` app must be installed for this process."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1071
msgid ""
"`Official documentation for the registration of down payments in Mexico "
"<http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/documentos/GuiaAnexo311221.pdf>`_"
msgstr ""
"`墨西哥預付款登記官方文件 <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/"
"Paginas/documentos/GuiaAnexo311221.pdf>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1077
msgid "Method A"
msgstr "方法 A"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1079
msgid ""
"This method consists of creating a down payment invoice, then an invoice for"
" the total amount, and finally a credit note for the down payment total."
msgstr ""
"此方法包括先建立預付款發票，然後建立總金額發票，最後建立預付款總額的貸項通知"
"單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1082
msgid ""
"First, create a sales order with the total amount and create a down payment "
"from it, either using a percentage or a fixed amount. Then, sign the "
"document via |CFDI| and register the payment."
msgstr ""
"首先，按總金額建立銷售訂單，並從中以百分比或固定金額建立預付款。然後，透過 "
"|CFDI| 簽署文件並登記付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1085
msgid ""
"When the time comes to issue the final invoice to the customer, create it "
"again from the same sales order. In the :guilabel:`Create Invoice` pop-up "
"window, select :guilabel:`Regular Invoice`, then delete the line that "
"contains the `Anticipo` product."
msgstr ""
"當需要向客戶開立最終發票時，請從同一張銷售訂單再次建立發票。在 :guilabel:`建"
"立發票` 彈出視窗中，選取 :guilabel:`一般發票`，然後刪除包含 `Anticipo` 產品的"
"資料行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1090
msgid ""
"When using down payments in the Mexican localization, make sure the "
":guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` of the products is set to :guilabel:`Ordered "
"quantities`. Otherwise, a customer credit note is created."
msgstr ""
"在墨西哥本地化功能中使用預付款項時，請確保產品的:guilabel:`開票政策`設"
"為:guilabel:`已訂購數量`。否則，系統將會建立客戶貸項通知單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1094
msgid ""
"Then, copy the :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio` of the down payment invoice and "
"paste it into the :guilabel:`CFDI Origin` field of the final invoice. Add "
"the `07|` prefix before the value and sign the document via |CFDI|."
msgstr ""
"然後，複製預付款發票的 :guilabel:`財政編號`，並貼上至最終發票的 "
":guilabel:`CFDI 來源` 欄位。在該數值前加上 `07|` 前綴，然後透過 |CFDI| 簽署文"
"件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1098
msgid ""
"Finally, create a credit note for the first invoice. Copy the "
":guilabel:`Fiscal Folio` of the final invoice and paste it into the "
":guilabel:`CFDI Origin` field of the credit note, adding the `07|` prefix. "
"Then, sign the document via |CFDI|."
msgstr ""
"最後，為第一張發票建立貸記單。複製最終發票的 :guilabel:`財政編號`，並貼上至貸"
"記單的 :guilabel:`CFDI 來源` 欄位，同時加上 `07|` 前綴。然後，透過 |CFDI| 簽"
"署文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1102
msgid ""
"All electronic documents are now linked to each other. The final step is to "
"fully pay the new invoice: at the bottom of the new invoice, the credit note"
" appears under :guilabel:`Outstanding credits`; add it as a payment. Then, "
"register the remaining amount with the :guilabel:`Pay` window."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1106
msgid ""
"On the sales order, all three documents appear as :guilabel:`In Payment`."
msgstr "在銷售訂單上，這三份文件都會顯示為:guilabel:`付款中`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1111
msgid "Method B"
msgstr "方法 B"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1113
msgid ""
"Another, simpler way to fulfill the |SAT| requirements consists of creating "
"only the down payment invoice and a second invoice for the remainder. This "
"method relies on negative lines being treated as discounts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1117
msgid ""
"Follow the same process as :ref:`Method A <l10n/mx/down-payments/method-a>` "
"up to the creation of the final invoice. Instead of deleting the line that "
"contains the down payment, rename the :guilabel:`Description` of the other "
"products to include the text `CFDI por remanente de un anticipo`. Add the "
":guilabel:`Fiscal Folio` of the down payment invoice in the :guilabel:`CFDI "
"Origin` field of the final invoice, with the `07|` prefix."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1123
msgid "Finally, sign the final invoice via |CFDI|."
msgstr "最後，透過 |CFDI| 簽署最終發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1128
msgid "Addendas and complements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1130
msgid ""
"An addenda is a code addition to an invoice XML file that provides extra "
"information beyond the legal requirements. It is added after the invoice has"
" been signed. A complement is a fiscal addition that reports specific fiscal"
" operations and is added before the invoice is signed. Only a limited number"
" of complements are available, and some are included by default."
msgstr ""
"附加資料是發票 XML 檔案中的代碼附加項，用於提供法律要求以外的額外資訊，並會在"
"發票簽署後加入。補充資料是匯報特定稅務操作的稅務附加項，會在發票簽署前加入。"
"目前僅提供有限數量的補充資料，部分會預設包含在內。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1136
msgid ""
"`SAT documentation on invoice complements "
"<https://www.sat.gob.mx/portal/public/tramites/complementos-de-factura>`_"
msgstr ""
"`有關發票補充資料的 SAT 文件 <https://www.sat.gob.mx/portal/public/tramites/"
"complementos-de-factura>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1139
msgid ""
"Both addendas and complements can be included in the XML file. To add one, "
"go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Addendas & "
"Complementos (MX)` and click :guilabel:`New` to enter the code to be "
"injected. Fields beyond the standard ones may be required."
msgstr ""
"XML 檔案中可同時包含附加資料及補充資料。若要新增，請前往 :menuselection:`會"
"計 --> 配置 --> 附加及補充資料 (MX)` 並點擊 :guilabel:`新增` 以輸入要插入的程"
"式碼。除了標準欄位外，可能還需要填寫其他欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1144
msgid ""
"This section may require technical knowledge and may add technical debt. "
"Contact the account manager for the best technical advice."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1147
msgid ""
"Once the desired nodes are created, they can be selected on each contact so "
"that they appear on every invoice addressed to that contact. By default, all"
" selected nodes are automatically added to every invoice."
msgstr ""
"建立所需節點後，即可在各個聯絡人中選取這些節點，使其顯示於發給該聯絡人的每張"
"發票上。預設情況下，所有已選取的節點都會自動加入每張發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1151
msgid ""
"Nodes can also be selected individually for each invoice from the "
":guilabel:`Addendas & Complementos` field in the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab."
msgstr ""
"你亦可透過 :guilabel:`Addendas & Complementos` 欄位（位於 :guilabel:`其他資"
"料` 分頁內），為每張發票個別選擇節點。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1155
msgid "More than one node can be added per contact or per invoice."
msgstr "每個聯絡人或每張發票可新增多於一個節點。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1160
msgid "CFDI to public"
msgstr "面向公眾的 CFDI"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1162
msgid ""
"The Mexican government requires that any good or service sold be backed up "
"by an invoice. If the customer does not require an invoice or has no |RFC|, "
"a *CFDI to public*, also known as a nominative invoice, must be created."
msgstr ""
"墨西哥政府規定，任何已售出的貨品或服務都必須有發票作為憑證。如客戶不需要發票"
"或沒有 |RFC|，則必須建立 *對公眾 CFDI*（亦稱為記名發票）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1166
msgid ""
"If the :guilabel:`CFDI to public` checkbox is ticked on a sales order or an "
"invoice, the final XML file overrides the data of the invoice contact and "
"adds the following characteristics:"
msgstr ""
"如果在銷售訂單或發票上勾選了 :guilabel:`向公眾開具 CFDI` 核取方塊，最終的 "
"XML 檔案會覆寫發票聯絡人的資料，並新增以下特徵："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1169
msgid ""
"|RFC|: `XAXX010101000` for a national customer, or `XEXX010101000` for a "
"foreign customer"
msgstr "|RFC|：國內客戶為 `XAXX010101000`，外國客戶為 `XEXX010101000`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1170
msgid ":guilabel:`ZIP` code: the ZIP code of the company"
msgstr ":guilabel:`郵遞區號` 代碼：公司的郵遞區號"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1171
msgid ":guilabel:`Usage`: `S01 - Without Fiscal Effects`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`用途`： `S01 - Without Fiscal Effects`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1173
msgid "CFDI to public checkbox on the invoice form."
msgstr "發票表單上的「向公眾開立 CFDI」核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1176
msgid ""
"If the final customer does not share any details, create a generic customer."
" Its name cannot be `PUBLICO EN GENERAL`, as this triggers an error; use "
"another name, such as `CLIENTE FINAL`."
msgstr ""
"如果最終客戶沒有提供任何資料，請建立一個通用客戶。其名稱不可為 `PUBLICO EN "
"GENERAL`，因為這會觸發錯誤；請改用其他名稱，例如 `CLIENTE FINAL`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1180
msgid ""
"By default, sending the invoice is not allowed if the partner has neither a "
":guilabel:`Country` nor a :guilabel:`ZIP` code set. This does not apply when"
" the :guilabel:`CFDI to public` checkbox is ticked."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，如果合作夥伴未設定:guilabel:`國家/地區`或:guilabel:`郵政編號`，則"
"不允許傳送發票。如果已剔選:guilabel:`向公眾發出 CFDI`核取方塊，則不適用此限制"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1185
msgid ""
"`Regla 2.7.1.21 Expedición de comprobantes en operaciones con el público en "
"general <https://www.sat.gob.mx/articulo/90959/regla-2.7.1.21>`_"
msgstr ""
"`Regla 2.7.1.21 Expedición de comprobantes en operaciones con el público en "
"general <https://www.sat.gob.mx/articulo/90959/regla-2.7.1.21>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1191
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1682
msgid "Global invoice"
msgstr "彙總發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1193
msgid ""
"If, at the end of a given period, which can vary from daily to bimonthly "
"depending on the company's legal needs and preferences, a customer still has"
" sales that were not marked as regular invoices or as individual *CFDI to "
"public* invoices, the |SAT| allows creating a single invoice containing all "
"the operations, known as a *global invoice*."
msgstr ""
"在指定期間結束時（可視乎公司的法律要求及偏好，由每日至每兩個月不等），如果客"
"戶仍有銷售未標記為一般發票或個別 *向公眾開立的 CFDI* 發票， |SAT| 容許建立包"
"含所有交易的單一發票，稱為 *彙總發票* 。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1202
msgid ""
"`Guía de llenado del CFDI global "
"<http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/documentos/GuiallenadoCFDIglobal311221.pdf>`_"
msgstr ""
"`CFDI 匯總填寫指南（Guía de llenado del CFDI global） <http://"
"omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/documentos/"
"GuiallenadoCFDIglobal311221.pdf>`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1210
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Global Invoice Serie` is specific to each branch or company "
"and defines the sequence of global invoices. To configure it, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Settings` and scroll to the"
" :guilabel:`MX Electronic invoicing` section. The :guilabel:`Global Invoice "
"Serie` field is located under :guilabel:`Service Tax Administration (SAT)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1215
msgid "Accounting settings of a Mexican company."
msgstr "墨西哥公司的會計設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1219
msgid "The default sequence for every company or branch is `GINV/`."
msgstr "每間公司或分公司的預設序列為 `GINV/`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1224
msgid "Sales flow"
msgstr "銷售流程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1226
msgid ""
"First, create a dedicated journal in :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Journals` to maintain a separate sequence for global "
"invoices, which function as orders when they are created."
msgstr ""
"首先，在:menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 日記賬`建立專用日記賬，以維護匯總發"
"票的獨立編號序列；這類發票在建立時會作為訂單運作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1229
msgid ""
"Then, make sure all the sales orders to be signed have the following "
"configuration:"
msgstr "然後，確保所有須簽署的銷售訂單均具備以下設定："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1231
msgid "The :guilabel:`CFDI to public` checkbox is ticked."
msgstr "已剔選 :guilabel:`向公眾開立的 CFDI` 核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1232
msgid "The :guilabel:`Invoice Status` is set to :guilabel:`To Invoice`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1234
msgid ""
"Next, in the Sales app, click :guilabel:`To Invoice`, select all the "
"relevant sales orders, and click :guilabel:`Create Invoices`. Make sure to "
"untick the :guilabel:`Consolidated Billing` checkbox, then click "
":guilabel:`Create Draft`."
msgstr ""
"接著，在銷售應用程式中，點擊 :guilabel:`待開發票`，選擇所有相關的銷售訂單，然"
"後點擊 :guilabel:`建立發票`。請務必取消剔選 :guilabel:`合併帳單` 核取方塊，然"
"後點擊 :guilabel:`建立草稿`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1238
msgid ""
"In the list of draft invoices displayed, select all of them, click "
":icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions`, and select :guilabel:`Confirm entries`. "
"Then, select all the posted invoices again and, from the same :icon:`fa-cog`"
" :guilabel:`Actions` menu, select :guilabel:`Create Global Invoice`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1243
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Create Global Invoice` window, select the "
":guilabel:`Periodicity` recommended by an accountant and use the "
":guilabel:`Date` field to specify the period to invoice. Then, click "
":guilabel:`Create`. Verify that all the invoices are signed under the same "
"XML file and share the same :guilabel:`Fiscal Folio`."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`建立總發票`視窗中，選擇會計師建議的:guilabel:`週期`，並使"
"用:guilabel:`日期`欄位指定要開立發票的期間。然後點擊:guilabel:`建立`。請確認"
"所有發票均以同一份 XML 檔案簽署，並共用相同的:guilabel:`財政編號`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1249
msgid ""
"The selected :guilabel:`Date` is only used to extract the *month* and the "
"*year* for the XML file. For the bimonthly periodicity, the month determines"
" the period declared as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1252
msgid ""
"Months 1 to 12: standard month number, e.g., January is 1 and February is 2"
msgstr "1 至 12 月：標準月份數字，例如 1 月為 1，2 月為 2"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1253
msgid "January and February: 13"
msgstr "一月及二月：13"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1254
msgid "March and April: 14"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1255
msgid "May and June: 15"
msgstr "五月及六月：15"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1256
msgid "July and August: 16"
msgstr "7 月及 8 月：16"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1257
msgid "September and October: 17"
msgstr "九月及十月：17"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1258
msgid "November and December: 18"
msgstr "11 月及 12 月：18"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1260
msgid ""
"Global invoices created this way do not include a PDF attachment, as their "
"information is already available in the database and is not meant to be seen"
" by customers."
msgstr ""
"以此方式建立的總括發票不會附帶 PDF 附件，因為其資料已儲存在資料庫中，且並非供"
"客戶查閱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1264
msgid ""
"Selecting the date 01/12/2026 with the monthly periodicity declares month 12"
" and year 2026."
msgstr "選擇日期 01/12/2026 並將週期設為每月，即會申報 2026 年 12 月。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1265
msgid ""
"Selecting the date 01/12/2026 with the bimonthly periodicity declares month "
"18 and year 2026."
msgstr "選擇日期 01/12/2026 並設定雙月週期時，會申報第 18 個月及 2026 年。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1266
msgid ""
"Selecting the date 01/12/2026 with the daily periodicity declares month 12 "
"and year 2026."
msgstr "選擇日期 01/12/2026 並設定每日週期，即會申報 2026 年 12 月。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1269
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Show` in the :guilabel:`CFDI` tab to display the list of "
"all related invoices."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :guilabel:`顯示`（位於 :guilabel:`CFDI` 分頁內），即可顯示所有相關發票的"
"清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1270
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Cancel` in the :guilabel:`CFDI` tab to cancel the global "
"invoice in both the |SAT| and the database."
msgstr ""
"按一下 :guilabel:`取消`（位於 :guilabel:`CFDI` 分頁中），即可同時在 |SAT| 及"
"資料庫中取消總括發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1276
msgid "Electronic accounting reports"
msgstr "電子會計報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1278
msgid ""
"In Mexico, `electronic accounting "
"<https://www.sat.gob.mx/aplicacion/42150/envia-tu-contabilidad-"
"electronica>`_ refers to the obligation to keep accounting records and "
"entries electronically, and to submit accounting information monthly through"
" the |SAT| website."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1283
msgid "It consists of three main XML files:"
msgstr "它由三個主要的 XML 檔案組成："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1285
msgid "The updated list of the chart of accounts currently in use"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1286
msgid ""
"A monthly trial balance, plus a closing entry report, also known as the "
"*trial balance month 13*"
msgstr "每月試算表，加上結賬分錄報表（亦稱為 *第 13 個月試算表*）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1287
msgid ""
"An export of the journal entries in the general ledger, which is optional "
"except in the case of a compulsory audit"
msgstr "匯出總賬中的日記賬記項（除非須進行強制審計，否則屬可選項目）"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1290
msgid ""
"The resulting XML files follow the requirements of the `Anexo Técnico de "
"Contabilidad Electrónica 1.3 "
"<https://www.gob.mx/cms/uploads/attachment/file/151135/Anexo24_05012015.pdf>`_."
msgstr ""
"產生的 XML 檔案符合 `Anexo Técnico de Contabilidad Electrónica 1.3 <https://"
"www.gob.mx/cms/uploads/attachment/file/151135/Anexo24_05012015.pdf>`_ 的要求"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1293
msgid ""
"In addition, the |DIOT| can be generated: a report of the vendors' journal "
"entries involving IVA taxes, which can be exported as a TXT file."
msgstr ""
"此外，亦可產生 |DIOT|：該報表載有涉及 IVA 稅項的供應商日記賬分錄，並可匯出為 "
"TXT 檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1297
msgid "The following modules must be installed to use these reports:"
msgstr "必須安裝以下模組才可使用這些報表："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1299
msgid ":guilabel:`Odoo Mexican Localization Reports` (`l10n_mx_reports`)"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Odoo 墨西哥本地化報告` (`l10n_mx_reports`)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1300
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Mexico - Month 13 Trial Balance` (`l10n_mx_reports_closing`)"
msgstr ":guilabel:`墨西哥 - 第 13 個月試算表` (`l10n_mx_reports_closing`)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1301
msgid ":guilabel:`Odoo Mexican XML Polizas Export` (`l10n_mx_xml_polizas`)"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Odoo 墨西哥 XML Polizas 匯出` (`l10n_mx_xml_polizas`)"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1303
msgid ""
"The chart of accounts and the trial balance month 13 reports are available "
"in :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Trial Balance`. The |DIOT| "
"report is available in :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Tax "
"Report`."
msgstr ""
"會計科目表及第 13 個月試算表報表可於 :menuselection:`會計 --> 報表 --> 試算"
"表` 查看。|DIOT| 報表可於 :menuselection:`會計 --> 報表 --> 稅務報表` 查看。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1308
msgid ""
"The specific characteristics and obligations of the reports to be submitted "
"can change depending on the fiscal regime. Always contact an accountant "
"before sending any document to the government."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1316
msgid ""
"The :doc:`chart of accounts <../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>` "
"in Mexico follows a specific pattern based on the |SAT| documentation "
"`Código agrupador de cuentas "
"<http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/fichas_tematicas/buzon_tributario/Documents/codigo_agrupador.pdf>`_."
msgstr ""
"墨西哥的 :doc:`會計科目表 <../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>` 遵循"
"特定模式，該模式以 |SAT| 文件 `Código agrupador de cuentas <http://"
"omawww.sat.gob.mx/fichas_tematicas/buzon_tributario/Documents/"
"codigo_agrupador.pdf>`_ 為基礎。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1320
msgid ""
"Any account can be created as long as it respects the |SAT| encoding group; "
"the pattern is `NNN.XX.YY`, `NNN.XX.YYY`, or `NNN.XX.YYY.ZZ`."
msgstr ""
"只要符合 |SAT| 編碼分組，即可建立任何會計科目；其格式為 "
"`NNN.XX.YY`、`NNN.XX.YYY` 或 `NNN.XX.YYY.ZZ`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1324
msgid ""
"`102.01.99`, `401.01.001`, and `401.01.001.16` are valid account codes."
msgstr "`102.01.99`、`401.01.001` 及 `401.01.001.16` 均為有效的科目代碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1326
msgid ""
"The structure is validated when a new account is created in "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Chart of Accounts`."
msgstr ""
"在 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 會計科目表` 建立新會計科目時，系統會驗證"
"該結構。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1329
msgid ""
"Once all the accounts are created, make sure the correct :guilabel:`Tags` "
"are added, as they mark the nature of the account."
msgstr ""
"建立所有帳戶後，請確保已新增正確的 :guilabel:`標籤`，因為標籤會標示帳戶的性質"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1332
msgid ""
"Due to the account hierarchy on parent accounts, set the appropriate "
":guilabel:`Parent Account` on each account to create a hierarchy for the "
"reports. Accounts without a parent are level 1 accounts, accounts below them"
" are level 2, and so on."
msgstr ""
"由於上級賬戶的賬戶層級架構，請為每個賬戶設定適當的 :guilabel:`上級賬戶`，以建"
"立報表的層級結構。沒有上級賬戶的賬戶為第 1 級賬戶，其下的賬戶為第 2 級賬戶，"
"如此類推。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1337
msgid ""
"Active accounts must be longer than five digits, or they trigger errors in "
"the report. By By default, accounts are flagged in yellow if the numbering "
"could cause issues later."
msgstr ""
"使用中的科目編號必須超過五位數，否則會在報表中觸發錯誤。預設情況下，如果編號"
"日後可能導致問題，科目會以黃色標記。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1339
msgid ""
"If an account is shorter than five characters, mark it as inactive so that "
"the validations do not apply to it."
msgstr "如果會計科目少於五個字元，請將其標記為非活躍，以免驗證套用於該科目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1341
msgid ""
"Accounts shorter than three characters are not reported in the XML files. "
"This is useful to classify accounts."
msgstr "少於三個字元的會計科目不會在 XML 檔案中申報。此特性有助於將科目分類。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1343
msgid ""
"As a good practice, keep only last-level accounts active and all parent "
"accounts inactive. This prevents accounting errors, while parent accounts "
"still appear in the reports."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1346
msgid ""
"Once everything is set up, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting "
"--> Trial Balance`. Click the :icon:`fa-cog` (:guilabel:`gear`) icon and "
"select :guilabel:`SAT (XML)` to generate an XML file containing all the "
"accounts. This XML file is ready to be uploaded to the |SAT| website."
msgstr ""
"完成所有設定後，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 報告 --> 試算表`。點擊 "
":icon:`fa-cog`（:guilabel:`齒輪`）圖示，然後選擇 :guilabel:`SAT (XML)`，以產"
"生包含所有會計科目的 XML 檔案。此 XML 檔案已準備好上載至 |SAT| 網站。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1355
msgid ""
"The trial balance reports the initial balance, the credits, and the total "
"balances of the accounts, provided that their :ref:`numbering "
"<l10n/mx/chart-of-accounts>` is correct."
msgstr ""
"試算表會報告各賬戶的期初餘額、貸方金額及總餘額，前提是其 :ref:`編號 <l10n/mx/"
"chart-of-accounts>` 正確無誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1358
msgid ""
"To generate an XML file of the trial balance, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Trial Balance` and select the "
"date. Click the :icon:`fa-cog` (:guilabel:`gear`) icon and select "
":guilabel:`SAT (XML)`. Then, in the :guilabel:`Export SAT` window, select "
"the appropriate :guilabel:`Submit Type`, depending on whether the trial "
"balance is :guilabel:`Normal` or :guilabel:`Supplementary`."
msgstr ""
"如要產生試算表的 XML 檔案，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 報表 --> 試算表` "
"並選擇日期。點擊 :icon:`fa-cog`（:guilabel:`齒輪`）圖示，然後選擇 "
":guilabel:`SAT (XML)`。接著，在 :guilabel:`匯出 SAT` 視窗中，選擇適當的 "
":guilabel:`提交類型`，視乎試算表屬於 :guilabel:`一般` 還是 :guilabel:`補充`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1367
msgid "Month 13"
msgstr "第 13 個月"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1369
msgid ""
"The *month 13* report is a closing balance sheet that shows the adjustments "
"or movements made in the accounting to close the year."
msgstr ""
"*第 13 個月* 報表是一份期末資產負債表，顯示為進行年結而在會計上作出的調整或變"
"動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1372
msgid ""
"To generate this XML file, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Accounting "
"--> Journal Entries` and create a new entry. Add all the amounts to modify "
"and balance the debits and credits for each one."
msgstr ""
"要產生此 XML 檔案，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 會計 --> 日記賬記項`，並建"
"立新記項。加入所有要修改的金額，並平衡每一項的借方及貸方金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1375
msgid ""
"Then, go to the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab and tick the :guilabel:`Month 13 "
"Closing` checkbox. If needed, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting"
" --> Trial Balance` and select the :guilabel:`Month 13` date to display the "
"total amount of the year, plus all the additions of the journal entry. To "
"generate the XML file, click the :icon:`fa-cog` (:guilabel:`gear`) icon, "
"then select :guilabel:`SAT (XML)`."
msgstr ""
"然後，前往 :guilabel:`其他資訊` 分頁，並勾選 :guilabel:`第 13 個月結算` 核取"
"方塊。如有需要，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 報告 --> 試算表` 並選擇 "
":guilabel:`第 13 個月` 日期，即可顯示全年總金額及該日記賬分錄的所有新增項目。"
"要產生 XML 檔案，請按一下 :icon:`fa-cog`（:guilabel:`齒輪`）圖示，然後選擇 "
":guilabel:`SAT (XML)`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1386
msgid ""
"By law, all transactions in Mexico must be recorded digitally. As the "
"underlying journal entries for all invoices and payments are created "
"automatically, exporting the general ledger is enough to comply with |SAT| "
"audits and tax refunds."
msgstr ""
"根據法律規定，墨西哥的所有交易都必須以數碼方式記錄。由於系統會自動為所有發票"
"及付款建立相關的日記賬分錄，因此只需匯出總分類賬，便足以符合 |SAT| 審計及退稅"
"的要求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1391
msgid "The report can be filtered by period or by journal."
msgstr "報告可按期間或日記賬篩選。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1393
msgid ""
"To create the XML file, go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> "
"General Ledger`, click the :icon:`fa-cog` (:guilabel:`gear`) icon, then "
"click :guilabel:`XML (Polizas)`. Then, select one of the four "
":guilabel:`Export` types:"
msgstr ""
"要建立 XML 檔案，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 報告 --> 總分類賬`，點擊 "
":icon:`fa-cog`（:guilabel:`齒輪`）圖示，然後點擊 :guilabel:`XML (Polizas)`。"
"接著，選擇以下四種 :guilabel:`匯出` 類型之一："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1397
msgid ":guilabel:`Tax audit`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`稅務審計`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1398
msgid ":guilabel:`Audit certification`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`審計認證`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1399
msgid ":guilabel:`Return of goods`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`退貨`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1400
msgid ":guilabel:`Compensation`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`抵銷`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1402
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Tax audit` and :guilabel:`Audit certification`, add the "
":guilabel:`Order Number` provided by the |SAT|. For :guilabel:`Return of "
"goods` and :guilabel:`Compensation`, add the :guilabel:`Process Number`, "
"also provided by the |SAT|."
msgstr ""
"如屬:guilabel:`稅務稽查`及:guilabel:`審計認證`，請加入:guilabel:`指令編號`（"
"由 |SAT| 提供）。如屬:guilabel:`退貨`及:guilabel:`補償`，請加入:guilabel:`處"
"理編號`（同樣由 |SAT| 提供）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1407
msgid ""
"To view this report without sending it, use `ABC6987654/99` as the "
":guilabel:`Order Number` or `AB123451234512` as the :guilabel:`Process "
"Number`."
msgstr ""
"如要在不傳送的情況下檢視此報表，請使用 `ABC6987654/99` 作為 :guilabel:`訂單編"
"號`，或使用 `AB123451234512` 作為 :guilabel:`處理編號`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1413
msgid "DIOT report"
msgstr "DIOT 報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1415
msgid ""
"The |DIOT| is an additional obligation to the |SAT| that provides the "
"current status of the creditable and non-creditable payments, withholdings, "
"import taxes, and VAT refunds on vendor bills."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1418
msgid ""
"Unlike other reports, the |DIOT| is uploaded to a |SAT|-provided website "
"that contains the A-29 form. All transaction records can be downloaded as a "
"TXT file with 54 columns. This file can be uploaded to the form, reducing "
"the data to add manually."
msgstr ""
"與其他報表不同，|DIOT| 會上傳至由 |SAT| 提供的網站，該網站載有 A-29 表格。所"
"有交易記錄均可下載為包含 54 欄的 TXT 檔案。此檔案可上傳至該表格，從而減少需手"
"動輸入的資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1422
msgid ""
"The transactions file contains the total amount of the payments registered "
"on vendor bills, broken down by the corresponding types of IVA. The "
":guilabel:`VAT`, :guilabel:`Country`, and :guilabel:`Type of operation` "
"fields are mandatory for all vendors."
msgstr ""
"交易檔案包含已登記在供應商賬單上的付款總額，並按相應的 IVA 類型細分。對所有供"
"應商而言，:guilabel:`增值稅`、:guilabel:`國家/地區` 及 :guilabel:`操作類型` "
"欄位均為必填。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1426
msgid ""
"To download the |DIOT| report as a TXT file, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Tax Report`. Select the desired"
" month, click the :icon:`fa-cog` (:guilabel:`gear`) icon, and select "
":guilabel:`DIOT (txt)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1430
msgid ""
"When new taxes are created in the database, two types of tags are available."
" Tags containing `tax` go into the tax distribution, and the ones with the "
"base name go on the base of the tax. All the lines of a VAT tax **must** "
"contain at least one tax grid."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1435
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Type of Operation` field must be filled in the "
":guilabel:`Accounting` tab of each vendor to prevent validation errors. Make"
" sure foreign customers have their :guilabel:`Country` set."
msgstr ""
"必須填寫:guilabel:`操作類型`欄位（位於每位供應商的:guilabel:`會計`分頁內），"
"以免發生驗證錯誤。請確保已為外國客戶設定:guilabel:`國家/地區`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1439
msgid ""
"Selecting :guilabel:`87 - Global Operations` merges all the vendors that are"
" part of the global operations under the generic VAT `XAXX010101000` in the "
"final TXT file."
msgstr ""
"選擇 :guilabel:`87 - 全球營運` 會將所有屬於全球營運的供應商，在最終 TXT 檔案"
"中合併至通用增值稅編號 `XAXX010101000` 之下。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1445
msgid "Accounting reports"
msgstr "會計報表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1447
msgid ""
"The :ref:`balance sheet <l10n/mx/balance-sheet>` and the :ref:`profit and "
"loss <l10n/mx/profit-loss>` reports follow the Mexican financial reporting "
"standards."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1455
msgid ""
"This report is based on the NIF B-6 standard and is divided into assets, "
"liabilities, and equity, which reflect the current financial state of the "
"company."
msgstr ""
"此報表基於 NIF B-6 標準編製，並分為資產、負債及權益三個部分，以反映公司的當前"
"財務狀況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1463
msgid ""
"This report is based on the NIF B-3 standard and is divided into income, "
"operating expenses, comprehensive financial results (RIF), and taxes, which "
"help identify the net profit or the financial position of a company."
msgstr ""
"此報表基於 NIF B-3 準則編製，分為收入、營運開支、綜合財務結果（RIF）及稅項，"
"有助識別公司的淨利潤或財務狀況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1470
msgid "Foreign trade"
msgstr "對外貿易"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1472
msgid ""
"Foreign trade is a complement to a regular invoice that adds values to both "
"the XML and PDF files of invoices addressed to a foreign customer, according"
" to the `SAT regulations "
"<http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/complemento_comercio_exterior.htm>`_,"
" such as:"
msgstr ""
"根據 `SAT 法規 <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/"
"complemento_comercio_exterior.htm>`_，外貿是一般發票的補充項目，會為發給外國"
"客戶的發票 XML 及 PDF 檔案新增數值，例如："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1476
msgid "The specific address of the receiver and of the sender"
msgstr "收件人及寄件人的具體地址"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1477
msgid "A :guilabel:`Tariff Fraction` that identifies the type of product"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1478
msgid "The correct :doc:`../accounting/customer_invoices/incoterms`"
msgstr "正確的 :doc:`../accounting/customer_invoices/incoterms`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1479
msgid ""
"Additional information, such as the *certificate of origin* and *special "
"units of measure*"
msgstr "額外資料，例如 *產地來源證* 及 *特殊計量單位*"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1481
msgid ""
"This allows the correct identification of exporters and importers, and "
"expands the description of the merchandise sold."
msgstr "這可確保準確識別出口商及進口商，並補充所售貨品的詳細說明。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1484
msgid ""
"Since January 1, 2018, foreign trade is a requirement for taxpayers who "
"carry out export operations of type A1. While the current |CFDI| is 4.0, the"
" foreign trade complement is on version 2.0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1488
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`EDI for Mexico (Advanced Features)` (`l10n_mx_edi_extended`) "
"module must be installed to use this feature."
msgstr ""
"必須安裝 :guilabel:`墨西哥 EDI（進階功能）`（`l10n_mx_edi_extended`）模組，方"
"可使用此功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1492
msgid ""
"Before installing the module, confirm that the business needs this feature; "
"consult an accountant if needed."
msgstr "安裝模組前，請確認業務是否需要此功能；如有需要，請諮詢會計師。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1495
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`CFDI to public` checkbox must be ticked when creating foreign"
" invoices."
msgstr "建立海外發票時，必須剔選 :guilabel:`對公眾開立 CFDI` 核取方塊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1507
msgid ""
"To configure the company contact for foreign trade, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Customers`, remove the default "
":guilabel:`Customer Invoices` filter, and select the company name:"
msgstr ""
"若要設定用於外貿的公司聯絡人，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 客戶 --> 客"
"戶`，移除預設的 :guilabel:`客戶發票` 篩選條件，然後選擇公司名稱："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1511
msgid ""
"While the |CFDI| 4.0 requirements include a valid :guilabel:`ZIP` code in "
"the company contact record, the foreign trade complement also requires that "
"the :guilabel:`City` and :guilabel:`State` be valid. All three fields must "
"match the `official SAT catalog for Carta Porte "
"<http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/catalogos_emision_cfdi_complemento_ce.htm>`_,"
" or an error occurs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1518
msgid ""
"Add the :guilabel:`City` and :guilabel:`State` in the *contact record* of "
"the company, not in the company record itself."
msgstr ""
"請在公司的 *聯絡人記錄*（而非公司記錄本身）中新增:guilabel:`城"
"市`及:guilabel:`州／省`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1521
msgid ""
"On the contact record, the optional :guilabel:`Locality` and "
":guilabel:`Colony Code` fields can also be filled in. These two fields must "
"also match the data of the |SAT|."
msgstr ""
"在聯絡人記錄上，亦可填寫選填的 :guilabel:`地區` 及 :guilabel:`社區代碼` 欄位"
"。這兩個欄位亦必須與 |SAT| 的資料相符。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1523
msgid ""
"All contacts require a foreign trade value, even if the feature itself is "
"not used. The default value for all contacts is :guilabel:`Does not apply`, "
"which corresponds to the value `01` used on all invoices with no complement."
" Four other values are available depending on the need, and the value is "
"copied automatically onto the new invoices created for the contact."
msgstr ""
"所有聯絡人都必須設定外貿數值，即使本身沒有使用該功能亦然。所有聯絡人的預設數"
"值為 :guilabel:`不適用`，對應數值 `01`，用於所有沒有補充資料的發票。系統另提"
"供四個其他數值供不同情況選用，而該數值會自動複製至為該聯絡人建立的新發票上。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1528
msgid ""
"To configure the contact data of a foreign receiving client, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Customers` and select the "
"contact of the foreign client. The following fields must be completed on the"
" contact form to avoid errors:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1532
msgid ""
"Full company :guilabel:`Address`, including a valid :guilabel:`ZIP` code and"
" the foreign :guilabel:`Country` - Foreign :guilabel:`Tax ID` in the correct"
" format, e.g., `123456789-1` for Colombia - :guilabel:`External Trade`, in "
"the :guilabel:`Sales & Purchase` tab"
msgstr ""
"完整的公司 :guilabel:`地址`，包括有效的 :guilabel:`郵政編碼` 及外國 "
":guilabel:`國家/地區` - 正確格式的外國 :guilabel:`稅務編號`，例如哥倫比亞的 "
"`123456789-1` - :guilabel:`對外貿易`，位於 :guilabel:`銷售及採購` 分頁"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1537
msgid ""
"In the resulting XML and PDF files, the :guilabel:`Tax ID` is automatically "
"replaced by the generic VAT for foreign transactions, `XEXX010101000`."
msgstr ""
"在產生的 XML 及 PDF 檔案中，系統會自動將 :guilabel:`稅務編號` 替換為境外交易"
"通用的增值稅編號 `XEXX010101000`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1545
msgid ""
"All products involved in foreign trade require four additional fields, two "
"of which are exclusive to foreign trade:"
msgstr "所有涉及對外貿易的產品都需要四個額外欄位，其中兩個為對外貿易專用："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1548
msgid ":guilabel:`Reference` (:guilabel:`General Information` tab)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1549
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Weight` (:guilabel:`Inventory` tab): Must be greater than `0`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1550
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tariff Fraction` (:guilabel:`Accounting` tab): Refer to the "
"`VUCEM tariff fraction classifier "
"<https://www.ventanillaunica.gob.mx/vucem/Clasificador.html>`_ to find the "
"correct value."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1553
msgid ""
":guilabel:`UMT Aduana` (:guilabel:`Accounting` tab): Must match the "
":guilabel:`Tariff Fraction`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1555
msgid "Required foreign trade product fields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1559
msgid ""
"If the UoM code of the :guilabel:`Tariff Fraction` is `01`, the correct "
":guilabel:`UMT Aduana` is `kg`."
msgstr ""
"如果 :guilabel:`關稅分類` 的計量單位（UoM）代碼為 `01`，正確的 "
":guilabel:`UMT Aduana` 應為 `kg`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1561
msgid ""
"If the UoM code of the :guilabel:`Tariff Fraction` is `06`, the correct "
":guilabel:`UMT Aduana` is `Units`."
msgstr ""
"如果 :guilabel:`關稅分類` 的計量單位代碼為 `06`，則正確的 :guilabel:`UMT "
"Aduana` 為 `Units`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1569
msgid ""
"Foreign trade invoices require converting product prices into a foreign "
"currency, such as USD. Therefore, :ref:`multicurrency and automatic currency"
" rates must be enabled <l10n/mx/multicurrency>`. To convert product prices, "
"create a :doc:`pricelist <../../sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing>`"
" in the foreign currency."
msgstr ""
"外貿發票需要將產品價格轉換為外幣（例如美元）。因此，:ref:`必須啟用多幣種及自"
"動匯率 <l10n/mx/multicurrency>`。如要轉換產品價格，請建立外幣 :doc:`價目表 "
"<../../sales/sales/products_prices/prices/pricing>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1574
msgid ""
"Then, with the correct exchange rate set up, open the invoice, fill in the "
":guilabel:`Incoterm`, and optionally set the :guilabel:`Certificate Source` "
"field in the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab. The :guilabel:`External Trade` "
"value can also be changed on a per-invoice basis from that tab."
msgstr ""
"設定正確匯率後，開啟發票，填寫 :guilabel:`國際貿易術語`，並可在 :guilabel:`憑"
"證來源` 分頁中選擇性設定 :guilabel:`其他資料` 欄位。您亦可在該分頁中按個別發"
"票更改 :guilabel:`對外貿易` 的值。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1579
msgid ""
"The exchange rates have a one-day offset, so a new database needs two days "
"to get the expected rate. Add the rate manually to the day prior if it is "
"needed sooner."
msgstr ""
"匯率有一天的時間差，因此新數據庫需要兩天才能取得預期匯率。如需要提早使用，請"
"手動為前一天新增匯率。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1582
msgid ""
"Finally, confirm the invoice as a regular invoice and click :guilabel:`Send`"
" to sign it via |CFDI|."
msgstr "最後，將發票確認為一般發票，並點擊 :guilabel:`傳送` 以透過 |CFDI| 進行簽署。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1587
msgid "Invoicing services"
msgstr "開立服務發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1589
msgid ""
"Services and merchandise can be invoiced together on the same invoice if the"
" service is set up correctly. To do so, proceed as follows:"
msgstr "只要正確設定服務，即可將服務與商品在同一張發票上開立。請按以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1592
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Products` and open the "
"relevant service form."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 客戶 --> 產品`，然後開啟相關服務表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1593
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab, under the :guilabel:`UNSPSC` section, "
"click the :icon:`east` (:guilabel:`internal link`) icon of the "
":guilabel:`UMT Aduana` field."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`會計` 分頁的 :guilabel:`UNSPSC` 部分中，按一下 "
":icon:`east`（:guilabel:`內部連結`）圖示（:guilabel:`UMT Aduana` 欄位）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1595
msgid ""
"Verify that either the :guilabel:`UNSPSC Category` is set to :guilabel:`E48 "
"service unit` or the :guilabel:`Customs code` is set to `99`."
msgstr ""
"確認:guilabel:`UNSPSC 類別`已設為:guilabel:`E48 服務單位`，或:guilabel:`海關"
"代碼`已設為 `99`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1598
msgid ""
"Invoicing with either of these codes sets the service price to `0` for "
"customs declarations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1605
msgid ""
"The :doc:`Point of Sale <../../sales/point_of_sale>` adaptation of the "
"Mexican localization enables the creation of invoices that comply with the "
"|SAT| requirements directly from the POS register. It also allows creating "
"receipt tickets that enable *self-invoicing* through a dedicated portal, as "
"well as global invoices."
msgstr ""
"墨西哥本地化版本的 :doc:`銷售點 <../../sales/point_of_sale>` 功能，可直接從 "
"POS 收銀機建立符合 |SAT| 規定的發票。它亦支援建立可透過專用門戶網站 *自助開立"
"發票* 的收據票據，以及建立彙總發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1613
msgid "Point of sale flow"
msgstr "銷售點流程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1615
msgid ""
"On top of the standard :ref:`Point of Sale configuration "
"<pos/use/settings>`, the Mexican localization requires each payment method "
"to be configured with a correct :guilabel:`Payment Way` and a :guilabel:`Re-"
"invoicing account` to handle the accounting of the invoices created from the"
" self-invoicing portal."
msgstr ""
"除了標準的:ref:`銷售點配置 <pos/use/settings>`外，墨西哥本地化版本要求為每種"
"付款方式配置正確的:guilabel:`付款途徑`及:guilabel:`重新開立發票賬戶`，以處理"
"透過自助開票入口網站建立的發票會計入賬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1621
msgid ""
"By default, preconfigured payment methods are created for cash, credit card,"
" and debit card, and assigns the :guilabel:`402.04.01 Re-invoicing` account "
"as the default re-invoicing account."
msgstr ""
"系統預設會為現金、信用卡及扣帳卡建立預先配置的付款方式，並將 "
":guilabel:`402.04.01 重新開立發票` 帳戶指派為預設的重新開立發票帳戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1624
msgid ""
"While :ref:`selling from the POS register <pos/use/sell>`, follow these "
"steps:"
msgstr "在 :ref:`透過 POS 收銀機銷售 <pos/use/sell>` 時，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1626
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Customer` to create or select a customer. The customer "
"invoicing information, such as the |RFC| or the :guilabel:`Fiscal Regime`, "
"can be reviewed and modified directly within the session."
msgstr ""
"按一下:guilabel:`客戶`以建立或選擇客戶。你可直接在工作階段內檢視及修改客戶開"
"票資料，例如 |RFC| 或:guilabel:`稅務制度`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1629
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Payment`, then click :icon:`fa-file-text-o` "
":guilabel:`Invoice`."
msgstr "點擊:guilabel:`付款`，然後點擊:icon:`fa-file-text-o` :guilabel:`發票`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1630
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Additional Invoicing Information` window, select the "
":guilabel:`Usage` and define whether the document is a CFDI to public. Then "
"click :guilabel:`Ok`."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`其他發票資料`視窗中，選擇:guilabel:`用途`，並指定該文件是否為面"
"向公眾的 CFDI，然後點擊:guilabel:`確定`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1632
msgid ""
"Select the payment method, then click :guilabel:`Validate` to complete the "
"order."
msgstr "選擇付款方式，然後按一下 :guilabel:`驗證` 以完成訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1633
msgid ""
"The PDF file is then downloaded, and the invoice and receipt are emailed to "
"the final customer."
msgstr "系統隨即會下載 PDF 檔案，並將發票及收據透過電郵發送給最終客戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1636
msgid ""
"To create invoices from orders, go to the :guilabel:`Orders` menu, select "
"the order, click :guilabel:`Load Order`, and click :icon:`fa-file-text-o` "
":guilabel:`Invoice` to open the same menu for the :guilabel:`Usage` and "
":guilabel:`CFDI to public` fields."
msgstr ""
"如要從訂單建立發票，請前往 :guilabel:`訂單` 選單，選擇訂單，點擊 "
":guilabel:`載入訂單`，然後點擊 :icon:`fa-file-text-o` :guilabel:`發票`，以開"
"啟包含 :guilabel:`用途` 及 :guilabel:`對公眾的 CFDI` 欄位的相同選單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1640
msgid "Invoice configuration in the Point of Sale."
msgstr "銷售點中的發票設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1643
msgid ""
"To sign a credit note automatically, click :icon:`fa-file-text-o` "
":guilabel:`Invoice` when processing a :ref:`refund <pos/use/refund>`."
msgstr ""
"若要自動簽署貸項通知單，請點擊 :icon:`fa-file-text-o` :guilabel:`發票`（於處"
"理 :ref:`退款 <pos/use/refund>` 時）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1647
msgid ""
"Credit notes for returned products contain the relation type :guilabel:`03 -"
" Devolución de mercancía sobre facturas o traslados previos`."
msgstr ""
"已退回產品的貸記單包含關聯類型 :guilabel:`03 - Devolución de mercancía sobre "
"facturas o traslados previos`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1651
msgid ""
"In the Mexican localization, positive and negative lines cannot be mixed in "
"a POS session."
msgstr "在墨西哥本地化設定中，POS 營業時段內不能同時包含正數及負數資料行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1652
msgid ""
"If a |SAT| validation error occurs, the customer receives a :doc:`pro-forma "
"invoice <../../sales/sales/invoicing/proforma>` instead."
msgstr ""
"如果發生 |SAT| 驗證錯誤，客戶將會改為收到 :doc:`形式發票 <../../sales/sales/"
"invoicing/proforma>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1658
msgid "Self-invoicing portal"
msgstr "自助開立發票門戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1660
msgid ""
"If the final customer does not request an invoice during checkout, a receipt"
" with a QR code or URL can be provided instead. To do so, proceed as "
"follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1663
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> Settings`."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`POS 銷售點 --> 配置 --> 設定`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1664
msgid "Select the point of sale."
msgstr "選擇銷售點。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1665
msgid "Scroll to the :guilabel:`Bills & Receipts` section."
msgstr "向下捲動至 :guilabel:`賬單及收據` 部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1666
msgid "Enable :guilabel:`Self-service invoicing`."
msgstr "啟用 :guilabel:`自助開立發票`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1667
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Print` field to :guilabel:`QR code`, :guilabel:`URL`, or "
":guilabel:`QR code + URL`."
msgstr ""
"將 :guilabel:`列印` 欄位設為 :guilabel:`二維碼`、:guilabel:`網址` 或 "
":guilabel:`二維碼 + 網址`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1670
msgid ""
"Customers who scan the QR code or follow the URL access a menu where they "
"can add their fiscal information, including the :guilabel:`Usage` and "
":guilabel:`Fiscal Regime`."
msgstr ""
"客戶掃描二維碼或點擊網址後，即可進入選單新增其稅務資料，包括:guilabel:`用"
"途`及:guilabel:`稅務制度`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1673
msgid ""
"In the session's journal entries, the selected re-invoicing account is used "
"to handle reversals of sales entries when invoices are requested, and serves"
" as the sales account for new invoices."
msgstr ""
"在該營業時段的日記賬分錄中，所選的重新開立發票科目會在客戶要求開立發票時處理"
"銷售分錄的沖銷，並用作新發票的銷售科目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1677
msgid ":ref:`Refunds in the Point of Sale <pos/use/refund>`"
msgstr ":ref:`銷售點退款 <pos/use/refund>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1684
msgid ""
"As with regular sales orders, global invoices can be created from the POS "
"register."
msgstr "與一般銷售訂單一樣，可從 POS 收銀機建立匯總發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1686
msgid "To do so, follow these steps:"
msgstr "請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1688
msgid ""
"Make sure no customer and no invoice option are selected in the payment "
"menu."
msgstr "請確保在付款選單中沒有選取任何客戶或發票選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1689
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-bars` (:guilabel:`menu`) icon, then :icon:`fa-angle-"
"left` :guilabel:`Backend`."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :icon:`fa-bars`（:guilabel:`選單`）圖示，然後點擊 :icon:`fa-angle-left` "
":guilabel:`後台`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1691
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Orders --> Orders` and select all "
"the orders to invoice."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`銷售點 --> 訂單 --> 訂單`，然後選擇所有需要開立發票的訂"
"單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1692
msgid ""
"Click :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`Actions`, and select :guilabel:`Create "
"Global Invoice`."
msgstr "點擊:icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`動作`，然後選擇:guilabel:`建立匯總發票`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1693
msgid ""
"As with :ref:`sales orders <l10n/mx/global-invoice/sales-flow>`, select "
"appropriate :guilabel:`Periodicity`, then click :guilabel:`Create`."
msgstr ""
"與 :ref:`銷售訂單 <l10n/mx/global-invoice/sales-flow>` 相同，選擇合適的 "
":guilabel:`週期性`，然後按一下 :guilabel:`建立`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1695
msgid ""
"An XML file is then attached to each selected order. Download these files "
"from the :guilabel:`CFDI` tab, where the invoice can also be canceled if "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"系統隨即會將一個 XML 檔案附加至每張所選訂單。請在 :guilabel:`CFDI` 分頁下載這"
"些檔案；如有需要，亦可在此取消發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1698
msgid ""
"If one of the orders on the global invoice must be addressed to a customer, "
"the invoice can still be sent. To do so, open the POS register and click "
":guilabel:`Orders`. Then, change the :guilabel:`Active` filter to "
":guilabel:`Paid`, select the order, and click :icon:`picture_as_pdf` "
":guilabel:`Invoice`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1704
msgid ""
"Global invoices, like regular invoices, can only be grouped by physical "
"address. The address is determined by the one set on the POS invoice "
"journal, so a warning is displayed when attempting to invoice two addresses."
msgstr ""
"綜合發票與一般發票一樣，只可按實體地址分組。地址取決於 POS 發票日記賬中所設定"
"的地址，因此當嘗試為兩個地址開立發票時，系統會顯示警告。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1709
msgid ":ref:`Total rounding <l10n/mx/invoices/total-rounding>`"
msgstr ":ref:`總額捨入 <l10n/mx/invoices/total-rounding>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1716
msgid ""
"The :doc:`eCommerce <../../websites/ecommerce>` adaptation of the Mexican "
"localization adds a step to the checkout to create invoices that comply with"
" the |SAT| requirements. It collects the customer's fiscal data, "
"automatically signs invoices once payment is processed, sends the files to "
"customers via email, and grants them access to their PDF files from the "
"customer portal."
msgstr ""
"墨西哥本地化的 :doc:`電子商務 <../../websites/ecommerce>` 適配功能在結賬時新"
"增了一個步驟，以建立符合 |SAT| 要求的發票。系統會收集客戶的稅務資料，在處理付"
"款後自動簽署發票，透過電郵將檔案傳送給客戶，並讓客戶從客戶門戶網站存取其 PDF "
"檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1724
msgid "eCommerce flow"
msgstr "電子商務流程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1726
msgid ""
"During the checkout process, an :guilabel:`Invoicing info` step is added, "
"which asks :guilabel:`Do you need an invoice?`:"
msgstr ""
"在結賬過程中，系統會新增一個 :guilabel:`發票資料` 步驟，詢問 :guilabel:`您需"
"要發票嗎？`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1729
msgid ""
"Clicking :guilabel:`I don't need an invoice` skips the step and proceeds to "
"the payment."
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`我不需要發票` 會跳過此步驟並繼續進行付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1730
msgid ""
"Clicking :guilabel:`Yes` displays the fiscal fields, which are all required "
"to issue the invoice:"
msgstr "點擊 :guilabel:`是` 會顯示稅務欄位，開立發票時必須填寫所有該等欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1732
msgid ":guilabel:`RFC`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`RFC`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1734
msgid ":guilabel:`Fiscal Regime`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`稅務制度`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1736
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1762
msgid ":guilabel:`Payment Way`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1737
msgid ""
":guilabel:`IEPS Breakdown` (optional): Enable to request the :ref:`IEPS "
"breakdown <l10n/mx/ieps-breakdown>`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`IEPS 明細`（選填）：啟用即可請求提供:ref:`IEPS 明細 <l10n/mx/ieps-"
"breakdown>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1740
msgid ""
"The information is then completed on the sales order, whose status changes "
"to :guilabel:`To Invoice`."
msgstr "隨後資料會在銷售訂單上完成填寫，其狀態會變更為 :guilabel:`待開立發票`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1744
msgid ""
"Make sure to add a :guilabel:`UNSPSC Product Category` to the :ref:`shipping"
" product <ecommerce/checkout/delivery>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1747
msgid ""
"If :guilabel:`Automatic Invoicing` is enabled in :menuselection:`Website -->"
" Configuration --> Settings`, under the :guilabel:`Invoicing` section, the "
"electronic document is signed automatically."
msgstr ""
"若已啟用:guilabel:`自動開立發票`（位於:menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 設"
"定`的:guilabel:`開立發票`部分），電子文件將會自動簽署。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1750
msgid ""
"When no invoice is requested, the sales order is marked as :guilabel:`CFDI "
"to public`. A :ref:`CFDI to public <l10n/mx/cfdi>` invoice is only created "
"if :guilabel:`Automatic Invoicing` is enabled; otherwise, the sales order "
"keeps the information without being invoiced."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1759
msgid ""
"The Sales app includes fields that simplify invoicing. These fields do not "
"affect sales behavior, but are transferred to the invoice upon creation, "
"including:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1767
msgid ""
"Invoice previews for customer validation can be enabled by installing the "
":doc:`pro-forma invoice <../../sales/sales/invoicing/proforma>` feature, "
"which adds the fields listed above to the sales order, along with:"
msgstr ""
"安裝 :doc:`形式發票 <../../sales/sales/invoicing/proforma>` 功能即可啟用供客"
"戶確認的發票預覽，此功能會將上述欄位加至銷售訂單，以及："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1771
msgid ":guilabel:`Product code`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`產品編碼`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1772
msgid ":guilabel:`Unit code`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1773
msgid ":guilabel:`Fiscal regime`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1780
msgid ""
"For subscriptions, all the sales fields are used to create the recurring "
"invoices. These invoices are signed and sent by email automatically, with "
"the PDF and XML files attached, requiring no additional manual action."
msgstr ""
"對於訂閱項目，所有銷售欄位都會用於建立定期發票。系統會自動簽署並以電郵傳送這"
"些發票，並附上 PDF 及 XML 檔案，無須額外人手操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1785
msgid ""
"All invoices generated by the Subscriptions app are always signed "
"automatically, without exception."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1791
msgid "Inventory"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1796
msgid "Customs numbers"
msgstr "海關編號"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1798
msgid ""
"A *customs declaration* (Pedimento Aduanero) is a fiscal document certifying"
" that all contributions to the fiscal entity, i.e., the |SAT|, have been "
"paid, including for the import and export of goods."
msgstr ""
"*報關單* （Pedimento Aduanero）是一份財政文件，用於證明已向稅務機關（即 "
"|SAT| ）繳付所有稅款，包括貨物的進出口稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1801
msgid ""
"According to `Annex 20 "
"<http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/anexo_20.htm>`_ of the "
"|CFDI| 4.0, in documents where the invoiced goods come from a first-hand "
"import operation, the :guilabel:`Customs Number` field must be added to all "
"the product lines involved in the operation, as well as the date of the "
"document."
msgstr ""
"根據 `附件 20 <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/"
"anexo_20.htm>`_（|CFDI| 4.0），在發票貨品來自一手進口業務的文件中，必須為所有"
"涉及該業務的產品資料行加入 :guilabel:`海關編號` 欄位以及文件日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1807
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Odoo Mexico Localization for Stock/Landing` "
"(`l10n_mx_edi_landing`) module must be installed, in addition to the "
":doc:`Inventory <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory>`, :doc:`Purchase "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/purchase>`, and :doc:`Sales <../../sales/sales>` "
"apps."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1812
msgid ""
"Do not confuse this feature with foreign trade. Customs numbers are directly"
" related to importing goods, while the foreign trade complement is related "
"to exporting. Consult an accountant before making any modifications."
msgstr ""
"請勿將此功能與對外貿易混淆。海關編號直接與進口貨物相關，而對外貿易補充資料則"
"與出口相關。進行任何修改前，請先諮詢會計師。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1821
msgid ""
"The correct customs number for a specific invoice is tracked through "
":doc:`landed costs "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/landed_costs>`. Go to"
" :menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Settings` and, in the "
":guilabel:`Valuation` section, make sure :guilabel:`Landed Costs` is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1827
msgid ""
"Adding a :guilabel:`Default Journal` automatically fills in the mandatory "
":guilabel:`Journal` field on landed costs, even though landed costs that "
"only add customs numbers, without :guilabel:`Additional Costs`, do not "
"create journal entries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1831
msgid "Then, configure the goods-type products that hold the customs numbers:"
msgstr "然後，設定包含海關編號的貨物類型產品："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1833
msgid "Create the products and complete the following three requirements:"
msgstr "建立產品並完成以下三項要求："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1835
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tracking` **must** be set to either :guilabel:`By Lots` or "
":guilabel:`By Unique Serial Number`, but **not** :guilabel:`By Quantity`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`追蹤` **必須** 設為 :guilabel:`按批次` 或 :guilabel:`按唯一序號`，"
"但 **不可** 設為 :guilabel:`按數量`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1837
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Invoicing Policy` **must** be set to :guilabel:`Delivered "
"quantities`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1838
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab, the :doc:`Valuation by Lots/Serial "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots>` "
"option **must** be enabled in the :guilabel:`Traceability` section."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`庫存` 分頁中，:doc:`按批次/序號估值 <../../inventory_and_mrp/"
"inventory/inventory_valuation/valuation_by_lots>` 選項 **必須** 在 "
":guilabel:`可追溯性` 部分啟用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1842
msgid ""
"Then, an additional :guilabel:`Customs invoicing` field appears in the "
":guilabel:`Accounting` tab: enable the option to use custom numbers with "
"this product."
msgstr ""
"隨後，額外的 :guilabel:`海關發票` 欄位會顯示在 :guilabel:`會計` 分頁中：啟用"
"該選項即可為此產品使用自訂編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1845
msgid ""
"Make sure the product has a :guilabel:`Product Category` with the following "
"configuration:"
msgstr "請確保產品所屬的 :guilabel:`產品類別` 具有以下設定："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1847
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Inventory Valuation`: either :guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)` or"
" :guilabel:`Perpetual (at invoicing)`"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`存貨估值`：:guilabel:`定期（結算時）` 或 :guilabel:`永續（開發票時"
"）`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1849
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Costing Method`: either :guilabel:`Average Cost (AVCO)` or "
":guilabel:`First In First Out (FIFO)`"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`成本計價方法`：:guilabel:`平均成本 (AVCO)` 或 :guilabel:`先進先出 "
"(FIFO)`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1853
msgid ""
"The feature works regardless of whether the :doc:`inventory valuation "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet>` is set "
"to :guilabel:`Periodic (at closing)` or :guilabel:`Perpetual (at "
"invoicing)`."
msgstr ""
"無論 :doc:`存貨估值 <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/"
"cheat_sheet>` 設為 :guilabel:`定期（結賬時）` 或 :guilabel:`永續（開立發票時"
"）`，此功能均可運作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1860
msgid "Purchase and sales flow"
msgstr "採購及銷售流程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1862
msgid ""
"After configuring the product, follow the standard :doc:`purchase flow "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/purchase>`:"
msgstr "設定產品後，請依照標準:doc:`採購流程 <../../inventory_and_mrp/purchase>`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1865
msgid ""
":ref:`Create a purchase order <purchase/manage_deals/create-new-rfq>` and "
"confirm it."
msgstr ":ref:`建立採購訂單 <purchase/manage_deals/create-new-rfq>`並確認。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1866
msgid "Click :guilabel:`Receive Products`, and :guilabel:`Validate`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1867
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Operations --> Landed Costs` and create "
"a new record."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`庫存 --> 作業 --> 到岸成本` 並建立新記錄。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1868
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Transfer` field, add the receipt that was just validated, "
"then add the :guilabel:`Customs number`."
msgstr "在 :guilabel:`調撥` 欄位加入剛驗證的收貨單，然後加入 :guilabel:`海關編號`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1872
msgid ""
"While costs related to the customs number can be added at this stage, "
"creating a landed cost from a vendor bill issued by a customs agent is "
"highly recommended. Learn more about :doc:`landed costs "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/landed_costs>`."
msgstr ""
"雖然在此階段可加入與海關編號相關的費用，但強烈建議從報關代理商發出的供應商帳"
"單建立到岸成本。進一步了解 :doc:`到岸成本 <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/"
"inventory_valuation/landed_costs>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1877
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Customs number` field is not editable once set and cannot be "
"repeated. However, the lot number or serial number can be fixed later by "
"selecting a different landed cost."
msgstr ""
"設定後，:guilabel:`海關編號`欄位不可再編輯，亦不可重複。不過，稍後仍可透過選"
"擇不同的到岸成本來修正批次編號或序列號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1880
msgid "Customs number on a landed cost record."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1883
msgid ""
"The customs number assigned to a specific lot or serial number is available "
"on its record in :menuselection:`Inventory --> Products --> Lots/Serial "
"Numbers`. The :guilabel:`L10N Mx Edi Landed Cost` field can be edited at any"
" time to fix mistakes made when registering the landed cost. Editing this "
"field automatically updates the :guilabel:`Customs number` and the name of "
"the lot or serial number."
msgstr ""
"特定批次或序號獲分配的海關編號，可在 :menuselection:`庫存 --> 產品 --> 批次／"
"序號` 中的記錄內查看。如需修正登記到岸成本時的錯誤，可隨時編輯 "
":guilabel:`L10N Mx Edi 到岸成本` 欄位。編輯此欄位會自動更新 :guilabel:`海關編"
"號` 及該批次或序號的名稱。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1889
msgid ""
"Next, :ref:`create a sales order <sales/create_quotations/create-quotation>`"
" and :ref:`confirm it <sales/create_quotations/send-and-confirm>`. Click the"
" :guilabel:`Delivery` smart button and carefully review the assigned lots "
"and serial numbers to make sure they are the desired values. Then, click "
":guilabel:`Validate` on the delivery order."
msgstr ""
"接下來，:ref:`建立銷售訂單 <sales/create_quotations/create-quotation>"
"`並:ref:`確認訂單 <sales/create_quotations/send-and-confirm>`。點"
"擊:guilabel:`送貨`智能按鈕，並仔細核對已指派的批次及序號，確保數值正確無誤。"
"然後，在送貨單上點擊:guilabel:`驗證`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1894
msgid ""
"Finally, :ref:`create an invoice from the sales order "
"<accounting/invoice/invoice-from-sales>` and confirm it. The invoice lines "
"are created according to the delivery order's distribution. If more than one"
" customs number is selected, the invoice lines are split by quantity and "
"customs number."
msgstr ""
"最後，:ref:`從銷售訂單建立發票 <accounting/invoice/invoice-from-sales>`並確認"
"。發票明細會根據送貨單的分配建立。如果選擇了多於一個海關編號，發票明細將按數"
"量及海關編號分拆。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1899
msgid "Customs number on a confirmed sales order product."
msgstr "已確認銷售訂單產品的海關編號。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1907
msgid ""
"A `Carta Porte <https://www.sat.gob.mx/portal/public/tramites/complemento-"
"carta-porte>`_ is a bill of lading, a document stating the type, quantity, "
"and destination of the goods being carried."
msgstr ""
"`Carta Porte <https://www.sat.gob.mx/portal/public/tramites/complemento-"
"carta-porte>`_ 是一種提單，即列明所運送貨物類型、數量及目的地的文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1910
msgid ""
"On July 17, 2024, version 3.1 of this |CFDI| was implemented for all "
"transportation providers, intermediaries, and owners of goods. A document of"
" type `T` (Traslado) is generated, which, unlike other documents, is created"
" on a delivery order instead of an invoice or a payment."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1914
msgid ""
"XML and PDF files are generated with or without ground transport, and "
"materials treated as *dangerous hazards* are processed."
msgstr ""
"不論是否涉及陸路運輸，系統均會生成 XML 及 PDF 檔案，並處理被視為 *危險品* 的"
"物料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1917
msgid ""
"To print the PDF file, the delivery order must be signed by the |PAC|. It "
"can then be printed using the :guilabel:`Print Carta Porte` button on the "
"delivery order."
msgstr ""
"要列印 PDF 檔案，送貨單必須先由 |PAC| 簽署。之後，可使用送貨單上的 "
":guilabel:`列印 Carta Porte` 按鈕列印。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1921
msgid ""
"The PDF file contains a QR code that allows the authorities to verify the "
"CCP code."
msgstr "PDF 檔案包含一個 QR 碼，可供當局驗證 CCP 代碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1923
msgid ""
"To transport goods between warehouses, the logistics route must contain a "
"delivery-type operation."
msgstr "要在倉庫之間運送貨物，物流路線必須包含交貨類型的作業。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1926
msgid ""
":doc:`Inter-warehouse replenishment "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/replenishment/resupply_warehouses>`"
msgstr ""
":doc:`倉庫間補貨 <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"replenishment/resupply_warehouses>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1930
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Mexico - Electronic Delivery Guide` (`l10n_mx_edi_stock`) "
"module must be installed to use this feature, in addition to the "
":doc:`Inventory <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory>` and :doc:`Sales "
"<../../sales/sales>` apps."
msgstr ""
"必須安裝 :guilabel:`墨西哥 - 電子送貨指南` (`l10n_mx_edi_stock`) 模組，以及 "
":doc:`庫存 <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory>` 和 :doc:`銷售 <../../sales/"
"sales>` 應用程式，方可使用此功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1935
msgid ""
"The Carta Porte documents of type `I` (Ingreso), air, train, or marine "
"transport are currently not supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1938
msgid "Consult an accountant before making any modifications."
msgstr "進行任何修改前，請先諮詢會計師。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1945
msgid ""
"There are two types of |CFDI| of type `T`, which can be generated from "
":doc:`incoming shipments or delivery orders "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations>`:"
msgstr ""
"`T` 類型的 |CFDI| 有兩種，可透過 :doc:`收貨單或送貨單 <../../"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/shipping_receiving/daily_operations>` 生成："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1948
msgid ""
"Use :guilabel:`No Federal Highways` when the :guilabel:`Distance to "
"Destination` is `less than 30 km "
"<http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/cartaporte/Paginas/documentos/PreguntasFrecuentes_Autotransporte.pdf>`_:"
" No additional configuration is needed beyond the standard requirements for "
"regular invoicing, i.e., the customer |RFC|, the UNSPSC code, etc."
msgstr ""
"選用 :guilabel:`無聯邦公路`（適用於 :guilabel:`至目的地距離` 為 `少於 30 公"
"里 <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/cartaporte/Paginas/documentos/"
"PreguntasFrecuentes_Autotransporte.pdf>`_ 的情況）：除了一般開立發票的標準要"
"求（即客戶 |RFC|、UNSPSC 代碼等）外，無需進行額外設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1952
msgid ""
"Use :guilabel:`Federal Transport` when the :guilabel:`Distance to "
"Destination` exceeds 30 km: Additional configurations for contacts, vehicle "
"setups, and products are needed and are included in the XML and PDF files."
msgstr ""
"使用:guilabel:`聯邦運輸`（當:guilabel:`目的地距離`超過 30 公里時）：系統需要"
"為聯絡人、車輛設定及產品進行額外配置，相關資料亦會包含於 XML 及 PDF 檔案中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1959
msgid "Contacts and vehicles"
msgstr "聯絡人及車輛"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1961
msgid ""
"As for the foreign trade feature, the :guilabel:`Address` field of both the "
"company and the final customer must be complete, and the :guilabel:`ZIP` "
"code, :guilabel:`City`, and :guilabel:`State` must match the `official SAT "
"catalog for Carta Porte "
"<http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/catalogos_emision_cfdi_complemento_ce.htm>`_."
" The :guilabel:`Locality` field is optional for both addresses."
msgstr ""
"至於外貿功能，公司及最終客戶的 :guilabel:`地址` 欄位必須完整填寫，而 "
":guilabel:`郵政編碼`、:guilabel:`城市` 及 :guilabel:`州份` 必須與 `Carta "
"Porte 官方 SAT 目錄 <http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/"
"catalogos_emision_cfdi_complemento_ce.htm>`_ 相符。兩個地址的 :guilabel:`地"
"區` 欄位均為選填。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1968
msgid ""
"The origin address used for the delivery guide is set in "
":menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Warehouses`. While it is set"
" to the company address by default, it can be changed to a proper warehouse "
"address."
msgstr ""
"送貨單使用的出發地址設於 :menuselection:`庫存 --> 設定 --> 倉庫`。雖然系統預"
"設為公司地址，但可以更改為合適的倉庫地址。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1972
msgid ""
"This feature requires the :doc:`Fleet <../../hr/fleet/new_vehicle>` app to "
"manage vehicles. The vehicle setup is managed directly on the vehicle, and "
"all the required fields are only visible after ticking the :guilabel:`L10N "
"Mx Is Freight Vehicle` checkbox."
msgstr ""
"此功能需要使用 :doc:`車隊 <../../hr/fleet/new_vehicle>` 應用程式來管理車輛。"
"車輛設定會直接在車輛記錄上管理，且所有必填欄位只有在剔選 :guilabel:`L10N Mx "
"為貨運車輛` 核取方塊後才會顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1976
msgid ""
"Ticking the :guilabel:`L10N Mx Is Freight Vehicle` checkbox displays the "
":guilabel:`MX Parameters` tab, which contains the mandatory fields needed to"
" create a correct delivery guide. The vehicle **must** also have a "
":guilabel:`License Plate`, a :guilabel:`Model Year`, and a "
":guilabel:`Driver`."
msgstr ""
"剔選 :guilabel:`L10N Mx 是否為貨運車輛` 核取方塊後，系統會顯示 :guilabel:`MX "
"參數` 分頁，當中包含建立正確送貨指引所需的必填欄位。此外，車輛 **必須** 填有 "
":guilabel:`車牌號碼`、:guilabel:`型號年份` 及 :guilabel:`司機`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1981
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Vehicle Plate Number` and :guilabel:`Number Plate` fields "
"must contain between five and seven characters."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1984
msgid ""
"The main driver of the vehicle is set in the :guilabel:`Driver` field, and "
"more vehicle operators can be added in the :guilabel:`Intermediaries` "
"section. The only mandatory fields for driver contacts are the "
":guilabel:`Tax ID` and :guilabel:`Operator License`."
msgstr ""
"車輛的主要司機在 :guilabel:`司機` 欄位中設定，並可在 :guilabel:`中介人` 部分"
"新增更多車輛操作員。司機聯絡人的唯一必填欄位為 :guilabel:`稅務編號` 及 "
":guilabel:`駕駛執照`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1989
msgid ""
"If the vehicle is rented, or if more intermediaries are required, they can "
"be added in the :guilabel:`Intermediaries` field."
msgstr "如車輛為租賃，或需要更多中介方，可在 :guilabel:`中介方` 欄位中新增。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:1997
msgid ""
"As for regular invoicing, all products must have a :guilabel:`UNSPSC Product"
" Category`. Two additional configurations apply to products involved in "
"delivery guides:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2000
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Product Type`: Set it to :guilabel:`Storable Product` for stock "
"movements to be created."
msgstr ":guilabel:`產品類型`：將其設為 :guilabel:`可庫存產品`，系統才會建立庫存移動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2002
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Weight` (in the :guilabel:`Inventory` tab): Must be greater than "
"`0`."
msgstr ":guilabel:`重量`（位於 :guilabel:`庫存` 分頁）：必須大於 `0`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2005
msgid ""
"Creating a delivery guide for a product whose :guilabel:`Weight` is set to "
"`0` triggers an error. As the :guilabel:`Weight` is immediately stored on "
"the delivery order, the products must then be returned and the delivery "
"order, along with the delivery guide, recreated with the correct values."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2010
msgid ""
"Certain values of the :guilabel:`UNSPSC Product Category` are considered "
"*dangerous hazards* in the `official SAT catalog "
"<http://omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/complemento_carta_porte.htm>`_."
" To configure a product in one of those categories for a delivery guide with"
" :guilabel:`Federal Transport`:"
msgstr ""
"某些:guilabel:`UNSPSC 產品類別`的數值在 `官方 SAT 目錄 <http://"
"omawww.sat.gob.mx/tramitesyservicios/Paginas/complemento_carta_porte.htm>`_ "
"中被視為 *危險物品*。要為屬於這些類別的產品配置包含:guilabel:`聯邦運輸`的送貨"
"指南："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2015
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Inventory --> Products --> Products` and access the "
"product form."
msgstr "前往 :menuselection:`庫存 --> 產品 --> 產品` 並開啟產品表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2016
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab, fill in the :guilabel:`Hazardous Material"
" Designation Code` and :guilabel:`Packaging type for hazardous material` "
"fields with the correct code from the |SAT| catalog."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`會計` 分頁中，填寫 :guilabel:`危險品指定代碼` 及 :guilabel:`危"
"險品包裝類型` 欄位，輸入來自 |SAT| 目錄的正確代碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2020
msgid "Required fields for a hazardous material product on a delivery guide."
msgstr "送貨單上危險物料產品的必填欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2024
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`UNSPSC Product Category` may or may not be classified as a "
"dangerous hazard, e.g., `01010101`. If it is not dangerous, enter `0` in the"
" :guilabel:`Hazardous Material Designation Code` field."
msgstr ""
"每個 :guilabel:`UNSPSC 產品類別` 可能會或可能不會被歸類為危險品，例如 "
"`01010101`。如不屬危險品，請在 :guilabel:`危險物料指定代碼` 欄位中輸入 `0`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2028
msgid "Open the Fleet app."
msgstr "開啟車隊應用程式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2029
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`MX Parameters` tab of the vehicle, complete the "
":guilabel:`Environment Insurer` and :guilabel:`Environment Insurance Policy`"
" fields."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2031
msgid ""
"Follow the regular :ref:`delivery guide flow <l10n/mx/inventory/delivery-"
"guide/flow>`."
msgstr "請按照常規的:ref:`送貨單流程 <l10n/mx/inventory/delivery-guide/flow>`操作。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2036
msgid "Imports and exports"
msgstr "進口與出口"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2038
msgid ""
"If a Carta Porte is used for international operations, additional fields "
"must be considered."
msgstr "如將 Carta Porte 用於國際業務，必須考慮額外欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2040
msgid ""
"First, make sure all the relevant products have the following configuration "
