#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2045
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Tariff Fraction` and :guilabel:`UMT Aduana` must be set, as "
"for the :ref:`foreign trade <l10n/mx/external-trade>` flow."
msgstr ""
"必須設定 :guilabel:`關稅分類` 及 :guilabel:`海關計量單位 (UMT Aduana)`，做法"
"與 :ref:`對外貿易 <l10n/mx/external-trade>` 流程相同。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2047
msgid "The :guilabel:`Material Type` must be set."
msgstr "必須設定 :guilabel:`物料類型`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2049
msgid ""
"Then, when creating a delivery guide from a delivery or a receipt, fill in "
"the following fields:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2051
msgid ":guilabel:`Customs Regimes`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2052
msgid ":guilabel:`Customs Document Type`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2053
msgid ":guilabel:`Customs Document Identification`"
