#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2055
msgid ""
"When creating a delivery guide for a receipt whose :guilabel:`Customs "
"Document Type` is :guilabel:`Customs number`, two additional fields appear: "
":guilabel:`Customs Number` and :guilabel:`Importer`."
msgstr ""
"當為 :guilabel:`海關文件類型` 為 :guilabel:`海關編號` 的收貨單建立送貨單時，"
"系統會顯示兩個額外欄位：:guilabel:`海關編號` 及 :guilabel:`進口商`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2060
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Customs Number` field follows the `xx xx xxxx xxxxxxx` "
"pattern, e.g., `15 48 3009 0001235`, with two spaces between each group."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/mexico.rst:2066
