"It is also possible to add Arabic as a second language to your company's "
"billing documents if desired or required. To do so, go to "
":menuselection:`Configuration --> Settings` in the **Accounting** app, then,"
" in the :guilabel:`Customer Invoices` section, enable :guilabel:`Gulf "
"Cooperation Council Format`."
