"每種文件類型在所指派的每個日記賬中均可擁有唯一的序號。作為本地化設定的一部分"
"，文件類型包含該文件適用的國家/地區；安裝本地化模組時，系統會自動建立有關數據"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:354
msgid ""
"The information required for the document types is included by default so "
"the user does not need to fill anything on this view:"
msgstr "文件類型所需的資料已預設包含在內，因此用戶無需在此檢視畫面填寫任何內容："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:357
msgid "Document Type list."
msgstr "文件類型清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:361
msgid ""
"Currently the documents supported on customer invoices are: Invoice, Boleta,"
" Debit Note and Credit Note."
msgstr "目前客戶發票支援的文件包括：發票、Boleta、借項通知單及貸項通知單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:367
msgid ""
"When creating Sales Journals, the following information must be filled, in "
"addition to the standard fields on the Journals:"
msgstr "建立銷售日記賬時，除日記賬的標準欄位外，亦必須填寫以下資料："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:371
msgid "Use Documents"
msgstr "使用文件"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:373
msgid ""
"This field is used to define if the journal uses Document Types. It is only "
"applicable to Purchase and Sales journals, which are the ones that can be "
"related to the different set of document types available in Peru. By "
"default, all the sales journals created use documents."
msgstr ""
"此欄位用於定義日記賬是否使用文件類型。這僅適用於採購及銷售日記賬，因為只有這"
"些日記賬可與秘魯提供的不同文件類型集關聯。預設情況下，所有已建立的銷售日記賬"
"均會使用文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:378
msgid "Electronic Data Interchange"
msgstr "電子數據交換"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:380
msgid ""
"This section indicates which EDI workflow is used in the invoice, for Peru "
"we must select “Peru UBL 2.1”."
msgstr "此部分顯示發票所使用的 EDI 工作流程；對於秘魯，必須選擇「Peru UBL 2.1」。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:383
msgid "Journal EDI field."
msgstr "日記賬 EDI 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:387
msgid ""
"By default, the value Factur-X (FR) is always displayed, make sure you can "
"uncheck it manually."
msgstr "系統預設會一直顯示 Factur-X (FR) 數值，請確保你可以手動取消勾選該項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:393
msgid "Identification Type and VAT"
msgstr "識別類型及增值稅"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:395
msgid ""
"As part of the Peruvian localization, the identification types defined by "
"the SUNAT are now available on the Partner form, this information is "
"essential for most transactions either on the sender company and in the "
"customer, make sure you fill in this information in your records."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:399
msgid "Partner identification type."
msgstr "業務夥伴識別類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:405
msgid ""
"Additional to the basic information in your products, for the Peruvian "
"localization, the UNSPC Code on the product is a required value to be "
"configured."
msgstr "對於秘魯本地化設定，除了產品的基本資料外，亦必須配置產品的 UNSPC 代碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:408
msgid "UNSPC Code on products."
msgstr "產品上的 UNSPC 代碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:418
msgid "EDI Elements"
msgstr "EDI 元素"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:420
msgid ""
"Once you have configured your master data, the invoices can be created from "
"your sales order or manually. In addition to the :doc:`basic invoice "
"information <../accounting/customer_invoices>`, the following fields are "
"required as part of the Peru EDI:"
msgstr ""
"配置主數據後，您即可從銷售訂單或手動建立發票。除了 :doc:`基本發票資料 <../"
"accounting/customer_invoices>` 外，秘魯電子數據交換（EDI）還要求填寫以下欄位"
"："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:424
msgid ""
"**Document type**: The default value is “Factura Electronica” but  you can "
"manually change the document type if needed and select Boleta for example."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:427
msgid "Invoice document type field on invoices."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:430
msgid ""
"**Operation type**: This value is required for Electronic Invoice and "
"indicates the transaction type, the default value is “Internal Sale” but "
"another value can be selected manually when needed, for example Export of "
"Goods."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:434
msgid "Invoice operation type field on invoices."
msgstr "發票上的發票操作類型欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:437
msgid ""
"**EDI Affectation Reason**: In the invoice lines, additional to the Tax "
"there is a field “EDI Affectation Reason” that determines the tax scope "
"based on the SUNAT list that is displayed. All the taxes loaded by default "
"are associated with a default EDI affection reason, if needed you can "
"manually select another one when creating the invoice."
msgstr ""
"**EDI 課稅原因**：在發票資料行中，除了「稅項」外，還有一個「EDI 課稅原因」欄"
"位，根據顯示的 SUNAT 清單決定稅務適用範圍。預設載入的所有稅項均已關聯至預設"
"的 EDI 課稅原因。如有需要，您可在建立發票時手動選擇其他原因。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:442
msgid "Tax affectation reason in invoice line."
msgstr "發票明細行中的稅項歸屬原因。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:446
msgid "Invoice validation"
msgstr "發票驗證"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:448
msgid ""
"Once you check all the information in your invoice is correct, you can "
"proceed to validate it. This action registers the account move and triggers "
"the Electronic invoice workflow to send it to the OSE and the SUNAT. The "
"following message is displayed at the top of the invoice:"
msgstr ""
"確認發票上的所有資料無誤後，即可驗證發票。此操作會登賬會計分錄並觸發電子發票"
"工作流程，將發票傳送至 OSE 及 SUNAT。發票頂部會顯示以下訊息："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:452
msgid "Sending of EDI Invoice in blue."
msgstr "發送 EDI 發票以藍色顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:455
msgid ""
"Asynchronous means that the document is not sent automatically after the "
"invoice has been posted."
msgstr "「非同步」是指在發票過賬後，系統不會自動發送文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:460
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:547
msgid "Electronic Invoice Status"
msgstr "電子發票狀態"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:462
msgid ""
"**To be Sent**: Indicates the document is ready to be sent to the OSE, this "
"can be done either automatically by Odoo with a *cron* that runs every hour,"
" or the user can send it immediately by clicking on the button “Sent now”."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:466
msgid "Send EDI manually."
msgstr "手動發送 EDI。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:469
msgid ""
"**Sent**: Indicates the document was sent to the OSE and was successfully "
"validated. As part of the validation a ZIP file is downloaded and a message "
"is logged in the chatter indicating the correct Government validation."
msgstr ""
"**已傳送**：表示文件已傳送至 OSE 並已成功驗證。作為驗證的一部分，系統會下載一"
"個 ZIP 檔案，並在通訊欄記錄一則訊息，指出政府驗證正確無誤。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:473
msgid "Message on chatter when the invoice is valid."
msgstr "發票有效時在通訊欄顯示的訊息。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:476
msgid ""
"In case there is a validation error the Electronic Invoice status remains in"
" “To be sent” so the corrections can be made and the invoice can be sent "
"again."
msgstr ""
"若出現驗證錯誤，電子發票狀態會維持在「待發送」，以便你作出更正並重新發送發票"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:480
msgid ""
"One credit is consumed each time that you send a document for validation, in"
" this sense if an error is detected on an invoice and you send it one more "
"time, two credits are consumed in total."
msgstr ""
"每次傳送文件進行驗證時，都會消耗一個點數。因此，如果發票發現錯誤並需要再次傳"
"送，總共會消耗兩個點數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:485
msgid "Common Errors"
msgstr "常見錯誤"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:487
msgid ""
"There are multiple reasons behind a rejection from the OSE or the SUNAT, "
"when this happens Odoo sends a message at the top of the invoice indicating "
"the error details and in the most common cases a hint to fix the issue."
msgstr ""
"OSE 或 SUNAT 拒絕文件的原因有多種。發生這種情況時，Odoo 會在發票頂部顯示訊息"
"，說明錯誤詳情，並在大多數常見情況下提供修復問題的提示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:491
msgid "If a validation error is received, you have two options:"
msgstr "如收到驗證錯誤，您有兩個選擇："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:493
msgid ""
"In case the error is related to master data on the partner, customer or "
"taxes, you can simply apply the change on the record (example customer "
"identification type) and once it is done click on the Retry button."
msgstr ""
"如錯誤與合作夥伴、客戶或稅項的主數據有關，你只需直接修改該筆記錄（例如客戶識"
"別類型），完成後按一下「重試」按鈕即可。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:496
msgid ""
"If the error is related to some data recorded on the invoice directly "
"(Operation type, missing data on the invoice lines), the correct solution is"
" to reset the invoice to Draft, apply the changes, and then send the invoice"
" again to the SUNAT for another validation."
msgstr ""
"如錯誤與發票上直接記錄的某些資料有關（例如操作類型、發票明細行缺少資料），正"
"確的解決方法是將發票重設為草稿，套用更改後，再將發票重新發送至 SUNAT 進行驗證"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:500
msgid "List of common errors on invoices."
msgstr "常見發票錯誤清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:503
msgid ""
"For more detail please refert to `Common errors in SUNAT "
"<https://www.nubefact.com/codigos-error-sunat/>`_."
msgstr ""
"如需更多詳情，請參閱 `SUNAT 常見錯誤 <https://www.nubefact.com/codigos-error-"
"sunat/>`_。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:507
msgid "Invoice PDF Report"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:509
msgid ""
"After the invoice is accepted and validated by the SUNAT, the invoice PDF "
"report can be printed. The report includes a QR code, indicating the invoice"
" is a valid fiscal document."
msgstr ""
"發票經 SUNAT 接納並驗證後，即可列印發票 PDF 報表。該報表包含一個 QR 碼，顯示"
"該發票為有效的稅務文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:512
msgid "Invoice PDF report."
msgstr "發票 PDF 報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:516
msgid "IAP Credits"
msgstr "IAP 點數"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:518
msgid ""
"Odoo’s Electronic IAP offers 1000 credits for free, after these credits are "
"consumed in your production database, your company must buy new credits in "
"order to process your transactions."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 電子 IAP 免費提供 1000 點數。當您的正式資料庫用完這些點數後，貴公司必須"
"購買新點數才能繼續處理交易。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:521
msgid ""
"Once you run out of credits a red label is displayed at the top of the "
"invoice indicating that additional credits are required, you can easily buy "
"them by accessing the link provided in the message."
msgstr ""
"當你用完點數時，發票頂部會顯示紅色標籤，提示需要額外點數，你可以透過訊息中提"
"供的連結輕鬆購買。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:525
msgid "Buying credits in the IAP."
msgstr "在 IAP 購買點數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:528
msgid ""
"In the IAP service includes packages with different pricing based on the "
"number of credits. The price list in the IAP is always displayed in EUR."
msgstr "IAP 服務包含按點數數量而設的不同價格套餐。IAP 的價格表一律以歐元（EUR）顯示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:532
msgid "Special Use cases"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:535
msgid "Cancellation process"
msgstr "取消流程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:537
msgid ""
"Some scenarios require an invoice cancellation, for example, when an invoice"
" was created by mistake. If the invoice was already sent and validated by "
"the SUNAT, the correct way to proceed is by clicking on the button Request "
"Cancellation:"
msgstr ""
"某些情況需要取消發票，例如錯誤建立了發票。如果發票已傳送並經 SUNAT 驗證，正確"
"的處理方式是點擊「請求取消」按鈕："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:541
msgid "Request invoice cancellation button."
msgstr "要求取消發票按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:544
msgid "In order to cancel an invoice, please provide a cancellation Reason."
msgstr "如要取消發票，請提供取消原因。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:549
msgid ""
"**To Cancel**:  Indicates the cancellation request is ready to be sent to "
"the OSE, this can be done either automatically by Odoo with a *cron* that "
"runs every hour, or the user can send it immediately by clicking on the "
"button “Send now”. Once it is sent, a cancellation ticket is created, as a "
"result the next message and CDR File are logged in the chatter:"
msgstr ""
"**待取消**：表示取消要求已準備好傳送至 OSE。此操作可由 Odoo 透過每小時執行一"
"次的 *cron* 自動進行，亦可由用戶按「立即傳送」按鈕即時傳送。傳送後系統會建立"
"取消憑證，並於通訊欄記錄以下訊息及 CDR 檔案："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:554
msgid "Cancellation CDR sent by the SUNAT."
msgstr "由 SUNAT 傳送的取消 CDR。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:557
msgid ""
"**Cancelled**: Indicates the cancellation request was sent to the OSE and "
"was successfully validated. As part of the validation a ZIP file is "
"downloaded and a message is logged in the chatter indicating the correct "
"Government validation."
msgstr ""
"**已取消**：表示取消請求已發送至 OSE 並已成功驗證。在驗證過程中，系統會下載一"
"個 ZIP 檔案，並在通訊欄記錄訊息，表明政府已正確完成驗證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:561
msgid "Invoice after cancellation."
msgstr "取消後開立發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:565
msgid "One credit is consumed on each cancellation request."
msgstr "每次取消請求均會消耗一個點數。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:570
msgid ""
"When creating exportation invoices, take into account the next "
"considerations:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:572
msgid "The Identification type on your customer must be Foreign ID."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:573
msgid "Operation type in your invoice must be an Exportation one."
msgstr "發票中的操作類型必須為出口類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:574
msgid "The taxes included in the invoice lines should be EXP taxes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:580
msgid "Advance Payments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:583
msgid ""
"Because the SUNAT does not allow negative in filings, a workaround is "
"required when reporting down payments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:586
msgid "Open the sales order requiring a down payment."
msgstr "開啟需要預付訂金的銷售訂單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:587
msgid ""
"Click :guilabel:`Create Invoice` and select :guilabel:`Down payment "
"(percentage)` or :guilabel:`Down payment (fixed amount)`. Enter the amount, "
"then click :guilabel:`Create Draft`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:589
msgid ""
"Check that all information is correct. If yes, click :guilabel:`Confirm`. If"
" not, make the necessary changes before confirming."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:591
msgid ""
"Navigate back to the sales order and click :menuselection:`Create Invoice "
"--> Regular Invoice --> Create Draft` to proceed with invoice creation."
msgstr ""
"返回銷售訂單，然後點擊 :menuselection:`建立發票 --> 一般發票 --> 建立草稿` 以"
"繼續建立發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:593
msgid ""
"From the invoice, remove the section separation *and* the down payment "
"invoice line by clicking the :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`(trash bin)` "
"icon, and :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr ""
"在發票中，點擊 :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`（垃圾桶）` 圖示以移除區段分"
"隔*及*訂金發票明細行，然後點擊 :guilabel:`確認`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:596
msgid "Removing invoice lines and section."
msgstr "移除發票明細行及分節。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:599
msgid ""
"Once confirmed, click :guilabel:`Credit Note`, then :guilabel:`Reverse`, and"
" finally remove all invoice lines by clicking the :icon:`fa-trash-o` "
":guilabel:`(trash bin)` icon. The invoice should be clear of any product."
msgstr ""
"確認後，按一下 :guilabel:`貸項通知單`，然後按一下 :guilabel:`沖銷`，最後按一"
"下 :icon:`fa-trash-o` :guilabel:`（垃圾桶）` 圖示以移除所有發票明細行。發票上"
"不應留有任何產品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:602
msgid ""
"Next, click :guilabel:`Add a line`. Click the :icon:`fa-bars` "
":guilabel:`(bars)` icon, enter a description (e.g., `Down Payment`), and "
"input the :guilabel:`Price`. Click :guilabel:`Confirm`."
msgstr ""
"接著，點擊 :guilabel:`新增資料行`。點擊 :icon:`fa-bars` :guilabel:`（橫條）` "
"圖示，輸入描述（例如 `訂金`），然後輸入 :guilabel:`價格`。點擊 :guilabel:`確"
"認`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:605
msgid "Adding down payment description."
msgstr "新增首期付款說明。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:608
msgid ""
"After issuing the credit note and if not done automatically, reconcile it "
"with the final invoice."
msgstr "開立貸記單後，如未自動完成對賬，請將其與最終發票進行對賬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:609
msgid ""
"The final invoice's remaining balance **must** be paid with a regular "
"payment transaction."
msgstr "最終發票的餘額**必須**透過一般付款交易支付。"

