"driver (or carrier) performs."
msgstr "*承運商* 送貨單類型用於證明司機（或承運商）所執行的運輸服務。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:695
msgid ""
"This delivery guide is issued by the carrier and must be issued to each "
"shipper when the shipment goes through public transport."
msgstr "此送貨指南由承運商發出；當貨物經由公共交通工具運送時，必須向每位付運人簽發。"

