"file with the CDR, XML, and PDF files directly from the customer portal by "
"clicking the :guilabel:`Download` button."
msgstr ""
"發票經 |SUNAT| 驗證後，客戶可直接從客戶門戶點擊 :guilabel:`下載` 按鈕，下載包"
"含 CDR、XML 及 PDF 檔案的 .zip 壓縮檔。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1005
msgid "Permanent inventory reports: |PLE| 12.1 and |PLE| 13.1"
msgstr "永續盤存報告：|PLE| 12.1 及 |PLE| 13.1"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1008
msgid ""
"Make sure to :ref:`set <peru/configuration-ple>` the appropriate type of "
"chart of accounts for your PLE reports."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1011
msgid ""
"Odoo can produce two permanent inventory reports as `.txt` files for "
"Peruvian accounting: |PLE| 12.1 and |PLE| 13.1. All inventory transactions "
"made need to be reported."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 可為秘魯會計產生兩份 `.txt` 檔案格式的永久庫存報表：|PLE| 12.1 及 |PLE| "
"13.1。所有已進行的庫存交易均須申報。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1014
msgid ""
"|PLE| 12.1 **only tracks inventory in physical units**, focusing on the "
"inflow and outflow of goods for effective management and planning."
msgstr ""
"|PLE| 12.1 **僅以實物單位追蹤庫存**，專注於貨物的流入及流出，以進行有效管理及"
"規劃。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1017
msgid ""
"|PLE| 13.1 tracks **both physical quantities and monetary values of "
"inventory**, providing a comprehensive view for tax and management purposes."
msgstr ""
"|PLE| 13.1 同時追蹤**存貨的實物數量及貨幣價值**，為稅務及管理用途提供全面概覽"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1020
msgid ""
"Both reports must be maintained semi-annually (January-June and July-"
"December), with monthly transaction details reported within these periods. "
"The submission deadlines are October 1st for the first semester and April "
"1st for the second semester, in accordance with the *Resolución de "
"Superintendencia N° 169-2015*."
msgstr ""
"兩份報表均須每半年維護一次（1 月至 6 月及 7 月至 12 月），並在該期間內申報每"
"月交易明細。根據 *Resolución de Superintendencia N° 169-2015*，上半年報表的提"
"交截止日期為 10 月 1 日，下半年則為 4 月 1 日。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1028
msgid ""
"Before generating the |PLE| 12.1 or |PLE| 13.1 reports, make sure the "
":guilabel:`Peru - Stock Reports` (`l10n_pe_reports_stock`) module is "
"installed, then update the fields for:"
msgstr ""
"在產生 |PLE| 12.1 或 |PLE| 13.1 報表前，請確保已安裝 :guilabel:`秘魯 - 庫存報"
"表`（`l10n_pe_reports_stock`）模組，然後更新以下項目的欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1031
msgid ":ref:`Products <peru/reports-ple-products>`"
msgstr ":ref:`產品 <peru/reports-ple-products>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1032
msgid ":ref:`Warehouses <peru/reports-ple-warehouses>`"
msgstr ":ref:`倉庫 <peru/reports-ple-warehouses>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1033
msgid ":ref:`Inventory transfers <peru/reports-ple-transfers>`"
msgstr ":ref:`存貨調撥 <peru/reports-ple-transfers>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1040
msgid ""
"Several configurations related to the product or product category are "
"necessary for |PLE| reporting:"
msgstr "進行 |PLE| 報告時，必須完成多項與產品或產品類別相關的設定："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1042
msgid ""
"**Type of existence**: For all products needing |PLE| reporting, go to the "
"product record's :guilabel:`Accounting` tab and select the :guilabel:`Type "
"of Existence` according to |SUNAT|'s table 5 for inventory reporting."
msgstr ""
"**存在類型**：對於所有需要進行 |PLE| 申報的產品，請前往產品記錄的 "
":guilabel:`會計` 分頁，並選取 :guilabel:`存在類型`（根據 |SUNAT| 的庫存申報"
"表 5）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1046
msgid ""
"**Automatic inventory valuation**: For storable goods (:dfn:`products with "
"tracked inventory`), use :doc:`automatic inventory valuation "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet>`. Once "
"automatic inventory valuation is enabled, this valuation method can be "
"enabled for a product's product category."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1051
msgid ""
"**Costing method:** Storable goods must use a :doc:`costing method "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet>` "
"**other** than :guilabel:`Standard Price`, as the journal entries generated "
"from stock moves are used to populate the |PLE| reports."
msgstr ""
"**成本計算方法：** 可儲存貨品必須使用 :doc:`成本計算方法 <../../"
"inventory_and_mrp/inventory/inventory_valuation/cheat_sheet>`，且 **不可** "
"為 :guilabel:`標準價格`，因為系統會使用庫存移動產生的日記賬分錄來填入 |PLE| "
"報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1059
msgid "Warehouses"
msgstr "倉庫"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1061
msgid ""
"When :doc:`setting up a warehouse "
"<../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/inventory_management/warehouses>`,"
" the :guilabel:`Annex Establishment Code` field must be filled. This code "
"acts as a unique ID for each warehouse and should only be a numeric "
"combination, containing between 4 to 7 digits."
msgstr ""
"在 :doc:`設定倉庫 <../../inventory_and_mrp/inventory/warehouses_storage/"
"inventory_management/warehouses>` 時，必須填寫 :guilabel:`附屬機構代碼` 欄位"
"。此代碼用作每個倉庫的唯一識別碼，且只應為 4 至 7 位數字的組合。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/peru.rst:1069
msgid "Inventory transfers"
msgstr "庫存調撥"

