msgstr ":guilabel:`貨幣` 必須設為 :guilabel:`SAR`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:196
msgid ""
"All fields must be completed accurately to avoid rejection during "
":ref:`ZATCA onboarding <localizations/saudi-arabia/zatca>`."
msgstr ""
"必須準確填寫所有欄位，以免在進行:ref:`ZATCA 啟用流程 <localizations/saudi-"
"arabia/zatca>`時遭拒絕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:200
msgid ""
"The same configuration applies to all relevant :doc:`contact "
"<../../essentials/contacts>` forms."
msgstr "相同的設定適用於所有相關的 :doc:`聯絡人 <../../essentials/contacts>` 表單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:205
msgid "Branches configuration"
msgstr "分支機構配置"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:207
msgid ""
"Set up your company :ref:`branches <general/branches>` in compliance with "
":ref:`ZATCA rules <localizations/saudi-arabia/company-contacts>`."
msgstr ""
"設定貴公司的:ref:`分支機構 <general/branches>`，以符合 :ref:`ZATCA 規定 "
"<localizations/saudi-arabia/company-contacts>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:211
msgid ""
"On the branch contact form, enter the same :guilabel:`VAT Number` as the "
"parent company and enter the branch :guilabel:`Commercial Registration "
"Number (CRN)` in the :guilabel:`Identification Scheme` field."
msgstr ""
"在分公司的聯絡人表單中，輸入與母公司相同的 :guilabel:`增值稅編號`，並將分公司"
"的 :guilabel:`商業登記號碼（CRN）` 填入 :guilabel:`識別方案` 欄位。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:216
msgid ""
"Either use the parent company’s sales journal to follow a centralized "
"billing system model, or onboard a new branch-specific journal to set up a "
"multi-threaded system with parallel invoice processing."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:225
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:244
msgid ""
"Invoices can be issued in different languages to meet regional or customer-"
"specific requirements at two levels:"
msgstr "發票可在兩個層級以不同語言開立，以滿足地區或特定客戶的要求："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:228
msgid ""
"Customer level: To assign a preferred language to a customer, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Customers --> Customers` or "
":menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Orders --> Customers`, and open the "
"relevant customer form.  In the :guilabel:`Language` field, update the "
"language. All documents are then automatically generated in the selected "
"language for that customer."
msgstr ""
"客戶層級：如要為客戶指定偏好語言，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 客戶 --> 客"
"戶` 或 :menuselection:`銷售點 --> 訂單 --> 客戶`，並開啟相關客戶表單。在 "
":guilabel:`語言` 欄位中更新語言。之後，該客戶的所有文件都會自動以所選語言生成"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:234
msgid ""
"Saudi Arabia's VAT regulations require :guilabel:`Tax Invoices` and "
":guilabel:`Simplified Tax Invoices` (along with corresponding credit notes "
"or debit notes) to be in Arabic, mandatorily. Invoices can be bilingual, "
"including English."
msgstr ""
"沙特阿拉伯的增值稅法規規定，:guilabel:`稅務發票` 及 :guilabel:`簡易稅務發"
"票`（連同相應的貸項通知單或借項通知單）必須使用阿拉伯文。發票可採用雙語（包括"
"英文）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:238
msgid ""
"Company level: To add Arabic as a secondary language to meet Saudi Arabia "
"VAT regulations:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:240
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:253
msgid ""
"For :guilabel:`Tax Invoices`: Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, in the :guilabel:`Customer Invoices` section."
msgstr ""
"對於 :guilabel:`稅務發票`：前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 設定` 中的 "
":guilabel:`客戶發票` 部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:242
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:255
msgid ""
"For Point of Sale receipts: Go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> "
"Configuration --> Settings`, and navigate to the :guilabel:`Bills & "
"Receipts` section."
msgstr ""
"如為銷售點收據：前往 :menuselection:`銷售點 --> 配置 --> 設定`，並導覽至 "
":guilabel:`賬單及收據` 部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:245
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:258
msgid ""
"Then, enable the :guilabel:`Gulf Cooperation Council Format` option, and "
":guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr "然後，啟用:guilabel:`海灣合作委員會格式`選項，並:guilabel:`儲存`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:250
msgid "Electronic invoicing with ZATCA"
msgstr "透過 ZATCA 開立電子發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:252
msgid ""
"The ZATCA e-invoicing system is designed to streamline and digitize the "
"invoicing process for businesses operating in Saudi Arabia."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:255
msgid ""
"ZATCA Phase 2 employs a clearance e-invoicing model for Business-to-Business"
" (B2B) transactions. Conversely, for Business-to-Consumer (B2C) "
"transactions, Odoo generates a QR code and subsequently reports these "
"transactions to the Fatoora reporting endpoint."
msgstr ""
"ZATCA 第 2 階段對企業對企業（B2B）交易採用核准（clearance）電子發票模式。相反"
"，對於企業對消費者（B2C）交易，Odoo 會產生 QR 碼，然後將這些交易申報至 "
"Fatoora 申報端點。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:259
msgid ""
"In a B2B scenario, a :guilabel:`Tax Invoice` is issued, whereas in a B2C "
"scenario, a :guilabel:`Simplified Tax Invoice` is generated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:263
msgid ""
"`ZATCA e-invoicing page "
"<https://zatca.gov.sa/en/E-Invoicing/Pages/default.aspx>`_"
msgstr ""
"`ZATCA 電子發票頁面 <https://zatca.gov.sa/en/E-Invoicing/Pages/default.aspx>"
"`_"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:268
msgid "Step-by-step process"
msgstr "逐步操作流程"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:270
msgid "When onboarding to ZATCA (Phase 2), there are three modes:"
msgstr "接入 ZATCA（第二階段）時，共有三種模式："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:272
msgid ""
":ref:`Sandbox <localizations/saudi-arabia/sandbox>`: Common pre-configured "
"testing environment; use it to simulate integration functionality out of the"
" box."
msgstr ""
":ref:`沙盒 <localizations/saudi-arabia/sandbox>`：常用的預先配置測試環境；可"
"用於直接模擬整合功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:274
msgid ""
":ref:`Simulation (Pre-Production) <localizations/saudi-arabia/simulation>`: "
"User-specific testing environment; use it to simulate your unique "
"integration."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:276
msgid ""
":ref:`Production <localizations/saudi-arabia/production>`: Live environment"
msgstr ":ref:`正式環境 <localizations/saudi-arabia/production>`：實際運作環境"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:281
msgid "Sandbox"
msgstr "沙盒"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:284
msgid ""
"Use VAT Number 399999999900003 on your company setup for sandbox testing."
msgstr "進行沙盒測試時，請在公司設定中使用增值稅號碼 399999999900003。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:0
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:317
