"<https://zatca.gov.sa/en/AboutUs/ZATCAApps/Pages/default.aspx>`_."
msgstr ""
"如要驗證發票上的二維碼，請使用官方 `ZATCA 應用程式 <https://zatca.gov.sa/en/"
"AboutUs/ZATCAApps/Pages/default.aspx>`_ 進行掃描。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:467
msgid ""
"Once in the app, click :guilabel:`Services`. In the :guilabel:`E-Invoice "
"Validation` section, click :guilabel:`Start Service`. Then, begin scanning "
"the invoices' QR codes."
msgstr ""
"進入應用程式後，點擊:guilabel:`服務`。在:guilabel:`電子發票驗證`部分，點"
"擊:guilabel:`啟動服務`。然後開始掃描發票的二維碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:471
msgid ""
