"請確認 :guilabel:`沙地阿拉伯 - 電子發票（簡化版）(l10n_sa_edi_pos)` 模組 "
":ref:`已安裝 <general/install>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:588
msgid ""
"PoS orders must be properly reported in compliance with ZATCA Phase 2. To do"
" so, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:590
msgid ""
"Onboard the :guilabel:`Invoices` default journal in the :ref:`PoS settings "
"<pos/use/settings>`:"
msgstr "將 :guilabel:`發票` 預設日記賬設定於 :ref:`POS 設定 <pos/use/settings>`："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:592
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Point of Sale --> Configuration --> Settings`. In the "
"yellow banner, select the relevant :guilabel:`Point of Sale`, then navigate "
"to the :guilabel:`Accounting` section."
msgstr ""
