":guilabel:`POS 銷售點`，然後前往 :guilabel:`會計` 部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/saudi_arabia.rst:595
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Default Journals` section, find the :guilabel:`Invoices` "
