#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:130
msgid "Standard taxable domestic purchases. The input VAT is deductible."
msgstr "標準應課稅本地採購。進項增值稅可予扣減。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:131
msgid ":guilabel:`10% FA`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:132
msgid ""
"Purchases of fixed assets, such as machinery or vehicles, reported "
"separately from other purchases. The input VAT is deductible."
msgstr "購買機械或車輛等固定資產，須與其他採購分開申報。進項增值稅可予扣減。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:134
msgid ":guilabel:`10% ND`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`10% ND`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:135
msgid ""
"Purchases for which the input VAT is not deductible, such as entertainment "
"expenses. The VAT is added to the cost of the expense instead of being "
"recorded as receivable."
msgstr ""
"進項增值稅不可扣減的採購項目（例如應酬費）。有關增值稅會計入開支成本，而不會"
"入賬為應收款項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:137
msgid ":guilabel:`10% FA ND`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`10% FA ND`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:138
msgid ""
"Purchases of fixed assets for which the input VAT is not deductible, such as"
" non-business passenger cars. The VAT is added to the cost of the asset."
msgstr ""
"購買進項增值稅不可扣減的固定資產，例如非商業用途的客車。該增值稅會計入資產成"
"本中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:141
msgid "Zero-rated purchases, such as purchases under a local letter of credit"
msgstr "零稅率採購，例如透過本地信用證進行的採購"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:143
msgid "Purchases of tax-exempt goods, supported by a tax-exempt invoice"
msgstr "購買免稅貨品，並附有免稅發票"

