msgid ":guilabel:`10% IM (Tax Only)`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`10% IM（僅稅項）`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:145
msgid ""
"Import tax invoices issued by customs. Only the 10% VAT is recorded as "
"payable, as the base amount is deducted from the total of the bill."
msgstr ""
"海關發出的進口稅發票。由於基本金額會從賬單總額中扣除，因此只有 10% 的增值稅會"
"記錄為應付款項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:147
msgid ":guilabel:`4% DP`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`4% DP`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:148
msgid ""
"**Deemed input tax**: purchases of exempt agricultural, livestock, or "
"fishery products used to supply taxable goods or services. The deductible "
"input VAT is extracted from the price at the rate of 4/104."
msgstr ""
"**視同進項稅**：購入用於供應應課稅貨品或服務的豁免農業、畜牧業或漁業產品。可"
"扣減進項增值稅按 4/104 的比率從價格中提取。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:151
msgid ":guilabel:`3% RP`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`3% RP`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:152
msgid ""
"Purchases of recycled waste or used goods from non-business persons. The "
"deductible input VAT is extracted from the price at the rate of 3/103."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:158
msgid "Deemed input tax at another rate"
msgstr "按其他稅率視同進項稅"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:160
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`4% DP` tax is provided as a sample for deemed input tax. To "
"create a deemed input tax at another statutory rate, follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"系統提供 :guilabel:`4% DP` 稅項作為視同進項稅的範例。若要按其他法定稅率建立視"
"同進項稅，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:163
msgid "Go to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Taxes`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:164
msgid "Open the :guilabel:`4% DP` tax."
msgstr "開啟 :guilabel:`4% DP` 稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:165
msgid ""
"Click the :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`(vertical ellipsis)` icon and "
"select :guilabel:`Duplicate`."
msgstr ""
"點擊 :icon:`fa-ellipsis-v` :guilabel:`（垂直省略號）` 圖示，然後選擇 "
":guilabel:`複製`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:167
msgid ""
"Update the :guilabel:`Tax Name` and the :guilabel:`Amount`, for example, `6`"
" for a 6/106 rate."
msgstr "更新:guilabel:`稅項名稱`和:guilabel:`金額`，例如將 6/106 稅率設為 `6`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:168
msgid ""
"Keep the tax grids unchanged, so that the amounts are reported with the "
"other deemed input purchases."
msgstr "保持稅務網格不變，以便將相關金額與其他視同進項採購一併申報。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:174
