#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:176
msgid ""
"A **simplified taxpayer** calculates VAT on the total price (supply value "
"and VAT), using the value-added rate of their industry. The following taxes "
"are inactive by default. To use them, :ref:`activate "
"<taxes/list_activation>` them from the list of taxes."
msgstr ""
"**簡易課稅人** 按總價（供應價值連增值稅）及所屬行業的增值稅率計算增值稅。以下"
"稅項預設為停用。如要使用，請在稅項清單中將其 :ref:`啟用 <taxes/"
"list_activation>`。"

