#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:203
msgid ""
"Each of these sales taxes computes 10% of the supply value. Only the share "
"that corresponds to the value-added rate is recorded as VAT payable, and the"
" rest is recorded as revenue."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:207
msgid ""
"For a retail sale with a supply value of 100,000 won, the :guilabel:`10% "
"RETAIL` tax computes 10,000 won. The VAT payable is 1,650 won (110,000 × 15%"
" × 10%), and the remaining 8,350 won is recorded as revenue."
msgstr ""
"若零售交易的供應價值為 100,000 韓元，:guilabel:`10% RETAIL` 稅項會計算出 "
"10,000 韓元。應繳增值稅為 1,650 韓元（110,000 × 15% × 10%），其餘 8,350 韓元"
"則記錄為收入。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:211
msgid ""
"For purchases, use the :guilabel:`10% Simplified` tax. A simplified taxpayer"
" can only deduct 0.5% of the total price of purchases supported by a tax "
"invoice, a credit card slip, or a cash receipt. This tax records 5.5% of the"
" VAT as deductible, which equals 0.5% of the total price. The remaining VAT "
"is added to the cost of the expense or asset."
msgstr ""
"對於採購項目，請使用 :guilabel:`10% 簡易` 稅項。簡易納稅人僅可扣減附有稅務發"
"票、信用卡簽賬單或現金收據的採購總價之 0.5%。此稅項會將增值稅的 5.5% 記錄為可"
"扣減稅額，相等於總價的 0.5%。其餘增值稅則會加入開支或資產的成本。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:217
msgid ""
"Simplified taxpayers must use :guilabel:`10% Simplified` for purchases of "
"fixed assets, instead of :guilabel:`10% FA`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:219
msgid ""
"For purchases with non-deductible input VAT, continue using :guilabel:`10% "
"ND` or :guilabel:`10% FA ND`."
msgstr ""
"對於不可扣抵進項增值稅的採購，請繼續使用 :guilabel:`10% ND` 或 "
":guilabel:`10% FA ND`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:221
msgid ""
"Simplified taxpayers must also use the :ref:`VAT Return (Simplified "
"Taxpayer) <localizations/south_korea/accounting/tax_report>`."
msgstr ""

