"input, and recycled purchase taxes are only available with this fiscal "
"position."
msgstr "標準本地交易。固定資產、不可抵扣、視同進項及回收採購稅僅適用於此財政狀況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:242
msgid ":guilabel:`Overseas (Export/Import)`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:243
msgid "Yes, for foreign partners"
msgstr "是，適用於外國合作夥伴"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:244
msgid ""
"Exports and imports. Sales taxes are set to :guilabel:`0%`, and purchase "
"taxes to :guilabel:`Exempt`. The :guilabel:`10% IM (Tax Only)` tax is "
"available for import tax invoices."
msgstr ""
"進出口貿易。銷項稅設為 :guilabel:`0%`，進項稅則設為 :guilabel:`豁"
"免`。:guilabel:`10% IM（僅限稅項）` 稅項可用於進口稅務發票。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:247
msgid ":guilabel:`Indirect Export`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:249
msgid ""
"Zero-rated domestic transactions, such as supplies under a local letter of "
"credit or a purchase confirmation. Taxes are set to :guilabel:`0%`."
msgstr ""
"零稅率本地交易，例如根據本地信用證或採購確認書進行的供應。稅率設為 "
":guilabel:`0%`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:251
msgid ":guilabel:`Domestic Exempt`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:253
msgid "VAT-exempt domestic transactions. Taxes are set to :guilabel:`Exempt`."
msgstr "免徵增值稅的本地交易。稅項設為 :guilabel:`免稅`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:266
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Address`: When the :guilabel:`Country` is South Korea, the "
"address fields follow the Korean address format, in the following order:"
