msgstr ":guilabel:`街道 2`：道路名稱及大廈門牌號碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:274
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Street`: The apartment or building name, and the unit details, "
"such as the building (-dong) and floor."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:276
msgid ":guilabel:`Zip Code`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`郵遞區號`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:278
msgid ""
":guilabel:`BRN`: Business registration number, the 10-digit number issued by"
" the National Tax Service to identify a business for tax purposes, for "
"example, `123-45-67890`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`BRN`：商業登記號碼，即國稅廳（National Tax Service）簽發的 10 位數"
