#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:281
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Invoicing` tab, under the :guilabel:`Customer Invoices` "
"section, select the contact's default :ref:`Proof of Issuance "
"<localizations/south_korea/proof_of_issuance>`. It automatically applies to "
"their sales orders, invoices, and bills."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`開立發票` 分頁的 :guilabel:`客戶發票` 區域下，選擇聯絡人的預設 "
":ref:`開立證明 <localizations/south_korea/proof_of_issuance>`。該設定會自動套"
"用至其銷售訂單、發票及賬單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:293
msgid "Proof of issuance"
msgstr "簽發證明"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:295
msgid ""
"A **proof of issuance** is the government-verified document that supports a "
"transaction, such as a tax invoice or a cash receipt. It determines in which"
" box of the :ref:`VAT report "
"<localizations/south_korea/accounting/tax_report>` the transaction is "
"reported."
msgstr ""
"**開立證明**是經政府核實、用以支持交易的文件，例如稅務發票或現金收據。它會決"
"定該筆交易在 :ref:`增值稅報告 <localizations/south_korea/accounting/"
"tax_report>` 中的哪一個欄目申報。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:299
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Proof of Issuance` field is displayed on invoices and bills, "
"and is filled in by default from the :ref:`contact "
"<localizations/south_korea/contacts>`. The following options are available:"
msgstr ""
"發票及賬單上會顯示 :guilabel:`開立證明` 欄位，預設從 :ref:`聯絡人 "
"<localizations/south_korea/contacts>` 填入。可用選項如下："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:303
msgid ":guilabel:`Tax Invoice`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`稅務發票`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:304
msgid ":guilabel:`Tax-exempt Invoice`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`免稅發票`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:305
msgid ":guilabel:`Credit Card`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`信用卡`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:306
msgid ":guilabel:`Cash Receipt`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`現金收據`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:307
msgid ":guilabel:`Other`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`其他`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:308
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Invoice issued by Purchaser`: only available on invoices and "
"bills, not as a default on contacts."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`由買方開立的稅務發票`：僅適用於客戶發票及供應商賬單，不可設為聯絡"
"人的預設選項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:311
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Other Info` tab of an invoice or bill, enter the "
":guilabel:`e-Document Number`: the approval number given by HomeTax or the "
"payment provider. It has 24 digits for e-tax invoices, and 9 digits for cash"
" receipts."
msgstr ""
"在發票或賬單的 :guilabel:`其他資訊` 分頁中，輸入 :guilabel:`電子文件編號`，即"
"由 HomeTax 或付款服務供應商提供的批准編號。電子稅務發票為 24 位數字，現金收據"
"則為 9 位數字。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:316
msgid ""
"Invoices or bills without proof of issuance cannot be reported in the "
"correct VAT box. In this case, the :ref:`VAT report "
"<localizations/south_korea/accounting/tax_report>` displays a warning "
"banner. Click the link within the warning to display the list of unassigned "
"documents."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:325
msgid ""
"To access the South Korean VAT reports, go to :menuselection:`Accounting -->"
" Reporting --> Tax Report`, and select one of the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:328
msgid ":guilabel:`VAT Report - General Taxpayer`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:329
msgid ":guilabel:`VAT Report - Simplified Taxpayer`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`增值稅報告 - 簡易納稅人`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/south_korea.rst:332
msgid ""
"The reports are automatically filled in from the taxes and tax grids applied"
" to transactions, and the total lines are calculated. Amounts that cannot be"
" computed must be entered manually by clicking the :icon:`fa-pencil` "
":guilabel:`(pencil)` icon next to the amount."
msgstr ""
"報告會根據套用於交易的稅項及稅務網格自動填寫，並計算總計項目。無法自動計算的"
"金額必須手動輸入，方法為點擊金額旁邊的 :icon:`fa-pencil` :guilabel:`（鉛筆"
"）` 圖示。"

