#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:286
msgid ""
"e-Invoice/e-Archive is a government-approved digital invoice system that "
"replaces traditional paper invoices, allowing businesses to issue, transmit,"
" and store invoices electronically in compliance with Turkish tax "
"regulations. While e-Invoices are for customers who are registered with the "
"|GİB|, e-Archives can be sent to customers who are not registered with the "
"|GİB|, ensuring senders can comply with government regulations even when "
"dealing with foreign customers or B2C workflows."
msgstr ""
"電子發票／電子存檔（e-Invoice/e-Archive）是一套經政府認可的數碼發票系統，用以"
"取代傳統紙本發票，讓企業能以電子方式開立、傳送及儲存發票，從而符合土耳其稅務"
"法規。電子發票（e-Invoice）適用於已在 |GİB| 註冊的客戶，而電子存檔（e-Archive"
"）則可發送給尚未在 |GİB| 註冊的客戶，確保發票開立者在處理海外客戶或 B2C 業務"
"流程時，亦能遵守政府規定。"

