"The e-Dispatch is an electronic document that replaces traditional paper "
"delivery notes, allowing businesses to digitally issue, transmit, and track "
"shipment details for goods in transit. In Odoo, users can generate "
"e-Dispatch documents as XML and upload them through the Nilvera integration,"
" ensuring compliant and traceable delivery operations."
msgstr ""
"電子發運單（e-Dispatch）是一種電子文件，用以取代傳統紙本送貨單，讓企業能以數"
"碼方式簽發、傳送及追蹤運輸途中貨物的運送詳情。在 Odoo 中，用戶可將電子發運單"
"生成為 XML 檔案，並透過 Nilvera 整合功能上載，確保送貨運作合規且可追溯。"

