"Open the **Inventory** app, and go to :menuselection:`Operations --> "
"Receipts`."
msgstr "開啟**庫存**應用程式，並前往:menuselection:`作業 --> 收貨`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:411
msgid ""
