#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:423
msgid "Mandatory compliance information"
msgstr "強制性合規資訊"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:425
msgid ""
"The following rules are mandatory for all users of the Türkiye localization "
"integration. Compliance with these requirements is essential for the legal "
"validity of e-Documents issued through the |GİB| via Nilvera."
msgstr ""
"所有使用土耳其本地化整合功能的用戶，必須遵守以下規則。為確保透過 Nilvera 經 "
"|GİB| 簽發的電子單據具有法律效力，必須符合這些要求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:430
msgid "Document numbering structure"
msgstr "單據編號結構"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:432
msgid ""
"All generated invoices and dispatch documents must follow a specific "
"numbering structure: `three alphanumeric characters` + `document year` + "
"`sequential number`."
msgstr ""
"所有產生的發票及發貨單據均須遵循特定的編號結構：`三個英數字元` + `單據年份` "
"+ `順序編號`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:436
msgid "INV/2025/00001"
msgstr "INV/2025/00001"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:438
msgid ""
"The numbering must be unique, sequential, and continuous. Each document must"
" have a distinct identifier."
msgstr "編號必須唯一、順序且連續。每份文件必須擁有不同的識別碼。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:441
msgid ""
"Once a file has been submitted, even if it returns an error, the same "
"sequence number cannot be used; a new document must be created."
msgstr "檔案一經提交，即使傳回錯誤，亦不可再使用相同的序號；必須建立新文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:445
msgid ":doc:`../accounting/customer_invoices/sequence`"
msgstr ":doc:`../accounting/customer_invoices/sequence`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:446
msgid ":doc:`../accounting/vendor_bills/sequence`"
msgstr ":doc:`../accounting/vendor_bills/sequence`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:449
msgid "e-Dispatch numbering structure"
msgstr "e-Dispatch 編號結構"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:451
msgid ""
"To access the e-Dispatch numbering structure, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Inventory --> Configuration --> Operation Types`, then "
"select an operation matching the :guilabel:`Delivery Orders` type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:455
msgid ""
"An arbitrary alphanumerical :guilabel:`Sequence Prefix` can be set. The "
"system uses only the last three characters of that prefix. The prefix must "
"contain at least three characters; any shorter prefix is automatically "
"denied by the system."
msgstr ""
"可設定任意字母數字的 :guilabel:`序列前綴`。系統只會使用該前綴的最後三個字元。"
"前綴必須包含至少三個字元；任何較短的前綴都會被系統自動拒絕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:460
msgid "In the sequence WH/OUT/948224, the system will only send **224**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:463
msgid ""
"You can preview the sequence by going to :menuselection:`Inventory --> "
"Configuration --> Operation Types --> Delivery Orders`. Once the sequencing "
"is configured, the banner at the top shows a preview:"
msgstr ""
"您可以前往 :menuselection:`庫存 --> 配置 --> 作業類型 --> 送貨單` 預覽編號序"
"列。設定好編號序列後，頂部橫幅會顯示預覽："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:467
msgid "Banner preview of sequencing of e-Dispatch."
msgstr "電子送貨單編號順序的橫幅預覽。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:471
msgid "Sequential number gaps"
msgstr "連續編號缺漏"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:473
msgid ""
"If a sequence number is skipped, the previous missing numbers must be issued"
" within 7 days."
msgstr "如果跳過了某個序號，先前遺漏的編號必須在 7 天內補發。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:476
msgid ""
"If INV/2025/00002 is issued before INV/2025/00001, INV/2025/00001 must be "
"issued within 7 days."
msgstr ""
"如果 INV/2025/00002 在 INV/2025/00001 之前開立，則必須在 7 天內開立 INV/2025/"
"00001。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:478
msgid "No sequence number can remain unissued beyond this period."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:481
msgid "Discount rules"
msgstr "折扣規則"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:483
msgid ""
"Global discounts (discounts shown as a separate invoice line) cannot be "
"issued. All discounts must be applied at the product line level within the "
"invoice."
msgstr ""
"無法開立整體折扣（即作為獨立發票明細行顯示的折扣）。所有折扣必須套用至發票內"
"的產品明細行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:487
msgid "e-Ledger compliance"
msgstr "電子分類賬合規"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:489
msgid ""
"The first issued invoice must represent the opening balance for the "
"accounting period. All subsequent invoices must follow the sequential "
"numbering pattern."
msgstr ""
"首張發出的發票必須代表該會計期間的期初餘額。其後所有發票均須遵循連續編號模式"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:493
msgid "INV/2025/00001, INV/2025/00002, INV/2025/00003, etc."
msgstr "INV/2025/00001、INV/2025/00002、INV/2025/00003 等。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:495
msgid ""
"Sequential numbering must be maintained consistently across the e-Ledger to "
"ensure data integrity and compliance."
msgstr "必須在整個電子分類賬中保持一致的順序編號，以確保資料完整性及合規性。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:499
msgid "Nilvera e-Invoice subscriptions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:502
msgid ""
"Turkish e-Invoice law permits only one date range per invoice, at the header"
" level, not per individual line item. Therefore, items with different "
"subscription date ranges cannot be mixed on the same invoice. However, an "
"item with a subscription date range can be mixed with items that that have "
"no date range at all."
msgstr ""
"土耳其電子發票法例規定每張發票只可使用一個日期範圍，且設於發票頁首層級，而非"
"個別明細項目層級。因此，具有不同訂閱日期範圍的項目不可混合於同一張發票中。不"
"過，設有訂閱日期範圍的項目可與完全沒有日期範圍的項目混合。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:507
msgid ""
"If the invoice is generated from the subscription order in the "
":doc:`Subscriptions <../../sales/subscriptions>` app, the subscription "
"order's date is used as the invoice's date, at the header level."
msgstr ""
"如果發票是由:doc:`訂閱 <../../sales/subscriptions>`應用程式中的訂閱訂單產生，"
"發票標頭層級的日期將會使用該訂閱訂單的日期。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:511
msgid "Subscription dates must match across lines."
msgstr "各資料行的訂閱日期必須一致。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:514
msgid "Manage Commercial Invoices"
msgstr "管理商業發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:516
msgid ""
"Commercial invoice scenarios are managed in the **Accounting** app through "
":menuselection:`Customers --> Invoices` for outgoing invoices and "
":menuselection:`Vendors --> Bills` for incoming vendor bills."
msgstr ""
"商業發票情境會在 **會計** 應用程式中管理，對外發票透過 :menuselection:`客"
"戶 --> 發票` 處理，收到的供應商帳單則透過 :menuselection:`供應商 --> 帳單` 處"
"理。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:521
msgid "Outgoing commercial invoices"
msgstr "對外商業發票"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:523
msgid ""
"On a draft (non-posted) invoice, select a scenario from the "
":guilabel:`Invoice Scenario` field and specify the type in the "
":guilabel:`Is` field. Depending on the selection, the :guilabel:`Exemption "
"Reason` field may become available. If applicable, enter an exemption "
"reason."
msgstr ""
"在草稿（未過賬）發票上，從 :guilabel:`發票情景` 欄位選擇情景，並在 "
":guilabel:`為` 欄位指定類型。視乎所選項目， :guilabel:`豁免原因` 欄位可能會顯"
"示。如適用，請輸入豁免原因。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:527
msgid ""
"Once a commercial scenario invoice is confirmed and sent, its "
":guilabel:`Nilvera Status` changes to :guilabel:`Waiting`. The customer must"
" then accept or reject the invoice on their end."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:530
msgid ""
"If the customer rejects the invoice, the rejection reason is logged in the "
"invoice chatter."
msgstr "若客戶拒絕發票，拒絕原因會記錄在發票對話欄中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:533
msgid ""
"|GİB| automatically accepts an invoice if the recipient does not accept or "
"reject it within **8 days** of reception."
msgstr ""
"|GİB| 會在收件人收到發票後 **8 天** 內未有接受或拒絕的情況下，自動接受該發票"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:535
msgid ""
"Accepted invoices display one of two statuses: - **Accepted**: Manually "
"accepted by the customer. - **Accepted Automatically**: Automatically "
"acknowledged by |GİB| under the 8-day rule."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:540
msgid "Incoming commercial bills"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:542
msgid ""
"The system automatically fetches incoming commercial bills from Nilvera and "
"creates corresponding draft bills in Odoo."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:545
msgid ""
"A status banner appears at the top of fetched bills with options to "
":guilabel:`Accept` or :guilabel:`Reject`:"
msgstr ""
"已擷取賬單的頂部會顯示狀態橫幅，提供 :guilabel:`接受` 或 :guilabel:`拒絕` 選"
"項："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:548
msgid ":guilabel:`Accept`: Validates the bill."
msgstr ":guilabel:`接受`：驗證賬單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/turkiye.rst:549
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Reject`: Opens a pop-up window requiring a rejection reason. "
"After clicking :guilabel:`Proceed`, the rejection response is sent to "
"Nilvera. **This action cannot be undone.**"
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`拒絕`：開啟彈出式視窗，要求輸入拒絕原因。點擊:guilabel:`繼續`後，"
"拒絕回覆會傳送至 Nilvera。**此操作無法復原。**"

