msgid ""
"The UAE :doc:`chart of accounts "
"<../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>` is aligned with :abbr:`IFRS "
"(International Financial Reporting Standards)` and :abbr:`FTA (Federal Tax "
"Authority)` tax requirements. This includes classified accounts for assets, "
"liabilities, equity, income, and expenses, as well as separate accounts for "
"VAT payable and VAT receivable."
msgstr ""
"阿聯酋:doc:`會計科目表 <../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>`符"
"合:abbr:`IFRS (國際財務報告準則)`及:abbr:`FTA (聯邦稅務局)`的稅務規定。當中包"
"括資產、負債、權益、收入及費用的分類科目，以及應付增值稅與應收增值稅的獨立科"
"目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:70
msgid ""
"This structure ensures compatibility with UAE reporting obligations, VAT, "
"and corporate income tax filings."
msgstr "此結構可確保符合阿聯酋的申報規定、增值稅及企業所得稅申報要求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:78
msgid ""
"The UAE localization includes preconfigured VAT rates and :doc:`taxes "
"<../accounting/taxes>` as defined by the :abbr:`FTA (Federal Tax "
"Authority)`:"
msgstr ""
"阿聯酋本地化功能包含預設的增值稅率及:doc:`稅項 <../accounting/taxes>`，均依"
"照:abbr:`FTA（聯邦稅務局）`的規定設定："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:0
msgid ""
"Standard VAT (5%): The prevailing VAT rate applied to most taxable goods and"
" services supplied within the UAE."
msgstr ""
"標準增值稅 (5%)：適用於在阿聯酋境內供應的大多數應課稅貨品及服務的現行增值稅稅"
"率。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:0
msgid ""
"The supplier charges 5% VAT on the sale (Output VAT). VAT-registered "
"businesses may generally recover the VAT paid on eligible business purchases"
" (Input VAT)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:0
msgid ""
"Zero-Rated VAT (0%): Taxable supplies on which VAT is applied at a rate of "
"0%."
msgstr "零稅率增值稅 (0%)：適用 0% 增值稅稅率的應課稅供應品。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:0
msgid ""
"No VAT is collected on the sale, but the supplier remains fully entitled to "
