#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:263
msgid "Invoice types"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:265
msgid "The type of invoice to be issued depends on the following criteria:"
msgstr "所開具發票的類型取決於以下條件："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:267
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Invoices (B2B)`: A :guilabel:`Tax Invoice`, used for "
"business-to-business transactions, contains all the details required for VAT"
" recovery, including the supplier and customer legal names, addresses, "
":abbr:`TRN (Tax Registration Number)` numbers (where applicable), itemized "
"VAT amounts, and total amounts. This is the standard document required when "
"a customer intends to reclaim VAT."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`稅務發票 (B2B)`：:guilabel:`稅務發票` 用於企業對企業 (B2B) 交易，"
"當中包含申請增值稅 (VAT) 退稅或抵扣所需的所有資料，包括供應商及客戶的法定名稱"
"、地址、:abbr:`TRN (稅務登記編號)` 編號（如適用）、分項增值稅金額及總金額。當"
"客戶打算申請退回或抵扣增值稅時，必須具備此標準文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:272
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Simplified Tax Invoices (B2C)`: A :guilabel:`Simplified Tax "
"Invoice` is primarily used for business-to-consumer (B2C) transactions, "
"where the customer is not expected to reclaim VAT. It contains reduced "
"customer information (customer :abbr:`TRN (Tax Registration Number)` is not "
"required), focusing instead on supplier details, VAT charged, and the total "
"amount payable."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`簡化稅務發票（B2C）`：:guilabel:`簡化稅務發票` 主要用於企業對消費"
"者（B2C）交易，而客戶一般不會申請退還增值稅。此類發票包含較精簡的客戶資料（毋"
"須填寫客戶 :abbr:`TRN（稅務登記編號）`），並重點列明供應商詳情、所徵收的增值"
"稅及應付總額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:278
msgid ""
"To create a :guilabel:`Tax Invoice` for a customer, fill in the "
":guilabel:`TRN` field on the customer contact form. If this field is left "
"empty, a :guilabel:`Simplified Tax Invoice` is generated instead."
msgstr ""
"若要為客戶建立 :guilabel:`稅務發票`，請在客戶聯絡人表格上填寫 "
":guilabel:`TRN` 欄位。如留空此欄位，系統將會改為產生 :guilabel:`簡化稅務發"
"票`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:281
msgid ""
"If the customer's :abbr:`TRN (Tax Registration Number)` is not available, "
"and a :guilabel:`Tax Invoice` is required, enter `N/A` in the "
":guilabel:`TRN` field on the contact form."
msgstr ""
"如果未能提供客戶的 :abbr:`TRN (稅務登記編號)`，而系統需要開立 :guilabel:`稅務"
"發票`，請在聯絡人表單的 :guilabel:`TRN` 欄位輸入 `N/A`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_arab_emirates.rst:285
msgid ""
"A :guilabel:`Simplified Tax Invoice` is still a legally valid tax invoice "
"under VAT law."
msgstr "根據增值稅法，:guilabel:`簡易稅務發票`仍屬具法律效力的稅務發票。"

