msgid ""
"Import your obligations HMRC, filter on the period you want to submit, and "
"send your tax report by clicking :guilabel:`Send to HMRC`."
msgstr ""
"匯入你的 HMRC 報稅義務，篩選要提交的期間，然後按一下:guilabel:`傳送至 HMRC`以"
"傳送稅務報表。"

