#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:116
msgid ""
"The :doc:`chart of accounts (COA) "
"<../accounting/get_started/chart_of_accounts>` for the United States "
"localization, in Odoo, follows the standard |GAAP| structure, with accounts "
"grouped into seven main categories, with corresponding numeric values that "
"prefix individual journal entries:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:126
msgid ""
"**Equity**: the amount of money that is returned to a company's shareholders"
" if all of the assets were liquidated and all of the company's debt was paid"
" off in the case of liquidation. Equity is indicated by the journal code "
"labeled (or beginning) with :guilabel:`3` or :guilabel:`9`."
msgstr ""
"**權益**：如公司在清盤時將所有資產變現並清償所有債務，退還予公司股東的金額。"
"權益會以標記為（或開首為） :guilabel:`3` 或 :guilabel:`9` 的日記賬代碼表示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:142
msgid ""
"Predefined accounts are included in Odoo, as part of the |CoA| that is "
"installed with the US localization package. The accounts listed below are "
"preconfigured to perform certain operations within Odoo. It is recommended "
"to **not** delete these accounts; however, if changes are needed, rename the"
" accounts instead."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 隨美國本地化套件安裝的 |CoA| 中包含預設會計科目。以下列出的科目已預先配"
"置，用於在 Odoo 內執行特定操作。建議**切勿**刪除這些科目；但如需更改，請改為"
"重新命名科目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Accumulated Retained Earnings`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:0
msgid ":guilabel:`Profit or Loss Appropriation`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`損益分配`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:183
msgid "View, edit, and sort accounts"
msgstr "檢視、編輯及排序賬戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:185
msgid ""
"Access the *Chart of Accounts* dashboard in Odoo by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Accounting app --> Configuration --> Accounting: Chart of "
"Accounts`. From the :guilabel:`Chart of Accounts` dashboard, create new "
"accounts by clicking the :guilabel:`New` button in the top-left corner of "
"the dashboard and :ref:`filling in the corresponding form <chart-of-"
"account/create>`. Search and sort through existing accounts by using "
"specific :guilabel:`Filters` and :guilabel:`Group By` criteria, which are "
"available in the search drop-down menu."
msgstr ""
"前往 :menuselection:`會計應用程式 --> 配置 --> 會計：會計科目表` ，即可存取 "
"Odoo 的 *會計科目表* 儀表板。在 :guilabel:`會計科目表` 儀表板中，點擊左上角"
"的 :guilabel:`新增` 按鈕並 :ref:`填寫相應表格 <chart-of-account/create>` ，即"
"可建立新會計科目。你亦可使用搜尋下拉式選單中的特定 :guilabel:`篩選` 及 "
":guilabel:`分組方式` 條件，搜尋和排序現有會計科目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:192
msgid ""
"To filter accounts by category, click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` "
":guilabel:`(dropdown)` icon to access the drop-down menu and look under the "
":guilabel:`Filters` column for individual selections. Clicking on a specific"
" category will only show accounts that match that particular filter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:196
msgid ""
"To view all the available account types, remove all of the filters in the "
"search bar, and then click the :icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`(dropdown)` "
"icon to access the drop-down menu. From there, select :guilabel:`Account "
"Type` under the :guilabel:`Group By` column heading to list all of the "
"account types in the table."
msgstr ""
"要查看所有可用的會計科目類型，請移除搜尋列中的所有篩選條件，然後點擊 "
":icon:`fa-caret-down` :guilabel:`（下拉選單）` 圖示以開啟下拉式選單。接著，"
"在 :guilabel:`科目類型` 下選擇 :guilabel:`分組依據` 欄標題，以在表格中列出所"
"有會計科目類型。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:201
msgid "Chart of Accounts grouped by Account Type."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:204
msgid ""
"Besides structure, there are other key differences in the chart of accounts "
"in the United States, compared to other countries:"
msgstr "除結構外，美國的會計科目表與其他國家相比，還有其他主要差異："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:207
msgid ""
"**Specificity**: US |GAAP| often requires more detailed accounts compared to"
" some other countries. This can include separate accounts for various types "
"of revenue, expenses, and assets, providing more granular information in "
"financial reports."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:210
msgid ""
"**Regulatory Requirements**: In the United States, there are specific "
"regulatory requirements set by bodies such as the |SEC| for publicly traded "
"companies. These requirements may influence the structure and content of the"
" |COA| to ensure compliance with reporting standards."
msgstr ""
"**監管要求**：在美國，上市公司須遵守由 |SEC| 等機構訂立的特定監管要求。這些要"
"求可能會影響 |COA| 的結構及內容，以確保符合申報標準。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:213
msgid ""
"**Industry Practices**: Certain industries in the United States may have "
"unique accounting requirements or specialized |COA| structures. For example,"
" financial institutions often have specific accounts related to loans, "
"investments, and interest income."
msgstr ""
"**行業慣例**：美國的某些行業可能有獨特的會計要求或專門的|COA|結構。例如，金融"
"機構通常有與貸款、投資及利息收入相關的特定賬戶。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:216
msgid ""
"**Tax Considerations**: The |COA| may also reflect tax considerations, such "
"as accounts for deductible expenses, deferred tax assets, and liabilities, "
"to ensure compliance with tax laws and facilitate tax reporting."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:220
msgid ""
"These differences, ultimately, should be reflected in the |COA| structure "
"itself, with the addition of new accounts, as needed, in order to meet the "
"demands of US accounting reporting requirements."
msgstr ""
"這些差異最終應反映在 |COA| 結構本身，並根據需要新增賬戶，以符合美國會計申報要"
"求。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:224
msgid ":ref:`Create a new account <chart-of-account/create>`"
msgstr ":ref:`建立新會計科目 <chart-of-account/create>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:232
msgid ""
"In the United States, tax rates and what is considered taxable vary by "
"jurisdiction. Default *sales* and *purchase* taxes are created automatically"
" when the Odoo **Accounting** app is installed. To manage existing or "
"configure additional taxes, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Configuration --> Taxes`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:240
msgid "US tax configuration"
msgstr "美國稅項設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:242
msgid ""
"US taxes are categorized by jurisdiction and linked to their exempt and "
"nontaxable variations. The :ref:`tax report <l10n_us/tax-report>` uses these"
" settings to group taxes by jurisdiction, rather than by tax group."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:246
msgid ""
"To configure a tax, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration"
" --> Taxes`, and open the tax record. Then, open the :guilabel:`Advanced "
"Options` tab. The :guilabel:`US` section contains the following fields:"
msgstr ""
"要設定稅項，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 設定 --> 稅項`，並開啟該稅項記錄"
"。然後，開啟 :guilabel:`進階選項` 分頁。:guilabel:`美國` 區域包含以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:250
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Jurisdiction Type`: Categorizes the tax level as "
":guilabel:`State`, :guilabel:`County`, :guilabel:`City`, or "
":guilabel:`Special`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`管轄區類型`：將稅項層級分類為 "
":guilabel:`州`、:guilabel:`縣`、:guilabel:`市` 或 :guilabel:`特別`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:253
msgid ""
":guilabel:`State`: The state associated with the tax. This field appears and"
" is required once a :guilabel:`Jurisdiction Type` is selected, as the tax "
"report is organized by state."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:255
msgid ""
":guilabel:`County`: The county associated with the tax. This field appears "
"and is required when the :guilabel:`Jurisdiction Type` is "
":guilabel:`County`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:257
msgid ""
":guilabel:`City`: The city associated with the tax. This field appears and "
"is required when the :guilabel:`Jurisdiction Type` is :guilabel:`City`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`城市`：與該稅項相關聯的城市。當 :guilabel:`管轄區類型` 為 "
":guilabel:`城市` 時，此欄位才會顯示並為必填項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:260
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Exempt Tax`: Maps the linked tax records designated as tax-exempt"
" (e.g., `CA State 6% Exempt`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:262
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Nontaxable Tax`: Maps the linked tax records with their "
"nontaxable or reduced-rate counterpart (e.g., `CA State 6% Non-Taxable`)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`免稅稅項`：將已連結的稅項記錄對應至其免稅或減稅率項目（例如：`CA "
"State 6% Non-Taxable`）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:265
msgid ""
"Associating taxes with their exempt and nontaxable variations provides "
"better organization and shows how much tax should be paid or declared as "
"taxable base."
msgstr ""
"將稅項與其免稅及非應稅項目關聯，有助更清晰地分類管理，並顯示應繳稅額或須申報"
"的應稅基準。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:268
msgid ""
"US section of a tax's Advanced Options tab with a jurisdiction and exempt and nontaxable\n"
"taxes."
msgstr ""
"稅項「進階選項」分頁中的美國區段，當中設有司法管轄區以及豁免及非應稅\n"
"稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:273
msgid ""
"When using :ref:`AvaTax <l10n_us/taxes-avatax>`, most fields in the "
":guilabel:`US` section (:guilabel:`Jurisdiction Type`, :guilabel:`State`, "
":guilabel:`Exempt Tax`, and :guilabel:`Nontaxable Tax`) are populated "
"automatically, requiring minimal manual setup."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:277
msgid ""
"Since AvaTax tax rates can be shared between counties and cities, AvaTax "
"does not set the :guilabel:`County` or :guilabel:`City` fields. Set them "
"manually where applicable."
msgstr ""
"由於 AvaTax 稅率可能在縣與城市之間共用，因此 AvaTax 不會設"
"定:guilabel:`縣`或:guilabel:`城市`欄位。如有需要，請手動設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:285
msgid ""
"**Avalara AvaTax** is a cloud-based tax calculation and compliance software "
"that integrates with Odoo for several localizations. Integrating AvaTax with"
" Odoo provides real-time and region-specific tax calculations when items are"
" sold, purchased, and invoiced in the database."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:290
msgid ""
"AvaTax is available for integration with databases/companies that have "
"locations in the United States and Canada. Reference the "
":ref:`accounting/avalara/fiscal_country` documentation for more information."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:294
msgid ""
"When using AvaTax, most of the :ref:`US tax configuration <l10n_us/taxes-"
"configuration>` fields used by the :ref:`tax report <l10n_us/tax-report>` "
"are populated automatically."
msgstr ""
"使用 AvaTax 時，大部分在 :ref:`美國稅項配置 <l10n_us/taxes-configuration>` 中"
"供 :ref:`稅務報告 <l10n_us/tax-report>` 使用的欄位都會自動填寫。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:304
msgid ""
"`US Tax Compliance: AvaTax elearning video "
"<https://www.odoo.com/slides/slide/us-tax-compliance-"
"avatax-2858?fullscreen=1>`_"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:312
msgid ""
"In addition to the :doc:`generic reports <../accounting/reporting>`, the "
"following reports are available for the US localization under the "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting` menu:"
msgstr ""
"除了 :doc:`通用報表 <../accounting/reporting>` 之外，美國本地化方案亦在 "
":menuselection:`會計 --> 報表` 選單中提供以下報表："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:315
msgid ""
":ref:`Check Register <l10n_us/optional-modules>`: A report displaying cash "
"transactions (regardless of the journal) with their running balance after "
"the transaction."
msgstr ""
":ref:`支票登記冊 <l10n_us/optional-modules>`：顯示現金交易（不論所屬日記帳）"
"及交易後累計結餘的報表。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:317
msgid ""
":ref:`Profit and Loss <l10n_us/profit-loss-statement>`: The generic |P&L| "
"statement, with labels modified to conform to |GAAP| standards."
msgstr ""
":ref:`損益表 <l10n_us/profit-loss-statement>`：通用的 |P&L| 報表，當中的標籤"
"已按 |GAAP| 標準作出調整。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:319
msgid ""
":ref:`Cash Flow Statement <l10n_us/cash-flow-statement>`: A report of actual"
" cash inflows and outflows from the company's operations, compiled using the"
" direct cash flow method."
msgstr ""
":ref:`現金流量表 <l10n_us/cash-flow-statement>`：反映公司營運實際現金流入及流"
"出的報表，採用直接現金流量法編製。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:321
msgid ""
":ref:`Tax Report (US) <l10n_us/tax-report>`: An overview of US tax "
"obligations, organized by jurisdiction, with a breakdown of exempt, "
"nontaxable, and taxable amounts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:323
msgid ""
":ref:`1099 Report <l10n_us/1099-report>`: A CSV download of payments made to"
" non-employees in a period to file electronically in a third-party service."
msgstr ""
":ref:`1099 報表 <l10n_us/1099-report>`：下載某段期間內支付給非僱員款項的 CSV "
"檔案，以便透過第三方服務進行電子申報。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:329
msgid ":ref:`Cash basis reporting <accounting/cash-basis/report-filter>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:336
msgid ""
"To view the Profit and Loss (P&L) statement, navigate to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting --> Profit and Loss`. To conform to"
" |GAAP| standards and facilitate migration from other US accounting "
"software, the labels for the generic |P&L| statement are modified for the US"
" localization. The structure and formulas in this :doc:`custom report "
"<../accounting/reporting/customize>` are identical to the generic report."
msgstr ""
"要檢視損益表（P&L），請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 報表 --> 損益表`。為符"
