#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:378
msgid ""
"European accounting frameworks include appropriation of profit in the "
"generic |P&L| statement. Under |GAAP|, the |P&L| statement summarizes "
"performance only. As a result, the US report does not include *Allocations "
"and Withdrawals*."
msgstr ""
"歐洲會計準則會在通用 |P&L| 報表中包含利潤分配。根據 |GAAP|，|P&L| 報表僅總結"
"營運表現。因此，美國報表不包含*分配及提取*。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:387
msgid ""
"Navigate to the *Cash Flow Statement* (CFS) dashboard by going to "
":menuselection:`Accounting app --> Reporting --> Statement Reports: Cash "
"Flow Statement`. From here, |CFS| reports can be generated using the various"
" :ref:`filters <accounting/reporting/filters>` that are available at the top"
" of the dashboard."
msgstr ""
"要開啟 *現金流量表* (CFS) 儀表板，請前往 :menuselection:`會計應用程式 --> 報"
"表 --> 財務報表：現金流量表`。你可在此產生 |CFS| 報表，並使用儀表板頂部提供的"
"各種 :ref:`篩選條件 <accounting/reporting/filters>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:392
msgid ""
"Odoo uses the *direct* cash flow method to compile cash flow statements, "
"which measures actual cash inflows and outflows from the company's "
"operations, such as when cash is received from customers or when cash "
"payments are made to suppliers."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 使用 *直接* 現金流量法編製現金流量表，用以衡量公司營運的實際現金流入和流"
"出，例如向客戶收取現金或向供應商支付款項的情況。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:396
msgid ""
"By default, an account labeled with any of the three default "
":guilabel:`Tags` on the :guilabel:`Chart of Accounts` dashboard is included "
"in the report, which includes: :guilabel:`Operating Activities`, "
":guilabel:`Financing Activities`, and :guilabel:`Investing & Extraordinary "
"Activities`."
msgstr ""
"預設情況下，帳戶只要標有三個預設:guilabel:`標籤`（於:guilabel:`會計科目表`儀"
"表板中）之一，即會納入報表，當中包括：:guilabel:`營運活動`、:guilabel:`融資活"
"動`及:guilabel:`投資及非經常性活動`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:401
msgid ""
"Examples of tagged accounts that are included in the Cash Flow Statement in "
"Odoo."
msgstr "Odoo 現金流量表中所包含的已標記帳戶範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:404
msgid "Additionally, the cash flow statement in Odoo:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:406
msgid ""
"is limited to the *Bank* and *Cash* journals to reflect money coming in or "
"out; and"
msgstr "僅限於 *銀行* 及 *現金* 日記賬，以反映資金的流入或流出；以及"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:407
msgid ""
"also contains *Expenses* accounts, to show the counterpart transactions "
"versus *Bank* or *Cash* journal entries, while excluding |AR| and |AP| "
"activity."
msgstr ""
"亦包含 *開支* 賬戶，用於顯示與 *銀行* 或 *現金* 日記賬分錄相對應的交易，同時"
"排除 |AR| 及 |AP| 活動。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:411
msgid ""
"Create a vendor bill for $100, as an operating expense (not |AP|). Doing so "
"will **not** reflect a transaction on the cash flow statement. However, "
"register a corresponding payment for $100, and the transaction **will** "
"reflect on the cash flow statement as :guilabel:`Cash paid for operating "
"activities`."
msgstr ""
"建立一張金額為 $100 的供應商賬單，作為營運開支（而非 |AP|）。此操作**不會**在"
"現金流量表上反映為一筆交易。不過，若為該賬單登記一筆 $100 的相應付款，該交易"
"便**會**在現金流量表上反映為:guilabel:`營運活動所支付現金`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:416
msgid ""
"Example of a bill registered as an operating expense as part of a cash flow "
"statement."
msgstr "現金流量表中登記為營運開支的賬單範例。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:424
msgid ""
"The :guilabel:`Tax Report (US)` provides a comprehensive overview of US tax "
"obligations, organized by jurisdiction: state, county, city, and special. "
"While standard tax reporting tracks taxable bases and collected tax amounts,"
" this report also maps exempt and nontaxable amounts to present a complete "
"breakdown of gross sales and purchase activity:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:429
msgid "`Total Sales = Exempt + Non-Taxable + Taxable`"
msgstr "`總銷售額 = 免稅 + 非應稅 + 應稅`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:431
msgid ""
"The breakdown relies on the :ref:`US tax configuration <l10n_us/taxes-"
"configuration>` of each tax."
msgstr ""
"此明細分類取決於每項稅金的 :ref:`美國稅金設定 <l10n_us/taxes-configuration>"
"`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:433
msgid ""
"To open the report, navigate to :menuselection:`Accounting --> Reporting -->"
" Taxes & Fiscal: Tax Report`. In the :guilabel:`Report` selector, make sure "
":guilabel:`Tax Report (US)` is selected."
msgstr ""
"如要開啟報表，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 報表 --> 稅務與財務：稅務報"
"表`。在 :guilabel:`報表` 選擇器中，確保已選取 :guilabel:`稅務報表（美國）`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:436
msgid ""
"Tax Report (US) with sales and purchases grouped by state, showing exempt, nontaxable, and\n"
"taxable amounts."
msgstr ""
"稅務報表（美國），按州份分組列出銷售及採購，並顯示免稅、非應稅及\n"
"應稅金額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:441
msgid "Report structure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:443
msgid "Line items in the tax report are grouped by the following categories:"
msgstr "稅務報告中的明細項目按以下類別分組："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:445
msgid ""
"**Sales vs. purchases**: Line items are separated into :guilabel:`Sales` and"
" :guilabel:`Purchases` sections, each with its own total."
msgstr ""
"**銷售與採購**：明細項目分為 :guilabel:`銷售` 與 :guilabel:`採購` 兩個部分，"
"各自設有總計。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:447
msgid ""
"**Jurisdictions**: Line items are automatically grouped by state (e.g., "
"`California`, `Texas`), with the taxes of each child jurisdiction (county, "
"city, and special) grouped under the state. The subtotal for each state is "
"provided."
msgstr ""
"**管轄區**：明細項目會自動按州份（例如 `California`、`Texas`）分組，每個子管"
"轄區（縣、市及特別稅區）的稅項則歸入該州份之下，並提供各州份的小計。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:450
msgid ""
"**Undefined**: Unmapped taxes or transactions that are missing a "
"jurisdiction assignment, grouped for reconciliation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:456
msgid "Each line item in the tax report contains the following columns:"
msgstr "稅務報表中的每個細項均包含以下欄位："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:458
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Total Sales`: The total gross volume, calculated as "
":guilabel:`Exempt` + :guilabel:`Non-Taxable` + :guilabel:`Taxable`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`銷售總額`：總營業額，計算方式為 :guilabel:`免稅` + :guilabel:`非應"
"稅` + :guilabel:`應稅`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:460
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Exempt`: Transactions categorized under exempt tax mappings. "
"These are usually linked to customers that have an exemption certificate "
"granted by the state or another institution (e.g., nonprofit and charitable "
"organizations)."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`豁免`：歸類為免稅對應項目的交易。這些交易通常與持有州政府或其他機"
"構（例如非牟利及慈善機構）頒發的免稅證明的客戶相關聯。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:463
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Non-Taxable`: Transactions categorized under nontaxable tax "
"mappings. For example, unprocessed groceries are free from tax in most "
"states."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`非應稅`：歸類為非應稅稅務映射的交易。例如，在大多數州份，未加工的"
"雜貨均免稅。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:465
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Taxable`: The net amount subject to tax, calculated as "
":guilabel:`Total Sales` - :guilabel:`Exempt` - :guilabel:`Non-Taxable`."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`應課稅`：需課稅的淨額，計算公式為 :guilabel:`總銷售額` - "
":guilabel:`豁免` - :guilabel:`非應課稅`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:467
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Tax Rate` and :guilabel:`Tax`: The applicable rate percentage and"
" the total tax collected or owed."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`稅率` 及 :guilabel:`稅項`：適用的稅率百分比，以及已收取或應付的稅"
"款總額。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:475
msgid ""
