"*Bank* journal that the company wishes to pay vendors with, a |NACHA| "
"configuration section needs to be filled out on the Odoo database."
msgstr ""
"Odoo 可產生符合美國全國自動票據交換所協會（NACHA）標準的 |ACH| 檔案，以傳送至"
"公司的銀行。對於公司希望用來向供應商付款的每個個別 *銀行* 日記賬，都需要在 "
"Odoo 資料庫中填寫 |NACHA| 設定部分。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:564
msgid ""
"First, navigate to the :menuselection:`Accounting app --> Configuration --> "
"Journals`. Open the bank journal and click into the :guilabel:`Outgoing "
"Payments` tab."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:567
msgid ""
"NACHA (National Automated Clearing House Association) configuration settings"
" on Odoo."
msgstr "Odoo 上的 NACHA（全國自動票據交換所協會）設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:571
msgid ""
"The following |NACHA| configuration information is normally provided by the "
"company's financial institution once they have been approved to send "
"payments via their account."
msgstr "當公司獲批准透過其帳戶發送付款時，其金融機構通常會提供以下 |NACHA| 設定資訊。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:574
msgid ""
"Under the section labeled, :guilabel:`NACHA configuration` are the fields "
"required to generate a |NACHA| compatible |ACH| file to send to a company's "
"bank. First, enter the routing number of the financial institution in the "
"field labeled, :guilabel:`Immediate Destination`. This information is widely"
" available on the Internet and generally varies by bank location. This "
"number is usually provided during the initial account setup."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:580
msgid ""
"Next, enter the registered name of the financial institution in the field "
"called, :guilabel:`Destination`. This information is provided by the bank or"
" credit union."
msgstr ""
"接著，在名為 :guilabel:`目的地` 的欄位中輸入該金融機構的註冊名稱。此資料由銀"
"行或信用合作社提供。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:583
msgid ""
"Following the :guilabel:`Destination` field is the :guilabel:`Immediate "
"Origin` field. Enter the 9-digit company ID or Employer Identification "
"Number (EIN) into this field. This information is provided by the financial "
"institution."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`目的地` 欄位之後是 :guilabel:`直接來源` 欄位。請在此欄位輸入 9 "
"位數字的公司識別碼或僱主識別號碼（EIN）。此資料由金融機構提供。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:587
msgid ""
"Next, enter the :guilabel:`Company Identification` number, which is a "
"10-digit number made from combining the 9-digit company ID or Employer "
"Identification Number (EIN), along with an additional number at the start of"
" the sequence. This number is often a `1`. Check with the financial "
"institution should this first number differ to verify that it is correct, as"
" this number is provided for |ACH| approved accounts."
msgstr ""
"接下來，輸入 :guilabel:`公司識別編號` 編號。該編號為 10 位數字，由 9 位數的公"
"司識別碼或僱主識別號碼（EIN）加上開頭的額外一位數字組成。該開頭數字通常為 "
"`1`。如果首個數字有所不同，請向金融機構查詢以核實是否正確，因為此編號是為 "
"|ACH| 核准賬戶提供的。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:593
msgid ""
"Enter the :guilabel:`Originating DFI Identification` number next, which "
"should contain an assigned 8-digit number from the financial institution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:597
msgid ""
"Enter the numerical values in this section *exactly* as the company's "
"financial institution (e.g. bank or credit union) has provided them, "
"otherwise risk failing a successful |NACHA| configuration in Odoo."
msgstr ""
"請 *完全* 按照公司金融機構（例如銀行或信用合作社）提供的數值輸入此部分的數字"
"，否則可能導致無法在 Odoo 成功完成 |NACHA| 設定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:601
msgid ""
"NACHA settings with the standard entry class code drop-down menu "
"highlighted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:604
msgid ""
"Two options are available for the next field: :guilabel:`Standard Entry "
"Class Code`. Select the drop-down menu to the right of the field and pick "
"either :guilabel:`Corporate Credit or Debit (CCD)` or :guilabel:`Prearranged"
" Payment and Deposit (PPD)`. Again, this information is provided by the "
"financial institution. By default :guilabel:`Corporate Credit or Debit "
"(CCD)` is selected."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:609
msgid ""
"Finally, the last option is for :guilabel:`Generated Balanced Files`. Tick "
"the checkbox to the right of the field to enable :guilabel:`Generated "
"Balanced Files`. Consult the company's accountant or financial adviser to "
"make an informed decision for this field."
msgstr ""
"最後一個選項為 :guilabel:`產生平衡檔案`。勾選欄位右側的核取方塊，即可啟用 "
":guilabel:`產生平衡檔案`。請諮詢公司的會計師或財務顧問，以就此欄位作出明智決"
"定。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:613
msgid ""
"Manually save the configuration by clicking the :icon:`fa-cloud-upload` "
":guilabel:`(cloud upload)` icon, or navigate away from this screen to auto-"
"save. The configuration is now complete."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:619
msgid "Create batch payment"
msgstr "建立批次付款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:621
msgid "Now, record each payment in Odoo using the |NACHA| payment method."
msgstr "現在，請在 Odoo 中使用 |NACHA| 付款方式記錄每筆付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:624
msgid ""
":ref:`Register Payments in Odoo <accounting/payments/from-invoice-bill>`"
msgstr ":ref:`在 Odoo 登記付款 <accounting/payments/from-invoice-bill>`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:627
msgid ""
"Be aware of the cut-off time for same-day payments. Either the file needs to"
" have a future date associated with each payment or the file needs to be "
"sent prior to the cut-off, if the dates included in it match today's date. "
"Consult the financial institution for the exact cut-off time for their "
"processing of same-day payments."
msgstr ""
"請留意即日付款的截止時間。檔案中的每筆付款必須關聯未來日期；若檔案包含的日期"
"與今日日期相同，則必須於截止時間前傳送該檔案。請向金融機構查詢其處理即日付款"
"的確切截止時間。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:632
msgid ""
"Once all the payments to be included in the |NACHA| |ACH| file have been "
"made, a batch payment needs to be made from the :icon:`fa-cog` "
":guilabel:`Action` menu."
msgstr ""
"完成所有要納入 |NACHA| |ACH| 檔案的付款後，需從 :icon:`fa-cog` :guilabel:`操"
"作` 選單建立批次付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:635
msgid ""
"To create the batch payments, access the payments page, by navigating to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Vendors --> Payments`. Select all the "
"payments that should be included in the |NACHA| |ACH| file, by ticking the "
"checkboxes to the far-left of the rows."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:639
msgid ""
"On the payments screen, the action menu is highlighted with create a batch payment\n"
"selected."
msgstr ""
"在付款畫面上，操作選單已突出顯示，並已選取\n"
"建立批次付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:644
msgid ""
"All payments in the batch **must** share the same |NACHA| payment method."
msgstr "批次中的所有付款**必須**使用相同的 |NACHA| 付款方式。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:646
msgid ""
"Next, navigate to the batched payment (:menuselection:`Accounting --> "
"Vendors --> Batch Payments`). Click into the payment recently created and "
"then click into the :guilabel:`Exported File` tab. The generated file is "
"listed with the :guilabel:`Generation Date`. Click the :icon:`fa-download` "
":guilabel:`(download)` button to download the file."
msgstr ""
"接著，前往該批量付款（:menuselection:`會計 --> 供應商 --> 批量付款`）。點擊進"
"入剛建立的付款，然後切換至 :guilabel:`匯出檔案` 分頁。已產生的檔案會連同 "
":guilabel:`產生日期` 一併列出。點擊 :icon:`fa-download` :guilabel:`(下載)` 按"
"鈕以下載檔案。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:651
msgid ""
"The exported file tab highlighted in the batch payment with the download "
"circled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:654
msgid ""
"If any adjustments need to be made, click the :guilabel:`Re-generate Export "
"File` button to recreate a new |NACHA| |ACH| file."
msgstr ""
"如需作出任何調整，請點擊:guilabel:`重新產生匯出檔案`按鈕，以重新建立新的 "
"|NACHA| |ACH| 檔案。"

