"Click the Bank accounts field, then click Create to enter the bank account "
"details."
msgstr "點擊「銀行賬戶」欄位，然後點擊「建立」以輸入銀行賬戶詳細資料。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:741
msgid ""
"Click  on the :guilabel:`Bank` field, then select the bank from the list, or"
