msgid "Add a bank account"
msgstr "新增銀行賬戶"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:892
msgid ""
"To add a bank account on a contact record, open the **Contacts** app and "
"click on the contact record, and click into the :guilabel:`Accounting` tab. "
"Click into the blank field next to :guilabel:`Banks`, click "
":guilabel:`Create...`, and a :guilabel:`Create Banks` pop-up window loads. "
"Fill out the following fields on the form, then click :guilabel:`Save`:"
msgstr ""
"要在聯絡人記錄中新增銀行賬戶，請開啟**聯絡人**應用程式，點擊該聯絡人記錄，然"
