msgid ""
":guilabel:`Bank`: Using the drop-down menu, select the bank for the account."
" If the bank does not appear in the list, add a new bank by clicking "
":guilabel:`Search more...` then click :guilabel:`New`, and fill out the "
":guilabel:`Create Bank` form."
msgstr ""
":guilabel:`銀行`：使用下拉式選單，為該賬戶選擇銀行。如果清單中未顯示該銀行，"
"請點擊:guilabel:`搜尋更多...`，然後點擊:guilabel:`新增`，並填寫:guilabel:`建"
"立銀行`表單以新增銀行。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/fiscal_localizations/united_states.rst:904
msgid ""
":guilabel:`Send Money`: Ensure this slider is set to :guilabel:`Trusted`. "
