#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:209
msgid ""
"Some of these online payment providers can also be added as :doc:`bank "
"accounts <../finance/accounting/bank>`, but this is **not** the same process"
" as adding them as payment providers. Payment providers allow customers to "
"pay online, and bank accounts are added and configured in the Accounting app"
" to do a :doc:`bank reconciliation <accounting/bank/reconciliation>`."
msgstr ""
"部分網上付款服務商亦可作為 :doc:`銀行賬戶 <../finance/accounting/bank>` 新增"
"，但這與新增為付款服務商 **並非** 同一流程。付款服務商可讓客戶進行網上付款，"
"而銀行賬戶則是在會計應用程式中新增及配置，以進行 :doc:`銀行對賬 <accounting/"
"bank/reconciliation>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:216
msgid ""
"In addition to the regular payment providers that integrate with an API, "
"such as Stripe, PayPal, or Adyen, Odoo bundles the :doc:`Demo payment "
"provider <payment_providers/demo>`. This payment provider allows you to test"
" business flows involving online payments. No credentials are required as "
"the demo payments are dummy payments."
msgstr ""
"除整合 API 的常規付款服務商（如 Stripe、PayPal 或 Adyen）外，Odoo 亦內置 "
":doc:`演示付款服務商 <payment_providers/demo>`。此付款服務商讓您測試涉及網上"
"付款的業務流程。由於演示付款屬虛擬付款，因此無需任何憑證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:224
msgid "Alternative payment methods"
msgstr "其他付款方式"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:226
msgid ""
"Some payment methods do not rely on an external payment provider. These "
"methods are installed and configured as payment providers in Odoo, and "
"include the following:"
msgstr ""
"部分付款方式並不依賴外部付款服務商。這些付款方式在 Odoo 中會作為付款服務商進"
"行安裝及設定，包括以下項目："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:229
msgid ""
":ref:`Wire Transfer <payment_providers/bank_payments/wire_transfer>`: "
"Customers make a bank transfer using your payment information and a payment "
"reference."
msgstr ""
":ref:`電匯 <payment_providers/bank_payments/wire_transfer>`：客戶可使用你的付"
"款資料及付款參考編號進行銀行轉賬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:231
msgid ""
":ref:`SEPA Direct Debit <payment_providers/bank_payments/sdd>`: Customers "
"make a bank transfer to register a SEPA Direct Debit mandate, allowing their"
" account to be charged directly for future payments."
msgstr ""
":ref:`SEPA 直接扣賬 <payment_providers/bank_payments/sdd>`：客戶透過銀行轉賬"
"登記 SEPA 直接扣賬授權書，以便日後直接從其銀行賬戶扣款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:234
msgid ""
":ref:`Pay on Site <ecommerce/payments/pay-on-site>`: Customers reserve "
"products online and pay when collecting their orders in store."
msgstr ""
":ref:`門市付款 <ecommerce/payments/pay-on-site>`：顧客於網上預訂產品，並於門"
"市取貨時付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:236
msgid ""
":ref:`Cash on Delivery <ecommerce/payments/cash-on-delivery>`: Customers pay"
" for their orders upon delivery."
msgstr ""
":ref:`貨到付款 <ecommerce/payments/cash-on-delivery>`：客戶於送貨時支付訂單款"
"項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:238
msgid ""
":ref:`Pay on Invoice <ecommerce/payments/pay-on-invoice>`: Customers pay for"
" their orders later, after receiving an invoice."
msgstr ""
":ref:`憑發票付款 <ecommerce/payments/pay-on-invoice>`：客戶會在收到發票後再為"
"訂單付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:244
msgid "Enabling a payment provider"
msgstr "啟用付款服務商"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:246
msgid ""
"To add a new payment provider and make its related payment methods available"
" to your customers, proceed as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:249
msgid ""
"Go to the payment provider's website, create an account, and make sure you "
"have the API credentials requested for third-party use. These are necessary "
"for Odoo to communicate with the payment provider."
msgstr ""
"前往付款服務商的網站，建立帳戶，並確保您擁有第三方使用所需的 API 憑證。這是 "
"Odoo 與付款服務商通訊的必要條件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:252
msgid ""
"In Odoo, navigate to the :guilabel:`Payment providers` by going to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Payment Providers`, "
":menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Payment Providers`, or "
":menuselection:`Sales --> Configuration --> Payment Providers`."
msgstr ""
"在 Odoo 中，要存取 :guilabel:`付款服務商`，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配"
"置 --> 付款服務商`、:menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 付款服務商` 或 "
":menuselection:`銷售 --> 配置 --> 付款服務商`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:255
msgid "Select the provider and configure the :guilabel:`Credentials` tab."
msgstr "選擇服務供應商並設定 :guilabel:`憑證` 分頁。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:256
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:64
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/iyzico.rst:33
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/stripe.rst:45
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/stripe.rst:86
msgid "Set the :guilabel:`State` field to :guilabel:`Enabled`."
msgstr "將 :guilabel:`狀態` 欄位設為 :guilabel:`已啟用`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:259
msgid ""
"The fields available in the :guilabel:`Credentials` tab depend on the "
"payment provider. Refer to the :ref:`related documentation "
"<payment_providers/supported_providers>` for more information."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`憑證` 分頁中可用的欄位視乎付款服務商而定。詳情請參閱 :ref:`相關"
"說明文件 <payment_providers/supported_providers>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:262
msgid ""
"Once the payment provider has been enabled the payment provider, it is "
"automatically published on the website. To unpublish it, click the "
":guilabel:`Published` button. Customers cannot make payments through an "
"unpublished provider, but they can still manage :dfn:`(delete and assign to "
"a subscription)` their existing tokens linked to such a provider."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:273
msgid ""
"We recommend using the test mode on a **duplicate** or a **test** database "
"to avoid potential issues with invoice numbering."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:276
msgid ""
"To try a payment provider without affecting live transactions, set the "
":guilabel:`State` field in the payment provider form to :guilabel:`Test "
"mode`. Then, enter the **provider's dedicated test or sandbox credentials** "
"in the :guilabel:`Credentials` tab. Each payment provider has its own "
"separate test account or environment for this purpose."
msgstr ""
"如要在不影響實際交易的情況下試用付款服務商，請將付款服務商表單中的 "
":guilabel:`狀態` 欄位設為 :guilabel:`測試模式`。然後，在 :guilabel:`憑證` 分"
"頁中輸入 **該服務商專用的測試或沙盒憑證**。每個付款服務商均有獨立的測試賬戶或"
"環境供此用途。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:282
msgid ""
"By default, the payment provider remains **unpublished** in test mode so "
"that it's not visible to visitors."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:290
msgid ""
"Each payment provider is related to a list of supported payment methods; the"
" methods listed in the :guilabel:`Payment methods` field in the "
":guilabel:`Configuration` tab of the payment provider form are the ones that"
" have been activated. To activate or deactivate a payment method for a "
"provider, click :guilabel:`Enable Payment Methods`, then click the toggle "
"button of the related method."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:296
msgid ""
"To view the complete list of supported payment methods, go to "
":menuselection:`Accounting --> Configuration --> Payment Methods`, "
":menuselection:`Website --> Configuration --> Payment Methods`, or "
":menuselection:`Sales --> Configuration --> Payment Methods`."
msgstr ""
"要查看支援的付款方式完整清單，請前往 :menuselection:`會計 --> 配置 --> 付款方"
"式`、:menuselection:`網站 --> 配置 --> 付款方式` 或 :menuselection:`銷售 --> "
"配置 --> 付款方式`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:299
msgid ""
"Payment methods are displayed on the ecommerce website based on their "
"sequence order. To reorder them, drag and drop the payment methods into the "
"desired order in the :guilabel:`Payment Methods` list."
msgstr ""
"電子商務網站會按順序顯示付款方式。若要重新排列順序，請在 :guilabel:`付款方"
"式` 清單中將付款方式拖放至所需位置。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:304
msgid "Icons and brands"
msgstr "圖示與品牌"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:306
msgid ""
"The icons displayed next to the payment method on your website are either "
"the icons of the brands activated for the payment method or, if there aren't"
" any, the icons of the payment methods themselves. To modify them, "
":ref:`access the list of payment methods "
"<payment_providers/payment_methods>`, then click the relevant one."
msgstr ""
"網站上付款方式旁邊顯示的圖示，會是已為該付款方式啟用的品牌圖示；如沒有啟用任"
"何品牌，則會顯示付款方式本身的圖示。如要修改這些圖示，請 :ref:`前往付款方式清"
"單 <payment_providers/payment_methods>`，然後點擊相關項目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:311
msgid ""
"To modify a payment method's icon, hover your mouse over the image in the "
"upper-right corner of the payment method's form and click the :icon:`fa-"
"pencil` (:guilabel:`pencil`) icon."
msgstr ""
"如要修改付款方式的圖示，請將滑鼠游標移至付款方式表單右上角的圖片上，然後按一"
"下 :icon:`fa-pencil` (:guilabel:`鉛筆`) 圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:314
msgid ""
"Select the :guilabel:`Brands` tab to view the brands that have been "
"activated for the payment method. The brands and their related icons are "
"displayed based on their sequence order; to reorder them, drag and drop them"
" into the desired order. To modify a brand's icon, select the brand, then, "
"in the popup window that opens, hover the mouse over the image in the upper-"
"right corner and click the :icon:`fa-pencil` (:guilabel:`pencil`) icon."
msgstr ""
"選擇 :guilabel:`品牌` 分頁，以查看已為該付款方式啟用的品牌。品牌及其相關圖示"
"會按順序顯示；如要重新排序，請將其拖放至所需位置。如要修改品牌圖示，請選擇該"
"品牌，然後在開啟的彈出視窗中，將滑鼠停留在右上角的圖片上，再點擊 :icon:`fa-"
"pencil`（:guilabel:`鉛筆`）圖示。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:321
msgid "Advanced configuration"
msgstr "進階設定"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:323
msgid "To further configure payment methods, follow these steps:"
msgstr "如要進一步配置付款方式，請按照以下步驟操作："

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:326
msgid ""
":ref:`Access the list of payment methods "
"<payment_providers/payment_methods>` and click the relevant one."
msgstr ""
":ref:`存取付款方式清單 <payment_providers/payment_methods>`，然後按一下相關項"
"目。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:328
msgid ""
"Go to the :guilabel:`Configuration` tab and adjust the features as needed."
msgstr "前往 :guilabel:`配置` 分頁，並按需要調整功能。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:331
msgid ""
"Each payment method is preconfigured in a way that aligns with the payment "
"providers' behavior and their integration with Odoo. Any change to this "
"configuration may result in errors and should be tested on a duplicate or "
"test database first."
msgstr ""
"每種付款方式均已預先設定，以配合付款服務商的運作方式及其與 Odoo 的整合。更改"
"此設定可能會導致錯誤，應先在複本或測試資料庫上進行測試。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:334
msgid ""
"Modifications to the payment method's configuration only work to the extent "
"of the method's and provider's capabilities. For example, adding "
":ref:`countries <payment_providers/currencies_countries>` for a payment "
"method only supported in one country or enabling :ref:`tokenization "
"<payment_providers/tokenization>` for a method linked to a provider that "
"does not support it will not produce the intended results."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:343
msgid "Tokenization"
msgstr "代碼化"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:345
msgid ""
":ref:`If the payment provider supports this feature "
"<payment_providers/online_providers>`, customers can save their payment "
"method details for later. To enable this feature, go to the "
":guilabel:`Configuration` tab of the selected payment provider and enable "
":guilabel:`Allow Saving Payment Methods`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`若付款服務商支援此功能 <payment_providers/online_providers>`，客戶便可"
"儲存付款方式資料以便日後使用。要啟用此功能，請前往所選付款服務商"
"的:guilabel:`配置`分頁，並啟用:guilabel:`允許儲存付款方式`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:350
msgid ""
"In this case, a **payment token** is created in Odoo to be used as a payment"
" method for subsequent payments without the customer having to enter their "
"payment method details again. This is particularly useful for the eCommerce "
"conversion rate and subscriptions that use recurring payments."
msgstr ""
"在此情況下，系統會在 Odoo 中建立**付款權杖**，作為後續付款的付款方式，客戶無"
"需再次輸入其付款方式詳細資料。這對電子商務轉換率及使用定期付款的訂閱服務尤其"
"有用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:355
msgid ""
"To add or delete their saved payment method details, customers can click "
":guilabel:`Manage payment methods` in the :ref:`customer portal <users-"
"portal-payment-methods>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:358
msgid "PCI DSS and Attestation of Compliance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:360
msgid ""
"Odoo is not `PCI <https://www.pcisecuritystandards.org>`_ DSS-certified "
"because it does not store cardholder data or process payments. Instead, it "
"outsources tokenization and payment to :ref:`external payment providers "
"<payment_providers/online_providers>`, which means that as an Odoo customer,"
" you only need to complete the minimal Self-Assessment Questionnaire (SAQ) "
"with the provider to obtain the Attestation of Compliance (AoC) and achieve "
"PCI compliance. Odoo should not be mentioned as a payment processor or a "
"third-party service provider in the :abbr:`SAQ (Self-Assessment "
"Questionnaire)`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:371
#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:73
msgid "Manual capture"
msgstr "手動請款"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:373
msgid ""
":ref:`If the payment provider supports this feature "
"<payment_providers/online_providers>`, you can authorize and capture "
"payments in two steps instead of one. To enable this feature, go to the "
":guilabel:`Configuration` tab of the selected payment provider and enable "
":guilabel:`Capture Amount Manually`."
msgstr ""
":ref:`如果付款服務供應商支援此功能 <payment_providers/online_providers>`，您"
"可以分兩步授權及擷取付款，而非一步完成。若要啟用此功能，請前往所選付款服務供"
"應商的 :guilabel:`配置` 分頁，並啟用 :guilabel:`手動擷取金額`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:378
msgid ""
"When you authorize a payment, the funds are reserved on the customer's "
"payment method but not immediately charged. They are charged when you "
"manually capture the payment later on. You can also void the authorization "
"to cancel it and release the reserved funds. Capturing payments manually is "
"helpful in many situations:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:383
msgid ""
"Receive the payment confirmation and wait until the order is shipped to "
"capture the payment."
msgstr "收到付款確認，並等待訂單發貨後才收取款項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:384
msgid ""
"Review and verify that orders are legitimate before the payment is completed"
" and the fulfillment process starts."
msgstr "在完成付款及開始履行流程前，審閱並驗證訂單是否合法。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:386
msgid ""
"Avoid potentially high refund fees for refunded payments: payment providers "
"will not charge you for voiding an authorization."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:388
msgid ""
"Hold a security deposit to return later, minus any deductions (e.g., in case"
" of damages)."
msgstr "暫扣保證金，日後退還時會扣除任何應扣款項（例如發生損壞的情況）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:390
msgid ""
"To capture the payment after it was authorized, go to the related sales "
"order or invoice and click the :guilabel:`Capture Transaction` button. To "
"release the funds, click the :guilabel:`Void Transaction` button."
msgstr ""
"款項獲授權後，如需擷取付款，請前往相關銷售訂單或發票，並點擊:guilabel:`擷取交"
"易`按鈕。如需釋放資金，請點擊:guilabel:`作廢交易`按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:395
msgid ""
"Some payment providers support capturing only part of the authorized amount."
" The remaining amount can then be either captured or voided. These providers"
" have the value **Full and partial** in the :ref:`table above "
"<payment_providers/online_providers>`. The providers that only support "
"capturing or voiding the total amount have the value **Full only**."
msgstr ""
"部分付款服務商支援只對部分已授權金額進行請款。剩餘金額其後可選擇請款或作廢。"
"這些服務商在 :ref:`上表 <payment_providers/online_providers>` 中顯示的值為 "
"**全額及部分**。只支援對總金額進行請款或作廢的服務商，其值則為 **僅限全額**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:399
msgid ""
"The funds are likely not reserved forever. After a certain time, they may be"
" automatically released back to the customer's payment method. Refer to your"
" payment provider's documentation for the exact reservation duration."
msgstr ""
"資金通常不會永久保留。經過一段時間後，系統可能會自動將資金退回客戶的付款方式"
"。有關確切的保留期限，請參閱付款服務供應商的說明文件。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:402
msgid ""
":doc:`payment_providers/adyen` and :doc:`payment_providers/stripe` allow to "
"capture payments manually directly from their website interface."
msgstr ""
":doc:`payment_providers/adyen` 及 :doc:`payment_providers/stripe` 容許直接從"
"其網站介面手動擷取付款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:410
msgid ""
"If your payment provider supports this feature, you can refund payments "
"directly from Odoo. It does not need to be enabled first. To refund a "
"customer payment, navigate to it and click the :guilabel:`Refund` button."
msgstr ""
"如果你的付款服務商支援此功能，你可直接從 Odoo 退款，無需事先啟用。要退回客戶"
"款項，請前往該筆付款並按 :guilabel:`退款` 按鈕。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:415
msgid ""
"Some payment providers support refunding only part of the amount. The "
"remaining amount can then optionally be refunded, too. These providers have "
"the value **Full and partial** in the :ref:`table above "
"<payment_providers/online_providers>`. The providers that only support "
"refunding the total amount have the value **Full only**."
msgstr ""
"部分付款服務商支援只退還部分金額。之後亦可選擇性退還剩餘金額。這些服務商在 "
":ref:`上表 <payment_providers/online_providers>` 中會顯示為 **全額及部分**。"
"只支援退還全額的服務商則會顯示為 **僅全額**。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:419
msgid ""
":doc:`payment_providers/adyen` and :doc:`payment_providers/stripe` allow to "
"refund payments directly from their website interface."
msgstr ""
":doc:`payment_providers/adyen` 及 :doc:`payment_providers/stripe` 允許直接從"
"其網站介面為付款進行退款。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:425
msgid "Express checkout"
msgstr "快速結賬"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:427
msgid ""
":ref:`If the payment provider supports this feature "
"<payment_providers/online_providers>`, you can allow customers to use the "
":guilabel:`Google Pay` and :guilabel:`Apple Pay` buttons and pay their "
"eCommerce orders in one click. When they use one of these buttons, customers"
" go straight from the cart to the confirmation page without filling out the "
"contact form. They just have to validate the payment on Google's or Apple's "
"payment form."
msgstr ""
":ref:`如果付款服務商支援此功能 <payment_providers/online_providers>`，您可讓"
"客戶使用 :guilabel:`Google Pay` 及 :guilabel:`Apple Pay` 按鈕，一鍵支付電子商"
"貿訂單。客戶使用其中一個按鈕時，無需填寫聯絡表格，即可直接從購物車前往確認頁"
"面，只需在 Google 或 Apple 的付款表格上驗證付款即可。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:433
msgid ""
"To enable this feature, go to the :guilabel:`Configuration` tab of the "
"selected payment provider and enable :guilabel:`Allow Express Checkout`."
msgstr ""
"如要啟用此功能，請前往所選付款服務供應商的 :guilabel:`設定` 分頁，並啟用 "
":guilabel:`允許快速結賬`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:437
msgid ""
"All prices shown on the express checkout payment form always include taxes."
msgstr "快速結賬付款表單上顯示的所有價格均已包含稅項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:444
msgid ""
"You can adapt the payment provider's availability by specifying the "
"**Minimum** and :guilabel:`Maximum amounts` allowed, modifying the "
":guilabel:`Currencies` and :guilabel:`Countries`, and specifying "
":guilabel:`Pricelists` in the :guilabel:`Configuration` tab."
msgstr ""
"你可以調整付款服務商的適用範圍，方法包括指定允許的 **最低** 及 :guilabel:`最"
"高金額`、修改 :guilabel:`貨幣` 及 :guilabel:`國家/地區`，以及指定 "
":guilabel:`價格表`，上述項目均位於 :guilabel:`配置` 分頁中。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:449
msgid ""
"To display an availability report for payment providers and payment methods,"
" and to help diagnose potential availability issues on the payment form, "
"enable the :ref:`developer-mode`, then click the :icon:`fa-bug` "
"(:guilabel:`bug`) icon next to the :guilabel:`Choose a payment method` "
"heading on the payment form. The report includes a list of enabled payment "
"providers and payment methods, reasons for any payment providers or methods "
"not being available, if applicable, and a list of supported providers for "
"each payment method."
msgstr ""
"如要顯示付款服務商及付款方式的可用性報告，並協助診斷付款表單上潛在的可用性問"
"題，請啟用 :ref:`developer-mode`，然後點擊 :icon:`fa-bug`（:guilabel:`除錯`）"
"圖示，該圖示位於付款表單上的 :guilabel:`選擇付款方式` 標題旁邊。報告內容包括"
"已啟用的付款服務商及付款方式清單、任何付款服務商或方式無法使用的原因（如適用"
"），以及每種付款方式支援的服務商清單。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:459
msgid "Minimum and maximum amounts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:461
msgid ""
"Set the :guilabel:`Minimum Amount` and :guilabel:`Maximum Amount` that can "
"be paid with the selected provider. Leave the fields to `0.00` to make the "
"payment provider available regardless of the payment amount."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:466
msgid ""
"This feature is not intended to work on pages that allow the customer to "
"update the payment amount, e.g., the **Donation** snippet and the "
"**Checkout** page when paid :doc:`shipping methods "
"<../websites/ecommerce/shipping>` are enabled."
msgstr ""
"此功能不適用於容許客戶更新付款金額的頁面，例如 **捐款** 區塊，以及啟用付費 "
":doc:`送貨方式 <../websites/ecommerce/shipping>` 後的 **結賬** 頁面。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:473
msgid "Currencies and countries"
msgstr "貨幣及國家/地區"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:475
msgid ""
"All payment providers have a different list of available currencies and "
"countries. They serve as a first filter during payment operations, i.e., the"
" payment methods linked to the payment provider are not available for "
"selection if the customer's currency or country is not in the supported "
"list. As there might be errors, updates, and unknowns in the lists of "
"available currencies and countries, adding or removing a payment provider's "
"supported currencies or countries is possible."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:482
msgid ""
":ref:`Payment methods <payment_providers/payment_methods>` also have their "
"own list of available currencies and countries that serves as another filter"
" during payment operations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:484
msgid ""
"If the list of supported currencies or countries is empty, it means the list"
" is too long to be displayed, or Odoo does not have information on that "
"payment provider. The payment provider remains available, even though it is "
"possible the payment will be refused at a later stage should the country or "
"currency not be supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:492
msgid "Pricelists"
msgstr "價格表"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:494
msgid ""
"Select specific :guilabel:`Pricelists` that can apply to the payment "
"provider. Leaving the field blank makes all pricelists available to the "
"provider."
msgstr ""
"選取可套用於該付款服務商的特定 :guilabel:`價目表`。若將此欄位留空，所有價目表"
"皆可套用於該付款服務商。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:500
msgid "Payment journal"
msgstr "付款日記賬"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:502
msgid ""
"A :doc:`payment journal <accounting/bank>` must be defined for the payment "
"provider to record the payments on an **outstanding account**. By default, "
"the :guilabel:`Bank` journal is added as the payment journal for all payment"
" providers. To modify it, go to the :guilabel:`Configuration` tab of the "
"selected payment provider and select another :guilabel:`Payment journal`."
msgstr ""
"必須為付款服務商定義:doc:`付款日記賬 <accounting/bank>`，以便將付款記錄於**未"
"結算賬戶**。系統預設會將:guilabel:`銀行`日記賬設為所有付款服務商的付款日記賬"
"。如要修改，請前往所選付款服務商的:guilabel:`設定`分頁，並選擇其"
"他:guilabel:`付款日記賬`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:508
msgid "The payment journal must be a :guilabel:`Bank` journal."
msgstr "付款日記賬必須為 :guilabel:`銀行` 日記賬。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:509
msgid "The same journal can be used for several payment providers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:510
msgid ""
"Payment journals must only be configured if the :doc:`Invoicing or "
"Accounting app <accounting>` is installed."
msgstr ""
"只有當已安裝 :doc:`發票或會計應用程式 <accounting>` 時，才需要設定付款日記賬"
"。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:514
msgid "Accounting perspective"
msgstr "會計角度"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:516
msgid ""
"From an accounting perspective, there are two types of online payment "
"workflows: the payments that are directly deposited into your bank account "
"and follow the usual :doc:`reconciliation <accounting/bank/reconciliation>` "
"workflow, and those coming from third-party :ref:`online payment providers "
"<payment_providers/online_providers>` and require you to follow another "
"accounting workflow. For these payments, you need to consider how you want "
"to record your payments' journal entries. We recommend you ask your "
"accountant for advice."
msgstr ""
"從會計角度來看，網上付款工作流程分為兩種：一種是直接存入您銀行賬戶並遵循一般 "
":doc:`對賬 <accounting/bank/reconciliation>` 工作流程的付款；另一種則是來自第"
"三方 :ref:`網上付款服務商 <payment_providers/online_providers>`、需要您遵循另"
"一套會計工作流程的付款。對於這些付款，您需要考慮如何記錄付款的日記賬分錄。我"
"們建議您向會計師諮詢意見。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:523
msgid ""
"By default, the :guilabel:`Bank Account` defined for the :ref:`payment "
"journal <payment_providers/journal>` is used, but you can also specify an "
":ref:`outstanding account <accounting/journals/outstanding-accounts>` for "
"each payment provider to separate the provider's payments from other "
"payments."
msgstr ""
"系統預設會使用:guilabel:`銀行賬戶`（定義於:ref:`付款日記賬 "
"<payment_providers/journal>`），但你亦可為每個付款服務商指定:ref:`未結算賬戶 "
"<accounting/journals/outstanding-accounts>`，將該服務商的付款與其他付款分開。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers.rst:528
msgid "Define an outstanding account for a payment provider."
msgstr "為付款服務商定義未結算賬戶。"

