":icon:`fa-copy`（:guilabel:`複製用戶端密鑰`）圖示並儲存該值，以供 "
":ref:`payment_providers/adyen/configure_odoo` 步驟使用。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:37
