msgstr "按一下頁面底部的 :guilabel:`儲存變更`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:40
msgid ""
"Go to :menuselection:`Developers --> Webhooks` in the left menu and click "
":icon:`fa-plus-circle` :guilabel:`Create new webhook`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:42
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Create new webhook` popup, click :guilabel:`Add` on the "
":guilabel:`Standard webhook` line."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`建立新 Webhook` 彈出視窗中，點擊 :guilabel:`新增`（對應 "
":guilabel:`標準 Webhook` 一行）。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:44
msgid ""
"On the :guilabel:`Webhook generation` form, in the :guilabel:`Server "
"configuration` section, enter your Odoo database :guilabel:`URL` followed by"
" `/payment/adyen/notification`."
msgstr ""
"在:guilabel:`產生 Webhook`表單的:guilabel:`伺服器設定`部分中，輸入您的 Odoo "
"資料庫:guilabel:`網址`，並在後方加上 `/payment/adyen/notification`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/adyen.rst:46
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`Security` section, click :guilabel:`Generate` under "
":guilabel:`HMAC`, then click the :icon:`fa-copy` (:guilabel:`Copy HMAC to "
