#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:0
msgid ""
"Enter your database URL followed by `/payment/aps/webhook` in the "
":guilabel:`Direct Transaction Feedback` and :guilabel:`Notification URL` "
"fields."
msgstr ""
"在 :guilabel:`直接交易回饋` 及 :guilabel:`通知網址` 欄位中，輸入你的資料庫網"
"址，並在後方加上 `/payment/aps/webhook`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/amazon_payment_services.rst:0
