"must be a valid IBAN."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/bank_payments.rst:102
msgid "Online payments with |sdd|"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/bank_payments.rst:105
msgid ""
"To use SEPA Direct Debit (SDD) as an online payment method and create "
":ref:`SEPA Direct Debit mandates <accounting/sepa_payments/sdd>`, the "
"invoice being paid must be in euros."
msgstr ""
"要使用 SEPA 直接扣帳（SDD）作為網上付款方式並建立 :ref:`SEPA 直接扣帳授權書 "
"<accounting/sepa_payments/sdd>`，所支付的發票必須以歐元計價。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/bank_payments.rst:108
msgid "The |sdd| online payment process involves the following steps:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/bank_payments.rst:110
msgid ""
"Customers selecting |sdd| as a payment method are prompted to enter their "
"IBAN to complete the :ref:`SEPA Direct Debit mandate "
"<accounting/sepa_payments/sdd_mandates>`, which is then automatically "
"created as a :guilabel:`Draft`."
msgstr ""
"選擇 |sdd| 作為付款方式的客戶，系統會提示他們輸入 IBAN 以完成 :ref:`SEPA 直接"
"扣賬授權書 <accounting/sepa_payments/sdd_mandates>`，系統隨後會自動將其建立"
"為 :guilabel:`草稿`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/bank_payments.rst:113
msgid ""
"To confirm the mandate, customers must make a successful bank transfer of "
"the expected amount, using the specified payment reference (communication) "
"and bank account number."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/bank_payments.rst:115
msgid ""
"Once this initial payment is received, the :doc:`bank transaction "
"<../accounting/bank/transactions>` must be matched with the payment "
"transaction."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/bank_payments.rst:117
msgid ""
"The sales order is confirmed automatically and the |sdd| mandate is "
"validated."
msgstr "銷售訂單會自動確認，而 |sdd| 授權書亦會獲驗證。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/bank_payments.rst:118
msgid ""
"Once a mandate is active, it is reused for all subsequent payments made by "
"the customer with the |sdd| payment method."
msgstr ""

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/bank_payments.rst:120
msgid ""
":ref:`Process the SDD payments <accounting/sepa_payments/XML>` to collect "
"payments from customers with an active |sdd| mandate."
msgstr ""
":ref:`處理 SDD 付款 <accounting/sepa_payments/XML>`，以向持有有效 |sdd| 授權"
"書的客戶收取款項。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/bank_payments.rst:124
msgid ":doc:`../accounting/payments/sepa_payments`"
msgstr ":doc:`../accounting/payments/sepa_payments`"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/bank_payments.rst:127
msgid ""
"Mandates are automatically :ref:`closed <accounting/sepa_payments/close-"
"revoke-mandate>` 36 months after the date of the last collection."
msgstr ""
"授權書會在最後一次收款日期起計 36 個月後自動:ref:`關閉 <accounting/"
"sepa_payments/close-revoke-mandate>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/bank_payments.rst:129
msgid ""
"|sdd| is also available as a payment method through other providers, such as"
" :doc:`adyen`, :doc:`buckaroo`, and :doc:`stripe`. In these cases, |sdd| "
"mandates are handled externally by the payment provider."
msgstr ""
"|sdd| 亦可透過其他付款服務商作為付款方式提供，例如 "
":doc:`adyen`、:doc:`buckaroo` 及 :doc:`stripe`。在此情況下，|sdd| 授權書會由"
"付款服務商在外部處理。"

