msgstr "同意:guilabel:`條款及細則`，然後點擊:guilabel:`提交`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:18
msgid ""
"DPO Pay creates a test account based on the submitted information and sends "
"you an email containing your login credentials for the `DPO portal "
"<https://portal.dpopay.com>`_ and the :ref:`test credentials "
"<payment_providers/test-mode>` to enter in :ref:`Odoo "
"<payment_providers/dpo/configure_odoo>` if you want to try DPO Pay without "
"affecting live transactions."
msgstr ""
"DPO Pay 會根據提交的資料建立測試帳戶，並向您發送電郵，當中包含 `DPO 入口網站 "
"<https://portal.dpopay.com>`_ 的登入憑證以及 :ref:`測試憑證 "
"<payment_providers/test-mode>`；如您想在不影響實際交易的情況下試用 DPO Pay，"
"可將這些憑證輸入至 :ref:`Odoo <payment_providers/dpo/configure_odoo>`。"

#: ../../export/content/applications/finance/payment_providers/dpo.rst:23
msgid ""
"Once DPO has verified the information and documents, they will transition "
"your test account to a live account and send another email containing your "
"live credentials to configure in :ref:`Odoo "
"<payment_providers/dpo/configure_odoo>`."
msgstr ""

